# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**\"Created its own account\"** = the git-forge identity from Decision #13; the PR is authored by the agent, not a shared bot."
msgstr "**\"Ustvaril svoj račun\"** = identiteta git-forge iz odločbe #13; PR je avtor agenta, ne skupnega robota."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**\"Spins up local containers\"** happens inside the agent's isolated sandbox, which MUST therefore be able to run compose workloads (nested Docker inside the isolated runtime). This is a real capability constraint the agent role MUST declare; it is exactly the kind of host-near need Decision #4's runtime selection has to accommodate."
msgstr "**\"Zavrti lokalne vsebnike\"** se zgodi v izoliranem peskovniku, ki mora biti zato sposoben zagnati sestavljanje delovnih bremen (Gnezdil Docker znotraj izoliranega časa delovanja). To je resnična omejitev sposobnosti zastopnik vlogo MORAjo prijaviti; je točno vrsta gostitelj-blizu potrebe Odločba #4Izbira časa mora ustrezati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**\"Waits for feedback\"** = the agent polls the PR through the git-forge MCP server (025); the human review gate stays human."
msgstr "**\"Čaka na povratne informacije\"** = agent anketira PR prek strežnika git-forge MCP (025); Človeška vrata ostanejo človeška."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**.well-known Support:** Ensures full ACME challenge compatibility."
msgstr "**.znana podpora:** Zagotavlja popolno združljivost izziva ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A (and optional AAAA) records** on the **apex** (`@`) for all **base SLD domains**"
msgstr "**A (in neobvezna AAAA) evidence** o **apex** (`@`) za vse **Osnovne SLD domene**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A (and optional AAAA) records** on the **apex** (``@``) for all **base SLD domains**"
