# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A `svc-ai-litellm` gateway is the single model entrypoint.** It exposes one OpenAI-compatible `/v1` endpoint and routes to backends via its `model_list`. No consumer addresses a provider directly."
msgstr "**A `svc-ai-litellm` Prehod je vstopna točka enega modela.** Razkrije eno z OpenAI združljivo `/v1` končna točka in poti do hrbtenjače prek `model_list`. Noben potrošnik se ne obrne neposredno na ponudnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A `svc-ai-lmstudio` role is added as a routable backend, x86/GPU node only.** It deploys LM Studio in headless server mode (`lms server`, OpenAI-compatible API) and registers behind the gateway. LM Studio has no arm64 Linux server build, so it MUST be pinned to an x86 (typically GPU) node via placement constraint and MUST NOT be scheduled onto the Raspberry Pi / arm64 agent nodes of [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md). LM Studio ships primarily as a desktop GUI; the role MUST use its headless/server mode, and the README MUST document the container caveat (GPU passthrough, licensing/model-download constraints)."
msgstr "**A `svc-ai-lmstudio` vloga je dodana kot rutable backend, x86Samo GPU vozlišče.** Uporablja se LM Studio v načinu strežnika brez glave (`lms server`, združljiv z OpenAI API) in se registrira za vhodom. LM Studio nima roke64 Linux strežnik graditi, tako da je treba pripeti na x86 (tipično GPU) vozlišče z namestitvijo omejitev in NE sme biti načrtovano na Raspberry Pi / roko64 agensovski vozliči [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md). LM Studio ladje predvsem kot namizni grafični vmesnik; vloga MORA uporabljati svoj način brez glave/strežaja, in README MORA dokumentirati kontejnerja caveat (Prepustnost GPU, omejitve licenciranja/model prenosa)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A blocked mode is NEVER a reason to silently switch to another.** If a mode cannot run (the swarm NFS wedge below, a wedged daemon, a missing host capability), STOP the whole sweep, report the blocker together with the exact recovery command, and wait for it to be cleared. You MUST NOT fall back to a `modes=compose`-only (or any reduced) sweep to look productive: it hides the unmet swarm parity and never satisfies the compose-AND-swarm gate. Resume the full sweep only once the blocker is gone."
msgstr "**Zablokirani način NIKOLI ni razlog za tiho preklop na drugega.** Če način ne more delovati (klin roja NFS spodaj, klinasti demon, manjkajoča zmožnost gostitelja), ustaviti celotno čiščenje, prijaviti blokator skupaj z natančnim ukazom za izterjavo, in počakati, da se očisti. Ne smete se vrniti k `modes=compose`- Samo (ali katero koli zmanjšano) Pometati, da bi izgledalo produktivno: skriva neizpolnjeno pariteto roja in nikoli ne zadovolji komponiranih in toplih vrat. Nadaljuj s popolnim pregledom, ko blokatorja ne bo več."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A change in `services.hugo.source_version`** invalidates the clone, which invalidates `COPY ./services/repository/` in the Dockerfile, which triggers a fresh `hugo` build on the next deploy."
msgstr "**Sprememba `services.hugo.source_version`** razveljavi klon, ki razveljavi `COPY ./services/repository/` v Dockerfile, ki sproži novo `hugo` nadgrajujte naslednjo razporeditev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A declared window is an upper bound the backend honours, and the token demand is a floor.** Two numbers guard the same decision from opposite sides, and each was wrong in the direction that hid the other. `smollm2:135m` was declared at 16384 against a trained `max_position_embeddings` of 8192 with no rope scaling, so Ollama clamped `num_ctx` and then truncated the prompt to half the window, which is the `n_left=4091` recorded in `8dbdd31b22`. Meanwhile `CHARS_PER_TOKEN = 3` was justified as erring high, but the router's own probe builds its oversized prompt from `\"x \"`, which tokenizes at two characters per token: 16384 characters are 8193 real tokens on all three served tokenizers against an estimate of 5461."
msgstr "**Razglašeno okno je zgornja meja časti hrbtenice, žetonska zahteva pa je nadstropje.** Dve številki stražita isto odločitev od nasprotnih strani in vsaka je bila napačna v smeri, ki je skrivala drugo. `smollm2:135m` je bil prijavljen na 16384 proti usposobljenemu `max_position_embeddings` o 8192 brez luščenja vrvi. Ollama vpeto `num_ctx` in nato skrajšati poziv do polovice okna, ki je `n_left=4091` zabeleženo v `8dbdd31b22`. Medtem. `CHARS_PER_TOKEN = 3` je bilo upravičeno, kot da se je zmotila visoka, vendar je lastna sonda gradi svojo preveliko spodbudo iz `\"x \"`, ki označuje na dva znaka na žeton: 16384 znaki so 8193 Resnični žetoni za vse tri postrežene simbole proti oceni 5461."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A dump needs a running engine.** It is replayed through ``docker exec``, so unlike a file tree it cannot be restored onto a bare host. After a total loss the order is: deploy the stack, stop the consumers, replay, start them again. The step names which of the two states is missing — a stopped container that only needs starting, or no container at all."
msgstr "**Odpadnik potrebuje delujoč motor.** Ponavlja se skozi ``docker exec``, tako za razliko od datotečnega drevesa ni mogoče obnoviti na golega gostitelja. Po popolni izgubi je naročilo: razporediti kup, ustaviti potrošnike, ponovno predvajati, jih znova začeti. Postopna imena, katera od obeh stanj manjkajo – zaustavljena posoda, ki jo je treba samo zagnati, ali pa sploh nobene posode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A dump needs a running engine.** It is replayed through `docker exec`, so unlike a file tree it cannot be restored onto a bare host. After a total loss the order is: deploy the stack, stop the consumers, replay, start them again. The step names which of the two states is missing — a stopped container that only needs starting, or no container at all."
msgstr "**Odpadnik potrebuje delujoč motor.** Ponavlja se skozi `docker exec`, tako za razliko od datotečnega drevesa ni mogoče obnoviti na golega gostitelja. Po popolni izgubi je naročilo: razporediti kup, ustaviti potrošnike, ponovno predvajati, jih znova začeti. Postopna imena, katera od obeh stanj manjkajo – zaustavljena posoda, ki jo je treba samo zagnati, ali pa sploh nobene posode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A force rebuild** without a source-version change can be triggered by clearing the role's image cache:"
msgstr "**Obnova sile** brez spremembe različice vira se lahko sproži z odstranitvijo predpomnilnika slike vloge:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A generation holding a cluster dump fails the drill.** `baudolo-restore` has no subcommand that replays one, so that database cannot be proven restorable — the honest verdict is a red, not a silent skip."
msgstr "**Generacija, ki drži smetišče, ne opravi vaje.** `baudolo-restore` nima podukaza, ki bi ga ponovno predvajal, tako da podatkovne zbirke ni mogoče dokazati za restavrirano – poštena sodba je rdeča, ne pa tiha preskok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A probe for every container.** Health checks are composed from prefixes and are mandatory: every declared image either carries a probe or states why it cannot have one, enforced from both sides. Probes hit the port the container actually binds, no longer derive an HTTP Host from a kernel hostname, and are defined once instead of per proxy. Rescue diagnostics pin the dnsmasq listener loss to its moment, sample what the resolver answers rather than just its socket, probe the daemon.json upstreams, and record the whole boot instead of the last 10 000 lines."
msgstr "**Sonda za vsak zabojnik.** Zdravstveni pregledi so sestavljeni iz predpone in so obvezni: vsaka deklarirana slika nosi sondo ali navaja, zakaj je ne more imeti, uveljavlja z obeh strani. Sonde zadenejo vrata, ki jih zabojnik dejansko veže, ne dobijo več HTTP gostitelja iz imena gostitelja jedra in so definirane enkrat namesto na posrednika. Reševalna diagnostika pripne dnsmasq poslušalec izgubo na svoj trenutek, vzorec, kaj reševalec odgovori in ne samo vtičnico, sonda daemon.json navzgor in zapišite celoten škorenj namesto zadnjega 10 000 linije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A request stays inside the deployment while a local model can serve it.** A prompt can carry a credential, so locality is its own rank above price rather than a consequence of local models happening to be free. `services.litellm.router_remote_fallback` defaults to `false`: while any local route is deployed, a request no local model can take is refused with its reason instead of reaching a third party, and the refusal names the switch that would allow it. With no local route deployed the rule does not apply, because there would be nothing to hold the request on."
msgstr "**Zahteva ostane znotraj razporeditve, medtem ko jo lahko lokalni model služi.** Poziv lahko nosi poverilnico, zato je kraj sam svoj rang nad ceno in ne posledica lokalnih modelov, ki se dogaja brezplačno. `services.litellm.router_remote_fallback` privzeto za `false`: medtem ko se uporablja katera koli lokalna proga, se zahteva, ki je ne more sprejeti noben lokalni model, zavrne z razlogom, namesto da bi dosegla tretjo osebo, in zavrnitev imenuje stikalo, ki bi to omogočilo. Brez lokalne proge se pravilo ne uporablja, ker ne bi bilo ničesar, kar bi zadržalo zahtevo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A role may narrow the pool.** `meta/services.yml.<primary_entity> .architectures` lists what the role can run on, next to `modes`, because both state a capability rather than a testing preference. The row draws from the intersection of the run's pool with the declarations of the role and of every role the deploy planner brings up for that variant, because the deploy pulls those in too; an empty intersection aborts the matrix."
msgstr "**Vloga lahko zoži bazen.** `meta/services.yml.<primary_entity> .architectures` navaja, na čem lahko deluje vloga, poleg `modes`, ker oba navajata sposobnost in ne prednost za testiranje. Vrstica črpa iz presečišča bazena run z izjavami o vlogi in o vsaki vlogi, ki jo planer razporedi za to različico, ker razporeditev potegne tudi tiste; prazno križišče prekine matrico."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A shared infrastructure network carries lateral reach the application layer does not control.** On the compose stack, Flowise and Baserow both join `postgres` because both use the central database, and Flowise opens `baserow:80` at `192.168.200.5` although Baserow does not admit Flowise. Reach has to be measured by resolved address: an unknown name falls through to a wildcard resolver that answers with one reachable address, so a name-based probe reports every peer as reachable and proves nothing."
msgstr "**Skupno infrastrukturno omrežje ima lateralni doseg, ki ga aplikacijska plast ne nadzoruje.** Na skladalniku. Flowise ter Baserow oba se pridružita `postgres` ker obe uporabljata centralno bazo podatkov in Flowise odprti `baserow:80` na dan `192.168.200.5` čeprav Baserow ne prizna Flowise. Doseg je treba izmeriti z razrešenim naslovom: neznano ime pade na razreševalca, ki odgovarja z enim dosegljivim naslovom, zato sonda na osnovi imena poroča o vsakem vrstniku kot dosegljivem in ne dokazuje ničesar."

