# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**AI assistance inside the applications you already run.** A gateway role, *svc-ai-litellm*, fronts OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter from declared keys, with *svc-ai-ollama* and the new *svc-ai-lmstudio* serving local models from one shared catalogue, so inference can stay inside the deployment. Sixteen applications use it for their own built-in AI features instead of calling a vendor directly: WordPress AI Engine, MediaWiki AIEditingAssistant, Moodle's AI subsystem, Zammad Smart Assist, the xWiki LLM extension, Discourse AI, the Matrix ChatGPT bridge, Nextcloud, Mattermost Agents, n8n, Open WebUI and Flowise. The gateway's admin UI signs in through Keycloak. See [svc-ai-litellm](roles/svc-ai-litellm/README.md) and [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."
msgstr "**AI pomoč znotraj vlog, ki ste jih že zagnali.** Vloga portala, *svc-ai-litellm*, spredaj OpenAI, Anthropic in OpenRouter iz prijavljenih ključev, z *svc-ai-ollama* in novo *svc-ai-lmstudio* služiti lokalnim modelom iz enega skupnega kataloga, tako da lahko sklepanje ostane znotraj uporabe. Šestnajst aplikacij ga uporablja za svoje vgrajene funkcije AI namesto klic prodajalca neposredno: WordPress AI Engine, MediaWiki AIEditing Assistant, Moodlepodsistem AI, Zammad Smart Assist, xWiki LLM razširitev, Discourse Al, Matrix most ChatGPT, Nextcloud, Mattermost Agenti, n8n, Open WebUI ter Flowise. Administracija UI portala se vpiše skozi Keycloak. Glej [svc-ai-litellm](roles/svc-ai-litellm/README.md) ter [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."

