# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Adapter in front of the sidecar:** The ``gitea-mcp`` sidecar runs as compose service ``giteamcpupstream`` on the role’s own network only, so nothing but the adapter reaches it. It answers ``initialize`` and ``tools/list`` to any caller because it holds no credential of its own and expects each client to supply a Gitea token per request, which makes it unsafe to expose directly. The adapter is what authenticates: a client presents the ``mcp_bearer`` credential and is refused with 401 otherwise, and the adapter presents the minted Gitea token upstream via ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY``."
msgstr "**Adapter pred prikolico:** – ``gitea-mcp`` stranske prikolice kot komponiranje ``giteamcpupstream`` samo na lastnem omrežju vloge, zato ga doseže samo adapter. Odgovori. ``initialize`` ter ``tools/list`` za vsakega klicatelja, ker nima lastne poverilnice in pričakuje, da bo vsaka stranka Gitea Žeton na zahtevo, zaradi česar ni varno razkriti neposredno. Adapter je tisto, kar potrjuje: odjemalec predstavlja ``mcp_bearer`` Zaupnost in je zavrnjena 401 sicer, in adapter predstavlja kovano Gitea žeton v smeri proti toku preko ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Adapter in front of the sidecar:** The `gitea-mcp` sidecar runs as compose service `giteamcpupstream` on the role's own network only, so nothing but the adapter reaches it. It answers `initialize` and `tools/list` to any caller because it holds no credential of its own and expects each client to supply a Gitea token per request, which makes it unsafe to expose directly. The adapter is what authenticates: a client presents the `mcp_bearer` credential and is refused with 401 otherwise, and the adapter presents the minted Gitea token upstream via `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`."
msgstr "**Adapter pred prikolico:** – `gitea-mcp` stranske prikolice kot komponiranje `giteamcpupstream` samo na lastni mreži, tako da ga doseže samo adapter. Odgovori. `initialize` ter `tools/list` za vsakega klicatelja, ker nima lastne poverilnice in pričakuje, da bo vsaka stranka Gitea Žeton na zahtevo, zaradi česar ni varno razkriti neposredno. Adapter je tisto, kar potrjuje: odjemalec predstavlja `mcp_bearer` Zaupnost in je zavrnjena 401 sicer, in adapter predstavlja kovano Gitea žeton v smeri proti toku preko `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`."

