# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Added:** New workstation bundles (*admin*, *admin-network*, *browser*, *design*, *dev-arduino*, *dev-core*, *dev-java*, *dev-php*, *dev-python*, *dev-shell*, *game-compose*, *game-os*, *game-windows*, *office*). Inventory driven *sys-package* role with constructor auto load when *SYS_PACKAGES* is set. New roles *sys-openssl* and *sys-aur-install*. New lookup plugin *command_path*. New variable *SOFTWARE_URL* and updated login banner."
msgstr "**Dodano:** Novi svežnji delovnih postaj (*admin*, *administrativno omrežje*, *brskalnik*, *zasnova*, *dev-arduino*, *dev-core*, *dev-java*, *dev-php*, *dev-python*, *dev-shell*, *igrano združevanje*, *igra-os*, *igralna okna*, *pisarna*). Pogon popisa *pakiranje sys* vloga z samodejno obremenitvijo konstruktorja, kadar *SYS_PACKAGES* Pripravljen. Nove vloge *sys-openssl* ter *sys-aur-install*. Nov vstavek za iskanje *command_path*Nova spremenljivka *SOFTWARE_URL* in posodobljeno prijavno zastavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Addon state is a variant axis.** Optional addons (`required: false`) MUST express their enabled/disabled split through the role's [`meta/variants.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) so CI matrix runs exercise both states, mirroring requirement 025's MCP variant axis. Required addons (`required: true`) are not a variant axis because they are always installed."
msgstr "**Addonsko stanje je variantna os.** Neobvezni dodatki (`required: false`) MORAJO izraziti svojo možnost/invalidsko delitev med vlogo [`meta/variants.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) tako CI matrika deluje v obeh stanjih, zrcalna zahteva 025MCP variantna os. Zahtevani dodatki (`required: true`) niso variantna os, ker so vedno nameščeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Admin / role model = both** (operator: \"admin anlegen wenn nicht oidc sonst claim mapping\"), implemented within Semaphore's constraints: (a) a **break-glass local admin** is always seeded via `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*` with a dedicated `breakglass` login + dedicated email — reachable via the form only when LDAP is off; (b) when SSO is enabled the role creates the Keycloak administrator as an **external admin** at deploy time (`semaphore user add --admin --external`), so the OIDC callback (matches by email, accepts only external users) elevates that operator to admin. Upstream has no claim→role mapping, so this deploy-time external-admin seed is the \"smallest reconciliation step\"."
msgstr "**Skrbnik/vzorec = oba** (operator: \"admin angen wenn nicht oidc sonst trdijo kartiranje\"), izvaja se v okviru omejitev Semaforja: (a) a **lom-glass lokalni admin** se vedno seje preko `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*` z namensko `breakglass` prijava + namenska e-pošta – dosegljiva prek obrazca samo, ko je LDAP izključen; (b) ko je omogočen SSO vlogo ustvarja Keycloak administrator kot **zunanji admin** ob času uporabe (`semaphore user add --admin --external`), tako da OIDC klic nazaj (ujema po e-pošti, sprejema samo zunanje uporabnike) Dvigne ga na admin. V zgornjem toku ni nobene trditve. \"Najmanjša faza usklajevanja\"."

