# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator-issued token:** The role mints a Gitea personal access token named ``gitea-mcp`` for the ``administrator`` account with the read-only scope set ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, and persists it in the token store MCP clients read. Every deploy asks the API whether the stored token still authenticates, revokes the stale entry under that name, and re-mints when the API rejects it. The deploy fails if the fresh token is rejected too."
msgstr "**Žeton za administratorja:** Vloga meti a Gitea osebni dostop, imenovan ``gitea-mcp`` za ``administrator`` račun samo za branje ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, in vztraja v žeton trgovina MCP stranke brati. Vsak odhod zahteva API ali shranjeni žeton še vedno potrjuje, prekliče stalen vnos pod tem imenom in ponovno meti, kadar API zavrne. Odprava ne uspe, če se zavrne tudi svež žeton."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator-issued token:** The role mints a Gitea personal access token named `gitea-mcp` for the `administrator` account with the read-only scope set `read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification`, and persists it in the token store MCP clients read. Every deploy asks the API whether the stored token still authenticates, revokes the stale entry under that name, and re-mints when the API rejects it. The deploy fails if the fresh token is rejected too."
msgstr "**Žeton za administratorja:** Vloga meti a Gitea osebni dostop, imenovan `gitea-mcp` za `administrator` račun samo za branje `read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification`, in vztraja v žeton trgovina MCP stranke brati. Vsak odhod zahteva API ali shranjeni žeton še vedno potrjuje, prekliče stalen vnos pod tem imenom in ponovno meti, kadar API zavrne. Odprava ne uspe, če se zavrne tudi svež žeton."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced Analytics:** Gain insights through detailed reporting on campaign metrics and subscriber behavior."
msgstr "**Napredna analitika:** Pridobite vpogled skozi podrobno poročanje o meritvah kampanje in vedenje naročnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced Rights Management:** Fine-grained permissions for users, groups, and spaces."
msgstr "**Napredno upravljanje pravic:** Dobro grajena dovoljenja za uporabnike, skupine in prostore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced SEO Tools:** Optimize your site's visibility in search engines using built-in support for SEO best practices and a rich ecosystem of SEO plugins."
msgstr "**Napredni SEO Orodje:** Optimizirajte vidljivost vaše spletne strani v iskalnikih z uporabo vgrajene podpore za SEO najboljše prakse in bogat ekosistem SEO plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced SEO Tools:** Optimize your site’s visibility in search engines using built-in support for SEO best practices and a rich ecosystem of SEO plugins."
msgstr "**Napredni SEO Orodje:** Optimizirajte vidljivost vaše spletne strani v iskalnikih z vgrajeno podporo za SEO najboljše prakse in bogat ekosistem SEO plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced Security Options:** Benefit from multi-factor authentication, configurable password policies, and secure session management."
msgstr "**Napredne varnostne možnosti:** Prednosti večfaktorske avtentikacije, nastavljivih geselnih politik, in varno upravljanje sej."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced Security:** Incorporates TLS encryption, DKIM, and SPF to secure your communications and prevent spoofing."
msgstr "**Napredna varnost:** Vključuje TLS šifriranje, DKIM, in SPF za zaščito vaše komunikacije in preprečevanje spoofing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced openresty load-balancing strategies.** v1 uses default round-robin in the per-app `upstream` block. Weighted distribution, least-connections, sticky sessions (`ip_hash` / cookie-based), and active HTTP healthchecks are out of scope. Adding them is a follow-up requirement and only becomes load-bearing once a service is regularly run with replicas > 1, which itself depends on shared storage being NFS-backed for that service."
msgstr "**Napredne strategije za izravnavo obremenitve.** v1 uporablja privzeto okroglo-robin v posamezni aplikaciji `upstream` blok. Ponderirana porazdelitev, najmanjše povezave, lepljive seje (`ip_hash` / osnova za piškote), in aktivni HTTP pregledi so izven obsega. Dodajanje je dodatna zahteva in postane nosilnost le, ko se storitev redno izvaja z replikami > 1, kar je odvisno od tega, da se za to storitev podpre skupno skladiščenje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent dashboards are public behind proxy + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` follow the standard `web-app-*` contract: own canonical domain, reverse-proxy routing, SSO enforced via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes uses its native self-hosted OIDC support. OpenClaw's native OIDC is unverified upstream: if absent, the dashboard sits behind the platform's standard auth-proxy pattern (SSO enforced at the proxy, OpenClaw's own token auth staying internal-only). No unauthenticated public surface either way."
msgstr "**Agent armaturne plošče so javne za posrednikom + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` ter `web-app-openclaw` sledite standardu `web-app-*` pogodba: lastna kanonična domena, obratna proxy routing, SSO izvaja preko [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes uporablja podporo OIDC-a. Domorodni OIDC OpenClaw je nepreverjen navzgor: če ga ni, armaturna plošča sedi za standardnim vzorcem auth-proxy platforme (SSO, ki se izvaja pri pooblaščencu, OpenClawlasten simbol avta, ki ostane samo znotraj)V nobenem primeru ni neavtentirane javne površine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent gateway:** The container runs the OpenClaw gateway bound to the LAN interface on port 18789, with an HTTP health check against `/healthz`."
msgstr "**Vrata agenta:** Vsebnik teče OpenClaw prehod na vmesnik LAN na vratih 18789, z zdravstvenim pregledom HTTP `/healthz`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent gateway:** The container runs the OpenClaw gateway bound to the LAN interface on port 18789, with an HTTP health check against ``/healthz``."
msgstr "**Vrata agenta:** Vsebnik teče OpenClaw prehod na vmesnik LAN na vratih 18789, z zdravstvenim pregledom HTTP ``/healthz``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent receiver:** Container port 8000 is mapped to a host port (``local.agent``); external proxying for remote-host TLS agent registration is a follow-up."
msgstr "**Sprejemnik agentov:** Vrata zabojnika 8000 je kartirano na gostiteljska vrata (``local.agent``); Zunanje posredništvo za registracijo agenta TLS daljinskega gostitelja je nadaljevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent receiver:** Container port 8000 is mapped to a host port (`local.agent`); external proxying for remote-host TLS agent registration is a follow-up."
msgstr "**Sprejemnik agentov:** Vrata zabojnika 8000 je kartirano na gostiteljska vrata (`local.agent`); Zunanje posredništvo za registracijo agenta TLS daljinskega gostitelja je nadaljevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent reuse:** The embodied deployment is the agent role itself, so image, configuration and model routing stay identical to the isolated deployments."
msgstr "**Ponovna uporaba sredstva:** Utelešena razporeditev je vloga agenta sama, tako da podoba, konfiguracija in model usmerjanja ostanejo enaki izolirani razporeditvi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent-aware:** an agent role on the same host brings its editor extension along."
msgstr "**Agent-aware:** Zastopniška vloga na istem gostitelju prinaša njegovo razširitev uredništva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agents as employees, with a kernel between them and the host.** *web-app-hermes* and *web-app-openclaw* deploy agents behind the single sign-on gate, wired to the gateway's models and to the MCP servers discovery hands them, each proving on deploy that it can actually reach them. *svc-virt-kata* runs that tier under a kernel-isolating container runtime, and *svc-ai-robot* embodies an agent on a dedicated device. Every sandboxed agent acts as its own platform account rather than borrowing yours. See [web-app-hermes](roles/web-app-hermes/README.md), [web-app-openclaw](roles/web-app-openclaw/README.md) and [svc-virt-kata](roles/svc-virt-kata/README.md)."
msgstr "**Agenti kot zaposleni, z jedrom med njimi in gostiteljem.** *web-app-hermes* ter *web-app-openclaw* razporedite agente za enim samim vhodom, povezani z modeli vrat in na strežnike MCP, ki jih odkrijejo, in vsak od njih dokaže, da jih lahko doseže. *svc-virt-kata* izvaja to stopnjo v času delovanja posode z jedrom in *svc-ai-robot* Uteleša agenta na namenski napravi. Vsak agent v peskovniku deluje kot lastni račun, namesto da bi si sposodil tvojega. Glej. [web-app-hermes](roles/web-app-hermes/README.md), [web-app-openclaw](roles/web-app-openclaw/README.md) ter [svc-virt-kata](roles/svc-virt-kata/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agents consume tools as MCP clients via the [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) mechanism.** Hermes and OpenClaw are configured as MCP clients of the repository's MCP server roles over HTTP/SSE (not stdio: under microVM isolation and multi-node placement a stdio subprocess cannot reach an MCP server in another container). Discovery and credentials reuse 025's [`roles_with_service`](../../plugins/lookup/roles_with_service.py) lookup and `credentials:` blocks. Both roles are added to 025's MCP audit as client roles. Only 025's shared contract (the `services.mcp` schema) and the lookup extension are prerequisites for this requirement; 025's audit tooling, full lint set, and baserow+openwebui slice are independent later work."
msgstr "**Agenti porabijo orodja kot MCP stranke preko [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) mehanizem.** Hermes in OpenClaw so konfigurirani kot odjemalci MCP v vlogi strežnika skladišča nad HTTP/SSE (ne stdio: pod izolacijo mikroVM in namestitvijo več vozlišč podprocesa stdio ne more doseči strežnika MCP v drugi posodi). Odkritje in poverilnice ponovno uporabo 025's [`roles_with_service`](../../plugins/lookup/roles_with_service.py) iskanje in `credentials:` bloki. Obe vlogi sta dodani 025Revizija MCP kot vloge strank. Samo 025Skupna pogodba (o `services.mcp` shema) in razširitev iskanja sta pogoj za to zahtevo; 025Revizijska orodja, komplet lint in rezina baserow+openwebui so kasneje neodvisna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agents on demand:** The first completion of a user for ``hermes`` or ``openclaw`` creates that user’s agent; later requests reuse it, and a stopped agent is started again with its state volume re-attached."
msgstr "**Agenti na zahtevo:** Prvi zaključek uporabnika za ``hermes`` ali ``openclaw`` ustvari, da je uporabnik agent; kasneje zahteva ponovno uporabo, in ustavi agent se ponovno začne z njegovo stanje glasnost ponovno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agents on demand:** The first completion of a user for `hermes` or `openclaw` creates that user's agent; later requests reuse it, and a stopped agent is started again with its state volume re-attached."
msgstr "**Agenti na zahtevo:** Prvi zaključek uporabnika za `hermes` ali `openclaw` ustvari, da uporabnik agent; kasneje zahteva ponovno uporabo, in ustavi agent se ponovno začne z njegovo stanje glasnost ponovno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agents that spin up containers use nested Docker inside the isolated runtime; host socket passthrough is forbidden.** When an agent needs to run compose workloads (see the scenario below), it runs a nested Docker daemon inside its own isolated runtime. Mounting the host `/var/run/docker.sock` into an agent that executes model-generated code is **forbidden**: it grants root-equivalent host control and defeats the isolation entirely. Nested Docker costs performance and, on gVisor, may need `runsc` with the appropriate platform; the role README MUST document the overhead. An agent role that requires containers MUST declare this capability explicitly."
msgstr "**Agenti, ki vrtijo zabojnike, uporabljajo ugnezdenega Dockerja znotraj izoliranega časa delovanja; prehod skozi gostiteljsko vtičnico je prepovedan.** Ko mora agent zagnati sestavljanje delovnih bremen (Glej spodnji scenarij.), V svojem izoliranem času teče v gnezdu. Pritrditev gostitelja `/var/run/docker.sock` v agenta, ki izvaja modelno ustvarjeno kodo je **prepovedano**: daje prednost gostitelju in popolnoma izniči izolacijo. Nested Docker stroškov uspešnosti in, na gVisor, morda potrebujejo `runsc` z ustrezno platformo; vloga README MORA dokumentirati režijske stroške. Zastopniška vloga, ki zahteva posode, MORA to sposobnost izrecno navesti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agile Boards & Scrum/Kanban Integration:** Manage agile projects using Scrum or Kanban boards, track progress through sprints, and maintain a clear overview of work in progress."
msgstr "**Agile Boards & Scrum / Kanban Integracija:** Upravljajte agilne projekte z uporabo plošč Scrum ali Kanban, spremljajte napredek preko sprintov in ohranite jasen pregled nad delom v teku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Alert rules live in the role that owns the metric.** A role ships its Prometheus rules in *templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2*. The new *alert_rule_roles* lookup includes them only for roles that Prometheus actually scrapes, so a rules file needs no activation check of its own. It must start at the *groups:* item level. OpenBao's seal alert is the first rule to use it."
msgstr "**Pravila opozarjanja živijo v vlogi, ki je lastnica merila.** Vloga ladje Prometheus pravila v *templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2*. Novi *alert_rule_roles* iskanje vključuje le za vloge, ki Prometheus Pravzaprav postrga, zato datoteka s pravili ne potrebuje aktivacije. Začeti se mora pri *skupine:* raven postavk. Odpri Baov alarm je prvo pravilo, ki ga uporablja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Alert rules ship with the role.** ``templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`` is discovered by the ``alert_rule_roles`` lookup, which returns only roles that are actually scraped, so the fragment carries no activation guard of its own. It must start at the ``groups:`` item level."
msgstr "**Opozorilo pravila ladja z vlogo.** ``templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`` ga odkrije ``alert_rule_roles`` Vpogled, ki vrne le vloge, ki so dejansko opraskane, tako da fragment nosi brez aktivacijske straže svojega. Začeti se mora pri ``groups:`` raven postavk."

