# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Ansible authenticates via AppRole with caller-set ids.** First init uses the root token in memory only, enables AppRole, writes the inventory-generated `role_id` and `secret_id` through `role-id` / `custom-secret-id`, then revokes the root token. Later deploys log in with those inventory credentials."
msgstr "**Ansible overiti preko AppRole s klicatelj-set IDs.** Prvi init uporablja korenski žeton samo v pomnilniku, omogoča AppRole, napiše inventar-generated `role_id` ter `secret_id` skozi `role-id` / `custom-secret-id`, Potem prekliče žeton. Kasneje se prijavi s temi inventarji."

