msgstr "**Anzible**: Morate imeti Ansible nameščen v vašem sistemu za uporabo te vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Any other non-empty `whitelist`** (forwarded from `entry-manual-steer.yml` and similar). The explicit value MUST win over the diff and is passed through verbatim."
msgstr "**Drugo, neprazno `whitelist`** (posredovano od `entry-manual-steer.yml` in podobno). Izrecna vrednost mora zmagati nad diff in se prenese skozi dobesedno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Application Ecosystem** 🚀 A curated suite of self-hosted apps, from **project management**, **version control**, and **CI/CD** to **chat**, **video conferencing**, **CMS**, **e-learning**, **social networking**, and **e-commerce**, all seamlessly integrated."
msgstr "**Ekosistem uporabe** 🚀 Kustosiran apartma samogostoljubnih aplikacij iz **vodenje projektov**, **nadzor različic**in **CI/CD** do **klepet**, **videokonferenca**, **CMS**, **e-učenje**, **socialna omrežja**in **e-trgovanje**, vse brezhibno integrirano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Application fixes you will notice.** Nextcloud installs an OnlyOffice release upstream actually published, keeps social login working over tor, and makes its OIDC account an administrator. Element shows invites again through the new room list. Moodle survives the container roll during installation. Mattermost keeps its configuration in Postgres instead of on a shared volume, and its plugin tree is per node. GitLab creates the default organization a headless install never gets. Jellyfin waits for health before driving the setup wizard. Keycloak registers redirect URIs only for the apps a play deploys, keeps the allowed-origins claim out of the access token, and no longer caches LDAP federation past a fresh grant. The platform's own health mail no longer eats the sender quota."
msgstr "**Aplikacija popravi boste opazili.** Nextcloud namesti OnlyOffice sprostitev na začetku dejansko objavljena, ohranja družbeno prijavo deluje nad tor, in da svoj OIDC račun administrator. Elementi ponovno vabi skozi nov seznam sob. Moodle preživi zvitek posode med namestitvijo. Najbolj ohranja svojo konfiguracijo v Postgres namesto na skupni glasnosti, in njegov plugin drevo je na vozlišče. GitLab ustvari privzeto organizacijo brezglavo namestitev nikoli ne dobi. Jellyfin čaka na zdravje, preden vozi čarovnika. Registri Keycloak preusmerijo URI samo za aplikacije igra uporablja, ohranja dovoljeno-origini zahtevek izven dostopa žeton, in ne več caches LDAP federation mimo sveže donacije. Lastna pošta ne poje več kvote pošiljatelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Application improvements.** Penpot gained hardened OIDC, LDAP and native-login variants, SeaweedFS-backed asset tests and Swarm-ready health checks. Pi-hole received its v6-compatible login and password flow, Keycloak RBAC integration and expanded persona coverage. Further deployment, replication and startup fixes landed across Akaunting, BigBlueButton, ERPNext, Gitea, Keycloak, Magento, Mailu, Mastodon, Matomo, MediaWiki, Nextcloud, OpenProject, Pixelfed, Semaphore, Taiga, WordPress, XWiki and the internal CDN."
msgstr "**Izboljšave uporabe.** Penpot je pridobil utrjene OIDC, LDAP in native-login variante, SeaweedFS-Podprti testi in zdravstveni pregledi. Pi-hole prejel v6-kompatibilen pretok prijav in gesel, Keycloak Integracija RBAC in razširjena persona pokritost. Nadaljnja uporaba, replikacija in začetni popravki, iztovorjeni čez Akaunting, BigBlueButton, ERPNext, Gitea, Keycloak, Magento, Mailu, Mastodon, Matomo, MediaWiki, Nextcloud, OpenProject, Pixelfed, Semafor, Taiga, WordPress, XWiki in notranji CDN."

