# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Arch today:** the vendor ships neither a Debian nor an RPM repository, so only the Arch build is wired up."
msgstr "**Arch danes:** Prodajalec ne pošilja ne Debian ne RPM skladišča, tako da je samo Arch gradnja ozvočena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Architecture-guarded:** a host that is not amd64 aborts before the download."
msgstr "**Arhitekturno varovana:** gostitelj, ki ni amd64 prekine pred prenosom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Assignment is deterministic, never random.** It follows the row's index in the global discovery order and the sweep number, so re-running a sweep reproduces the run. Discovery order itself is stabilised by `INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SEED`, which CI sets to the run id, so the plan table, the discover job and every chunk block of one run agree without passing state between them."
msgstr "**Dodelitev je deterministična, nikoli naključna.** Sledi indeksu zaporedja v svetovnem vrstnem redu odkritij in številki preiskave, tako da ponovno zaganjanje reproducira tek. Sam vrstni red odkritja se stabilizira z `INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SEED`, ki KI nastavi na teči ID, tako da tabela načrta, odkritje delo in vsak delček blok enega teče strinja brez prehoda stanje med njimi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Assignment reads the row's position like an odometer.** The distro is the low digit and the filesystem the high one, so consecutive rows walk every pairing instead of a diagonal through it. Turning both on the position directly covers only `n` of the `n x m` pairs whenever the two pools are the same length, and the sweep number does not unlock it, because it shifts both by the same amount."
msgstr "**Razporeditev se glasi položaj vrste kot števec.** Distro je nizko število in datotečni sistem visok, zato zaporedne vrstice hodijo po vsakem paru namesto diagonale skozi njega. Vklop obeh pozicij neposredno zajema samo `n` – `n x m` pari, kadar sta oba bazena iste dolžine, in številka zamaha ga ne odklene, ker se premika oba za enako količino."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Atomic:** A fragment is applied in a single ``nft -f`` transaction, so the table is never observed half built."
msgstr "**Atomska:** Delček se uporabi v enem samem ``nft -f`` transakcija, tako da tabela ni nikoli opazna na pol zgrajena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Atomic:** A fragment is applied in a single `nft -f` transaction, so the table is never observed half built."
msgstr "**Atomska:** Delček se uporabi v enem samem `nft -f` transakcija, tako da tabela ni nikoli opazna na pol zgrajena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Auth caveat is documented.** Home Assistant uses its own auth (users + long-lived tokens + `trusted_proxies`), not full OIDC. The MCP endpoint is authenticated with a Home Assistant credential stored in `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:`; if platform SSO in front of the HA UI is wanted, the trusted-proxy header approach and its limits MUST be documented in the role README."
msgstr "**Auth Caveat je dokumentiran.** Domov Pomočnik uporablja svojo dušo (uporabniki + dolgoživi žetoni + `trusted_proxies`), Ne polno OIDC. Končna točka MCP je potrjena z Home Assistant credential shranjeno v `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:`; če je platforma SSO pred HA UI je zaželen, zaupanja vreden-proxy header pristop in njegove omejitve MORA biti dokumentiran v vlogi README."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Auth:** \"Sign in with Bluesky\" — AT Protocol OAuth against the user's PDS / identity. No local password store."
msgstr "**Auth:** \"Vpišite se z Bluesky\" — AT Protokol OAuth proti uporabniški PDS / identiteti. Ni krajevnih gesel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Authorization subject.** MCP integrations prefer user-scoped authorization. Service-account or administrator-scoped MCP credentials are allowed only for read-only default tool sets, or when the role README documents the upstream limitation and the operator explicitly enables mutating tools."
msgstr "**Predmet odobritve.** MCP integracije raje uporabniško-skopsko dovoljenje. Uporabniški račun ali poverilnice MCP, ki jih upravlja administrator, so dovoljene samo za privzete nabore orodij za branje ali kadar vloga README dokumentira zgornjo omejitev in operator izrecno omogoča mutirajoča orodja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Auto-Discovery**: Scans your NGINX ``servers`` directory for ``.conf`` files. 🔍"
msgstr "**Samodejno odkritje**: Skenira NGINX ``servers`` mapa za ``.conf`` datoteke. 🔍"

