# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Automation-friendly:** Admin user seeded from inventory variables."
msgstr "**Avtomatizacija prijazno:** Uporabnik skrbnika, posejan iz spremenljivk popisa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Avoid Root Logins & Plaintext Passwords** Infinito.Nexus MUST NOT allow logging in via the root user or using simple passwords. Instead, an SSH key MUST be generated and transferred during system initialization. When executing commands as root, always use `sudo` (or, if necessary, `sudo su`, but only if you understand the risks). (More information on [SSH](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell) and [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) is available on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Izogibajte se root prijav in navadnih gesel** Infinito.Nexus NE SME dovoliti prijave preko uporabnika root ali z uporabo preprostih gesel. Namesto tega je treba med inicializacijo sistema ustvariti in prenesti ključ SSH. Pri izvajanju ukazov kot root, vedno uporabite `sudo` (ali po potrebi, `sudo su`, vendar le, če razumete tveganja). (Več informacij o [SSH](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell) ter [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) je na voljo na Wikipediji.)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backend routing:** Model entries are generated for Ollama and LM Studio when those services run on the host, under the shared alias each model carries so a consumer names one model whichever local backend answers it."
msgstr "**Hrbtna pot:** Vnosi vzorcev so ustvarjeni za Ollama ter LM Studio kadar te storitve delujejo na gostitelja, ima vsak model pod skupnim imenom tako ime za potrošnika en model, na katerega odgovori lokalna hrbtenica."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup & Disaster Recovery** 💾 Scheduled backups and scripted recovery processes to safeguard your data."
msgstr "**Okrepitev in okrevanje po nesrečah** 💾 Načrtovane varnostne kopije in skriptirani procesi okrevanja za zaščito vaših podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Friendly:** Data isolated under ``{{ CONFLUENCE_HOME }}``."
msgstr "**Pomoč Prijazno:** Podatki, izolirani pod ``{{ CONFLUENCE_HOME }}``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Friendly:** Data isolated under `{{ CONFLUENCE_HOME }}`."
msgstr "**Pomoč Prijazno:** Podatki, izolirani pod `{{ CONFLUENCE_HOME }}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Layout:** Consolidated all backups under /var/lib/infinito, parameterized the pull workflow, switched to dump-only backups, and disabled Redis backups across web applications."
msgstr "**Postavitev varnostne kopije:** Konsolidirane vse varnostne kopije pod /var/lib/infinito, parameteriziral potek dela vlečenja, preklopil na varnostne kopije, ki so samo odvržene, in onemogočil Redis varnostne kopije preko spletnih aplikacij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Ready:** Persistent data under ``{{ JIRA_STORAGE_PATH }}``."
msgstr "**Rezerva pripravljena:** Trajni podatki ``{{ JIRA_STORAGE_PATH }}``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Ready:** Persistent data under `{{ JIRA_STORAGE_PATH }}`."
msgstr "**Rezerva pripravljena:** Trajni podatki `{{ JIRA_STORAGE_PATH }}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup and disaster recovery.** *svc-bkp-container-2-local* is superseded by *svc-bkp-volume-2-local*, making backup policy explicit per volume. The role prefers filesystem snapshots when available and can prepare btrfs hosts for snapshot-based backups itself. New *svc-bkp-nfs-2-local* protects the shared NFS export, *svc-bkp-secrets-2-local* captures secret material, and *svc-bkp-local-2-device* synchronizes backups to mounted external media. A unified *recover* CLI drives restores, while Compose recovery checks and a full Swarm disaster-recovery drill continuously verify the path. Rsync no longer retains superseded files as *~* copies."
msgstr "**Okrepitev in okrevanje po nesrečah.** *Svc-bkp-zabojnik-2-Lokalno.* nadomesti z *svc-bkp-volume-2-local*, da rezervna politika izrecno na obseg. Vloga raje datotečni sistem posnetke, ko so na voljo in lahko pripravi btrf gostitelje za fotografije-backups sam. Novo *svc-bkp-nfs-2-local* varuje skupni izvoz NFS, *svc-bkp-secrets-2-local* zajema skrivni material in *svc-bkp-local-2-device* sinhronizira varnostne kopije na nameščene zunanje medije. Enotna *izterja* Pogoni CLI se obnavljajo, medtem ko Compound pregledi okrevanja in polno Swarm-Recovery vrtalnik nenehno preverja pot. Rsync ne zadrži več zamenjanih datotek kot *~* Kopije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup free:** The volume is backup-disabled and its backup consumer stays off; every artefact in it is re-fetchable from its upstream."
msgstr "**Brezplačna rezerva:** Obseg je rezervno onemogočen in njegov rezervni potrošnik ostane izključen; vsak artefakt v njem je mogoče ponovno pridobiti iz svojega zgornjega toka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup integration:** Backup Docker Volumes snapshots the model volume when that role is present, without stopping the container."
msgstr "**Varnostna integracija:** Backup Docker Volume prikazuje obseg modela, ko je ta vloga prisotna, ne da bi ustavili posodo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup user SSH access was hardened:** backup keys are wrapped with a forced command wrapper and written via the shared user role; config is now users.backup.authorized_keys."
msgstr "**Varnostna kopija uporabnika SSH dostop je bil utrjen:** rezervni ključi so zaviti s prisilnim ovojem ukaza in zapisani prek skupne uporabniške vloge; config je zdaj users.backup.authorized_keys."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup/cleanup services are more reliable:** run-once flags execute earlier, user-backup is an explicit dependency, and cleanback now uses a configurable backups root and keeps the newest backups by default (force-keep=3)."
msgstr "**Varnostne/čistilne storitve so zanesljivejše:** prapori za zaganjanje enkrat prej, user-backup je eksplicitna odvisnost, in čiščenje nazaj zdaj uporablja nastavljive varnostne kopije koren in ohranja najnovejše varnostne kopije privzeto (vzdrževanje sile=3)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Baseline deploy**: a successful `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` run as defined in [Compose Loop](compose.md)."
msgstr "**Izhodiščno uvajanje**: uspešen `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` deluje, kot je opredeljeno v [Zanka sestavljanja](compose.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Baudolo-compatible layout:** snapshots land in the same `<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>` tree as the container backups, so pull and cleanup tooling applies unchanged."
msgstr "**Postavitev, združljiva z Baudolo:** Slike kopnega v istem `<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>` drevo kot rezerva posode, tako pull in čiščenje orodje velja nespremenjeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Baudolo-compatible layout:** snapshots land in the same ``<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>`` tree as the container backups, so pull and cleanup tooling applies unchanged."
msgstr "**Postavitev, združljiva z Baudolo:** Slike kopnega v istem ``<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>`` drevo kot rezerva posode, tako pull in čiščenje orodje velja nespremenjeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Be Collaborative:** Foster an environment where everyone can contribute freely. Offer help and constructive feedback, and work together towards common goals."
msgstr "**Sodelujte:** Spodbujati okolje, v katerem lahko vsakdo svobodno prispeva. Ponuditi pomoč in konstruktivne povratne informacije ter sodelovati pri doseganju skupnih ciljev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Be Inclusive:** Welcome contributions from all backgrounds and experiences. Encourage diverse perspectives and engage in constructive dialogue."
msgstr "**Bodite vključujoči:** Dobrodošli prispevki iz vseh okolij in izkušenj. Spodbujanje različnih perspektiv in sodelovanje v konstruktivnem dialogu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Be Respectful:** Communicate and collaborate with courtesy, empathy, and respect. Listen to others’ opinions and value their input."
msgstr "**Bodite spoštljivi:** Komunicirajte in sodelujte z vljudnostjo, empatijo in spoštovanjem. Poslušajte mnenja drugih in cenite njihov prispevek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bearer authentication.** An empty key list would disable auth, so the role always renders one."
msgstr "**Overovitev nosilcev.** Prazni seznam ključev bi onemogočil avt, tako da vloga vedno naredi enega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bearer-key API server:** The API server is gated by a generated `API_SERVER_KEY`, and calls to `/v1/models` without that key are rejected."
msgstr "**Nosilec-ključ API strežnik:** – API strežnik je vrata z ustvarjeno `API_SERVER_KEY`, in klice k `/v1/models` brez tega ključa se zavrne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bearer-key API server:** The API server is gated by a generated ``API_SERVER_KEY``, and calls to ``/v1/models`` without that key are rejected."
msgstr "**Nosilec-ključ API strežnik:** – API strežnik je vrata z ustvarjeno ``API_SERVER_KEY``, in klice k ``/v1/models`` brez tega ključa se zavrne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Best practices compliant** with modern SSH usage"
msgstr "**V skladu z najboljšimi praksami** s sodobno SSH uporabo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Better cross-distro stability:** sys-pip-install now resolves the correct pip executable dynamically and uses ansible.builtin.pip, reducing interpreter/PATH mismatches; plus CoreDNS is a compose dependency and yay auto-rebuilds if the binary is broken after libalpm ABI changes."
msgstr "**Boljša navzkrižna distro stabilnost:** sys-pip-install Zdaj reši pravilno izvršljivo dinamično in uporabo ansible.builtin.pip, zmanjšanje tolmača/PATH neskladja; plus CoreDNS je komponirana odvisnost in yay avto-rebuildings, če je binarna razbita po libalpm ABI spremembe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Beware of Phishing and Social Engineering** You MUST verify email senders, avoid clicking on unknown links, and MUST NEVER share your passwords or 2FA codes with anyone. (Learn more about [Phishing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phishing) and [Social Engineering](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_engineering_(security)) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Pazite se fishinga in socialnega inženiringa** MORATE preveriti e-poštnih pošiljateljev, se izogniti kliku na neznane povezave, in NE MORAJO nikoli deliti svoja gesla ali 2Kode FA s komerkoli. (Več o tem [Fishing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phishing) ter [Socialni inženiring](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_engineering_(security)) na Wikipediji.)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bind Mount Robustness:** Fixed CI-specific bind mount issues, ensured /tmp/gh-action visibility, prevented file-vs-directory conflicts, and asserted OpenResty/NGINX mount sources before startup."
msgstr "**Robustnost priključka:** Fiksna CI-specific vezana vprašanja priklopa, zagotovljena /tmp/gh-action vidnost, preprečevanje navzkrižja datotek-vs-imenik, in uveljavlja OpenResty/NGINX priklopite vire pred zagonom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Book Cataloging:** Add, search, and organize books; import/export libraries."
msgstr "**Kataloga knjige:** Dodajanje, iskanje in organiziranje knjig; uvoz / izvoz knjižnic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**BookWyrm** is a self-hosted social reading platform where users can share books, post reviews, follow each other, and join federated conversations across the Fediverse. It is a community-driven alternative to proprietary platforms like Goodreads. Readers can catalog their library, track reading progress, and discover new books through friends and federated timelines."
msgstr "**BookWyrm** je platforma za samogost družabnega branja, kjer si uporabniki lahko delijo knjige, objavljajo ocene, si sledijo in se pridružijo federativnim pogovorom po Fediversu. To je alternativa lastnim platformam, kot je Goodreads. Bralci lahko katalogizirajo svojo knjižnico, sledijo napredku branja in odkrivajo nove knjige preko prijateljev in federiranih časovnih okvirov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bootstrap Volume Exclusion:** Ignores known bootstrap volumes (e.g., `/var/www/bootstrap`)."
msgstr "**Izločitev glasnosti škornje:** Prezri znane količine škornjitrapa (Npr. `/var/www/bootstrap`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bootstrap Volume Exclusion:** Ignores known bootstrap volumes (e.g., ``/var/www/bootstrap``)."
msgstr "**Izločitev glasnosti škornje:** Prezri znane količine škornjitrapa (Npr. ``/var/www/bootstrap``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bootstrap leaves no stored root token.** The first deploy holds it in memory, pins both AppRole halves to inventory values, then revokes it. Tokens reach the CLI through stdin and the container token helper, never through process arguments, and the helper file is removed at the end of the run."
msgstr "**Čevlji ne puščajo shranjenih žetonov.** Prva aplikacija ga drži v pomnilniku, obe polovici AppRole pritrdi na inventarne vrednosti, nato pa ga prekliče. Žetoni dosežejo CLI skozi stdin in vsebnik žeton pomočnika, nikoli s procesnimi argumenti, datoteka pomočnika pa se ob koncu teka odstrani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bootstrap-styled interface**: clean, minimalistic, and responsive layout."
msgstr "**Vmesnik v slogu škornjev**: čista, minimalistična in odzivna postavitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Both deployment modes are supported** (`modes.compose.enabled: true`, `modes.swarm.enabled: true`), with swarm running a single node pinned to the manager."
msgstr "**Oba načina uvajanja sta podprta** (`modes.compose.enabled: true`, `modes.swarm.enabled: true`), Z rojem, ki vodi eno vozlišče do upravitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Both** auth plugins: `jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth` (central OpenLDAP, all clients) **and** `9p4/jellyfin-plugin-sso` (Keycloak OIDC, web one-click)."
msgstr "**Oboje** vstavki za outh: `jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth` (osrednji OpenLDAP, vse stranke) **ter** `9p4/jellyfin-plugin-sso` (Keycloak OIDC, spletni en klik)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares ``start``, ``end`` and ``step`` has its point count checked against ``result_items`` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
msgstr "**Meje:** Orodje, katerega shema je objavljena ``start``, ``end`` ter ``step`` ima preverjeno število točk ``result_items`` in se zavrne z najmanjšim korakom, ki ustreza, tako da toku navzgor nikoli ne skenira razpona, katerega rezultat bi adapter zavrgel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares `start`, `end` and `step` has its point count checked against `result_items` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
msgstr "**Meje:** Orodje, katerega shema je objavljena `start`, `end` ter `step` ima preverjeno število točk `result_items` in se zavrne z najmanjšim korakom, ki ustreza, tako da toku navzgor nikoli ne skenira razpona, katerega rezultat bi adapter zavrgel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded resources:** The container is capped at 4 CPUs, 8 GB of memory and 2048 processes, and the role declares a minimum of 4 GB free storage for building the image; downloaded models grow the volume beyond that."
msgstr "**Omejeni viri:** Posoda je pokrita 4 CPE, 8 GB pomnilnika in 2048 procese in vlogo razglasi za najmanj 4 GB brezplačno shranjevanje za gradnjo slike; preneseni modeli rastejo obseg, ki presega to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass ``cmkadmin``:** Seeded on first run via ``CMK_PASSWORD`` and re-converged onto the running site on every deploy; reachable via the local login form only when the SSO gate is absent."
msgstr "**lomno steklo ``cmkadmin``:** Semena na prvi vožnji preko ``CMK_PASSWORD`` in se ponovno priklopil na tekočo lokacijo na vsaki lokaciji; dosegljiv prek lokalnega prijavnega obrazca le, če vrat SSO ni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass `cmkadmin`:** Seeded on first run via `CMK_PASSWORD` and re-converged onto the running site on every deploy; reachable via the local login form only when the SSO gate is absent."
msgstr "**lomno steklo `cmkadmin`:** Semena na prvi vožnji preko `CMK_PASSWORD` in se ponovno priklopil na tekočo lokacijo na vsaki lokaciji; dosegljiv prek lokalnega prijavnega obrazca le, če vrat SSO ni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass admin** - a local administrator seeded via the first-run wizard (`/Startup`), independent of SSO/LDAP."
msgstr "**Break-glass admin** - lokalni administrator posejan preko čarovnika prvega teka (`/Startup`), neodvisno od SSO/LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass admin** - a local administrator seeded via the first-run wizard (``/Startup``), independent of SSO/LDAP."
msgstr "**Break-glass admin** - lokalni administrator posejan preko čarovnika prvega teka (``/Startup``), neodvisno od SSO/LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass local admin:** `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*` seeds a local admin from the `web-app-semaphore-breakglass` user in every variant, reachable through the login form only when LDAP is disabled."
msgstr "**Break-glass lokalni admin:** `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*` seme lokalni admin iz `web-app-semaphore-breakglass` uporabnik v vsaki varianti, dosegljiv prek prijavnega obrazca samo, če je LDAP onemogočen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass local admin:** ``SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*`` seeds a local admin from the ``web-app-semaphore-breakglass`` user in every variant, reachable through the login form only when LDAP is disabled."
msgstr "**Break-glass lokalni admin:** ``SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*`` seme lokalni admin iz ``web-app-semaphore-breakglass`` uporabnik v vsaki varianti, dosegljiv prek prijavnega obrazca samo, če je LDAP onemogočen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Breaking Changes**"
msgstr "**Prekinjanje sprememb**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Breaking Changes:** Migration from *util-* to bundle inventories under *inventories/bundles/*; deployments must migrate to new bundle and role names. Central package and AUR model via *SYS_PACKAGES* and *SYS_AUR_PACKAGES*; new roles *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install*; renames including *util-desk-dev-core* to *dev-core*, *util-desk-dev-python* to *dev-python*, *util-desk-dev-arduino* to *dev-arduino*; *util-srv-corporate-identity* removed."
msgstr "**Prelomne spremembe:** Migracije iz *util-* V paketne zaloge *zaloge/kupole/*; napotitve morajo preiti na nove skupine in imena vlog. Osrednji paket in model AUR prek *SYS_PACKAGES* ter *SYS_AUR_PACKAGES*; nove vloge; *sys-aur* ter *sys-aur-install*; preimenovanja, vključno z *Util-desk-dev-core* do *dev-core*, *Util-desk-dev-python* do *dev-python*, *Util-desk-dev-arduino* do *dev-arduino*; *Identiteta podjetja* odstranjena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bridges are explicit and validated.** When an addon itself integrates with another role, it MUST list the bridged service key under `bridges:`. Each listed key MUST resolve to a service block already declared in the same role's `meta/services.yml`. Lint fails otherwise. Front-door auth gates such as oauth2-proxy are not addon bridges unless the addon itself talks to that service. **Two distinct meanings of \"bridge\" exist and MUST NOT be conflated:** the `bridges:` *field* names an in-repo cross-role service dependency (e.g. an addon that talks to `svc-db-openldap`), whereas `mechanism: bridge` marks an addon that *is* a network/appservice bridge to an external system (e.g. a Matrix mautrix bridge to WhatsApp/Telegram). A single addon MAY be both: a `mechanism: bridge` addon MAY also declare a `bridges:` dependency on an in-repo service it relies on."
msgstr "**Mostovi so jasni in potrjeni.** Ko se addon sam integrira z drugo vlogo, MORA naštevati premostitveni servisni ključ pod `bridges:`. Vsak navedeni ključ mora rešiti do storitvenega bloka, ki je že deklariran v isti vlogi `meta/services.yml`. Lint ne uspe drugače. vhodna vrata, kot je oauth2-Proxy niso addon mostovi, razen če addon sam govori s to službo. **Dva različna pomena \"bridge\" obstajajo in NE smejo biti povezani:** o `bridges:` *polje* navaja odvisnost od storitev navzkrižne role in repo (npr. dodatek, s katerim se pogovarja `svc-db-openldap`), medtem ko `mechanism: bridge` označuje addon, ki *m* most za omrežje/appservice do zunanjega sistema (Npr. Matrix mautrix most na WhatsApp/Telegram). En dodatek je lahko oboje: a `mechanism: bridge` Addon LAHKO razglasi tudi `bridges:` odvisnost od storitev v zvezi z vračanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Browser Cache:** Browsers cache responses based on HTTP headers like `Cache-Control` or `Expires`."
msgstr "**Predpomnilnik brskalnika:** Predpomnilnik brskalnikov temelji na glavah HTTP kot `Cache-Control` ali `Expires`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Browser:** Clear the browser cache or use a private window."
msgstr "**Brskalnik:** Počisti predpomnilnik brskalnika ali pa uporabi zasebno okno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Build-time model.** The checkpoint is a cached image layer rather than a download the first container start waits for."
msgstr "**Zgraditi-čas model.** Kontrolna točka je predpomnjena plast slike, namesto da bi prenesli prvi začetek vsebnika čaka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Builder stage:** pinned ``hugomods/hugo:exts-<version>`` (extended Hugo) clones the configured content repository and runs ``hugo --minify -e <env> -b <baseURL>`` to render the site to ``/public``."
msgstr "**Graditeljska faza:** pripeto ``hugomods/hugo:exts-<version>`` (podaljšano Hugo) klonira nastavljeno skladišče vsebin in teče ``hugo --minify -e <env> -b <baseURL>`` da bi mesto ``/public``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Builder stage:** pinned `hugomods/hugo:exts-<version>` (extended Hugo) clones the configured content repository and runs `hugo --minify -e <env> -b <baseURL>` to render the site to `/public`."
msgstr "**Graditeljska faza:** pripeto `hugomods/hugo:exts-<version>` (podaljšano Hugo) klonira nastavljeno skladišče vsebin in teče `hugo --minify -e <env> -b <baseURL>` da bi mesto `/public`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Built-in Analytics:**"
msgstr "**Vgrajena Analytics:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Built-in Analytics:**   Monitor link performance and track click data to gain valuable insights into user engagement."
msgstr "**Vgrajena Analytics:** Monitor povezavo uspešnosti in sledenje klikom podatkov, da bi pridobili dragocene vpoglede v sodelovanje uporabnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Built-in Database Access:** Seamlessly interact with the underlying MariaDB for your Git service."
msgstr "**Vgrajen dostop do podatkovne zbirke:** Brezhibno interakcijo z osnovnim MariaDB za vašo Git storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Built-in healthcheck** ``rabbitmq-diagnostics ping``."
msgstr "**Vgrajen zdravstveni pregled** ``rabbitmq-diagnostics ping``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Built-in healthcheck** `rabbitmq-diagnostics ping`."
msgstr "**Vgrajen zdravstveni pregled** `rabbitmq-diagnostics ping`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Built-in healthcheck** authenticated ``redis-cli ping``."
msgstr "**Vgrajen zdravstveni pregled** overjeno ``redis-cli ping``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Built-in healthcheck** authenticated `redis-cli ping`."
msgstr "**Vgrajen zdravstveni pregled** overjeno `redis-cli ping`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bump path**: update ``services.erpnext.version`` in ``meta/services.yml``, redeploy. Schema migrations run automatically on first start of the new image (Frappe ships ``bench migrate`` in the backend container’s entrypoint)."
msgstr "**Udarna pot**: posodobitev ``services.erpnext.version`` v ``meta/services.yml``, redeploy. Migracije shem samodejno tečejo ob prvem začetku nove slike (Ladje Frappe ``bench migrate`` v vstopni točki posode za hrbtni del)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bump path**: update `services.erpnext.version` in `meta/services.yml`, redeploy. Schema migrations run automatically on first start of the new image (Frappe ships `bench migrate` in the backend container's entrypoint)."
msgstr "**Udarna pot**: posodobitev `services.erpnext.version` v `meta/services.yml`, redeploy. Migracije shem samodejno tečejo ob prvem začetku nove slike (Ladje Frappe `bench migrate` v vstopni točki zabojnika za zadnji del)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bundled Elasticsearch:** Search engine ships with the role until a central ``svc-db-elasticsearch`` exists."
msgstr "**Bundled Elasticsearch:** Iščite ladje z vlogo do centra ``svc-db-elasticsearch`` Obstaja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bundled Elasticsearch:** Search engine ships with the role until a central `svc-db-elasticsearch` exists."
msgstr "**Bundled Elasticsearch:** Iščite ladje z vlogo do centra `svc-db-elasticsearch` Obstaja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CDN Cache (Cloudflare):** If your domain is proxied through Cloudflare, Cloudflare may cache your content at their edge servers and serve it from there, often without requests reaching your origin server."
msgstr "**Predpomnilnik CDN (Cloudflare):** Če je vaša domena proksirana prek Cloudflare, lahko Cloudflare shrani vašo vsebino na robnih strežnikih in jo od tam postreže, pogosto brez zahtev, ki bi dosegle vaš izvorni strežnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CDN-backed delivery:** Declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes."
msgstr "**Dostava s podporo CDN:** Deklare ``web-svc-cdn`` kot toku, ki služi dejanskim CSS bajtom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CDN-backed delivery:** Declares `web-svc-cdn` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes."
msgstr "**Dostava s podporo CDN:** Deklare `web-svc-cdn` kot toku, ki služi dejanskim CSS bajtom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI DNS & Defaults:** Introduced CoreDNS-based *.localhost resolution (A/AAAA to loopback), set DOMAIN_PRIMARY to localhost, added DNS assertions and a strict default 404 vhost to stabilize early CI stages."
msgstr "**Privzeti IZ DNS:** Uvedeno na osnovi CoreDNS *.lokalna resolucija gostitelja (A/AAAA za nazaj), pripravljen DOMAIN_PRIMARY lokalnemu gostitelju, dodane izjave DNS in strogo privzeto 404 vhost stabilizirati zgodnje faze CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI Debugging:** Greatly improved CI diagnostics by dumping resolved docker compose configuration and environment data in debug mode, with optional unmasked .env output."
msgstr "**CI Debugging:** Zelo izboljšano CI diagnostiko z odmetavanjem rešenih docker sestavljanje konfiguracije in okoljskih podatkov v načinu razhroščevanja, z neobveznim razmaščen .env izhod."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI Optimized:** Prevents GitHub Actions images from growing uncontrollably."
msgstr "**CI Optimizirano:** Preprečuje GitHub Actions slike iz nenadzorovano raste."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and Tests**"
msgstr "**CI in testi**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and Tests:** New integration tests for portable python shebangs, forbid *sh -lc* with *pipefail*, and improved variable checks. CI stability improvements for per distro stacks and mirror resolver via venv Python, plus more robust package manager retries."
msgstr "**CI in testi:** Novi integracijski testi za prenosne piton shebangs, prepoved *sh - lc* z *pipefail*, in izboljšane variabilne preglede. Izboljšave stabilnosti CI za distro nizov in zrcalno ločljivost preko venv Python, plus bolj robusten manager."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and diagnostics.** Deployment runs are planned separately per mode and divided into starred priority and regular lines, with branch-new roles scheduled first. Matrix entries serialize across branches, large lines serialize their deployment modes, and failed roles can be retriggered on the original distribution set; *--strict* limits this to hard failures. Cancelled runs can have their failed jobs rerun, and role failures on *main* open or update dedicated issues. Deployment stages are sourced from *categories.yml*."
msgstr "**CI in diagnostika.** Teke uvajanja so načrtovane posebej za vsak način in razdeljene na zvezdnate prednostne in redne linije, pri čemer so najprej predvidene nove vloge. Vpisi Matrix se seštevajo med podružnicami, velike linije se seštevajo njihove načine uporabe in neuspešne vloge se lahko ponovno sprožijo na originalnem distribucijskem nizu; *-- short* to omejuje na težke napake. Preklicane vožnje imajo lahko neuspešna ponavljanja opravil in neuspešne vloge *glavni* odprta ali posodobljena namenska vprašanja. Stopnje uvajanja izhajajo iz *categories.yml*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI deploys only the variants a change reaches.** An image bump in a provider no longer redeploys the variants of its consumers that switch that provider off. The diff-derived whitelist, used by the weekly update PRs, Dependabot and every other diff-driven run, narrows each affected role to the variants whose round closure still reaches a changed role, emitted as *role#0,2* selection tokens. A changed role and a role reached only through *run_after* keep every variant. A pinned token naming a role that discovery does not return now warns instead of aborting the run; role names are still checked against *roles/* before the run starts."
msgstr "**CI uporablja samo variante, ki jih doseže sprememba.** Slikovna ovira v ponudniku ne spreminja več različic svojih potrošnikov, ki izključijo ponudnika. Beli seznam diff, ki ga uporabljajo tedenske posodobitve PR, Dependabot in vsak drug diff pogon, zoži vsako prizadeto vlogo na variante, katerih zaokroženo zaprtje še vedno doseže spremenjeno vlogo, oddano kot *vloga#0,2* Žetoni za izbiro. Spremenjena vloga in vloga, ki sta bili doseženi samo z *run_after* Obdrži vse variante. Pritrjen simbol, ki imenuje vlogo, ki je odkritje ne vrne zdaj opozarja namesto prekinitev teče; imena vlog so še vedno preverjena *vloge/* Preden se začne tek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI images are built natively per architecture and published as one tag per distro.** Each architecture builds on its own runner, and [push.sh](../../../scripts/image/push.sh) pushes the result by digest only, so no per-architecture tag exists. [manifest_all.sh](../../../scripts/image/manifest_all.sh) then publishes the plain `<tag>` as a manifest list over every architecture's digest. Every consumer pulls the plain tag and gets the image matching its machine."
msgstr "**CI slike so zgrajene doma po arhitekturi in objavljene kot ena oznaka na distro.** Vsaka arhitektura gradi na svojem tekaču, in [push.sh](../../../scripts/image/push.sh) Potisne rezultat samo s prebavo, tako da ne obstaja oznaka po arhitekturi. [manifest_all.sh](../../../scripts/image/manifest_all.sh) nato objavi ravnino `<tag>` kot manifest za vsako arhitekturo. Vsak potrošnik potegne znak in dobi sliko, ki ustreza stroju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI runner-split.** The deploy-matrix discovery ([axes.py](../../../utils/github/variant/axes.py), wired via [output_apps.sh](../../../scripts/github/resolve/output_apps.sh)) gives every variant its own matrix entry (runner): a 5-variant role becomes five rows `0`…`4`, each carrying the deploy mode and tor state the sweep rotation assigned it. Each runner receives its variant through the `variant` env (consumed by `--variant`). Which rows a given run deploys is decided by the chunker ([chunks.py](../../../cli/meta/ci/chunks.py)), not by bundling."
msgstr "**CI runner-plit.** Odkritje po meri ([axes.py](../../../utils/github/variant/axes.py), z žico [output_apps.sh](../../../scripts/github/resolve/output_apps.sh)) daje vsaka varianta svoj matrični vnos (tekač): a 5-spremenljiva vloga postane pet vrstic `0`...`4`, vsak ima način razporeditve in tor navesti vrtenje pometa, ki mu je bilo dodeljeno. Vsak tekač prejme svojo različico skozi `variant` env (zaužiti `--variant`). O katerih vrsticah, ki se uporabljajo za določen potek, odloča lončar ([chunks.py](../../../cli/meta/ci/chunks.py))Ne z združevanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI runs a real Tor E2E** (`torsocks curl` against the minted onion) with retry logic; unit tests remain the merge-blocking base."
msgstr "**CI vodi pravi Tor E2E** (`torsocks curl` proti kovani čebuli) z logiko ponovnega poskusa; preskusi enote ostanejo osnova za blokiranje združitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI selects, resumes and proves.** A fourth deploy chunk stops a short priority chunk stranding budget, a manual run can set the chunk size the formula would derive, and a retrigger can override the chunk gate. Retriggering works by role and by what never got a verdict, resumes behind the green window rather than the deployed one, retires suites the source run already passed, and cancels the run before retriggering its failed roles. Each role's README instructions are replayed on its smallest deploy row, in the mode its *services.yml* declares. Distro images build concurrently on one runner, the matrix job folds into the image job, and the deploy chunks no longer wait on the DNS test."
msgstr "**CI izbere, nadaljuje in dokaže.** Četrta uporaba delček ustavi kratek prednostni del nasedanje proračun, ročno teči lahko nastavite velikost delčkov formula bi dobili, in retrigger lahko razveljavi del vrata. Retriggering dela po vlogi in po tem, kar nikoli ni bilo razsodbe, nadaljuje za zelenim oknom, namesto razporejenega, upokoji suite, ki jih vir že teče, in prekliče tek, preden ponovno sproži svoje neuspešne vloge. Navodila za vsako vlogo README se ponovno predvajajo v najmanjši vrsti uporabe v načinu *services.yml* Razglasi. Distro slike gradijo hkrati na enem tekaču, matrično opravilo se zloži v slikovno opravilo in razporedi delčke, ki ne čakajo več na DNS test."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI workflow ready:** All deploy-test workflows route to GitHub-hosted runners by default; set `CI_SELF_HOSTED_RUNNER_COUNT` to overflow jobs to your runners."
msgstr "**Delovni tok CI pripravljen:** Privzeto vsa delovna pot do tekačev, ki gostijo GitHub; nastavljena `CI_SELF_HOSTED_RUNNER_COUNT` da preplavite delo svojim tekačem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI workflow ready:** All deploy-test workflows route to GitHub-hosted runners by default; set ``CI_SELF_HOSTED_RUNNER_COUNT`` to overflow jobs to your runners."
msgstr "**Delovni tok CI pripravljen:** Privzeto vsa delovna pot do tekačev, ki gostijo GitHub; nastavljena ``CI_SELF_HOSTED_RUNNER_COUNT`` da preplavite delo svojim tekačem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI**: set the `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` repository variable. For the GitHub click path see [CI Configuration](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md#infinito_playwright_keep-)."
msgstr "**IZ**: nastavite `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` spremenljivka skladišča. Za pot GitHub si oglejte [Nastavitev CI](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md#infinito_playwright_keep-)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CLI OIDC login (`bao login -method=oidc`, `http://localhost:8250/oidc/callback`) is out of scope.**"
msgstr "**Prijava CLI OIDC (`bao login -method=oidc`, `http://localhost:8250/oidc/callback`) je izven dosega.**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CLI OIDC login is out of scope.** ``redirect_uris`` registers ``https://<domain>/*``, covering UI and API callbacks but not the CLI’s ``http://localhost:8250/oidc/callback``. Use AppRole for non-interactive access."
msgstr "**Prijava CLI OIDC je izven obsega.** ``redirect_uris`` registri ``https://<domain>/*``, ki zajema IU in API pozivi, vendar ne CLI ``http://localhost:8250/oidc/callback``. Uporabite AppRole za neinteraktivni dostop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CLI OIDC login is out of scope.** `redirect_uris` registers `https://<domain>/*`, covering UI and API callbacks but not the CLI's `http://localhost:8250/oidc/callback`. Use AppRole for non-interactive access."
msgstr "**Prijava CLI OIDC je izven obsega.** `redirect_uris` registri `https://<domain>/*`, ki zajema IU in API pozivi, vendar ne CLI-jev `http://localhost:8250/oidc/callback`. Uporabite AppRole za neinteraktivni dostop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CNG multi-service deployment:** webservice, sidekiq, workhorse, gitaly, gitlab-shell and a migrations one-shot from unmodified upstream images."
msgstr "**Uporaba več storitev CNG:** spletna storitev, sidekiq, delovni konj, gitaly, gitlab-shell in migracija en posnetek iz nespremenjenih gornjih slik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CPU inference:** The role builds its own image from the pinned llmster release for the host's architecture, amd64 or arm64, keeps only the CPU llama.cpp engine and passes no GPU device into the container."
msgstr "**Utemeljitev CPE:** Vloga gradi svojo lastno podobo iz vezanega lmster javnost za arhitekturo gostitelja, amd64 ali roke64, ohranja samo CPE llama.cpp motor in ne prehaja nobene naprave GPU v posodo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CPU inference:** The role builds its own image from the pinned llmster release for the host’s architecture, amd64 or arm64, keeps only the CPU llama.cpp engine and passes no GPU device into the container."
msgstr "**Utemeljitev CPE:** Vloga gradi svojo lastno podobo iz vezanega lmster javnost za arhitekturo gostitelja, amd64 ali roke64, ohranja samo CPE llama.cpp motor in ne prehaja nobene naprave GPU v posodo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CPU transcoding only** (no GPU passthrough)."
msgstr "**Samo transkodiranje CPE** (brez prehoda GPE)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CRM & Sales Management:** Track leads, opportunities, and customer relationships. Manage sales pipelines, quotations, and orders with full visibility into sales performance."
msgstr "**Upravljanje & prodaje CRM:** Sledi vodi, priložnosti in odnosi s strankami. Upravljajte prodajne cevovode, kotacije in naročila s popolno prepoznavnostjo v prodajni uspešnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP & Canonical Domains:** Hooks into platform CSP/SSL/domain management to keep policies strict and URLs stable."
msgstr "**CSP & kanonične domene:** Priklopi na ploščad CSP/SSL/domain upravljanje za ohranjanje politik strogo in URL-ji stabilno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP & Canonical Domains:** Integrates with platform CSP and domain management."
msgstr "**CSP & kanonične domene:** Vključuje s platformo CSP in upravljanje domen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP Health Checks:** Migrated CSP health checks to a Docker-based csp-checker with configurable image selection, optional pre-pull behavior, and improved ignore handling."
msgstr "**Zdravstveni pregledi CSP:** Migrirani CSP zdravstveni pregledi za Docker-based csp-checker z nastavljivo izbiro slike, neobvezno pred-pull vedenje, in izboljšano prezreti ravnanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP Resource Validation:** Uses Puppeteer to simulate browser requests and detect blocked resources."
msgstr "**Potrjevanje virov CSP:** Uporablja Lutkeer za simulacijo zahtev brskalnika in odkrivanje blokiranih virov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP integration**: Automatically appends the required script hash into your CSP policy via the role’s CSP helper."
msgstr "**Integracija CSP**: Samodejno doda zahtevani skript hash v vašo politiko CSP preko CSP pomočnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP** allows ``unsafe-inline``/``unsafe-eval`` for ``script-src-elem`` and ``blob:`` workers/images, required by Penpot’s SPA and worker-based renderer."
msgstr "**CSP** omogoča ``unsafe-inline``/``unsafe-eval`` besedilo ``script-src-elem`` ter ``blob:`` delavci/slike, ki jih zahteva PenpotSPA in izrisovalec na osnovi delavcev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP** allows `unsafe-inline`/`unsafe-eval` for `script-src-elem` and `blob:` workers/images, required by Penpot's SPA and worker-based renderer."
msgstr "**CSP** omogoča `unsafe-inline`/`unsafe-eval` besedilo `script-src-elem` ter `blob:` delavci/slike, ki jih zahteva PenpotSPA in izrisovalec delavcev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP-derived allowlist:** Proxy upstreams are generated from the applications' CSP whitelists, so the mirror can only reach hosts the deployment already trusts."
msgstr "**Seznam dovoljenj, pridobljenih s strani CSP:** Posredniki so ustvarjeni iz belih seznamov CSP aplikacij, tako da lahko ogledalo doseže le gostitelje že vzpostavljenih skladov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP-derived allowlist:** Proxy upstreams are generated from the applications’ CSP whitelists, so the mirror can only reach hosts the deployment already trusts."
msgstr "**Seznam dovoljenj, pridobljenih s strani CSP:** Posredniki, ki so višje v smeri proti toku, so ustvarjeni iz belih seznamov CSP aplikacij, tako da lahko ogledalo doseže le gostitelje že vzpostavljenih skladov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP.** MCP Streamable HTTP runs server-to-server (the client role's backend connects to the server role), so a server role MUST NOT need a new browser `csp` `connect-src` entry for MCP. If an implementation does require a browser-side MCP fetch, the added `connect-src` source MUST be documented in the role README."
msgstr "**CSP.** MCP Streable HTTP poganja strežnik-to-strežnik (Hrbtenica odjemalca je povezana z vlogo strežnika), tako da vloga strežnika ne sme potrebujejo novega brskalnika `csp` `connect-src` vnos za MCP. Če izvajanje zahteva brskalnik-side MCP grack, dodan `connect-src` Vir mora biti dokumentiran v vlogi README."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cache directory management**: cleanup and recreation based on `MODE_CLEANUP`."
msgstr "**Upravljanje mape predpomnilnika**: čiščenje in rekreacija temelji na `MODE_CLEANUP`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cache directory management**: cleanup and recreation based on ``MODE_CLEANUP``."
msgstr "**Upravljanje mape predpomnilnika**: čiščenje in rekreacija temelji na ``MODE_CLEANUP``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cache friendly:** Responses for a commit SHA are immutable; every response carries `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`."
msgstr "**Cache prijazen:** Odzivi za zavezo SHA so nespremenljivi; vsak odgovor prinaša `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cache friendly:** Responses for a commit SHA are immutable; every response carries ``Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *``."
msgstr "**Cache prijazen:** Odzivi za zavezo SHA so nespremenljivi; vsak odgovor prinaša ``Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Canonical CDN service:** Provides the primary ``cdn`` service entry consumed via ``services.cdn`` across the stack."
msgstr "**Storitev Canonical CDN:** Zagotavlja primarno ``cdn`` vnos storitev, porabljen prek ``services.cdn`` Čez kup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Canonical CDN service:** Provides the primary `cdn` service entry consumed via `services.cdn` across the stack."
msgstr "**Storitev Canonical CDN:** Zagotavlja primarno `cdn` vnos storitev, porabljen prek `services.cdn` Čez kup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Case-sensitive keys**"
msgstr "**Tipke, občutljive na velikost črk**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Case‑insensitive (`ci`):** Most web apps expect case‑insensitive matching for usernames, emails, and search queries, improving usability."
msgstr "**Primer neobčutljiv (`ci`):** Večina spletnih aplikacij pričakuje neobčutljivo ujemanje z uporabniškimi imeni, e-pošto in iskalnimi poizvedbami, kar izboljšuje uporabnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central DB Integration:** Connects to shared MariaDB instances for multi-role environments."
msgstr "**Centralna integracija DB:** Povezuje s souporabo MariaDB primeri za večvrstna okolja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central Database:** PostgreSQL integration (local or central DB) with bootstrap credentials from role vars."
msgstr "**Osrednja podatkovna zbirka:** Integracija PostgreSQL (lokalni ali centralni DB) z poverilnicami o škornjih iz Vars."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central Database:** PostgreSQL integration (local or central) with credentials sourced from role configuration."
msgstr "**Osrednja podatkovna zbirka:** Integracija PostgreSQL (lokalno ali centralno) z poverilnicami, pridobljenimi iz konfiguracije vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central Engine:** A single pinned stack shared by many consumers, mirroring the central database roles."
msgstr "**Osrednji motor:** Enojni sklop, ki si ga delijo številni potrošniki in ki zrcali vlogo osrednje baze podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central LDAP (all clients)** - the [`jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth`](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth) plugin authenticates web AND native apps against the platform OpenLDAP."
msgstr "**Centralni LDAP (vse stranke)** - O, ja. [`jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth`](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth) plugin overi spletne IN domače aplikacije proti platformi OpenLDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central LDAP (all clients)** - the ```jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth`` <https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth>`__ plugin authenticates web AND native apps against the platform OpenLDAP."
msgstr "**Centralni LDAP (vse stranke)** - O, ja. ```jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth`` <https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth>` plugin overi spletne IN domače aplikacije proti platformi OpenLDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central PostgreSQL:** `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` against the shared `svc-db-postgres` (or a per-role engine when not shared), with centralised backup and monitoring."
msgstr "**Centralna PostgreSQL:** `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` proti skupnemu `svc-db-postgres` (ali z motorjem na rolo, kadar se ne deli), s centralizirano varnostno kopijo in spremljanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central PostgreSQL:** ``SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres`` against the shared ``svc-db-postgres`` (or a per-role engine when not shared), with centralised backup and monitoring."
msgstr "**Centralna PostgreSQL:** ``SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres`` proti skupnemu ``svc-db-postgres`` (ali z motorjem na rolo, kadar se ne deli), s centralizirano varnostno kopijo in spremljanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central RDBMS Integration**"
msgstr "**Centralna integracija RDBMS**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central RDBMS Integration**   Includes the `sys-svc-rdbms` role, which handles backups, restores, user and permission management for your relational database system (PostgreSQL, MariaDB, etc.)."
msgstr "**Centralna integracija RDBMS** Vključuje `sys-svc-rdbms` vloga, ki upravlja varnostne kopije, obnovi, uporabnik in upravljanje dovoljenja za vaš relacijski sistem baze podatkov (PostgreSQL, MariaDB, itd.)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central Resolver:** One shared recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver for many consumers."
msgstr "**Centralni resolver:** Eden od skupnih rekurzivnih/naprednih reševalcev DNSSEC za številne potrošnike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central User Directory:** Users and groups are read from a shared OpenLDAP backend, so accounts stay consistent across apps."
msgstr "**Centralna User Imenik:** Uporabniki in skupine se berejo iz skupne OpenLDAP hrbtni del, tako da računi ostanejo skladni med aplikacijami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central broker** one shared RabbitMQ stack consumed by many roles."
msgstr "**Centralni posrednik** ena skupna RabbitMQ kup porabi veliko vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central engines and object storage.** A new *engine* lookup extends the existing shared-database pattern to non-RDBMS services. Consumers can use centrally provisioned Redis, Memcached, RabbitMQ, Elasticsearch, Typesense, Qdrant and Unbound instances with isolated credentials, or retain an embedded sidecar. *sys-svc-objstore* and the new *objstore* lookup provide the same abstraction for SeaweedFS and MinIO, with lazy provider inclusion and object-storage integration across fourteen application roles."
msgstr "**Centralni motorji in shranjevanje predmetov.** Novo *motor* iskanje razširja obstoječi vzorec skupne podatkovne baze na storitve, ki niso storitve RDBMS. Potrošniki lahko uporabljajo centralno zagotovljene Redis, Memcached, RabbitMQ, Elasticsearch, Typesense, Qdrant ter Unbound primeri z izoliranimi poverilnicami ali obdržite vgrajeno prikolico. *sys-svc-objstore* in novo *objstore* iskanje zagotavlja enako abstrakcijo za SeaweedFS ter MinIO, z vključevanjem lenih ponudnikov in povezovanjem predmetov v štirinajst vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central object-store service:** One shared instance serves all consuming web-app roles, mirroring the shared database pattern."
msgstr "**Centralna storitev v trgovini s predmeti:** En skupni primerek služi vsem, ki uporabljajo spletne aplikacije vloge, zrcali vzorec skupne baze podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central or embedded** selected per consumer via ``services.redis.shared``."
msgstr "**Osrednji ali vgrajeni** izbrani na potrošnika prek ``services.redis.shared``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central or embedded** selected per consumer via `services.redis.shared`."
msgstr "**Osrednji ali vgrajeni** izbrani na potrošnika prek `services.redis.shared`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central or embedded:** Same ``shared`` toggle as the central databases."
msgstr "**Osrednji ali vgrajeni:** Enako. ``shared`` Osrednje baze podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central or embedded:** Same `shared` toggle as the central databases."
msgstr "**Osrednji ali vgrajeni:** Enako. `shared` Osrednje baze podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Central** (``enabled: true``, ``shared: true``): a standalone, manager-pinned Redis stack that many roles share. Each consumer gets its own ACL user restricted to the key-prefix ``{entity}:*``."
msgstr "**Centralna** (``enabled: true``, ``shared: true``): samostojno, manager-pripet Redis Veliko vlog si deli. Vsak potrošnik dobi svojega uporabnika ACL omejenega na predpono ključa ``{entity}:*``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Central** (`enabled: true`, `shared: true`): a standalone, manager-pinned Redis stack that many roles share. Each consumer gets its own ACL user restricted to the key-prefix `{entity}:*`."
msgstr "**Centralna** (`enabled: true`, `shared: true`): samostojno, manager-pripet Redis Veliko vlog si deli. Vsak potrošnik dobi svojega uporabnika ACL omejenega na predpono ključa `{entity}:*`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Alerting:** Provides a unified approach to monitor and notify about service failures."
msgstr "**Centralizirano opozarjanje:** Zagotavlja enoten pristop za spremljanje in obveščanje o odpovedih storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Configuration:** Promotes `.profile` as the single source for shared shell settings."
msgstr "**Centralizirane nastavitve:** Spodbuja `.profile` kot en sam vir za skupne nastavitve lupin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Configuration:** Promotes ``.profile`` as the single source for shared shell settings."
msgstr "**Centralizirane nastavitve:** Spodbuja ``.profile`` kot en sam vir za skupne nastavitve lupin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Data Management:** Benefit from integrated PostgreSQL and Redis, ensuring smooth and efficient operation."
msgstr "**Centralizirano upravljanje podatkov:** Koristi integriranega PostgreSQL ter Redis, zagotavljanje nemotenega in učinkovitega delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Data Management:** Improves data consistency and security."
msgstr "**Centralizirano upravljanje podatkov:** Izboljša doslednost in varnost podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Database Access:** Connects seamlessly to the shared MariaDB service."
msgstr "**Centralizirani dostop do podatkovne zbirke:** Brezhibno se povezuje s skupnim MariaDB storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Database Integration:**"
msgstr "**Integracija centraliziranih zbirk podatkov:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Database Integration:**   Seamlessly connect to a MariaDB instance for consistent, reliable data storage and management."
msgstr "**Integracija centraliziranih zbirk podatkov:** Brezšivne povezave z MariaDB za dosledno, zanesljivo shranjevanje in upravljanje podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Database Support:**"
msgstr "**Podpora centralizirani zbirki podatkov:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Database Support:**   Leverage MariaDB for secure and reliable data storage."
msgstr "**Podpora centralizirani zbirki podatkov:** Porazdelitev MariaDB za varno in zanesljivo shranjevanje podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Identity Management:** Maintain a unified repository for all users and groups with robust organizational structures."
msgstr "**Centralizirano upravljanje identitete:** Ohraniti enotno skladišče za vse uporabnike in skupine z robustnimi organizacijskimi strukturami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Logout:** Unified logout across applications in the ecosystem."
msgstr "**Centralizirana odjava:** Enotna odjava po aplikacijah v ekosistemu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized User Management & SSO** For robust authentication and central user management, you SHOULD set up Infinito.Nexus using Keycloak and LDAP. This configuration enables centralized [Single Sign-On (SSO)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Single_sign-on), simplifying user management and boosting security."
msgstr "**Centralizirano User Upravljanje in SSO** Za zanesljivo avtentikacijo in centralno upravljanje uporabnikov bi morali nastaviti Infinito.Nexus uporaba Keycloak in LDAP. Ta nastavitev omogoča centralizacijo [Enojni znak (SSO)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Single_sign-on), Poenostavitev upravljanja uporabnikov in povečanje varnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized compose path resolution** and file argument handling to be deterministic, consistent, and testable"
msgstr "**Centralizirana komponirana ločljivost poti** in obravnavanje argumentov datotek, da so deterministični, dosledni in testirni"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Certbot Installation:** Ensures the latest version of Certbot is installed."
msgstr "**Namestitev Certbot:** Zagotavlja najnovejšo različico Certbot je nameščen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Certbot Integration:** Revokes and deletes certificates without manual intervention."
msgstr "**Integracija Certbot:** Obnovi in izbriše potrdila brez ročnega posredovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Certbot-NGINX Package Installation:** Installs required certbot plugins for NGINX."
msgstr "**Namestitev paketa Certbot-NGINX:** Namesti zahtevane certbot vstavke za NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Certificate Cleanup Tool Installation**"
msgstr "**Namestitev orodja za čiščenje certifikatov**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Certificate Cleanup Tool Installation**   Uses `pkgmgr-install` to install the `certreap` binary."
msgstr "**Namestitev orodja za čiščenje certifikatov** Uporaba `pkgmgr-install` za namestitev `certreap` binarno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Certificate Renewal Logic:** Skips renewal if the certificate is still valid."
msgstr "**Logika obnovitve certifikata:** Preskoči podaljšanje, če je potrdilo še veljavno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Chain-native:** the generation lands in the standard backup tree, so ``svc-bkp-remote-2-local`` pulls it and ``svc-bkp-local-2-device`` mirrors it onto the encrypted device without extra wiring."
msgstr "**Veriga:** Generacija pristane na standardnem rezervnem drevesu. ``svc-bkp-remote-2-local`` ga potegne in ``svc-bkp-local-2-device`` zrcali na šifrirani napravi brez dodatne napeljave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Chain-native:** the generation lands in the standard backup tree, so `svc-bkp-remote-2-local` pulls it and `svc-bkp-local-2-device` mirrors it onto the encrypted device without extra wiring."
msgstr "**Veriga:** Generacija pristane na standardnem rezervnem drevesu. `svc-bkp-remote-2-local` ga potegne in `svc-bkp-local-2-device` zrcali na šifrirani napravi brez dodatne napeljave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Changed**"
msgstr "**Spremenjeno**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Changed:** Default distribution switched to *Debian* and CI image handling aligned. Python baseline raised: *dev-python* installs Python 3.11+ by default; *requires-python* raised to *>=3.11*. Cross distro Python interpreter and pip handling unified via *sys-pip-install*. Dashboard deployment uses fixed image *ghcr.io/kevinveenbirkenbach/port-ui:1.0.0* and mounts generated *config.yaml* read only. Alerting hardened with explicit timeouts for compose and email, plus portable mailer and systemd instance fallbacks."
msgstr "**Spremenjeno:** Privzeta porazdelitev preklopljena na *Debian* in CI upravljanje slik poravnano. Python izhodiščno zvišanje: *dev-python* namesti Python 3.11+ privzeto; *zahteva-python* povišan v *ni relevantno3.11*Navzkrižni Python tolmač in pip ravnanje poenoteno preko *sys-pip-install*Uporaba armature uporablja fiksno sliko *ghcr.io/kevinveenbirkenbach/port-ui:1.0.0* in ustvarjene naprave *config.yaml* Samo za branje. Opozorilo utrjena z izrecnimi časovnimi zamiki za komponiranje in e-pošto, plus prenosni poštni in sistemski primeri rezerv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Changing a password changes it everywhere.** A user declares how its password must be generated, the inventory pins one for every declared user, a new generator produces API-key shapes, the deploy rotates credentials between its two passes, and a reset command exists. Applications that persist an administrator password at install now realign it when the declared one changes: Nextcloud, Moodle, EspoCRM, Jellyfin, Listmonk, Discourse, Checkmk, xWiki, n8n, Matrix and the dedicated MariaDB and Postgres engines. Checkmk keeps a 401 fatal so a wrong password cannot lock the account out."
msgstr "**Sprememba gesla ga spremeni povsod.** Uporabnik izjavlja, kako je treba ustvariti geslo, inventar zaponke eno za vsakega prijavljenega uporabnika, nov generator proizvaja API-Key oblike, razporeditev vrti poverilnice med njegovimi dvema prehodoma, in reset ukaz obstaja. Aplikacije, ki vztrajajo geslo skrbnika pri namestitvi ga zdaj prerazporedite, ko se prijavljena spremeni: Nextcloud, Moodle, EspoCRM, Jellyfin, Listmonk, Discourse, Checkmk, xWiki, n8n, Matrix in posvečene MariaDB in motorje Postgres. Checkmk ohranja 401 Usodno, zato napačno geslo ne more zakleniti računa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Checks precede the grant:** The admission checks run inside the agent role before it deploys, so a refusal prevents the embodied container rather than following it."
