msgstr "**Počisti** Preostanek configs med vožnjo v načinu čiščenja 🧹"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cleaner Docker environments:** Removing implicit cgroup volumes prevents unwanted anonymous volumes and makes container behavior more predictable."
msgstr "**Okolja čistilnih naprav:** Odstranitev implicitne količine cgroup preprečuje nezaželene anonimne količine in naredi vedenje zabojnikov bolj predvidljivo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup & Reset Modes**"
msgstr "**Načini čiščenja in resetiranja**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup Mode**: Removes the wildcard config file when `CERTBOT_FLAVOR` is set to `dedicated` and `MODE_CLEANUP` is enabled. 🗑️"
msgstr "**Način čiščenja**: Odstrani nastavitveno datoteko z jokercardom `CERTBOT_FLAVOR` nastavljeno na `dedicated` ter `MODE_CLEANUP` je omogočeno. 🗑️"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup Mode**: Removes the wildcard config file when ``CERTBOT_FLAVOR`` is set to ``dedicated`` and ``MODE_CLEANUP`` is enabled. 🗑️"
msgstr "**Način čiščenja**: Odstrani nastavitveno datoteko z jokercardom ``CERTBOT_FLAVOR`` nastavljeno na ``dedicated`` ter ``MODE_CLEANUP`` je omogočeno. 🗑️"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup between rounds.** Before each non-first iteration the wrapper runs [entity.sh](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/entity.sh) for **every** app in the previous round's include set. The next round therefore boots from an empty host, which guarantees cross-round state coherence: nothing the previous round deployed (whether it stays in the current round's closure or falls out) can leak into round R, so variants are free to disagree on which deps they pull in. The final round is followed by no purge so the last state remains available for inspection or follow-up specs."
msgstr "**Čiščenje med naboji.** Pred vsako neprvenstveno ponovitvijo ovitek teče [entity.sh](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/entity.sh) besedilo **vsak** aplikacija v prejšnji rundi vključuje set. Naslednji krog zato škornji praznega gostitelja, ki zagotavlja navzkrižno skladnost države: nič prejšnji krog uporablja (ali ostane v tekočem krogu ali izpade) lahko curek v okrogle R, tako variante so prosti, da se ne strinjajo, kateri deps, ki jih vlečejo. Zadnjemu krogu ne sledi očiščenje, zato je zadnje stanje na voljo za pregled ali spremljanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Client-facing authentication:** The adapter issues its own bearer. The upstream credential authenticates the adapter to the provider and says nothing about who called the adapter, which is the gap the project-owned MCP sidecars leave open."
msgstr "**Overovitev, usmerjena k strankam:** Adapter izda svojega nosilca. Zgornja kredenca overi adapter do ponudnika in ne pove ničesar o tem, kdo je imenoval adapter, kar je vrzel, ki jo projektna stranska prikolica pusti odprta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
