# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Containerized deployment:** Run ejabberd through Docker Compose with the project’s standard role-meta wiring."
msgstr "**Uporaba v zabojnikih:** Poženi ejabber skozi Docker Compose s standardnim ožičenjem z vložkom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Containerized deployment:** Run the upstream Flask app under gunicorn through Docker Compose."
msgstr "**Uporaba v zabojnikih:** Zaženite gornji Flask aplikacijo pod topnino skozi Docker Compose."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Containerized hub:** Runs the official Home Assistant image on both the Docker Compose and Swarm stacks behind the reverse proxy."
msgstr "**Zabojniško vozlišče:** Poganja uradnika Home Assistant slike na obeh Docker Compose in Swarm nizov za nazaj posrednika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Context-aware data access:** Lookups can access the full Ansible context, including inventory, facts, and runtime variables."
msgstr "**Dostop do podatkov iz konteksta:** Ogledi lahko dostopajo do celotnega konteksta, vključno z inventarjem, dejstvi in spremenljivkami časa delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Continuous Updates** 🔄 Automatic patching and version upgrades across the stack."
msgstr "**Stalne posodobitve** 🔄 Samodejno krpanje in različice nadgradnje po kupu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Contract probe:** The ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` probe presents the ``mcp_bearer``, asserts the served tool surface matches the pinned contract, and separately asserts that an unauthenticated ``initialize`` is refused with a 4xx and discloses no tool inventory."
msgstr "**Sonda za pogodbo:** – ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` sonda predstavlja ``mcp_bearer``, trdi, da se površina za postreženo orodje ujema s pogodbo, in ločeno trdi, da je neavtentiran ``initialize`` je zavrnjen z 4xx in razkriva brez inventarja orodja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Contract probe:** The `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` probe presents the `mcp_bearer`, asserts the served tool surface matches the pinned contract, and separately asserts that an unauthenticated `initialize` is refused with a 4xx and discloses no tool inventory."
msgstr "**Sonda za pogodbo:** – `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` sonda predstavlja `mcp_bearer`, trdi, da se površina za postreženo orodje ujema s pogodbo, in ločeno trdi, da je neavtentiran `initialize` je zavrnjen z 4xx in razkriva brez inventarja orodja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Contributors**"
msgstr "**Prispevki**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Control is raw device access plus agent code execution; no robotics middleware is mandated.** Hermes drives the hardware by executing code directly against the granted devices (GPIO/I2C/SPI/serial/video libraries), consistent with its self-exploration. This is the deliberate choice over a ROS2/middleware abstraction: the embodied device is already the trust boundary (there is no microVM here), so the agent runs code on the device itself. A middleware layer MAY be added later per robot but is not required by this role."
msgstr "**Kontrola je neobdelan dostop do naprav in izvajanje kod agentov; ni obvezen noben vmesni program za robotiko.** Hermes poganja strojno opremo z izvajanjem kode neposredno proti podeljenim napravam (GPIO/I2C/SPI/serial/video knjižnice), V skladu z njegovo samoraziskavo. To je namerna izbira pred ROS2/srednjeveška abstrakcija: utelešena naprava je že meja zaupanja (Tukaj ni mikroVM.)Agent vodi kodo na sami napravi. Plast srednjega programja se LAHKO doda kasneje na robota, vendar se ta vloga ne zahteva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cosmos**      – the mermaid diagram, from ``meta/services.yml``."
msgstr "**Kozmos** – diagram morske deklice, iz ``meta/services.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cost:** The agent has read access to all files under `~/.ssh/`, including private keys. A compromised or prompt-injected agent could load those keys into the transcript via read tools (which are NOT gated by `ask`). Mitigations relied upon:"
msgstr "**Stroški:** Agent je prebral dostop do vseh datotek pod `~/.ssh/`, vključno z zasebnimi ključi. Kompromitirano ali hitro vbrizgano sredstvo bi lahko naložilo te ključe v prepis preko bralnih orodij (ki jih NE odpira `ask`). Blažitve so se opirale na:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Create a New User:**"
msgstr "**Ustvari novo User:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Credential Directory Management:** Creates a secured `/etc/certbot` directory with proper permissions."
msgstr "**Upravljanje imeniškega imenika:** Ustvari zavarovano `/etc/certbot` imenik z ustreznimi dovoljenji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Credential Directory Management:** Creates a secured ``/etc/certbot`` directory with proper permissions."
msgstr "**Upravljanje imeniškega imenika:** Ustvari zavarovano ``/etc/certbot`` imenik z ustreznimi dovoljenji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Credential Management:** Creates secure credential files for DNS API tokens when using DNS-01 validation."
msgstr "**Upravljanje zaupanja:** Ustvari varne datoteke za DNS API žetoni pri uporabi DNS-01 potrditev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Credits**     – the fixed block, from ``meta/main.yml`` author."
msgstr "**Krediti** – fiksni blok, od ``meta/main.yml`` avtor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cross-Distro Support:** Automatically detects the available package manager."
msgstr "**Podpora Cross-Distro:** Samodejno zazna razpoložljivega upravljalnika paketov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cross-Platform Support:** Handles package variations for multiple Linux distributions."
msgstr "**Podpora za večplastno tiskanje:** Upravlja spremembe paketa za več distribucij Linux."

