# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cross-network federation:** Mirror posts and interactions between ActivityPub, AT Protocol, and the IndieWeb."
msgstr "**Medmrežna zveza:** Zrcalne objave in interakcije med ActivityPub, AT Protocol, in IndieWeb."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom Configuration:** Leverage Ansible variables to fine-tune your deployment."
msgstr "**Nastavitve po meri:** Odvisne spremenljivke, da se prilagodi vaša razporeditev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom Git Configuration:** Invokes the git-configurator tool to merge user-specific configuration options."
msgstr "**Po meri Git Nastavitev:** Vklopi orodje za nastavitev git, da združi uporabniško specifične nastavitvene možnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom Plugins & Extensibility:** Extend functionality with a wide variety of plugins and integrations, or create your own to tailor OpenProject to your unique workflow."
msgstr "**Prilagojeni vstavki in razširjenost:** Razširite funkcionalnost z najrazličnejšimi vstavki in integracijami, ali ustvarite svoj krojač OpenProject na vaš edinstven delovni tok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom Systemd Service:** Configures a lightweight, dedicated renewal service."
msgstr "**Sistemska storitev po meri:** Nastavi lahko, namensko storitev obnove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom Templates:** Supports both ``systemctl.service.j2`` and ``systemctl@.service.j2``."
msgstr "**Predloge po meri:** Podpira oboje ``systemctl.service.j2`` ter ``systemctl@.service.j2``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom Templates:** Supports both `systemctl.service.j2` and `systemctl@.service.j2`."
msgstr "**Predloge po meri:** Podpira oboje `systemctl.service.j2` ter `systemctl@.service.j2`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom `NGINX.conf`** template with sensible defaults for performance and security."
msgstr "**Po meri `NGINX.conf`** predloge z razumnimi neplačili za uspešnost in varnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom ``NGINX.conf``** template with sensible defaults for performance and security."
msgstr "**Po meri ``NGINX.conf``** predloge z razumnimi neplačili za uspešnost in varnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom ``kix-proxy`` routing:** The role bind-mounts a complete ``default.conf`` into the upstream ``kix-proxy`` container that exposes the agent portal on port 80, routes through the frontend Node server, and forwards the OAuth2-proxy ``X-Forwarded-User`` header as a ``Remote-User`` upstream header."
msgstr "**Po meri ``kix-proxy`` usmerjanje:** Vloga je vezana na celoto ``default.conf`` v smeri toka ``kix-proxy`` zabojnik, ki izpostavlja portal agenta na vratih 80, poti skozi strežnik sprednje vozlišče, in posreduje OAuth2-proksi ``X-Forwarded-User`` glava kot ``Remote-User`` glavo navzgor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom `kix-proxy` routing:** The role bind-mounts a complete `default.conf` into the upstream `kix-proxy` container that exposes the agent portal on port 80, routes through the frontend Node server, and forwards the OAuth2-proxy `X-Forwarded-User` header as a `Remote-User` upstream header."
msgstr "**Po meri `kix-proxy` usmerjanje:** Vloga je vezana na celoto `default.conf` v smeri toka `kix-proxy` zabojnik, ki izpostavlja portal agenta na vratih 80, poti skozi strežnik sprednje vozlišče, in posreduje OAuth2-proksi `X-Forwarded-User` glava kot `Remote-User` glavo navzgor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Custom logic (optional).** Create `tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml`. The hook runs after `config:app:set` and MAY perform plugin-specific provisioning such as LDAP wiring or REST calls against the live container."
msgstr "**Logika po meri (neobvezno).** Ustvari `tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml`. Kljuka teče po `config:app:set` in LAHKO izvajajo posebne vtičnice, kot so LDAP ožičenje ali REST klice proti živo posodo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Configuration:** Tailor settings such as storage, email delivery, and administrative parameters using environment variables and configuration files."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev:** Nastavitve po meri, kot so shranjevanje, elektronsko dostavo in administrativni parametri z uporabo okoljskih spremenljivk in nastavitvenih datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Deployment:** Configure LDAP settings and LAM’s administrative credentials via flexible environment variables."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva razporeditev:** Nastavite nastavitve LDAP in LAMAdministrativna priporočila prek prilagodljivih okoljskih spremenljivk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Flavor:** Supports installation of different LibreOffice flavors by dynamically setting the package name."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiv okus:** Podpira namestitev različnih LibreOffice Okusi z dinamičnim nastavljanjem imena embalaže."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Interface:** Tailor the look and feel of your learning environment with numerous themes and plugins."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiv vmesnik:** Prilagodite videz in občutek učnega okolja s številnimi temami in plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Layouts & Themes:** Tailor your forum’s look and functionality to suit your community’s unique style."
msgstr "**Prilagodljivi razporedi in teme:** Prilagodite videz in funkcionalnost vašega foruma, da ustreza edinstvenemu slogu vaše skupnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Media Handling:** Configure media roots, static assets, and music directories tailored to your deployment."
msgstr "**Prilagodljivo ravnanje z mediji:** Nastavite večpredstavnostne korenine, statična sredstva in glasbene mape, prilagojene vaši uporabi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable SMTP Configuration:** Deploys a customizable msmtprc configuration file with parameters for TLS, authentication, and server details."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev SMTP:** Prilagodljiva nastavitvena datoteka msmtprc s parametri za TLS, avtentikacijo in podrobnosti strežnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Settings**: Allows customization of the MariaDB instance through various Ansible variables."
msgstr "**Prilagodljive nastavitve**: Omogoča prilagajanje MariaDB primer skozi različne Ansible spremenljivke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Setup:** Configure database connections, admin credentials, and server settings via environment variables and a TOML configuration file."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev:** Nastavite povezave do zbirke podatkov, admin poverilnice in nastavitve strežnika preko okoljskih spremenljivk in nastavitvene datoteke TOML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Setup:** Configure database connections, instance settings, and admin credentials via environment variables and a TOML configuration file."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev:** Nastavite povezave do zbirke podatkov, nastavitve primerkov in admin poverilnice preko okoljskih spremenljivk in nastavitvene datoteke TOML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Setup:** Configure icon sizes, formats, and routes effortlessly."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev:** Nastavite velikosti ikon, formate in poti brez truda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Templates:** Supports tailored Telegram message templates for service failure notifications."
msgstr "**Prilagodljive predloge:** Podpira prilagojene telegramske predloge sporočil za obvestila o napaki storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Templates:** Supports tailoring email templates for service failure notifications."
msgstr "**Prilagodljive predloge:** Podpira prilagajanje e-poštnih predlog za obvestila o napaki storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Themes and Plugins:** Extend your site's functionality with thousands of themes and plugins, enabling you to tailor your website's look, feel, and capabilities to your exact needs."
msgstr "**Prilagodljive teme in vstavki:** Razširite funkcionalnost vaše spletne strani z več tisoč tem in plugins, ki vam omogočajo, da prilagodite videz vaše spletne strani, občutek, in zmogljivosti za vaše natančne potrebe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Themes and Plugins:** Extend your site’s functionality with thousands of themes and plugins, enabling you to tailor your website’s look, feel, and capabilities to your exact needs."
msgstr "**Prilagodljive teme in vstavki:** Razširite funkcionalnost vaše spletne strani z več tisoč tem in plugins, ki vam omogočajo, da prilagodite videz, občutek in zmogljivosti vaše spletne strani natančno potrebe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Tiles**: Showcase applications with title, description, and icons, fully configurable via YAML."
msgstr "**Prilagodljive ploščice**: Predstavitveni programi z naslovom, opisom in ikonami, popolnoma nastavljivi preko YAML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable User Experience:** Configure themes, timeline settings, and notification options to tailor the social experience to your community."
msgstr "**Prilagodljivo User Izkušnje:** Nastavite teme, časovne nastavitve in možnosti obveščanja za prilagoditev socialnih izkušenj vaši skupnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Webmail and Administration:** Provides a modern web interface for managing emails and administrative tasks with ease."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiv spletni naslov in uprava:** Zagotavlja sodoben spletni vmesnik za upravljanje e-pošte in upravnih nalog z lahkoto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable:** Easily configurable to point to your own source code or documentation."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiv:** Enostavno nastavljivo, da pokažete na svojo izvorno kodo ali dokumentacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customization & Theming:** Adapt the look and feel of your wiki with skins, CSS, and scripting."
msgstr "**Prilagajanje & Teming:** Prilagodite videz in občutek Wiki s kožami, CSS, in skripte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customization**: You may need to customize the playbook, especially the ``{{users.client.username}}`` variable, to suit your specific setup."
msgstr "**Prilagoditev**: Morda boste morali prilagoditi igro knjigo, še posebej ``{{users.client.username}}`` Spremenljivka, ki ustreza vašim posebnim nastavitvam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customization**: You may need to customize the playbook, especially the `{{users.client.username}}` variable, to suit your specific setup."
msgstr "**Prilagoditev**: Morda boste morali prilagoditi igro knjigo, še posebej `{{users.client.username}}` Spremenljivka, ki ustreza vašim posebnim nastavitvam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**DIR_BACKUPS** (for example ``/Backups``)"
msgstr "**DIR_BACKUPS** (na primer ``/Backups``)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**DNS Plugin Installation:** Installs a matching plugin based on your configured ACME challenge method."
msgstr "**Namestitev vstavkov DNS:** Namesti ustrezni vstavek na podlagi nastavljene metode ACME izziv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**DNS and Webroot Challenges:** Dynamically selects the correct ACME challenge method."
msgstr "**DNS in spletni izzivi:** Dinamično izbere pravilno metodo ACME izziv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Daemon registration:** Only runtimes whose binary is present are written to the daemon configuration, on a bare host and inside docker-in-docker alike. A daemon pointed at an absent runtime path refuses to start, so this role installs first and re-renders the configuration afterwards."
msgstr "**Registracija programa:** Samo čas delovanja, katerega binarni je prisoten, je napisan na daemonsko konfiguracijo, na golem gostitelju in znotraj docker-in-docker podobno. Demon, ki je pokazal na odsotno runtime pot zavrne začetek, tako da ta vloga namesti prvi in ponovno spremeni konfiguracijo kasneje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dark mode** and customizable theme."
msgstr "**Temni način** in prilagodljivo temo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard card:** ``web-app-dashboard`` surfaces a KIX tile pointing at the canonical URL."
msgstr "**Kartica z armaturno ploščo:** ``web-app-dashboard`` površine a KIX Ploščica kaže na kanonični URL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard card:** `web-app-dashboard` surfaces a KIX tile pointing at the canonical URL."
msgstr "**Kartica z armaturno ploščo:** `web-app-dashboard` površine a KIX Ploščica kaže na kanonični URL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard tile:** The application contributes a dashboard card when the platform dashboard is part of the deployment."
msgstr "**Ploščice za armature:** Aplikacija prispeva kartico armaturne plošče, če je ploščad del razporeditve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Composition**"
msgstr "**Sestava zbirke podatkov**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Composition**   Leverages the `sys-stk-backend` role to stand up your containerized database (PostgreSQL, MariaDB, etc.) with backups and user management."
msgstr "**Sestava zbirke podatkov** Poviša `sys-stk-backend` vloga, da se postavite v svojo podatkovno zbirko zabojnikov (PostgreSQL, MariaDB, itd.) z rezervami in upravljanjem uporabnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Seeding:** Introduced the * multi-database marker for cluster-aware seeding, enabling clean PostgreSQL cluster dumps and clearer seeder semantics."
msgstr "**Sejanje zbirke podatkov:** Uvedel * označevalec večpodatkovne baze za sejanje grozdov, ki omogoča čiščenje PostgreSQL odlagališča grozdov in jasnejša semantika sejalcev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database-aware:** consumer apps seed their connection metadata into a central ``databases.csv``, so the same run can dump SQL state alongside the file payload."
msgstr "**Program za podatkovno zbirko:** aplikacije za potrošnike svoje metapodatke o povezavi sestavijo v osrednji ``databases.csv``, tako da lahko isto vožnjo smeti SQL država poleg datoteke korist tovora."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database-aware:** consumer apps seed their connection metadata into a central `databases.csv`, so the same run can dump SQL state alongside the file payload."
msgstr "**Program za podatkovno zbirko:** aplikacije za potrošnike svoje metapodatke o povezavi sestavijo v osrednji `databases.csv`, tako da lahko isto vožnjo smeti SQL država poleg datoteke korist tovora."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**De-dup / loop prevention.** With any future bidirectional bridge, an event mirrored A→B must not echo back B→A. v1 (one-way) sidesteps this, but the record↔event id mapping table introduced in v1 MUST be designed so a future reverse path can detect \"already mirrored\"."
msgstr "**De-dup / preprečevanje zanke.** Z vsakim bodočim dvosmernim mostom se dogodek, ki se zrcali, ne sme odzvati nazaj B.1 (enosmerna) stranski koraki to, vendar rekord id kartiranje tabela uvedena v v1 MORA biti zasnovan tako, da lahko v prihodnosti zaznamo obratno pot \"že zrcaljeno\"."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Mode**"
msgstr "**Način razhroščevanja**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Mode**   Supports an `MODE_DEBUG` flag that appends optional `console.log` statements for easier troubleshooting in staging or development."
msgstr "**Način razhroščevanja** Podpira `MODE_DEBUG` Zastava, ki se priloži neobvezno `console.log` izjave za lažje odpravljanje težav v uprizoritvi ali razvoju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Output**: Optional `MODE_DEBUG` gives detailed variable dumps for troubleshooting. 🐛"
msgstr "**Razhrošči izhod**: Neobvezno `MODE_DEBUG` podaja podrobne spremenljive odlagališča za odpravljanje težav. 🐛"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Output**: Optional ``MODE_DEBUG`` gives detailed variable dumps for troubleshooting. 🐛"
msgstr "**Razhrošči izhod**: Neobvezno ``MODE_DEBUG`` podaja podrobne spremenljive odlagališča za odpravljanje težav. 🐛"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Debugging helpers**: log formats and instructions for general and detailed troubleshooting."
msgstr "**Pomočniki pri razhroščevanju**: oblike dnevnika in navodila za splošno in podrobno odpravljanje težav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Content Sharing:** Empower users to share photos and visual content across an interoperable, federated network with enhanced privacy controls."
msgstr "**Decentralizirana izmenjava vsebin:** Pooblašča uporabnike za izmenjavo fotografij in vizualnih vsebin po interoperabilnem, federativnem omrežju z okrepljenim nadzorom zasebnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Network:** Connect with users across multiple instances in a federated social media ecosystem."
msgstr "**Decentralizirano omrežje:** Povežite se z uporabniki v več primerih v federiranem ekosistemu družbenih medijev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Social Networking:** Facilitate a distributed network for seamless peer-to-peer communication."
msgstr "**Decentralizirano socialno povezovanje:** Olajšati porazdeljeno omrežje za nemoteno medsebojno komunikacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Video Hosting:** Distribute video hosting across multiple instances to enhance resilience and avoid single-point control."
msgstr "**Decentralizirano gostovanje videov:** Razdelite video gostovanje v več primerih za povečanje odpornosti in preprečevanje nadzora z eno točko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized and Federated:** Connect with a global network of Matrix homeservers, ensuring there is no single point of failure."
msgstr "**Decentralizirana in Federirana:** Povezava z globalnim omrežjem Matrix strežniki, ki zagotavljajo, da ni nobene točke neuspeha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized social networking:** Self-host the AT Protocol PDS and serve user data under your own domain."
msgstr "**Decentralizirana socialna omrežja:** Self-host protokol AT PDS in služijo uporabniške podatke v vaši domeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Declaration driven:** Every proxied repository and every answered hostname comes from the ``cache:`` declarations, collected by the ``cache_upstreams`` and ``cache_repos`` lookups. A new upstream is added by declaring it there."
msgstr "**Pogon izjave:** Vsako varovano skladišče in vsako odgovorjeno ime gostitelja prihaja iz ``cache:`` deklaracije, ki jih zbere ``cache_upstreams`` ter ``cache_repos`` Poglejte. Doda se nov toku navzgor z razglasitvijo tam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Declaration driven:** Every proxied repository and every answered hostname comes from the `cache:` declarations, collected by the `cache_upstreams` and `cache_repos` lookups. A new upstream is added by declaring it there."
msgstr "**Pogon izjave:** Vsako varovano skladišče in vsako odgovorjeno ime gostitelja prihaja iz `cache:` deklaracije, ki jih zbere `cache_upstreams` ter `cache_repos` Poglejte. Doda se nov toku navzgor z razglasitvijo tam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Declared context windows:** A model entry carrying ``context`` publishes it as ``model_info.max_input_tokens``, and an Ollama entry also runs with that window as ``num_ctx`` instead of the server’s default, so a caller’s prompt is not silently truncated."
msgstr "**Prijavljena okna konteksta:** Vzorec vstopa, ki prevaža ``context`` objavi kot ``model_info.max_input_tokens``, in Ollama vnos teče tudi s tem oknom kot ``num_ctx`` namesto strežnika privzeto, zato klicatelj ni tiho okrnjen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Declared context windows:** A model entry carrying `context` publishes it as `model_info.max_input_tokens`, and an Ollama entry also runs with that window as `num_ctx` instead of the server's default, so a caller's prompt is not silently truncated."
msgstr "**Prijavljena okna konteksta:** Vzorec vstopa, ki prevaža `context` objavi kot `model_info.max_input_tokens`, in Ollama vnos teče tudi s tem oknom kot `num_ctx` namesto strežnika je privzeto, tako da klic ni tiho okrnjen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Declared hardware access:** Every device the agent may drive is listed by the operator and bound into the container; an empty list is refused rather than silently treated as deny-all-but-deployable."
msgstr "**Prijavljeni dostop do strojne opreme:** Vsaka naprava, ki jo lahko agent vozi, je navedena s strani upravljavca in vezana v posodo; prazen seznam se zavrne, ne pa da se z njim tiho ravna kot z zanikanjem vsega, vendar ga je mogoče razgraditi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated device only.** Full access is permitted solely on a node whose only tenant is this agent. Forbidden on any shared cluster node (Decision #12)."
msgstr "**Samo posebna naprava.** Popoln dostop je dovoljen samo na vozlišču, katerega edini najemnik je ta agent. Prepovedano na katerem koli skupnem vozlišču grozdov (Odločitev #12)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated domain:** The admin UI is reachable on its own canonical hostname under the primary domain."
msgstr "**Namenska domena:** Admin UI je dosegljiv na lastno kanonično ime gostitelja pod primarno domeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated, single-tenant, segmented node only.** The role MUST refuse to deploy on a node that carries any shared-workload label or hosts other tenants, and the node MUST be network-segmented from shared infrastructure. This is enforced, not just documented: a placement/preflight guard hard-fails on a shared node."
msgstr "**Predan, enoten, samo deljeno vozlišče.** Vloga mora zavrniti uporabo na vozlišču, ki nosi kakršno koli oznako za skupno delovno obremenitev ali gosti druge najemnike, vozlišče pa mora biti povezano z omrežjem iz skupne infrastrukture. To se izvaja, ne samo dokumentirano: namestitev/zavarovanje pred letom je težko na skupnem vozlišču."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated-device guard:** Deployment aborts when another application shares the host or when the device is part of a multi-node swarm, naming the offender."
msgstr "**Namensko-naprava stražar:** Uporaba prekine, ko druga aplikacija deli gostitelja ali ko je naprava del roja z več vozlišči in imenuje storilca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Default Sudoers Configuration:** Deploys a default sudoers file with best-practice settings."
msgstr "**Privzeta nastavitev Sudoers:** Privzeta datoteka s sudoers z nastavitvami najboljše prakse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Default behaviour (variable not set or set to any value other than `true`):** Artefacts are retained only when a test fails."
msgstr "**Privzeto obnašanje (spremenljivka ni nastavljena ali nastavljena na katero koli vrednost razen `true`):** Artefakti se obdržijo samo, če preskus ne uspe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Default behaviour (variable not set or set to any value other than `true`):** Pushes to `main` are gated out at the `run-policy` job and CI is skipped."
msgstr "**Privzeto obnašanje (spremenljivka ni nastavljena ali nastavljena na katero koli vrednost razen `true`):** Pritisne na `main` so zaprti ven na `run-policy` Služba in ovaduh sta preskočila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Default behaviour (variable not set or set to any value other than `true`):** The `update-docker-image-versions` job is skipped. Dependabot PRs are auto-closed on open with a comment pointing to this variable."
msgstr "**Privzeto obnašanje (spremenljivka ni nastavljena ali nastavljena na katero koli vrednost razen `true`):** – `update-docker-image-versions` Služba je preskočila. Dependentabot PR so samodejno zaprti na odprto s pripombo, ki kaže na to spremenljivko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Default behaviour (variable not set):** The workflow uses `infinito-nexus/core` as the source repository. When the current repository is already `infinito-nexus/core`, the same-repository skip applies."
msgstr "**Privzeto obnašanje (spremenljivka ni nastavljena):** Delovni tok uporablja `infinito-nexus/core` kot izvorno skladišče. Ko je trenutno skladišče že `infinito-nexus/core`, isto-repozitorij skip velja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Default:** `\"utf8mb4\"`"
msgstr "**Privzeto:** `\"utf8mb4\"`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Default:** `\"utf8mb4_unicode_ci\"`"
msgstr "**Privzeto:** `\"utf8mb4_unicode_ci\"`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Defaults** discovered from each role's per-topic meta files: `roles/*/meta/server.yml`, `roles/*/meta/rbac.yml`, `roles/*/meta/services.yml`, `roles/*/meta/volumes.yml`, plus `roles/*/meta/secrets.yml` (post-`apply_schema()`). Variants from `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` deep-merge over the assembled per-role payload. See [layout.md](../../../../design/role/services/layout.md)."
msgstr "**Privzeto** odkrite iz datotek vsake vloge na temo meta: `roles/*/meta/server.yml`, `roles/*/meta/rbac.yml`, `roles/*/meta/services.yml`, `roles/*/meta/volumes.yml`, plus `roles/*/meta/secrets.yml` (post -`apply_schema()`)Variante iz `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` Globok spoj nad sestavljenim tovorom na rolo. Glej. [layout.md](../../../../design/role/services/layout.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Defaults** discovered from every `roles/*/meta/users.yml` in the repository (file root IS the users map; no `users:` wrapper)."
msgstr "**Privzeto** Od vseh odkritih `roles/*/meta/users.yml` v skladišču (koren datoteke je zemljevid uporabnikov; ne `users:` ovoj)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Delete a User:**"
msgstr "**Zbriši a User:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Delete all emails in the queue**:"
msgstr "**Zbriši vsa sporočila v vrsti**:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependencies**"
msgstr "**Odvisnosti**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works in conjunction with related roles for comprehensive backup management."
msgstr "**Vključevanje odvisnosti:** Deluje v povezavi s povezanimi vlogami za celovito varnostno upravljanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) roles."
msgstr "**Vključevanje odvisnosti:** Deluje brezhibno z [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) ter [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ and `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ roles."
msgstr "**Vključevanje odvisnosti:** Deluje brezhibno z `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ ter `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Pripravite se.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) ponovno izvede isti načrt prek `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (načrtovalec je čista funkcija, ki se deli med in-it in uporabo) in teče eno razporeditev na mapo. **Vsaka runda uporablja svojo celotno različico-aware vključujejo set.** Round R se začne od čistega gostitelja (prejšnji krog vključuje se očisti pred začetkom kroga R, glej točko 5), tako da je treba vsak dep, da krog R potrebuje prerazporejen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Name** Vgraditi bi morali Infinito.Nexus na šifriranem strežniku, da se ponudnikom gostovanja prepreči dostop do podatkov končnega uporabnika. Za praktičen vodnik o nastavitvi šifriranega strežnika se obrnite na [Skladišče Hetzner Arch LUKS](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Več o tem [šifriranje diska](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) na Wikipediji.)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."
msgstr "**Name** Šifrirajmo izziv-in-redirect od ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."
msgstr "**Name** Šifrirajmo izziv-in-redirect od `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deployment and packaging foundations.** A host deployment mode joins Compose and Swarm in the deployment tooling. The former *sys-package*, *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install* roles were replaced by a distribution-independent package registry. Volume metadata now uses one canonical schema, single-file mounts become Swarm configs, and service placement, replica counts, dependencies, addresses and health probes resolve through deployment-aware lookups."
msgstr "**Temelji za uvajanje in pakiranje.** V orodju za uvajanje se pridruži gostiteljski način uvajanja Sestavite in Swarm. Prvi *pakiranje sys*, *sys-aur* ter *sys-aur-install* vloge je nadomestil register paketov, neodvisen od distribucije. Volumski metapodatki zdaj uporabljajo eno kanonično shemo, eno-file nastavki postanejo Swarm configs, in namestitev storitev, replike šteje, odvisnosti, naslovi in zdravstvene sonde rešiti z uvajanjem-zaveda iskalniki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for ``ssh-agent``."
msgstr "**Vključi in omogoči sistemsko uporabniško storitev** besedilo ``ssh-agent``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for `ssh-agent`."
msgstr "**Vključi in omogoči sistemsko uporabniško storitev** besedilo `ssh-agent`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** ACME client for automated Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS certificate issuance and renewal via webroot or DNS-01 challenges"
msgstr "**Opis:** ACME odjemalec za avtomatizirano šifriranje SSL/TLS certifikata izdaja in obnavljanje preko webroot ali DNS-01 izzivi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** AI-first code editor installed on the workstation, whose endpoint override stays an operator step"
msgstr "**Opis:** AI-prvi urejevalnik kode, nameščen na delovni postaji, katerega končna točka prevlada, ostane korak upravljavca"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Aggregate NGINX sub-filter injector adding Matomo tracking, global theming, iFrame and JS snippets by feature flag"
msgstr "**Opis:** Agregatni podfilter NGINX Matomo sledenje, globalno teating, iFrame in JS snippets po funkcijske zastave"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Aggregate desktop environment bundling caffeine, shell extensions, and terminal into a complete GNOME setup on Linux"
msgstr "**Opis:** Aggregate namizno okolje združevanje kofeina, lupin razširitve, in terminal v popolno GNOME nastavitev na Linuxu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Ansible helper role for idempotent persistence and lookup of per-user application tokens in a local YAML store"
msgstr "**Opis:** Nevidna vloga pomočnika za navidezno obstojnost in iskanje žetonov aplikacij na uporabnika v lokalni trgovini YAML"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Arch Linux driver bundle for Epson multifunction printing and scanning via escpr and imagescan"
msgstr "**Opis:** Arch Linux gonilnik paket za Epson multifunkcionalno tiskanje in skeniranje preko escpr in slikecan"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Automated recovery service restarting exited or unhealthy Docker Compose stacks and resolving port conflicts"
msgstr "**Opis:** Avtomatizirana rekuperacija ponovno zagnana ali nezdrava Docker Compose skladov in reševanje sporov v pristaniščih"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Automation role for reverse DNS (PTR) records on Hetzner Cloud servers, primary IPs, floating IPs, and load balancers"
msgstr "**Opis:** Vloga avtomatizacije za obratni DNS (PTR) zapisi o strežnikih Hetzner Cloud, primarnih IP-jih, plavajočih IP-ih in ravnotežjih obremenitve"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Base development environment for software engineers on Linux, with core editors and language-agnostic tooling"
msgstr "**Opis:** Razvojno okolje za inženirje programske opreme na Linuxu, z glavnimi urejevalniki in jezikovno-agnostičnimi orodji"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Base role for systemd manager configuration via drop-ins, default settings, and unit validation"
msgstr "**Opis:** Osnovna vloga za nastavitve sistemskega upravitelja preko spustov, privzetih nastavitev in potrjevanja enote"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Browser-based spinning wheel app for decision making, random selection, and gamification"
msgstr "**Opis:** Aplikacija vrtečega kolesa na osnovi brskalnika za odločanje, naključno izbiro in gamifikacijo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Browser-facing admin interface for the shared LLM gateway, published on its own domain behind the front proxy"
msgstr "**Opis:** Brskajoči admin vmesnik za skupni LLM prehod, objavljen na svoji domeni za sprednjim posrednikom"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Build-time tool for simulating root-owned file operations without elevated privileges during package builds"
msgstr "**Opis:** Gradi časovno orodje za simulacijo operacij datotek v lasti korena brez povišanih privilegijev med gradnjo paketa"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central Dockerized search engine shared by multiple apps with per-consumer scoped API keys"
msgstr "**Opis:** Centralni dockerizirani iskalnik, ki si ga deli več aplikacij s področjem uporabe na potrošnika API tipke"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central document extraction engine that turns uploaded files into text for retrieval-augmented chat"
msgstr "**Opis:** Centralni izhodni stroj za dokumente, ki spremeni naložene datoteke v besedilo za priklic-augmentiran klepet"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central in-memory caching engine with per-consumer key-prefix isolation, usable centrally or as an embedded sidecar"
msgstr "**Opis:** Osrednji vpojni motor z izolacijo ključ-predpona na potrošnika, ki se uporablja centralno ali kot vgrajena prikolica"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central loader role for ordered shared-service preloading and queued post-load role inclusions across the deployment"
msgstr "**Opis:** Vloga centralnega nakladalnika za naročene prednakladalne in čakalne vrste po uporabi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central logout proxy for single-action sign-out across all OIDC-connected apps, with Nginx snippets and a live status UI"
msgstr "**Opis:** Centralni posrednik za odjavo za enkratni odpis v vseh aplikacijah, povezanih z OIDC, z Nginxovimi odrezki in UI v živo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central mail orchestration layer routing host mail through Mailu, msmtp, or an optional local SMTP relay"
msgstr "**Opis:** Centralna mapa, ki usmerja gostiteljsko pošto skozi Mailu, msmtp, ali neobvezno lokalni SMTP rele"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver on a static IP for consumer stacks to target as their DNS"
msgstr "**Opis:** Centralni rekurzivni/predhodni reševalec DNSSEC na statičnem IP za potrošniške kupe, ki jih je treba ciljati kot DNS"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central search and analytics engine with per-consumer index namespaces isolating tenants in a shared Docker deployment"
msgstr "**Opis:** Centralni iskalni in analitični motor z indeksnim prostorom na potrošnika, ki izolira najemnike v skupni uporabi Dockerja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central vector database engine for storing and searching per-consumer embeddings shared across the stack"
msgstr "**Opis:** Centralna vektorska podatkovna baza za shranjevanje in iskanje vgradnje na potrošnika, ki se delijo po nizu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Centralized MariaDB or PostgreSQL database service shared across applications via Docker Compose"
msgstr "**Opis:** Centralizirano MariaDB ali PostgreSQL storitev zbirke podatkov, ki se izmenjujejo med aplikacijami prek Docker Compose"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Certbot-driven ACME service for Let's Encrypt single-domain and wildcard TLS certificates on NGINX domains"
msgstr "**Opis:** Storitev ACME, ki jo poganja Certbot, za Šifrirajmo potrdila TLS z enodomno in z joker kartico na domenah NGINX"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cleanup routine for deprecated domains, removing Nginx configs and revoking their Certbot certificates"
msgstr "**Opis:** Čiščenje rutine za amortizirane domene, odstranjevanje Nginx configs in preklic njihovih Certbot potrdila"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cleanup routine for reclaiming disk space from temp files, package caches, optional Docker data and old backups"
msgstr "**Opis:** Redno čiščenje prostora na disku iz temp datotek, predpomnilnikov paketov, neobveznih podatkov Docker in starih varnostnih kopij"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Client-side NFS setup for mounting a remote server export on every swarm node, with a deploy-time reachability probe"
msgstr "**Opis:** Nastavitev NFS na strani odjemalca za namestitev izvoza oddaljenega strežnika na vsako vozlišče roja s sondo, ki omogoča časovno razporeditev"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Client-side WireGuard VPN role for stable connectivity with a systemd service and script that tune interface MTU"
msgstr "**Opis:** Vloga WireGuard VPN na strani naročnika za stabilno povezljivost s sistemsko storitvijo in skripto, ki uglašuje vmesnik MTU"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Clipboard manager with editable history, custom actions, and scripting support"
msgstr "**Opis:** Upravljalnik odložišča z urejevalno zgodovino, dejanji po meri in podporo za skripte"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cloudflare DNS bootstrap role for apex and wildcard A/AAAA records (and optional CAA) across a web stack's base domains"
msgstr "**Opis:** Cloudflare DNS boottrap vloga za zapise A/AAAA (in neobvezna CAA) preko osnovnih domen spletnega sklada"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cluster-local container image registry for serving custom-built images to Docker Swarm worker nodes"
msgstr "**Opis:** Slikovni register zabojnikov za uporabo slik po meri Docker Swarm vozlišča delavcev"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cluster-local proxy cache for package upstreams, serving apt, pip, npm and raw artefacts every role declares"
msgstr "**Opis:** Cluster- local posredniški predpomnilnik za pakete v toku navzgor, ki služi apt, pip, npm in surove artefakte vsake vloge razglasi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cluster-local pull-through cache for shared Docker Hub base-image pulls, cutting duplicate transfers and rate limits"
msgstr "**Opis:** Krajevni predpomnilnik za skupno sliko Docker Hub, rezanje dvojnih prenosov in omejitev hitrosti"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Collaborative wiki platform for user-driven documentation with an extensible extension ecosystem and content management"
msgstr "**Opis:** Skupna wiki platforma za uporabniško podprto dokumentacijo z razširjenim ekosistemom in upravljanjem vsebin"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Command-line journal application for creating and managing personal diary entries from the terminal"
msgstr "**Opis:** Program ukazne vrstice za ustvarjanje in upravljanje vnosov osebnih dnevnikov s terminala"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Composite stack role bundling a containerized database backend with an HTTP reverse-proxy frontend for web access"
msgstr "**Opis:** Kompozitna vloga skladanja hrbtenico podatkovne zbirke z reverzno-proxy vmesnikom HTTP za spletni dostop"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Container engine runtime with Compose for building and running application containers on Linux hosts"
msgstr "**Opis:** Kontejnerski čas delovanja motorja s Sestavite za gradnjo in delovanje aplikacijskih posod na gostiteljih Linux"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Container orchestration cluster for scheduling services across pooled manager and worker nodes"
msgstr "**Opis:** Kontejnerski grozd za storitve razporejanja po združenih vozliščih upraviteljev in delavcev"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Containerized Reveal.js slide deck for presenting the platform to admins, developers, users, and investors"
msgstr "**Opis:** Zabojnik Reveal.js diapozitiv za predstavitev platforme administratorjem, razvijalcem, uporabnikom in investitorjem"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Containerized icon server for hosting the Simple Icons brand SVG and PNG collection for web and documentation use"
msgstr "**Opis:** Kontejnerni strežnik ikon za gostovanje Simple Icons blagovna znamka SVG in zbirka PNG za spletno in dokumentacijo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Containerized relational database with automated database, user, and privilege provisioning"
msgstr "**Opis:** Contailed relational baze podatkov z avtomatizirano bazo podatkov, uporabnik, in privilegij zagotavljanje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Content management system for building and managing websites, blogs, and multisite networks with themes and plugins"
msgstr "**Opis:** Sistem upravljanja z vsebinami za gradnjo in upravljanje spletnih strani, blogov in večmestnih mrež s temami in vstavki"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Core NGINX webserver with HTTP and TCP/UDP stream support and performance-tuned defaults"
msgstr "**Opis:** Core NGINX webserver z HTTP in TCP/UDP stream podporo in učinkovitost uglašene privzete"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cross-distribution installer for the Nix package manager with checksum-verified, reproducible multi-user setup"
msgstr "**Opis:** Inštalat za navzkrižno porazdelitev za upravitelja paketa Nix s ponovljivo nastavitvijo nadzorne vsote"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cross-distribution maintenance routine for disk reclamation across CI, container, and build environments"
msgstr "**Opis:** Redno vzdrževanje navzkrižne distribucije za predelavo diskov v okolju CI, zabojniku in gradnji"

# translated-by: libretranslate
