msgstr "**Paketi distroaware:** Namesti `nfs-common` o Debian/Ubuntu, `nfs-utils` na Arch / RHEL / Fedora / Alpine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Ne opozarjaj na ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao ohranja Vaultov metrični imenski prostor in zdravo nezapečateno vozlišče oddaja ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, torej opozorilo za ``== 0`` Ogenj za vedno. Uporaba ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 med zapečatenjem); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` potrjuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so an alert on `== 0` fires permanently. Use `/v1/sys/health` (503 while sealed); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` corroborates."
msgstr "**Ne opozarjaj na `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao ohranja Vaultov metrični imenski prostor in zdravo nezapečateno vozlišče oddaja `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, torej opozorilo za `== 0` Ogenj za vedno. Uporaba `/v1/sys/health` (503 med zapečatenjem); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` potrjuje."

