# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker Swarm deployment mode** for any role whose own Ansible group lists more than one host. The cluster is bootstrapped by the `svc-swarm-node` group; per-role topology is derived from `groups[application_id]` directly. A role with one or zero hosts in its group stays on the existing Compose path and renders byte-identical output (no implicit migration). Adding additional hosts to a role's own group is the single trigger that promotes the role to a Swarm service."
msgstr "**Docker Swarm način uporabe** za vsako vlogo, katere lastna skupina Ansible navaja več kot enega gostitelja. Kopica je v škornjih. `svc-swarm-node` skupina; topologija na rolo izhaja iz `groups[application_id]` neposredno. Vloga z enim ali ničelnim gostiteljem v svoji skupini ostaja na obstoječi poti Compoy in omogoča izpis bajtov (brez implicitne migracije). Dodajanje dodatnih gostiteljev v lastno skupino vloge je edini sprožilec, ki spodbuja vlogo v Swarm storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker Swarm secrets.** v1 keeps the existing env-file-based credential rendering (no app-side code changes). Migrating to `docker secret` (Raft-encrypted, mounted under `/run/secrets/<name>`) is a follow-up requirement and requires per-role app-code adaptations to read secrets from files instead of env vars."
msgstr "**Docker Swarm skrivnosti.** v1 ohranja obstoječo na env datoteki osnovano kredenco (brez sprememb kode ob aplikaciji). Selitev na `docker secret` (Raft šifriran, vdelan pod `/run/secrets/<name>`) je dodatna zahteva in zahteva prilagoditve aplikacijske kode na role za branje skrivnosti iz datotek namesto env vars."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker and Backup Integration:** Optionally cleans Docker resources and backups if configured."
msgstr "**Vključevanje dockerja in varnostne kopije:** Neobvezno čisti Docker vire in varnostne kopije, če so nastavljene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker-in-Docker:** Switched the deploy container to real Docker-in-Docker using fuse-overlayfs, fully decoupled from the host Docker socket and configured a deterministic storage driver."
msgstr "**Docker-in-Docker:** Preklopil je posodo za uporabo na pravi Docker-in-Docker z uporabo varovalk, popolnoma ločen od gostitelja Docker vtičnico in nastavljen deterministični gonilnik za shranjevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker-ready**: can be deployed in seconds using the official image."
msgstr "**Docker pripravljen**: se lahko razporedi v sekundah z uporabo uradne slike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker-ready**: fully integrated into the Infinito.Nexus Docker stack."
msgstr "**Docker pripravljen**: v celoti vključena v Infinito.Nexus Docker kup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dockerized Collabora CODE:** Uses the official ``collabora/code`` image."
msgstr "**Dockerized Collabora KODE:** Uporablja uradnika ``collabora/code`` slike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dockerized Collabora CODE:** Uses the official `collabora/code` image."
msgstr "**Dockerized Collabora KODE:** Uporablja uradnika `collabora/code` slike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dockerized Deployment:** Packages the application in a Docker container for consistent and isolated runtime."
msgstr "**Zapletena uvedba:** Nanos v vsebniku Docker za konsistenten in izoliran čas delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dockerized Environment:** The entire process is contained within Docker, ensuring consistent builds and easy deployment."
msgstr "**Dockerizirano okolje:** Celoten proces je v Dockerju, kar zagotavlja dosledno gradnjo in enostavno uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dockerized MariaDB**: Leverages Docker for MariaDB deployment, ensuring consistency across different environments."
msgstr "**Dockerized MariaDB**: finančnega vzvoda za MariaDB uporaba, zagotavljanje doslednosti v različnih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dockerized ONLYOFFICE Document Server:** Uses the official ``onlyoffice/documentserver`` image."
msgstr "**Strežnik dokumentov za samooskrbo:** Uporablja uradnika ``onlyoffice/documentserver`` slike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dockerized ONLYOFFICE Document Server:** Uses the official `onlyoffice/documentserver` image."
msgstr "**Strežnik dokumentov za samooskrbo:** Uporablja uradnika `onlyoffice/documentserver` slike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docs**"
msgstr "**Zdravniki**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Documentation and agent instructions.** Six new requirement documents cover the LLM gateway and model backends, agent employees, Home Assistant, the robot role, the MCP proxy expansion and native AI gateway integration. The MCP design docs are nested under their own folder with an audit the lints can check. The role README template asks the reader for a domain the deployment can resolve, enforces consistent Credits attribution, and drops the em dash. Documentation generators are gathered under *cli/build/docs*, and a new CLI edits role bonds in a matrix instead of hunting through files."
msgstr "**Dokumentacija in navodila za agenta.** Šest novih dokumentov o zahtevah zajema prehod LLM in modelne hrbtenice, zaposlene agente, Home Assistant, robot vlogo, MCP proxy širitev in naravno AI prehod integracijo. MCP docs so vgnezdili pod svojo mapo z revizijo lahko pregledajo. Vlogo predlogo README prosi bralca za domeno, ki jo lahko razporeditev razreši, uveljavlja dosledno Credits atribution, in spusti pomišljaj. Proizvajalci dokumentacije so zbrani pod *cli/build/docs*, in nov CLI ureja vezi vlog v matrici namesto lov skozi datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Domain Detection:** Scans NGINX server block `.conf` files for configured domains."
msgstr "**Odkrivanje domene:** Pregleduje blok strežnika NGINX `.conf` datoteke za nastavljene domene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Domain Detection:** Scans NGINX server block ``.conf`` files for configured domains."
msgstr "**Odkrivanje domene:** Pregleduje blok strežnika NGINX ``.conf`` datoteke za nastavljene domene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Domain Extraction:** Parses all `.conf` files in the NGINX config folder to determine the list of domains to check."
msgstr "**Ekstrakcija domene:** Razčleni vse `.conf` datoteke v nastavitveni mapi NGINX za določitev seznama domen za preverjanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Domain Extraction:** Parses all ``.conf`` files in the NGINX config folder to determine the list of domains to check."
msgstr "**Ekstrakcija domene:** Razčleni vse ``.conf`` datoteke v nastavitveni mapi NGINX za določitev seznama domen za preverjanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Domain template deployment** – copies a Jinja2 vHost from *sys-svc-proxy*."
msgstr "**Predloga domene** – kopije a Jinja2 vHost od *sys-svc-proxy*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**DooD isolation:** Runner containers mount the host Docker socket. Each job gets its own Infinito DinD container with a unique subnet, container names, and Docker volume — parallel jobs never conflict."
msgstr "**Izolacija dooD:** Tekoči kontejnerji priklopijo gostitelja Docker vtičnico. Vsako delo dobi svojo posodo Infinito DIND z edinstveno podmrežo, imeni zabojnikov in Dockerjem – vzporedna dela nikoli ne nasprotujejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Driver-injected** by `make compose-up` and the dev CLI (cache override paths like `INFINITO_CACHE_REGISTRY_PROXY_CONF`, the package-cache config paths, the frontend CA file). See [common.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/common.py) and [compose.yml.md](../artefact/files/compose.yml.md)."
msgstr "**Vbrizgavanje voznika** z `make compose-up` in dev CLI (Predpomnilnik povozi poti kot `INFINITO_CACHE_REGISTRY_PROXY_CONF`, config poti paket-cache, datoteka za začetni CA). Glej [common.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/common.py) ter [compose.yml.md](../artefact/files/compose.yml.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Drop-in Inclusion:** Ensures that configuration files from `/etc/sudoers.d` are included."
msgstr "**Vključevanje spusta:** Zagotavlja, da nastavitvene datoteke iz `/etc/sudoers.d` so vključeni."

