# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic Configuration:** Leverage runtime configuration overlays to adjust directory settings without downtime."
msgstr "**Dinamična nastavitev:** Nastavitev vzvoda med delovanjem se nastavi tako, da se nastavitve imenika prilagodijo brez izpada."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic Customization:** Adapt workflows and database structures to suit your specific needs."
msgstr "**Dinamična prilagoditev:** Prilagodite delovne tokove in strukture podatkovnih baz, da ustrezajo vašim posebnim potrebam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic DNS Plugin Support:** Automatically installs the correct ``certbot-dns-<provider>`` package based on your selected challenge method."
msgstr "**Podpora vstavkom DNS:** Samodejno namesti pravilno ``certbot-dns-<provider>`` paket, ki temelji na vaši izbrani metodi izziva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic DNS Plugin Support:** Automatically installs the correct `certbot-dns-<provider>` package based on your selected challenge method."
msgstr "**Podpora vstavkom DNS:** Samodejno namesti pravilno `certbot-dns-<provider>` paket, ki temelji na vaši izbrani metodi izziva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic Directory Structure:** Creates per-application instance folders for Compose setups."
msgstr "**Dinamična struktura map:** Ustvari mape na primer programa za nastavitve Sestavite."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic Icon Delivery:** Icons are dynamically served via RESTful endpoints."
msgstr "**Dinamična dostava ikon:** Ikone se dinamično strežejo preko RESTful končnih točk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic Redirects**: Builds ``source: \"www.domain\"`` → ``target: \"domain\"`` mappings on the fly. 🔧"
msgstr "**Dinamične preusmeritve**: Zgradi ``source: \"www.domain\"`` → ``target: \"domain\"`` Kartiranje na muhi. 🔧"

# translated-by: libretranslate
