msgstr "**Dinamične preusmeritve**: Zgradi `source: \"www.domain\"` → `target: \"domain\"` Kartiranje na muhi. 🔧"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic Timer Configuration:** Uses a Jinja2 template to create a timer unit file based on provided variables."
msgstr "**Nastavitev dinamičnega timerja:** Uporablja Jinjo2 predlogo za ustvarjanje datoteke timer enote na podlagi podanih spremenljivk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic Volume Migration:** Moves Docker volumes based on container image types."
msgstr "**Dinamične selitve glasnosti:** Premakne Docker volumne na osnovi vrst slik zabojnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic content support**: Uses a `MutationObserver` to handle AJAX‑loaded or dynamically injected logout elements."
msgstr "**Podpora dinamičnim vsebinam**: Uporablja a `MutationObserver` za ravnanje z elementi za odjavo, napolnjenimi z AJAX ali dinamično injiciranimi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dynamic content support**: Uses a ``MutationObserver`` to handle AJAX‑loaded or dynamically injected logout elements."
msgstr "**Podpora dinamičnim vsebinam**: Uporablja a ``MutationObserver`` za ravnanje z elementi za odjavo, napolnjenimi z AJAX ali dinamično injiciranimi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**ERP / CRM / inventory desk** — full ERPNext frontend at ``next.erp.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}``."
msgstr "**ERP / CRM / inventar miza** — polno ERPNext Naprej ``next.erp.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**ERP / CRM / inventory desk** — full ERPNext frontend at `next.erp.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`."
msgstr "**ERP / CRM / inventar miza** — polno ERPNext Naprej `next.erp.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Each agent platform is its own role; no generic wrapper.** `web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` are separate roles reflecting their different stacks (Hermes Docker backend vs OpenClaw npm/pnpm). No speculative \"generic agent runner\" abstraction. Additional agent platforms become additional roles."
msgstr "**Vsaka platforma agentov ima svojo vlogo; brez generičnega ovoja.** `web-app-hermes` ter `web-app-openclaw` so ločene vloge, ki odražajo njihove različne nizov (Hrbtenica Hermes Docker vs OpenClaw npm/pnpm). Ni špekulativne \"tekač generičnih zdravil\" abstrakcija. Dodatne agentske platforme postanejo dodatne vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Easy CSP Integration**"
msgstr "**Enostavna integracija CSP**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Easy CSP Integration**   Automatically computes and appends a CSP hash entry for your script, so you can lock down Content Security Policy without lifting a finger."
msgstr "**Enostavna integracija CSP** Samodejno izračuna in doda vnos s CSP hash za vaš skript, tako da lahko zaklenete Content Security Policy brez dvigovanja prsta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Easy CSP Integration**   Calculates a CSP hash for the injected script so you can safely allow it via your Content Security Policy."
msgstr "**Enostavna integracija CSP** Izračuna hašiš CSP za injiciran skript, tako da ga lahko varno omogočite preko vaše politike za varnost vsebine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Effects**"
msgstr "**Učinki**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Efficient Administration:** Streamline the handling of LDAP objects such as users, groups, and organizational units."
msgstr "**Učinkovita uporaba:** Poenostaviti ravnanje z LDAP predmeti, kot so uporabniki, skupine, in organizacijske enote."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Efficient Code Collaboration:** Manage repositories and workflows with an intuitive interface."
msgstr "**Učinkovito Code Sodelovanje:** Upravljajte skladišča in delovne tokove z intuitivnim vmesnikom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Efficient Integration:** Works seamlessly with web server roles for robust domain routing."
msgstr "**Učinkovito vključevanje:** Deluje brezhibno z vlogami spletnega strežnika za robustno usmerjanje domen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Efficient URL Shortening:**"
msgstr "**Učinkovito skrajšanje URL:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Efficient URL Shortening:**   Quickly generate short, branded links that help streamline your online presence."
msgstr "**Učinkovito skrajšanje URL:** Hitro ustvarjajo kratke, blagovne znamke povezave, ki pomagajo racionalizirati vašo spletno prisotnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Eligibility is read from LiteLLM's own catalog; a declaration is the override.** The image ships `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 models deep, carrying `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` and `input_cost_per_token`. The hook reads a route's capabilities from `litellm.model_cost`, keyed on the route's own `litellm_params.model` and then on that name without its first segment, because `ollama/llama3` is filed prefixed while `openai/gpt-4o-mini` is filed as `gpt-4o-mini`. It never probes a backend at request time."
msgstr "**Upravičenost se bere iz lastnega kataloga LiteLLM; deklaracija je prevlada.** Ladje za slike `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 modeli globoko, nošenje `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` ter `input_cost_per_token`. Kljuka bere sposobnosti poti iz `litellm.model_cost`, ki je na poti sama `litellm_params.model` in potem na to ime brez svojega prvega segmenta, ker `ollama/llama3` je vložena predpona med `openai/gpt-4o-mini` je vložena kot `gpt-4o-mini`. Nikoli ne preišče hrbtenice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Email Destination:** Specify the recipient via the ``lookup('users', 'administrator').email`` variable."
msgstr "**Cilj e- pošte:** Navedite prejemnika prek ``lookup('users', 'administrator').email`` spremenljivka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Email Destination:** Specify the recipient via the `lookup('users', 'administrator').email` variable."
msgstr "**Cilj e- pošte:** Navedite prejemnika prek `lookup('users', 'administrator').email` spremenljivka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Email notifications** via Mailu (optional)."
msgstr "**Elektronska obvestila** preko Mailu (neobvezno)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embedded mode:** Roles that opt out of the shared instance run a private storage-only container inside their own compose network."
msgstr "**Vgrajen način:** Vloge, ki odstopajo od skupnega primera, znotraj lastnega komponiranega omrežja vodijo samo zasebno skladišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embedded runner:** Automation executes inside the main container."
