# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embodied / dedicated-device mode moves the trust boundary to the whole device.** For an agent that owns and explores a single-purpose machine (a robot platform, a home-assistant appliance), the isolation boundary is the entire dedicated node, not a guest kernel inside it. Privileged/full host access (`/dev`, GPIO, sensors, cameras, host network) is allowed **only** on a node that is dedicated, single-tenant, network-segmented, and explicitly opted in, with the blast radius documented in the role README. It is **forbidden on any shared cluster node**: agents on shared infrastructure always stay under Decision #4. This is the deliberate exception that keeps the general rule intact rather than a hole in it."
msgstr "**Način evakuacije / namen-naprava premakne mejo zaupanja na celotno napravo.** Za agenta, ki ima v lasti in raziskuje enonamenski stroj (robotska ploščad, naprava za domačo pomoč), Izolacijska meja je celotno posvečeno vozlišče, ne pa jedrce v njem. Privilegiran/celoten dostop do gostitelja (`/dev`, GPIO, senzorji, kamere, gostiteljsko omrežje) je dovoljeno **samo** na vozlišču, ki je namenjeno, enonadstropno, omrežno integrirano in izrecno izbrano, s polmerom eksplozije, dokumentiranim v vlogi README. Res je. **prepovedana na katerem koli skupnem vozlišču grozdov**: agenti na skupni infrastrukturi vedno ostanejo pod odločbo #4. To je namerna izjema, ki ohranja splošno pravilo nedotaknjeno, ne pa luknja v njem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)** You MUST enable 2FA whenever possible. Many password managers (like KeePassXC) can generate [TOTP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-Time_Password) tokens, adding an extra layer of security even if your password is compromised. Synchronize your password database across devices using the [Nextcloud Client](https://nextcloud.com/) 📱💻."
msgstr "**Omogoči dvofaktorsko overitev (2FA)** Morate omogočiti 2FA, kadar je to mogoče. Številni upravljalniki gesel (kot KeePassXC) lahko ustvarja [TOTP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-Time_Password) žetoni, dodajanje dodatne plasti varnosti, tudi če je vaše geslo ogroženo. Uskladite svojo zbirko gesel po napravah z uporabo [Nextcloud Odjemalec](https://nextcloud.com/) 📱💻."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable detailed format**: set `MODE_DEBUG: true` and reload NGINX."
msgstr "**Omogoči podrobno obliko**: set `MODE_DEBUG: true` in ponovno napolnite NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable detailed format**: set ``MODE_DEBUG: true`` and reload NGINX."
msgstr "**Omogoči podrobno obliko**: set ``MODE_DEBUG: true`` in ponovno napolnite NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable state defaults to off; deliberately-wired integrations auto-enable with their partner.** `enabled` is optional and defaults to `false` unless `required: true` is set. An addon that bridges a service MUST derive its effective enablement from that service's `enabled` flag (never a duplicated group-membership expression), so a deliberately-wired cross-role integration activates automatically whenever its partner role is co-deployed (`services.<target>.enabled` is true) and stays off otherwise. Any credential an addon needs is declared in `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Decision 4): auto-generated where possible, or supplied through the same credentials mechanism's manual-entry path where the operator must enter the secret. There is no separate opt-in exception: auto-enable-with-partner holds, and an operator-entered credential resolves through `credentials` like any other. This auto-enable-with-partner rule is distinct from update-automation-discovered addons (Decision 10), which are added hard-off."
msgstr "**Omogočite izklop privzetih stanj; namerno vezane integracije so samodejno omogočljive z njihovim partnerjem.** `enabled` je neobvezna in privzeta `false` razen če `required: true` Pripravljen. Addon, da mostovi storitev mora izpeljati svojo učinkovito možnost iz te storitve `enabled` zastava (nikoli podvojen izraz skupinskega članstva), tako da se namerno vezano povezovanje med role aktivira samodejno vsakič, ko je njegova partnerska vloga sorazporejena (`services.<target>.enabled` je res) In se ne vmešavaj. Vsako spričevalo, ki ga potrebuje addon, se navede v `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` in berite preko `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Odločba 4): Samodejno ustvarjeno, kadar je to mogoče, ali dobavljeno po poti ročnega vstopa istega mehanizma poverilnic, kjer mora operator vstopiti v skrivnost. Izjema ni ločena: lastnina s partnerjem, ki jo je mogoče avtomatizirati, in kreditna rešitev, v katero je vstopil operater `credentials` Kot vse druge. To pravilo o samodejnem izklopu s partnerjem se razlikuje od dodatkov, odkritih s posodobitvijo (Odločba 10), ki se dodajo trdo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enabled by this:** The allow list uses the broad wildcard `Bash(*)` without maintaining narrow path lists. The single source of truth for writable paths is `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` in [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."
msgstr "**To omogoča:** Seznam dopustov uporablja široko jokercard `Bash(*)` brez vzdrževanja ozkih seznamov poti. Edini vir resnice za zapisljive poti je `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` v [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Encrypted app-password cache:** Keep the synthesised PDS app-password in a process-local map only as AES-256-GCM ciphertext, with the key sourced from the project's credentials vault."
msgstr "**Šifriran predpomnilnik za geslo aplikacije:** Sintetizirano PDS-geslo naj bo na krajevnem zemljevidu samo kot AES-256Šifra GCM, s ključem iz arhiva."

