# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every MCP implementation ships a Playwright test.** Each role that gains an MCP surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises its MCP surface (a server role's authenticated endpoint, a client role's configured-server list). No MCP role is considered implemented until its Playwright test is present and green."
msgstr "**Vsaka MCP ladja je Playwrightov test.** Vsaka vloga, ki pridobi površino MCP MORA dodati ujemanje Playwright spec pod `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` ki izvaja svojo MCP površino (overovljena končna točka vloge strežnika, nastavljen seznam strežnikov). Nobena vloga MCP se šteje, da se izvaja, dokler je Playwright test prisoten in zelena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every addon ships a Playwright test.** Each addon with a user-facing surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises that addon's behaviour (e.g. an `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` login path, a `wp-discourse` round-trip, an enabled Odoo module's UI entry point). Desktop roles (`desk-*`) drive no web surface a Playwright test could exercise and therefore NEVER ship addon specs — the lint forbids spec files under `desk-*` roles. For every web-facing role there is no per-addon exemption: an addon is considered migrated only once its Playwright spec is present and green. Cross-role integration specs (proving two roles are actually connected) run under a dedicated **integration-pair deploy variant** that co-deploys both partner roles, and are added incrementally as each ✅ pair is wired rather than all upfront."
msgstr "**Vsak addon odda Playwrightov test.** Vsak addon s površino, obrnjeno proti uporabniku, MORA dodati ujemanje Playwright spec pod `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` ki vadi obnašanje Addona (Npr. `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` pot prijave, a `wp-discourse` povratna pot, omogočena vstopna točka modula Odoo). Vloge namizja (`desk-*`) pogon nobene spletne površine, Playwright test bi lahko telovadili in zato NIKOLI ladja dodatne specifikacije – lint prepoveduje Spect datoteke pod `desk-*` vloge. Za vsako spletno vlogo ni izvzetja po addonu: za dodatek se šteje, da je migrantiran šele, ko je prisoten in zelen. Specifikacije povezovanja med roli (dokaz, da sta dve vlogi dejansko povezani) teče v skladu s posebnim **varianta uvajanja integracije-par** da soustvarja obe vlogi partnerjev in se dodajata postopoma kot vsaka ✅ par je bolj ozvočen, kot pa vse vnaprej."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The ``role_id``/``secret_id`` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in ``.applied.json``, then ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` re-pins to this run’s values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. ``custom-secret-id`` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers ``500`` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Vsaka razporeditev vrti AppRole.** – ``role_id``/``secret_id`` Tek ni tisti, ki ga vodi instant. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` poskuša inventar par, pade nazaj na par zabeležen v ``.applied.json``, potem ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` ponovno poudarja vrednote tega teka in uničuje staro SecretID. Zapis je napisan zadnji, tako da tek, ki umre del poti pusti prejšnjo generacijo nedotaknjeno. ``custom-secret-id`` m **ni** idempotent – ponovno pisanje odgovorov tajnega dokumenta ``500`` – zato je zamenjava nastavljena na spremenjeno vrednost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The `role_id`/`secret_id` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. `tasks/01_init.yml` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in `.applied.json`, then `tasks/06_rotate.yml` re-pins to this run's values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. `custom-secret-id` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers `500` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Vsaka razporeditev vrti AppRole.** – `role_id`/`secret_id` Tek ni tisti, ki ga vodi instant. `tasks/01_init.yml` poskuša inventar par, pade nazaj na par zabeležen v `.applied.json`, potem `tasks/06_rotate.yml` Ponovno poudarja vrednote tega teka in uničuje stari SecretID. Zapis je napisan zadnji, tako da tek, ki umre del poti pusti prejšnjo generacijo nedotaknjeno. `custom-secret-id` m **ni** idempotent – ponovno pisanje odgovorov tajnega dokumenta `500` – zato je zamenjava nastavljena na spremenjeno vrednost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every mounted volume is discarded**, not only the backed-up ones. A volume declared `backup: false` claims to be disposable; a drill that spares it never tests the claim. If its service cannot rebuild it, the health gate goes red — that is the finding, not a false alarm. The single exception is the data directory of an engine whose dump is about to be replayed: it carries the database and its role, which the deploy creates and the container does not, so wiping it would leave `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` with nothing to connect to and the drill would fail at itself instead of at a defect."
msgstr "**Vsaka nameščena prostornina se zavrže**Ne samo tiste s podkupnino. Navedena količina `backup: false` trdi, da je za enkratno uporabo; vrtalnik, ki mu prizanese, nikoli ne preizkusi trditve. Če je njegova služba ne more obnoviti, so vrata za zdravje rdeča – to je ugotovitev, ne lažni alarm. Enotna izjema je podatkovna mapa motorja, katerega odlagališče bo kmalu ponovno predvajano: nosi bazo podatkov in svojo vlogo, ki jo ustvari razporeditev in posoda ne, zato bi brisanje zapustil `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` Z ničimer se ne bi povezala in vrtanje bi propadlo samo po sebi, namesto pri napaki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every ref:** Role data, categories, bundles, files and TODO markers for the deployed working tree, any branch, tag or commit of core, and every branch or tag of its forks."
msgstr "**Vsak sodnik:** Podatki o vlogah, kategorijah, svežnjih, datotekah in oznakah TODO za razporejeno delovno drevo, katero koli vejo, značko ali obvezo jedra ter vsako vejo ali značko vilic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every release:** The latest commit is the default, each release tag is selectable and built on demand."
msgstr "**Vsaka sprostitev:** Najnovejša zaveza je privzeto, vsaka oznaka za izdajo je izbrana in zgrajena na zahtevo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-format
msgid "**Every token pins every axis.** `role#variant@mode+tor|clearnet%distro/filesystem` carries all six, and none is left to the rotation. A run whose rows the rotation is still free to move is not a verification run: the combination that comes back is not the one the question was asked about, and a green row then proves nothing about the red one it was supposed to answer."
msgstr "**Vsak žeton zašije vsako os.** `role#variant@mode+tor|clearnet%distro/filesystem` Nosi vseh šest, in nihče ni ostal na rotaciji. Potek, o katerem je vrtenje še prosto, ni preverjanje: kombinacija, ki se vrne, ni tista, o kateri je bilo postavljeno vprašanje, in zelena vrsta potem ne dokazuje ničesar o rdeči, na katero naj bi odgovorila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Example browser integration**: direct access to the original LittleJS example browser."
msgstr "**Integracija brskalnika**: neposreden dostop do izvirnika LittleJS brskalnik za primere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**Primer:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Exception** — names a concrete trip-wire (bug, pitfall, deliberate non-idiomatic choice). Must name the surprise; restating what the next line does is NOT an exception."
msgstr "**Izjema** — poimenuje betonsko žico (bug, past, namerna nediomična izbira). Morajo povedati presenečenje; ponovno kaj naslednja vrstica počne ni izjema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Exclusionary Behavior:** Do not engage in behaviors or comments that might exclude or isolate community members."
msgstr "**Izločevalno vedenje:** Ne ukvarjajte se z vedenjem ali pripombami, ki bi lahko izključile ali izolirale člane skupnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Executable Setup:** Sets proper permissions on the main script."
