# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Exporter ``PENPOT_PUBLIC_URI``** is shared from the single role env file (the external HTTPS base URL). Penpot upstream also supports an internal ``http://frontend:8080`` value; the shared-env contract renders one file for all containers, which the upstream image tolerates."
msgstr "**Izvoznik ``PENPOT_PUBLIC_URI``** se deli iz enotne datoteke vloge env (zunanji osnovni URL HTTPS). Penpot v toku podpira tudi notranji ``http://frontend:8080`` vrednost; pogodba z deljenim virom tvori eno datoteko za vse zabojnike, ki jih slika zgoraj tolerira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensible Architecture:** Leverage a wide range of extensions and customization options to tailor the wiki experience to your needs."
msgstr "**Obsežna arhitektura:** Liverage široko paleto razširitev in prilagoditev možnosti za prilagoditev wiki izkušnje za vaše potrebe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensible Architecture:** Optional Redis, OpenSearch, and plugin-based IAM integrations."
msgstr "**Obsežna arhitektura:** Neobvezno Redis, OpenSearch, in plugin temelji IAM integracije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensible Design:** Acts as a base layer for more specific development stacks (e.g., web, Python, embedded)."
msgstr "**Obsežna zasnova:** Deluje kot osnovna plast za bolj specifične razvojne sklope (npr. splet, Python, vgrajen)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensible Plugin Framework:** Easily manage and configure hundreds of Nextcloud plugins using the OCC command line tool."
msgstr "**Obsežen okvir vstavkov:** Enostavno upravljajte in nastavite na stotine Nextcloud vstavki z uporabo orodja ukazne vrstice OCC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensions & Applications:** Extend functionality with hundreds of available XWiki extensions and macros."
msgstr "**Razširitve in programi:** Razširite funkcionalnost s stotinami razpoložljivih XWiki razširitve in makroji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensive Community and Ecosystem:** Benefit from a massive community with frequent updates, security patches, and a wide range of third-party tools that continuously enhance the platform."
msgstr "**Obsežna skupnost in ekosistem:** Koristi množične skupnosti s pogostimi posodobitvami, varnostnimi popravki in široko paleto orodij tretjih oseb, ki nenehno izboljšujejo platformo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensive Plugin Support:** Enhance your forum with a wide range of plugins and integrations for additional functionality."
msgstr "**Obsežna podpora vstavkom:** Izboljšajte svoj forum s široko paleto plugins in integracije za dodatno funkcionalnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External Link Handling**"
msgstr "**Ravnanje z zunanjimi povezavami**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External Link Handling**   Automatically sets `target=\"_blank\"` and `rel=\"noopener\"` on links pointing outside your primary domain to improve security and user experience."
msgstr "**Ravnanje z zunanjimi povezavami** Samodejno nastavi `target=\"_blank\"` ter `rel=\"noopener\"` na povezave, ki kažejo izven vaše primarne domene za izboljšanje varnosti in uporabniške izkušnje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External PostgreSQL Database:** Configures Pretix to use a centralized PostgreSQL service."
msgstr "**Zunanja PostgreSQL Podatkovna zbirka:** Nastavi Pretix za uporabo centralizirane PostgreSQL storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External database:** Persist Joomla content in the project's central RDBMS through the standard role-meta wiring."
msgstr "**Zunanja zbirka podatkov:** Persist Joomla vsebina osrednjega sistema RDBMS projekta prek standardnega ožičenja z ožičenjem z meto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External database:** Persist Joomla content in the project’s central RDBMS through the standard role-meta wiring."
msgstr "**Zunanja zbirka podatkov:** Persist Joomla vsebina osrednjega RDBMS projekta prek standardnega ožičenja z ožičenjem z meto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External deps:** an AT Protocol PDS (read/write of calendar records), the AT Protocol relay/firehose for aggregation, and optionally Meilisearch."
msgstr "**Zunanji deli:** Protokol AT PDS (branje/pisanje koledarskih zapisov), AT protokol rele/požar za združevanje, in neobvezno Meilisearch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External drift monitoring.** Addon freshness is checked by opt-in external tests under `tests/external/update/addons/`. These tests are warn-only, emit GitHub Actions warning annotations, and are excluded from `make test` in the same way as Docker image and repository-ref external update checks."
msgstr "**Nadzor zunanjega premika.** Svežost dodatka se preverja z zunanjimi preskusi z možnostjo opt-in v `tests/external/update/addons/`. Ti preskusi so opozorilno-samo, oddaja GitHub Actions opozorilne oznake, in so izključeni iz `make test` na enak način kot preverjanje slik Docker in skladišča-ref zunanjih posodobitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External/central PostgreSQL and Redis:** rails ``database.yml``, ``resque.yml``, ``cable.yml`` and the workhorse config are pre-rendered by Ansible and mounted read-only."
msgstr "**Zunanji/centralni PostgreSQL ter Redis:** tirnice ``database.yml``, ``resque.yml``, ``cable.yml`` In delavski konj konfig so vnaprej rendered z Ansible in montiran samo branje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External/central PostgreSQL and Redis:** rails `database.yml`, `resque.yml`, `cable.yml` and the workhorse config are pre-rendered by Ansible and mounted read-only."
msgstr "**Zunanji/centralni PostgreSQL ter Redis:** tirnice `database.yml`, `resque.yml`, `cable.yml` In delavski konj konfig so vnaprej rendered z Ansible in montiran samo branje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fail-closed on drift:** A tool contract whose hash no longer matches its pinned ``schema_sha256`` refuses to start."
msgstr "**Neuspešno zapiranje ob premiku:** Pogodba o orodju, katere hašiš se ne ujema več s svojo pripeto ``schema_sha256`` Noče začeti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
