# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fails gracefully** with an optional debug message if the Git repository is unreachable."
msgstr "**Neuspešno** z neobveznim razhroščevalnim sporočilom, če Git Skladišče je nedosegljivo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification**"
msgstr "**Uradno obvestilo o napaki**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification**   Triggers service on failure."
msgstr "**Uradno obvestilo o napaki** Sprožilna služba na napako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification:** Integrated with ``sys-ctl-alm-compose`` for alerting on failures."
msgstr "**Obvestilo o napaki:** Vgrajeni z ``sys-ctl-alm-compose`` za opozarjanje na napake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification:** Integrated with `sys-ctl-alm-compose` for alerting on failures."
msgstr "**Obvestilo o napaki:** Vgrajeni z `sys-ctl-alm-compose` za opozarjanje na napake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notifications:** Leverages **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** to push alerts when the script exits with an error."
msgstr "**Obvestila o odpovedi:** Sredstva **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** potisniti opozorila, ko skript konča z napako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fast Access**: Automatic cache management ensures lightning-fast load times."
msgstr "**Hiter dostop**: Avtomatsko upravljanje predpomnilnika zagotavlja bliskovito hitro obremenitev čas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Faster gates.** Per-host setup runs once per host instead of once per application, a role's volumes are answered from its own file instead of a whole-tree build, the Keycloak RBAC root group resolves once rather than once per app, the Playwright fixture copy the tree copy already made is dropped, logout helpers wait for a control instead of sleeping, and the OIDC login helper stops waiting out probes that cannot match. Onion timeouts scale by tor flavor instead of a flat multiplier, and every Playwright timeout has one source."
msgstr "**Hitrejša vrata.** Nastavitev na gostitelja teče enkrat na gostitelja namesto enkrat na aplikacijo, obseg vloge se odgovori iz lastne datoteke namesto celo drevo gradi, Keycloak RBAC root group reši enkrat in ne enkrat na aplikacijo, Playwrightov priključek kopira že izdelano kopijo drevesa, odjavite pomočnike, ki čakajo na nadzor, namesto da bi spali, in pomočnik za prijavo OIDC preneha čakati na sonde, ki se ne morejo ujemati. Čebula timeouts lestvica po okusu tor namesto ploskega multiplikatorja, in vsak Playwright timeout ima en vir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Feature:** Describe a capability."
msgstr "**Lastnosti:** Opišite sposobnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Features:**"
msgstr "**Značilnosti:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Chess Matches:** Challenge and play with others across the Fediverse."
msgstr "**Federirano Chess Vžigalice:** Izzivaj in se igraj z drugimi po vsej Fediverse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Communication:** Designed to operate within a federated network, enabling seamless sharing and interconnection with other PeerTube instances."
msgstr "**Federativno sporočilo:** izdelani za delovanje v federativnem omrežju, ki omogoča nemoteno souporabo in medsebojno povezovanje z drugimi PeerTube primere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Social Network:** Connects with other BookWyrm instances and ActivityPub platforms."
msgstr "**Federativna socialna mreža:** Povezuje z drugimi BookWyrm primeri in platforme ActivityPub."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated User Lookup:** Invitee search resolves through the Keycloak admin Web API, so any user federated from OpenLDAP into Keycloak becomes findable inside OpenTalk."
msgstr "**Federirano User Vpogled:** Povabi iskanje reši skozi Keycloak admin Web API, tako vsak uporabnik federated iz OpenLDAP v Keycloak se najde znotraj OpenTalk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federation Ready:** The rendered ``socialhome.toml`` publishes the instance’s external URL, which is what QR pairing hands to peer households."
msgstr "**Federacija pripravljena:** Prevedeno ``socialhome.toml`` objavi zunanji URL primera, kar je tisto, kar QR paru roke za vrstniška gospodinjstva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federation Ready:** The rendered `socialhome.toml` publishes the instance's external URL, which is what QR pairing hands to peer households."
msgstr "**Federacija pripravljena:** Prevedeno `socialhome.toml` objavi zunanji URL primera, kar je tisto, kar QR paru roke za vrstniška gospodinjstva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fediverse & ActivityPub Support** 🌐 Seamlessly integrate Mastodon, Peertube, Matrix and other ActivityPub apps out of the box."
msgstr "**Podpora Fediverse & ActivityPub** 🌐 Brezhibno povezovanje Mastodon, Peertube, Matrix in druge aplikacije ActivityPub iz škatle."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fediwall** is a self-hosted *media wall* for the Fediverse: it follows hashtags or accounts on Mastodon-compatible servers and shows the most recent public posts in a screen-filling, self-updating masonry grid."
msgstr "**Fediwall** je samogostnik *večpredstavnostni zid* za Fediverse: sledi oznakam ali računom Mastodon-compatible strežniki in prikazuje najnovejše javne objave v zaslon-polnjevanje, sam-updating zidarske mreže."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fewer “mysterious” errors:** Path, working-directory, and virtualenv issues that previously caused random CI or local failures are fixed."
msgstr "**Manj „skrivnostnih“ napak:** Poti, delovne-imenik, in virtualenv vprašanja, ki so prej povzročili naključno KI ali lokalne napake, so določene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**File creation via shell heredoc is FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NOT use `cat > file <<EOF … EOF` or any variant (`tee > file <<EOF`, `printf \"…\" > file`, `echo \"…\" > file` for multi-line content) to create or overwrite files. Use the **Write tool**. For editing an existing file, use **Edit**, not `sed -i`/`awk -i`. Reason: Write/Edit land structured in the transcript and diff; heredoc + redirect shapes also fall out of the auto-allow heuristic and drop into ask."
msgstr "**Ustvarjanje datotek preko shell heredoc je FORBIDEN. ⛔** NE UPORABLJAJTE `cat > file <<EOF … EOF` ali katera koli različica (`tee > file <<EOF`, `printf \"…\" > file`, `echo \"…\" > file` za večvrstične vsebine) ustvariti ali nadomestiti datoteke. Uporabi **Orodje za pisanje**. Za urejanje obstoječe datoteke uporabite **Uredi**, ne `sed -i`/`awk -i`. Razlog: Napiši / Edit zemljišča strukturirana v prepisu in diff; heredoc + preusmerite oblike tudi pade iz avto-dopustno hevristično in spusti v povpraševanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**File-based model list:** The model list is mounted as a read-only config file, with database-stored model entries turned off."
msgstr "**Datotečni seznam modelov:** Seznam modelov je priklopljen kot konfig datoteka samo za branje, z izklopljenimi vnosi modelov, shranjenimi v zbirki podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Filter by host**: ``journalctl -u NGINX -f | grep \"{{ inventory_hostname }}\"``"
msgstr "**Filtriraj po gostitelju**: ``journalctl -u NGINX -f | grep \"{{ inventory_hostname }}\"``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Filter by host**: `journalctl -u NGINX -f | grep \"{{ inventory_hostname }}\"`"
msgstr "**Filtriraj po gostitelju**: `journalctl -u NGINX -f | grep \"{{ inventory_hostname }}\"`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Filter** domains with or without your `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`"
msgstr "**Filter** domena z ali brez vaše `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Filter** domains with or without your ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY``"
msgstr "**Filter** domena z ali brez vaše ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice is dashboard-only.** The first implementation wires each agent through its web dashboard only. Chat-platform connectors (Telegram/Discord/Signal/...), which need operator-supplied bot tokens, are deferred to a follow-up and MUST NOT block the first green deploy."
msgstr "**Prvi kos je samo armaturna plošča.** Prvi implementacija žic vsak agent skozi svojo spletno armaturno ploščo samo. Priključki za govorno-platformno komunikacijo (Telegram/Discord/Signal/...), ki potrebujejo žetone za bot, dostavljene operaterju, se odložijo na nadaljnje ukrepanje in ne smejo blokirati prve zelene uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice.** The first end-to-end migration is `web-app-friendica` (`ldapauth`, bridges `ldap` to `svc-db-openldap`), because it already exercises the bridge rule and the service-flag enablement path."
msgstr "**Prvi kos.** Prva migracija med koncema je `web-app-friendica` (`ldapauth`, mostovi `ldap` do `svc-db-openldap`), ker že izvaja pravilo mostu in servisno-zastava omogoča pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice.** The first end-to-end slice is `web-app-baserow` (server) plus `web-app-openwebui` (client)."
msgstr "**Prvi kos.** Prvi kos od konca do konca je `web-app-baserow` (strežnik) plus `web-app-openwebui` (odjemalec)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First-party asset delivery:** Browsers never contact third-party CDNs directly; the deployment fetches and caches assets server-side."
msgstr "**Dostava sredstev prve stranke:** Brskalniki se nikoli ne obrnejo neposredno na CDN tretjih oseb; uvajanje prinaša in predpomnilnik sredstev na strežniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Five-distro coverage:** Supports the five default CI distros (Archlinux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, CentOS) without duplicated task code."
msgstr "**Pet-distro pokritost:** Podpira pet privzetih diskrov CI (Archlinux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, CentOS) brez podvojene kode opravila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed Moodle redeploy failures** by stripping the trailing slash from *CFG->wwwroot* to prevent health check issues"
msgstr "**Fiksna Moodle napake pri prerazporejanju** z odstranjevanjem poševnice *CFG->wwwroot* preprečevanje zdravstvenih pregledov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed**"
msgstr "**Fiksna**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed:** OpenProject migrations stabilized (simplified migration step; preload *CustomFieldContext* before *db:migrate*). Nextcloud LDAP config hardened and incompatible apps disabled in production. XWiki extension install hardened and one time seed ensures *Main.WebHome* exists. Matomo bootstrap fails fast on root cause. TLS and CA improvements (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* improved on Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* build prerequisites and header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* policy added. Backup and ops fixes (OnlyOffice no restart during backups; backup home and ACL tasks more reliable). Container setup hardened (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker readiness and SSH restart improvements)."
msgstr "**Fiksno:** Migracije OpenProject stabilizirane (poenostavljen migracijski korak; predobremenitev *Po meriFieldContext* Pred uporabo *db: migrat*). Nextcloud LDAP konfig utrjene in nezdružljive aplikacije onemogočene v proizvodnji. XWiki razširitev namestitev utrjena in enkratno seme zagotavlja *Main.WebHome* Obstaja. Matomo škornji hitro propade pri koreninah. Izboljšanje TLS in CA (enotno samopodpisan CA env za zdravstvene storitve, rezerve za CA zaupanje prevladajo ustvarjanje, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* Na Feodori. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* izdelati predpogoje in refaktorirati nazaj glavo; na uporabnika *password_update* dodana politika. Popravki varnostne kopije in operacij (OnlyOffice ni ponovnega zagona med backup; backup home in ACL naloge bolj zanesljiv). Nastavitev zabojnika utrjena (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo dodaj, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker pripravljenost in SSH ponovno izboljšave)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flavor selectable:** one setting switches between Code - OSS, VSCodium and the Microsoft build."
