# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fork identity** for the operator's CI-redeploy shortcuts: `INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT` (defaults to the local OS username) and `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_URL` (composed as `https://github.com/$INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT/$INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`), both set by handlers under `utils/env/handlers/infinito/` (`fork_account.py`, `fork_repository_url.py`). The fork repository name itself lives in `default.env` as `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`."
msgstr "**Identiteta vilic** za bližnjice CI-redeploy upravljavca: `INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT` (privzeto krajevno uporabniško ime OS) ter `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_URL` (sestavljena kot `https://github.com/$INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT/$INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`), ki jih določijo obdelovalci `utils/env/handlers/infinito/` (`fork_account.py`, `fork_repository_url.py`). Ime skladišča sam živi v `default.env` kot `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`."

