# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway-backed:** one provider entry, no vendor credentials on the machine."
msgstr "**Vrata s hrbtom:** En vpis ponudnika, brez poverilnic na napravi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway-routed models:** With the LiteLLM Gateway deployed, the agent's model base URL points at that gateway and authenticates with a per-consumer virtual key."
msgstr "**Modeli, usmerjeni v prehod:** Z LiteLLM Gateway aktivirane, izhodiščne točke modela agenta na tem portalu in avtentificira z virtualnim ključem na potrošnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
