msgid "**Global Theming**   The role injects a global CSS link for consistent theming across your site."
msgstr "**Globalna tema** Vloga injicira globalno CSS povezavo za dosledno tematiko na vaši spletni strani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Group revocation is not reliable, in both directions.** Open WebUI removes a user from a synced group only while the groups claim is non-empty, so a user who loses their last role keeps stale membership until a later login carries a non-empty claim. Conversely, a non-empty claim removes the user from *every* local group the claim does not name, including groups an administrator created by hand. Reconciling either from the deploy would mean a second writer for group membership, competing with the login-time sync and able to evict accounts the platform's own user list does not know about, so both are left to an external reconciler or an upstream fix."
msgstr "**V obeh smereh preklic skupine ni zanesljiv.** Open WebUI odstrani uporabnika iz sinhronizirane skupine le, ko skupina trdi, da ni prazna, zato uporabnik, ki izgubi svojo zadnjo vlogo, ohrani zastarelo članstvo, dokler kasnejša prijava ne nosi neprazne trditve. Nasprotno, neprazna trditev odstrani uporabnika iz *vsak* lokalna skupina, ki jo zahtevek ne imenuje, vključno s skupinami skrbnika, ustvarjenega ročno. Uskladitev ali iz razporeda bi pomenila drugega pisca za članstvo v skupini, ki bi tekmoval s sinhronizacijo prijavnega časa in bi lahko izselil račune, za katere ne ve seznam uporabnikov platforme, tako da sta oba prepuščena zunanjemu usklajevalcu ali gornji fiks."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Group revocation is not reliable, in both directions.** Open WebUI removes a user from a synced group only while the groups claim is non-empty, so a user who loses their last role keeps stale membership until a later login carries a non-empty claim. Conversely, a non-empty claim removes the user from *every* local group the claim does not name, including groups an administrator created by hand. Reconciling either from the deploy would mean a second writer for group membership, competing with the login-time sync and able to evict accounts the platform’s own user list does not know about, so both are left to an external reconciler or an upstream fix."
msgstr "**V obeh smereh preklic skupine ni zanesljiv.** Open WebUI odstrani uporabnika iz sinhronizirane skupine le, ko skupina trdi, da ni prazna, zato uporabnik, ki izgubi svojo zadnjo vlogo, ohrani zastarelo članstvo, dokler kasnejša prijava ne nosi neprazne trditve. Nasprotno, neprazna trditev odstrani uporabnika iz *vsak* lokalna skupina, ki jo zahtevek ne imenuje, vključno s skupinami skrbnika, ustvarjenega ročno. Sklenitev bodisi iz razporeda bi pomenila drugega pisca za članstvo v skupini, ki bi tekmoval s sinhronizacijo prijavnega časa in bi lahko izselil račune lastnega uporabniškega seznama platforme, za katere ne ve, zato sta oba prepuščena zunanjemu usklajevalcu ali gornji fiks."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Group-mapped RBAC:** The Keycloak ``groups`` claim binds to OpenBao external identity groups carrying the ``administrator``, ``operator`` and ``reader`` policies. Authenticating on its own grants only ``default``."
msgstr "**RBAC s skupino:** – Keycloak ``groups`` zahtevek je vezan na OpenBao zunanje skupine identitete, ki nosijo ``administrator``, ``operator`` ter ``reader`` politike. Overjanje samo lastnih nepovratnih sredstev ``default``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Group-mapped RBAC:** The Keycloak `groups` claim binds to OpenBao external identity groups carrying the `administrator`, `operator` and `reader` policies. Authenticating on its own grants only `default`."
msgstr "**RBAC s skupino:** – Keycloak `groups` zahtevek je vezan na OpenBao zunanje skupine identitete, ki nosijo `administrator`, `operator` ter `reader` politike. Overjanje samo lastnih nepovratnih sredstev `default`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Guest MCP probe:** A Playwright spec asserts that an unauthenticated request to the MCP endpoint is never answered with a 2xx."
msgstr "**Sonda MCP za goste:** Spec Playwright trdi, da se neavtentirana zahteva za končno točko MCP nikoli ne odgovori z 2xx."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Guest smoke test:** A Playwright spec asserts that the UI answers behind the proxy and gates unauthenticated visitors: it expects the handover to Keycloak when SSO is on and the UI's own password form when it is off."
msgstr "**Preskus dimljenja za goste:** Spec Playwright trdi, da UI odgovarja za proxy in vrata neodobrenih obiskovalcev: pričakuje predajo Keycloak ko je SSO vključen in obrazec za geslo UI, ko je izključen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Guest smoke test:** A Playwright spec asserts that the UI answers behind the proxy and gates unauthenticated visitors: it expects the handover to Keycloak when SSO is on and the UI’s own password form when it is off."
msgstr "**Preskus dimljenja za goste:** Spec Playwright trdi, da UI odgovarja za proxy in vrata neodobrenih obiskovalcev: pričakuje predajo Keycloak ko SSO je na in lastno geslo UI, ko je izključen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP API:** Simple, predictable HTTP API for application developers."
msgstr "**HTTP API:** Enostaven, predvidljiv HTTP API za razvijalce programov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP Status Verification:** HEAD-requests each domain and compares the response against per-domain expected codes."
msgstr "**Preverjanje stanja HTTP:** HEAD zahteva vsako domeno in primerja odziv s pričakovanimi kodami na domeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP admin and BOSH:** Expose the ejabberd web admin and BOSH/WebSocket bindings on the role's HTTP port for browser-based interaction."
msgstr "**HTTP admin in BOSH:** Razširite ejabberd web admin in BOSH/WebSocket vezave na HTTP vrata za interakcijo, ki temelji na brskalniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP admin and BOSH:** Expose the ejabberd web admin and BOSH/WebSocket bindings on the role’s HTTP port for browser-based interaction."
