# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP on the onion side** (TLS forced off for `.onion`), vhosts on `:80`, upstream gets `X-Forwarded-Proto: https`."
msgstr "**HTTP na čebulni strani** (TLS prisiljena za `.onion`), vhosts on `:80`, toku gre `X-Forwarded-Proto: https`."

