msgid "**HTTP on the onion side:** TLS is forced off for `.onion` (no Let's Encrypt possible); onion v3 crypto is the transport auth."
msgstr "**HTTP na čebulni strani:** TLS je prisiljen za `.onion` (Ne Šifrirajmo mogoče); čebula v3 Kripto je transportna oprema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP on the onion side:** TLS is forced off for ``.onion`` (no Let’s Encrypt possible); onion v3 crypto is the transport auth."
msgstr "**HTTP na čebulni strani:** TLS je prisiljen za ``.onion`` (ne Šifrirajmo mogoče); čebula v3 Kripto je transportna oprema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP serving** with MIME types, gzip compression, caching, and custom `NGINX.conf` templating."
msgstr "**HTTP serviranje** z MIME tipi, gzip stiskanje, caching, in po meri `NGINX.conf` Zavlačujem."

