# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handler Integration**"
msgstr "**Integracija upravljalnika**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handler Integration**   Restart handler ensures the Docker daemon is reloaded when necessary."
msgstr "**Integracija upravljalnika** Znova zaženi upravljalnik zagotavlja, da se demon Docker ponovno naloži, kadar je to potrebno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handler-safe**: automatically triggers an NGINX reload when templates change."
msgstr "**Varnost krmilnika**: samodejno sproži ponovno nalaganje NGINX ob spremembi predlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handlers for Runtime Control:** Automatically builds, sets up, or restarts containers based on handlers. Notify ``compose up`` when rendered files or the service spec changed; notify ``container recreate`` when only in-container or in-database state changed and the process must reload it — the latter force-recreates in compose mode and forces a task recreation in swarm mode, where ``docker stack deploy`` alone would leave the running task untouched."
msgstr "**Upravljalniki za nadzor časa delovanja:** Samodejno gradi, postavlja ali ponovno zaganja zabojnike na osnovi obdelovalcev. Obvesti ``compose up`` kadar se datoteke ali storitvena specifikacija spremenijo; ``container recreate`` če se je spremenilo samo stanje v zabojniku ali v podatkovni bazi in ga mora proces ponovno naložiti – ta sila ustvarja v komponiranem načinu in sili rekreacijo naloge v načinu roja, kjer ``docker stack deploy`` Sam bi pustil tekočo nalogo nedotaknjeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handlers for Runtime Control:** Automatically builds, sets up, or restarts containers based on handlers. Notify `compose up` when rendered files or the service spec changed; notify `container recreate` when only in-container or in-database state changed and the process must reload it — the latter force-recreates in compose mode and forces a task recreation in swarm mode, where `docker stack deploy` alone would leave the running task untouched."
msgstr "**Upravljalniki za nadzor časa delovanja:** Samodejno gradi, postavlja ali ponovno zaganja zabojnike na osnovi obdelovalcev. Obvesti `compose up` kadar se datoteke ali storitvena specifikacija spremenijo; `container recreate` če se je spremenilo samo stanje v zabojniku ali v podatkovni bazi in ga mora proces ponovno naložiti – ta sila ustvarja v komponiranem načinu in sili rekreacijo naloge v načinu roja, kjer `docker stack deploy` Sam bi pustil tekočo nalogo nedotaknjeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handlers:** Automatic reload/restart of services when definitions change."
msgstr "**krmilniki:** Samodejno ponovno nalaganje/ponovni zagon storitev ob spremembi definicij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handles sendmail compatibility:** Installs ``msmtp-mta`` where available, otherwise provisions a compatible sendmail symlink."
msgstr "**Ravnanja sendmail compatibility:** Namesti ``msmtp-mta`` če je na voljo, drugače določbe združljiv simlink sendmail."

# translated-by: libretranslate
