# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Hardened CA trust, health, and repair logic** with *soft-fail* behavior, improved diagnostics, and safe handling of one-shot containers"
msgstr "**Okrepljeno zaupanje CA, zdravje in logika popravila** z *nežna napaka* vedenje, izboljšana diagnostika in varno ravnanje z enostrelnimi zabojniki"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Hardware access is declared, not blanket-by-accident.** The role exposes a device allowlist (`/dev/*`, GPIO, I2C/SPI, video/camera, serial) that the operator sets; \"full access\" is an explicit, documented opt-in, not the silent default. The README documents the blast radius: the agent can do anything the granted devices allow."
msgstr "**Dostop do strojne opreme je prijavljen, ne po nesreči.** Vloga izpostavlja seznam pravic naprave (`/dev/*`, GPIO, I2C/SPI, video/kamera, serijski) ki jih določi operator; \"popoln dostop\" je ekspliciten, dokumentiran opt-in, ne pa tihi privzeti. Readme dokumentira polmer eksplozije: agent lahko naredi vse, kar dovoljujejo odobrene naprave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Headless Provisioning:** The administrator is seeded from the role's credential and the first-boot wizard is completed over the API, so no manual click-through is required."
msgstr "**Zagotavljanje brez glave:** Administrator je posejan iz poverilnice in čarodej za prvi zagon je končan nad API, tako da ni potreben ročni klik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Headless Provisioning:** The administrator is seeded from the role’s credential and the first-boot wizard is completed over the API, so no manual click-through is required."
