msgstr "**Opazovani dogodek na področju zdravja:** A ``/health`` končna točka poroča o stanju časa delovanja in podpira pregled stanja posode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Health-probe friendly:** Redirects the canonical CSS hostname to the CDN so HTTP probes return a valid response."
msgstr "**Zdravju prijazno:** Preusmerja ime gostitelja kanoničnega CSS na CDN, tako da HTTP sonde vrnejo veljaven odziv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Healthchecks & Networking:** Includes Docker healthchecks and network setup logic."
msgstr "**Pregledi stanja in mreženje:** Vključuje Docker pregled stanja in logiko nastavitev omrežja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Helpdesk ticketing:** Multi-channel agent and customer surface for email, web and (optionally) chat tickets."
msgstr "**Vstopnice za pomoč uporabnikom:** Multi-kanal agent in stranka površina za e-pošto, web in (neobvezno) Vstopnice za klepet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**High Performance and Scalability:** Designed to handle large-scale deployments with rapid lookup and authentication response times."
msgstr "**Visoka zmogljivost in razširjenost:** Zasnovan za upravljanje obsežnih aplikacij s hitrim iskanjem in preverjanjem pristnosti odzivnih časov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**High Performance:** Optimized for handling large-scale mailing lists and newsletters with rapid processing."
msgstr "**Visoka zmogljivost:** Optimizirano za rokovanje velikih poštnih seznamov in glasil s hitro obdelavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Highly Portable:** Works out-of-the-box with minimal variables."
msgstr "**Zelo prenosljiv:** Deluje izven okvirjev z minimalnimi spremenljivkami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Home Directory Configuration:** Sets secure permissions on the administrator’s home directory and script folder."
msgstr "**Nastavitev mape Domov:** Nastavi varna dovoljenja v skrbnikovem domačem imeniku in skriptni mapi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Home automation joins the platform.** *web-app-homeassistant* deploys the automation hub, exposes it as an MCP server so agents can drive it, persists the token it mints, and is reachable over tor. See [web-app-homeassistant](roles/web-app-homeassistant/README.md)."
msgstr "**Avtomatizacija doma se pridruži platformi.** *web-app-homeassistant* odpre vozlišče za avtomatizacijo, ga izpostavi kot strežnik MCP, tako da ga agenti lahko vozijo, vztraja žeton, ki ga kovnice, in je dosegljiv nad tor. Glej. [web-app-homeassistant](roles/web-app-homeassistant/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Host-mode front proxy:** The role renders an OpenResty virtual host that terminates TLS and forwards to the gateway's local HTTP port, without deploying a container."
msgstr "**Prednji posrednik stanja gostitelja:** Vloga prinaša OpenResty virtualni gostitelj, ki prekine TLS in se prenese v lokalna vrata HTTP portala, brez razporeditve zabojnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Host-mode front proxy:** The role renders an OpenResty virtual host that terminates TLS and forwards to the gateway’s local HTTP port, without deploying a container."
msgstr "**Prednji posrednik stanja gostitelja:** Vloga prinaša OpenResty virtualni gostitelj, ki prekine TLS in se prenese v lokalna vrata HTTP portala, brez razporeditve zabojnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Host:** `_acme-challenge.DOMAIN_PRIMARY`"
msgstr "**Gostitelj:** `_acme-challenge.DOMAIN_PRIMARY`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**How it works:**"
msgstr "**Kako deluje:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**How much each factor counts is a number in `services.yml`, between 0 and 1.** `services.litellm.router_weights` carries one weight per factor: `locality`, `cost` and `speed`. Each factor is scaled to 0..1 *inside the candidate set* before its weight applies, because the raw units do not compare - a per-token price is a millionth of a cent and a rate is tens of tokens per second. A factor whose value is identical across the set scores every route 1 and therefore decides nothing, rather than ranking on a rounding artefact."
msgstr "**Koliko vsak faktor šteje je število `services.yml`, med 0 ter 1.** `services.litellm.router_weights` nosi eno težo na faktor: `locality`, `cost` ter `speed`. Vsak dejavnik je povečan na 0..1 *znotraj nabora kandidatov* preden se uporabi njegova teža, ker se surove enote ne primerjajo - cena na žeton je milijontina centa, stopnja pa desetine žetonov na sekundo. Faktor, katerega vrednost je enaka v vseh nizih rezultatov vsake poti 1 in se zato ne odloči ničesar, namesto da bi se uvrstil na okrogel artefakt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**How to Migrate Mailboxes to a New Domain in Mailu** 📖"
msgstr "**Kako premakniti poštne predale na novo domeno v Mailu** 📖"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Hub**: [hub.infinito.nexus](https://hub.infinito.nexus) for tutorials, FAQs, and community support."
msgstr "**Središče**: [hub.infinito.nexus](https://hub.infinito.nexus) za vaje, FAQ in podporo skupnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Human Resources:** Manage employees, recruitment, expenses, leaves, and appraisals. Optional HR modules provide comprehensive workforce management."
msgstr "**Človeški viri:** Upravljajte zaposlene, zaposlovanje, stroške, dopuste in ocene. Neobvezni moduli HR zagotavljajo celovito upravljanje delovne sile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Icon Server:** Serves scalable SVG and PNG icons from the Simple Icons collection."
msgstr "**Strežnik ikon:** Služi scalable SVG in PNG ikon iz Simple Icons zbiranje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotency**"
msgstr "**Neporavnanost**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotency:** Ensures tasks are executed only once."
msgstr "**Nedolžnost:** Zagotavlja, da se naloge izvajajo samo enkrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotency:** Ensures tasks run only once per play by setting the ``run_once_sys_svc_sshd`` fact."
msgstr "**Nedolžnost:** Zagotavlja naloge, ki se izvajajo samo enkrat na igro z nastavljanjem ``run_once_sys_svc_sshd`` Dejstvo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotency:** Ensures tasks run only once per play by setting the `run_once_sys_svc_sshd` fact."
msgstr "**Nedolžnost:** Zagotavlja naloge, ki se izvajajo samo enkrat na igro z nastavljanjem `run_once_sys_svc_sshd` Dejstvo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotency:** Ensures that key generation and output tasks execute only once."
msgstr "**Nedolžnost:** Zagotavlja, da ključne proizvodnje in izhodne naloge izvajajo samo enkrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent Design**: Ensures that repeat runs of the playbook do not result in unwanted changes."
msgstr "**Nepovratno oblikovanje**: Zagotavlja, da ponavljanje poteka igre ne povzroči nezaželenih sprememb."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent Design:** Ensures safe re-runs and minimal unnecessary restarts."
msgstr "**Nepovratno oblikovanje:** Zagotavlja varne ponovitve in minimalne nepotrebne ponovne zagone."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent Execution:** Ensures Node.js is only installed when missing."
msgstr "**Nepovratna izvedba:** Zagotavlja Node.js je nameščen samo, kadar manjka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent Execution:** Ensures that Make is installed only once."
msgstr "**Nepovratna izvedba:** Zagotavlja, da je znamka nameščena samo enkrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent Execution:** Ensures that fakeroot is installed and remains up to date."
