msgstr "**Nastavitev navideznega**: opravila tečejo samo enkrat na gostitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent:** Re-running the deploy rebuilds the image and restarts containers cleanly without manual cleanup."
msgstr "**Idempotent:** Ponovna uporaba postavitve obnovi sliko in ponovno zažene vsebnike čisto brez ročnega čiščenja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent:** Skips ``npm ci`` if no folder is configured."
msgstr "**Idempotent:** Preskoči ``npm ci`` če mapa ni nastavljena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent:** Skips `npm ci` if no folder is configured."
msgstr "**Idempotent:** Preskoči `npm ci` če mapa ni nastavljena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent:** both tasks are no-ops once the module is present"
msgstr "**Idempotent:** obe nalogi sta brez uporabe, ko je modul prisoten"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Idempotent:** repeated plug-ins re-use existing snapshots and only sync deltas."
msgstr "**Idempotent:** večkratni vstavki ponovno uporabljajo obstoječe posnetke in sinhronizirajo le delte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated (i.e. the cost turns out to be unacceptable on a given host):** Re-add `~/.ssh` to `denyRead` in `.claude/settings.local.json` and handle git pushes from an external terminal, or adopt the SSH-agent-socket variant. Both options preserve the deny without breaking the global policy."
msgstr "**Ob kršitvi (tj. stroški se izkažejo za nesprejemljive za določenega gostitelja):** Ponovno dodan `~/.ssh` do `denyRead` v `.claude/settings.local.json` in ročaj git potiska z zunanjega terminala, ali sprejeti različico SSH-agent-socket. Obe možnosti ohranjata zanikanje, ne da bi kršili globalno politiko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** A compromised `Makefile` could chain multiple non-blocked destructive calls. The mitigation is the normal code-review process for pull requests."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** Ogrožena `Makefile` lahko veže več neblokiranih destruktivnih klicev. Blažitev je običajen postopek pregleda kode za zahteve po vlečenju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** A credential directory not listed in `denyRead` (for example `~/.azure`, `~/.doctl`, `~/.config/op`) is readable by the agent, and its contents can leak into the transcript. Contributors adding a new credential store MUST extend `denyRead` in the same commit."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** Imenik, ki ni naveden v `denyRead` (na primer `~/.azure`, `~/.doctl`, `~/.config/op`) ga agent lahko bere in njegova vsebina lahko izteka v prepis. Prispevalci, ki dodajajo novo zadolžnico MORAJO razširiti `denyRead` v isti zavezi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** An invocation of `docker exec <container> docker run --privileged -v /:/host ...` escapes the sandbox without triggering the ask-gate. There is no automated mitigation for this path. Protection relies on the shell-loop deny rule, the `sudo*` deny rule, and operator review of any command that contains nested `docker`."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** Poziv `docker exec <container> docker run --privileged -v /:/host ...` pobegne iz peskovnika, ne da bi sprožil vrata. Za to pot ni samodejne ublažitve. Zaščita je odvisna od pravila zanikanja školjke, `sudo*` zanikati pravilo in pregledati vse ukaze, ki vsebujejo ugnezdene `docker`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** Blind-approving `ask` prompts defeats the policy layer entirely. Operators MUST treat every `ask` prompt as a code-review checkpoint."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** Slepo odobravanje `ask` sproži popolnoma poraz političnega sloja. Operaterji MORAjo zdraviti vsakega `ask` sproži kot kontrolna točka za pregled kode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** Every Bash command runs unconfined on the host. Contributors MUST install the sandbox backend rather than weaken these flags. See the installer section in [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** Vsako Bashovo povelje teče brez konfinacije na gostitelja. Prispevalci MORAjo namestiti hrbtenico peskovnika, namesto da oslabijo te zastave. Glej razdelek monter v [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** If a contributor widens `allowWrite` (for example by adding `~/` or `/`), the broad allow rules become genuinely broad. Changes to `allowWrite` SHOULD be reviewed with the same scrutiny as a `deny` rule."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** Če se prispevek razširi `allowWrite` (na primer z dodajanjem `~/` ali `/`), široko dovoljeno pravila postanejo resnično široko. Spremembe `allowWrite` Treba bi bilo pregledati z enakim pregledom kot `deny` Pravilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** Running Claude Code on a host with production containers exposes those containers to disruption. A contributor on such a host SHOULD add read-only-narrowing `docker *` ask/deny entries in `.claude/settings.local.json` before starting a session."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** Teče Claude Code na gostitelju s proizvodnimi zabojniki te zabojnike izpostavi motnjam. Prispevek k takšnemu gostitelju bi moral dodati zožitev samo za branje `docker *` vprašaj/zavrni vnose v `.claude/settings.local.json` pred začetkom seje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** The attempt fails, the agent sees the error, and typically refactors within one retry. No host-level exposure."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** Poskus ne uspe, agent vidi napako in običajno refaktorira v enem poskusu. Ni izpostavljenosti gostitelju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** This is the baseline cost of allowing Docker at all. Contributors on hosts where this cost is unacceptable SHOULD disable Docker socket access locally by denying `/var/run/docker.sock` in `.claude/settings.local.json`, accepting that `docker` commands will stop working."
msgstr "**V primeru kršitve:** To je osnovni strošek, da se Dockerju sploh dovoli. Prispevalci na gostitelje, pri katerih je ta strošek nesprejemljiv, BI MORAli onemogočiti dostop do Docker vtičnice lokalno z zanikanjem `/var/run/docker.sock` v `.claude/settings.local.json`, da sprejme to `docker` Ukazi bodo prenehali delovati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Ignore List Support:** Optional variable to suppress network block reports from specific external domains."
msgstr "**Prezri podporo za seznam:** Neobvezna spremenljivka za zatiranje poročil o blokiranju omrežja iz določenih zunanjih domen."

