# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Image delivery and frontend dependencies.** Image references now resolve from *meta/services.yml* as their single source of truth, replacing unpinned *latest* tags. *web-app-bigbluebutton* pins its component images separately. *web-svc-cdn* builds and serves mirrored frontend packages through an internal one-shot service, with the package-cache CA trusted by build containers."
msgstr "**Dostava slik in odvisnosti za začetek.** Reference slik so zdaj razrešene *meta/services.yml* kot njihov edini vir resnice, ki nadomešča neomadeževane *zadnji* oznake. *web-app-bigbluebutton* zatiči slike sestavnih delov posebej. *web-svc-cdn* gradi in služi zrcalne pakete frontend skozi interno storitev z enim strelom, s paket-cache CA zaupa gradnjo zabojnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Image strategy.** No upstream Docker image is known to exist. Likely a **self-built image** from `files/` (à la [015 Moodle](README.md#archive) / the `web-app-bluesky` login-broker), pinned to a concrete upstream git ref — not `:latest`."
msgstr "**Slikovna strategija.** Ni znano, da bi slika zgoraj obstajala. Verjetno **samozgrajena slika** od `files/` (à la [015 Moodle](README.md#archive) / `web-app-bluesky` posrednik prijav), pritrjen na beton v zgornjem toku – ne `:latest`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Image tag** pinned to `2.5.4` for all three containers (single upstream tag)."
msgstr "**Oznaka slike** pripeta na `2.5.4` za vse tri vsebnike (enonadstropna oznaka)."

