# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Implementation precedence.** `native` > `plugin` > `sidecar` > `adapter` > `external`. A lower-precedence path is allowed only when the higher one is unavailable or cannot enforce the required security boundary, and the role README documents why. Adapter instances follow requirement 035 and are isolated per provider application or trust domain."
msgstr "**Prednost izvajanja.** `native` > `plugin` > `sidecar` > `adapter` > `external`. Pot nižje stopnje je dovoljena le, če višja ni na voljo ali ne more uveljaviti zahtevane varnostne meje, in vloga README dokumentira zakaj. Adapterji sledijo zahtevam 035 in so izolirani na aplikacijo ponudnika ali skrbniško domeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Improved CLI testability** by making imports patchable and forwarding command arguments unchanged"
msgstr "**Izboljšana testnost CLI** z omogočanjem, da se uvoz ne spremeni, in posredovanjem argumentov ukazov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Improved image mirroring workflows** with clearer separation of full and missing-only runs, branch-scoped concurrency, and deploy gating on successful mirroring"
msgstr "**Izboljšani delovni tokovi zrcaljenja slik** z jasnejšo ločitvijo polnih in manjkajočih tekov, vejo-skopsko soglasje, in razporediti gating na uspešno zrcaljenje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Improved user management:** A unified *user_key* model provides clearer and more robust user and permission handling across all roles."
msgstr "**Boljše upravljanje uporabnikov:** Enotna *user_key* model zagotavlja jasnejše in bolj robustne uporabnike in dovoljenja za ravnanje v vseh vlogah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**In-container configuration** follows [`svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml`](../../roles/svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml): a shell exec into the container where the credential arrives through a container env var, never through Ansible's process arguments, guarded by `no_log: \"{{ MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS | bool }}\"`."
msgstr "**Konfiguracija v vsebniku** sledi [`svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml`](../../roles/svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml): lupina exec v posodo, kjer credential prispe skozi posodo env var, nikoli skozi Ansible proces argumentov, varovana z `no_log: \"{{ MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS | bool }}\"`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Include Vars** in the specified order."
msgstr "**Vključi vare** v določenem vrstnem redu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Include** the ``sys-svc-webserver-core`` role to install and configure NGINX."
msgstr "**Vključi** o ``sys-svc-webserver-core`` vloga za namestitev in nastavitev NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Include** the `sys-svc-webserver-core` role to install and configure NGINX."
msgstr "**Vključi** o `sys-svc-webserver-core` vloga za namestitev in nastavitev NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Independent of docker:** Docker owns its own tables and never touches these, so no rule has to be inserted into a chain another component controls. The unit is only enabled, never started or restarted: on Debian its `ExecStop` flushes the entire ruleset, docker's tables included, and the fragments are loaded explicitly anyway."
msgstr "**Ne glede na docker:** Docker ima svoje mize in se jih nikoli ne dotika, zato ni treba v verigo vstaviti nobenega pravila, ki bi ga upravljala druga komponenta. Enota je samo omogočena, nikoli zagnana ali ponovno zagnana: na Debian je `ExecStop` splakne celoten pravilniket, Docker je tabele vključeni, in fragmenti so tako ali tako izrecno naloženi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Independent of docker:** Docker owns its own tables and never touches these, so no rule has to be inserted into a chain another component controls. The unit is only enabled, never started or restarted: on Debian its ``ExecStop`` flushes the entire ruleset, docker’s tables included, and the fragments are loaded explicitly anyway."
msgstr "**Ne glede na docker:** Docker ima svoje mize in se jih nikoli ne dotika, zato ni treba v verigo vstaviti nobenega pravila, ki bi ga upravljala druga komponenta. Enota je samo omogočena, nikoli zagnana ali ponovno zagnana: na Debian je ``ExecStop`` splakne celoten pravilniket, docker mize vključeni, in fragmenti so naloženi izrecno vseeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Infinito.Nexus** is an **automated, modular infrastructure framework** built on **Docker**, **Linux**, and **Ansible**, equally suited for cloud services, local server management, and desktop workstations. At its core lies a **web-based desktop with single sign-on**, backed by an **LDAP directory** and **OIDC**, granting **seamless access** to an almost limitless portfolio of self-hosted applications. It fully supports **ActivityPub applications** and is **Fediverse-compatible**, while integrated **monitoring**, **alerting**, **cleanup**, **self-healing**, **automated updates**, and **backup solutions** provide everything an organization needs to run at scale."
msgstr "**Infinito.Nexus** je **avtomatiziran, modularni infrastrukturni okvir** zgrajeni na **Docker**, **Linux**in **Anzible**, enako primeren za storitve v oblaku, upravljanje lokalnih strežnikov in namizne delovne postaje. V njenem jedru leži **spletno namizje z enim samim vpisom**, ki ga podpira **Mapa LDAP** ter **OIDC**, podeljevanje **nemoten dostop** skoraj neomejen portfelj samogostoljubnih aplikacij. V celoti podpira **Programi ActivityPub** in je **Združljivo s fediversom**, medtem ko je integriran **spremljanje**, **opozarjanje**, **čiščenje**, **samozdravljenje**, **avtomatizirane posodobitve**in **Varnostne rešitve** zagotoviti vse, kar organizacija potrebuje za delovanje v obsegu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inline data manipulation:** Filters are designed for inline use in Jinja2 expressions (in templates, tasks, vars, etc.)."
msgstr "**Notranja manipulacija podatkov:** Filtri so namenjeni za inline uporabo v Jinji2 izrazi (v predlogah, nalogah, varih itd.)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inner loop**: the edit-rerun cycle on `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` driven by `make compose-playwright role=<role>`, without a redeploy. On the act-swarm test cluster the equivalent is `make swarm-playwright role=<role>`, which first copies the working-tree's modified files into the node's frozen bootstrap copy (swarm nodes are not bind-mounted like compose)."
msgstr "**Notranja zanka**: cikel za urejanje in ponovitev `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` pogon `make compose-playwright role=<role>`, Brez preprodaje. Na preskusni skupini s toplim učinkom je enakovredno `make swarm-playwright role=<role>`, ki najprej kopirajo spremenjene datoteke delovnega drevesa v zmrznjene čevlje vozla (vozliči se ne vežejo kot komposti)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Input**"
msgstr "**Vhod**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Insecure HTTP (v1):** No TLS for the initial implementation; the registry runs on the manager's host network and binds only the address the manager hostname resolves to, so no other interface listens. Each swarm node trusts the manager's `<host>:5000` via `daemon.json.insecure-registries`."
msgstr "**Nezanesljiv HTTP (v1):** Za začetno izvedbo ni TLS; register teče po gostiteljskem omrežju upravitelja in veže le naslov, na katerega se odloči gostiteljsko ime upravitelja, zato noben drug vmesnik ne posluša. Vsak vozel zaupa upravitelju. `<host>:5000` preko `daemon.json.insecure-registries`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Insecure HTTP (v1):** No TLS for the initial implementation; the registry runs on the manager’s host network and binds only the address the manager hostname resolves to, so no other interface listens. Each swarm node trusts the manager’s ``<host>:5000`` via ``daemon.json.insecure-registries``."
msgstr "**Nezanesljiv HTTP (v1):** Za začetno izvedbo ni TLS; register teče na gostiteljskem omrežju upravitelja in veže le naslov, na katerega se odloči gostiteljsko ime upravitelja, zato noben drug vmesnik ne posluša. Vsak vozel v roju zaupa upravitelju ``<host>:5000`` preko ``daemon.json.insecure-registries``."

