# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolated development worktrees.** Parallel branches can use independent stacks while sharing one cache layer, preventing containers and network state from colliding. New *swarm-app-exec*, *swarm-diagnostic*, zombie-cluster and cross-mode roundtrip targets improve live inspection and Compose/Swarm parity testing."
msgstr "**Osamljena delovna drevesa.** Vzporedne veje lahko uporabljajo neodvisne skladovnice, medtem ko delijo eno plast predpomnilnika, kar preprečuje trčenje zabojnikov in stanja omrežja. Novo *roy-app-exec*, *roj-diagnostika*, zombi-gruster in navzkrižno način okrogla pot ciljev izboljšati v živo pregled in Sestavite / Toplo paritetno testiranje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolating runtime:** The compose service is pinned to Kata Containers when hardware virtualization and the Kata shim are present, and to gVisor otherwise."
msgstr "**Izolacijski čas delovanja:** Komponenta storitev je vezana na Kata Containers, ko strojna virtualizacija in Kata šim so prisotni, in gVisor drugače."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolating runtime:** The compose service is pinned to Kata Containers where `/dev/kvm` and the Kata shim are available, and to gVisor otherwise."
msgstr "**Izolacijski čas delovanja:** Komponenta je pripeta na Kata Containers, kjer `/dev/kvm` in Kata šim so na voljo, in da gVisor drugače."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolating runtime:** The compose service is pinned to Kata Containers where ``/dev/kvm`` and the Kata shim are available, and to gVisor otherwise."
msgstr "**Izolacijski čas delovanja:** Komponenta je pripeta na Kata Containers, kjer ``/dev/kvm`` in Kata šim so na voljo, in da gVisor drugače."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolation is gVisor on top of in-app sandboxing; Firecracker is out of reach on this engine.** Each agent app runs under `runtime: runsc`, a userspace guest kernel that intercepts syscalls before they reach the host, so untrusted model-generated code stays kernel-isolated even if the app's own sandbox is bypassed. No custom VMM, jailer wiring, or bespoke rootfs pipeline. E2B/Beam noted as alternatives in the role README but not adopted."
msgstr "**Izolacija je gVisor na vrhu in-app peskovnika; Firecracker je izven dosega na tem motorju.** Aplikacija vsakega agenta teče pod `runtime: runsc`, uporabniški prostor gost jedro, ki prestreže syscalles preden pridejo do gostitelja , tako da nezaupen model generirane kode ostane jedra izolirana tudi, če je aplikacija lastno peskovnik je obšla . Ni po meri VMM, ječar napeljavo, ali bespoke roftfs cevovod. E2B/Beam označen kot alternativa v vlogi README, vendar ni bil sprejet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolation:** Every agent runs in its own container or single-replica service under the isolating runtime, with its own volume, its own network whose only other member is the broker, and its own bearer key; an agent that would start under ``runc`` is stopped and refused."
msgstr "**Izolacija:** Vsak agent deluje v svoji kontejnerski ali enoreplika storitev pod izoliranim časom delovanja, z lastno prostornino, svojo mrežo, katere edini član je posrednik, in svoj lastni ključ; agent, ki bi se začel pod ``runc`` se ustavi in zavrne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolation:** Every agent runs in its own container or single-replica service under the isolating runtime, with its own volume, its own network whose only other member is the broker, and its own bearer key; an agent that would start under `runc` is stopped and refused."
msgstr "**Izolacija:** Vsak agent deluje v svoji kontejnerski ali enoreplika storitev pod izoliranim časom delovanja, z lastno prostornino, svojo mrežo, katere edini član je posrednik, in svoj lastni ključ; agent, ki bi se začel pod `runc` se ustavi in zavrne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-format
msgid "**It is part of a row's identity.** The glyph is in the job label, the value in the artifact name, the column in the plan table, and `:arm64` narrows a selection token the way `%distro` and `/filesystem` do. A retrigger replays it, unlike the filesystem: the title states the machine the job actually ran on, not a preference it could have fallen back from."
msgstr "**To je del identitete vrste.** Glif je na oznaki delovnega mesta, vrednost v imenu artefakta, stolpec v tabeli načrta, in `:arm64` zoži izbor žeton poti `%distro` ter `/filesystem` Naredi. Retrigger ga ponovno predvaja, za razliko od datotečnega sistema: naslov navaja stroj, na katerem je delo dejansko potekalo, ne pa preferenca, iz katere bi lahko padel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**It rotates on the row's position directly, not as a third odometer digit.** The distro/filesystem odometer exists because two pools of equal length walked on the same index cover only `n` of `n x m` pairs. Two architectures against five distros are coprime, and against the fifteen distro/filesystem positions too, so the fast rotation reaches every pairing anyway. Making it the slowest digit would be actively wrong: a role with four rows would sit on one architecture forever, and the axis exists precisely so a role's own variants split over both."
msgstr "**Vrti se na položaju vrste neposredno, ne pa kot tretja števka števke števke.** Distro/filesystem števec obstaja, ker sta dva bazena enake dolžine hodila samo po istem indeksnem pokrovu `n` o `n x m` par. Dve arhitekturi proti petim distrojem sta coprime, proti petnajstim distro/filesystem pozicijam pa tudi, tako da hitra rotacija vseeno doseže vsako par. Narediti jo najpočasnejšo števko bi bilo aktivno napačno: vloga s štirimi vrsticami bi za vedno sedela na eni arhitekturi, os pa obstaja ravno tako, da se lastne variante vloge delijo na obe."

