msgstr "**Skupina Keycloak → Kartiranje vlog Frappe** — tri stopnje: `roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator` → `System Manager`, `roles/web-app-erpnext/manager` → `{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User`, privzeto → `Customer`. Sklenjeno pri vsaki prijavi z kljuko, ki bere trdovraten zemljevid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform’s OIDC endpoints from ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` and ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Sign in at ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` carries the administrator’s username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in ``litellm_usertable`` and refuses beyond that without ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."
msgstr "**Vpis v Keycloak:** Z Keycloak pri razporeditvi, vloga določa ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` in LiteLLM Gateway prebere končne točke OIDC platforme ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` ter ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Vpišite se na ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` nosi ime administratorja. LiteLLM služi SSO za do pet računov v ``litellm_usertable`` in zavrne več kot to brez ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets `services.sso.flavor: oidc` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform's OIDC endpoints from `GENERIC_CLIENT_ID`, `GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT`, `GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT` and `GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT`. Sign in at `/sso/key/generate`; `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` carries the administrator's username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in `litellm_usertable` and refuses beyond that without `LITELLM_LICENSE`."
msgstr "**Vpis v Keycloak:** Z Keycloak pri razporeditvi, vloga določa `services.sso.flavor: oidc` in LiteLLM Gateway prebere končne točke OIDC platforme `GENERIC_CLIENT_ID`, `GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT`, `GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT` ter `GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT`. Vpišite se na `/sso/key/generate`; `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` nosi administratorjevo uporabniško ime. LiteLLM služi SSO za do pet računov v `litellm_usertable` in zavrne več kot to brez `LITELLM_LICENSE`."

