# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP federation** — when ``svc-db-openldap`` is present, Frappe’s LDAP Settings doctype is auto-configured. End-to-end LDAP login (auto-create Frappe user from LDAP bind) is deferred to a follow-up requirement; v1 ships the Settings doctype only. The LDAP-login Playwright specs are intentionally absent for v1."
msgstr "**Zveza LDAP** — ko ``svc-db-openldap`` je prisoten, Frappe's LDAP Settings doctype je avto-konfiguriran. Prijava LDAP na koncu (Samodejno ustvari uporabnika Frappe iz vezave LDAP) se odloži na zahtevo po spremljanju; v1 pošilja samo doctype Nastavitve. LDAP-login Playwright specifikacije so namerno manjka v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
