# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lexicon source of truth for geo/time.** Mobilizon uses PostGIS + its own TZ handling; the lexicon calendar event carries its own location/time fields. The bridge needs an explicit, documented field mapping (start/end/tz/location/title/description/url) — incomplete mapping = silent data loss."
msgstr "**Leksikon vir resnice za geo/čas.** Mobilizon uporablja PostGIS + lastno TZ ravnanje; leksikon koledarski dogodek nosi lastna lokacijska/časovna polja. Most potrebuje eksplicitno dokumentirano kartiranje polj (start/end/tz/location/title/description/url) — nepopolno kartiranje = tiha izguba podatkov."

