msgstr "**Promocije življenjskega cikla:** *web-app-checkmk*, *web-app-jellyfin*, *web-app-n8n*, *svc-registry-docker* ter *svc-registry-cache* Predhodno *beta*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lifecycle settings:** ``agents.idle_stop``, ``agents.idle_minutes``, ``agents.max_running``, ``agents.start_timeout`` and ``agents.access_cache_seconds`` in ``meta/services.yml`` control idle stops, the running-agent bound, the start wait and the membership cache; an inventory overrides them under ``applications.svc-ai-agent-broker.services.agent-broker.agents``. An agent serving a request is never swept."
msgstr "**Nastavitve življenjskega cikla:** ``agents.idle_stop``, ``agents.idle_minutes``, ``agents.max_running``, ``agents.start_timeout`` ter ``agents.access_cache_seconds`` v ``meta/services.yml`` nadzor nedejavnosti ustavi, teče-agent vezan, začetek čaka in članstvo predpomnilnik; inventar jih prevlada pod ``applications.svc-ai-agent-broker.services.agent-broker.agents``. Agent, ki je izpolnil zahtevo, ni nikoli izginil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lifecycle settings:** `agents.idle_stop`, `agents.idle_minutes`, `agents.max_running`, `agents.start_timeout` and `agents.access_cache_seconds` in `meta/services.yml` control idle stops, the running-agent bound, the start wait and the membership cache; an inventory overrides them under `applications.svc-ai-agent-broker.services.agent-broker.agents`. An agent serving a request is never swept."
msgstr "**Nastavitve življenjskega cikla:** `agents.idle_stop`, `agents.idle_minutes`, `agents.max_running`, `agents.start_timeout` ter `agents.access_cache_seconds` v `meta/services.yml` nadzor nedejavnosti ustavi, teče-agent vezan, začetek čaka in članstvo predpomnilnik; inventar jih prevlada pod `applications.svc-ai-agent-broker.services.agent-broker.agents`. Agent, ki je izpolnil zahtevo, ni nikoli izginil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lightweight Service:** Built with Node.js and PostgreSQL for efficiency."
msgstr "**Lahka storitev:** Zgrajena z Node.js ter PostgreSQL za učinkovitost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lightweight and Fast:** Enjoy a minimal yet efficient Git service tailored for development teams."
msgstr "**Lahek in hiter:** Uživajte v minimalnem, a učinkovitem Git storitev prilagojena za razvojne ekipe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lint reuses the suppression model.** New MCP lint rules live under [`tests/lint/ansible/services/`](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/) and honour the existing `# nocheck:` marker convention (see [suppression docs](../contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."
msgstr "**Lint ponovno uporabi model za zatiranje.** Nova pravila MCP lint živijo [`tests/lint/ansible/services/`](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/) in spoštujejo obstoječe `# nocheck:` Oznaka (glej [zatiranje doks](../contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lints that fail closed.** Five properties that used to pass silently now fail. The PHP and Ruby that roles ship are syntax-checked, and so are shell scripts that ship as Jinja templates. *sys-service* owns every systemd unit a role installs. Healthcheck timings are judged against what the base image was measured to hold, a variable-free healthcheck belongs in *meta/services.yml*, an unenforceable NFS state layout fails at author time, a sandboxed role cannot be pinned to the manager, credentials are kept out of volumes declared non-secret, *no_log* is required on every task carrying one and forbidden in the test roles, and a JavaScript default for an unset environment variable is rejected."
msgstr "**Linti, ki propadejo, so zaprti.** Pet lastnosti, ki so minule prej molče, zdaj propade. PHP in Ruby, ki vloge ladja so sintaksi-preverjeni, in tako so lupinske skripte, ki ladja kot Jinja predloge. *sys-service* ima v lasti vsako sistemsko enoto, ki jo vgrajuje. Časovni okviri zdravstvenih pregledov so ocenjeni glede na to, kaj je bila osnovna slika izmerjena za držanje, nespremenljiv zdravstveni pregled spada v *meta/services.yml*, neuveljavljena postavitev stanja NFS ne uspe v času avtorja, s peskom obdana vloga ne more biti vezana na upravitelja, poverilnice se hranijo izven zvezkov, razglašenih za netajne, *no_log* se zahteva pri vsaki nalogi, ki nosi eno in prepovedano v testnih vlogah, privzeto JavaScript za nenastavljeno spremenljivko okolja pa se zavrne."

