# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**LittleJS** is a self-hosted web application that bundles the LittleJS engine, its official examples, and a minimal Infinito.Nexus launcher UI. It provides a simple, tile-based overview of demos and games, allowing you to quickly explore LittleJS examples directly in your browser."
msgstr "**Mali JS** je samogostoljubni spletni program, ki združuje LittleJS motor, njegovi uradni primeri, in minimalno Infinito.Nexus lanser UI. Zagotavlja preprost, na ploščicah temelječ pregled demo posnetkov in iger, kar vam omogoča hitro raziskovanje LittleJS primeri neposredno v vašem brskalniku."

