msgstr "**Lokalna uporaba**: predpona vsakih `make compose-deploy` zastopanje z `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP=true`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Local model execution:** Run popular open models (chat, code, embeddings) on your own hardware."
msgstr "**Izvedba lokalnega modela:** Zaženi priljubljene odprte modele (klepet, koda, vgrajevanje) s svojo strojno opremo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Local models reach the gateway again.** Upstream re-pushed the *svc-ai-lmstudio* CPU image with a server that listens on loopback only, so the role stayed green while litellm could not connect and the AI features of Mattermost, Matrix, xWiki, Moodle and Zammad failed their warm-up. The server binds the container network again and stays unpublished. The model preload now waits until the daemon has finished starting, so a slow host no longer ends up with a daemon that fails every later model load, and the readiness probe is capped per attempt so a silent peer cannot hang it. See [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."
msgstr "**Lokalni modeli spet pridejo do vrat.** Navzgor je ponovno *svc-ai-lmstudio* CPU slika s strežnikom, ki posluša samo na zankaback, tako je vloga ostala zelena, medtem ko litelm ni mogel povezati in AI značilnosti Mattermost, MatrixxWiki, Moodle ter Zammad Niso se ogreli. Strežnik zopet veže kontejnersko omrežje in ostane neobjavljen. Model preload zdaj čaka, da se demon konča z zagonom, tako da počasen gostitelj ne konča več z demonom, ki spodleti vsaki kasnejši modelni obremenitvi, sonda za pripravljenost pa je na poskus omejena, tako da jo tihi vrstnik ne more obesiti. Glej. [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Local-first vault:** Keeps the password database on the workstation, with no mandatory cloud sync."
msgstr "**Krajevni prvi trezor:** Ohrani bazo gesel na delovni postaji, brez obvezne sinhronizacije oblakov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
