msgstr "**Ustvarjanje krajev**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Localhost-bound host port.** Bound on `127.0.0.1` and only reachable through the front-proxy / SSH tunnels. The OS-level binding namespace is shared across all roles, so `local` values MUST be unique across the whole repo."
msgstr "**Vrata gostitelja, vezana na lokalnega gostitelja.** Vstavi `127.0.0.1` in dosegljiva samo skozi predore spredaj in SSH. Vezavni imenski prostor OS se deli v vseh vlogah. `local` vrednosti morajo biti edinstvene v celotnem repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Location Change Notification**"
msgstr "**Obvestilo o spremembi lokacije**"

