# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP Server:** Serve four read-only Baserow tools to AI clients through a bearer-guarded adapter sidecar that fronts the native SSE endpoint."
msgstr "**Strežnik MCP:** Služi samo štirim bralcem Baserow orodja za AI odjemalce prek nosilno varovanega adapterja, ki predstavlja domači SSE končni cilj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**MCP client contract:** With Home Assistant deployed, the role declares the MCP client side of the platform contract as an internal streamable-HTTP client with a read-only tool policy. Every discovered server is rendered into ``config.yaml`` under ``mcp_servers`` in the agent’s ``HERMES_HOME``, with the bearer referenced as ``${env:<ROLE>_MCP_TOKEN}`` so the config file carries no secret. The deploy then runs ``hermes mcp test`` per server and fails when one does not answer."
msgstr "**Pogodba za stranke MCP:** Z Home Assistant ponujena, vloga razglasi stran odjemalca MCP iz pogodbe o platformi kot interni pretočni odjemalec HTTP s politiko orodja samo za branje. Vsak najden strežnik je preveden v ``config.yaml`` pod ``mcp_servers`` v zastopniku ``HERMES_HOME``, pri čemer je nosilec naveden kot ``${env:<ROLE>_MCP_TOKEN}`` Torej konfig datoteka ne nosi skrivnosti. Postavitev nato teče ``hermes mcp test`` na strežnik in ne uspe, če se ne oglasite."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**MCP client contract:** With Home Assistant deployed, the role declares the MCP client side of the platform contract as an internal streamable-HTTP client with a read-only tool policy. Every discovered server is rendered into `config.yaml` under `mcp_servers` in the agent's `HERMES_HOME`, with the bearer referenced as `${env:<ROLE>_MCP_TOKEN}` so the config file carries no secret. The deploy then runs `hermes mcp test` per server and fails when one does not answer."
