msgstr "**Pogodba strežnika MCP:** Razglasi vgrajen strežnik MCP na `/api/mcp` pretočni HTTP kot notranji, prinosno-prinosno-prinosno-pripravljeni opazovani dogodek in ustvarja znak, ki ga predstavljajo stranke MCP. Dodajanje MCP Server integracija sama ostane a Home Assistant Na vlaku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Declares the built-in MCP server at ``/api/mcp`` over streamable HTTP as an internal, bearer-token-authenticated endpoint, and generates the token that MCP clients present. Adding the MCP Server integration itself stays a Home Assistant onboarding step."
msgstr "**Pogodba strežnika MCP:** Razglasi vgrajen strežnik MCP na ``/api/mcp`` pretočni HTTP kot notranji, prinosno-prinosno-prinosno-pripravljeni opazovani dogodek in ustvarja znak, ki ga predstavljajo stranke MCP. Dodajanje MCP Server integracija sama ostane a Home Assistant Na vlaku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Fronts GitLab's built-in MCP server with the repository-owned adapter. Clients reach `/mcp` on the `gitlabmcp` sidecar; the adapter alone talks to `/api/v4/mcp` upstream, so only the contracted tools are reachable."
msgstr "**Pogodba strežnika MCP:** Spredaj GitLabVgrajen MCP strežnik z adapterjem v lasti skladišča. Stranke dosežejo `/mcp` o `gitlabmcp` stranska prikolica; samo adapter govori z `/api/v4/mcp` v smeri proti toku, tako da so dosegljiva samo pogodbena orodja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Fronts GitLab’s built-in MCP server with the repository-owned adapter. Clients reach ``/mcp`` on the ``gitlabmcp`` sidecar; the adapter alone talks to ``/api/v4/mcp`` upstream, so only the contracted tools are reachable."
msgstr "**Pogodba strežnika MCP:** Spredaj GitLabVgrajen strežnik MCP z adapterjem v lasti skladišča. Stranke dosežejo ``/mcp`` o ``gitlabmcp`` stranska prikolica; samo adapter govori z ``/api/v4/mcp`` v smeri proti toku, tako da so dosegljiva samo pogodbena orodja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server surface:** Serve the ``mcp-server`` plugin’s streamable-HTTP endpoint on the container network, guarded by an administrator API token and limited to the read-only tool default."
msgstr "**Površina strežnika MCP:** Služiti ``mcp-server`` Pretočna končna točka vstavka na kontejnerskem omrežju, ki jo varuje skrbnik API žeton in omejen na privzeto orodje samo za branje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server surface:** Serve the `mcp-server` plugin's streamable-HTTP endpoint on the container network, guarded by an administrator API token and limited to the read-only tool default."
msgstr "**Površina strežnika MCP:** Služiti `mcp-server` Pretočni končni rezultat vstavka na kontejnerskem omrežju, ki ga varuje administrator API žeton in omejen na privzeto orodje samo za branje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP state is a variant axis.** Roles that gain an MCP surface MUST express the enabled/disabled split through `meta/variants.yml` so CI matrix runs cover both states."
msgstr "**MCP stanje je variantna os.** Vloge, ki pridobijo površino MCP, MORAJO izraziti omogočeno/onemogočeno razdelitev skozi `meta/variants.yml` Torej CI matrika poteka v obeh državah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP surface is the native `mcp_server` integration under the [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) contract.** The role's `meta/services.yml` declares `mcp` with `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, served under the role's canonical origin per 025. No third-party MCP add-on is used when the native integration covers the need."
msgstr "**MCP površina je avtohtona `mcp_server` vključevanje v okviru [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) pogodba.** Vloga je. `meta/services.yml` razglasi `mcp` z `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, ki služi pod kanoničnim izvorom vloge per 025. Nobena tretja stranka MCP dodatek se ne uporablja, ko je domača integracija pokriva potrebo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MTU Configuration:** Deploys a template-based script to set the MTU on all defined internet interfaces."
msgstr "**Nastavitev MTU:** Za nastavitev MTU na vseh opredeljenih internetnih vmesnikih aktivira skript, ki temelji na predlogah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Machine identity:** AppRole is configured independently of human login, so services and automation use their own identities and short-lived tokens instead of a shared administrator token."
msgstr "**Identifikacija stroja:** AppRole je konfiguriran neodvisno od človeške prijave, zato storitve in avtomatizacija uporabljajo lastne identitete in kratkotrajne žetone namesto deljenega administratorja žetona."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Made Snipe-IT admin bootstrap idempotent** and treated known *users_groups* duplicate constraint errors as non-fatal while keeping strict failure handling for other cases"
msgstr "**Made Snipe-IT admin škornjitrap idempotent** in zdravljenih *users_groups* podvojene napake omejitev kot neusodne, hkrati pa strogo ravnanje z napakami za druge primere"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Magento (Adobe Commerce Open Source)** is a powerful, extensible e-commerce platform built with PHP. It supports multi-store setups, advanced catalog management, promotions, checkout flows, and a rich extension ecosystem."
msgstr "**Magento (Adobe Commerce Open Source)** je močna, obsežna platforma za e-trgovanje, zgrajena s PHP. Podpira več-trgovinske nastavitve, napredno upravljanje katalogov, promocije, odjavne tokove in bogat razširjen ekosistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mail-to-ticket:** When ``web-app-mailu`` is present, the ``helpdesk`` mailbox is auto-provisioned and Zammad polls it to create tickets from incoming mail."
msgstr "**Poštna karta:** Kdaj ``web-app-mailu`` je prisoten, ``helpdesk`` poštni predal je zagotovljen samodejno in Zammad Voli za vstopnice iz dohodne pošte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mail-to-ticket:** When `web-app-mailu` is present, the `helpdesk` mailbox is auto-provisioned and Zammad polls it to create tickets from incoming mail."
msgstr "**Poštna karta:** Kdaj `web-app-mailu` je prisoten, `helpdesk` poštni predal je zagotovljen samodejno in Zammad Voli za vstopnice iz dohodne pošte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mailu-backed delivery** (with authentication tokens), or"
msgstr "**Mailu-backed dostava** (z žetoni za avtentikacijo), ali"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Maintenance & Administration Tools:** Built-in CLI and web-app-based tools to clear caches, manage the database, and monitor application health."
msgstr "**Orodja za vzdrževanje in upravljanje:** Vgrajeni CLI in spletno-app-based orodja za čiščenje predpomnilnikov, upravljanje baze podatkov, in spremljanje zdravja aplikacij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Maintenance & Cleanup:** Reduced Let’s Encrypt renewal frequency to avoid rate limits, removed deprecated logs and variables, applied broad refactorings, and merged the Matomo autosetup feature."
msgstr "**Vzdrževanje in čiščenje:** Zmanjšamo Šifrirajmo pogostost obnavljanja, da bi se izognili omejitvam stopnje, odstranimo depreciirane dnevnike in spremenljivke, uporabimo široke refaktorje in združimo Matomo funkcija samodejnega nastavitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Major Changes**"
msgstr "**Velike spremembe**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manage Inventories Securely** Your inventories for running Infinito.Nexus MUST be managed in a separate repository and secured with tools such as [Ansible Vault](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Sensitive credentials MUST NEVER be stored in plaintext; use a password file to secure these details."
msgstr "**Varno upravljanje zalog** Vaše zaloge za delovanje Infinito.Nexus JE TREBA upravljati v ločenem skladišču in ga zavarovati z orodji, kot so [Anzibilni trezor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Občutljive poverilnice NE SMEJO NIKOLI biti shranjene v navadnem besedilu; uporabite geslo datoteko za zaščito teh podrobnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Managed credentials:** The gateway master key and the admin UI password are generated and kept as role credentials, and the admin UI username is the platform administrator name."
msgstr "**Upravljanje poverilnic:** Glavni ključ portala in geslo admin UI sta ustvarjena in hranjena kot poverilnica vlog, uporabniško ime admin UI pa je ime skrbnika platforme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager Defaults:** Deploys custom timeouts via ``timeouts.conf``."
msgstr "**Privzeti upravitelj:** Zakasnitev po meri sproži preko ``timeouts.conf``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager Defaults:** Deploys custom timeouts via `timeouts.conf`."
msgstr "**Privzeti upravitelj:** Zakasnitev po meri sproži preko `timeouts.conf`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager-pinned** central on-disk state stays node-local (never on NFS) in swarm."
msgstr "**Upravitelj** Centralno stanje on-disk ostaja vozlišče-lokalno (nikoli na NFS) v roj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager-pinned, stateful:** Single instance per cluster; bypasses swarm task lifecycle so its volume cannot end up on a worker."
msgstr "**Manager-podloga, samozavestno:** En primerek na grozd; obide roj opravilni življenjski cikel, tako da njegov volumen ne more končati na delavca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manual Update and Log Access**: Provides guidance for viewing logs, accessing containers, and performing manual updates."
msgstr "**Ročno posodabljanje in dostop do dnevnika**: Zagotavlja navodila za ogled dnevnikov, dostop do zabojnikov, in izvajanje ročnih posodobitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MariaDB data** stays local on the manager node via [svc-db-mariadb](../svc-db-mariadb/) pinning. NFS for the DB data directory is intentionally out of scope for v1 (locking / `fsync` semantics). See 023's Future Extensions."
msgstr "**Podatki MariaDB** ostane krajevno na upravljalnem vozlišču preko [svc-db-mariadb](../svc-db-mariadb/) Pinning. NFS za podatkovno mapo DB je namerno izven področja uporabe za v1 (zaklepanje/ `fsync` semantika). Glej 023Bodoče razširitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MariaDB data** stays local on the manager node via `svc-db-mariadb <../svc-db-mariadb/>`__ pinning. NFS for the DB data directory is intentionally out of scope for v1 (locking / ``fsync`` semantics). See 023’s Future Extensions."
msgstr "**Podatki MariaDB** ostane krajevno na upravljalnem vozlišču preko `svc-db-mariadb <../svc-db-mariadb/>`__ Pinning. NFS za podatkovno mapo DB je namerno izven področja uporabe za v1 (zaklepanje/ ``fsync`` semantika). Glej 023» Bodoče razširitve. «."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Marker role:** Carries no tasks; selects which ``svc-swarm-node`` member runs the manager-init flow."
msgstr "**Marker vloga:** Ne opravlja nalog; izbere, katera ``svc-swarm-node`` Član vodi manager-init tok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Marker role:** Carries no tasks; selects which `svc-swarm-node` member runs the manager-init flow."
msgstr "**Marker vloga:** Ne opravlja nalog; izbere, katera `svc-swarm-node` Član vodi manager-init tok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Marketing & Automation:** Create email campaigns, marketing automation workflows, and social media management integrated with CRM data."
msgstr "**Trženje in avtomatizacija:** Ustvarite e-poštne kampanje, potek dela za avtomatizacijo trženja in upravljanje družbenih medijev, integrirano s podatki CRM."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Matomo Analytics & Global CSS:** Built-in support for analytics and unified styling."
msgstr "**Matomo Analytics & Global CSS:** Vgrajena podpora za analitiko in enotno styling."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Matomo and Prometheus aware:** Toggles tracker and metrics integration based on the presence of the corresponding application roles."
msgstr "**Matomo in Prometheus zavest:** Preklopi integracijo sledilnika in metrike glede na prisotnost ustreznih vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Matomo integration is safer:** it now fails fast on empty tokens and consistently uses the hydrated users.administrator.tokens value for API calls."
msgstr "**Integracija Matomo je varnejša:** zdaj ne uspe hitro na prazne žetone in dosledno uporablja hidrirane users.administrator.tokens vrednost za API Klici."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Matrix**: `#public:infinito.nexus` for general community discussion."
msgstr "**Matrica**: `#public:infinito.nexus` za splošno skupnostno razpravo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Meeting Recordings:** A dedicated recorder consumes recording jobs from the RabbitMQ queue and stores MP4 archives in MinIO."
msgstr "**Zapisi sestankov:** Namenski snemalnik porabi snemanje delovnih mest iz RabbitMQ Vrsta in zaloge MP4 arhivi v MinIO."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Metrics via `unauthenticated_metrics_access = true`** on the internal listener, scraped on the internal container port over the role-local docker network only — never through the proxy, never public."
msgstr "**Metrike preko `unauthenticated_metrics_access = true`** na notranjem poslušalcu, ki je razrezan na notranja vrata zabojnika samo prek krajevnega omrežja za doke – nikoli prek posrednika, nikoli javnega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Migrated compose files** from *docker-compose.yml* to *compose.yml*, including override and CA override variants, and unified compose-related configuration keys"
msgstr "**Migrirane datoteke sestavljanja** od *docker-compose.yml* do *compose.yml*, vključno z različicami za razveljavitev in CA za razveljavitev in enotnimi konfiguracijskimi ključi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Migration outline (~4-6h):**"
msgstr "**Opis migracij (~4-Kaj?6h):**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Migration**"
msgstr "**Migracije**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MinIO** is an S3-compatible object storage service for files, media, backups, and AI artifacts, self-hosted for performance and control."
msgstr "**Minio** je S3-kompatibilna storitev za shranjevanje predmetov za datoteke, medije, varnostne kopije in AI artefakte, ki so sami gostitelji za delovanje in nadzor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately."
msgstr "**Mini-QR** je lahek, samogostoljuben spletni program za ustvarjanje QR kod takoj in zasebno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately.   It provides a minimal and elegant interface to convert any text, URL, or message into a QR code directly in your browser, without external tracking or dependencies."
msgstr "**Mini-QR** je lahek, samogostoljuben spletni program za ustvarjanje QR kod takoj in zasebno. Zagotavlja minimalen in eleganten vmesnik za pretvorbo katerega koli besedila, URL ali sporočilo v QR kodo neposredno v vašem brskalniku, brez zunanjega sledenja ali odvisnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal NGINX Setup:** Clean and optimized default configurations."
msgstr "**Minimalna nastavitev NGINX:** Čiste in optimizirane privzete nastavitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal Setup:** No unnecessary dependencies are installed."
msgstr "**Minimalna nastavitev:** Nameščene niso nepotrebne odvisnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Does not enable services or autostart entries beyond what the package itself provides."
msgstr "**Najmanjši odtis:** Ne omogoča storitev ali vnosov samodejnega zagona, ki presegajo tisto, kar paket sam zagotavlja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Small Node.js/Express service that fits neatly into larger stacks."
msgstr "**Najmanjši odtis:** Majhna Node.js/Express storitev, ki se lepo ujema v večjih skladov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal scope** (client-only, no server configuration)"
msgstr "**Najmanjše področje uporabe** (samo odjemalec, brez nastavitev strežnika)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mirror failover:** A repository that declares a mirror is served through a guarded location: a 5xx from its primary remote re-runs the same path against the sibling repository, while a 404 is passed straight back."
msgstr "**Okvara ogledala:** Skladišče, ki izjavlja, da se zrcalo uporablja na varovani lokaciji: a 5xx iz svojega primarnega oddaljenega sistema ponovno teče po isti poti proti skladišču bratov in sester, 404 je šel naravnost nazaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Image-level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) and their synonyms (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) still route through `ask`, so the operator reviews them before they execute."
msgstr "**Blažitev:** Mutacija na ravni slike (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) in njihove sopomenke (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) še vedno pot skozi `ask`, tako da jih operater pregleda preden izvršijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Targets still cannot bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, or the `deny` list. A malicious target that called `rm -rf .` would be stopped by the `rm -rf*` deny rule."
msgstr "**Blažitev:** Cilji še vedno ne morejo mimo `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, ali `deny` Seznam. Zlonamerna tarča, ki je klicala `rm -rf .` bi ga ustavilo `rm -rf*` Zanikaj pravilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` and its synonyms are in `ask`, so the operator reviews them (subject to Assumption 5). The `deny` list blocks `sudo*`, so direct privilege escalation via `sudo` is unavailable."
msgstr "**Blažitev:** `docker run*` in njegove sopomenke so v `ask`, tako da jih operator pregleda (predmet domneve 5). O `deny` Bloki seznamov `sudo*`, tako neposredno privilegij stopnjevanje preko `sudo` ni na voljo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` with `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` refuses to start when the backend is unavailable. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` rejects the `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tool parameter, so there is no per-call escape."
msgstr "**Blažitev:** `sandbox.enabled: true` z `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` noče začeti, ko hrbtenica ni na voljo. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` zavrne `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` parameter orodja, tako da ni izhoda na klic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let's Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Mode-ware:** Odsotni neobvezni viri se preskočijo, ne spodletijo, zato ista vloga deluje tako pri samopodpisih kot pri nastavitvah Šifrirajmo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let’s Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Mode-ware:** odsotni neobvezni viri se preskočijo, ne spodletijo, tako da ista vloga deluje tako v samopodpisih kot v nastavitvah Šifrirajmo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in ``svc-swarm-node`` resolves ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Sprožilec izbire načina:** Članstvo v ``svc-swarm-node`` razrešitve ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` za vsako vlogo spletne aplikacije na tem gostitelju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in `svc-swarm-node` resolves `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Sprožilec izbire načina:** Članstvo v `svc-swarm-node` razrešitve `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` za vsako vlogo spletne aplikacije na tem gostitelju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model and context:** ``agents.model`` names the gateway alias every agent runs on and defaults to the gateway’s chat model, so agents can run on a larger model than Open WebUI’s default. The context window of that alias comes from the model’s ``context`` in the inventory and is written into the agent config as Hermes ``model.context_length`` and OpenClaw ``contextWindow``. An agent prompt runs to tens of thousands of tokens, so a CPU-only local model spends minutes per turn on it; point ``agents.model`` at a remote model for interactive use. Hermes refuses a window below 64000 tokens and answers HTTP 500 on every prompt, so a platform whose minimum the selected alias misses is not offered at all: it is left out of ``/v1/models`` and answers 404, and the deploy says which platform it dropped and why. The rest of the broker keeps working, which is what makes a small model and OpenClaw a valid pairing. An alias that declares no window is reported instead of filtered, because an agent that does not know its window runs."
msgstr "**Vzorec in kontekst:** ``agents.model`` poimenuje vrata alias vsak agent teče na in privzeto na chat model portala, tako da lahko agenti teči na večji model kot Open WebUITo je privzeto. Okvirno okno tega imena izhaja iz modela ``context`` v inventarju in je vpisan v agent config kot Hermes ``model.context_length`` ter OpenClaw ``contextWindow``. Zastopnik teče do deset tisoč žetonov, tako da samo CPU lokalni model preživi minute na zavoj na to točko; ``agents.model`` na oddaljenem modelu za interaktivno uporabo. Hermes zavrne okno spodaj 64000 žetoni in odgovori HTTP 500 na vsak poziv, tako platforma, katere minimum izbrani alias zgreši sploh ni na voljo: je izpuščen iz ``/v1/models`` in odgovori 404, Na kateri ploščadi je padel in zakaj. Preostali posrednik nadaljuje delo, kar je tisto, kar naredi majhen model in OpenClaw veljaven par. Aliase, ki razglaša, da okno ni prijavljeno, namesto filtrirano, ker agent, ki ne pozna njegovega okna teče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model and context:** `agents.model` names the gateway alias every agent runs on and defaults to the gateway's chat model, so agents can run on a larger model than Open WebUI's default. The context window of that alias comes from the model's `context` in the inventory and is written into the agent config as Hermes `model.context_length` and OpenClaw `contextWindow`. An agent prompt runs to tens of thousands of tokens, so a CPU-only local model spends minutes per turn on it; point `agents.model` at a remote model for interactive use. Hermes refuses a window below 64000 tokens and answers HTTP 500 on every prompt, so a platform whose minimum the selected alias misses is not offered at all: it is left out of `/v1/models` and answers 404, and the deploy says which platform it dropped and why. The rest of the broker keeps working, which is what makes a small model and OpenClaw a valid pairing. An alias that declares no window is reported instead of filtered, because an agent that does not know its window runs."
msgstr "**Vzorec in kontekst:** `agents.model` poimenuje vrata alias vsak agent teče na in privzeto na chat model portala, tako da lahko agenti teči na večji model kot Open WebUIPrivzeto. Okvirno okno tega imena prihaja iz modela. `context` v inventarju in je vpisan v agent config kot Hermes `model.context_length` ter OpenClaw `contextWindow`. Zastopnik teče do deset tisoč žetonov, tako da samo CPU lokalni model preživi minute na zavoj na to točko; `agents.model` na oddaljenem modelu za interaktivno uporabo. Hermes zavrne okno spodaj 64000 žetoni in odgovori HTTP 500 na vsak poziv, tako platforma, katere minimum izbrani alias zgreši sploh ni na voljo: je izpuščen iz `/v1/models` in odgovori 404, Na kateri ploščadi je padel in zakaj. Preostali posrednik nadaljuje delo, kar je tisto, kar naredi majhen model in OpenClaw veljaven par. Aliase, ki razglaša, da okno ni prijavljeno, namesto filtrirano, ker agent, ki ne pozna njegovega okna teče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model gateway key:** With the LiteLLM Gateway deployed, that gateway provisions a per-consumer virtual key aliased to this application."
msgstr "**Ključ modela:** Z LiteLLM Gateway uporabljajo, da prehodne določbe virtualni ključ na potrošnika, vzdevek za to aplikacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model relay:** Agents call ``http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`` with their own key; the broker forwards the call to LiteLLM with the broker’s virtual key, sets the OpenAI ``user`` field to the owner and logs a JSON ``relay`` event with owner, platform, path and upstream status."
msgstr "**Model rele:** Agenti kličejo. ``http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`` s svojim ključem; posrednik posreduje klic LiteLLM z virtualnim ključem posrednika, nastavi OpenAI ``user`` polje lastniku in evidentira JSON ``relay`` dogodek z lastnikom, platformo, potjo in stanjem na začetku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model relay:** Agents call `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1` with their own key; the broker forwards the call to LiteLLM with the broker's virtual key, sets the OpenAI `user` field to the owner and logs a JSON `relay` event with owner, platform, path and upstream status."
msgstr "**Model rele:** Agenti kličejo. `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1` s svojim ključem; posrednik posreduje klic LiteLLM z virtualnim ključem posrednika, nastavi OpenAI `user` polje lastniku in evidentira JSON `relay` dogodek z lastnikom, platformo, potjo in stanjem na začetku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Models go through the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway.** Each agent's BYO-model config points only at the `svc-ai-litellm` `/v1` + a model alias; it never addresses a provider directly. The Pis run no large models locally; heavy inference is routed to a GPU/external backend by the gateway."
msgstr "**Modeli gredo skozi [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) Vrata.** Vsak agent je BYO-model konfig točk samo na `svc-ai-litellm` `/v1` + model alias; nikoli ne naslovi ponudnika neposredno. Pis ne poganja velikih modelov lokalno; težko sklepanje je preusmerjeno na GPU/zunanjo hrbtenico ob prehodu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Models via the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway; higher-level tools via [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) MCP.** Embodiment changes the host boundary, not the model or tool planes: inference still goes through the gateway, and non-hardware tools still come via MCP."
msgstr "**Modeli prek [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) prehod; orodja na višji ravni prek [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) MCP.** Utelešenje spreminja mejo gostitelja, ne modela ali ravnin orodja: sklepanje še vedno poteka skozi prehod, nestrokovna orodja pa še vedno prihajajo preko MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern Dashboard:** Enjoy a sleek, user-friendly interface for managing campaigns and analyzing performance."
msgstr "**Sodobna Dashboard:** Uživajte v elegantnem, uporabniku prijaznem vmesniku za upravljanje kampanj in analiziranje uspešnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern Forum Experience:** Engage in interactive, real-time discussions with a responsive, mobile-friendly design."
msgstr "**Izkušnje sodobnega foruma:** Vključite interaktivne razprave v realnem času z odzivnim, mobilnim dizajnom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern and Scalable:** A robust Symfony-based framework optimized for commerce innovation."
msgstr "**Sodobna in raztegljiva:** Trden okvir, ki temelji na sistemu Symfony, optimiziran za poslovne inovacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern search:** OpenSearch out of the box (single-node)."
msgstr "**Sodobno iskanje:** Odpri iskanje iz škatle (eno vozlišče)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern, Responsive Web Interface:** Access an intuitive and adaptive UI for effortless browsing, administration, and content management."
msgstr "**Sodobni, odzivni spletni vmesnik:** Dostop do intuitivnega in prilagodljivega uporabniškega vmesnika za brez truda brskanje, upravljanje in upravljanje vsebin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Design:** Easily integrates with other WireGuard roles or network configuration roles."
msgstr "**Modularna zasnova:** Enostavno se integrira z drugimi vlogami WireGuard ali konfiguracijami omrežja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Integration:** Integrates with common routines and roles to further enhance system security."
msgstr "**Modularna integracija:** Združuje skupne rutine in vloge za nadaljnje izboljšanje varnosti sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Role Composition:** Leverages central roles for database and NGINX, ensuring consistency across deployments 🔄"
msgstr "**Modularna sestava vloge:** Poveča osrednje vloge za podatkovno zbirko in NGINX, s čimer se zagotavlja skladnost med uvajanjem 🔄"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Role Composition:** Uses shared roles for DB, proxy and monitoring to keep your stack consistent 🔄"
msgstr "**Modularna sestava vloge:** Uporablja skupne vloge za DB, posrednik in spremljanje, da bi vaš sklad skladen 🔄"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Scalability** 📈 Grow from small teams to global enterprises by composing only the services you need."
msgstr "**Modularna razteznost** 📈 Od malih ekip do globalnih podjetij rastete tako, da sestavljate le storitve, ki jih potrebujete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular includes**: headers, locations, and global snippets are factored for easy extension."
msgstr "**Modular vključuje**: glave, lokacije in globalni odrezki so faktor za enostavno razširitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Module fetch fails (`go.mod` resolution)**: Hugo modules pull from `proxy.golang.org`. Network egress to that host must be allowed by the local firewall / proxy."
msgstr "**Pridobivanje modula ni uspelo (`go.mod` Ločljivost)**: Hugo moduli potegnil iz `proxy.golang.org`. Omrežni izhod do tega gostitelja mora biti dovoljeno z lokalnim požarnim zidom / posrednik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Module**"
msgstr "**Modul**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring and dashboard entries:** Registers the hub with the metrics and dashboard services when those are part of the deployment."
msgstr "**Vnos za spremljanje in armaturno ploščo:** Ko so ti del uporabe, se vozlišče registrira z metriko in storitvami armaturne plošče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring**   You can follow logs in real time with `journalctl -f`."
msgstr "**Spremljanje** Lahko sledite dnevnike v realnem času z `journalctl -f`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring** You can follow logs in real time with ``journalctl -f``."
msgstr "**Spremljanje** Lahko sledite dnevnike v realnem času z ``journalctl -f``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring, Alerting & Analytics** 📊 Built-in system, application, and security monitoring with multi-channel notifications."
msgstr "**Spremljanje, opozarjanje in analitika** 📊 Vgrajen sistem, aplikacija in varnostni nadzor z več kanali obvestil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring:** Prometheus scrapes `/v1/sys/metrics` on the role-local network. A sealed node is detected from `/v1/sys/health`, which answers 503 while sealed and 200 once unsealed."
msgstr "**Spremljanje:** Prometej `/v1/sys/metrics` na lokalnem omrežju. Zatesnjeno vozlišče se odkrije iz `/v1/sys/health`, ki odgovarja 503 med zapečatenjem in 200 Enkrat odpečaten."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring:** Prometheus scrapes ``/v1/sys/metrics`` on the role-local network. A sealed node is detected from ``/v1/sys/health``, which answers 503 while sealed and 200 once unsealed."
msgstr "**Spremljanje:** Prometej ``/v1/sys/metrics`` na lokalnem omrežju. Zatesnjeno vozlišče se odkrije iz ``/v1/sys/health``, ki odgovarja 503 med zapečatenjem in 200 Enkrat odpečaten."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**More reliable Git configuration:** Git setup now works consistently for workstation users without broken or implicit dependencies."
msgstr "**Bolj zanesljivo Git konfiguracija:** Nastavitev Git zdaj deluje dosledno za uporabnike delovnih postaj brez lomljenih ali implicitnih odvisnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**More reliable installs and deploys:** Fewer Docker and OS-specific failures (especially on CentOS Stream), cleaner container builds, and stable Python/Ansible execution across CI and local environments."
msgstr "**Bolj zanesljivi namesti in razporedi:** Manj napak, specifičnih za OS (zlasti na CentOS Stream), čistejše posode gradi, in stabilno Python / Ansible izvajanje v CI in lokalnih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**More reliable workstation setups:** A dedicated *workstation user* ensures deployments and integration tests run consistently."
msgstr "**Bolj zanesljive nastavitve delovnih postaj:** Predano *uporabnik delovne postaje* zagotavlja, da preskusi uvajanja in vključevanja potekajo dosledno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**More robust Mailu configuration:** Optional user roles are handled safely, avoiding configuration and runtime errors."
msgstr "**Bolj robustno Mailu konfiguracija:** Neobvezne uporabniške vloge se obravnavajo varno, s čimer se izognemo konfiguraciji in napakam v času delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-Platform Support:** Installs Wireguard tools using [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Pacman) on Arch Linux and [apt](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/APT_(software)) on Ubuntu/Debian."
msgstr "**Večplastna podpora:** Namesti Wireguard orodja, ki uporabljajo [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Pacman) na Arch Linux in [apt](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/APT_(software)) na Ubuntu/Debian."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-Platform Support:** Installs Wireguard tools using `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Pacman>`__ on Arch Linux and `apt <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/APT_(software)>`__ on Ubuntu/Debian."
msgstr "**Večplastna podpora:** Namesti Wireguard orodja, ki uporabljajo `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Pacman>`__ na Arch Linux in `apt <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/APT_(software)>`__ na Ubuntu/Debian."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-distro:** Supports Debian, Ubuntu (``apt``), Arch Linux (``pacman``), and Fedora/EL (``dnf``) via distro-specific task files."
msgstr "**Večdimenzionalni:** Podpira Debian, Ubuntu (``apt``), Arch Linux (``pacman``), in Fedora/EL (``dnf``) preko distrospecifičnih datotek opravil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-distro:** Supports Debian, Ubuntu (`apt`), Arch Linux (`pacman`), and Fedora/EL (`dnf`) via distro-specific task files."
msgstr "**Večdimenzionalni:** Podpira Debian, Ubuntu (`apt`), Arch Linux (`pacman`), in Fedora/EL (`dnf`) preko distrospecifičnih datotek opravil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-instance:** Provisions N runner instances per host via `RUNNER_COUNT`; each handles one CI job at a time."
msgstr "**Večnazivnost:** Določbe N tekaški primeri na gostitelja preko `RUNNER_COUNT`; vsak opravlja po eno CI službo naenkrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-instance:** Provisions N runner instances per host via ``RUNNER_COUNT``; each handles one CI job at a time."
msgstr "**Večnazivnost:** Določbe N tekaški primeri na gostitelja preko ``RUNNER_COUNT``; vsak opravlja po eno CI službo naenkrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-manager HA.** v1 is single-manager (one host in `svc-swarm-manager`). A follow-up requirement covers 3+ managers with Raft-quorum and the inventory shape that supports it."
msgstr "**Multi-manager HA.** v1 je samostojen (en gostitelj v `svc-swarm-manager`). Nadaljnja zahteva zajema 3+ menedžerji z Raft-quorum in inventar obliko, ki ga podpira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-statement chains in shell invocations are FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NOT chain independent statements inside a single Bash tool call with **any** statement separator (`;`, literal newline, `&&`, `||`, `&` background operator, or subshell/brace groups around the same). The ban covers causally-dependent chains (`cd X && cmd`) just as much as optional ones, and applies to trailing `&` used to background a command (use the Bash tool's `run_in_background: true` parameter instead). Reason: identical to the loop rule. Split the work across **separate Bash tool calls** or use a single-command equivalent (`xargs`, `grep` with multiple args, a make target)."
msgstr "**Večbesedne verige so FORBIDEN. ⛔** Ne smete verige neodvisne izjave znotraj enega Bash orodja klic z **kateri koli** Ločevalnik izjav (`;`, Dobesedno novo linijo. `&&`, `||`, `&` upravljavec ozadja ali podskupine/skupine sledov približno enake). Prepoved zajema vzročno odvisne verige (`cd X && cmd`) ravno toliko kot neobvezne in velja za sledenje `&` uporablja za ozadje ukaza (uporaba orodja Bash `run_in_background: true` Namesto tega parameter)- Razlog: enak pravilu zanke. Razdelite delo čez **Ločeni klici orodja Bash** ali uporabite ekvivalent enega ukaza (`xargs`, `grep` z več argi, tarčo znamke)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-wall**: declare multiple purpose-built walls (per event, hashtag, account set, …) under one deployment."
msgstr "**večplastni**: razglasite več namensko zgrajenih sten (na dogodek, hashtag, nabor računov, ...) v okviru ene razporeditve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multisite Management:** Easily create and maintain multiple sites with a single WordPress installation, ideal for networks of blogs, corporate intranets, or educational institutions."
msgstr "**Upravljanje več strani:** Enostavno ustvarjanje in vzdrževanje več mest z enim samim WordPress namestitev, idealna za mreže blogov, podjetniške intranete ali izobraževalne ustanove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multisite path** (auto-detected via `is_multisite()`): per-site roles come from `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<canonical-domain>/<role>` entries; the super-admin capability comes from `/roles/web-app-wordpress/network-administrator`. The mapper adds the user to any site they have a role for (`add_user_to_blog`) and removes them from sites it previously added them to (`remove_user_from_blog`) when a role for that site disappears from the claim. A user-meta marker (`_infinito_oidc_added_blog_ids`) records which blog memberships the mapper owns, so memberships added through `wp-admin` or the REST API outside the OIDC flow are never touched."
msgstr "**Večmestna pot** (Samodejno zaznana preko `is_multisite()`): na kraju samem prihajajo vloge `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<canonical-domain>/<role>` vnosi; sposobnost super-admin prihaja iz `/roles/web-app-wordpress/network-administrator`. Mapper dodaja uporabnika na katero koli spletno stran imajo vlogo za (`add_user_to_blog`) in jih odstrani iz mest, ki jih je že dodal (`remove_user_from_blog`) kadar vloga za to stran izgine iz zahtevka. Označevalec uporabnikov-meta (`_infinito_oidc_added_blog_ids`) zapise, ki jih ima članski blog v lasti maper, tako da so člani dodali `wp-admin` ali REST API zunaj OIDC pretoka se nikoli ne dotaknejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi‑Server Management:**"
msgstr "**Upravljanje z več strežniki:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi‑Server Management:**   Connect to and administer multiple PostgreSQL instances from a single interface."
msgstr "**Upravljanje z več strežniki:** Povežite se z večkratnikom in ga dajte PostgreSQL primeri iz enega samega vmesnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mutating commands that stay inside `allowWrite`** (e.g. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, though builds still route through `ask`) just work under the sandbox."
msgstr "**Mutiranje ukazov, ki ostanejo znotraj `allowWrite`** (Npr. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, čeprav gradi še pot skozi `ask`) Samo delaj pod peskovnikom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mutating commands that target paths outside `allowWrite`** (e.g. `mv ~/file /etc/`) fail at the sandbox layer with EROFS."
msgstr "**Mutiranje ukazov, ki ciljne poti zunaj `allowWrite`** (Npr. `mv ~/file /etc/`) pri plasteh peskovnika z EROFS spodleti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NAT Support:** Configures the external interface for proper masquerading."
msgstr "**Podpora NAT:** Nastavi zunanji vmesnik za pravilno masquerading."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS for stateful databases.** v1 keeps DB data volumes local-only with node-pinning. Reconsidering this requires a separate requirement covering DB-specific NFS semantics (locking, fsync, version compatibility per engine)."
msgstr "**NFS za državne baze podatkov.** v1 hrani podatke DB samo lokalno z vozliščem. Ponovna preučitev tega zahteva ločeno zahtevo, ki zajema semantiko NFS, specifično za DB (zaklepanje, fsync, združljivost z različico na motor)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS-backed shared volumes** so that the Swarm scheduler can move a container between nodes without losing volume state."
msgstr "**Skupni obsegi, podprti z NFS** tako, da lahko Swarm razporejevalnik premakniti posodo med vozlišča, ne da bi izgubili stanje glasnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS-backed storage:** ``docker_registry_data`` survives container/manager restarts when storage backend is NFS."
msgstr "**Skladiščenje s podporo NFS:** ``docker_registry_data`` preživi posodo/upravljavec ponovno zažene, ko je hrbtenica za shranjevanje NFS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS-backed storage:** `docker_registry_data` survives container/manager restarts when storage backend is NFS."
msgstr "**Skladiščenje s podporo NFS:** `docker_registry_data` preživi posodo/upravljavec ponovno zažene, ko je hrbtenica za shranjevanje NFS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX Cleanup:** Safely removes server configuration files."
msgstr "**Čiščenje NGINX:** Varno odstrani nastavitvene datoteke strežnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX Integration**: Sets up NGINX for handling domain-specific requests and SSL termination."
msgstr "**Integracija NGINX**: Nastavite NGINX za obravnavo domene specifične zahteve in SSL zaključevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX Reverse Proxy Integration:** Provides secure access and HTTPS termination."
msgstr "**Povratna integracija posrednika NGINX:** Zagotavlja varen dostop in HTTPS prekinitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX Reverse Proxy:** Configures a public-facing proxy with TLS termination and WebSocket support for `/cool/` paths."
msgstr "**NGINX obratno posrednik:** Nastavi javno obrnjen posrednik z zaključkom TLS in podporo WebSocket za `/cool/` poti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX Reverse Proxy:** Configures a public-facing proxy with TLS termination and WebSocket support for ``/cool/`` paths."
msgstr "**NGINX obratno posrednik:** Nastavi javno obrnjen posrednik z zaključkom TLS in podporo WebSocket za ``/cool/`` poti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX Reverse Proxy:** Configures a public-facing proxy with TLS termination for `/` and internal API calls."
msgstr "**NGINX obratno posrednik:** Nastavi posrednika, ki gleda na javnost, s končanjem TLS za `/` in notranje API Klici."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX Reverse Proxy:** Configures a public-facing proxy with TLS termination for ``/`` and internal API calls."
msgstr "**NGINX obratno posrednik:** Nastavi posrednika, ki gleda na javnost, s končanjem TLS za ``/`` in notranje API Klici."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX reverse proxy:** Front the Joomla container with the project's `sys-stk-front-proxy` for TLS termination and per-domain routing."
msgstr "**Obratni posrednik NGINX:** Spredaj Joomla zabojnik s projektom `sys-stk-front-proxy` za prekinitev TLS in usmerjanje na dom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NGINX reverse proxy:** Front the Joomla container with the project’s ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` for TLS termination and per-domain routing."
msgstr "**Obratni posrednik NGINX:** Spredaj Joomla zabojnik s projektom ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` za prekinitev TLS in usmerjanje na dom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Named state:** the configuration and cache directories the image declares as volumes are pinned to named volumes, so no anonymous volume is left behind."
msgstr "**Ime:** konfiguracije in mape predpomnilnikov, ki jih slika izjavlja, da so zvezki vezani na imenovane zvezke, zato anonimna količina ni ostala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Narrow:** it configures name resolution and nothing else, so callers that only need resolution do not also change the system hostname"
msgstr "**Ozko:** nastavlja ločljivost imena in nič drugega, zato klicatelji, ki potrebujejo le ločljivost, ne spremenijo tudi imena gostitelja sistema"

# translated-by: libretranslate
