# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO via SSO-proxy sidecar:** Gate the FusionDirectory web UI through the project's SSO-proxy sidecar (provided by `web-app-keycloak`) for OIDC-authenticated entry."
msgstr "**Native OIDC SSO preko SSO-proxy sidecar:** Vrata FusionDirectory spletni vmesnik prek SSO-proxy sidecar projekta (zagotavlja `web-app-keycloak`) za OIDC-priznan vstop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
