msgstr "**Domači OIDC SSO:** Overi uporabnike proti Keycloak prek ``oic-auth`` vstavek, ki ga je ob zagonu nastavil JCSC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the `oic-auth` plugin, configured by JCasC at boot."
msgstr "**Domači OIDC SSO:** Overi uporabnike proti Keycloak prek `oic-auth` vstavek, ki ga je ob zagonu nastavil JCSC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin, with ``?fallback=local`` as an env-toggleable emergency hatch."
msgstr "**Domači OIDC SSO:** Overi uporabnike proti Keycloak preko in-rola ``plg_system_keycloak`` vstavek, z ``?fallback=local`` kot zasilna loputa, ki jo je mogoče zagnati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin, with `?fallback=local` as an env-toggleable emergency hatch."
msgstr "**Domači OIDC SSO:** Overi uporabnike proti Keycloak preko in-rola `plg_system_keycloak` vstavek, z `?fallback=local` kot zasilna loputa, ki jo je mogoče zagnati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Semaphore renders its own \"Sign in with Keycloak\" button via `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS`; the Keycloak client is auto-provisioned by `web-app-keycloak`."
msgstr "**Domači OIDC SSO:** Semafor naredi svojega. \"Vpišite se z Keycloak\" gumb preko `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS`; Keycloak odjemalec je samodejno zagotovljen `web-app-keycloak`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Semaphore renders its own “Sign in with Keycloak” button via ``SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS``; the Keycloak client is auto-provisioned by ``web-app-keycloak``."
msgstr "**Domači OIDC SSO:** Semafor naredi svojo » Podpišite z Keycloak“ gumb preko ``SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS``; Keycloak odjemalec je samodejno zagotovljen ``web-app-keycloak``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC flavor** (`services.sso.flavor: oidc`), not the oauth2-proxy gate: OpenBao speaks OIDC itself, so it follows [`web-app-semaphore`](../../roles/web-app-semaphore/) rather than [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."
msgstr "**Domači okus OIDC** (`services.sso.flavor: oidc`), ne oauth2OpenBao govori OIDC sam, zato sledi [`web-app-semaphore`](../../roles/web-app-semaphore/) namesto [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native Prometheus metrics** via the `services.prometheus.native_metrics` + `templates/prometheus.yml.j2` contract already used by [`web-app-gitea`](../../roles/web-app-gitea/templates/prometheus.yml.j2), scraped on the internal container port over the role-local docker network."
msgstr "**Native Prometheus metrike** prek `services.prometheus.native_metrics` + `templates/prometheus.yml.j2` pogodba, ki jo že uporablja [`web-app-gitea`](../../roles/web-app-gitea/templates/prometheus.yml.j2), razrezana na notranjih vratih zabojnika prek lokalnega omrežja za docker vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native in all editions** (incl. Raw): LDAP \"connections\" sync users, contact groups, roles."
msgstr "**Domačina v vseh izdajah** (vključno z surovi): LDAP \"connections\" sinhronizirati uporabnike, kontaktne skupine, vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native** local email/password login is *off* once OIDC is the login path (forces SSO), *on* otherwise — derived from the ``sso`` service flag. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-login-with-password`` / ``disable-login-with-password`` accordingly (no JS injection needed — Penpot disables the password form natively). When native login is on, the role bootstraps a local password for the ``administrator`` profile via the backend PREPL (``enable-prepl-server``) in ``tasks/main.yml`` — ``create-profile`` for a fresh profile, ``update-profile`` to set the password when a federated login already created it; the bootstrap is skipped under OIDC."
msgstr "**Native** lokalna prijava e- pošte/gesla je *izklop* ko OIDC je prijavna pot (sile SSO), *o* drugače – izhaja iz ``sso`` Zastava za storitve. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` Izrisi ``enable-login-with-password`` / ``disable-login-with-password`` ustrezno (injekcija JS ni potrebna — Penpot onemogoči geslo obrazec doma). Ko je avtohtona prijava vklopljena, vloga škornji past lokalno geslo za ``administrator`` profil prek hrbtenjače PREPL (``enable-prepl-server``) v ``tasks/main.yml`` — ``create-profile`` za svež profil, ``update-profile`` da nastavite geslo, ko je federated prijavo že ustvaril; boottrap je preskočil pod OIDC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native** local email/password login is *off* once OIDC is the login path (forces SSO), *on* otherwise — derived from the `sso` service flag. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-login-with-password` / `disable-login-with-password` accordingly (no JS injection needed — Penpot disables the password form natively). When native login is on, the role bootstraps a local password for the `administrator` profile via the backend PREPL (`enable-prepl-server`) in `tasks/main.yml` — `create-profile` for a fresh profile, `update-profile` to set the password when a federated login already created it; the bootstrap is skipped under OIDC."
msgstr "**Native** lokalna prijava e- pošte/gesla je *izklop* ko OIDC je prijavna pot (sile SSO), *o* drugače – izhaja iz `sso` Zastava za storitve. `PENPOT_FLAGS` Izrisi `enable-login-with-password` / `disable-login-with-password` ustrezno (injekcija JS ni potrebna — Penpot onemogoči geslo obrazec doma). Ko je avtohtona prijava vklopljena, vloga škornji past lokalno geslo za `administrator` profil prek hrbtenjače PREPL (`enable-prepl-server`) v `tasks/main.yml` — `create-profile` za svež profil, `update-profile` da nastavite geslo, ko je federated prijavo že ustvaril; boottrap je preskočil pod OIDC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Navigate to Pixelfed Directory:** Once inside the container, navigate to the Pixelfed directory. This is typically the root directory where Pixelfed is installed."
msgstr "**Navigacija za Pixelfed Imenik:** Ko je v zabojniku, navigirajte na Pixelfed Mapa. To je običajno korenski imenik, kjer Pixelfed je nameščen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Nested Docker state does not survive a teardown locally, but does in CI.** `INFINITO_DOCKER_VOLUME` is the named volume `docker` ([default.env](../../../../default.env)) and a host path (`/mnt/docker`) on GitHub. `compose down -v` removes a named volume and cannot remove a bind mount, so every workspace track starts on a clean inner daemon locally while CI carries the previous track's containers into the next one. Defects that need a container, network, or bind source to outlive a teardown cannot reproduce under act."
msgstr "**Nested Docker država ne preživi trganje lokalno, ampak v CI.** `INFINITO_DOCKER_VOLUME` po imenu zvezek `docker` ([default.env](../../../../default.env)) in pot gostitelja (`/mnt/docker`) Na GitHubu. `compose down -v` odstrani poimenovano glasnost in ne more odstraniti vezavnega sklopa, tako da se vsaka skladba delovnega prostora začne na čistem notranjem demonu lokalno, medtem ko CI nosi zabojnike prejšnje skladbe v naslednjo. Pomanjkljivosti, ki potrebujejo posodo, mrežo ali vežejo vir, da preživijo uničenje, se ne morejo razmnoževati pod dejanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Nested keys.** Both flat and nested credential keys are accepted, so e.g. `recaptcha.key` and `recaptcha.secret` remain nested."
msgstr "**Nesgrajeni ključi.** Sprejemajo se tako ploščati kot gnjezdilni ključi kredence, zato npr. `recaptcha.key` ter `recaptcha.secret` Ostani v gnezdu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Network Configuration**: Includes setup of a dedicated Docker network for MariaDB."
msgstr "**Nastavitve omrežja**: Vključuje nastavitev namenskega Docker omrežja za MariaDB."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Network bridges are addons.** Appservice / network bridges (e.g. the Matrix `mautrix` bridges to WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, Slack, Facebook, Instagram) are addons declared under `meta/addons/` with `mechanism: bridge`, one file per bridged network. Each bridge owns its credentials in [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) and is `required: false` and disabled by default. The role's former bridge declarations (e.g. `web-app-matrix`'s `vars/bridges.yml`) are absorbed into `meta/addons/`."
msgstr "**Omrežni mostovi so dodatki.** Appservice / omrežni mostovi (Npr. Matrix `mautrix` mostovi na WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, Slack, Facebook, Instagram) so dodatki, navedeni pod `meta/addons/` z `mechanism: bridge`, ena datoteka na premostitveno omrežje. Vsak most ima svoje poverilnice v [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) in je `required: false` in privzeto onemogočen. Vloga nekdanjih deklaracij o mostu (Npr. `web-app-matrix`'s `vars/bridges.yml`) absorbirajo v `meta/addons/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NetworkManager + dnsmasq**. preferred path when NetworkManager is active; configures the NM dnsmasq plugin with a wildcard zone entry."
msgstr "**Upravitelj omrežja + dnsmasq**. najprimernejša pot, ko je NetworkManager aktiven; konfigurira vstavek NM dnsmasq z vnosom divje karte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Networks.** For `implementation: sidecar` or `external`, the MCP container MUST attach to the role's existing `networks.local` subnet and MUST NOT introduce a new top-level network."
msgstr "**Mreže.** Za `implementation: sidecar` ali `external`, posoda MCP mora pritrditi na obstoječo vlogo `networks.local` podomrežje in NE SME uvesti novega vrhunskega omrežja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Neutral choice:** Unlike language‑specific collations, `unicode_ci` works robustly in multilingual contexts without bias."
msgstr "**Nevtralna izbira:** Za razliko od jezikovno specifičnih kolacij, `unicode_ci` deluje robustno v večjezičnih kontekstih brez pristranskosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never a plain container, and the deploy proves it.** A preflight probes the host for `/dev/kvm` and for each runtime's binary, and selects the strongest runtime that is actually installed; the choice is logged at deploy time. It MUST NOT fall back to a plain `runc` container: unisolated execution of model-generated code is never allowed."
msgstr "**Nikoli ni bil navaden zabojnik, kar dokazuje.** Pred letom sonde gostitelj za `/dev/kvm` in za vsak binarni čas delovanja ter izbere najmočnejši čas delovanja, ki je dejansko nameščen; izbira je zabeležena ob času razporeditve. Ne sme pasti nazaj v ravnino `runc` posoda: neizolirano izvajanje kode, ki jo ustvarjajo modeli, ni nikoli dovoljeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never commit your API token to a public repository. Always keep it secure!**"
msgstr "**Nikoli se ne obveži. API žeton v javno skladišče. Vedno imej varno!**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never disable.** Required by almost every app."
msgstr "**Nikoli ne onesposobi.** Zahteva skoraj vsaka aplikacija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never dispatch again while the watch is armed.** `entry-manual-steer.yml` declares the branch's concurrency group with `cancel-in-progress`, so a second dispatch cancels the run being triaged. The loop then triages a cancelled run and reports every unfinished row as a failure, which is a phantom: those rows never reached a verdict."
msgstr "**Nikoli več ne odpošlji, dokler je ura oborožena.** `entry-manual-steer.yml` izjavlja, da je skupina podružnica sočasna z `cancel-in-progress`, Druga depeš je preklicala poskus. Zanka nato triažira preklican tek in poroča o vsaki nedokončani vrsti kot o neuspehu, ki je fantomski: te vrste niso nikoli dosegle razsodbe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never enable buffering for true WebSocket connections!**   Use `proxy_buffering off;` (as in `ws_generic.conf.j2`) or connections may fail."
msgstr "**Nikoli ne omogočite pufr za prave povezave WebSocket!** Uporaba `proxy_buffering off;` (kot v `ws_generic.conf.j2`) ali povezave lahko odpovejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**New CLI capability:** Automatic resolution of *run_after* dependencies with safe cycle detection simplifies role analysis and automation."
msgstr "**Nova zmogljivost CLI:** Samodejna ločljivost *run_after* odvisnost z varnim zaznavanjem ciklov poenostavlja analizo vloge in avtomatizacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**New and reshaped roles.** *sys-svc-nss* is split out of *sys-hostname*, *web-svc-mirror* serves frontend assets as a privacy proxy, PeerTube becomes clearnet-only, and roles that could not run were deleted rather than repaired. CLI tools install via pip instead of pkgmgr."
msgstr "**Nove in preoblikovane vloge.** *sys-svc-nss* je razdeljena od *sys-hostname*, *web-svc-mirror* uporablja sredstva za varovanje zasebnosti, PeerTube postane samo jasno, vloge, ki jih ni bilo mogoče zagnati, pa so bile izbrisane in ne popravljene. CLI orodja namestite preko pip namesto pkgmgr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**New lint contracts.** Port variables must resolve through lookups, scheduler services must declare *replicas: 1*, and volume-owning stack roles must declare their backup policy. *role_path* is forbidden in shell and command bodies. Deployment-mode defaults, container-inspection resolvers, asynchronous-task rationales and health-check declarations are validated centrally. Hadolint directives and documented *nocheck* exceptions are recognized instead of producing false positives."
msgstr "**Nove pogodbe.** Spremenljivke v pristaniščih se morajo rešiti z iskanjem, storitve voznih redov morajo prijaviti *Replike: 1*, in prostorno lastninski nizov vloge morajo prijaviti svojo varnostno politiko. *role_path* je prepovedano v oklepnih in poveljniških telesih. Privzeti načini uvajanja, reševalci nadzora nad zabojniki, razlogi za asinhronsko nalogo in izjave o zdravstvenem preverjanju se validirajo centralno. direktive o hadolinu in dokumentirane *nocheck* izjeme so priznane, namesto da bi ustvarjale lažne pozitivne učinke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Nextcloud minted a new app password on every run and revoked none.** The name was fixed and managed, so each run that found the stored password rejected added another valid token to the account while every previous one kept full access. The mint is now preceded by a listing and the revocation of every token carrying that name."
msgstr "**Nextcloud je na vsakem zagonu skoval novo geslo za aplikacijo in ga ni preklical.** Ime je bilo fiksirano in upravljano, zato je vsak tek, ki je našel shranjeno geslo zavrnjeno, dodal še en veljaven žeton na račun, medtem ko je vsak prejšnji ohranil popoln dostop. Pred meto je seznam in preklic vseh žetonov s tem imenom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Nginx** (frontend) — static assets + reverse proxy onto Frappe / SocketIO"
msgstr "**Nginx** (Začelje) — statična sredstva + obratni približek na Frappe / Socketio"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No Let's Encrypt for `.onion`** (ACME needs public DNS). Onion transport is already encrypted + server-authenticated (address = pubkey)."
msgstr "**Ne Šifrirajmo za `.onion`** (ACME potrebuje javni DNS). Čebulni transport je že šifriran + strežnik-avtentiran (naslov = pubkey)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No Let's Encrypt** for `.onion` (ACME requires public DNS)."
msgstr "**Ne Šifrirajmo** besedilo `.onion` (ACME zahteva javni DNS)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No Let’s Encrypt** for ``.onion`` (ACME requires public DNS)."
msgstr "**Ne Šifrirajmo** besedilo ``.onion`` (ACME zahteva javni DNS)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No Outbound Surprises:** The upstream app catalog fetch to github.com is disabled. Without ``web-svc-coturn`` the app still falls back to its built-in Google STUN server, since suppressing the variable entirely would leave WebRTC with none at all."
msgstr "**Brez zunanjih presenečenj:** Pridobite gornji katalog aplikacij github.com je onemogočena. brez ``web-svc-coturn`` aplikacija še vedno spada nazaj na vgrajen strežnik Google STUN, saj bi zatiranje spremenljivke v celoti zapustilo WebRTC brez kakršnih koli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No Outbound Surprises:** The upstream app catalog fetch to github.com is disabled. Without `web-svc-coturn` the app still falls back to its built-in Google STUN server, since suppressing the variable entirely would leave WebRTC with none at all."
msgstr "**Brez zunanjih presenečenj:** Pridobite gornji katalog aplikacij github.com je onemogočena. brez `web-svc-coturn` aplikacija še vedno spada nazaj na vgrajen strežnik Google STUN, saj bi zatiranje spremenljivke v celoti zapustilo WebRTC brez kakršnih koli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No allowlist edits** are needed when introducing new make targets, scripts, tooling, or shell shapes (redirects, pipes, env-prefixes, quoted args)."
msgstr "**Ni urejanje seznamov dovoljenj** so potrebni pri uvajanju novih ciljev, skript, orodja, ali lupin oblike (preusmeri, cevi, env-predpone, citirane args)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No clone needed:** `/v1/tree` and `/v1/file` read any path of a ref, `/v1/log` walks its history."
msgstr "**Klon ni potreben:** `/v1/tree` ter `/v1/file` prebral vsako pot sodnika, `/v1/log` hodi svojo zgodovino."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No clone needed:** ``/v1/tree`` and ``/v1/file`` read any path of a ref, ``/v1/log`` walks its history."
msgstr "**Klon ni potreben:** ``/v1/tree`` ter ``/v1/file`` prebral vsako pot sodnika, ``/v1/log`` hodi svojo zgodovino."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No configuration without a key:** the file is written only once URL, key and model list are set."
msgstr "**Ni nastavitev brez ključa:** datoteka je zapisana samo, ko so nastavljeni URL, ključ in model."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No configuration without a key:** the settings file is written only once both the gateway URL and the key are set."
msgstr "**Ni nastavitev brez ključa:** datoteka z nastavitvami je zapisana šele, ko sta nastavljena URL in ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No diff at all** OR **any changed path outside `roles/<role>/...`**: no whitelist is set, so the full deploy across the workflow's scope runs."
msgstr "**Ni razlike.** ALI **katera koli spremenjena pot zunaj `roles/<role>/...`**: ni nastavljena bela lista, tako da je celotna razporeditev preko obsega dela poteka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No external database** - self-contained SQLite under `/config`."
msgstr "**Ni zunanje zbirke podatkov** - samostojni SQLite pod `/config`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No external database** - self-contained SQLite under ``/config``."
msgstr "**Ni zunanje zbirke podatkov** - samostojni SQLite pod ``/config``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No external database.** OpenBao's integrated raft storage owns all state on one persistent volume."
msgstr "**Ni zunanje baze podatkov.** Integrirano skladišče splavov OpenBao ima v lasti vse stanje na enem vztrajnem volumnu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No external database:** Self-contained on a single persistent volume."
msgstr "**Ni zunanje zbirke podatkov:** Samostojen na enem vztrajnem volumnu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No external lookups:** Filters only operate on data you explicitly pass to them and cannot access external files, the Ansible inventory, or runtime context."
msgstr "**Brez zunanjih ogledov:** Filtri delujejo le na podatke, ki jih izrecno prenesete nanje in ne morejo dostopati do zunanjih datotek, inventarja Ansible ali konteksta časa delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No implicit token generation**"
msgstr "**Brez implicitnega ustvarjanja žetonov**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No invented configuration:** the provider setup stays in the application, because its file schema is not documented upstream."
msgstr "**Ni izmišljenih nastavitev:** nastavitev ponudnika ostane v programu, ker njegova shema datotek ni dokumentirana v smeri toka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No new secret store.** Any credential an addon needs continues to be declared in [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`."
msgstr "**Ni nove skrivne trgovine.** Vsako spričevalo, ki ga potrebuje dodatek, se še naprej navaja v [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) `credentials:` in berite preko `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No state changes beyond install:** Does not enable services or write per-user OBS configuration."
msgstr "**Po namestitvi ni sprememb stanja:** Ne omogoča storitev ali zapisa na uporabnika nastavitev OBS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Nocheck directive** — `# nocheck:`, `# noqa:`, `# shellcheck …`, `# type: ignore`, `# pragma: no cover`, etc."
msgstr "**Direktiva o preverjanju** — `# nocheck:`, `# noqa:`, `# shellcheck …`, `# type: ignore`, `# pragma: no cover`, itd."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Node labelling:** In swarm mode the node is labelled ``kata-capable=true``, and sandboxed services are constrained to that label. A deploy without a single such node is refused rather than left pending."
msgstr "**Označevanje vozlišča:** V načinu roja je vozlišče označeno ``kata-capable=true``, in peskovnik storitve so omejene na to oznako. Odprava brez enega samega takega vozlišča je zavrnjena, namesto da bi ostala v pripravljenosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Node labelling:** In swarm mode the node is labelled `kata-capable=true`, and sandboxed services are constrained to that label. A deploy without a single such node is refused rather than left pending."
msgstr "**Označevanje vozlišča:** V načinu roja je vozlišče označeno `kata-capable=true`, in peskovnik storitve so omejene na to oznako. Odprava brez enega samega takega vozlišča je zavrnjena, namesto da bi ostala v pripravljenosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Node labels:** Per-host labels declared via ``swarm_node_labels`` in inventory are applied to the joining node."
msgstr "**Oznake vozlišča:** Oznake na gostitelja, prijavljene preko ``swarm_node_labels`` v popisu se uporabi za spojno vozlišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Node labels:** Per-host labels declared via `swarm_node_labels` in inventory are applied to the joining node."
msgstr "**Oznake vozlišča:** Oznake na gostitelja, prijavljene preko `swarm_node_labels` v popisu se uporabi za spojno vozlišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Node.js Installation:** Installs the latest Node.js version available via the system's package manager."
msgstr "**Node.js Namestitev:** Namesti najnovejše Node.js različica je na voljo preko upravljalnika paketov sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Node.js Installation:** Installs the latest Node.js version available via the system’s package manager."
msgstr "**Node.js Namestitev:** Namesti najnovejše Node.js različica je na voljo preko upravljalnika paketov sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Non-Interactive Operation:** Fully automated using `--non-interactive` and `--agree-tos`."
msgstr "**Neinteraktivna operacija:** Popolnoma avtomatizirana uporaba `--non-interactive` ter `--agree-tos`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Non-Interactive Operation:** Fully automated using ``--non-interactive`` and ``--agree-tos``."
msgstr "**Neinteraktivna operacija:** Popolnoma avtomatizirana uporaba ``--non-interactive`` ter ``--agree-tos``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Non-Invasive:** Does not alter the content of `.profile`."
msgstr "**Neinvazivni:** Ne spremeni vsebine `.profile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Non-Invasive:** Does not alter the content of ``.profile``."
msgstr "**Neinvazivni:** Ne spremeni vsebine ``.profile``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Not every subject is a compose project.** Discourse is built by its own `./launcher rebuild` ([handlers/stack_host.yml](../../../web-app-discourse/handlers/stack_host.yml)) and runs as a plain container with no compose label. The drill treats such a container as a subject whenever it mounts a volume this generation backed up: it is stopped with everything else and started again at the end, and its return is asserted like any other. Left running it would take an `rsync --delete` into its live data directory, and the chain's consumer check — which reads compose labels — would not see it, so the dump replay would race it exactly like the zammad failure this whole change came from."
msgstr "**Ni vsak predmet komponiran projekt.** Razmere gradijo sami `./launcher rebuild` ([handlers/stack_host.yml](../../../web-app-discourse/handlers/stack_host.yml)) in teče kot navadna posoda brez nalepke. Sveder obravnava tako posodo kot predmet, kadarkoli priklopi glasnost te generacije, ki je podprta: ustavi se z vsem drugim in začne znova na koncu, njegov povratek pa se uveljavlja kot vsak drug. Za levo vožnjo bi bilo potrebno `rsync --delete` V svoj imenik podatkov v živo, in preverjanje potrošnikov verige – ki bere komponirane oznake – ga ne bi videli, tako da bi odvržena replay dirke je točno tako kot zammad neuspeh to celotno spremembo prišel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Not for Server Use**: This playbook is not designed for server environments. It is optimized for individual development machines."
msgstr "**Ni za uporabo strežnika**: Ta igralna knjižica ni namenjena za strežniška okolja. Optimiziran je za posamezne razvojne stroje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
