# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Once-per-play idempotency:** Wraps the dispatch in ``when: run_once_update is not defined`` and writes the flag via ``tasks/utils/once/flag.yml``, so repeated invocations within one play are no-ops."
msgstr "**Idejnost enkrat na igro:** Zavije odpremo v ``when: run_once_update is not defined`` in napiše zastavo preko ``tasks/utils/once/flag.yml``, V eni igri se ponavljajo pozivi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Once-per-play idempotency:** Wraps the dispatch in `when: run_once_update is not defined` and writes the flag via `tasks/utils/once/flag.yml`, so repeated invocations within one play are no-ops."
msgstr "**Idejnost enkrat na igro:** Zavije odpremo v `when: run_once_update is not defined` in napiše zastavo preko `tasks/utils/once/flag.yml`, V eni igri se ponavljajo pozivi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One CI chain instead of four workflows.** The deploy workflows collapse into a single chunk chain gated by one validation job, with every variant getting its own row and rotating distro, filesystem and tor axes. Selection tokens pin deploy axes, retriggers reproduce the exact selection of the source run in every mode, and the regular line resumes where the source stopped. Fork code no longer runs with the base repository token, workflow tokens are scoped to the jobs that need them, superseded runs are force-cancelled, and a mid-run budget SIGKILL is counted as skipped rather than green. Apt call sites are bounded so a stalled mirror cannot burn a job budget."
msgstr "**Ena veriga CI namesto štirih delovnih tokov.** Razporeditev delovnih tokov se sesuje v eno verigo delčkov, ki jo vodi ena validacija, pri čemer vsaka različica dobi svojo vrsto in rotira distro, datotečni sistem in tor osi. Izbirni žetoni pin razporejajo osi, retriggerji reproducirajo natančno izbiro izvornega toka v vsakem načinu, redna linija pa se nadaljuje tam, kjer se je vir ustavil. Koda vilice ne deluje več z žetonom baznega skladišča, žetoni za potek dela so vključeni v delovna mesta, ki jih potrebujejo, nadomeščeni pogoni so odklopljeni in srednji proračun SIGKILL se šteje kot preskočiti namesto zelene. Apt klicne strani so omejene, tako da zastalo ogledalo ne more zažgati proračuna za delo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One contract, three flavors.** ``laya`` serves multilingual checkpoints and preloads them at start; ``torch`` runs the GLiFormer checkpoint as published; ``onnx`` exports an int8 graph at build time and needs roughly a quarter of the memory. Every flavor answers the same ``POST /v1/systemone``, so the gateway does not know which one it asked."
msgstr "**Ena pogodba, trije okusi.** ``laya`` služi večjezičnim kontrolnim točkam in jih vnaprej nalaga na začetku; ``torch`` vodi kontrolno točko GLiFormer, kot je objavljena; ``onnx`` izvozi int8 Graf v času gradnje in potrebuje približno četrtino spomina. Vsak okus odgovarja enako. ``POST /v1/systemone``, Zato ne ve, katero je vprašala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One contract, three flavors.** `laya` serves multilingual checkpoints and preloads them at start; `torch` runs the GLiFormer checkpoint as published; `onnx` exports an int8 graph at build time and needs roughly a quarter of the memory. Every flavor answers the same `POST /v1/systemone`, so the gateway does not know which one it asked."
msgstr "**Ena pogodba, trije okusi.** `laya` služi večjezičnim kontrolnim točkam in jih vnaprej nalaga na začetku; `torch` vodi kontrolno točko GLiFormer, kot je objavljena; `onnx` izvozi int8 Graf v času gradnje in potrebuje približno četrtino spomina. Vsak okus odgovarja enako. `POST /v1/systemone`, Zato ne ve, katero je vprašala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One file per addon.** Addon definitions live under `roles/<role>/meta/addons/`, one file per addon at `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`. The file-root convention applies per file: the file content IS the addon spec, with no wrapping `<addon_id>:` key (the filename stem supplies the addon id); all files are collected into `applications.<role_id>.addons` keyed by `<addon_id>` (see [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md)). The materialised path is `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>`, read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."
msgstr "**Ena datoteka na addon.** Opredelitve dodatkov živijo pod `roles/<role>/meta/addons/`, ena datoteka na addon na `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`. Za vsako datoteko velja konvencija o datoteki: vsebina datoteke je addon spec, brez ovoja `<addon_id>:` ključ (Datotečno ime steblo vsebuje addon ID); vse datoteke se zbirajo v `applications.<role_id>.addons` tipka `<addon_id>` (glej [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md)). Materializirana pot je `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>`, berite preko `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One instruction file for every agent.** *AGENTS.md* now holds every agent rule, and *CLAUDE.md* and *GEMINI.md* are gone. The rules they carried bind every runtime anyway, and the PR templates, scope tables, requirement documents and docs that named the old files now name *AGENTS.md*."
msgstr "**En ukaz za vsakega agenta.** *AGENTS.md* Zdaj ima vsak agent pravilo, in *CLAUDE.md* ter *GEMINI.md* Ni jih več. Pravila, ki so jih nosili, tako ali tako zavezujejo vsak čas delovanja, in predloge PR, tabele obsega, dokumenti zahtev in dokumenti, ki so poimenovali stare datoteke zdaj ime *AGENTS.md*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One node key + per-app subdomains** (`<sub>.<NODE_ONION>.onion`), Host-header-routed. No per-app onions in MVP."
msgstr "**Eno vozlišče + poddomene na aplikacijo** (`<sub>.<NODE_ONION>.onion`), Host-header-usmerjen. V MVP ni čebule na app."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One override per tool:** `ACTIONLINT_VERSION`, `HADOLINT_VERSION` and `SHFMT_VERSION` override the pin for a one-off install without editing the role."
msgstr "**Ena prevlada na orodje:** `ACTIONLINT_VERSION`, `HADOLINT_VERSION` ter `SHFMT_VERSION` povozi pin za enkratno namestitev brez urejanja vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
