msgid "**One premise, one place:** A second shared desktop prerequisite is added here rather than in every ``dsk-*`` role."
msgstr "**Ena predpostavka, eno mesto:** Drugi skupni namizje predpogoj je dodan tukaj in ne v vsakem ``dsk-*`` vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
