msgstr "**Enovrstična injekcija skripta**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One-line Script Injection**   Collapses your JavaScript into a single line and injects it via `sub_filter` for minimal footprint and maximal compatibility."
msgstr "**Enovrstična injekcija skripta** Zloži JavaScript v eno vrstico in ga injicira preko `sub_filter` za minimalni odtis in največjo združljivost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Onion opt-in, not a port.** A category-keyed map of booleans naming which of the entity's own categories get a `HiddenServicePort` on the node onion. It declares no numbers: the port is read from `local` when the category is declared there and from `public` otherwise, matching what `container_ports` publishes. Collision detection ignores it."
msgstr "**Čebulo, ne vrata.** Zemljevid boolov, ki je na ključ kategorije in katerega od lastnih kategorij podjetja se imenuje `HiddenServicePort` Na vozlu čebule. Izjavlja brez številk: vrata se bere iz `local` kadar je kategorija prijavljena tam in od `public` sicer se ujema s čim `container_ports` objavlja. Zaznavanje trka ga ignorira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Onions, firewall and name resolution.** *svc-net-firewall* owns the packet filter as one nftables table per role. Tor carries mail to a .onion in both deploy modes, rejects forged sources on the guarded ports, and binds its dnsmasq listeners statically so a failed re-enumeration can no longer drop every one of them. The deployment declares its own address space once, the egress range moved out of the Docker pool, and the container resolver follows the live bridge instead of a guessed address. Every host-bound port requires an explicit onion decision. See [svc-net-firewall](roles/svc-net-firewall/README.md)."
msgstr "**Čebula, požarni zid in rešitev imena.** *svc-net-firewall* ima v lasti paketni filter kot eno tabelo nftables na vlogo. Tor nosi pošto na .onion v obeh načinih uporabe, zavrača ponarejene vire na varovanih pristaniščih, in veže svoje poslušalce dnsmasq statično, tako da neuspešno ponovno oštevilčenje ne more več spustiti vsakega od njih. Razporeditev razglasi svoj naslovni prostor enkrat, razpon egresov se je premaknil iz bazena Docker, reševalec kontejnerjev pa sledi živemu mostu namesto uganjenega naslova. Vsako gostiteljsko pristanišče zahteva izrecno odločitev o čebuli. Glej. [svc-net-firewall](roles/svc-net-firewall/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Only bridging addons add a service block.** A `<target>:` service block is added to the row role ONLY for addons that declare a `bridges:` dependency (per Decision 3), i.e. the in-repo cross-role integrations; a plain addon with no cross-role dependency adds no service block. Each bridging addon's `<target>:` block carries the standard dynamic `enabled`/`shared` flags with matching true/false `meta/variants.yml` coverage, and (for web-facing pairs) a co-deploy Playwright spec. Across the in-repo ✅ set this is a bounded, mechanical expansion scoped to the bridging integrations, accepted as part of Decision 15's full scope."
msgstr "**Samo premostitveni dodatki dodajo servisni blok.** A `<target>:` Servisni blok se doda vlogi vrstice SAMO za dodatke, ki razglašajo `bridges:` odvisnost (na sklep 3), tj. in-repo navzkrižne povezave; navaden dodatek brez navzkrižne odvisnosti ne dodaja nobenega bloka storitev. Vsak premostitveni addon je `<target>:` blok nosi standardno dinamiko `enabled`/`shared` Zastave, ki ustrezajo resničnemu/lažnemu `meta/variants.yml` pokritost in (za parje, ki se obračajo po spletu) Souporaba Playwrighta. Čez in-repo ✅ set to je omejena, mehanska širitev, ki je zajeta v premostitvenih integracijah, sprejetih kot del Sklepa 15Polni obseg."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Only the first start serves nothing.** The env is authoritative again on every start, so what `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS` carries is the state the container comes back with. Before any group exists that is a disabled entry, which is the safe direction: no access rather than every administrator. Once the provisioning task has created the group, its id lives in the token store, `vars/main.yml` reads it back on the next deploy, and the filter renders the entry enabled with its exact group grant. From then on a bare container restart restores a served, correctly scoped connection without a deploy."
msgstr "**Samo prvi začetek ne služi nič.** Env je spet avtoritativen na vsakem začetku. `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS` To je stanje, s katerim se posoda vrača. Preden obstaja katera koli skupina, ki je onemogočen vnos, ki je varna smer: ni dostopa namesto vsakega administratorja. Ko je naloga priprave ustvarila skupino, njena identiteta živi v žetonski trgovini, `vars/main.yml` ga prebere nazaj na naslednji razpored, filter pa omogoča vnos s svojo točno skupinsko donacijo. Odtod na goli posodi ponovno vzpostavi servisirano, pravilno razširjeno povezavo brez uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Only the first start serves nothing.** The env is authoritative again on every start, so what ``TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`` carries is the state the container comes back with. Before any group exists that is a disabled entry, which is the safe direction: no access rather than every administrator. Once the provisioning task has created the group, its id lives in the token store, ``vars/main.yml`` reads it back on the next deploy, and the filter renders the entry enabled with its exact group grant. From then on a bare container restart restores a served, correctly scoped connection without a deploy."
msgstr "**Samo prvi začetek ne služi nič.** Env je spet avtoritativen na vsakem začetku. ``TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`` To je stanje, s katerim se posoda vrača. Preden obstaja katera koli skupina, ki je onemogočen vnos, ki je varna smer: ni dostopa namesto vsakega administratorja. Ko je naloga priprave ustvarila skupino, njena identiteta živi v žetonski trgovini, ``vars/main.yml`` ga prebere nazaj na naslednji razpored, filter pa omogoča vnos s svojo točno skupinsko donacijo. Odtod na goli posodi ponovno vzpostavi servisirano, pravilno razširjeno povezavo brez uporabe."

