# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at `/openbao/policies/`, because OpenBao parses *every* file under `-config` as server configuration. Storage is `/openbao/file`, not `/openbao/data`: the image pre-chowns only `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` for the non-root `openbao` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. `command:` is just `server` — the entrypoint appends `-config` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Poti, ki so videti napačne in niso.** Vklop politik `/openbao/policies/`, ker OpenBao parze *vsak* datoteka `-config` kot nastavitve strežnika. Shranjevanje `/openbao/file`, ne `/openbao/data`: slika samo predpodoba `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` za nekorenine `openbao` uporabnik, tako da obseg drugje zemljišča korenine v lasti in splav ne more pisati. `command:` je samo `server` — vstopne točke `-config` Sam, in mimo njega podvaja zastavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at ``/openbao/policies/``, because OpenBao parses *every* file under ``-config`` as server configuration. Storage is ``/openbao/file``, not ``/openbao/data``: the image pre-chowns only ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` for the non-root ``openbao`` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. ``command:`` is just ``server`` — the entrypoint appends ``-config`` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Poti, ki so videti napačne in niso.** Vklop politik ``/openbao/policies/``, ker OpenBao parze *vsak* datoteka ``-config`` kot nastavitve strežnika. Shranjevanje ``/openbao/file``, ne ``/openbao/data``: slika samo predpodoba ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` za nekorenine ``openbao`` uporabnik, tako da obseg drugje zemljišča korenine v lasti in splav ne more pisati. ``command:`` je samo ``server`` — vstopne točke ``-config`` Sam, in mimo njega podvaja zastavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Each consumer gets a role and user scoped to its own `<entity>-*` index namespace."
msgstr "**Izolacija na potrošnika:** Vsak potrošnik dobi svojo vlogo in uporabnik ima svoje področje uporabe `<entity>-*` indeksni imenski prostor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Each consumer gets a role and user scoped to its own ``<entity>-*`` index namespace."
msgstr "**Izolacija na potrošnika:** Vsak potrošnik dobi svojo vlogo in uporabnik ima svoje področje uporabe ``<entity>-*`` indeksni imenski prostor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Issues a scoped API key per consumer, restricted to its own collection namespace."
msgstr "**Izolacija na potrošnika:** Izdaja področja uporabe API ključ na potrošnika, omejen na lastni imenski prostor za zbiranje podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** OSS Qdrant has no per-user auth; each consumer is isolated by the collection-name prefix ``{entity}_``."
msgstr "**Izolacija na potrošnika:** OSS Qdrant nima auth na uporabnika; vsak potrošnik je izoliran s predpono ime zbiranja ``{entity}_``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** OSS Qdrant has no per-user auth; each consumer is isolated by the collection-name prefix `{entity}_`."
msgstr "**Izolacija na potrošnika:** OSS Qdrant nima auth na uporabnika; vsak potrošnik je izoliran s predpono ime zbiranja `{entity}_`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` or `/roles/web-app-kix/user` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. The `user` role is declared via `meta/rbac.yml` so non-admin agents can be granted helpdesk access without bumping them to global administrator."
msgstr "**Na app RBAC:** Člani `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` ali `/roles/web-app-kix/user` so sprejeti v KIXDrugi uporabniki so blokirani na OAuth2 Proxy. – `user` vloga je deklarirana preko `meta/rbac.yml` tako, da se lahko agentom, ki niso skrbniki, odobri dostop do službe za pomoč uporabnikom, ne da bi jih zaleteli v globalnega administratorja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of ``/roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` or ``/roles/web-app-kix/user`` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. The ``user`` role is declared via ``meta/rbac.yml`` so non-admin agents can be granted helpdesk access without bumping them to global administrator."
msgstr "**Na app RBAC:** Člani ``/roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` ali ``/roles/web-app-kix/user`` so sprejeti v KIXDrugi uporabniki so blokirani na OAuth2 Proxy. – ``user`` vloga je deklarirana preko ``meta/rbac.yml`` tako, da se lahko agentom, ki niso skrbniki, odobri dostop do službe za pomoč uporabnikom, ne da bi jih zaleteli v globalnega administratorja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-consumer isolation:** Every consumer receives its own identity and bucket with bucket-scoped actions only."
msgstr "**Izolacija na potrošnika:** Vsak potrošnik dobi svojo identiteto in vedro samo z dejanji, ki jih nadzoruje vedro."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-consumer virtual keys:** Each consuming application receives its own virtual key, created through the gateway admin API under an alias naming that application."
msgstr "**Virtualni ključi na potrošnika:** Vsaka uporaba prejme svoj virtualni ključ, ustvarjen prek portala admin API pod psevdonimom, ki navaja navedeno vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-container snapshots:** rsync `--link-dest` snapshots deduplicate unchanged files across runs."
msgstr "**Fotografije na zabojnik:** rsync `--link-dest` Posnetki deduplicirajo nespremenjene datoteke v teku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-container snapshots:** rsync ``--link-dest`` snapshots deduplicate unchanged files across runs."
msgstr "**Fotografije na zabojnik:** rsync ``--link-dest`` Posnetki deduplicirajo nespremenjene datoteke v teku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-domain TLS via app-level override**: extra public domains under `applications.<app>.server.domains` deploy as additional HTTPS vhosts; flavor from `applications.<app>.tls.mode` (default `TLS_MODE`). `.onion` → always HTTP. No per-domain TLS map."
msgstr "**TLS na dom prek preklopa na ravni aplikacije**: dodatne javne domene pod `applications.<app>.server.domains` uporabljati kot dodatne HTTPS vhosts; okus iz `applications.<app>.tls.mode` (privzeto `TLS_MODE`). `.onion` → vedno HTTP. Ni zemljevida TLS na dom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-family dispatch:** Routes by ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` so the caller never has to gate the role with a ``when:`` clause."
msgstr "**Odpošiljanje po družini:** Poti mimo ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` da klicatelju nikoli ne bo treba igrati z ``when:`` klavzula."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-family dispatch:** Routes by `ansible_facts['distribution']` so the caller never has to gate the role with a `when:` clause."
msgstr "**Odpošiljanje po družini:** Poti mimo `ansible_facts['distribution']` da klicatelju nikoli ne bo treba igrati z `when:` klavzula."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-IN** on a non-swarm host: explicitly rejected. Swarm mode is exclusively triggered by group membership. The per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` override only opts OUT on a swarm host, never opts IN on a non-swarm host."
msgstr "**Per-role opt-IN** na netoplega gostitelja: izrecno zavrnjen. Swarm način se sproži izključno zaradi članstva v skupini. Na rolo `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` Preglasi se samo za gostitelja roja, nikoli pa se ne odloči za netoplega gostitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-OUT** on a swarm host: a role MAY override `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` in its `vars/main.yml` to stay on the compose path even when the host is in `svc-swarm-node`. Role vars win over `group_vars/all` by Ansible precedence."
msgstr "**Opt-OUT na rolo** na gostitelja roja: vloga LAHKO prevlada `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` v svojem `vars/main.yml` ostati na sestavljeni poti tudi, ko je gostitelj `svc-swarm-node`. Vloga vars zmago čez `group_vars/all` z Ansible prednost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-round variant selection.** In round R every primary app uses variant index `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. So a single-variant app stays on variant 0 in every round, and a 3-variant app in a 5-round deploy follows `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`."
msgstr "**Per-round variantna izbira.** V krogu R vsaka primarna aplikacija uporablja variantni indeks `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. Torej aplikacija z eno spremenljivko ostane na varianti 0 v vsaki rundi in a 3-različica aplikacija v 5- Okrogla razporeditev sledi `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Performance Enhancement:** Ensures adequate swap space for optimal system performance."
msgstr "**Izboljšanje učinkovitosti:** Zagotavlja primeren prostor za zamenjavo za optimalno delovanje sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Performance Optimization:** Improves overall system performance by leveraging appropriate storage media."
msgstr "**Optimizacija delovanja:** Izboljša splošno delovanje sistema s spodbujanjem ustreznih nosilcev podatkov za shranjevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Performance trade‑off:** While slightly more storage might be used compared to `latin1`, the universality of `utf8mb4` outweighs the cost for most deployments."
msgstr "**Poravnava uspešnosti:** Medtem ko se lahko uporabi nekoliko več shranjevanja v primerjavi z `latin1`, univerzalnost `utf8mb4` odtehta stroške večine napotitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Permissions:** Ensure you have the necessary permissions and rights within the Docker container to perform these actions."
msgstr "**Dovoljenja:** Zagotovite, da imate potrebna dovoljenja in pravice v zabojniku Docker za izvajanje teh dejanj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persisted on the deploy target** for `INFINITO_VERSION`, written by the [sys-version](../../../roles/sys-version/) role."
msgstr "**Vztrajno na cilju** besedilo `INFINITO_VERSION`, ki jo je napisal [sys-version](../../../roles/sys-version/) vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent Timers:** Optionally enables persistent timer behavior to ensure missed activations are handled."
msgstr "**Vztrajni časovniki:** Neobvezno omogoča trdovratno vedenje časovnika, da se zagotovi ravnanje z zamujeno aktivacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent agent data:** Agent state is stored in a named volume mounted at `/opt/data`, which the Backup Docker Volumes service captures without stopping the container."
msgstr "**Podatki o obstojnem agentu:** Zastopniško stanje se hrani v navedeni prostornini, nameščeni na `/opt/data`, ki Backup Docker Volumes zajemanje storitev brez ustavljanja posode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
