# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent configuration:** Mounts `/config` as a named volume and hands it to the container backup service when volume backups are part of the deployment."
msgstr "**Vztrajna nastavitev:** Priklopniki `/config` kot imenovani volumen in ga izročijo rezervni službi zabojnika, kadar so varnostne kopije glasnosti del razporeditve."

