# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent state:** Memory and workspace live in a volume mounted at `/home/node/.openclaw`, with the rendered `openclaw.json` mounted into it, and are included in the container volume backup when that service is deployed."
msgstr "**Vztrajno stanje:** Spomin in delovni prostor živita v prostornini, pritrjeni na `/home/node/.openclaw`, s preslikanim `openclaw.json` vgrajeni vanj in so vključeni v rezervo za prostornino posode, ko se ta storitev uporablja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent state:** Memory and workspace live in a volume mounted at ``/home/node/.openclaw``, with the rendered ``openclaw.json`` mounted into it, and are included in the container volume backup when that service is deployed."
