# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent store:** Proxied artefacts live in a named volume, so a redeploy reuses what earlier runs already pulled."
msgstr "**Trajna trgovina:** Proxied artefakti živijo v imenovanem obsegu, tako da redeploy ponovno uporabi tisto, kar je prej teče že potegnil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent:** ``nftables.service`` loads every fragment at boot, so rules outlive a reboot without a unit of this project’s own. The ruleset it reads is a distribution decision, so the path follows ``os_family``: RedHat reads ``/etc/sysconfig/nftables.conf``, the others ``/etc/nftables.conf``."
msgstr "**Vztrajen:** ``nftables.service`` naloži vsak delček ob škorenj, tako da izključuje podvajanje ponovni zagon brez enote tega projekta. Pravila, ki jih bere, so odločitev o razdelitvi, zato sledi pot ``os_family``: RedHat bere ``/etc/sysconfig/nftables.conf``, drugi ``/etc/nftables.conf``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent:** `nftables.service` loads every fragment at boot, so rules outlive a reboot without a unit of this project's own. The ruleset it reads is a distribution decision, so the path follows `os_family`: RedHat reads `/etc/sysconfig/nftables.conf`, the others `/etc/nftables.conf`."
msgstr "**Vztrajen:** `nftables.service` Napolni vsak delček ob škornju, tako da je izključen ponovni zagon brez enote tega projekta. Pravila, ki jih bere, so odločitev o razdelitvi, zato sledi pot `os_family`: RedHat bere `/etc/sysconfig/nftables.conf`, drugi `/etc/nftables.conf`."

