# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Personal Attacks:** Avoid personal insults or demeaning comments toward any contributor or participant."
msgstr "**Osebni napadi:** Ogibajte se osebnih žalitev ali ponižujoče pripombe do katerega koli prispevajoča ali udeleženca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Physical safety is the operator's responsibility, and the role MUST say so.** This role does NOT mandate an emergency-stop or motion rate-limits as a platform acceptance criterion. Because an agent driving motors/actuators can cause physical harm, the README MUST prominently warn that hardware safety (e-stop, current/motion limits, fail-safe wiring) is the operator's responsibility and is out of the platform's scope. The role MUST NOT claim any safety guarantee it does not enforce."
msgstr "**Fizična varnost je odgovornost izvajalca, in vloga mora povedati.** Ta vloga NE zahteva omejitev stopnje zasilnega ustavljanja ali gibanja kot merila sprejemljivosti platforme. Ker lahko agent, ki vozi motorje/aktivatorje, povzroči fizično škodo, mora README vidno opozoriti, da je varnost strojne opreme (e-ustavljanje, omejitve tokov/motorjev, varovalna napeljava) je odgovoren operater in ne spada v področje uporabe platforme. Vloga NE SME uveljavljati nobene varnostne garancije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pin**: a concrete stable v15.x semver (no `:latest`, no `:edge`, no v14 LTS, no v16 pre-release line)."
msgstr "**Pin**: beton stabilna v15.x semver (ni `:latest`, ne `:edge`, ni v14 LTS, ni v16 Linija pred sprostitvijo)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pin**: a concrete stable v15.x semver (no ``:latest``, no ``:edge``, no v14 LTS, no v16 pre-release line)."
msgstr "**Pin**: beton stabilna v15.x semver (ni ``:latest``, ne ``:edge``, ni v14 LTS, ni v16 Linija pred sprostitvijo)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned and verified:** the AppImage version and its sha256 live in the role, and a mismatch aborts the deploy."
msgstr "**Okovano in preverjeno:** različica AppImage in njena ša256 živijo v vlogi in neskladje prekine uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned tool surface:** ``files/mcp/tools.json`` holds the 24 read-only tools captured from the sidecar, pinned twice: ``tools.schema_sha256`` over the parsed mapping the adapter rehashes at startup, and ``adapter.specification_sha256`` over the file bytes."
msgstr "**Površina okovja:** ``files/mcp/tools.json`` ima 24 orodja, ki se uporabljajo samo za branje in so zajeta iz stranske prikolice, pripeta dvakrat: ``tools.schema_sha256`` nad razčlenjeno kartiranje adapter rehaše ob zagonu, in ``adapter.specification_sha256`` preko bajtov datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned tool surface:** `files/mcp/tools.json` holds the 24 read-only tools captured from the sidecar, pinned twice: `tools.schema_sha256` over the parsed mapping the adapter rehashes at startup, and `adapter.specification_sha256` over the file bytes."
msgstr "**Površina okovja:** `files/mcp/tools.json` ima 24 orodja, ki se uporabljajo samo za branje in so zajeta iz stranske prikolice, pripeta dvakrat: `tools.schema_sha256` nad razčlenjeno kartiranje adapter rehaše ob zagonu, in `adapter.specification_sha256` preko bajtov datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned upstream client:** Build the ``social-app`` web client from a pinned tag so the broker’s ``BSKY_STORAGE`` handoff stays in sync with the upstream persistence schema."
msgstr "**Odjemalec na začetku:** Zgradi ``social-app`` spletni odjemalec iz pripeto značko tako posrednik je ``BSKY_STORAGE`` Predaja ostane usklajena s shemo vztrajnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned upstream client:** Build the `social-app` web client from a pinned tag so the broker's `BSKY_STORAGE` handoff stays in sync with the upstream persistence schema."
msgstr "**Odjemalec na začetku:** Zgradi `social-app` spletni odjemalec s pripete oznake, tako da posrednik je `BSKY_STORAGE` Predaja ostane usklajena s shemo vztrajnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinning rounds (single or bundle).** Both init and deploy accept `--variant <csv>` (same semantics as the `variant=` make arg): a single index (`1`) pins one round, a comma-separated list (`0,1,2`) iterates that subset, and empty/unset is the full matrix. When the selection is a single round no inter-round cleanup runs (no previous round to diff against); out-of-range indices raise a clean error. The `make compose-deploy mode=update` flows honour the same `variant=` arg by suffixing `INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR` / `INFINITO_INVENTORY_FILE` to `<base>-<idx>` (single index), so a redeploy can target one specific variant without iterating the full matrix."
msgstr "**Krogi za vrtanje (enojna ali pramenska).** Tako init in napoti sprejeti `--variant <csv>` (iste semantike kot `variant=` Naredite arg): en indeks (`1`) čepi eno okroglo, z vejico ločen seznam (`0,1,2`) iterira to podskupino in prazno/izklopljeno je polna matrika. Ko je izbor en krog, ni medosno čiščenje teče (ni predhodnega kroga za diff proti); indeksi izven dosega dvignejo čisto napako. – `make compose-deploy mode=update` teče čast enako `variant=` org s pripono `INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR` / `INFINITO_INVENTORY_FILE` do `<base>-<idx>` (en indeks), tako da redeploy lahko cilja na eno določeno varianto brez iteracije polno matrico."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pins that cannot age unnoticed.** Image pins are classified and pull references built from the class, a moving tag declares itself with the marker it already carries, and a role's images move as one release or not at all. The updater reads addon declarations, orders vendor patch counters and five-component versions, reads a release line written before the number as a family, and now also watches pinned pip requirements and Ansible collections. Seven roles moved off the Debian codename base onto slim, and one Ubuntu mirror list with failover, a short timeout and a health test serves both the package cache and the image builds. *js-yaml* was lifted to 4.3.2 for GHSA-2883-xcg3-v3hh."
msgstr "**Pins, ki se ne morejo neopaženo starati.** Slike zatiči so razvrščeni in potegnite reference, zgrajene iz razreda, premikajoča se značka se razglasi z označevalcem, ki ga že nosi, in slike vloge se premikajo kot ena sprostitev ali pa sploh ne. Posodobitelj prebere izjave o dodatkih, naroči števce za obliže prodajalcev in pet-komponentne različice, prebere vrstico za sprostitev, napisano pred številko kot družina, zdaj pa gleda tudi ukleščene zahteve za pip in Ansible zbirke. Sedem vlog se je premaknilo iz baze Debian Codename na tanko, in en Ubuntu zrcalni seznam z neuspehom, kratek odmor in zdravstveni test služi tako predpomnilnik paket in slike gradi. *js-jaml* je bil dvignjen na 4.3.2 za GHSA-2883-xcg3- V3Hh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pip Installation:** Installs python-pip if not already present."
msgstr "**Namestitev Pip:** Namesti piton- pip, če ni že prisoten."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Playwright exemption:** these are desktop browser extensions with no in-app web surface to drive, so they are exempt from the per-addon Playwright spec (requirement 026, Decision 11)."
msgstr "**Izjema predvajanja:** To so razširitve namiznega brskalnika brez spletne površine v aplikaciji za pogon, zato so izvzeti iz specifikacije po Addon Playwright (zahteva 026, Sklep 11)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Plug-triggered:** a systemd `.mount` unit fires the backup service the moment the device appears, so backups happen without an interactive command."
msgstr "**vtisnjeno:** sistemd `.mount` Enota izstreli rezervno službo takoj, ko se naprava pojavi, tako da se varnostne kopije zgodijo brez interaktivnega ukaza."

