# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**PostgreSQL database:** all data including attachments stored in the database, no extra volumes needed."
msgstr "**Podatkovna zbirka PostgreSQL:** vsi podatki, vključno s prilogami, shranjenimi v bazi podatkov, niso potrebni dodatni volumni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Postgres backend:** Workflow definitions, execution history, and user data persist in the central ``svc-db-postgres``."
msgstr "**Hrbtenica Postgres:** Definicije delovnega toka, zgodovina izvajanja in podatki uporabnikov ostajajo v središču ``svc-db-postgres``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Postgres backend:** Workflow definitions, execution history, and user data persist in the central `svc-db-postgres`."
msgstr "**Hrbtenica Postgres:** Definicije delovnega toka, zgodovina izvajanja in podatki uporabnikov ostajajo v središču `svc-db-postgres`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Power-aware Configuration:** Differentiates between battery, AC power, and docked state."
msgstr "**Nastavitve programske opreme:** Diferenciate med baterijo, AC energijo in zasidrano stanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Powerful Search:** Full-text and structured search to quickly find knowledge across spaces."
msgstr "**Mogočno iskanje:** Celotno besedilo in strukturirano iskanje za hitro iskanje znanja po prostorih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Practice Professionalism:** Use clear and professional language in all communications. Maintain focus on ideas and project goals rather than personal attributes."
msgstr "**Prakse Strokovnost:** Uporabljajte jasen in profesionalen jezik v vseh komunikacijah. Ohranjajte osredotočenost na ideje in projektne cilje namesto osebnih atributov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pre-installed plugin set:** Bake build-pipeline, credentials, and SCM plugins into the image so first start-up does not block on plugin downloads."
msgstr "**Prednameščeni nabor vstavkov:** Bake build-pipeline, poverilnice, in SCM plugins v sliko, tako da prvi zagon ne blokira vstavkov prenosov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Prefers Python 3.11+:** Installs Python 3.11+ where available and makes it the default via `/usr/local/bin/python3` and `/usr/local/bin/pip3`."
msgstr "**Preferira Python 3.11+:** Namesti Python 3.11+ če je na voljo in omogoča privzeto preko `/usr/local/bin/python3` ter `/usr/local/bin/pip3`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Prefers Python 3.11+:** Installs Python 3.11+ where available and makes it the default via ``/usr/local/bin/python3`` and ``/usr/local/bin/pip3``."
msgstr "**Preferira Python 3.11+:** Namesti Python 3.11+ če je na voljo in omogoča privzeto preko ``/usr/local/bin/python3`` ter ``/usr/local/bin/pip3``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Preloaded models:** Every entry of ``services.lmstudio.preload_models`` is downloaded on the hosting node with ``lms get --gguf``, overlapped and reaped like the Ollama pre-pull. Each entry carries the ``source`` repository to download, the ``quant`` variant to take from it, the ``name`` LM Studio indexes that repository under and the gateway addresses it by, and the ``alias`` the gateway publishes it as. ``source`` is a full Hugging Face URL, never a search term: a search term resolves to whichever model the catalogue lists first. ``quant`` is appended as ``@<variant>`` and is required: without it LM Studio picks the variant itself, and the ``file``, ``sha256`` and ``bytes`` the entry declares then describe a guess that the store check and the download budget are both measured against."
msgstr "**Prednaloženi modeli:** Vsak vnos ``services.lmstudio.preload_models`` prenese na vozlišče gostitelja z ``lms get --gguf``, prekriva in žanje kot Ollama Pre-pull. Vsak vnos ima ``source`` odložišče za prenos, ``quant`` varianto, da bi iz nje, ``name`` LM Studio indeksira, da repozitorij pod in prehod naslovi, in ``alias`` portal ga objavi kot. ``source`` je polno Hughing Face URL, nikoli iskalni izraz: iskalni izraz se reši na kateri model katalog seznamov prvi. ``quant`` je priložen kot ``@<variant>`` in se zahteva: brez nje LM Studio izbere varianto sama, in ``file``, ``sha256`` ter ``bytes`` Vnos izjavlja, da je nato opisano ugibanje, da se preverjanje skladišča in proračun za prenos merita na podlagi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Preloaded models:** Every entry of `services.lmstudio.preload_models` is downloaded on the hosting node with `lms get --gguf`, overlapped and reaped like the Ollama pre-pull. Each entry carries the `source` repository to download, the `quant` variant to take from it, the `name` LM Studio indexes that repository under and the gateway addresses it by, and the `alias` the gateway publishes it as. `source` is a full Hugging Face URL, never a search term: a search term resolves to whichever model the catalogue lists first. `quant` is appended as `@<variant>` and is required: without it LM Studio picks the variant itself, and the `file`, `sha256` and `bytes` the entry declares then describe a guess that the store check and the download budget are both measured against."
msgstr "**Prednaloženi modeli:** Vsak vnos `services.lmstudio.preload_models` prenese na vozlišče gostitelja z `lms get --gguf`, prekriva in žanje kot Ollama Pre-pull. Vsak vnos ima `source` odložišče za prenos, `quant` varianto, da bi iz nje, `name` LM Studio indeksira, da repozitorij pod in prehod naslovi, in `alias` portal ga objavi kot. `source` je polno Hughing Face URL, nikoli iskalni izraz: iskalni izraz se reši na kateri model katalog seznamov prvi. `quant` je priložen kot `@<variant>` in se zahteva: brez nje LM Studio izbere varianto sama, in `file`, `sha256` ter `bytes` Vnos izjavlja, da je nato opisano ugibanje, da se preverjanje skladišča in proračun za prenos merita na podlagi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pretix Installation:** Deploys Pretix in a dedicated Docker container."
msgstr "**Namestitev Pretix:** Namesti Pretix v posvečeni posodi Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Priority first, never mixed.** Priority rows sort to the head of the list and the split forces a chunk boundary at the priority/regular seam, so a chunk is either all priority or all regular. The seam chunk stays short rather than being topped up with regular rows -- that is what guarantees every priority row is done before the first regular one starts. Priority is never subject to the sweep offset: it leads every sweep."
msgstr "**Najprej prednost, nikoli mešana.** Prednostne vrstice razvrstijo na glavo seznama in razcepi sile del meje na prednostni/redni šiv, tako da je delček bodisi vse prednostne ali vse redne. Košček šivov ostane kratek, namesto da bi bil dopolnjen z rednimi vrstami -- to je tisto, kar zagotavlja, da se vsaka prednostna vrsta opravi pred začetkom prve redne. Prioriteta ni nikoli predmet izravnave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Privacy & Moderation:** Fine-grained controls for content visibility, moderation, and federation settings."
msgstr "**& Zmernost zasebnosti:** Fino grajene kontrole za vsebinsko vidljivost, zmernost in nastavitve zveze."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Privacy-First:** Enjoy a self-hosted solution that prioritizes data ownership and privacy."
msgstr "**Zasebnost-Prvič:** Uživajte v samogostoljubni rešitvi, ki daje prednost lastništvu podatkov in zasebnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Privacy-First:** Self-hosted solution ensures data ownership and GDPR-compliance."
msgstr "**Zasebnost-Prvič:** Samogostujoča rešitev zagotavlja lastništvo podatkov in skladnost z GDPR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Privacy-friendly**: all generation happens client-side; no data leaves your server."
msgstr "**Zasebnost prijazna**: vse generacije zgodi na strani odjemalca; noben podatek ne zapusti vašega strežnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Privacy-friendly**: no server-side state, no tracking, all logic runs in the browser."
msgstr "**Zasebnost prijazna**: brez stanja na strani strežnika, brez sledenja, vsa logika teče v brskalniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Project Management:** Plan and track projects with Gantt charts, Kanban boards, and time tracking. Integrate with sales and invoicing for complete project billing."
msgstr "**Upravljanje projekta:** Načrtovati in slediti projekte z Gantt grafikone, Kanban plošče, in sledenje času. Povezovati s prodajo in izdajanjem računov za popolno zaračunavanje projektov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**PromQL interface:** Query and explore metrics via the Prometheus web UI."
msgstr "**Vmesnik PromQL:** Poizvedovanje in raziskovanje metrike preko Prometheus spletni UI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Prometheus ran with no `--query.timeout`**, so a query the adapter abandoned after 15s kept the server busy for its two-minute default, and a range query's point count was unbounded although the response was truncated to 100 rows. The timeout is now derived from `mcp.limits.timeout_seconds`, and `policy.assert_range` refuses a range whose point count exceeds the contract's `result_items`, naming the smallest step that would fit."
msgstr "**Prometej je tekel brez `--query.timeout`**, tako poizvedba adapter opuščen po 15s ohranil strežnik zaseden za svojo dvominutno privzeto, in število točk poizvedbe razpona je bilo nevezano, čeprav je bil odgovor okrnjen na 100 Vrstice. Zakasnitev zdaj izhaja iz `mcp.limits.timeout_seconds`, in `policy.assert_range` zavrne obseg, katerega število točk presega vrednost naročila `result_items`, imenuje najmanjši korak, ki bi ustrezal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Prometheus** metrics support"
msgstr "**Prometej** metrična podpora"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Proprietary Driver Installation**"
msgstr "**Lastniška namestitev gonilnika**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Proprietary Driver Installation**   Installs the latest non-free GPU driver (e.g., NVIDIA, AMD) provided through Arch’s `mhwd` system."
msgstr "**Lastniška namestitev gonilnika** Namesti najnovejši GPU gonilnik, ki ni prost (npr. NVIDIA, AMD) zagotovljena prek Arch's `mhwd` sistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pros:**"
msgstr "**Prednosti:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Protected by this:** `git commit*`, `git push*`, `docker run*`, `docker build*`, `docker push*`, `docker login*`, every mutating `gh` verb, and every non-GET `gh api` call. Each would be destructive or externally visible if executed without review."
msgstr "**Zaščiten s tem:** `git commit*`, `git push*`, `docker run*`, `docker build*`, `docker push*`, `docker login*`, vse mutanije `gh` glagol in vsak ne-GET `gh api` Pokliči. Vsaka bi bila uničujoča ali navzven vidna, če bi bila izvedena brez pregleda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Proxy-aware:** Exposes HTTP on localhost, picked up by front proxy role."
msgstr "**Pomnilniška oprema:** Razkrije HTTP na krajevnega gostitelja, ki ga je prevzela sprednja vloga posrednika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Public Key Output:** Displays and outputs the generated public SSH key."
msgstr "**Izhod javnega ključa:** Prikaže in prikaže ustvarjen javni ključ SSH."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Public-facing host port.** Bound on `0.0.0.0` and exposed to the public internet (or to whatever the operator's firewall allows). Same uniqueness rule as `local`."
msgstr "**Javno obrnjeno gostiteljsko pristanišče.** Vstavi `0.0.0.0` in izpostavljen javnemu internetu (ali za vse, kar operatorjev požarni zid omogoča). Enako pravilo edinstvenosti kot `local`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Published tool schemas were a suggestion, not a boundary.** An argument the contract does not name was appended to the upstream request as a query parameter, and a tool declaring no schema accepted anything. Arguments are now validated against the contract, after the size ceiling so a large payload is still refused for being large."
msgstr "**Objavljene sheme orodja so bile predlog, ne meja.** Argument, ki ga pogodba ne imenuje, je bil dodan zahtevi na začetku kot parameter poizvedbe, in orodje, ki navaja, da ni shema sprejela ničesar. Argumenti so zdaj potrjeni glede na pogodbo, po zgornji meji velikosti, tako da je velik tovor še vedno zavrnjen zaradi velikega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pull-only trust model:** the local host owns the SSH session; provider hosts never gain credentials on this side."
msgstr "**Model zaupanja samo za vlečenje:** lokalni gostitelj je lastnik seje SSH; ponudnik gostitelj nikoli ne pridobi poverilnic na tej strani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Purpose**"
msgstr "**Namen**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Purpose:**   Handles \"normal\" web traffic such as HTML pages, API endpoints, and general HTTP(S) requests."
msgstr "**Namen:** Ročaji \"normal\" spletni promet, kot so strani HTML, API končne točke in splošni HTTP(S) zahteve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Purpose:**   Handles WebSocket connections, enabling real-time features such as live updates or chats."
msgstr "**Namen:** Upravlja povezave WebSocket, kar omogoča funkcije v realnem času, kot so posodobitve v živo ali klepeti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Purpose:**   Proxies and caches static media files (images, icons, etc.)."
msgstr "**Namen:** Proksije in predpomnilniki statičnih medijskih datotek (slike, ikone itd.)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Python-based Install:** Installs ``dockreap`` (isolated, system-friendly CLI install)."
msgstr "**Namesti na osnovi Pythona:** Namesti ``dockreap`` (izoliran, sistemsko prijazen CLI namestitev)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Python-based Install:** Installs `dockreap` (isolated, system-friendly CLI install)."
msgstr "**Namesti na osnovi Pythona:** Namesti `dockreap` (izoliran, sistemsko prijazen CLI namestitev)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Qdrant ran with no authentication at all.** Its environment set the HTTP port and disabled telemetry, so every container reaching its network held full read, write and delete access to every collection, and the surface's read-only promise rested entirely on the adapter's contract naming only GET routes. The engine now declares `read_only_api_key`, the adapter presents it, and a write route is refused by the engine rather than only by the adapter."
msgstr "**Qdrant je tekel brez avtentikacije.** Njegovo okolje je nastavilo vrata HTTP in onemogočeno telemetrijo, tako da je vsaka posoda, ki doseže svoje omrežje, v celoti brala, pisala in izbrisala dostop do vsake zbirke, in samo površinska obljuba za branje je v celoti temeljila na pogodbi adapterja samo na poti GET. Motor zdaj razglaša `read_only_api_key`, adapter ga predstavi, in pisanje pot je zavrnil motor in ne samo adapter."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Queue clock.** GitHub cancels a job that sat queued for ``INFINITO_CI_QUEUE_HOURS``. With ``INFINITO_CI_CONCURRENCY`` runners free and every job assumed to burn its full ``timeout-minutes``, a chunk drains in waves, and the last wave that still starts inside the queue window is ``floor(queue_hours / job_timeout)``. A chunk therefore holds at most ``concurrency * waves`` jobs. Assuming every job runs to its timeout is deliberately pessimistic -- no job can outlast it -- so the drain estimate can only overshoot, never undershoot."
msgstr "**V vrsto.** GitHub prekliče delo, ki je čakalo v vrsti ``INFINITO_CI_QUEUE_HOURS``. z ``INFINITO_CI_CONCURRENCY`` tekači so svobodni in vsako delo naj bi sežgalo. ``timeout-minutes``, delček odteka v valovih, in zadnji val, ki se še vedno začne znotraj okna čakalne vrste je ``floor(queue_hours / job_timeout)``. Del zato drži največ ``concurrency * waves`` službe. Ob predpostavki, da vsako delo teče do časovnega premora, je namerno pesimistično -- nobeno delo ga ne more preseči -- tako da lahko ocena odvoda le prekorači, nikoli ne preseže."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Quick Setup** – the deploy commands, from the role id (invokable roles"
msgstr "**Hitra nastavitev** – uporabo ukazov, iz ID vloge (Zastavljive vloge"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Quick links for games**: navbar entries for selected games (e.g. platformer, pong, space shooter)."
msgstr "**Hitre povezave za igre**: vnosi navbar za izbrane igre (npr. platformer, pong, vesoljski strelec)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Quick links for games**: navbar entries for selected games (e.g. platformer, pong, space shooter)."
msgstr "**Hitre povezave za igre**: vnosi navbar za izbrane igre (npr. platformer, pong, vesoljski strelec)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Quiet and Safe Operation:** Uses `--quiet` and `--agree-tos` flags to ensure non-interactive renewals."
msgstr "**Tiho in varno delovanje:** Uporaba `--quiet` ter `--agree-tos` zastave za zagotovitev neinteraktivne obnove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Quiet and Safe Operation:** Uses ``--quiet`` and ``--agree-tos`` flags to ensure non-interactive renewals."
msgstr "**Tiho in varno delovanje:** Uporaba ``--quiet`` ter ``--agree-tos`` zastave za zagotovitev neinteraktivne obnove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**RBAC gate:** A user needs the ``agent-user`` role of ``web-app-hermes`` or ``web-app-openclaw``. Open WebUI lists each agent model only to that group, and the broker refuses any other caller with HTTP 403 and stops a running agent of a user who lost the role."
msgstr "**Vrata RBAC:** Uporabnik potrebuje ``agent-user`` vloga ``web-app-hermes`` ali ``web-app-openclaw``. Open WebUI navaja vsak model agenta samo tej skupini, in posrednik zavrne vse druge klicatelja s HTTP 403 in ustavi delujočega agenta uporabnika, ki je izgubil vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**RBAC gate:** A user needs the `agent-user` role of `web-app-hermes` or `web-app-openclaw`. Open WebUI lists each agent model only to that group, and the broker refuses any other caller with HTTP 403 and stops a running agent of a user who lost the role."
msgstr "**Vrata RBAC:** Uporabnik potrebuje `agent-user` vloga `web-app-hermes` ali `web-app-openclaw`. Open WebUI navaja vsak model agenta samo tej skupini, in posrednik zavrne vse druge klicatelja s HTTP 403 in ustavi delujočega agenta uporabnika, ki je izgubil vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**RBAC group mapping:** Map Keycloak group paths onto Joomla's built-in `Super Users`, `Editor`, and `Registered` user groups inside the plugin."
msgstr "**Kartiranje skupine RBAC:** Zemljevid Keycloak skupinske poti na Joomlaje vgrajen `Super Users`, `Editor`, in `Registered` skupine uporabnikov znotraj vstavka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**RBAC group mapping:** Map Keycloak group paths onto Joomla’s built-in ``Super Users``, ``Editor``, and ``Registered`` user groups inside the plugin."
msgstr "**Kartiranje skupine RBAC:** Zemljevid Keycloak skupinske poti na JoomlaVgrajeni ``Super Users``, ``Editor``, in ``Registered`` skupine uporabnikov znotraj vstavka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**RBAC roles are `administrator` / `operator` / `reader`.**"
msgstr "**Vloge RBAC so `administrator` / `operator` / `reader`.**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**RBAC** via [`meta/rbac.yml`](../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) + the `rbac_group_path` lookup, so the Keycloak `groups` claim arrives as `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` and OpenBao binds those paths to policies."
msgstr "**RBAC** preko [`meta/rbac.yml`](../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) + `rbac_group_path` Poglej gor, torej Keycloak `groups` zahtevek je prispel ob prihodu `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` ter OpenBao Te poti povezuje s politikami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**RBAC** — only users in the ``web-app-pihole-administrator`` group can access the dashboard"
msgstr "**RBAC** — samo uporabniki v ``web-app-pihole-administrator`` skupina lahko dostopa do armaturne plošče"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**RBAC** — only users in the `web-app-pihole-administrator` group can access the dashboard"
msgstr "**RBAC** — samo uporabniki v `web-app-pihole-administrator` skupina lahko dostopa do armaturne plošče"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Raspberry Pi is a real deploy target.** Agent images MUST publish an `arm64` manifest so a Pi-class node can pull them, and the agents MUST schedule across at least two labelled worker nodes. This is arch coverage, not arch exclusivity: the same images keep running on the amd64 nodes that CI and the lab use, so the requirement is that every architecture a node may have is published, never that a deploy is pinned to one."
msgstr "**Raspberry Pi je prava tarča.** Zastopniške slike MORAJO objaviti `arm64` manifestirajte tako, da jih lahko vozel razreda Pi potegne, agenti pa MORAjo načrtovati vsaj dva označena vozla delavca. To je pokritost z lokom, ne ekskluzivnost z lokom. Enake slike še naprej tečejo.64 vozlišča, ki jih uporabljajo CI in laboratoriji, zato je zahteva, da se objavi vsaka arhitektura, ki jo ima vozlišče, nikoli pa se ne uporabi ena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Read-only by default:** A non-`GET`/`HEAD` operation is refused unless `mutating_tools_enabled` is explicitly true."
msgstr "**Privzeto branje:** Ne-`GET`/`HEAD` operacija je zavrnjena, razen če `mutating_tools_enabled` je izrecno res."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Read-only by default:** A non-``GET``/``HEAD`` operation is refused unless ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is explicitly true."
msgstr "**Privzeto branje:** Ne-``GET``/``HEAD`` operacija je zavrnjena, razen če ``mutating_tools_enabled`` je izrecno res."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Read-only inspection commands** (`grep`, `find`, `ls`, `cat`, `git log`, `docker ps`, etc.) just work."
msgstr "**Kontrolni ukazi, ki se uporabljajo samo za branje** (`grep`, `find`, `ls`, `cat`, `git log`, `docker ps`, itd.) Samo delaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Read-only tool surface:** The sidecar runs with `-r` and `GITEA_READONLY=true`, which hides every write tool. What remains are the read categories `user`, `repository`, `issue`, `pull_request`, `search`, `file`, `branch`, `tag`, `commit` and `release`, pinned through `GITEA_SCOPES`. Making the instance mutate anything through MCP is an explicit operator change to the command line and the token scopes."
msgstr "**Samo za branje:** Stranska prikolica teče z `-r` ter `GITEA_READONLY=true`, ki skriva vsako orodje za pisanje. Kar ostaja, so kategorije branja `user`, `repository`, `issue`, `pull_request`, `search`, `file`, `branch`, `tag`, `commit` ter `release`, stisnjen skozi `GITEA_SCOPES`. Narediti primer mutira vse prek MCP je izrecna sprememba operatorja v ukazno vrstico in žeton obsegov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Read-only tool surface:** The sidecar runs with ``-r`` and ``GITEA_READONLY=true``, which hides every write tool. What remains are the read categories ``user``, ``repository``, ``issue``, ``pull_request``, ``search``, ``file``, ``branch``, ``tag``, ``commit`` and ``release``, pinned through ``GITEA_SCOPES``. Making the instance mutate anything through MCP is an explicit operator change to the command line and the token scopes."
msgstr "**Samo za branje:** Stranska prikolica teče z ``-r`` ter ``GITEA_READONLY=true``, ki skriva vsako orodje za pisanje. Kar ostaja, so kategorije branja ``user``, ``repository``, ``issue``, ``pull_request``, ``search``, ``file``, ``branch``, ``tag``, ``commit`` ter ``release``, stisnjen skozi ``GITEA_SCOPES``. Narediti primer mutira vse prek MCP je izrecna sprememba operatorja v ukazno vrstico in žeton obsegov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Readiness gating:** Bootstrap blocks until the engine accepts connections."
msgstr "**Ready gating:** Čevlji blokira, dokler motor ne sprejme povezav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reading Status & Reviews:** Mark books as “to read,” “reading,” or “finished,” and publish reviews or quotes."
msgstr "**Branje mnenj & stanja:** Označite knjige kot “za branje”, “branje” ali “končano” in objavljajte kritike ali citate."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Real-Time Analytics:** Monitor visitor activity and generate detailed insights instantly."
msgstr "**Analitika v realnem času:** Spremljajte dejavnost obiskovalcev in takoj ustvarite podrobne vpoglede."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Real-Time Streaming:** Enjoy dynamic updates and real-time content delivery through dedicated streaming services."
msgstr "**Pretok v realnem času:** Uživajte v dinamičnih posodobitvah in dostavi vsebin v realnem času prek namenskih streaming storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reasoning:**"
msgstr "**Utemeljitev:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Redacted audit trail:** Every call emits provider, consumer, tool, credential subject, status, duration and correlation id, and never the arguments, the response body or the credential."
msgstr "**Preoblikovana revizijska sled:** Vsak klic oddaja ponudnika, potrošnika, orodje, osebek, status, trajanje in korelacijo ID, in nikoli argumentov, odzivni organ ali zaupanja."

