# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Refused early:** an unknown flavor aborts the deploy with the list of carried flavors."
msgstr "**Zavrnjeno zgodaj:** neznan okus prekine razporeditev s seznamom prenesenih okusov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Registry and variant changes.** A variant can dictate the configuration of the providers it pulls in, and an MCP round decides for itself what it carries, which is the breaking change in this release. Fifteen moving pins gained names the registry can order, every MCP provider is registered as a shared service, *meta/schema.yml* finished its rename to *meta/secrets.yml*, role scripts are sorted into per-language folders, and *meta/addons* is now an accepted declaration site for pins and plugins."
msgstr "**Registrske in variantne spremembe.** Različica lahko narekuje konfiguracijo ponudnikov, ki jih vleče, in MCP krog odloči za sebe, kaj nosi, kar je prelomna sprememba v tej izdaji. Petnajst premikajočih se zatičev je dobilo imena, ki jih register lahko naroči, vsak ponudnik MCP je registriran kot skupna storitev, *meta/schema.yml* končal svoje preimenovanje v *meta/secrets.yml*, skripte vlog so razvrščeni v imenikih v jeziku, in *meta/addoni* je zdaj sprejeta deklaracija mesto za zatiči in plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reload** NGINX automatically when any template changes."
msgstr "**Znova naloži** NGINX samodejno, ko se spremeni katera koli predloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reload-on-change:** Re-running the role overwrites `/etc/exports` with the current allowed-IP set; the handler reloads via `exportfs -ra` only when the file changed."
msgstr "**Ponovno naloži ob spremembi:** Ponovna izvedba nadomestitve vloge `/etc/exports` s trenutnim dovoljenim naborom IP; obdelovalec ponovno naloži preko `exportfs -ra` samo kadar se je datoteka spremenila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reload-on-change:** Re-running the role overwrites ``/etc/exports`` with the current allowed-IP set; the handler reloads via ``exportfs -ra`` only when the file changed."
msgstr "**Ponovno naloži ob spremembi:** Ponovna izvedba nadomestitve vloge ``/etc/exports`` s trenutnim dovoljenim naborom IP; obdelovalec ponovno naloži preko ``exportfs -ra`` samo kadar se je datoteka spremenila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Remote providers:** OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter each add their models when a key is configured. The keys are declared in ``meta/secrets.yml`` with the ``type`` and ``regex`` their value must satisfy, and default to the central ``API.<provider>.api_key`` entry; an unset key leaves that provider’s routes unpublished."
msgstr "**Oddaljeni ponudniki:** OpenAI, Anthropic in OpenRouter vsak doda svoje modele, ko je nastavljen ključ. Ključi so prijavljeni v ``meta/secrets.yml`` z ``type`` ter ``regex`` njihova vrednost mora ustrezati centralni vrednosti in mora biti privzeta ``API.<provider>.api_key`` vstop; nenastavljen ključ pušča neobjavljene poti ponudnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Remote providers:** OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter each add their models when a key is configured. The keys are declared in `meta/secrets.yml` with the `type` and `regex` their value must satisfy, and default to the central `API.<provider>.api_key` entry; an unset key leaves that provider's routes unpublished."
msgstr "**Oddaljeni ponudniki:** OpenAI, Anthropic in OpenRouter vsak doda svoje modele, ko je nastavljen ključ. Ključi so prijavljeni v `meta/secrets.yml` z `type` ter `regex` njihova vrednost mora ustrezati centralni vrednosti in mora biti privzeta `API.<provider>.api_key` vstop; izključen ključ pušča neobjavljene poti ponudnika."

