# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reporting Vulnerabilities** If you discover a security vulnerability in Infinito.Nexus, you MUST report it immediately through [SECURITY.md](../../SECURITY.md) and MUST NOT open a public issue. We encourage proactive vulnerability reporting so that issues can be addressed as quickly as possible."
msgstr "**Poročanje o ranljivosti** Če odkrijete varnostno ranljivost v Infinito.Nexus, morate prijaviti takoj skozi [SECURITY.md](../../SECURITY.md) in NE SME odpreti javnega vprašanja. Spodbujamo proaktivno poročanje o ranljivosti, da bi lahko čim prej rešili vprašanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Repository Cloning:** Automatically clones the Package Manager repository from GitHub."
msgstr "**Kloniranje skladišča:** Samodejno klonira skladišče upravljalnika paketov iz GitHuba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Repository Cloning:** Automatically fetches the latest auto-btrfs-balancer repository."
msgstr "**Kloniranje skladišča:** Samodejno prinesite najnovejšo skladišče za samodejno uravnoteženje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reproducible installs:** every tool resolves to the pinned ``ref``, so the same commit installs the same linter version on every host and in every CI run."
msgstr "**Ponovljivi namesti:** vsako orodje se odloči za pripeto ``ref``, tako da ista zaveza namesti isto interno različico na vsakem gostitelju in v vsakem CI teči."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reproducible installs:** every tool resolves to the pinned `ref`, so the same commit installs the same linter version on every host and in every CI run."
msgstr "**Ponovljivi namesti:** vsako orodje se odloči za pripeto `ref`, tako da ista zaveza namesti isto interno različico na vsakem gostitelju in v vsakem CI teči."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Required addons are explicit, and install failure is gated by `required`.** Every addon carries a boolean `required` field (default `false`). Core components that are part of the deployed app contract, such as Odoo's core modules, use `required: true`: they are always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, and MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. The field also governs install-failure behaviour: when an addon's installation fails, a `required: true` addon MUST hard-fail the play (the deploy stops), while a `required: false` addon MUST only emit a warning, skip that addon, and let the play continue."
msgstr "**Zahtevani dodatki so izrecni, install napake je vrata `required`.** Vsak addon nosi bool `required` polje (privzeto `false`). Jedrne komponente, ki so del uporabljene pogodbe o aplikaciji, kot so Odoovi osnovni moduli, uporaba `required: true`: so vedno nameščene, lahko izpusti `enabled`, in ne sme nastaviti `enabled: false`. Polje ureja tudi obnašanje vgradnje-neuspeh: ko naprava addona odpove, a `required: true` addon MORA hard-fail igro (ustavitev uporabe), medtem ko `required: false` Addon MORA oddajati samo opozorilo, preskočite ta dodatek in pustite, da se igra nadaljuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reset Logic:** Cleans previous Compose project files and data when `MODE_RESET` is enabled."
msgstr "**Ponastavi logiko:** Očisti prejšnje Sestavite projektne datoteke in podatke, ko `MODE_RESET` je omogočeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reset Logic:** Cleans previous Compose project files and data when ``MODE_RESET`` is enabled."
msgstr "**Ponastavi logiko:** Očisti prejšnje Sestavite projektne datoteke in podatke, ko ``MODE_RESET`` je omogočeno."

