# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Response caching:** Mirrored assets are cached with stale-serving, keeping delivery fast and resilient against upstream outages."
msgstr "**Odziv:** Zrcaljeno premoženje je predpomnjeno s stale-serviranjem, ohranjanjem dostave hitro in odporno proti izpadom v zgornjem toku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Responsive Design**: Optimized for desktop, tablet & mobile, built on Bootstrap."
msgstr "**Odgovorna zasnova**: Optimizirano za namizje, tablični & mobilni, zgrajena na Bootstrap."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Responsive Design**: optimized for both desktop and mobile devices."
msgstr "**Odgovorna zasnova**: optimizirana za namizne in mobilne naprave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Responsive Design:** Ensure that your website looks great on all devices with mobile-friendly themes and layouts."
msgstr "**Odzivna zasnova:** Poskrbite, da bo vaša spletna stran videti odlično na vseh napravah z mobilnimi prijaznimi temami in postavitevmi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restore verified against real dumps.** The *recover* CLI replays a generation's database and cluster dumps, reads the generation's own layout instead of guessing it, and places each dump by the engine the backup observed rather than by name alone. The *svc-bkp-volume-2-local* drill now empties every volume it claims to test, fails on a database that was never dumped, and stops the backup timers before it goes destructive. Baudolo is pinned per host, its contract read from baudolo itself."
msgstr "**Obnovi preverjeno na pravih odlagališčih.** – *izterja* CLI ponovno predvaja bazo podatkov generacije in grozd odlagališča, prebere lastno postavitev generacije namesto ugibanja, in postavi vsako odlagališče z motorjem backup opazovano namesto po imenu sam. – *svc-bkp-volume-2-local* Vrta zdaj izprazni vsak volumen, za katerega trdi, da ga testira, spodleti v podatkovni bazi, ki ni bila nikoli odvržena, in ustavi rezervne ure, preden postane destruktivna. Baudolo je ujet na gostitelja, njegova pogodba se bere iz samega baudola."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restricted engine access:** The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume shared with the socket proxy, which publishes no port and runs with ``network_mode: none`` in compose. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. It filters methods and paths, not request bodies: ``volumes/create`` stays open for the per-agent volume, so the isolation holds against a compromised agent, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised broker."
msgstr "**Omejen dostop do motorja:** Mešetar doseže kontejnerski motor samo skozi filtrirano unix vtičnico v prostornini, ki se deli z vtičnico proxy, ki ne objavlja vrat in teče z ``network_mode: none`` v sestavi. Proxy priznava samo zabojnik, storitev, naloga, omrežje, glasnost in sliko kliče posrednik naredi, in zavrne vse druge metode in poti, vključno exec in brisanje. Filtrira metode in poti, ne zahteva organov: ``volumes/create`` ostane odprt za glasnost na agenta, tako da izolacija drži proti kompromitiranemu agentu, ki sploh ne doseže vtičnice, ne proti ogroženemu posredniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restricted engine access:** The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume shared with the socket proxy, which publishes no port and runs with `network_mode: none` in compose. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. It filters methods and paths, not request bodies: `volumes/create` stays open for the per-agent volume, so the isolation holds against a compromised agent, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised broker."
msgstr "**Omejen dostop do motorja:** Mešetar doseže kontejnerski motor samo skozi filtrirano unix vtičnico v prostornini, ki se deli z vtičnico proxy, ki ne objavlja vrat in teče z `network_mode: none` v sestavi. Proxy priznava samo zabojnik, storitev, naloga, omrežje, glasnost in sliko kliče posrednik naredi, in zavrne vse druge metode in poti, vključno exec in brisanje. Filtrira metode in poti, ne zahteva organov: `volumes/create` ostane odprt za glasnost na agenta, tako da izolacija drži proti kompromitiranemu agentu, ki sploh ne doseže vtičnice, ne proti ogroženemu posredniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Retry-with-backoff:** transient SSH/rsync failures retry up to twelve times across a long window before surfacing as a hard failure."
msgstr "**Poizkusi ponovno z vrnitvijo:** prehodne napake SSH/rshync, ki se ponovijo do dvanajstkrat skozi dolgo okno, preden se pojavijo kot trda napaka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reusable Role:** Can be used as a foundational component for software development, CI/CD pipelines, and build environments."
msgstr "**Vloga za večkratno uporabo:** Lahko se uporablja kot osnovna komponenta za razvoj programske opreme, cevovode CI/CD in gradnjo okolja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reusable dependency role** for higher-level SSH workflows"
msgstr "**Vloga ponovne odvisnosti** za delovne tokove višje ravni SSH"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Revalidation required:** [ADR 0003 - One MCP surface per provider, and a disposition for every role](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) holds the exhaustive per-role audit and the standing contract, and supersedes this document where this document assumes an empty baseline, treats metadata as enforcement, or marks client provisioning and end-to-end authorization complete. The remaining work is tracked in [035 - MCP Proxy Expansion and Application Interconnection](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md). Checked items below describe the original implementation slice and MUST NOT be read as proof that the stricter identity, revocation, transport, restart, proxy, and real-tool-call criteria in requirement 035 are complete."
msgstr "**Zahtevano podaljšanje veljavnosti:** [ADR 0003 - Ena MCP površina na ponudnika, in razporeditev za vsako vlogo](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) ima izčrpno revizijo na role in stalno pogodbo ter nadomešča ta dokument, kadar ta dokument prevzame prazno osnovo, obravnava metapodatke kot izvršbo ali označuje popolno zagotavljanje odjemalca in dovoljenje od konca do konca. Preostalo delo se sledi v [035 - MCP proxy razširitev in uporaba medpovezava](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md). Spodaj pregledane postavke opisujejo prvotni izvedbeni del in NE SMEJO brati kot dokaz, da se zahtevajo strožja identiteta, preklic, prevoz, ponovni zagon, približek in realno-orodje. 035 so popolni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse Proxy**"
msgstr "**Povratna posrednika**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse Proxy**   Includes the `sys-stk-front-proxy` role to configure a proxy (e.g. NGINX) for routing HTTP(S) traffic to your database UI or management endpoint."
msgstr "**Povratna posrednika** Vključuje `sys-stk-front-proxy` vloga za nastavitev posrednika (npr. NGINX) za usmerjanje HTTP(S) promet do vaše zbirke podatkov UI ali ciljna točka upravljanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse bridge ownership (ActivityPub → AT).** Writing an AT record requires *an account to write it as*. Whose PDS, whose app-password/OAuth token? Options: a dedicated service account, or per-user delegated write via the login-broker. Unresolved → reverse direction deferred to a follow-up requirement."
msgstr "**Povratno lastništvo mostu (ActivityPub → AT).** Pisanje zapisa AT zahteva *račun za pisanje kot*Čigava je PDS, čigava je aplikacija? Možnosti: namenski storitveni račun, ali na uporabnika preneseno pisanje preko login-broker. Nerazrešen → obratna smer odložena na zahtevo po spremljanju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-Proxy Ready:** Sets `ATL_PROXY_NAME/PORT/SCHEME/SECURE` so Confluence generates correct external URLs behind HTTPS."
msgstr "**Reverzni način pripravljen:** Seti `ATL_PROXY_NAME/PORT/SCHEME/SECURE` tako Confluence ustvarja pravilne zunanje URL-je za HTTPS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-Proxy Ready:** Sets ``ATL_PROXY_NAME/PORT/SCHEME/SECURE`` so Confluence generates correct external URLs behind HTTPS."
msgstr "**Reverzni način pripravljen:** Seti ``ATL_PROXY_NAME/PORT/SCHEME/SECURE`` tako Confluence ustvarja pravilne zunanje URL-je za HTTPS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-Proxy/HTTPS Ready:** Preconfigured Atlassian Tomcat proxy envs so Jira respects external scheme/host/port."
msgstr "**Vzvratna proga/HTTPS Pripravljen:** Predkonfiguriran atlasovski Tomcat proxy envs tako Jira spoštuje zunanje scheme/host/port."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` with ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in ``trusted_proxies``. In swarm the hub joins the proxy’s own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub’s, and trusting only the hub’s subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Povratno-proxy trust:** Oblikuje ``configuration.yaml`` z ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, in projektno-zaupne CIDR, navedene v ``trusted_proxies``. V roju se vozlišče pridruži lastnemu pokrovu posrednika, tako posredovana zahteva prispe iz tega omrežja in ne iz vozlišča, in zaupanje samo podmrežje vozlišča naredi Home Assistant odgovori na vsako zahtevano zahtevo s HTTP 400."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` with `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in `trusted_proxies`. In swarm the hub joins the proxy's own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub's, and trusting only the hub's subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Povratno-proxy trust:** Oblikuje `configuration.yaml` z `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, in projektno-zaupne CIDR, navedene v `trusted_proxies`. V roju se vozlišče pridruži lastnemu pokrovu posrednika, tako posredovana zahteva prispe iz tega omrežja in ne iz vozlišča, in zaupanje samo podmrežje vozlišča naredi Home Assistant odgovori na vsako zahtevano zahtevo s HTTP 400."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Risks / unknowns:**"
msgstr "**Tveganja / neznana:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust API Integration:** Leverage a comprehensive API to extend functionalities and integrate with other systems."
msgstr "**Robust API Vključevanje:** Izboljšati vseobsegajočo API razširitev funkcionalnosti in vključitev v druge sisteme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Administration:** Automatically creates databases, users, and assigns privileges."
msgstr "**Robust administracija:** Samodejno ustvarja zbirke podatkov, uporabnike in dodeljuje privilegije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Authentication:** Supports LDAP and OIDC for secure identity and access management."
msgstr "**Trdna overitev:** Podpira LDAP in OIDC za varno upravljanje identitete in dostopa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Connectivity:**"
msgstr "**Robustna povezanost:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Connectivity:**   Easily manage database configurations, user accounts, and monitor query activity with built‑in health checks."
msgstr "**Robustna povezanost:** Z vgrajenimi zdravstvenimi pregledi lahko upravljate konfiguracije baz podatkov, uporabniške račune in spremljate poizvedovalno dejavnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Content Management:** Organize, categorize, and retrieve information efficiently with powerful content management tools."
msgstr "**Upravljanje z Robust vsebinami:** Organizirajte, kategorizirajte in učinkovito pridobivajte informacije z zmogljivimi orodji za upravljanje vsebin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Content Moderation:** Utilize powerful moderation tools to manage community interactions and maintain safe spaces."
msgstr "**Zmernost Robust Content:** Uporabljajte močna orodja za zmernost za upravljanje interakcij skupnosti in vzdrževanje varnih prostorov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Data Management:** Secure and reliable storage of both the Moodle application and user data through Docker volumes."
msgstr "**Trdno upravljanje podatkov:** Varno in zanesljivo shranjevanje Moodle podatki o aplikacijah in uporabnikih prek glasnosti Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Infrastructure:** Seamlessly integrates with PostgreSQL for reliable data management and supports deployment behind a reverse proxy."
msgstr "**Robustna infrastruktura:** Brezhibno se povezuje z PostgreSQL za zanesljivo upravljanje podatkov in podpira uporabo za povratnim posrednikom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Media Management:** Manage your images, videos, and other media with an integrated media library, including options for enhanced upload limits and dynamic content delivery."
msgstr "**Robust medijsko upravljanje:** Upravljajte svoje slike, videoposnetke in druge medije z integrirano medijsko knjižnico, vključno z možnostmi za izboljšane omejitve pošiljanja in dinamično dostavo vsebin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Moderation Tools:** Benefit from comprehensive tools for content management and community moderation."
msgstr "**Robustna moderacijska orodja:** Koristi celovitih orodij za upravljanje vsebin in zmernost skupnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Reporting & Dashboards:** Gain insights through comprehensive reporting features and customizable dashboards that help monitor project performance and key metrics."
msgstr "**Robustna poročila in armature:** Pridobite vpogled skozi celovito poročanje funkcije in prilagodljive armaturne plošče, ki pomagajo pri spremljanju uspešnosti projekta in ključne metrike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Reset and Recovery Tools:** Easily reset and reinitialize both the application and its underlying database."
msgstr "**Robustna orodja za ponastavitev in obnovo:** Enostavno ponastaviti in ponovno začeti tako aplikacijo in njeno bazo podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Scalability & Performance:** Leverage integrated Redis caching and a reliable database (MariaDB or PostgreSQL) for smooth scaling and high performance."
msgstr "**Trdna razteznost in zmogljivost:** Vgrajeni vzvodi Redis caching in zanesljivo zbirko podatkov (MariaDB ali PostgreSQL) za gladko ostrenje in visoko zmogljivost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Tracking:** Track user interactions across your website with comprehensive analytics tools."
msgstr "**Robustno sledenje:** Spremljajte interakcije uporabnikov po vaši spletni strani s celovitimi orodji analitike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Role Integration:** Depends on the [svc-net-wireguard-plain](../svc-net-wireguard-plain/README.md) role to ensure that WireGuard is properly configured before applying firewall rules."
msgstr "**Vključevanje vlog:** Odvisno od [svc-net-wireguard-plain](../svc-net-wireguard-plain/README.md) vloga zagotoviti, da je WireGuard pravilno nastavljen pred uporabo pravil požarnega zidu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Role Integration:** Depends on the `svc-net-wireguard-plain <../svc-net-wireguard-plain/README.md>`__ role to ensure that WireGuard is properly configured before applying firewall rules."
msgstr "**Vključevanje vlog:** Odvisno od `svc-net-wireguard-plain <../svc-net-wireguard-plain/README.md>`__ vloga zagotoviti, da je WireGuard pravilno nastavljen pred uporabo pravil požarnega zidu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Role-Based Access Control & Security:** Manage user permissions precisely to ensure that sensitive information and critical functions remain secure."
msgstr "**Nadzor in varnost dostopa na podlagi vloge:** Upravljajte uporabniška dovoljenja točno za zagotovitev, da občutljive informacije in kritične funkcije ostanejo varne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Role-strategy authorisation:** Map Keycloak groups and LDAP groups onto Jenkins authorities through the ``role-strategy`` plugin."
