# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Use Docker to ensure your analytics platform can grow with your traffic demands."
msgstr "**Razširljiva razporeditev:** Uporabite Docker za zagotovitev vaše analitične platforme lahko rastejo z vašimi prometnimi zahtevami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Use Docker to ensure your event platform grows seamlessly with your community’s needs."
msgstr "**Razširljiva razporeditev:** Uporabite Dockerja, da zagotovite, da bo vaš dogodek raste brezhibno s potrebami vaše skupnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Utilize Docker for a portable and scalable setup that adapts as your community grows."
msgstr "**Razširljiva razporeditev:** Uporabite Docker za prenosno in razkošno nastavitev, ki se prilagaja, ko vaša skupnost raste."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Service Architecture:** Leverage the robust orchestration of multiple services to power your Funkwhale instance."
msgstr "**Arhitektura povečanih storitev:** Povečajte močno orkestracijo več storitev za napajanje Funkwhale Primer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable and Customizable:** Easily tailor settings and scale your Keycloak instance to meet growing demands."
msgstr "**Raztegljiv in prilagodljiv:** Preprosto prilagodite nastavitve in povečajte Keycloak primer za izpolnjevanje naraščajočih zahtev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Schedule-coordinated:** the systemd unit is part of the global manipulation group, so it never races backup/cleanup/repair jobs on the same host."
msgstr "**Usklajeno po razporedu:** sistemska enota je del globalne manipulacijske skupine, zato nikoli ne dirka. backup/cleanup/repair dela na istem gostitelju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scheduled Execution:** Integrates with a systemd timer for periodic health sweeps."
msgstr "**Načrtovana izvedba:** Vključuje s sistemsko časovnico za periodične zdravstvene preglede."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scheduled Execution:** Runs daily (or as configured) based on `SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER`."
msgstr "**Načrtovana izvedba:** Teče dnevno (ali kot nastavljeno) temelji na `SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scheduled Execution:** Runs daily (or as configured) based on ``SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER``."
msgstr "**Načrtovana izvedba:** Teče dnevno (ali kot nastavljeno) temelji na ``SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scope is the full backlog, executed in phases.** The definition of done is the FULL set: every ✅ cell in the matrix wired as an addon, and an exhaustive per-`web-app-*`-role upstream-plugin survey completed so the ✅ layer is exhaustive rather than hub-biased. Delivery is phased: the shared contract plus the first-slice roles land first (see [Implementation Strategy](#implementation-strategy)), then the remaining roles and ✅ wirings sweep incrementally, but no phase reduces scope. The requirement is not complete until the full ✅ set is wired and every `web-app-*` role surveyed."
msgstr "**Obseg je celoten zaostanek, izveden v fazah.** Opredelitev opravljenega je FULL set: vsak ✅ celica v matriki, ožičena kot dodatek, in izčrpna na-`web-app-*`-role touch-plugin raziskava končana tako ✅ Plast je izčrpna, ne pa omejena. Dostava je postopna: skupna pogodba in vloge prve delitve najprej pristanejo (glej [Strategija izvajanja](#implementation-strategy)), potem preostale vloge in ✅ Ožičenje postopoma poči, vendar nobena faza ne zmanjša obsega. Zahteva ni izpolnjena, dokler ni popolna. ✅ Set je ozvočen in vsak `web-app-*` pregledano vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scoped Content-Security-Policy:** The UI's inline bootstrap scripts pass through a `script-src-elem` flag, and no external font or connect sources are whitelisted."
msgstr "**Področje uporabe politike varnosti vsebine:** UI-jev inline škornji scenariji gredo skozi `script-src-elem` Zastava in nobena zunanja pisava ali povezovalni viri niso beli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scoped Content-Security-Policy:** The UI’s inline bootstrap scripts pass through a ``script-src-elem`` flag, and no external font or connect sources are whitelisted."
msgstr "**Področje uporabe politike varnosti vsebine:** UI-jev notranji škornji Trap skripte skozi ``script-src-elem`` Zastava in nobena zunanja pisava ali povezovalni viri niso beli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Script Cloning:** Retrieves the latest swapfile creation script from a Git repository."
msgstr "**Kloniranje skripta:** Pridobi najnovejšo skripto za ustvarjanje swapfile Git Skladišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seal is `seal \"static\"`** with a 32-byte key generated by the repo credential generator into the ansible-vault-encrypted inventory and injected as `env://OPENBAO_SEAL_KEY`."
msgstr "**Pečat je `seal \"static\"`** z a 32-bajtni ključ, ki ga ustvari generator repo credential v ansible-vault šifrirani inventar in vbrizga kot `env://OPENBAO_SEAL_KEY`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Collaboration:** Collaborate in real time with team members, ensuring smooth data sharing and project management."
msgstr "**Brezšivno sodelovanje:** Sodelujte v realnem času s člani ekipe, kar zagotavlja nemoteno izmenjavo podatkov in vodenje projektov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Docker Integration:** Works harmoniously with Docker Compose and other roles in your infrastructure."
msgstr "**Brezšivni doker integracija:** Deluje skladno z Docker Compose in druge vloge v vaši infrastrukturi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Docker Integration:** Works with Docker Compose and the central-engine deploy machinery."
msgstr "**Brezšivni doker integracija:** Deluje z Docker Compose in centralni motor uporablja stroje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless IFrame Embedding**: Launch apps directly within the UI or open in new tabs."
msgstr "**Vgradnja brezšivne IFrame**: Zaženite aplikacije neposredno znotraj uporabniškega vmesnika ali odprite v novih zavihkih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Integration:** Designed to work within a larger system setup environment, integrating with dependencies such as Hunspell for spell checking."
msgstr "**Brezšivne integracije:** Zasnovan za delo v večjem okolju za nastavitev sistema, ki se povezuje z odvisnostmi, kot so Hunspell za preverjanje črkovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Integration:** Easily integrates with other automation roles for a complete system setup."
msgstr "**Brezšivne integracije:** Enostavno se integrira z drugimi vlogami avtomatizacije za popolno nastavitev sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Integration:** Provides a stable and secure browsing setup as part of broader system automation workflows."
msgstr "**Brezšivne integracije:** Zagotavlja stabilno in varno nastavitev brskanja kot del širšega sistema avtomatizacije delovnih tokov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless NGINX Reload:** Reloads the NGINX service automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "**Brezšivni NGINX ponovno naloži:** Storitev NGINX po uspešnih obnovitvah samodejno ponovno naloži."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secrets management with OpenBao.** The new *web-app-openbao* role deploys OpenBao at *openbao.<domain>*. It stores application credentials, API keys and machine identities. People sign in through Keycloak, or through LDAP when OpenLDAP is deployed. Their *administrator*, *operator* or *reader* group decides what they can reach, and signing in without one of those groups grants only the default policy. Services and automation use their own AppRole identities, whose credentials change on every deploy, and no root token is kept after the first deploy. A recovery key kept in the token store lets a later deploy get back in if those credentials are lost. A static seal unseals the node on its own after every restart. An internal PKI can be switched on, and Prometheus alerts when the node is sealed or unreachable. The seal key lives only in the encrypted inventory, and a backup of the store cannot be read without it, so back up the inventory together with the volume. See [web-app-openbao](roles/web-app-openbao/README.md)."
msgstr "**Upravljanje skrivnosti z OpenBao.** Novo *web-app-openbao* vloga uvaja OpenBao na dan *Openbao.<domain>*. hrani poverilnice za prijave, API tipke in strojne identitete. Ljudje se prijavijo. Keycloakali prek LDAP, ko OpenLDAP je razporejen. Njihovi *upravitelj*, *upravljavec* ali *bralec* skupina odloča o tem, kaj lahko doseže, in se vpiše brez ene od teh skupin, ki odobri samo privzeto politiko. Storitve in avtomatizacija uporabljajo lastne identitete AppRole, katerih poverilnice se spreminjajo pri vsaki uporabi, po prvi uporabi pa se ne obdrži noben korenski žeton. Ključ za okrevanje, ki ga imajo v trgovini z žetoni, omogoča kasnejšo uporabo, da se vrnejo, če se te poverilnice izgubijo. Statični pečat po vsakem ponovnem zagonu sam odpečati vozlišče. Notranji PKI se lahko vklopi in Prometheus razpisi ukrepov, kadar je vozlišče zapečateno ali nedosegljivo. Ključ od tjulnjev živi samo v šifriranem inventarju, brez njega pa se ne da prebrati varnostne kopije trgovine, zato skupaj s prostornino podprite inventar. Glej. [web-app-openbao](roles/web-app-openbao/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secrets reuse the credentials mechanism.** MCP tokens, app-passwords, and OAuth client secrets are declared in each role's [`meta/secrets.yml`](../../roles/web-app-baserow/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` block and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. No new secret store is introduced."
msgstr "**Skrivnosti ponovno uporabijo mehanizem poverilnic.** MCP žetoni, app-geslo in OAuth skrivnosti strank so deklarirani v vsaki vlogi. [`meta/secrets.yml`](../../roles/web-app-baserow/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` blokirati in brati preko `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. Ni nove skrivne trgovine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Access:** Integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy for encrypted, high-performance access."
msgstr "**Varen dostop:** Integrira z NGINX obratnim posrednikom za šifriran, visoko zmogljiv dostop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Access:** Utilize NGINX reverse proxy integration to safeguard your management interface."
msgstr "**Varen dostop:** Uporabite NGINX obratno posredniško integracijo za zaščito vašega upravljalnega vmesnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Communications:** Enable TLS encryption for data in transit when accessed through an NGINX reverse proxy."
msgstr "**Varne komunikacije:** Omogoči šifriranje TLS za podatke v tranzitu, ko dostopate preko povratnega posrednika NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Notifications:** Integrates with systemd to trigger email alerts when services fail."
msgstr "**Varnostna obvestila:** Vključuje s sistemom za sprožitev e-poštnih opozoril, ko storitve odpovejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Notifications:** Leverages systemd to trigger alerts automatically when services fail."
msgstr "**Varnostna obvestila:** Obveznosti, ki se samodejno sprožijo ob odpovedi storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Remote Access:** Facilitates secure remote access by providing a verified public key for use with [SSH](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell)."
msgstr "**Varen oddaljen dostop:** Omogoča varen dostop na daljavo z zagotavljanjem preverjenega javnega ključa za uporabo [SSH](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Remote Access:** Facilitates secure remote access by providing a verified public key for use with `SSH <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__."
msgstr "**Varen oddaljen dostop:** Omogoča varen dostop na daljavo z zagotavljanjem preverjenega javnega ključa za uporabo `SSH <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Reverse Proxy Setup:**"
msgstr "**Varnostna nastavitev povratnega posrednika:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Reverse Proxy Setup:**   Easily configure your access through a reverse proxy to ensure secure, controlled entry to your LDAP management tool."
msgstr "**Varnostna nastavitev povratnega posrednika:** Preprosto nastavite svoj dostop prek povratnega posrednika, da se zagotovi varen, nadzorovan vnos v vaše orodje za upravljanje LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Web Access:** Configured to work seamlessly behind an NGINX reverse proxy for enhanced security and performance."
msgstr "**Varen spletni dostop:** Nastavljeno tako, da deluje brezhibno za NGINX obratnega posrednika za večjo varnost in učinkovitost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure and Private:** Built-in support for TLS, secure SMTP integration, and strict administrative controls to ensure data protection."
msgstr "**Varno in zasebno:** Vgrajena podpora TLS, varna integracija SMTP in strog upravni nadzor za zagotovitev varstva podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure and Reliable:** Benefit from secure access via an NGINX reverse proxy combined with a MariaDB backend for reliable data storage."
msgstr "**Varen in zanesljiv:** Prednosti varnega dostopa prek povratnega posrednika NGINX v kombinaciji z MariaDB hrbtenica za zanesljivo shranjevanje podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure and Scalable:**"
msgstr "**Varno in raztegljivo:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure and Scalable:**   Benefit from container isolation and reproducible deployments that ensure your service is both secure and scalable."
msgstr "**Varno in raztegljivo:** Koristi izolacije zabojnika in ponovljive uporabe, ki zagotavljajo, da je vaša storitev varna in razširljiva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Secure by Default:** Includes modern SSL headers and best practices via NGINX."
msgstr "**Privzeto zavarovano:** Vključuje sodobne glave SSL in najboljše prakse preko NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Security Considerations**: While adding a user to the Docker group provides ease of use, be aware of the security implications. It grants the user elevated privileges which, if misused, can affect the entire system."
msgstr "**Varnostni pomisleki**: Medtem ko dodajanje uporabnika v skupino Docker zagotavlja enostavno uporabo, bodite pozorni na varnostne posledice. Uporabniku podeljuje povišane privilegije, ki lahko, če so zlorabljeni, vplivajo na celoten sistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Security Defaults:** Disables password authentication and root login; enforces public-key authentication; conditionally sets `LogLevel` to `DEBUG3` when `MODE_DEBUG` is true."
msgstr "**Varnostne privzetosti:** Onemogoči avtentikacijo gesla in prijavo korena; uveljavlja avtentikacijo javnega ključa; pogojno nastavi `LogLevel` do `DEBUG3` ko `MODE_DEBUG` Res je."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Security Defaults:** Disables password authentication and root login; enforces public-key authentication; conditionally sets ``LogLevel`` to ``DEBUG3`` when ``MODE_DEBUG`` is true."
msgstr "**Varnostne privzetosti:** Onemogoči avtentikacijo gesla in prijavo korena; uveljavlja avtentikacijo javnega ključa; pogojno nastavi ``LogLevel`` do ``DEBUG3`` ko ``MODE_DEBUG`` Res je."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Security Focus:** Provides commented guidelines to avoid common sudo misconfigurations."
msgstr "**Varnostno središče:** Navaja pripombe smernice, da bi se izognili skupni sudo napačne konfiguracije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Security Focused**: Implements best practices for securing the MariaDB root password."
msgstr "**Osredotočena varnost**: Izvaja najboljše prakse za zagotovitev MariaDB geslo root."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Security headers**: sensible defaults plus optional X-Frame-Options / CSP based on application settings."
msgstr "**Varnostne glave**: razumne privzete vrednosti plus neobvezne X-Frame-Options / CSP na podlagi nastavitev programa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Segmentation.** The device is network-isolated from shared infrastructure; a compromise stays on the device."
msgstr "**Segmentacija.** Naprava je omrežno izolirana iz skupne infrastrukture; kompromis ostane na napravi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Selectable agent:** Whichever agent role the deployment carries embodies the device, Hermes Agent taking precedence; the matrix deploys both so neither path rots."
msgstr "**Izbirno sredstvo:** Ne glede na vlogo agenta, ki jo ima aplikacija, vključuje napravo. Hermes Agent ima prednost; matrica uporablja oboje tako, da nobena pot ne gnije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-Healing & Maintenance** ⚙️ Automated cleanup, container healing, and auto-updates keep infrastructure healthy without human intervention."
msgstr "**Samozdravljenje in vzdrževanje** ⚙️ Avtomatizirano čiščenje, zdravljenje zabojnikov in avtomatska posodobitev ohranjajo infrastrukturo zdravo brez človeškega posredovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-cleaning:** failed backup attempts are torn down by ``sys-ctl-cln-faild-bkps`` so a broken run cannot poison the next."
msgstr "**Samočiščenje:** neuspešni rezervni poskusi so uničeni ``sys-ctl-cln-faild-bkps`` Tako da polomljen tek ne more zastrupiti naslednjega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-cleaning:** failed backup attempts are torn down by `sys-ctl-cln-faild-bkps` so a broken run cannot poison the next."
msgstr "**Samočiščenje:** neuspešni rezervni poskusi so uničeni `sys-ctl-cln-faild-bkps` Tako da polomljen tek ne more zastrupiti naslednjega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-contained Prosody:** Component secrets for jicofo, jvb, jigasi and jibri are pre-generated via ``meta/secrets.yml`` so XMPP auth is stable across redeploys."
msgstr "**Samostojna prosodija:** Komponente skrivnosti za jicofo, jvb, jigasi in jibri so vnaprej ustvarjene preko ``meta/secrets.yml`` tako XMPP V redu je."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-contained Prosody:** Component secrets for jicofo, jvb, jigasi and jibri are pre-generated via `meta/secrets.yml` so XMPP auth is stable across redeploys."
msgstr "**Samostojna prosodija:** Komponente skrivnosti za jicofo, jvb, jigasi in jibri so vnaprej ustvarjene preko `meta/secrets.yml` tako XMPP V redu je."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-exploration is a first-class capability.** Hermes enumerates and probes the granted hardware to build a capability map (which sensors/actuators exist, what they report/do) before or during control, and that map is retrievable."
msgstr "**Samoraziskovanje je prvovrstna sposobnost.** Hermes našteva in sonde dodeljeno strojno opremo za izdelavo zemljevida zmogljivosti (kateri senzorji/aktivatorji obstajajo, kaj poročajo/storijo) pred nadzorom ali med njim in ta zemljevid je dostopen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-hosted CI runner for the pilot workflow.** v1 pins `test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` to GitHub-hosted DinD. Once [014](014-svc-runner-ci.md) is in place, the workflow MAY be migrated to a self-hosted runner for closer-to-production validation."
msgstr "**Samogostitelj CI tekača za pilotski potek dela.** v1 zatiči `test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` Na GitHuba. [014](014-svc-runner-ci.md) je na voljo, se lahko delovni tok preseli v tekača, ki je sam gostitelj, za potrjevanje bližje proizvodnji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-hosted LittleJS environment**: run LittleJS demos and games under your own domain."
msgstr "**samogostujoči LittleJS okolje**: tek LittleJS Demo in igre pod vašo domeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-hosted Music Sharing:** Enjoy a secure and private platform to share and stream your favorite tunes."
msgstr "**Souporaba glasbe, ki jo gosti sam:** Uživajte varno in zasebno platformo deliti in pretakati svoje najljubše melodije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-hosted:** Run CI jobs on your own server without consuming GitHub-hosted runner minutes."
msgstr "**Samogostujoči:** Zaženite CI opravila na lastnem strežniku brez porabe GitHub-gostuje tekaške minute."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the ``sso`` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with ``?error=registration-disabled`` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` accordingly."
msgstr "**Samoregistracija** m *o* ko je omogočen OIDC in *izklop* sicer – izhaja tudi iz ``sso`` Zastava za storitve. Penpot poti prvič OIDC prijave po registracijski poti (Zastava za invalide povzroči, da klic ne uspe z ``?error=registration-disabled`` za uporabnike, ki še niso predvideni), Registracija mora ostati na OIDC. Domorodni admin je v škornjih in LDAP samozagotavlja brez njega. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` Izrisi ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` ustrezno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the `sso` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with `?error=registration-disabled` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` accordingly."
msgstr "**Samoregistracija** m *o* ko je omogočen OIDC in *izklop* sicer – izhaja tudi iz `sso` Zastava za storitve. Penpot poti prvič OIDC prijave po registracijski poti (Zastava za invalide povzroči, da klic ne uspe z `?error=registration-disabled` za uporabnike, ki še niso predvideni), Registracija mora ostati na OIDC. Domorodni admin je v škornjih in LDAP samozagotavlja brez njega. `PENPOT_FLAGS` Izrisi `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` ustrezno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sentinel `__ALL__` in the `whitelist` input** (case-insensitive). The diff logic MUST be skipped and an empty whitelist MUST be emitted, which deploys everything in the workflow's scope. This is the explicit opt-out from diff narrowing for manual dispatch."
msgstr "**Sentinel `__ALL__` v `whitelist` vnos** (neobčutljiva na velikost črk). Logika diff mora biti preskočiti in prazen beli seznam mora biti izpuščen, ki razporedi vse v obsegu delovnega toka. To je izrecna zavrnitev zožitve diff za ročno odpošiljanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Serve stage:** pinned ``nginx:<version>-alpine`` ships the rendered ``/public`` from the builder stage as ``/usr/share/nginx/html``."
msgstr "**Servisna stopnja:** pripeto ``nginx:<version>-alpine`` ladje, s katerimi je bilo opravljeno ``/public`` z gradbeniškega odra kot ``/usr/share/nginx/html``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Serve stage:** pinned `nginx:<version>-alpine` ships the rendered `/public` from the builder stage as `/usr/share/nginx/html`."
msgstr "**Servisna stopnja:** pripeto `nginx:<version>-alpine` ladje, s katerimi je bilo opravljeno `/public` z gradbeniškega odra kot `/usr/share/nginx/html`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Server-name alias:** ``zammad.helpdesk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` is a true vhost alias of ``helpdesk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` (not a 301 redirect)."
msgstr "**Ime strežnika:** ``zammad.helpdesk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` je pravi vhost alias ``helpdesk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` (ni 301 preusmeritev)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Server-name alias:** `zammad.helpdesk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` is a true vhost alias of `helpdesk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` (not a 301 redirect)."
msgstr "**Ime strežnika:** `zammad.helpdesk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` je pravi vhost alias `helpdesk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` (ni 301 preusmeritev)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Service Configuration:** Sets up a systemd service for running the balancing script."
msgstr "**Nastavitev storitve:** Nastavi sistemsko storitev za vodenje skripta za izravnavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Service Installation & Configuration:** Installs and configures necessary components (including the ``curl`` package)."
msgstr "**Nastavitve in namestitev storitve:** Namesti in nastavi potrebne komponente (vključno z ``curl`` paket)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
