# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smart Execution Logic**"
msgstr "**Logika pametne usmrtitve**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smart Execution Logic**   Prevents multiple runs in one play by setting a `run_once_sys_ctl_cln_certs` fact."
msgstr "**Logika pametne usmrtitve** Preprečuje večkratne vožnje v eni igri z nastavitvijo a `run_once_sys_ctl_cln_certs` Dejstvo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smart Injection**"
msgstr "**Pametno injiciranje**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smart Injection**   Uses NGINX's `sub_filter` to insert the tracking and theming snippets right before the closing `</head>` tag of your HTML documents."
msgstr "**Pametno injiciranje** Uporablja NGINX `sub_filter` za vstavljanje sledilnih in tematskih odrezkov tik pred zapiranjem `</head>` oznaka vaših dokumentov HTML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smoother inventory creation:** Inventory and credential generation now work consistently after refactors, without brittle path assumptions."
msgstr "**Bolj gladka izdelava inventarja:** Inventar in generacija zaupanja zdaj deluje dosledno po refaktorjih, brez krhkih predpostavk poti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** on a btrfs data root the whole run is captured from one atomic filesystem snapshot with no container stopped; the host is probed before every run and falls back to the live copy when a snapshot would not be faithful."
msgstr "**Snapshot-ware:** na btrfs podatkovni koren je celoten potek ujet iz enega atomskega datotečnega sistema posnetka brez ustavitve zabojnika; gostitelj je pred vsakim zagonom sondiran in pade nazaj v živo kopijo, ko posnetek ne bi bil zvest."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync `--link-dest` against the previous local snapshot deduplicates unchanged files."
msgstr "**Snapshot-ware:** rsync `--link-dest` glede na prejšnje krajevne slike deduplicira nespremenjene datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync `--link-dest` against the previous snapshot keeps storage growth proportional to actual change."
msgstr "**Snapshot-ware:** rsync `--link-dest` glede na prejšnji posnetek ohranja rast skladiščenja sorazmerno z dejansko spremembo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync ``--link-dest`` against the previous local snapshot deduplicates unchanged files."
msgstr "**Snapshot-ware:** rsync ``--link-dest`` glede na prejšnje krajevne slike deduplicira nespremenjene datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync ``--link-dest`` against the previous snapshot keeps storage growth proportional to actual change."
msgstr "**Snapshot-ware:** rsync ``--link-dest`` glede na prejšnji posnetek ohranja rast skladiščenja sorazmerno z dejansko spremembo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sovereign File Sync and Share:** Self-host file sync, shares, and collaborative spaces under your own domain."
msgstr "**Sinhronizacija in souporaba suverenih datotek:** Samo- host datoteke sinhronizacijo, deli, in sodelovalne prostore v vaši domeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sovereign Video Conferencing:** Self-host meetings under your own domain without external SaaS dependency."
msgstr "**Državna videokonferenca:** Sestanki self-host pod vašo lastno domeno brez zunanje odvisnosti SaaS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Speed is measured at deploy time, not declared, and only for a model that has no rate yet.** A rate is a property of this machine under this load, not of the model, so no catalogue carries one and a hand-written number in `services.yml` would be a guess that rots. After the gateway is warm, [measure_speed.py](../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/python/measure_speed.py) asks it which models it serves and sends one warm-up request plus `services.litellm.router_speed_samples` (12) measured requests to each unranked one, taking their median as output tokens per second. The warm-up is discarded at every setting, including a one-sample run: a rate that still carries the model load time ranks a small model below a larger one, and the router then routes on that inversion."
msgstr "**Hitrost se meri ob času uporabe, ni navedena, in samo za model, ki še nima stopnje.** Stopnja je lastnost tega stroja pod to obremenitvijo, ne modela, tako da noben katalog nosi eno in ročno napisano številko v `services.yml` Ugibam, da gnije. Ko je prehod topel, [measure_speed.py](../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/python/measure_speed.py) vpraša, kateri modeli služijo in pošlje eno zahtevo za ogrevanje plus `services.litellm.router_speed_samples` (12) Izmerjene zahteve za vsako nerazvrščeno osebo, pri čemer je njihova mediana kot izhodni žeton na sekundo. Ogrevanje se zavrže pri vsaki nastavitvi, vključno z enovzorčnim potekom: stopnja, ki še vedno nosi čas obremenitve modela, uvršča majhen model pod večjo, usmerjevalnik pa nato na tej inverziji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Stabilized multi-distro CI deploys** with per-distro orchestration, two-pass *ASYNC* testing, hard cleanup between runs, and a global execution time budget"
msgstr "**Stabilizirani multi-distro CI uporablja** s per-distro orkestracijo, dvopasovno *ASYNC* testiranje, trdo čiščenje med poteki in globalni proračun za čas izvrševanja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Stack:** TypeScript + Svelte (with some Astro). `pnpm` monorepo."
msgstr "**Zbirka:** VrstaScript + Svelte (z nekaj Astro). `pnpm` monorepo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Staging dir**: `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>` (default `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright/<role>`). Contains the rendered `.env` and the Playwright project from the last deploy."
msgstr "**Staging dir**: `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>` (privzeto `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright/<role>`). Vsebuje prevedeno `.env` in projekt Playwright iz zadnje razporeditve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Standardized container execution** by fully replacing raw Docker CLI usage with the *container* and *compose* wrappers, enforcing engine-agnostic behavior via integration tests"
msgstr "**Standardizirana izvedba posode** s popolno zamenjavo surove uporabe Docker CLI z uporabo *vsebnik* ter *compose* ovitki, uveljavljanje agnostičnega vedenja motorja prek integracijskih testov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Standards Support:** Seamlessly integrate with SAML, OpenID Connect, and OAuth2 to support various authentication flows."
msgstr "**Podpora standardom:** Brezhibno povezovanje s SAML, OpenID Connect, in OAuth2 podpirati različne tokove avtentikacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Static Content Hosting:** Serve any type of static files (documents, software, media, etc.)."
msgstr "**Statično gostovanje vsebin:** Služijo vse vrste statičnih datotek (dokumente, programsko opremo, medije itd.)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Static IP:** Exposes a fixed resolver address on its own network for ``dns:`` targeting."
msgstr "**Statični IP:** Razkrije fiksni naslov reševalca na svojem omrežju za ``dns:`` Ciljanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Static IP:** Exposes a fixed resolver address on its own network for `dns:` targeting."
msgstr "**Statični IP:** Razkrije fiksni naslov reševalca na svojem omrežju za `dns:` Ciljanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Static Site Hosting:** Serves HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and other static files."
msgstr "**Statično gostovanje mesta:** Služi HTML, CSS, JavaScript, in druge statične datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Status codes / health.** An authenticated MCP endpoint returns a non-2xx status (e.g. `401`/`406`) to unauthenticated probes. The role MUST NOT let the MCP path break the platform uptime/status-code check: either the health probe targets an unauthenticated `mcp.endpoint.health_path`, or the MCP path is excluded from the canonical `status_codes` check. The chosen approach MUST be explicit in `server.yml`."
msgstr "**Statusne kode / zdravje.** Potrjena končna točka MCP vrne ne-2Status xx (Npr. `401`/`406`) na neavtohtone sonde. Vloga NE SME dovoliti, da bi pot MCP prekinila preverjanje razpoložljivosti/status-kode platforme: bodisi zdravstvena sonda cilja neavtentirano `mcp.endpoint.health_path`, ali je pot MCP izključena iz kanoničnega `status_codes` Preveri. Izbrani pristop MORA biti izrecen v `server.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Status:** accepted"
msgstr "**Stanje:** sprejet"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Storage backend is `raft`** (integrated storage), single node, on one persistent volume."
msgstr "**Hrbtenica za shranjevanje je `raft`** (integrirano skladiščenje), eno vozlišče, na eno vztrajno glasnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Stream proxy support**: includes ``stream`` block for TCP/UDP proxies."
msgstr "**Stream posredniška podpora**: vključuje ``stream`` blok za pooblaščence TCP/UDP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Stream proxy support**: includes `stream` block for TCP/UDP proxies."
msgstr "**Stream posredniška podpora**: vključuje `stream` blok za pooblaščence TCP/UDP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Streaming and recording:** Provides the upstream OBS Studio binary for both live broadcasting and local recording."
msgstr "**Pretok in snemanje:** Zagotavlja gornji tok OBS Studio binarno za prenos v živo in za lokalno snemanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Streamlined Configuration:** Automatically creates necessary directories and applies correct file permissions."
msgstr "**Poenostavljena nastavitev:** Samodejno ustvarja potrebne mape in uporablja pravilna dovoljenja za datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Strict assertion:** Missing ``storage.nfs.server`` or fails the deploy with a precise error."
msgstr "**Stroga trditev:** Manjka ``storage.nfs.server`` ali pa ne uspe z natančno napako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Strict assertion:** Missing `storage.nfs.server` or fails the deploy with a precise error."
msgstr "**Stroga trditev:** Manjka `storage.nfs.server` ali pa ne uspe z natančno napako."

