# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token handling was unified:** Mailu and Matomo now read tokens from users.*.tokens (mailu_token legacy removed), and a token-store hydration mechanism loads persisted tokens automatically."
msgstr "**Ravnanje z žetoni je bilo poenoteno:** Mailu in Matomo Zdaj preberite žetone uporabnikov.*žetoni (mailu_token zapuščina odstranjena), in žetoni v hidracijskem mehanizmu žetone."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token protected:** every request carries a token from the credential store; the token is never handed to a browser user."
msgstr "**Zaščiten žeton:** vsaka zahteva nosi žeton iz hrambe; žeton se nikoli ne izroči uporabniku brskalnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token publishing:** Manager-fetched worker/manager join tokens are published as facts to every cluster member."
msgstr "**Založništvo Token:** Žetoni za pridružitev delavcev/upraviteljev, ki so v lasti upravitelja, se objavijo kot dejstva za vsakega člana grozda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token verified against the hub:** Every deploy asks the hub whether the stored token still authenticates and re-mints it when the hub rejects it, then fails the deploy if the fresh token is rejected too. A hub whose `.storage/auth` was recreated leaves a stored token pointing at a deleted refresh token, and clients would receive a 401 on every call."
msgstr "**Žeton preverjen na vozlišču:** Vsaka aplikacija vpraša vozlišče, ali shranjeni žeton še vedno potrjuje in ponovno meti, ko ga vozlišče zavrne, nato pa ne izvede, če se zavrne tudi svež žeton. Središče, katerega `.storage/auth` Ponarejeni listi shranjen žeton, ki kaže na izbrisano osvežitev žeton, in stranke bi prejeli 401 Na vsak klic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token verified against the hub:** Every deploy asks the hub whether the stored token still authenticates and re-mints it when the hub rejects it, then fails the deploy if the fresh token is rejected too. A hub whose ``.storage/auth`` was recreated leaves a stored token pointing at a deleted refresh token, and clients would receive a 401 on every call."
msgstr "**Žeton preverjen na vozlišču:** Vsaka aplikacija vpraša vozlišče, ali shranjeni žeton še vedno potrjuje in ponovno meti, ko ga vozlišče zavrne, nato pa ne izvede, če se zavrne tudi svež žeton. Središče, katerega ``.storage/auth`` Ponarejeni listi shranjen žeton, ki kaže na izbrisano osvežitev žeton, in stranke bi prejeli 401 Na vsak klic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tokens & Secrets:** Unified token handling through a centralized token store, added user token defaults, and fully centralized secrets path definitions across roles."
msgstr "**Žetoni in skrivnosti:** Enotni žeton ravnanje skozi centralizirano žeton trgovina, doda uporabnik žeton privzetih, in popolnoma centralizirane opredelitve poti skrivnosti med vlogami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor = compose sidecar**, `network_mode: host`, keys on a named volume, restored from the vaulted mint **before** Tor starts. Backup via `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."
msgstr "**Tor = sestavljena stranska prikolica**, `network_mode: host`, tipke na imenovani glasnosti, obnovljena iz obokane mete **Pred uporabo** Tor se začne. Varnostna kopija preko `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor as a first-class deployment axis.** The new *svc-net-tor* role routes onion names through Tor via DNS instead of per-app proxies, offers a chutney flavor for private-net test deployments, and ties its dnsmasq listener to ownership rather than the deploy mode. Applications follow: server-side OIDC discovery and token exchange reach plaintext onion issuers through the SOCKS proxy (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), session cookies drop the *Secure* flag where an onion cannot carry it (Taiga, Pixelfed, Joomla), and mail authenticates on the submission port the onion relay actually serves. The deploy matrix gained a tor axis with an onion marker plus enforced and exclusive modes, and lint now requires the onion in every variant. See the [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) README."
msgstr "**Tor kot prvovrstna pogonska os.** Novo *svc-net-tor* čebulne poti preko Tor preko DNS namesto na app proxies, ponuja chutney okus za zasebno-net testne razporeditve, in povezuje svojega dnsmasq poslušalca z lastništvom namesto načina razporeditve. Programi sledijo: iskanje z OIDC strani strežnika in žetonska izmenjava dosežejo izdajatelje navadnega čebula preko posredniškega strežnika SOCKS (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), seje piškotke spusti *Varno* zastava, kjer je čebula ne more nositi (Taiga, Pixelfed, Joomla), in pošto overovitve na vrata predložitve čebula štafeta dejansko služi. Matrika je dobila os tor s čebulnim označevalcem in uveljavljenimi in ekskluzivnimi načini, zdaj pa zahteva čebulo v vsaki varianti. Glejte [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) -Preberi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor image built via `files/Dockerfile`** from a pinned Debian `tor` package (`deb.debian.org`; no sandbox-allowlist change). `deb.torproject.org` = documented alternative requiring an allowlist entry."
msgstr "**Slika Tor zgrajena preko `files/Dockerfile`** iz pripetega Debiana `tor` paket (`deb.debian.org`; ni spremembe peskovnika-dopustni seznam). `deb.torproject.org` = dokumentirana alternativa, ki zahteva vstop na seznam dovoljenj."

