# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**V1 (SSO):** The oauth2-proxy edge gate redirects all requests to Keycloak. ``files/hooks.js`` reads the trusted ``Remote-Email`` header openresty sets once the gate passes and auto-provisions/logs in the matching n8n user (role ``global:member``, or the pre-existing owner for ``users.administrator.email``), so every Keycloak user — administrator and regular users alike — lands directly on n8n’s own workflow surface with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**V1 (SSO):** Oauth2-proxy rob vrata preusmeri vse zahteve na Keycloak. ``files/hooks.js`` bere zaupanja vredno ``Remote-Email`` openresty glave set po prehodu vrat in samodejno načrtovanje/log v ujemanju n8n uporabnik (vloga ``global:member``, ali že obstoječi lastnik za ``users.administrator.email``), tako vsak Keycloak uporabnik – administrator in redni uporabniki – pristane neposredno na n8n lastna površina delovnega toka brez sekunde, n8n-lokalni prijavni korak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**V1 (SSO):** The oauth2-proxy edge gate redirects all requests to Keycloak. `files/hooks.js` reads the trusted `Remote-Email` header openresty sets once the gate passes and auto-provisions/logs in the matching n8n user (role `global:member`, or the pre-existing owner for `users.administrator.email`), so every Keycloak user — administrator and regular users alike — lands directly on n8n's own workflow surface with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**V1 (SSO):** Oauth2-proxy rob vrata preusmeri vse zahteve na Keycloak. `files/hooks.js` bere zaupanja vredno `Remote-Email` openresty glave set po prehodu vrat in samodejno načrtovanje/log v ujemanju n8n uporabnik (vloga `global:member`, ali že obstoječi lastnik za `users.administrator.email`), tako vsak Keycloak uporabnik – administrator in redni uporabniki – pristane neposredno na n8n-jeva delovna površina brez sekunde, n8n-lokalni prijavni korak."

