# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Why this matters:** Loops can hide destructive operations (for example `for f in $(ls); do rm \"$f\"; done`) behind a single approval step. The deny rule converts a rule violation into a hard failure, so the agent receives concrete feedback and refactors to the flat form."
msgstr "**Zakaj je to pomembno?** Zanke lahko skrijejo uničevalne operacije (na primer `for f in $(ls); do rm \"$f\"; done`) za enim samim korakom odobritve. Pravilo zanikanja spremeni pravilo kršenja v trd neuspeh, zato agent prejme konkretne povratne informacije in refaktorje v ploščato obliko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Why this set?** [Debian](https://www.debian.org) is preferred for stable community-operated servers because it offers long-term support without commercial backing requirements. [Fedora](https://fedoraproject.org) and [CentOS](https://www.centos.org) are required to ensure compatibility with [Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL)](https://www.redhat.com/en/technologies/linux-platforms/enterprise-linux) environments. Red Hat support MUST be guaranteed because enterprise customers operate under SLA and security compliance requirements that mandate a RHEL-compatible platform, including certified package versions, SELinux enforcement, and vendor-backed security advisories. [Arch Linux](https://archlinux.org) is included to catch integration problems with newer software versions early in the development cycle before they reach stable distributions."
msgstr "**Zakaj je tako?** [Debian](https://www.debian.org) ima prednost pri stabilnih strežnikih, ki jih upravlja skupnost, ker zagotavlja dolgoročno podporo brez zahtev za komercialno podporo. [Fedora](https://fedoraproject.org) ter [CentOS](https://www.centos.org) morajo zagotoviti združljivost z [Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL)](https://www.redhat.com/en/technologies/linux-platforms/enterprise-linux) okolja. Podpora Red Hat mora biti zagotovljena, ker podjetja stranke delujejo v skladu s SLA in varnostne zahteve skladnosti, ki zahtevajo RHEL-združljivo platformo, vključno s certificiranimi paket različice, SELINux uveljavljanje, in prodajalci-podprte varnostne svetovalce. [Arch Linux](https://archlinux.org) je vključen za reševanje težav pri integraciji z novejšimi različicami programske opreme zgodaj v razvojnem ciklu, preden dosežejo stabilno porazdelitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Why:** Friendica currently authenticates in two steps: oauth2-proxy gates the vhost (Keycloak-Authorization-Code-Flow, 2FA-enforceable), then the user must fill Friendica's own `/login` form because stock Friendica has **no header-trusted auto-login** — Owa.php / OAuth/Token.php only read `HTTP_AUTHORIZATION` for API endpoints, never for the web session. The ldapauth addon stays enabled solely as a first-login bootstrap that materialises the `friendica.user` row from openldap."
msgstr "**Zakaj:** Frienica trenutno potrjuje v dveh korakih: oauth2- Proxy vrata vhost (Keycloak-Pooblastitev...Code-Flow, 2Uveljavljanje FA), potem mora uporabnik izpolniti FriendicaLastna. `/login` oblika zaradi zaloge Friendica ima **brez samodejnega loginiranja, zaupanega z glavo** — Owa.php / OAuth/Token.php samo beri `HTTP_AUTHORIZATION` besedilo API končne točke, nikoli za spletno sejo. Idapauth addon ostane omogočen samo kot prvi login škornji past, ki se uresniči `friendica.user` Veslajte iz Openldapa."

