msgstr "**Nastavitve YAML- Driven**: Definiraj vse vsebine & strukturo enostavno v `config.yaml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Your tools reachable from your assistants.** About twenty applications now speak MCP. Gitea, GitLab, Mattermost, Nextcloud, n8n, Baserow, Jenkins, Home Assistant, Moodle, Snipe-IT and WordPress serve their own endpoints; ten more get one through a locked-down sidecar. Open WebUI, Flowise and the agents discover what the deployment offers and register it automatically. Access is bounded rather than assumed: blocked paths are declared, every served path is gated, tools a provider calls mutating are withheld, reader and writer roles are separate, and each provider authenticates callers as its own service account. See [svc-ai-mcp-adapter](roles/svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md)."
msgstr "**Vaše orodje je dosegljivo od vaših pomočnikov.** Približno dvajset prijav zdaj govori MCP. Gitea, GitLab, Mattermost, Nextcloud, n8n, Baserow, Jenkins, Home Assistant, Moodle, Snipe-IT in WordPress služijo lastne končne točke; še deset jih dobi eno skozi zaklenjeno prikolico. Odpri spletni vmesnik, Flowise in agenti odkrijejo, kaj namestitev ponuja in jo registrirajo samodejno. Dostop je omejen, namesto da bi predvidevali: zamašene poti so prijavljene, vsaka ponujena pot je zaklenjena, orodja, ki jih ponudnik mutira, so zadržana, bralne in pisateljske vloge ločene, vsak ponudnik pa overi klicatelje kot svoj službeni račun. Glej. [svc-ai-mcp-adapter](roles/svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Zone Resources:** Set to `Include → All zones`   (Or restrict to specific zones as needed for your environment.)"
msgstr "**Območje Viri:** Nastavi na `Include → All zones` (Ali pa omejite na določena območja, ki so potrebna za vaše okolje.)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus container hardening. Ships an official web dashboard with **self-hosted OIDC** auth (fits the platform SSO), delegates work through **isolated subagents**, has persistent memory, scheduling, vision web browsing, and MCP support (**client since v0.2.0, server since v0.6.0**). Deployed as `web-app-hermes`."
msgstr "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Raziskava Nous, MIT). Samogostoljubno z `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` hrbtenice in zatrjevanje posode. Ladje uradno spletno armaturno ploščo z **samogostujoči OIDC** auth (ustreza platformi SSO), delegati delajo skozi **izolirani subagenti**, ima vztrajen spomin, urnik, Vizija brskanje po spletu in podporo MCP (**odjemalec od v0.2.0, strežnik od v0.6.0**). Nastavljen kot `web-app-hermes`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, persistent memory, skills/plugins, and native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, both client and server). Deployed as `web-app-openclaw`."
msgstr "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (odprtokodna, npm/pnpm)Vgrajena spletna armaturna plošča Gateway (privzeta vrata `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, nadzor brskalnika, datotečni peskovnik, vztrajen pomnilnik, spretnosti/plugini in domači MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, tako odjemalec kot strežnik). Nastavljen kot `web-app-openclaw`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular sync pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding the host_var, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the async pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
msgstr "**`--full-cycle` (async posodobitev prepustnica).** Ko je omogočeno (ali `full_cycle=true` o `make compose-deploy`), Ovitek teče vsako rundo razporedi TWICE: najprej redno sinhronizacijo podajo, nato takoj drugo podajo z `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` prevladajo host_var, proti mapi Same variante, preden se premaknete v naslednji krog. Obe podaji se zato vedno sododaljujeta na isto državo gostiteljico; async prepustnica nikoli slučajno ne cilja gostitelja, ki ga je prejšna različica kroga pustila za seboj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`.onion` is in the Public Suffix List** → `user@x.onion` passes most validators."
msgstr "**`.onion` je na javnem seznamu pripone** → `user@x.onion` mimo večine potrjevalcev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`/etc/hosts` fallback**. used in non-systemd environments (e.g. Docker containers, LXC) where service management is unavailable; writes a managed block of host entries directly into the hosts file."
msgstr "**`/etc/hosts` rezervno**. uporablja se v nesistemskih okoljih (npr. posode za doker, LXC) kadar upravljanje storitev ni na voljo; neposredno v datoteko gostiteljev zapiše upravljan blok vnosov gostiteljev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`/etc/resolv.conf`** pointed at the local dnsmasq instance (`127.0.0.1`)."
msgstr "**`/etc/resolv.conf`** opozoril na lokalni primerek dnsmasq (`127.0.0.1`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`/etc/wsl.conf`** set to `generateResolvConf=false` to prevent WSL from overwriting the resolver config on restart."
msgstr "**`/etc/wsl.conf`** nastavljeno na `generateResolvConf=false` preprečiti, da bi WSL ob ponovnem zagonu prepisal konfiguracijo reševalca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`DOMAIN_PRIMARY` = the node's `.onion` address.** Everything derives from `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`, so the whole node becomes Tor-native with **zero domain-transform code**:"
msgstr "**`DOMAIN_PRIMARY` = vozlišče `.onion` naslov.** Vse izhaja iz `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`, tako da celotno vozlišče postane Tor-native z **koda ničelne transformne domene**:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`HEALTH_CSP_IGNORE_NETWORK_BLOCKS_FROM`** (list, default: `[]`)   Optional list of domains whose network block failures (e.g., ORB) should be ignored during CSP checks."
msgstr "**`HEALTH_CSP_IGNORE_NETWORK_BLOCKS_FROM`** (seznam, privzeto: `[]`) Neobvezen seznam domen, katerih napake v omrežnih blokih (npr. ORB) je treba med pregledi CSP prezreti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`TOR_EGRESS_ENABLED: false` default.** Flag + plumbing in MVP (SOCKS `127.0.0.1:9050` reachable for containers when enabled, documented); transparent egress torification out of scope. Inbound is always onion."
msgstr "**`TOR_EGRESS_ENABLED: false` privzeto.** Zastava + vodovod v MVP (SOCKS `127.0.0.1:9050` dosegljiv za posode, kadar je omogočen, dokumentiran); pregledno izginotje s področja uporabe. Prihaja vedno čebula."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``HEALTH_CSP_IGNORE_NETWORK_BLOCKS_FROM``** (list, default: ``[]``) Optional list of domains whose network block failures (e.g., ORB) should be ignored during CSP checks."
msgstr "**``HEALTH_CSP_IGNORE_NETWORK_BLOCKS_FROM``** (seznam, privzeto: ``[]``) Neobvezen seznam domen, katerih napake v omrežnih blokih (npr. ORB) je treba med pregledi CSP prezreti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``disable-onboarding``** is in ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` so users land directly on the dashboard (sovereign install; also keeps the project/asset flows testable)."
msgstr "**``disable-onboarding``** je v ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` uporabniki pristanejo neposredno na armaturni plošči (državna inštalacija; prav tako omogoča preizkušanje tokov projekta/sredstva)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``extensions/``** stays local. Extensions are rebuilt from the role-managed git source on every install — no shared state needs to survive a node move."
msgstr "**``extensions/``** ostane domačin. Razširitve so obnovljene iz vira git, upravljanega z vlogami, na vsakem installu – nobena skupna država ni potrebna za preživetje premika vozlišča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``external.sh`` — real job-pickup smoke test (optional).** Uses ``RUNNER_API_TOKEN`` to confirm the runners registered and are online via the GitHub API, dispatches a smoke workflow, and polls it to completion. Skipped automatically when no token is present."
msgstr "**``external.sh`` — pravi preskus dimljenja pri iskanju zaposlitve (neobvezno).** Uporaba ``RUNNER_API_TOKEN`` za potrditev prijavljenih tekačev in so na spletu preko GitHub APIOdpošlje dim in ga dokonča. Samodejno preskočil, ko ni nobenega žetona."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``images/``** opts into NFS (``nfs: true`` in the ``compose_volumes`` call from ``templates/compose.yml.j2``). The volume is shared across all swarm nodes so the MediaWiki application service can be rescheduled freely."
msgstr "**``images/``** odloči v NFS (``nfs: true`` v ``compose_volumes`` klic od ``templates/compose.yml.j2``). Volumen se deli po vseh vozliščih rojov, tako da MediaWiki Storitev aplikacije se lahko prosto prestavi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``local.sh`` — fully local, no external GitHub.** Checks the runner containers are healthy and the DooD socket works, then ``container cp``\\ s the repo into a runner, **builds the Infinito image locally**, and deploys ``web-app-dashboard`` (all other services disabled) inside a **sealed, throwaway Docker daemon** that shares the runner’s network namespace. The sandbox is torn down on exit, so the host stack is never touched and **no GitHub/GHCR access is required**. On the async test pass the heavy deploy is skipped (it is validated once on the sync pass)."
msgstr "**``local.sh`` – v celoti lokalno, brez zunanjega GitHuba.** Preveri tekaške posode so zdrave in DooD vtičnica deluje, potem ``container cp``Zaplemba v tekača. **gradi sliko Infinito lokalno**, in razporedi ``web-app-dashboard`` (vse druge storitve, onemogočene) znotraj a **zapečaten, odvržen demon Docker** ki si deli imenski prostor tekača. Peskovnik se podre na izhodu, zato se gostitelja nikoli ne dotakne in **dostop GitHub/GHCR ni potreben**. Na testu async preskočiti težka uporaba (je potrjena enkrat na sinhronski prepustnici)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
