msgstr "**``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’ SSO-proxy sidecar** *(neobvezno)* – ščiti mesto z OAuth2."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`administrative_surface` (5):** `web-app-fusiondirectory`, `web-app-lam`, `web-app-pgadmin`, `web-app-phpldapadmin`, `web-app-phpmyadmin`. These UIs expose identity or database administration rather than a bounded application-domain API and are never represented by a shared service-account tool surface."
msgstr "**`administrative_surface` (5):** `web-app-fusiondirectory`, `web-app-lam`, `web-app-pgadmin`, `web-app-phpldapadmin`, `web-app-phpmyadmin`. Ti UI izpostavljajo identiteto ali upravljanje zbirke podatkov namesto omejenega področja uporabe API in jih nikoli ne predstavlja skupna površina orodja za servisne račune."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`algorithm:` defaults to `plain`** when the field is omitted."
msgstr "**`algorithm:` privzeto za `plain`** ko je polje izpuščeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`allowed_consumers` creates no network edge.** A client reaches a provider only when the provider declares a `kind: mcp_client` consumer in `meta/networks.yml`, or when the client happens to declare that provider for an unrelated reason. Four of twenty providers declared the opening; the other sixteen admitted consumers they could not serve, four of them enabled. Deploying Hermes failed at its own probe with `All connection attempts failed` against `http://prometheusmcp:8080/mcp`, because `hermes` joins `[gitlab, hermes, homeassistant, litellm, moodle]` while `prometheusmcp` joins `[prometheus]` alone."
msgstr "**`allowed_consumers` ne ustvarja mrežnega roba.** Odjemalec doseže ponudnika le, če ponudnik objavi `kind: mcp_client` potrošnik v `meta/networks.yml`, ali ko se zgodi, da stranka razglasi tega ponudnika iz nepovezanega razloga. Štiri od dvajset ponudnikov je razglasilo odprtje; ostalih šestnajst je sprejelo potrošnike, ki jim niso mogli služiti, štirje so omogočili. Vzpostavljanje Hermes ni uspelo na lastno sondo z `All connection attempts failed` proti `http://prometheusmcp:8080/mcp`, ker `hermes` pridruži `[gitlab, hermes, homeassistant, litellm, moodle]` med `prometheusmcp` pridruži `[prometheus]` Sam."

