# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`docker exec` is FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NEVER invoke `docker exec` (nor nested `docker exec … docker exec …` into the DiD stack) directly. Always reach the live stack through `make` targets (e.g. `make compose-exec`, or the role-specific targets the `Makefile` exposes). If no `make` target covers what you need, ask the operator instead of falling back to raw `docker exec`."
msgstr "**`docker exec` FORBIDEN. ⛔** Nikoli se ne smete sklicevati `docker exec` (niti vgnezdeno `docker exec … docker exec …` v DiD sklad) neposredno. Vedno priti do živega sklada skozi `make` cilji (Npr. `make compose-exec`, ali cilje za posamezno vlogo `Makefile` izpostavljenosti)Če ne `make` Tarča pokriva tisto, kar potrebujete, vprašajte operaterja, namesto da bi se vrnil na surovo. `docker exec`."

