msgstr "**`linux.sh`**. namesti CA v skrbniško trgovino Linux sistema"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`local.sh` — fully local, no external GitHub.** Checks the runner containers are healthy and the DooD socket works, then `container cp`s the repo into a runner, **builds the Infinito image locally**, and deploys `web-app-dashboard` (all other services disabled) inside a **sealed, throwaway Docker daemon** that shares the runner's network namespace. The sandbox is torn down on exit, so the host stack is never touched and **no GitHub/GHCR access is required**. On the async test pass the heavy deploy is skipped (it is validated once on the sync pass)."
msgstr "**`local.sh` – v celoti lokalno, brez zunanjega GitHuba.** Preveri tekaške posode so zdrave in DooD vtičnica deluje, potem `container cp`za repo v tekača, **gradi sliko Infinito lokalno**, in razporedi `web-app-dashboard` (vse druge storitve, onemogočene) znotraj a **zapečaten, odvržen demon Docker** Ki si deli imenski prostor tekačev. Peskovnik se podre na izhodu, zato se gostitelja nikoli ne dotakne in **dostop GitHub/GHCR ni potreben**. Na testu async preskočiti težka uporaba (je potrjena enkrat na sinhronski prepustnici)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`mechanism: bridge`** marks an addon that *is* a network/appservice bridge to an external system (e.g. a Matrix `mautrix` bridge to WhatsApp)."
msgstr "**`mechanism: bridge`** označuje addon, ki *m* most za omrežje/appservice do zunanjega sistema (Npr. Matrix `mautrix` most na WhatsApp)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`no_remote_surface` (27):** `svc-ai-ollama`, `svc-ai-robot`, `svc-ai-s1`, `svc-ai-searxng`, `svc-ai-tika`, `web-app-chess`, `web-app-dashboard`, `web-app-docs`, `web-app-fediwall`, `web-app-hugo`, `web-app-littlejs`, `web-app-mig`, `web-app-mini-qr`, `web-app-navigator`, `web-app-roulette-wheel`, `web-opt-rdr-domains`, `web-opt-rdr-www`, `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-css`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-html`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-logout`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-simpleicons`. These roles have no independently useful authenticated remote action contract at the pinned implementation. Static published content may later be consumed through one owning application's bounded `resource_readonly` adapter, but a new MCP sidecar that merely reimplements a static site's behaviour does not count as integration. Model tool calling in Ollama does not by itself make Ollama an MCP client or server."
msgstr "**`no_remote_surface` (27):** `svc-ai-ollama`, `svc-ai-robot`, `svc-ai-s1`, `svc-ai-searxng`, `svc-ai-tika`, `web-app-chess`, `web-app-dashboard`, `web-app-docs`, `web-app-fediwall`, `web-app-hugo`, `web-app-littlejs`, `web-app-mig`, `web-app-mini-qr`, `web-app-navigator`, `web-app-roulette-wheel`, `web-opt-rdr-domains`, `web-opt-rdr-www`, `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-css`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-html`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-logout`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-simpleicons`. Te vloge nimajo neodvisno uporabne avtenticirane pogodbe za daljinsko ukrepanje na podlagi izvajanja. Statična objavljena vsebina se lahko pozneje porabi z omejeno uporabo `resource_readonly` adapter, vendar nov MCP stranski priključek, ki zgolj ponovno izvaja obnašanje statičnega mesta ne šteje za integracijo. Vzorčno orodje kliče Ollama sam po sebi ne naredi Ollama odjemalec ali strežnik MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`privileged_control_plane` (27):** `svc-ai-agent-broker`, `svc-ai-jupyter`, `svc-bkp-local-2-device`, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`, `svc-bkp-remote-2-local`, `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, `svc-dns-unbound`, `svc-net-firewall`, `svc-net-tor`, `svc-net-wireguard-core`, `svc-net-wireguard-firewalled`, `svc-net-wireguard-plain`, `svc-opt-keyboard-color`, `svc-opt-ssd-hdd`, `svc-opt-swapfile`, `svc-prx-openresty`, `svc-registry-cache`, `svc-registry-docker`, `svc-runner`, `svc-storage-nfs-client`, `svc-storage-nfs-server`, `svc-swarm-manager`, `svc-swarm-node`, `svc-virt-kata`, `update`, `web-app-openbao`. These roles can recover secrets, alter routing or host state, run code, change deployment state, or reach storage/control-plane sockets; they require a separate audited operations gateway and human approval rather than general-purpose application MCP."
msgstr "**`privileged_control_plane` (27):** `svc-ai-agent-broker`, `svc-ai-jupyter`, `svc-bkp-local-2-device`, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`, `svc-bkp-remote-2-local`, `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, `svc-dns-unbound`, `svc-net-firewall`, `svc-net-tor`, `svc-net-wireguard-core`, `svc-net-wireguard-firewalled`, `svc-net-wireguard-plain`, `svc-opt-keyboard-color`, `svc-opt-ssd-hdd`, `svc-opt-swapfile`, `svc-prx-openresty`, `svc-registry-cache`, `svc-registry-docker`, `svc-runner`, `svc-storage-nfs-client`, `svc-storage-nfs-server`, `svc-swarm-manager`, `svc-swarm-node`, `svc-virt-kata`, `update`, `web-app-openbao`. Te vloge lahko izterjajo skrivnosti, spremenijo usmerjanje ali državo gostiteljico, zaženejo kodo, spremenijo stanje uporabe ali dosežejo vtičnice za shranjevanje/nadzor letala; zahtevajo ločene revidirane operacije prehod in človeško odobritev namesto splošne aplikacije MCP."

