# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A blank ``current`` (the addon tracks the app default) never produces a suggestion, and a non-semver ``latest`` is ignored so the checker never proposes a non-comparable tag."
msgstr "Prazen ``current`` (addon sledi privzeti aplikaciji) nikoli ne ustvari sugestije in nesemver ``latest`` je prezrta, tako da šaher nikoli ne predlaga neprimerljive oznake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A block device (remote path under ``/dev/``) is recovered on the host over ssh (the host must carry the repo checkout), then the restored backup tree is rsync-pulled. An image file is rsync-pulled and recovered locally. Either way the result is a local backup root the caller then recovers from."
msgstr "Bločna naprava (oddaljena pot pod ``/dev/``) se izterja na gostitelju nad ssh (gostitelj mora imeti odjavo za repo)Potem je restavrirano drevo rsync-pulled. Slika datoteka je rsync-pulled in izterjati lokalno. V vsakem primeru je rezultat lokalni rezervni koren klicatelj nato okreva od."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A block naming a key the entity does not carry, or a type the resolver does not know, would otherwise pin nothing and say nothing."
msgstr "Blok z imenom ključa, ki ga podjetje ne nosi, ali tip, ki ga reševalec ne pozna, bi sicer ničesar ne pribil in rekel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A block that only one side has is usually a feature the other never had. Check whether it was superseded before dropping it — grep for its variables."
msgstr "Blok, ki ga ima samo ena stran, je običajno značilnost, ki je drugi nikoli ni imel. Preverite, ali je bil zamenjan, preden ga spustite – grep za njegove spremenljivke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A body that asserts only constants (`expect(1).toBe(1)`) without driving any role surface is rejected on review."
msgstr "Telo, ki trdi samo konstante (`expect(1).toBe(1)`) brez vožnje katere koli površine vloge se ob pregledu zavrne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A body that carries a `TODO`, `STUB`, `FIXME`, or `XXX` marker is rejected. The contract requires real flows, not deferred work."
msgstr "Telo, ki nosi `TODO`, `STUB`, `FIXME`, ali `XXX` marker je zavrnjen. Pogodba zahteva realne tokove, ne odloženega dela."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A body that contains only `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(...)` (or any combination of helper calls) without at least one `expect(...)`, `await <fn>(...)`, or equivalent real-flow step is rejected."
msgstr "Telo, ki vsebuje samo `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(...)` (ali katera koli kombinacija klicev pomočnikov) brez vsaj enega `expect(...)`, `await <fn>(...)`, ali enakovredna stopnja realnega toka se zavrne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A branch is ready to be opened as a pull request"
msgstr "Veja je pripravljena na odprtje kot zahteva za vlečenje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
