msgstr "Vse nastavitve se obravnavajo preko ``meta/services.yml`` (Zemljevid storitev na korenu datoteke) ter ``meta/server.yml`` (Strežnikov blok na korenu datoteke)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All configuration is handled via `meta/services.yml` (services map at file root) and `meta/server.yml` (server block at file root)."
msgstr "Vse nastavitve se obravnavajo preko `meta/services.yml` (Zemljevid storitev na korenu datoteke) ter `meta/server.yml` (Strežnikov blok na korenu datoteke)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All core modules carry ``required: true`` and ``group: core``, so they are always installed. The ``optional`` group is empty today."
msgstr "Vsi jedrni moduli so na voljo ``required: true`` ter ``group: core``, Vedno so nameščeni. – ``optional`` Skupina je danes prazna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All core modules carry `required: true` and `group: core`, so they are always installed. The `optional` group is empty today."
msgstr "Vsi jedrni moduli so na voljo `required: true` ter `group: core`, Vedno so nameščeni. – `optional` Skupina je danes prazna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All criteria are checked (`- [x]`)."
msgstr "Vsa merila se preverijo (`- [x]`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All deployment roles, Ansible tasks, and programs that run inside a deployed system MUST be compatible with the following distributions."
msgstr "Vse vloge uvajanja, Anzibilne naloge in programi, ki delujejo znotraj sistema, morajo biti združljivi z naslednjimi razporeditvami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All headings MUST use sentence-case (capitalize only the first word and proper nouns)."
msgstr "Vsi naslovi MORAJO uporabljati stavke (Izkoristite samo prvo besedo in prave samostalnike)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All human-readable logs go to **stderr**"
msgstr "Vsi človeški berljivi dnevniki gredo na **stderr**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All non-compose top-level keys (everything except `compose:`, `server:`, `rbac:`, and `credentials:`) MUST be inlined into `meta/services.yml` under `<primary_entity>.<key>`, where `<primary_entity>` is the value returned by `get_entity_name(role_name)`."
msgstr "Vsi nesestavljeni vrhunski ključi (vse, razen `compose:`, `server:`, `rbac:`, in `credentials:`) POTREBNO VKLJUČENO `meta/services.yml` pod `<primary_entity>.<key>`, kjer `<primary_entity>` vrednost, ki jo vrne `get_entity_name(role_name)`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All of them are read-only; ``mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled`` is ``false`` and no write function is attached."
msgstr "Vsi so samo bralni; ``mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled`` m ``false`` in nobena funkcija pisanja ni priložena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All of them are read-only; `mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled` is `false` and no write function is attached."
msgstr "Vsi so samo bralni; `mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled` m `false` in nobena funkcija pisanja ni priložena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All other `4xx`/`5xx` codes and connection errors (DNS, SSL) fail the test."
msgstr "Vse drugo `4xx`/`5xx` kode in napake v povezavi (DNS, SSL) ne opravi preskusa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All other scopes MUST run the full [call-orchestrator.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-orchestrator.yml)."
msgstr "Vsa druga področja uporabe morajo biti polna [call-orchestrator.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-orchestrator.yml)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All post-bootstrap configuration (OIDC Social Login Key, LDAP Settings, outbound Email Account, group-role mapping) runs as Python scripts piped to ``python`` inside the backend container (see ``files/scripts/``)."
msgstr "Vse nastavitve po zagonu (OIDC Socialni ključ, LDAP Nastavitve, izhodni e-poštni račun, kartiranje skupinske role) teče kot Python skripte cevd, da ``python`` v hrbtni posodi (glej ``files/scripts/``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All post-bootstrap configuration (OIDC Social Login Key, LDAP Settings, outbound Email Account, group-role mapping) runs as Python scripts piped to `python` inside the backend container (see `files/scripts/`)."
msgstr "Vse nastavitve po zagonu (OIDC Socialni ključ, LDAP Nastavitve, izhodni e-poštni račun, kartiranje skupinske role) teče kot Python skripte cevd, da `python` v hrbtni posodi (glej `files/scripts/`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All project documentation MUST be reachable at [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."
msgstr "Vsa projektna dokumentacija mora biti dosegljiva [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All resolution kwargs (``image=``, ``version=``, ``custom=``, ``tag_only=``) are forwarded to `image`. For a bare reference (no wrapping), call the `image` lookup directly."
msgstr "Vsi ločevalni kvargi (``image=``, ``version=``, ``custom=``, ``tag_only=``) se pošljejo `image`. Za golo referenco (brez ovojnine), pokličite `image` Poglej naravnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All review comments MUST be resolved"
msgstr "Vse pripombe k pregledu MORAJO biti razrešene"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All rules above are **currently enforced** on `main`."
msgstr "Vsa pravila zgoraj so **trenutno izvršeno** o `main`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All rules apply when targeting `main`."
msgstr "Pri usmerjanju se uporabljajo vsa pravila `main`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All rules in this document are **actively enforced** on the default branch (`main`)."
msgstr "Vsa pravila v tem dokumentu so **aktivno izvršeno** na privzeti veji (`main`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All rules in this document are actively enforced on `main` via GitHub branch protection. See [branch.md](../../tools/github/branch/security.md) for the full enforcement policy."
msgstr "Vsa pravila v tem dokumentu se aktivno izvajajo `main` prek zaščite podružnice GitHub. Glej. [branch.md](../../tools/github/branch/security.md) za polno politiko izvrševanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All scripts extract the Root CA from a running Infinito container and install it into the appropriate system trust store, so that browsers and tools accept `*.infinito.test` TLS certificates without warnings."
msgstr "Vsi skripti izvlečejo Root CA iz tekoče posode Infinito in jo namestijo v ustrezno trgovino sistem zaupanja, tako da brskalniki in orodja sprejmejo `*.infinito.test` Potrdila TLS brez opozoril."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All scripts map `*.infinito.test` → `127.0.0.1` so that local deployments are reachable via their expected hostnames."
msgstr "Zemljevid vseh skriptov `*.infinito.test` → `127.0.0.1` tako, da so lokalne razporeditve dosegljive prek pričakovanih imen gostiteljev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All services are deployed behind a reverse proxy and share a unified authentication layer where applicable. The inventory defines a single default host named 'server' and activates roles declaratively via group names."
msgstr "Vse storitve se izvajajo za povratnim posrednikom in po potrebi delijo enotno stopnjo avtentikacije. Inventar določa enega privzetega gostitelja z imenom 'server' in aktivira vloge deklarativno preko imen skupin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All services are expected to be exposed behind a reverse proxy role where applicable."
msgstr "Vse storitve naj bi bile po potrebi izpostavljene vlogi povratnih posrednikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All services run behind a reverse proxy and share centralized identity management. The inventory defines a single host and activates roles declaratively."
msgstr "Vse storitve potekajo za povratnim posrednikom in delijo centralizirano upravljanje identitete. Inventar definira enega gostitelja in aktivira vloge deklarativno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All settings available as `SEMAPHORE_*` env vars; `_FILE` suffix reads a value from a file (secret-friendly)."
msgstr "Vse nastavitve so na voljo kot `SEMAPHORE_*` env vars; `_FILE` pripona bere vrednost iz datoteke (skrivnostno prijazen)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All tasks are guarded by “run once” facts and `MODE_CLEANUP` flags to avoid unintended re-runs or stale files."
msgstr "Vse naloge so varovane z “beži enkrat” dejstva in `MODE_CLEANUP` zastave za preprečevanje nenamernih ponovitev ali zastojev datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All tasks are guarded by “run once” facts and ``MODE_CLEANUP`` flags to avoid unintended re-runs or stale files."
msgstr "Vse naloge so varovane z “beži enkrat” dejstva in ``MODE_CLEANUP`` zastave za preprečevanje nenamernih ponovitev ali zastojev datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All tasks are idempotent. Once your certificates are in place and your configuration is set, Ansible will skip unchanged steps on subsequent runs."
msgstr "Vse naloge so navidezne. Ko so vaši certifikati na voljo in so nastavitve nastavljene, bo Ansible preskočil nespremenjene korake na naslednjih vožnjah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All three booleans MUST be `true`, and `verified_version` MUST name the exact tag or digest the source was read at. A newer upstream release is not evidence for the deployed pin."
msgstr "Vsi trije booles morajo biti `true`, in `verified_version` MORAJO natančno navesti oznako ali prebaviti vir, na katerem je bil prebran. Novejši topniški izpust ni dokaz za nameščeno iglo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "All three personas (`guest`, `biber`, `administrator`) start at `${APP_BASE_URL}/` via direct goto (bookmark-style entry). The OAuth2-Proxy gate fires on the first request and redirects unauthenticated requests through Keycloak. No dashboard-tile click sits in the persona path."
msgstr "Vse tri osebe (`guest`, `biber`, `administrator`) začni na `${APP_BASE_URL}/` preko direktnega geta (Vnos v slogu zaznamkov)OAuth2-Proxy vrata požari na prvi zahtevi in preusmeri neoporečne zahteve skozi KeycloakNi klika na armaturni plošči."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All variables consumed by [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml). The per-variable default + comment lives next to the key in [default.env](../../../../default.env); the tables below stay scoped to \"what role does this variable play in compose.yml\" and stop duplicating the default."
msgstr "Vse spremenljivke, ki jih porabijo [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml). Na spremenljivko privzeto + komentar živi poleg ključa v [default.env](../../../../default.env); spodnje tabele bivajo na \"Kakšno vlogo ima ta spremenljivka pri compose.yml\" in nehaj podvajati privzeto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "All workflows use `secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN` to log in to GHCR:"
msgstr "Vsi delovni tokovi `secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN` za prijavo v GHCR:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allow Permissions ✅"
msgstr "Dovoli dovoljenja ✅"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allowed Fields"
msgstr "Dovoljena polja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allowed Merge Method: Merge ✅"
msgstr "Dovoljena metoda združevanja: združitev ✅"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allowed `lifecycle` Values"
msgstr "Dovoljeno `lifecycle` Vrednosti"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allowed classifications are `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`, `adapter_candidate`, `blocked`, `enabler`, `subordinate`, and `no_surface`. Allowed reasons MUST be documented and linted, including `no_remote_surface`, `host_execution_boundary`, `privileged_control_plane`, `shared_engine_isolation`, `administrative_surface`, `duplicate_owner`, `version_unverified`, `licence`, `hosted_only`, `stdio_only`, `interactive_browser_session`, `unreviewed_third_party`, and `missing_dependency`. A deployable mapping additionally carries the source URL and the exact supported version or commit; a negative classification carries a concrete reason and notes."
msgstr "Dovoljene razvrstitve so `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`, `adapter_candidate`, `blocked`, `enabler`, `subordinate`, in `no_surface`. Dovoljeni razlogi MORAJO biti dokumentirani in lined, vključno `no_remote_surface`, `host_execution_boundary`, `privileged_control_plane`, `shared_engine_isolation`, `administrative_surface`, `duplicate_owner`, `version_unverified`, `licence`, `hosted_only`, `stdio_only`, `interactive_browser_session`, `unreviewed_third_party`, in `missing_dependency`. Razporejena kartiranje dodatno nosi izvorni URL in natančno podprta različica ali zaveza; negativna razvrstitev nosi konkreten razlog in opombe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allowed file types 📋"
msgstr "Dovoljene vrste datotek 📋"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allowed group flavors, currently `groupOfNames`"
msgstr "Dovoljeni skupinski okusi, trenutno `groupOfNames`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allowed implementation values are `native`, `plugin`, `sidecar`, `adapter`, and `external`. An `adapter` declares exactly one type:"
msgstr "Dovoljene vrednosti izvajanja so `native`, `plugin`, `sidecar`, `adapter`, in `external`. An `adapter` izjavlja točno en tip:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows JavaScript to substitute a value for an unset environment variable. Reserved for a value the code itself owns and no role renders. Normalising to `\"\"`, `\"[]\"`, `false`, `0` or another `process.env` entry needs no marker."
msgstr "JavaScript omogoča zamenjavo vrednosti za nenastavljeno spremenljivko okolja. Rezervirano za vrednost, ki jo ima sama koda in nima nobene vloge. Normalizacija na `\"\"`, `\"[]\"`, `false`, `0` ali drugo `process.env` Vstop ni potreben."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows `*_CONTAINER_ADDRESS | quote` in a role task file. Reserved for sites that never see the swarm `$(...)` fragment (`IS_COMPOSE_MODE`-gated tasks, `compose_mode_force` roles) or consumers that re-evaluate the argument themselves."
msgstr "Dovoljenja `*_CONTAINER_ADDRESS | quote` v datoteki z nalogami. Rezervirano za lokacije, ki nikoli ne vidijo roja `$(...)` fragment (`IS_COMPOSE_MODE`-naloge, `compose_mode_force` Vloge) ali potrošniki, ki ponovno ocenijo argument."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows `... | bool == True/False/true/false` when a real tri-state guard is intended (distinguishing `None` from `False`)."
msgstr "Dovoljenja `... | bool == True/False/true/false` kadar je predvidena prava tridržavna straža (razlikovanje `None` od `False`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a Jinja expression to stand as a mapping key under `roles/*/meta/`. Ansible renders the values of an `include_vars` payload and leaves the keys as written, so the consumer receives the source text. Marker goes on or directly above the line."
msgstr "Omogoča, da izraz Jinja stoji kot tipka za kartiranje pod `roles/*/meta/`. Ansible daje vrednosti `include_vars` tovor in pusti ključe napisane, tako da potrošnik prejme izvorno besedilo. Marker gre naprej ali neposredno nad črto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `*.sh.j2` to exist. Default path: ship the script as a plain `.sh` under `files/shell/` and pass its values as `ExecStart` arguments or `Environment=` entries, because shellcheck, the repository's `.sh` guards and every test skip a Jinja template, so nothing reads what actually runs on the host. Reserved for a script whose shape is generated, not just its values. Place the marker BELOW the shebang, never above it, and prefer the Jinja comment form so it does not reach the rendered script."
msgstr "Dovoli a `*.sh.j2` da obstaja. Privzeta pot: pošljite skript kot navadno `.sh` pod `files/shell/` in prenaša svoje vrednosti kot `ExecStart` argumenti ali `Environment=` vnosi, ker shellcheck, skladišče je `.sh` Stražarji in vsi testi preskočijo predlogo Jinja, zato nič ne bere, kaj dejansko teče na gostitelju. Rezervirano za skripto, katere oblika je ustvarjena, ne samo njene vrednosti. Postavite marker BLOW shebang, nikoli nad njim, in raje Jinja komentar obrazec, tako da ne doseže prevedeno scenarij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `.j2` template to write the software's name, domain or URL as a literal. Default path: render `SOFTWARE_NAME`, `SOFTWARE_DOMAIN`, `SOFTWARE_URL` or `ORGANIZATION`, which `group_vars/all/00_general.yml` declares once and derives from each other, so a rename reaches the template too. Reserved for a literal that must survive a rename, such as an identifier a third party issued under the old name."
msgstr "Dovoli a `.j2` predloge za pisanje imena, domene ali URL programske opreme kot dobesednega. Privzeta pot: izris `SOFTWARE_NAME`, `SOFTWARE_DOMAIN`, `SOFTWARE_URL` ali `ORGANIZATION`, ki `group_vars/all/00_general.yml` Izjavlja enkrat in izhaja drug od drugega, tako da preimenovanje doseže tudi predlogo. Rezervirano za dobesednega, ki mora preživeti preimenovanje, kot je identifikator tretje osebe, izdane pod starim imenom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `.py` file to carry a literal role-file path instead of the matching `ROLE_FILE_*` constant from `utils.roles.mapping`. Reserved for tests asserting the constant's value, migration scripts, or doc strings."
msgstr "Dovoli a `.py` datoteka za izvajanje dobesedne poti datoteke namesto ujemanja `ROLE_FILE_*` konstanta iz `utils.roles.mapping`. Rezervirano za teste, ki trdijo vrednost konstante, migracije skripte, ali doc strune."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `container exec` / `container inspect` target that does not route through the `container_address` lookup. Reserved for a container ID already resolved at `delegate_to` runtime (`*_LOCAL_CID`), where the lookup would return a manager-only subshell, and for deliberate bare-name partner probes gated on compose co-location."
msgstr "Dovoli a `container exec` / `container inspect` cilj, ki ne poteka skozi `container_address` Poglej. Rezervirano za ID zabojnika, ki je že rešen na `delegate_to` čas delovanja (`*_LOCAL_CID`), kjer bi iskanje vrnilo samo upravitelja, in za namerne sonde z golim imenom, ki so nastavljene na komponirano kolokacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `container_address`-derived target to be reached from a `command: argv:` list, which runs no shell to evaluate the swarm `$(...)` fragment. Reserved for roles pinned to compose via `compose_mode_force`, where the lookup can only ever yield a bare name."
msgstr "Dovoli a `container_address`-izpeljan cilj, ki ga je treba doseči `command: argv:` seznam, ki ne poganja lupine za oceno roja `$(...)` fragment. Rezervirano za vloge, vezane na komponiranje prek `compose_mode_force`, kjer lahko iskanje le kdaj da golo ime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `loop_var` to take the name of a variable declared in `group_vars/**` or in a role's `vars`/`defaults`. Inside the loop that name carries the item, so every lookup, template and nested include reading it sees the item instead, and ansible only warns. Reserved for a loop whose body reads the name as the item on purpose, typically because the item IS that value: state which meaning the body relies on."
msgstr "Dovoli a `loop_var` Ime spremenljivke, navedene v `group_vars/**` ali v vlogi `vars`/`defaults`. Znotraj zanke, da ime nosi element, tako da vsako iskanje, predlogo in vgnezdeni vključujejo branje je videti element namesto, in lahko samo opozarja. Rezervirano za zanko, na katero telo namenoma prebere ime kot postavko, običajno zato, ker je postavka IS ta vrednost: navedite, od katere se telo zanaša."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` `min_storage` to exceed the measured compressed size of its own `image:`/`version:` by more than 1 GB. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same comment line naming what occupies the space. Reserved for services whose data volume genuinely dominates the footprint; the default path is to lower the value, because an over-declared budget makes a host look too small and prunes a cache the deploy did not need to lose."
msgstr "Dovoli a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` `min_storage` da preseže izmerjeno lastno stisnjeno velikost `image:`/`version:` več kot 1 GB. MORA biti v paru z `Reason:` na isti komentar vrstico poimenovanje, kaj zaseda prostor. Rezervirano za storitve, katerih obseg podatkov resnično prevladuje v odtisu; privzeta pot je znižati vrednost, ker preveč prijavljen proračun naredi gostitelja videti premajhen in sreže predpomnilnik, ki ga je uporaba izgubila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` entry whose image ships no `HEALTHCHECK` to declare none either. Default path: add `healthcheck:` to the entry, because a container without a probe counts as healthy the moment its process starts — which is how a service that came back empty passes a restore drill. Reserved for containers nothing can probe: a one-shot process that exits, or an image with neither a port nor a shell."
msgstr "Dovoli a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` vnos, katerega slikovne ladje `HEALTHCHECK` tudi razglasiti ne. Privzeta pot: dodaj `healthcheck:` do vstopa, ker posoda brez sonde šteje za zdravo v trenutku, ko se začne njen proces – kar je način, kako storitev, ki se je vrnila prazna, opravi ponovno vrtanje. Rezervirano za zabojnike nič ne more sondirati: enostrelni proces, ki izstopa, ali slika z niti vrata niti lupine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>` entry to reference a service key that is NOT declared as a top-level entry in `meta/services.yml`. Reserved for resolver-only matrix hooks (typically on invokable infrastructure roles) whose variant entries pin the round's companion topology via service-key flags the resolver maps to provider roles, with no real consumer contract in the base meta."
msgstr "Dovoli a `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>` vpis na referenco ključa storitve, ki ni naveden kot najvišji vnos `meta/services.yml`. Rezervirano za samo reševalne matrične kavlje (tipično o vlogi infrastrukture, ki jo je mogoče priklicati) katerih variantni vnosi nastavijo spremljevalno topologijo kroga preko zastavic ključa storitev, zemljevide reševalcev na vloge ponudnika, brez prave potrošniške pogodbe v osnovni meta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` leaf override of an attribute whose base value in `meta/services.yml` is a static literal. Place on the override line in `variants.yml`. Use only when the consumer chain is provably immune to the variant-merge propagation gap; the default is to make the base value dynamic via `\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`."
msgstr "Dovoli a `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` listna prevlada atributa, katerega osnovna vrednost v `meta/services.yml` je statična dobesedna. Namestite na linijo za upravljanje `variants.yml`. Uporabite samo, če je potrošniška veriga dokazano imuna na razmnoževalno vrzel variantnega spoja; privzeto je, da je osnovna vrednost dinamična prek `\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `services.<key>.healthcheck` that no `lookup('container_healthcheck', …)` call renders. Default path: add the lookup to the service block, because an unrendered declaration reads like the service is watched while the compose file carries no probe. Reserved for a call the static resolver cannot attribute — mastodon renders every service through a macro whose `service_name` is a macro parameter."
msgstr "Dovoli a `services.<key>.healthcheck` da ne `lookup('container_healthcheck', …)` Izpis klicev. Privzeta pot: dodajte iskanje v servisni blok, ker se nepopravljena deklaracija glasi, kot da se storitev opazuje, medtem ko komponirana datoteka ne vsebuje sonde. Rezervirano za klic, ki ga statični reševalec ne more pripisati – mastodon opravi vsako storitev skozi makro, katerega `service_name` je makro parameter."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a bare curl invocation without the `curl` filter or inline `--max-time`."
msgstr "Omogoča golo kodro invokacijo brez `curl` filter ali notranji `--max-time`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a conditional `resolve_host_cid` include whose `<PREFIX>_HOST_NODE` a `delegate_to` in the same role reads. Marker goes on or directly above the include's `- name:`."
msgstr "Omogoča pogojno `resolve_host_cid` vključuje: `<PREFIX>_HOST_NODE` a `delegate_to` v isti vlogi se bere. Marker gre naprej ali neposredno nad Inclue's `- name:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a file to contain its own relative path from the repo root as a string literal. Reserved for load-bearing self-references. Repo-root files are exempt without a marker."
msgstr "Omogoča, da datoteka vsebuje svojo relativno pot iz repo korena kot niz dobesedno. Rezervirano za samoreferenčne obremenitve. Datoteke so izvzete brez označevalca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a hardcoded `http://` / `https://` literal next to a `lookup(...)` call. Reserved for genuinely fixed protocols (Docker-network upstreams, loopback URLs in CI fixtures)."
msgstr "Dovoli trdokodno `http://` / `https://` dobesedno poleg `lookup(...)` Pokliči. Rezervirano za resnično fiksne protokole (Docker-omrežje v smeri proti toku, zanka nazaj URL-ji v CI napeljavah)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a lookup plugin (`plugins/lookup/` or `roles/*/lookup_plugins/`) to import a config-merge function from `utils.cache.applications` / `.domains` / `.users` instead of reaching the SPOT via `lookup_loader.get('applications'/'config'/'domains'/'users')`. Reserved for the SPOT providers (`applications` / `config` / `applications_current_play` / `users` / `domains`) and the raw-volume accessors (`volume` / `nginx`)."
msgstr "Dovoli vstavek za iskanje (`plugins/lookup/` ali `roles/*/lookup_plugins/`) za uvoz funkcije nastavitve iz `utils.cache.applications` / `.domains` / `.users` namesto da bi dosegli SPOT preko `lookup_loader.get('applications'/'config'/'domains'/'users')`. Rezervirano za ponudnike SPOT (`applications` / `config` / `applications_current_play` / `users` / `domains`) in neobdelane priključke (`volume` / `nginx`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a raw `Path.read_text` / `Path.read_bytes` call in `tests/lint/` outside the LRU-cached `utils.cache.files.read_text` contract."
msgstr "Omogoča surovo `Path.read_text` / `Path.read_bytes` klic `tests/lint/` zunaj območja LRU `utils.cache.files.read_text` pogodba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a raw `Path.rglob`, `os.walk`, or `glob.glob` call outside the `utils.cache.files.iter_project_files` contract."
msgstr "Omogoča surovo `Path.rglob`, `os.walk`, ali `glob.glob` klic zunaj `utils.cache.files.iter_project_files` pogodba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a raw `container_name:` key in a `roles/*/templates/**/*.j2` template. Default path: route through the generic `compose_only` lookup (`{{ lookup('compose_only', 'container_name', NAME) }}`) so swarm-mode replicas do not collide on the static name."
msgstr "Omogoča surovo `container_name:` ključ v a `roles/*/templates/**/*.j2` predloge. Privzeta pot: pot skozi generično `compose_only` iskanje (`{{ lookup('compose_only', 'container_name', NAME) }}`) Tako da rojevske replike ne trčijo na statično ime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a raw `pull_policy:` key in a `roles/*/templates/**/*.j2` template. Default path: route through the generic `compose_only` lookup (`{{ lookup('compose_only', 'pull_policy', 'never') }}`) so swarm does not reject the compose-only extension with \"Additional property pull_policy is not allowed\"."
msgstr "Omogoča surovo `pull_policy:` ključ v a `roles/*/templates/**/*.j2` predloge. Privzeta pot: pot skozi generično `compose_only` iskanje (`{{ lookup('compose_only', 'pull_policy', 'never') }}`) tako roj ne zavrne podaljška samo za komponiranje \"Dodatna lastnost pull_policy ni dovoljeno\"."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a raw `restart:` key in a `roles/*/templates/**/*.j2` template. Default path: route through the `compose_restart` lookup so swarm-mode does not silently drop the operator's `docker_restart_policy`."
msgstr "Omogoča surovo `restart:` ključ v a `roles/*/templates/**/*.j2` predloge. Privzeta pot: pot skozi `compose_restart` Poglej gor, tako da roj-mode ne tiho spusti operator je `docker_restart_policy`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a role task to render a `*.service.j2` itself instead of handing the unit to `sys-service`. Default path: name the template `templates/systemctl.service.j2` and include `sys-service` with `system_service_id`, so the unit also gets the daemon reload, the enable, and the timer, async and flush behaviour. Reserved for units `sys-service` cannot carry, such as a user-scope unit under `$HOME`."
msgstr "Omogoča nalogo za vlogo, da `*.service.j2` namesto, da bi enoto izročili `sys-service`. Privzeta pot: ime predloge `templates/systemctl.service.j2` in vključujejo `sys-service` z `system_service_id`, tako da enota dobi tudi daemon ponovno obremenitev, omogoča, in časovnik, async in splakovanje vedenje. Rezervirano za enote `sys-service` ne more prenesti, kot je enota uporabniškega področja pod `$HOME`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a rule in a `roles/*/templates/nftables.conf.j2` fragment to end in an `accept` verdict. Default path: express the intent as a `drop` of what must not pass, or put the rule in the chain carrying the policy it has to overrule, because an `accept` terminates only its own base chain and every other chain at that hook still runs, docker's `drop` policy on forwarded packets included. Reserved for an accept whose only job is to skip the fragment's own later rules."
msgstr "Omogoča pravilo v `roles/*/templates/nftables.conf.j2` fragment, ki se konča v `accept` Razsodba. Privzeta pot: izrazi namen kot `drop` o tem, kaj ne sme biti mimo, ali postaviti pravilo v verigi, ki nosi politiko, ki jo mora prevladati, ker `accept` konča samo svojo osnovno verigo in vse druge verige na tem trnku še vedno teče, Docker's `drop` politiko o posredovanih paketih, ki so vključeni. Rezervirano za sprejem, katerega edina naloga je preskočiti kasnejša pravila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a single `when:` item to reference a `run_once_<other>` flag whose suffix differs from the current role."
msgstr "Omogoča enojno `when:` točka za sklicevanje a `run_once_<other>` zastava, katere pripona se razlikuje od sedanje vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows advanced content filtering (e.g., via Lua body/headers)"
msgstr "Omogoča filtriranje naprednih vsebin (npr. prek telesa/glav Lua)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows an image reference whose tag names a Debian release by codename. Reserved for an upstream that publishes no numeric tag; the marker MUST name which upstream, because a codename pin can never be raised by the updater."
msgstr "Omogoča referenco slike, katere imena značk Debian po kodnem imenu. Rezervirano za gornji tok, ki ne objavi nobene številčne oznake; označevalec NE VSEBUJE imena, ki je v zgornjem toku, ker ažurator nikoli ne more dvigniti šifre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows an untyped `container inspect` under `roles/`. Default path: pin `--type container`, because a role's overlay network carries the same entity name as its main container, so an untyped inspect can resolve the network and report `map has no entry for key \"State\"`. Use the typed subcommand (`container volume inspect` etc.) when the target genuinely is not a container."
msgstr "Dovoli netipkano `container inspect` pod `roles/`. Privzeta pot: pin `--type container`, ker ima omrežje za prekrivanje vloge isto ime podjetja kot njegov glavni zabojnik, tako da lahko netipkan pregled reši omrežje in poroča `map has no entry for key \"State\"`. Uporabite natipkano podvodenje (`container volume inspect` itd.) ko tarča resnično ni posoda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows contributors on Windows to run the full local stack without a separate VM"
msgstr "Omogoča, da prispevajoči v sistemu Windows zaženejo celoten lokalni sklad brez ločenega VM"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows forced execution during maintenance runs (`MODE_CLEANUP`)."
msgstr "Omogoča prisilno izvajanje med vzdrževanjem (`MODE_CLEANUP`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows forced execution during maintenance runs (``MODE_CLEANUP``)."
msgstr "Omogoča prisilno izvajanje med vzdrževanjem (``MODE_CLEANUP``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows instant, low-latency bidirectional traffic"
msgstr "Omogoča takojšen, nizkolatenten dvosmeren promet"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows the agent to resolve unknown APIs and tooling questions without leaving the terminal."
msgstr "Omogoča agentu, da reši neznane API-je in orodna vprašanja, ne da bi zapustil terminal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows the marked `ARG` to carry a default. The caller normally supplies every build argument so a missing one fails the build instead of selecting a base image nobody chose."
msgstr "Dovoli označitev `ARG` da nosi privzeto. Klicatelj običajno priskrbi vsak argument gradnje, tako da manjkajoča ne uspe zgraditi, namesto da izbere osnovno sliko, ki je nihče ni izbral."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows the marked `yaml.safe_load` / `safe_dump` call to bypass `utils.cache.yaml`. MUST use `nocheck:`, not `noqa:`."
msgstr "Dovoli označitev `yaml.safe_load` / `safe_dump` klic na obvod `utils.cache.yaml`. MORATE uporabiti `nocheck:`, ne `noqa:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows the marked task to carry a credential without `no_log` on itself or a parent. Marker goes on or directly above the task's `- name:`."
msgstr "Omogoča označeno opravilo nositi poverilnico brez `no_log` na sebe ali na starše. Marker gre naprej ali neposredno nad nalogo. `- name:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows the redundant `| bool | ternary('true','false')` pattern when a consumer requires the lowercase tokens."
msgstr "Omogoča odvečne `| bool | ternary('true','false')` vzorec, ko potrošnik zahteva majhne žetone."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows traffic from the WireGuard client interface (e.g. `wg0-client`) and sets up NAT masquerading on the external interface (e.g. `eth0`)."
msgstr "Omogoča promet z vmesnika odjemalca WireGuard (Npr. `wg0-client`) in vzpostavi NAT masquerading na zunanjem vmesniku (Npr. `eth0`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows traffic from the WireGuard client interface (e.g. ``wg0-client``) and sets up NAT masquerading on the external interface (e.g. ``eth0``)."
msgstr "Omogoča promet z vmesnika odjemalca WireGuard (Npr.``wg0-client``) in vzpostavi NAT masquerading na zunanjem vmesniku (Npr.``eth0``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Alpine Linux → ``openssh-client``"
msgstr "Alpski Linux → ``openssh-client``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Alpine Linux → `openssh-client`"
msgstr "Alpski Linux → `openssh-client`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Already wired via an infinito-native service flag in the row role's `meta/services.yml` (group-gated). Links to that declaration."
msgstr "Že ožičena z zastavico neskončnih storitev v vrsti `meta/services.yml` (skupina). Povezave s to izjavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Also callable directly from Python (unit tests, helpers) without a Jinja context: in that case the only positional argument is the value and compose-style quoting is used."
msgstr "Prav tako klic neposredno iz Python (preskusi enote, pomočniki) brez konteksta Jinja: v tem primeru je edini pozicijski argument vrednost in sestav-style citira se uporablja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Also manually dispatchable: `cron-images-mirror-all.yml`, `cron-images-cleanup-ci.yml`, `cron-cleanup-stale.yml`, `cron-update.yml`, `cron-release-highest.yml`, `call-release-version.yml`, `call-lint.yml`, `call-test.yml`, `call-test-dns.yml`, `call-test-workspace.yml`, `call-test-runner-smoke.yml`."
msgstr "Ročno odpremljiv tudi: `cron-images-mirror-all.yml`, `cron-images-cleanup-ci.yml`, `cron-cleanup-stale.yml`, `cron-update.yml`, `cron-release-highest.yml`, `call-release-version.yml`, `call-lint.yml`, `call-test.yml`, `call-test-dns.yml`, `call-test-workspace.yml`, `call-test-runner-smoke.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Alternative"
msgstr "Druga možnost"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Alternative compression style"
msgstr "Alternativni slog stiskanja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Alternative: Build an inventory where all invokable apps are set as a host variable (as a list)."
msgstr "Alternativna možnost: Zgradite inventar, kjer so vse aplikacije, ki se lahko prijavijo, nastavljene kot gostiteljska spremenljivka (kot seznam)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Alternative: Recreate the User"
msgstr "Alternativa: Poustvariti User"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Alternatively, disable IPv6 only in Docker via `/etc/docker/daemon.json`:"
msgstr "Alternativno onemogočite IPv6 samo v Docker preko `/etc/docker/daemon.json`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Alternatives weighed 🔀"
msgstr "Alternative, stehtane 🔀"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Always Category-Keyed Maps 🗂️"
msgstr "Zemljevidi s ključnimi kategorijami 🗂️"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Always create the new domain and user in Mailu first."
msgstr "Vedno ustvarite novo domeno in uporabnika v Mailu Najprej."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Always overwrite `image`/`version` from the mirror"
msgstr "Vedno zamenjaj `image`/`version` iz ogledala"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Always purge the Cloudflare cache after significant changes to your website or OpenResty/NGINX configuration."
msgstr "Vedno očistite predpomnilnik Cloudflare po pomembnih spremembah na vaši spletni strani ali OpenResty/NGINX nastavitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Always resolve tokens as: **``users → token store → empty``**"
msgstr "Vedno rešite žetone kot: **``users → token store → empty``**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Always resolve tokens as: **`users → token store → empty`**"
msgstr "Vedno rešite žetone kot: **`users → token store → empty`**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Always up-to-date packages; minimal base; fast feedback on upstream changes"
msgstr "Vedno posodobljeni paketi; minimalna osnova; hitre povratne informacije o spremembah v smeri toka"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Always. The named roles enter the include set verbatim."
msgstr "Vedno. Imenovane vloge vstopijo in vključujejo nastavljeno dobesedno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Ambiguous and external-only roles"
msgstr "Dvoumne in zunanje vloge"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Amended after implementation: the deployed Hermes version serves a bearer API rather than a browser dashboard, so its native-OIDC support cannot be used. It is gated at the auth proxy instead, like OpenClaw and Flowise, admitting the role's `administrator` and `mcp` groups. Holding `API_SERVER_KEY` alone was the whole boundary before, which put every MCP provider Hermes is admitted to behind one shared deployment secret. The cost of the proxy is deliberate: an OpenAI-compatible client presenting only a bearer no longer reaches Hermes through its public vhost, and has to come from inside the container network."
msgstr "Spremenjeno po izvedbi: uporabljena Hermes različica služi nosilcu API namesto armaturne plošče brskalnika, tako da njene podpore native-OIDC ni mogoče uporabiti. Namesto tega je zaklenjena na avt proxy. OpenClaw ter FlowisePriznavam vlogo. `administrator` ter `mcp` skupine. Gospodarstvo `API_SERVER_KEY` Sam je bil meja pred tem, zaradi česar je vsak ponudnik MCP Hermes sprejet za eno skupno skrivnost. Stroški posrednika so premišljeni: OpenAI-združljiv odjemalec, ki predstavlja le nosilca ne doseže več Hermes preko svojega javnega vhost, in mora priti iz notranjosti kontejnerskega omrežja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Among the hosts in `svc-swarm-node`, the cluster manager is identified by additional membership in `svc-swarm-manager`. v1 scope: exactly ONE host. Workers are derived as `svc-swarm-node − svc-swarm-manager` — no duplicated list in `group_vars`."
msgstr "Med gostitelji v `svc-swarm-node`, vodja grozda je opredeljen z dodatnim članstvom v `svc-swarm-manager`. v1 obseg: točno en gostitelj. Delavci so izpeljani kot `svc-swarm-node − svc-swarm-manager` — ni podvojenega seznama `group_vars`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An \"application role\" carries at least one project-owned `meta/<topic>.yml` marker file (services, server, rbac, volumes, schema, users)."
msgstr "A \"vloga uporabe\" ima v lasti vsaj en projekt `meta/<topic>.yml` označevalna datoteka (storitve, strežnik, rbac, količine, shema, uporabniki)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An Anthropic key"
msgstr "Antropični ključ"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An Arch Linux based system; ``package_install`` sets up the unprivileged AUR build environment itself."
msgstr "Sistem, ki temelji na Arch Linuxu; ``package_install`` vzpostavi neprivilegirano AUR, ki gradi okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An Arch Linux based system; `package_install` sets up the unprivileged AUR build environment itself."
msgstr "Sistem, ki temelji na Arch Linuxu; `package_install` vzpostavi neprivilegirano AUR, ki gradi okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An MCP client turns an application's API into tools a model may call. The cheap way to build that is one process holding administrator credentials for every application and translating an OpenAPI document into tools on demand. That process is a single credential store, a single network position reaching every application, and a tool surface that grows with every upstream release nobody reviewed."
msgstr "Odjemalec MCP obrne aplikacijo API V orodja, ki se jim lahko reče model. Poceni način za izgradnjo, da je en proces, ki ima administrator poverilnice za vsako aplikacijo in prevajanje dokumenta OpenAPI v orodja na zahtevo. Ta proces je enojna hramba podatkov, enotna omrežna pozicija, ki doseže vsako aplikacijo, in površina orodja, ki raste z vsakim toku izpusta, ki ga nihče ni pregledal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An OIDC round-trip plus admin token request (allow ≥ 60 s)."
msgstr "Povratna vožnja z OIDC in žeton za admin (Dovoli ≥ 60 s)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An OpenAI key, to deploy and test the route"
msgstr "Ključ OpenAI za razporeditev in testiranje poti"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An OpenRouter key"
msgstr "Ključ OpenRouter"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An `ImageRef` carries: `role`, `service`, `name` (without registry), `version`, `source` (full pull ref), `registry`, and `source_file`."
msgstr "A `ImageRef` Nosi: `role`, `service`, `name` (brez registra), `version`, `source` (Polno pull ref), `registry`, in `source_file`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An ``admin`` user authenticated from the ``RABBITMQ_PASSWORD`` credential."
msgstr "A ``admin`` uporabnik overjen iz ``RABBITMQ_PASSWORD`` Zaupnica."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An `admin` user authenticated from the `RABBITMQ_PASSWORD` credential."
msgstr "A `admin` uporabnik overjen iz `RABBITMQ_PASSWORD` Zaupnica."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An `swarm-zombie` run rebuilds a full DinD cluster over tens of minutes, so you MUST confirm a fix on the live cluster before redeploying."
msgstr "A `swarm-zombie` zažene obnovo polne DIND kopice več deset minut, tako da morate potrditi fiks na živo kopico pred prerazporeditvijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An adapter could reach these, and none has been curated yet. The five that used to sit under \"current MCP metadata requiring revalidation\" are here because that revalidation found no shipped surface to revalidate."
msgstr "Adapter bi jih lahko dosegel in še nihče ni bil kuriran. Pet, ki je včasih sedelo pod \"trenutni metapodatki MCP, ki zahtevajo podaljšanje veljavnosti\" so tukaj, ker je ta ponovna potrditev ni našla nobene odpremljene površine za obnovitev veljavnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An addon MUST NOT bridge a service that is absent from `meta/services.yml`; lint fails with the missing key named."
msgstr "Addon NE SME premostiti storitve, ki je odsotna `meta/services.yml`; lint propade z manjkajočim ključem imenovan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An addon that needs install/enable/configure logic beyond the generic `config:` payload MUST place it in `roles/<role>/tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml`, mirroring the `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` file-root convention."
msgstr "Addon, ki potrebuje install/enable/configure logika, ki presega splošno `config:` koristni tovor MORA vstaviti `roles/<role>/tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml`, zrcaljenje `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` Konvencija o datotečnem sistemu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An addon under `meta/addons/` MAY declare an `incompatible_plugins` list in its `config:`. [01_install.yml](./01_install.yml) runs `occ app:disable` for every listed plugin before the install attempt. This guarantees that mutually exclusive integrations such as the OIDC entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) and the document-editing surfaces (`onlyoffice`, `richdocuments`, `fileslibreofficeedit`) cannot accidentally coexist on the same instance."
msgstr "Dodaj pod `meta/addons/` LAHKO razglasi `incompatible_plugins` seznam v svojem `config:`. [01namesti.yml](./01_install.yml) teče `occ app:disable` za vsak navedeni plugin pred poskusom namestitve. To zagotavlja, da se medsebojno izključujoče integracije, kot so vstopne točke OIDC (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) in površine za urejanje dokumentov (`onlyoffice`, `richdocuments`, `fileslibreofficeedit`) ne more po naključju soobstajati na istem primerku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An addon whose pinned version is behind the latest upstream release."
msgstr "Addon, katerega pripeta različica je za zadnjo zgornjo javnostjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An address is matched before that, on the raw text, because a URL carries the characters the stripping removes."
msgstr "Naslov se ujema pred tem, na surovem besedilu, ker URL nosi znake odstranjevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An app that needs an extra mapper MUST add it through a per-client scope. See [nextcloud.json.j2](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/import/scopes/nextcloud.json.j2) for the precedent: a dedicated scope holds the Nextcloud-specific UID and quota mappers and is attached only to the Nextcloud client."
msgstr "Aplikacija, ki potrebuje dodaten zemljevid, ga MORA dodati preko področja uporabe za posamezne stranke. Glej. [nextcloud.json.j2](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/import/scopes/nextcloud.json.j2) za precedens: namensko področje uporabe Nextcloud-posebne UID in karte kvot in je priložen samo Nextcloud Stranka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An application SHOULD opt in to `axis: domain` only when its authorisation model is genuinely per-tenant and the tenant axis is the canonical domain. Typical consumer: WordPress Multisite. Applications whose authorisation is one global user set (Nextcloud, Gitea, Keycloak itself) MUST keep `axis: none`."
msgstr "Aplikacija bi se morala vključiti `axis: domain` samo kadar je njegov model odobritve resnično na prebivalca in je os najemnika kanonična domena. Tipični potrošnik: WordPress Multisite. Aplikacije, katerih odobritev je en globalni nabor uporabnikov (Nextcloud, Gitea, Keycloak sam) MORAJO obdržati `axis: none`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An application id is expanded to the service key(s) that role provides; every other token is kept verbatim. Order-preserving, de-duplicated. Used wherever the operator supplies service references (``disable``, include/prune closures) so both spellings resolve identically."
msgstr "ID programa se razširi na ključ storitve(s) Ta vloga zagotavlja; vsak drugi žeton se ohranja dobesedno. Ohranjanje reda, razdvojeno. Uporaba povsod, kjer izvajalec zagotavlja reference za storitve (``disable``, vključujejo/prune zaprtja) Tako da oba črkovanja rešita enako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An application whose registration rejects the shell-safe alphabet states that in its own meta/users.yml rather than carrying a second credential beside the account it already owns."
msgstr "Vloga, katere registracija zavrača abecedo, ki je zaščitena pred lupino, navaja, da je meta/users.yml namesto da bi imel drugo poverilnico poleg svojega računa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An application's canonical primary domain when it has at most max_length characters, otherwise its short entity name (e.g. ``keycloak``)."
msgstr "Primarna domena aplikacije, ko ima največ max_length znaki, drugače njegovo kratko ime subjekta (Npr. ``keycloak``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
