msgid "Assets are stored on the filesystem backend (``PENPOT_ASSETS_STORAGE_BACKEND=assets-fs``) on the backup-ready named volume ``penpot_assets``, mounted into both ``frontend`` and ``backend`` at ``/opt/data/assets``."
msgstr "Sredstva so shranjena na datotečnem sistemu (``PENPOT_ASSETS_STORAGE_BACKEND=assets-fs``) o varnostno-pripravljenem volumnu ``penpot_assets``, pritrjena na oba ``frontend`` ter ``backend`` na dan ``/opt/data/assets``."

