msgstr "Ker ni nobene storitve, roj test vrata, ki anketo ``docker service ls`` (``converge``, ``seed``, ``drain``, ``assert``) preskočijo sami preko ``workload: node-local`` deklaracija (``scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh`` zemljevidi ``node-local`` do ``HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false``); sama uporaba, distribucijska veriga registra in CLI e2E apartma teče v celoti."

