# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Before any implementation work, the agent MUST read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and follow it, then [Role Loop](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) and the [Playwright spec contract](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md)."
msgstr "Pred izvedbo mora agent prebrati [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) In potem mu sledite. [Zanka vloge](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) in [Spec pogodba Playwright](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Before every redeploy you MUST fully resolve the failure and reach at least **95% confidence that your fix actually fixes it**. That confidence MUST come from in-container inspection (`make compose-exec` / `make compose-inner-run`): reproduce the failure, walk the fix path, and confirm the corrected behaviour. Never redeploy on a guess."
msgstr "Pred vsako prerazporeditvijo morate popolnoma rešiti napako in doseči vsaj **95% zaupanje, da ga vaš fix dejansko popravi**. To zaupanje mora izhajati iz pregleda v zabojnikih (`make compose-exec` / `make compose-inner-run`): reproduciraj napako, hodi po fiksni poti in potrdi popravljeno vedenje. Nikoli ne ugibaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Before every redeploy you MUST fully resolve the failure in swarm and reach at least **95% confidence that your fix actually fixes it**. That confidence MUST come from inspecting the live cluster in-container: reproduce the failure, walk the fix path, and confirm the corrected behaviour on the running services. Never redeploy on a guess — a swarm redeploy costs tens of minutes."
msgstr "Pred vsako prerazporeditvijo morate popolnoma rešiti napako v roju in doseči vsaj **95% zaupanje, da ga vaš fix dejansko popravi**. To zaupanje mora izvirati iz pregleda živega grozda v zabojniku: reproducirati napako, hoditi po fiksni poti in potrditi popravljeno obnašanje na tekočih storitvah. Nikoli se ne prenavljaj na ugibanju – rojska prerazporeditev stane deset minut."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Before implementation, the agent MUST read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md), the target role's `AGENTS.md` when present, [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md), and the repository's agent and contributor guidance. Any upstream capability MUST be verified against the exact image tag, source tag, or commit selected by the implementation; current documentation or a newer upstream release is not evidence for the deployed pin."
msgstr "Pred izvedbo mora agent prebrati [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md), Ciljna vloga `AGENTS.md` kadar je prisotna, [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md), ter agent skladišča in navodila za prispevke. Kakršna koli gornja zmogljivost MORA biti preverjena na podlagi natančne značke slike, značke vira ali objave, izbrane z izvedbo; trenutna dokumentacija ali novejša objava na začetku ni dokaz za nameščeno žebljo."

