# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Najboljši cilj: brskalnik lutkarja ni prenesen tukaj (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) tako ``install-lint`` ostane na varnem. mmdc potrebuje le brskalnik za RENDER, ki ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` določbe o povpraševanju (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) Tik preden se prikaže. Brskal je po internetu. ``unzip`` je tu zagotovljeno (lutkovni ekstraktor ga potrebuje, sicer pusti prazno različico dir in mmdc poroča, da brskalnik manjka). Neuspešna namestitev opozarja namesto prekinitve ``install-lint``, tako da peskovniki brez dostopa npm / browser še vedno dobili preostanek verige orodja."

