msgstr "Cached"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cached YAML load that returns `{}` for missing files (legacy contract). Non-mapping roots surface as `SystemExit` to match the inventory CLI's existing error UX."
msgstr "Predrto breme YAML, ki se vrne `{}` za manjkajoče datoteke (zapuščinska pogodba). Površina korenin, ki niso pobarvane kot `SystemExit` da se ujema z obstoječo napako inventarja CLI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cached keyed on (applications fingerprint, include_aliases); the result is returned as-is, so callers MUST treat it as read-only."
msgstr "Nastavljeno s ključem (prstni odtis vlog, include_aliases); rezultat se vrne, kot je, tako da klicarji MORAjo obravnavati kot samo branje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cached keyed on (roles_dir, variables_signature, render_state). A read issued while the applications render is in progress sees the unrendered tree, whose service flags are still Jinja strings; its map is cached under its own key so the render's own call sites reuse it without it ever being served as the finished map. The tor flags are rendered before they are read (``_resolved_flag``), so that mid-render map carries the same onion domains the finished one does."
msgstr "Nastavljeno s ključem (roles_dir, variables_signature, render_state). Branje, ki je bilo izdano, medtem ko so prijave v teku vidi nepoškodovano drevo, katerih storitvene zastave so še vedno Jinja strune; njegov zemljevid je shranjen pod lastnim ključem, tako da je izrisovanih lastnih spletnih mest ponovno, ne da bi se kdaj služil kot končni zemljevid. Zastave za tor so narejene, preden se preberejo (``_resolved_flag``), tako da je sredin-render zemljevid nosi iste čebule domene, ki jih končni naredi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cached value: the **list of documents** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` returns for that file. Single-document YAML files cache as a 1-element list, so a callsite that asks for the single doc (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) and a callsite that asks for the multi-doc list (``load_yaml_all``) share **the same parse**. The same list / dict instances are returned to every caller, so callers that mutate the result MUST `copy.deepcopy()` it first. Treat the value as read-only."
msgstr "Cached vrednost: **seznam dokumentov** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` vrne za to datoteko. Predpomnilnik datotek YAML z enim dokumentom 1- seznam elementov, tako klic, ki prosi za enega zdravnika (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) in kalit, ki zahteva več doktorski seznam (``load_yaml_all``) delež **enak razčlenek**. Isti seznam / dict primere so vrnjeni vsakemu klicarju, tako da klicarji, ki mutira rezultat MORAJO `copy.deepcopy()` Najprej. Obravnavajte vrednost kot samo za branje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cached: repeated calls for the same *role_dir* reuse the first parse. Pass an absolute path so the cache key is stable across callers that resolve relative paths differently."
msgstr "Cached: večkratni pozivi za isto *role_dir* ponovno uporabi prvi razčleni. Prenesite absolutno pot, tako da je predpomnilni ključ stabilen med klicarji, ki rešujejo relativne poti drugače."

