# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cap torch's intra-op threads on the CPU path. `meta/services.yml` limits the container to `cpus: \"2.0\"`, but torch sizes its thread pool from the host's core count, so a 16-core runner spawns 16 threads for 2 cores. laya reads `LAYA_THREADS` (`serve.py`, `_apply_thread_limit`) and upstream says to keep it at or below the physical core count; `templates/env.j2` does not set it. Costs latency, breaks nothing, so no test catches it."
msgstr "Bakle so na poti CPU. `meta/services.yml` omeji posodo na `cpus: \"2.0\"`, ampak bakel velikosti svojo nit bazen iz jedra gostitelja, tako da 16-jedrni drstilci 16 navojnice za 2 Jedra. laya beri `LAYA_THREADS` (`serve.py`, `_apply_thread_limit`) in gorvodno pravi, da naj ostane pri ali pod fizičnim številom jeder; `templates/env.j2` ga ne nastavi. Stroški zamuda, ne zlomi ničesar, tako da noben test ne ujame."

