# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Checkmk Raw bundles its own monitoring core (Nagios), RRD storage, and an Apache-served web GUI, so it needs no external database. All state lives on one persistent volume mounted at `/omd/sites`, and the GUI is served under the OMD site path (`/cmk/check_mk/`). The image is pinned to `checkmk/check-mk-raw:2.4.0p32` in `meta/services.yml`; Checkmk renamed the Raw image to `check-mk-community` from 2.5, so bump the tag only after reviewing the upstream [version notes](https://docs.checkmk.com/latest/en/cmk_versions.html)."
msgstr "Checkmk Raw združuje lastno jedro za spremljanje (Nagios), RRD shranjevanje, in Apache-served spletni grafični vmesnik, tako da ne potrebuje zunanje baze podatkov. Vse države živijo z eno vztrajno prostornino, nameščeno na `/omd/sites`, in GUI je služil na poti OMD mestu (`/cmk/check_mk/`). Slika je pritrjena na `checkmk/check-mk-raw:2.4.0p32` v `meta/services.yml`; Checkmk preimenoval Raw sliko v `check-mk-community` od 2.5, tako zaskočite oznako šele po pregledu navzgor navzgor [opombe k različici](https://docs.checkmk.com/latest/en/cmk_versions.html)."

