msgstr "Konfiguracija na strani odjemalca je vezana na `infinito` tekač, tako da je pip, npm, in apt pot skozi sonatip Nexus 3 OSS povleci skozi posrednika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients do not read the server list directly. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) computes the intersection of the provider's admitted clients, resolved by `derive_allowed_consumers` in [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), with the calling client's `supported_transports` and `supported_auths`, resolves each provider's declared credential, and returns:"
msgstr "Odjemalci seznama strežnikov ne berejo neposredno. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) izračuna presečišče sprejetih ponudnikovih strank, ki jih reši `derive_allowed_consumers` v [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), S stranko, ki kliče. `supported_transports` ter `supported_auths`, reši vsak ponudnik je deklarirani zaupanja, in vrne:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in `sys-token-store`. Its `auth_subject` is `administrator`, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Stranke predstavljajo Gitea osebni dostop žeton kot `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Žeton se izda na administratorskem računu in se hrani v `sys-token-store`. Njegova. `auth_subject` m `administrator`, tako da MCP klici tečejo z administratorskimi pravicami in ne kot uporabnik zahteva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in ``sys-token-store``. Its ``auth_subject`` is ``administrator``, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Stranke predstavljajo Gitea osebni dostop žeton kot ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. Žeton se izda na administratorskem računu in se hrani v ``sys-token-store``. Njegova. ``auth_subject`` m ``administrator``, tako da MCP klici tečejo z administratorskimi pravicami in ne kot uporabnik zahteva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in `sys-token-store` under the `administrator` user, not in the role's `credentials:` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Odjemalci predstavljajo dolgotrajen dostop do žetona kot `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Žeton je skovan enkrat na razporeditev in se hrani v `sys-token-store` v okviru `administrator` uporabnik, ne v vlogi `credentials:` blok. Nepriznana zahteva je odgovor z 404: Home Assistant ne razkriva končne točke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in ``sys-token-store`` under the ``administrator`` user, not in the role’s ``credentials:`` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Odjemalci predstavljajo dolgotrajen dostop do žetona kot ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. Žeton je skovan enkrat na razporeditev in se hrani v ``sys-token-store`` v okviru ``administrator`` uporabnik, ne v vlogi ``credentials:`` blok. Nepriznana zahteva je odgovor z 404: Home Assistant ne razkriva končne točke."

