msgid "Designed for Arch Linux systems, this role leverages the ``pacman`` module to install Git. It uses a fact (``run_once_dev_git``) to control task execution, ensuring that the Git installation is performed only once per run."
msgstr "Zasnovan za Arch Linux sistemov, ta vloga vpliva na ``pacman`` modul za namestitev GitUporablja dejstvo. (``run_once_dev_git``) nadzor izvajanja nalog, s čimer se zagotovi, da Git namestitev se izvede samo enkrat na vožnjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Designed for Arch Linux systems, this role leverages the `pacman` module to install Git. It uses a fact (`run_once_dev_git`) to control task execution, ensuring that the Git installation is performed only once per run."
