msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumenti a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Vloga ohranja `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (tako, da pogodba o poravnavi vlog ostane izpolnjena) vendar `roles_with_service('matomo')` kapljice iz `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` in sledilnik matomo e2Pogodba. Rezervirano za statično datoteko (autoindex) ter 301-redirektni vhosts, ki ne nosijo uporabniško obrnjeno stran HTML vredno `_paq` Sledilnik. Marker spremlja `track:` Zaznavam čast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumenti a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Vloga ohranja `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (tako, da pogodba o poravnavi vlog ostane izpolnjena) vendar `roles_with_service('prometheus')` kapljice iz `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Rezervirano za 301-redirektno-samo vhosts, ki nikoli ne služijo zahtevo skozi lua-resty-prometheus, tako da oddajajo `app=\"<role>\"` etiketiranje in nimajo tarče. Marker spremlja `scrape:` Zaznavam čast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Dokumenti `unsafe-*: true` Zastava v `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. Mora biti v paru z `Reason:` na isti liniji imenuje, kaj odmori brez sprostitve. `unsafe-inline` ponovno doda začetno izvedbo potreb po XSS in `unsafe-eval` ponovno doda nit-to-code, tako da je treba zastavo preveriti z zagnano aplikacijo, ne pa kopirati iz druge vloge."

