# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Dropping the axes does not mean forgiving them. A row is proven only when *every* job it had was green: one red or aborted combination un-proves it, however many green siblings it has. Only a priority row can have several, since it deploys its whole cross-product at once while a regular row gets one combination per sweep -- and letting a green compose job carry a red swarm one would walk the regular line past a combination nobody fixed."
msgstr "Padanje osi ne pomeni, da jim odpuščamo. Vrsta je dokazana samo, če *vsak* Zaposlitev je bila zelena: ena rdeča ali prekinjena kombinacija ga ne dokazuje, ne glede na to, koliko zelenih bratov in sester ima. Le prioritetna vrsta jih ima lahko več, saj razpošlje celoten navzkrižni produkt naenkrat, medtem ko redna vrsta dobi po eno kombinacijo na pometanje -- in pustiti zelenemu komponu, da opravlja delo z rdečim rojem, bi šla po navadni liniji mimo kombinacije, ki je nihče ne popravi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
