# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Drops the per-entity default Docker network when `compose.sh` left it behind with the wrong / empty `com.docker.compose.network` label (typical between matrix-deploy rounds). Skips removal when the network still has active container endpoints, so shared-service networks (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, …) stay in place while their provider container is up. The global `docker network prune -f` sweep that catches orphans whose names do NOT match the entity is run once by the orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) after the entity loop. Idempotent."
msgstr "Odvrže privzeto Dockerjevo omrežje, ko `compose.sh` Za sabo je pustil napačno / prazno `com.docker.compose.network` nalepka (tipično med matričnimi naboji). Preskoči odstranitev, ko ima omrežje še vedno aktivne končne točke zabojnika, tako da omrežja deljena storitev (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, ...) ostanejo na svojem mestu, medtem ko je zabojnik za dobavitelje pripravljen. Globalno `docker network prune -f` iskanje, da ulov sirote, katerih imena se NE ujemajo s subjektom, vodi enkrat Orkester [apps.sh](../apps.sh) po zanki entitete. Idempotent."

