# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ERPNext is exposed as a consumable shared service and renders the Keycloak SSO button on */login* under gunicorn *--preload*. Nextcloud is provisioned on the SeaweedFS S3 object store with a dedicated consumer end-to-end test and has its OIDC plugins gated as mandatory; the upgrade to version 34 is deliberately not carried out because of plugin incompatibilities, so it stays pinned at 33."
msgstr "ERPNext je izpostavljen kot potrošno skupno storitev in omogoča Keycloak SSO gumb vključen */ login* pod tornikom *-- preload*. Nextcloud je predvidena na SeaweedFS S3 objekt shramba z namenskim potrošniškim testom od konca do konca in ima svoje vstavke OIDC zaklenjene kot obvezne; nadgradnja različice 34 se namerno ne izvede zaradi nezdružljivosti plugin, tako da ostane pritrjen na 33."

