msgid "Each **Acceptance Criterion** MUST be written as a Markdown task list item (`- [ ]`)."
msgstr "Vsaka **Merilo sprejemljivosti** MORA biti zapisan kot postavka seznama opravil Markdown (`- [ ]`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each PR-opening job in [cron-update.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) runs an `actions/create-github-app-token@v2` step gated on `steps.diff.outputs.changed == 'true'`, then forwards the minted token as `GH_TOKEN` and the resolved `APP_SLUG` to the subsequent PR step. The job's `permissions:` block keeps the workflow-provided `GITHUB_TOKEN` read-only; write access is provided exclusively by the App token, scoped to the App's repository permissions."
msgstr "Vsako PR-odpiranje dela v [cron-update.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) teče `actions/create-github-app-token@v2` Stopnica je zaprta. `steps.diff.outputs.changed == 'true'`, nato pa skovan žeton kot `GH_TOKEN` in rešeno `APP_SLUG` do naslednjega koraka za stike z javnostmi. Služba je. `permissions:` blok ohranja potek dela `GITHUB_TOKEN` samo za branje; dostop do pisanja zagotavlja izključno Aplikacija žeton, ki obsega dovoljenja za odložišče Aplikacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each Raspberry Pi joins the swarm as an agent node labelled `kata-capable` with the isolating runtime as its daemon-wide default (Decision #3, applied per node). Flowise and the gateway run on a manager node. Swarm distributes agent replicas across the Pis; adding a Pi adds agent capacity with no code change. The Pis do **not** run large models locally: agents speak only the gateway `/v1`, which routes light work to a small local `svc-ai-ollama` and heavy work to a GPU or external backend. All node-run images MUST be `arm64`."
msgstr "Vsak Raspberry Pi se pridruži roju kot agent vozlišče označeno `kata-capable` z izoliranim časom delovanja kot privzeto (Odločitev #3, ki se uporablja na vozel). Pretok in prehod tečeta po upravljalnem vozlišču. Swarm distribuira agent replike po Pisu; dodajanje Pi dodaja agens kapaciteto brez spremembe kode. Piska. **ni** zagnati velike modele lokalno: agenti govorijo samo vrata `/v1`, ki usmerja svetlobo delo na majhno lokalno `svc-ai-ollama` in težko delo na GPU ali zunanji backend. Vse slike, ki vodijo vozlišča, morajo biti `arm64`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each Recoverer parses and validates its own colon-encoded ``source`` and builds the role's ``files/python/recover.py`` invocation. Colon segments are classified by shape: an ABSOLUTE path is the restore destination (replacing a --target flag); for device a RELATIVE segment is the on-device snapshot subpath and an all-digit ``YYYYMMDDHHMMSS`` segment is the generation to restore. No colon means the derived standard-layout target and the newest generation. The uniform console command ``<type> <source> <target>`` dispatches to one Recoverer via :data:`RECOVERERS`."
msgstr "Vsak recoverer razčleni in potrdi svojo lastno kolono kodirano ``source`` in gradi vlogo. ``files/python/recover.py`` invokacija. Kolon segmenti so razvrščeni po obliki: ABSOLUTE pot je obnovljena destinacija (o nadomestitvi ciljne zastave); za napravo odsek ODNOSIVE je posnetek na napravi podpot in vsemestna ``YYYYMMDDHHMMSS`` segment je generacija za obnovo. Nobeno debelo črevo ne pomeni izpeljane standardne tarče in najnovejše generacije. Ukaz enotne konzole ``<type> <source> <target>`` pošilja v en recoverer preko :data:`RECOVERERS`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each `tasks/02_manager_ops/06_plugin/<step>.yml` file owns exactly one OCC stage and one decision about whether to continue."
msgstr "Vsaka `tasks/02_manager_ops/06_plugin/<step>.yml` datoteka ima v lasti točno eno fazo OCC in eno odločitev o nadaljevanju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Each `test()` runs in its own isolated browser context. Specs MUST NOT share session state between tests. Running biber and administrator as two separate `test()` blocks already gives that isolation by default. When a single scenario needs more than one identity at once (peer-to-peer messaging, RBAC promotion observed by the admin, …), it MUST open a fresh `browser.newContext({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` per identity and close them in `finally`."
msgstr "Vsaka `test()` teče v lastnem izoliranem kontekstu brskalnika. Specifi ne smejo deliti stanja seje med preskusi. Vodenje biber in administrator kot dva ločena `test()` bloki že dajejo to izolacijo privzeto. Če en scenarij zahteva več kot eno identiteto naenkrat (sporočila med vrstniki, promocija RBAC, ki jo je opazil admin, ...), mora odpreti sveže `browser.newContext({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` na identiteto in jih zapri `finally`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each additional MCP server role SHOULD land in a focused commit or PR when it can be validated independently."
msgstr "Vsaka dodatna vloga strežnika MCP MORA pristati v osredotočeni zavezi ali PR, ko ga je mogoče neodvisno potrditi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each additional role SHOULD land in a focused commit or PR when it can be validated independently."
msgstr "Vsaka dodatna vloga bi morala pristati v osredotočeni zavezi ali PR, ko jo je mogoče neodvisno potrditi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each addon lives in its own file `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`: **the file root IS the addon spec, there is NO wrapping `<addon_id>:` key, and the filename stem supplies the addon id.** All files in the directory are collected into `applications.<role_id>.addons`, keyed by `<addon_id>`. The materialised path is `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>`, read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."
msgstr "Vsak addon živi v svoji datoteki `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`: **Koren datoteke je addon spec, ni ovoj `<addon_id>:` ključ, in datotečno geslo vsebuje addon ID.** Vse datoteke v imeniku se zberejo v `applications.<role_id>.addons`, ki ga veže `<addon_id>`. Materializirana pot je `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>`, berite preko `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each addon spec MUST guard on the addon being enabled via `skipUnlessAddonEnabled('<addon_id>')`, backed by the `ADDON_<ID>_ENABLED` flags rendered into `templates/playwright.env.j2`, and skip cleanly when it is not."
msgstr "Vsak dodatek mora paziti na addon, ki je omogočen preko `skipUnlessAddonEnabled('<addon_id>')`, ki ga podpira `ADDON_<ID>_ENABLED` Zastave, vstavljene v `templates/playwright.env.j2`, in čisto preskoči, ko ni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each agent now claims its own key in `meta/users.yml` and declares nothing about the password there, because provisioning stores one for every declared account. An earlier attempt pinned the password to a separate `identity_password` credential in `meta/secrets.yml`; that was the wrong home for it. An account password belongs to the account, and the provisioning code says so directly: a role whose registration rejects the shell-safe alphabet states that in its own `meta/users.yml` rather than carrying a second credential beside the account it already owns. The `{{ 42 | strong_password }}` that re-renders per read is the fallback for an inventory nobody provisioned, not the value a deployed account holds."
msgstr "Vsak agent zdaj zahteva svoj ključ v `meta/users.yml` in tam ne objavi ničesar o geslu, ker je zagotavljanje hrani eno za vsak prijavljen račun. Zgodnejši poskus je geslo povezal z ločenim `identity_password` Zaupnost `meta/secrets.yml`; To je bil napačen dom. Geslo računa pripada računu, in določila koda pravi, da neposredno: vloga, katere registracija zavrača lupinsko varno abecedo navaja, da v svojem `meta/users.yml` namesto da bi imel drugo poverilnico poleg svojega računa. – `{{ 42 | strong_password }}` da je ponaredek na branje rezervni znesek za inventar, ki ga nihče ni zagotovil, in ne vrednost, ki jo ima odprt račun."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each application role stays responsible for its own Playwright tests and configuration. This role only provides the execution framework."
msgstr "Vsaka vloga ostane odgovorna za lastne Playwrightove preskuse in nastavitve. Ta vloga zagotavlja le okvir izvajanja."

