# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each candidate starts with three to five named read tools rather than a generated copy of an API, and the first investigation uses the starter contract recorded in [Adapter starter contracts](#adapter-starter-contracts). If the exact pinned version cannot implement the named contract through a stable authenticated API, the role becomes `blocked` with the observed reason rather than receiving a generic substitute."
msgstr "Vsak kandidat začne s tremi do petimi imenovanimi bralnimi orodji in ne z ustvarjeno kopijo API, pri prvi preiskavi pa se uporabi pogodba o začetku postopka, vpisana v [Pogodbe o zagonu pretvornika](#adapter-starter-contracts). Če natančna podprta različica ne more izvajati imenovane pogodbe s stabilno overjeno API, vloga postane `blocked` z ugotovljenim razlogom, namesto da bi prejeli generično nadomestilo."

