msgid "Each case pins one half of the contract: a snapshot is taken **only** where it would be faithful, and where it would not be, `auto` degrades silently to the live copy while a stated kind fails the run loudly."
msgstr "V vsakem primeru je ena polovica pogodbe: posnetek je narejen **samo** kjer bi bilo zvesto in kjer ne bi bilo, `auto` Tiho se ponižuje v živo, medtem ko izrečena vrsta glasno spodleti."

