# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one Ansible surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Topical concerns that are not Ansible-specific (compose/docker/networks, OAuth2/OIDC, service registry, role-meta layout) live under [`infrastructure/`](../infrastructure/), [`iam/`](../iam/), [`meta/`](../meta/), or [`roles/`](../roles/)."
msgstr "Vsaka mapa za otroke zapiči eno Ansible površino; glej Per-imenik README za obseg. Površinske skrbi, ki niso specifične za nesnovne (compose/docker/networks, OAuth2/OIDC, register storitev, razporeditev vloge-meta) živi pod [`infrastructure/`](../infrastructure/), [`iam/`](../iam/), [`meta/`](../meta/), ali [`roles/`](../roles/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one IAM surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Generic OIDC-redirect URI checks and domain rules live under [`meta/domains/`](../meta/domains/); port allocations live under `tests/integration/ports/` once introduced."
msgstr "Vsaka mapa za otroke zašije eno površino IAM; za področje uporabe si oglejte README po navodilih. Splošna OIDC-redirektna preverjanja URI in pravila o domeni živijo v skladu z [`meta/domains/`](../meta/domains/); dodelitve pristanišč živijo v okviru `tests/integration/ports/` Enkrat predstavljena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one infrastructure surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Ansible-native artefacts (filters, lookups, playbooks) live under [`ansible/`](../ansible/); IAM concerns under [`iam/`](../iam/); per-role structural rules under [`roles/`](../roles/)."
msgstr "Vsaka mapa za otroke zabije eno infrastrukturno površino; oglejte si področje uporabe README po navodilih. Nesnovni predmeti (filtri, iskalniki, igralne knjige) živi pod [`ansible/`](../ansible/); pomisleki IAM [`iam/`](../iam/); na role strukturna pravila po [`roles/`](../roles/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one meta surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Per-role structural rules (`meta/main.yml`, `meta/services.yml`, includes) live under [`roles/`](../roles/); infrastructure layout lives under [`infrastructure/`](../infrastructure/)."
msgstr "Vsaka mapa za otroke zašije eno meta površino; oglejte si README po navodilih za področje uporabe. Konstrukcijska pravila na rolo (`meta/main.yml`, `meta/services.yml`, vključuje) živi pod [`roles/`](../roles/); postavitve infrastrukture [`infrastructure/`](../infrastructure/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each compose service that needs static configuration owns a sub-directory whose name matches the service. New service-specific config MUST go into the matching sub-directory rather than at the `compose/` root."
msgstr "Vsaka komponirana storitev, ki potrebuje statično konfiguracijo, ima podimenik, katerega ime se ujema s storitvijo. Nova konfig za posamezne storitve mora iti v ustrezno podimenik namesto na `compose/` koren."

