# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each file's root IS the addon spec; the filename stem is the addon id. Malformed (non-mapping) payloads are skipped here; the lint layer is the one that reports them, so the checker stays robust against in-progress files."
msgstr "Root vsake datoteke je addon spec; ime datoteke je addon ID. Napačen (neobdelava) tovori so preskočili tukaj; lint plast je tista, ki jih poroča, tako da da je šaher ostal robusten proti in-progress datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each flag MUST be accompanied by a one-line `# nocheck` comment above the env line stating the role contract that justifies blocking the persona, and a matching paragraph in the role's `README.md` (or `TODO.md` while the rationale is still drafting). Without the flag, the persona helper hard-fails the test with a diagnostic naming the last-seen URL and pointing the operator at two repair paths: fix the auth chain, or declare the opt-out flag."
msgstr "Vsaka zastava mora biti opremljena z eno vrstico `# nocheck` pripomba nad črto, v kateri je navedena pogodba o vlogi, ki upravičuje blokiranje osebe, in ustrezen odstavek v vlogi `README.md` (ali `TODO.md` medtem ko je utemeljitev še vedno redakcija). Brez zastave, persona pomočnik trdo-neuspeh test z diagnostičnim poimenovanjem nazadnje videnega URL in kazanje upravljavca na dveh poti popravila: popraviti auth verigo, ali razglasijo zastavo izvzetja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each function returns the ordered calls that bring a package in from one source. :mod:`utils.packages.plan` picks between them; none of them knows about the others."
msgstr "Vsaka funkcija vrne naročene klice, ki prinašajo paket iz enega vira. :mod:`utils.packages.plan` Nihče ne ve za ostale."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each handler module exposes ``apply(eb, ctx) -> None``. Cross-handler data flows via :class:`utils.env.builder.EnvBuilder`; handlers must not import each other."
msgstr "Vsak modul upravljalnika razkrije ``apply(eb, ctx) -> None``. Navzkrižni pretok podatkov preko :class:`utils.env.builder.EnvBuilder`; obdelovalci ne smejo uvažati drug drugega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each helper MUST forward `roles_dir` when present in `self._kwargs` so tests can point the lookup at a temporary role tree."
msgstr "Vsak pomočnik mora naprej `roles_dir` če je prisotna `self._kwargs` Tako lahko testi kažejo pogled na začasno drevo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each helper resolves a single piece of information from the host the generator runs on (disk free space, RAM, hostname, /proc/version, GitHub Actions env vars, ...). They are intentionally tiny and side-effect-free apart from the OS read they need to perform, so they can be exercised independently in tests."
msgstr "Vsak pomočnik reši en sam del informacij od gostitelja generator deluje na (prostor brez diska, RAM, ime gostitelja, /proc/version, GitHub dejanja env vars, ...). So namerno majhne in stranski učinek brez, razen OS branje, ki jih potrebujejo za opravljanje, tako da se lahko izvajajo neodvisno v preskusih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each inventory defines:"
msgstr "Vsak inventar določa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each inventory must follow this structure:"
msgstr "Vsak popis mora slediti tej strukturi:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each invocation MUST be reviewed individually for billing + data-flow impact."
msgstr "Vsak poziv mora biti individualno pregledan za obračun + vpliv podatkovnega toka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each invocation MUST be reviewed to confirm the target workflow and inputs."
msgstr "Vsak poziv MORA biti pregledan, da se potrdi ciljni potek dela in vhodne podatke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each invocation carries a unique risk profile depending on flags. `docker run` can mount host paths (`-v /:/host`), expose privileged capabilities (`--privileged`, `--cap-add`), bypass the sandbox via the Docker daemon's root privileges, and pull arbitrary images from any reachable registry. Middle-wildcard false positives (e.g. a container name containing \" run\") land here as harmless extra prompts, an acceptable trade-off against per-synonym enumeration."
msgstr "Vsak poklic ima edinstven profil tveganja, odvisno od zastav. `docker run` lahko priklopite gostiteljske poti (`-v /:/host`), izpostaviti privilegirane sposobnosti (`--privileged`, `--cap-add`), bypass peskovnik preko Docker je koren privilegiji, in potegni poljubne slike iz katerega koli dosegljivega registra. Lažni pozitivi srednjih kart (npr. ime vsebnika, ki vsebuje \" Poženi\") Pristanite tukaj kot neškodljivi dodatni pozivi, sprejemljiv kompromis proti vsakemu sinonimu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each key is preceded by its documentation comment when the builder carries one, mirroring the convention used in `default.env`."
msgstr "Pred vsakim ključem je njegov dokumentacijski komentar, ko ga ima graditelj, ki odraža konvencijo, uporabljeno v `default.env`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each list entry MUST be either:"
msgstr "Vsak vnos seznama MORA biti:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each module in this directory owns exactly one lint tool and exposes a single `ensure()` function. The CLI in [__main__.py](__main__.py) groups these ensure calls and applies the stamp-based skip for the default \"all\" invocation."
msgstr "Vsak modul v tem imeniku ima v lasti točno eno lit orodje in izpostavlja eno `ensure()` funkcijo. CLI v [ main .py](__main__.py) skupine, ki zagotavljajo klice in uporablja preskok na osnovi žiga za privzeto \"all\" invokacija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each module in this directory owns exactly one variable, or one tightly-coupled group resolved by a single helper call. The orchestrator in [builder.py](../builder.py) iterates the registry in [__init__.py](__init__.py) and calls each handler's `apply(eb, ctx)` in order."
msgstr "Vsak modul v tem imeniku ima v lasti točno eno spremenljivko ali eno tesno povezano skupino, ki jo reši en klic pomočnika. Orkester v [builder.py](../builder.py) iterira register v [ init .py](__init__.py) in pokliče vsakega vodjo. `apply(eb, ctx)` V redu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each module owns a private `_reset()` that clears its own cache dicts. The package-level `utils.cache._reset_cache_for_tests()` orchestrates all six (`base`, `applications`, `users`, `domains`, `yaml`, `files`) plus the shared fingerprint memo. Unit tests that exercise the cached paths MUST call it in `setUp` to guarantee clean state across test cases."
msgstr "Vsak modul ima v lasti zasebnega `_reset()` Ki čisti svoje skrivnosti. Raven paketa `utils.cache._reset_cache_for_tests()` Orkestrira vseh šest (`base`, `applications`, `users`, `domains`, `yaml`, `files`) Poleg tega pa še sporočilo o prstnih odtisih. Preskusi enote, ki izvajajo predpomnjene poti, MORAJO priklicati `setUp` zagotoviti čisto stanje med preskusnimi primeri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each module, class, or function MUST have exactly one responsibility so that changes to one concern do not ripple into unrelated code."
msgstr "Vsak modul, razred ali funkcija MORA imeti točno eno odgovornost, tako da spremembe ene zadeve ne valovijo v nepovezano kodo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each one undoes a shape a translator produced and the source did not ask for. They read the source only to decide whether something was lost, never to change what the translation says."
msgstr "Vsak razveljavi obliko, ki jo je izdelal prevajalec in vir ni zahteval. Vir so prebrali samo zato, da bi se odločili, ali je kaj izgubljeno, da ne bi nikoli spremenili prevoda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each operator workflow has a skill that routes the agent to its authoritative procedure and drives it — clarifying open requirements first, then acting autonomously to completion. Most are `i8-` skills specific to this repository; a few (such as `triage`) are portable skills shared across projects."
msgstr "Vsak potek dela upravljavca ima veščino, ki vodi agenta do njegovega avtoritativnega postopka in ga poganja – najprej pojasni odprte zahteve, nato pa deluje samostojno do zaključka. Večina jih je `i8-` veščine, značilne za to skladišče; nekaj (kot so `triage`) so prenosne spretnosti, ki se delijo med projekti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each override is gated on the resource it needs being present, not on the instance slot: an override whose `:?` guard is unsatisfied would abort the stack outright, so a checkout that was never handed a shared git dir or cache network simply does not layer that file in."
msgstr "Vsaka premostitev je nastavljena na vir, ki ga potrebuje, da je prisoten, ne na primer slot: preklop, ki `:?` Varovalka je nezadovoljna, bi prekinila sklad čisto, tako da odjava, ki ni bil nikoli oddan skupni git dir ali cache omrežje preprosto ne plast, da datoteko v."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each persona scenario MUST be named `<persona>: <flow>`, where `<persona>` is the literal token `guest`, `biber`, or `administrator` and `<flow>` is a concise step description (e.g. `dashboard → app → logout`). The persona token MUST appear at the very start of the test title so the Playwright reporter groups runs by persona without further parsing."
msgstr "Vsaka oseba mora biti imenovana `<persona>: <flow>`, kjer `<persona>` je dobesedni simbol `guest`, `biber`, ali `administrator` ter `<flow>` je kratek opis koraka (Npr. `dashboard → app → logout`). Persona žeton MORAjo pojavi na samem začetku naslova testa, tako da Playwright reporter skupine teče po persona brez nadaljnjega razčlenjevanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each recover mirrors a snapshot with `rsync -a --delete` and first runs the role's backup unit as a rollback point. `--no-safety-backup` skips that (only when the target holds nothing worth saving: fresh host / empty / disposable). `--preview` prints the exact commands without running them."
msgstr "Vsaka izterja ogledala posnetek z `rsync -a --delete` In najprej vodi rezervno enoto. `--no-safety-backup` Preskoči to. (samo, če cilj nima nič vredno prihraniti: svež gostitelj / prazen / enkratno). `--preview` Natisne natančne ukaze, ne da bi jih preveril."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each role group must contain the default host."
msgstr "Vsaka skupina vlog mora vsebovati privzetega gostitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each role in that closure is then narrowed to the variants that actually reach a seed: variant `i` of a role is kept only when round `i`'s closure — walked on the same variant-merged services maps [the matrix planner](../../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py) builds its rounds from, and therefore variant-aware at every generation of the chain — contains one of the seeds. A role whose variants do not all qualify enters the whitelist as a `role#0,2` selection token, so an image bump in a provider no longer redeploys the variants that switch that provider off. This applies to every auto-derived whitelist — the weekly update PRs, Dependabot, and any other diff-driven run — because they all resolve through this one path."
msgstr "Vsaka vloga v tem zaprtju se nato omeji na variante, ki dejansko dosežejo seme: varianta `i` vloga se ohrani samo, ko se zaokroži `i`Zaprtje – hodi po istih zemljevidih različnih storitev [načrtovalec matrike](../../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py) gradi svoje kroge iz, in zato varianta-zavedanje na vsaki generaciji verige – vsebuje eno od semen. Vloga, katere variante se ne štejejo za vse, je na beli listi `role#0,2` Izbor žeton, tako da slika buck v ponudniku ne spreminja več variant, ki izklopijo ponudnika. To velja za vsak samodejni Whitelist – tedenske posodobitve PR, Dependabot, in vse druge diff pogon teči – ker so vsi rešiti skozi to eno pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each row is a migration target. The \"Bridges\" column is the cross-role dependency this requirement makes explicit. \"Today's location\" is where the declaration lives before migration."
msgstr "Vsaka vrsta je migracijska tarča. – \"Bridges\" stolpec je navzkrižna odvisnost, ki jo ta zahteva izrecno določa. \"Današnja lokacija\" je kraj, kjer deklaracija živi pred migracijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each row recomputes the role's embedded (forward) service deps from that variant's merged ``services`` map, so toggling a sidecar off in a variant drops it from the variant's ``embeds``/``weight``. The consumer (reverse) side is the variant-independent role-level graph: who else in the catalog embeds this role does not change with the role's own variant selection."
msgstr "Vsaka vrstica preračuna vgrajeno vlogo (Naprej) service deps iz te variante je združil ``services`` Zemljevid, tako, da ga sklanjaš v varianti. ``embeds``/``weight``. Potrošnik (vzvratno) stran je graf na ravni vloge, ki je neodvisna od variant: kdo še v katalogu vnaša to vlogo, se ne spremeni z izbiro lastne variante vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each runner instance is provisioned as an ephemeral container using **DooD** (Docker-out-of-Docker — it mounts the host `docker.sock`). Isolation is keyed on the instance number, so parallel jobs never collide:"
msgstr "Vsak primerek tekača je predviden kot efemerni zabojnik z uporabo **DooD** (Docker-out-of-docker – nastavlja gostitelja `docker.sock`). Izolacija je ključnega pomena na primer število, tako da vzporednih delovnih mest nikoli ne trči:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each scenario MUST live in its own `test-*.js` module (e.g. `test-login-oidc.js`, `test-seaweedfs.js`). `playwright.spec.js` is the thin aggregator that `require()`s every scenario module, keeping each case atomic and individually inspectable. The runner globs every `*.js`, so no extra wiring is needed."
msgstr "Vsak scenarij mora živeti sam. `test-*.js` modul (Npr. `test-login-oidc.js`, `test-seaweedfs.js`). `playwright.spec.js` je tanek agregator, ki `require()`s vsi moduli scenarijev, ki vodijo vsak primer atomsko in individualno pregled. Tekač se zgrudi. `*.js`, tako da ni potrebna dodatna napeljava."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Each script MUST be entered via `cli.administration.deploy.development exec --env KEY=VAL` (or an equivalent `docker exec -e …` invocation) so the host wrapper can inject the required environment. Each script MUST assert its required env-vars at the top with `: \"${VAR:?}\"` so missing context surfaces immediately. Each script MUST `cd \"${INFINITO_SRC_DIR}\"` before running anything so relative paths resolve against the bind-mounted repo. Each script SHOULD run `./scripts/docker/entry.sh true` for entry bootstrap before the deploy step."
msgstr "Vsak skript mora biti vnesen preko `cli.administration.deploy.development exec --env KEY=VAL` (ali ekvivalenta `docker exec -e …` vpoklic) tako da lahko ovitek gostitelja injicira potrebno okolje. Vsak skript MORA uveljavljati svoje zahtevane env-vars na vrhu z `: \"${VAR:?}\"` Tako manjkajoče površine konteksta takoj. Vsak skript MORA `cd \"${INFINITO_SRC_DIR}\"` pred vožnjo kaj tako relativne poti rešiti proti vezano-montirani repo. Vsak skript naj teče `./scripts/docker/entry.sh true` za vstopni škornji pred uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each service entry lives in the provider role's own `meta/services.yml`, where the file root IS the services map keyed by `<entity_name>` (no `compose:` and no `services:` wrapper). See [layout.md](layout.md) for the full per-role meta layout."
msgstr "Vsaka vstopna storitev živi v svoji vlogi ponudnika `meta/services.yml`, kjer je koren datoteke je zemljevid storitev, ki jih zaklene `<entity_name>` (ni `compose:` in ne `services:` ovoj). Glej [layout.md](layout.md) za celotno meta razporeditev na rolo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each service in host vars MAY carry a `mirror_policy` field that controls how the override is applied:"
msgstr "Vsaka storitev v gostitelju vars MAY nosi `mirror_policy` polje, ki nadzoruje način uporabe razveljavitve:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each service-account integration provisions a dedicated non-login identity holding only the upstream permissions the declared allowlist needs. The lookup resolves `mcp.credential.owner`, `source` and `key`; deployment fails when the resolved principal is missing, empty, more privileged than `auth_subject` declares, or shared with an unrelated provider."
msgstr "Vsaka določba o integraciji storitvenega računa vsebuje namensko identiteto, ki ni login in ki ima le gornja dovoljenja za prijavljene potrebe po seznamu pravic. Vpogled razreši `mcp.credential.owner`, `source` ter `key`; uvedba ne uspe, ko je rešeni glavnica manjka, prazna, bolj privilegirana kot `auth_subject` razglasi ali deli z nepovezanim ponudnikom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each settings change MUST be reviewed before it lands. Approval here is equivalent in blast radius to approving a `deny`-rule edit: the next tool call may run under new rules. Operators SHOULD diff the proposed change against the live file before approving and SHOULD decline any change that widens `allowWrite`, removes a `deny` entry, adds a broad `allow` wildcard, or registers a hook command."
msgstr "Vsaka sprememba nastavitev MORA biti pregledana, preden pristane. Odobritev je v polmeru eksplozije enakovredna odobritvi `deny`-pravilo urejanje: naslednji klic orodja lahko teče po novih pravilih. Upravljavci bi morali pred odobritvijo vnesti predlagano spremembo v živo in zavrniti vsako spremembo, ki se razširi. `allowWrite`, odstrani a `deny` vnos, dodaja široko `allow` divje karte ali registrira ukaz za trnek."

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span lost=[] gained=['0']
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Vsak šim mora rešiti koren skladišča glede na svojo
# lokacijo, tako da lahko teče iz katerega koli delovnega imenika, MORAjo
# posredovati argumente na osnovni CLI tako `--dry-run` in podobne zastave še
# naprej delajo iz lupine, in NE izhod non-0 na CLI napako, tako da je potek
# dela površina napake.
msgid "Each shim MUST resolve the repository root relative to its own location so it can run from any working directory, MUST forward arguments to the underlying CLI so `--dry-run` and similar flags keep working from the shell, and MUST exit non-zero on CLI failure so the workflow surfaces the error."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each stage entry below lists the criteria a role MUST satisfy to claim that stage. Promotion to the next stage is a deliberate human decision, not an automated transition. A role MAY only be tagged with a stage whose criteria are fully met; any drift MUST be corrected by either fixing the role or demoting the lifecycle key to the highest stage whose criteria still hold."
msgstr "V vsaki spodnji fazi so navedena merila, ki jih mora izpolnjevati vloga. Promocija na naslednjo stopnjo je namerna človeška odločitev, ne avtomatiziran prehod. Vlogo LAHKO označimo le s stopnjo, katere merila so v celoti izpolnjena; vsak premik je treba popraviti tako, da se bodisi določi vloga ali zniža ključ življenjskega cikla do najvišje stopnje, katere merila še vedno veljajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each subpackage owns one generated page and runs through its own make target; ``docs/`` itself holds only the rendered result."
msgstr "Vsaka podpakiranje ima v lasti eno ustvarjeno stran in teče skozi svoj cilj; ``docs/`` ima samo rezultat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each test MUST cover one isolated behavior. Do not test multiple concerns in a single test method."
msgstr "Vsak test MORA zajeti eno izolirano vedenje. Pri eni preskusni metodi ne preskušajte več pomislekov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each unique repository URL is queried once per run; the result is reused for every entry pointing at the same repo."
msgstr "Vsak edinstven URL skladišča se poizveduje enkrat na zagon; rezultat se ponovno uporabi za vsak vnos, ki kaže na isti repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each verb folder MUST contain `all.sh` for every discovered application and MAY contain `selection.sh` for one or more apps passed via `apps` (or as a positional argument where supported)."
msgstr "Vsaka glagolska mapa MORA vsebovati `all.sh` za vsako odkrito aplikacijo in MAY vsebuje `selection.sh` za eno ali več aplikacij, ki se prenašajo prek `apps` (ali kot argument o položaju, če je podprt)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Eager placeholder substitution for cached user dicts."
msgstr "Zamenjava za predpomnjene uporabniške odredbe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Earlier revisions gated these blocks on ``services.sso.enabled``, which unblocked the personas in exactly the variant where the chain still does not work."
msgstr "Predhodne revizije so te bloke zagnale ``services.sso.enabled``, ki je odblokirala osebo v varianti, kjer veriga še vedno ne deluje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Earlier revisions gated these blocks on `services.sso.enabled`, which unblocked the personas in exactly the variant where the chain still does not work."
msgstr "Predhodne revizije so te bloke zagnale `services.sso.enabled`, ki je odblokirala osebo v varianti, kjer veriga še vedno ne deluje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Early value shortens feedback loops."
msgstr "Zgodnja vrednost skrajša povratne zanke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Easily configure your access through a reverse proxy to ensure secure, controlled entry to your LDAP management tool."
msgstr "Preprosto nastavite svoj dostop prek povratnega posrednika, da se zagotovi varen, nadzorovan vnos v vaše orodje za upravljanje LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Easily customize your YOURLS instance through environment variables: set your site URL, admin credentials, and more."
msgstr "Preprosto prilagodite svoje YOURLS primer skozi okoljske spremenljivke: nastavite URL strani, admin poverilnice, in še več."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Easily extend this role with:"
msgstr "Enostavno razširiti to vlogo z:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Easily manage database configurations, user accounts, and monitor query activity with built‑in health checks."
msgstr "Z vgrajenimi zdravstvenimi pregledi lahko upravljate konfiguracije baz podatkov, uporabniške račune in spremljate poizvedovalno dejavnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Easy-to-explain code is usually sound."
msgstr "Enostavna za razlago kode je običajno zvok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Edge proxy"
msgstr "Posrednik robov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Edge style encodes the flag: a solid edge is a fixed (literal ``true``) relationship, a dashed edge is variable (a ``{{ ... }}`` conditional), and a red ``0..0`` edge is one the role turns off (``enabled`` and ``shared`` both literally ``false``) — the relationship exists in the metadata but carries nothing at deploy time."
msgstr "Slog roba kodira zastavo: trden rob je fiksni (dobesedno ``true``) razmerje, črtasti rob je spremenljivo (a ``{{ ... }}`` pogojno)in rdečo ``0..0`` Rob je ena vloga izklopi (``enabled`` ter ``shared`` Oba dobesedno ``false``) — razmerje obstaja v metapodatkih, vendar ne vsebuje ničesar v času začetka uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Uredi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Edit / Fix / Redeploy Loop 🔁"
msgstr "Uredi / Popravi / Redeploy Loop 🔁"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Edit `roles/<application_id>/meta/variants.yml` (create the file if absent)."
msgstr "Uredi `roles/<application_id>/meta/variants.yml` (ustvari datoteko, če je ni)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Edit `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. You MUST NOT hand-edit the staged copy under `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>/tests/`; the rerunner overwrites it from the repo on each run."
msgstr "Uredi `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Ne smete ročno urediti uprizorjeno kopijo pod `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>/tests/`; Prevajalec jo je prepisal iz repota."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Edition is **Raw / Community** (`checkmk/check-mk-raw`)."
msgstr "Izdaja je **Surova / skupnost** (`checkmk/check-mk-raw`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Education Suite"
msgstr "Izobraževalni apartma"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Educational institutions seeking an integrated platform for learning management, collaboration, and virtual classrooms."
msgstr "Izobraževalne ustanove, ki iščejo celostno platformo za upravljanje učenja, sodelovanje in virtualne učilnice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "Učinek"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Effect of disabling"
msgstr "Učinek onesposobitve"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Effective ``--id`` list: seed ∪ dep-walk(seed) ∪ default-placement safety net."
msgstr "Učinkovito ``--id`` seznam: seme (seme)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Effective terminal alias repository from the generated .env."
msgstr "Učinkoviti terminalski alias repozitorij iz ustvarjenega .env."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Effectively: nothing blocks merge here"
msgstr "Učinkovito: tukaj se ne združuje nič blokov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Egress"
msgstr "Izstop"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Either approach keeps the Playwright suite deterministic without disabling the LDAP first-login-provisioning behavior that real users rely on."
msgstr "Oba pristopa ohranja Playwright suite deterministično brez onemogočanja LDAP prvo-login-zagotavlja vedenje, na katerega se zanašajo pravi uporabniki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Either of the above is accepted."
msgstr "Kar koli od navedenega je sprejeto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
