# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Elevate your email marketing with Listmonk, a high-performance, self-hosted newsletter and mailing list manager featuring a modern, intuitive dashboard. Listmonk empowers you with advanced analytics, efficient subscriber segmentation, and streamlined campaign management, all configurable via a flexible TOML configuration file."
msgstr "Dvignite e-pošto trženje z Listmonk, visoko zmogljivo, samogostoljubno glasilo in manager poštnih seznamov z moderno, intuitivno armaturno ploščo. Listmonk vas pooblašča z napredno analitiko, učinkovito segmentacijo naročnikov in racionaliziranim upravljanjem kampanje, vse je nastavljivo preko prilagodljive nastavitvene datoteke TOML."

