# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Entries render **disabled**, and the task enables each one in the same write that carries its grant. An empty ``access_grants`` is not “nobody”: Open WebUI reads it as every administrator, which is wider than the ``mcp`` group. Since ``ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`` makes the env authoritative again on every start, an enabled-but-ungranted entry would hand access to all administrators before the first provisioning run and after any bare container restart. A disabled entry is not served at all, so the fallback is no access rather than too much."
msgstr "Izris vnosov **onemogočeno**, in naloga omogoča vsak v istem pisanju, ki nosi svojo donacijo. Prazno ``access_grants`` ni “nikogar”: Open WebUI ga bere kot vsak administrator, ki je širši od ``mcp`` skupina. Od ``ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`` na vsakem začetku ponovno postane avtoritativen, tako da bi omogočeni, vendar neupravičeni vstop vsem administratorjem omogočil dostop pred prvo rezervacijo in po ponovnem zagonu vseh praznih zabojnikov. Invalidni vstop sploh ni na voljo, zato je rezervni dostop bolj kot preveč."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Entries render **disabled**, and the task enables each one in the same write that carries its grant. An empty `access_grants` is not \"nobody\": Open WebUI reads it as every administrator, which is wider than the `mcp` group. Since `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false` makes the env authoritative again on every start, an enabled-but-ungranted entry would hand access to all administrators before the first provisioning run and after any bare container restart. A disabled entry is not served at all, so the fallback is no access rather than too much."
msgstr "Izris vnosov **onemogočeno**, in naloga omogoča vsak v istem pisanju, ki nosi svojo donacijo. Prazno `access_grants` ni \"nobody\": Open WebUI ga bere kot vsak administrator, ki je širši od `mcp` skupina. Od `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false` na vsakem začetku ponovno postane avtoritativen, tako da bi omogočeni, vendar neupravičeni vstop vsem administratorjem omogočil dostop pred prvo rezervacijo in po ponovnem zagonu vseh praznih zabojnikov. Invalidni vstop sploh ni na voljo, zato je rezervni dostop bolj kot preveč."

