msgstr "Vsaka vloga mora prijaviti svoje Docker slike v `meta/services.yml`. Koren datoteke je zemljevid storitev, ki jih tipka `<service-name>` (ni `compose:` in ne `services:` ovoj):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role carries a disposition"
msgstr "Vsaka vloga je naravnana"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role file with its per-type policy and dotted-path entries."
msgstr "Vsaka datoteka z vlogami s svojimi vnosi po vrsti in pikčasto potjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role that declares RBAC at the file root of its `meta/rbac.yml` MUST be provisioned with a per-application namespace under the container named by `RBAC.GROUP.NAME` (default `roles`). Each LDAP group entry is a direct child of that container; the application identifier (and the tenant identifier, if any) is encoded into the CN with hyphen separators:"
msgstr "Vsaka vloga, ki razglasi RBAC na korenu datoteke `meta/rbac.yml` MORA biti zagotovljena z imenom prostora po aplikaciji pod vsebnikom, ki ga imenuje `RBAC.GROUP.NAME` (privzeto `roles`). Vsak vnos skupine LDAP je neposreden otrok tega vsebnika; identifikator aplikacije (in identifikator najemnika, če obstaja) je kodiran v KN s separatorji za zavijanje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role that ships role-level extensions MUST declare them under `roles/<role>/meta/addons/`, one file per addon at `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`. The file root IS the addon spec; there is NO wrapping `<addon_id>:` key (the filename stem supplies the addon id)."
msgstr "Vsaka vloga, ki jo imajo ladje na ravni vloge, jih mora razglasiti za `roles/<role>/meta/addons/`, ena datoteka na addon na `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`. Koren datoteke je addon spec; ni zavijanje `<addon_id>:` ključ (Datotečno ime steblo vsebuje addon ID)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role type with the files it MAY or MUST ship."
msgstr "Vsaka vrsta vlog z datotekami, ki jih LAHKO ali MORAJO ladja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role with a literal `application_id` is filed exactly once below. A role missing from these lists would read as \"not yet looked at\" and as \"decided against\" at the same time, with nothing to tell the two apart."
msgstr "Vsaka vloga z dobesedno `application_id` je vložena točno enkrat spodaj. Manjkajoča vloga na teh seznamih bi se glasila kot \"še nisem pogledal\" in kot \"odločeno proti\" hkrati, z ničimer, da se ločita."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role with an ``application_id`` declares exactly one ``mcp:`` entry. The block is an audit disposition first and a deployable surface second: ``classification`` states what the role is, and only a deployable classification may also carry ``enabled``/``shared`` and a served contract."
msgstr "Vsaka vloga z ``application_id`` razglasi točno enega ``mcp:`` vstop. Blok je najprej revizija, nato pa razmestljiva površina: ``classification`` navaja, kakšna je vloga, in lahko ima tudi le razvrstitev, ki jo je mogoče razporediti ``enabled``/``shared`` in pogodbo za vročitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role with an `application_id` carries one role-local `mcp:` mapping in `meta/services.yml`. Discovery selects only a deployable classification with explicit `enabled: true` and `shared: true`; an audit-only mapping never becomes an endpoint:"
msgstr "Vsaka vloga z `application_id` ima eno lokalno vlogo `mcp:` Kartiranje v `meta/services.yml`. Discovery izbere samo razpoložljivo razvrstitev z izrecnim `enabled: true` ter `shared: true`; kartiranje, ki temelji samo na reviziji, nikoli ne postane končna točka:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every row is assigned its deploy mode, tor state, distro, filesystem and CPU architecture by its position in that list (:mod:`utils.github.variant.axes`)."
msgstr "Vsaka vrstica ima svoj način uporabe, stanje tor, distro, datotečni sistem in arhitekturo CPU po svojem položaju na tem seznamu (:mod:`utils.github.variant.axes`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every row of the CI matrix is one ``role#variant`` selection. Five axes are decided here, all as a deterministic rotation over the row's position in the *global* discovery order and the sweep number -- never at random, so a red job can be reproduced by re-running the same sweep, and so consecutive sweeps cover the combinations instead of sampling them:"
msgstr "Vsaka vrsta matrice CI je ena. ``role#variant`` izbira. Pet sekir se odloča tukaj, vse kot deterministično vrtenje nad pozicijo vrste v *globalno* vrstni red iskanja in številka premetavanja -- nikoli naključno, tako da se lahko rdeče opravilo reproducira tako, da se ponovno izvede isti pregled, in tako zaporedni pregledi zajemajo kombinacije namesto vzorčenja:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every rule in `permissions.ask` assumes the operator reads the prompt and confirms the action matches intent. Rules in `ask` are NOT a hard barrier. They are a speed-bump that converts automatic execution into a deliberate decision."
msgstr "Vsako pravilo `permissions.ask` Predvideva, da upravljavec prebere poziv in potrdi namen dejanja. Pravila `ask` niso trda ovira. So hitrostni skok, ki avtomatsko izvedbo pretvori v namerno odločitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every runner instance is an ephemeral container that mounts its host's docker socket (DooD). For each CI job it starts a fresh Infinito DinD container with a unique subnet and volume, runs the job inside it, and tears it down; the runner then re-registers with GitHub as a fresh ephemeral runner."
msgstr "Vsak primerek tekača je efemeralna posoda, ki nastavlja gostiteljevo vtičnico. (DooD). Za vsako delo CI se začne sveže Infinito DIND zabojnik z edinstveno podneto in prostornino, vodi delo v njej, in ga rušenje navzdol; tekač nato ponovno registrira z GitHub kot sveže efemerni tekač."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every runner instance is an ephemeral container that mounts its host’s docker socket (DooD). For each CI job it starts a fresh Infinito DinD container with a unique subnet and volume, runs the job inside it, and tears it down; the runner then re-registers with GitHub as a fresh ephemeral runner."
msgstr "Vsak primerek tekača je ephemeralni zabojnik, ki nastavlja gostiteljevo vtičnico. (DooD). Za vsako delo CI se začne sveže Infinito DIND zabojnik z edinstveno podneto in prostornino, vodi delo v njej, in ga rušenje navzdol; tekač nato ponovno registrira z GitHub kot sveže efemerni tekač."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every scenario MUST end with the browser in a clearly logged-out state."
msgstr "Vsak scenarij SE MORA končati z brskalnikom v jasno prijavljenem stanju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every selected run is attempted before anything is reported; abandoning the rest on the first rejection would leave them burning runners. `HTTP 409` means the run already finished and is not a rejection at all. Any other rejection is logged as an `ERROR` line, but only a denied token fails the job — a rate limit or a run that vanished between listing and cancel is transient, and a red check for those is a red check nobody reads."
msgstr "Vsak izbrani tek se poskuša, preden se karkoli poroča; opustitev ostalega ob prvi zavrnitvi bi jih zapustil goreče tekače. `HTTP 409` pomeni, da je tek že končan in sploh ni zavrnitev. Vsaka druga zavrnitev se zabeleži kot `ERROR` linija, vendar samo zavrnjeni žeton ne uspe delo – meja obrestne mere ali tek, ki je izginil med seznamom in preklicem je prehoden, in rdeči ček za to je rdeči ček, ki ga nihče ne bere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every selection names every axis: role, variant, mode, onion state, distro and filesystem. Nothing is left to the rotation."
msgstr "Vsak izbor označuje vsako os: vlogo, varianto, način, stanje čebule, distro in datotečni sistem. Nič ni ostalo od vrtenja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every service-dependent step uses `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(...)`. Direct `process.env` reads of `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED` are forbidden."
msgstr "Vsak korak, odvisen od storitev `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(...)`. Neposredno `process.env` bere `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED` so prepovedani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every shell invocation the agent makes: `make` targets, `git`/`gh`/`docker` calls, `grep`/`head`/`tail`/`wc`, Python test runners, log-capture pipelines, etc."
msgstr "Vsaka lupina kliče agenta: `make` cilje, `git`/`gh`/`docker` klice, `grep`/`head`/`tail`/`wc`, Pythonovi testni tekači, cevovodi za zajemanje dnevnikov itd."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every spec MUST include the three persona scenarios below as its baseline. Additional scenarios (RBAC loops, peer-to-peer messaging, federation round-trips, CSP-deep-checks, …) MAY be added on top. Three personas exist in the deploy fixture: `guest` (no Keycloak account), `biber` (regular end-user), and `administrator` (operator/admin). The flow shape is identical across roles. Only the role-specific selectors and the post-login assertion change. Service-dependent steps MUST be guarded with [`skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/service-gating.js) so a deploy with `disable=<svc>` reports the affected step as `skipped: <NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`, never `failed`."
msgstr "Vsaka specifikacija mora vključevati tri scenarije v nadaljevanju kot izhodišče. Dodatni scenariji (Zanke RBAC, sporočila med vrstniki, runde federacije, CSP-globoko preverjanje, ...) MORDA se doda na vrh. Tri osebe obstajajo v vgrajeni napravi: `guest` (ni Keycloak račun), `biber` (običajni končni uporabnik)in `administrator` (upravljavec/uprava)Pretok je identičen med vlogami. Spreminjajo se samo selektorji, specifični za vlogo, in trditve po prijavi. Koraki, odvisni od storitev, MORAJO biti varovani [`skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/service-gating.js) tako razporeditev z `disable=<svc>` poroča o prizadeti stopnji kot `skipped: <NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`, nikoli `failed`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every spec MUST set `test.use({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` at the top of the file because the test environment uses self-signed certificates. The central `playwright.config.js` does NOT set this globally. Per-spec opt-in is the contract."
msgstr "Vsaka specifikacija mora biti določena `test.use({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` na vrhu datoteke, ker preskusno okolje uporablja samopodpisana potrdila. Osrednji `playwright.config.js` NE postavlja tega globalno. Per-spec opt-in je pogodba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every stack has its own domain below it (`INFINITO_DOMAIN`): the primary checkout is `main.infinito.test`, a worktree from `make worktree-up` is its branch lowercased with every character outside `a-z0-9_-` replaced by `-` (`feature/store-i18n` → `feature-store-i18n.infinito.test`). `linux.sh` routes each stack's domain to that checkout's `INFINITO_BIND_IP`, read from the `.env` of every `git worktree list` entry. Re-run `make network-dns-setup` after creating or removing a worktree."
msgstr "Vsak sklad ima svojo domeno pod njim (`INFINITO_DOMAIN`): primarna odjava je `main.infinito.test`, Delavsko drevo iz `make worktree-up` je njena podružnica majhna z vsakim znakom zunaj `a-z0-9_-` nadomesti z `-` (`feature/store-i18n` → `feature-store-i18n.infinito.test`). `linux.sh` vodi domene vsakega sklada do te odjavne postaje. `INFINITO_BIND_IP`, beri iz `.env` vsake `git worktree list` vstop. Ponoven zagon `make network-dns-setup` po ustvarjanju ali odstranitvi delovnega drevesa."

