msgid "Exists so shell and workflow steps can compose the same reference the env layer composes, instead of spelling ``ghcr.io/...`` out a second time."
msgstr "Obstaja tako lupinski in delovni tok koraki lahko sestavijo isto referenco env plast sestavlja, namesto črkovanja ``ghcr.io/...`` Drugič."

# translated-by: libretranslate
