msgstr "Fiksna Moodle uporaba: PHP 8.3- fpm pin, serijsko PHP- ext graditi, da bi se izognili modulom/ dirki, padla msmtp iz FPM zdravstvenega pregleda, poravnana meta/services.yml s soglasjem zrcala slike+verzije"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed Nextcloud Talk admin spec, Settings-menu locator drift, Metadata plugin incompatibility, OIDC alt-login click, and the files_bpm plugin entry"
msgstr "Fiksna Nextcloud Talk admin spec, Nastavitve-menu lokator drift, Metadata plugin nezdružljivost, OIDC alt-login klik, in files_bpm vnos vstavkov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed OpenCloud / OpenTalk Playwright OIDC scenarios; added the OpenTalk recorder; fixed OpenCloud SPA wait after the OIDC callback"
msgstr "Fiksna OpenCloud / OpenTalk Playwright OIDC scenariji; doda OpenTalk zapisovalnik; fiksni OpenCloud SPA počakajte na klic OIDC"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed PR / branch cancellation behavior, branch-scope CI gating, fork prerequisite handling, and several GitHub Actions orchestration edge cases"
msgstr "Fiksno vedenje PR / podružnica preklica, podružnica-skop CI aligacija, vilice predpogojno ravnanje, in več primerov GitHub akcije orkestracija rob"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed PeerTube plugin-install reliability with explicit image pinning, improved diagnostics, memory-cap-aware install handling, and local OOM reproduction support"
msgstr "Fiksna PeerTube plugin-install zanesljivost z eksplicitno sliko pinning, izboljšano diagnostiko, Memory-cap-aware install, in lokalno podporo OOM reprodukcije"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed Prometheus origin, explicit lookback/sample/time caps; no admin, reload, snapshot, delete-series, or arbitrary URL proxy"
msgstr "Fiksna Prometheus izvor, izrecno lookback/sample/time kapice; brez admin, ponovno nalaganje, posnetek, brisanje serije, ali poljubno URL posrednik"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed SMTP in CI and DinD by dynamically selecting ports and disabling authentication when TLS is off"
msgstr "Fiksni SMTP v CI in DIND z dinamično izbiro vrat in onemogočanjem avtentikacije, ko je TLS izključen"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed WordPress multisite wp-config quoting, hardcoded plugin-enable lookups, discourse-integration ordering, and per-variant Discourse toggle gating"
msgstr "Fiksna WordPress multisite wp-config citiranje, težko kodirani plugin-enable lookups, diskurzno-integracija naročanje, in na spremenljivko Discourse glajenje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed deploy resolution, AUR installs (use ***aur_builder***), Debian/Ubuntu images (openssh-client), CI rate limits (***NIX_CONFIG***), plus general test and security fixes."
msgstr "Stalna resolucija o uporabi, namesti AUR (uporaba ***aur_builder***), Slike Debian/Ubuntu (opensh-client), omejitve stopnje CI (***NIX_CONFIG***), plus splošne teste in varnostne popravke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed env-test suites: dynamic Fedora release resolution in the cache probe, compose-network discovery for the DiD probe, and oauth2-proxy allowed_groups slash normalization"
msgstr "Fiksni suiti za env-preskus: dinamična sprostitev Fedora v sondi predpomnilnika, odkritje komponiranja omrežja za sondo DiD in oauth2-proksi allowed_groups normalizacija poševnice"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed flaky Nix-related network failures and added explicit failure-path coverage for retry handling"
msgstr "Nespremenljive okvare omrežja, povezane z Nixom, in dodana eksplicitna pokritost poti okvare za ponovno poskusno ravnanje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed integration tests **CI Enhancements**"
msgstr "Preskusi stalne integracije **Izboljšanje CI**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Fixed meta drift: req-008 sweep gaps (lost suppressions, silent test breakage, one prod bug), host-bound port collisions on 8071/8072, subnet collisions on 192.168.105.{48,64}/28, and Moodle resource limits"
msgstr "Fiksni meta premik: req-008 vrzeli pri brisanju (izgubljene supresije, tihi zlom preizkusa, en trni hrošč), trki v pristanišče, vezani na gostitelja 8071/8072, podmrežna trčenja 192.168.105.{48,64}/28, in Moodle omejitve virov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed multiple domain, CSP, email, lookup, and proxy wiring issues uncovered during the applications / users migration"
msgstr "Fiksna več domen, CSP, email, lookup, in proxy ožičenje vprašanja odkritih med aplikacij / uporabniki migracije"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed reusable workflow wait parameter wiring and test-dns CI image selection"
msgstr "Fiksna ožičenje parametrov delovnega toka, ki ga je mogoče ponovno uporabiti, in izbira slik CI v testih"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fixed systemd-in-container boot hangs by disabling systemd-firstboot and initializing machine-id"
msgstr "Fiksni sistem-v-zabojnik visi z onesposobitvijo sistem-prvi zagon in inicializacijo stroj-id"

# translated-by: libretranslate
