#, no-python-format
msgid "Follow the instructions from AGENTS.md, then run both verification lanes by following the procedure in `docs/agents/action/verify-parallel.md` (relative to the Infinito.Nexus repository root) exactly. That document is the source of truth; this skill only routes you there. Begin by clarifying every open requirement with the `active-listening` skill (escalating any root-cause or design question you are not ~99% sure of to the `dialectic` skill), then work under the `robot` skill. The CI lane MUST be dispatched by invoking the `i8-ci-trigger-priority` skill rather than by building a line here, so the two skills cannot drift on what a verification row is. The two lanes run at once because they run on different machines; inside the local lane deploys stay serial. Never dispatch a second CI run while the triage loop is armed, and close each question by naming which lane answered it."
msgstr "Upoštevajte navodila AGENTS.md, nato pa zaženite oba voznega pasu preverjanja z uporabo postopka v `docs/agents/action/verify-parallel.md` (glede na Infinito.Nexus Koren skladišča) Točno. Ta dokument je vir resnice; ta spretnost vas le vodi tja. Začnite s pojasnitvijo vseh odprtih zahtev z `active-listening` spretnost (stopnjuje vse korenine vzrok ali oblikovalsko vprašanje niste ~99% je prepričano v `dialectic` spretnost), nato delo pod `robot` spretnost. Pot CI mora biti odposlana s sklicevanjem na `i8-ci-trigger-priority` spretnosti in ne z izgradnjo linije tukaj, tako da se dve spretnosti ne moreta zanašati na to, kaj je vrsta preverjanja. Ta dva pasova tečeta naenkrat, ker tečeta na različnih strojih; znotraj lokalnega pasu se uporablja serijski. Nikoli ne razpošlji drugega CI-ja, medtem ko je triažna zanka oborožena, in zapri vsako vprašanje z imenom kateri pas je odgovoril nanj."

