# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "For each external failure, you MUST first search [s.infinito.nexus/issues](https://s.infinito.nexus/issues) for a matching open issue using `gh issue list --search \"<exact error message>\"`. A match requires the exact same error message line from the log to appear in the existing issue. Looser symptom-only matches MUST NOT be treated as duplicates."
msgstr "Za vsako zunanjo napako morate najprej iskati [s.infinito.nexus/vprašanja](https://s.infinito.nexus/issues) za ujemanje odprte izdaje z uporabo `gh issue list --search \"<exact error message>\"`. Za ujemanje je potrebna ista vrstica sporočila o napaki iz dnevnika, ki se pojavi v obstoječi izdaji. Vžigalic, ki se nanašajo samo na simptome, se ne sme obravnavati kot dvojnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "For each failed run you MUST download every failed job's logs and artefacts via `python -m cli.meta.ci.logs.download <child-run-url> -f`, which writes the per-job logs, the artefacts, and a `jobs.json` / `summary.tsv` manifest under `/tmp/logs/<child-run-id>/`. See [the logs CLI](../../../../cli/meta/ci/logs/README.md)."
msgstr "Za vsako neuspešno vožnjo MORATE prenesti dnevnike in artefakte vseh neuspešnih opravil preko `python -m cli.meta.ci.logs.download <child-run-url> -f`, ki piše dnevnike na delo, artefakte, in a `jobs.json` / `summary.tsv` manifestirano pod `/tmp/logs/<child-run-id>/`. Glej [dnevnik CLI](../../../../cli/meta/ci/logs/README.md)."

