# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "For fork PRs, CI waits for privileged images built by the `pull_request_target` event before proceeding. For an untrusted fork that build runs from the safe base merge ref **without organization secrets** (only the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN`); a maintainer-applied `🛡️ Trusted` label switches the build source to the PR head, unlocks the mirror credentials, and skips the wait — see [Trusted fork PRs](#trusted-fork-prs-)."
msgstr "Za vilice PR, CI čaka na privilegirane slike, ki jih je zgradil `pull_request_target` dogodek pred nadaljevanjem. Za nezaupne vilice, ki gradijo teče iz varne baze združi ref **brez skrivnosti organizacije** (samo na delo `GITHUB_TOKEN`); vzdrževalec `🛡️ Trusted` nalepka preklopi gradnik na PR glavo, odklene zrcalne poverilnice in preskoči čakanje – glej [Zaupne vilice PR](#trusted-fork-prs-)."

