# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs can now scope the CI matrix: a 🧩 *Subset* label reads a *roles:* block from the PR body and narrows the deploy whitelist. Gives forks the maintainer-only manual dispatch they could not trigger before. Without the label nothing changes. See [the fork-PR pipeline](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md)."
msgstr "Viličasti PR lahko zdaj zajamejo matrico KI: a 🧩 *Podnastavitev* oznaka se glasi a *vloge:* blokirajo telo PR in zožijo belo listo. Daje vilice samo vzdrževalec ročno dispečer niso mogli sprožiti prej. Brez nalepke se nič ne spremeni. Glej. [cevovod vilice-PR](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish mirror packages directly, so their runs wait for the `pull_request_target` mirror producer before continuing. The producer mirrors with the Docker Hub credentials only for trusted PRs ([🛡️ Trusted](#trusted-fork-prs-)); untrusted forks mirror anonymously (no organization secrets). See [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) for the mirroring architecture and naming convention."
msgstr "Vilice PR ne morejo objaviti zrcalnih paketov neposredno, tako da njihovi teče čakati na `pull_request_target` producent ogledal pred nadaljevanjem. Producent zrcali z poverilnicami Docker Hub samo za zaupanja vredne PR ([🛡️ Zaupanje](#trusted-fork-prs-)); nezaupane vilice ogledalo anonimno (brez skrivnosti organizacije). Glej [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) za zrcalno arhitekturo in konvencijo o poimenovanju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish packages themselves, so their untrusted `pull_request` runs wait in `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` until a trusted producer run has published the required refs."
msgstr "Viličasti PR-ji ne morejo sami objavljati paketov, zato jim ne zaupajo `pull_request` Teci. `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` dokler zaupanja vreden potek proizvajalcev ne objavi zahtevanih sodnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs run under the `pull_request` event without write permissions. Privileged steps (image builds, package writes) run via `pull_request_target`. The fork CI waits for those privileged images before proceeding. See [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) for the contributor-facing fork workflow."
msgstr "Vila za stike z javnostmi tečejo pod `pull_request` dogodek brez dovoljenja za pisanje. Privilegirani koraki (slike gradi, paket piše) vodi preko `pull_request_target`. Vilice čakajo na te privilegirane slike. Glej. [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) za potek dela na vilicah, obrnjenih proti prispevanju."

