# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Vilice [rppardini/dokler-register-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) in naučiti paket ginx za ravnanje z GCP Artifact Register preusmeritev URL-jev (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Trenutno `gcr.io` Potegi se zaobidejo. `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` v [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), ki je delo okoli ki onemogoči caching za te registre. Dolgoročno: ponovna baza na toku `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` Pravila za prepoznavo nove oblike preusmeritve. `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (ali njegovo slikovno oznako) na vilicah, in spustite `NO_PROXY` Obvod."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Vilice `pull_request` runs vedno prejeli samo branje žeton (GitHub-forced); Zaznamek nikoli ne podeljuje žetonov ali skrivnosti nezaupanemu dogodku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork main-branch sync: the push entry workflow now synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a working branch. See [the Actions configuration reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Sinhronizacija glavne veje vilic: delovni tok potisnega vnosa zdaj sinhronizira trenutno skladišče *glavni* iz nastavljenega izvornega skladišča (privzeto *infinito-nexus/core*) pred področjem uporabe CI in zagonom odkritja, tako da vilice potiskajo le svoje spremembe proti najnovejši bazi. Vir je prehuda ali nestabilna skozi *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* Spremenljivka skladišča in sinhronizacijski prenosi sile *glavni*, zato se sinhronizirano skladišče ne sme uporabljati kot delovna veja. Glej. [sklic na konfiguracijo dejanj](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork, PR, release, or scheduled paths affected:"
msgstr "Prizadete vilice, PR, sprostitev ali načrtovane poti:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork-PR CI hardening (follow-up to the 11.1.0 trusted-fork flow): the privileged *pull_request_target* image producer and mirror now set *allow-unsafe-pr-checkout* so *actions/checkout* stops refusing the merged fork ref it had begun rejecting. Untrusted fork builds run without organization secrets — they authenticate to GHCR with the per-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* only and mirror Docker Hub anonymously — while the maintainer-trusted path keeps full credentials and builds the raw PR head. The trust switch moved to the *🛡️ Trusted* label. See [the fork-PR pipeline](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) and [the GHCR authentication reference](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."
msgstr "Otrdelost CI za vilice-PR (nadaljnje ukrepanje po 11.1.0 Zaupen pretok vilic): privilegiran *pull_request_target* zdaj nastavljena producentka in zrcalo *dovoljeno-nevarno-pr-odjava* tako *ukrepi/odjava* preneha zavračati združene vilice, ki jih je začel zavračati. Nezaupne vilice gradijo brez skrivnosti organizacije – pristnosti za GHCR na delovnem mestu *GITHUB_TOKEN* samo in zrcali Docker Hub anonimno – medtem ko vzdrževana pot ohranja polno poverilnico in gradi surovo glavo PR. Stikalo za zaupanje se je premaknilo na *🛡️ Zaupanje* nalepka. Glej. [cevovod vilice-PR](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) ter [sklic za avtentikacijo GHCR](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."

