# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "GitHub Actions cannot generate a variable number of jobs, so the chunk blocks are written out in the orchestrator. `INFINITO_CI_MAX_CHUNKS` must equal how many exist there — `slots` plans a sweep against that key, and a sweep planned larger than the chain silently drops its tail. Declare one block more than `available` fills (`ceil(available / chunk size) + 1`): the split receives every declared block, so after a short priority chunk the regular rows still fill the rest of the budget. Blocks whose slice comes back empty skip themselves and cost nothing."
msgstr "Dejanja GitHub ne morejo ustvariti spremenljivega števila delovnih mest, zato so delčki izpisani v orkestratorju. `INFINITO_CI_MAX_CHUNKS` morajo biti enaki, koliko jih obstaja – `slots` Načrtuje pometanje proti temu ključu in načrtno večje od verige tiho spusti rep. En blok več kot `available` polnila (`ceil(available / chunk size) + 1`): delitev prejme vsak prijavljen blok, tako da po kratki prednostni del redne vrstice še vedno izpolni preostanek proračuna. Bloki, katerih rezina se vrne prazna preskočijo sami sebe in ne stanejo ničesar."

