msgid "Identity integration"
msgstr "Povezovanje identitete"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Identity is per provider, never the deployment administrator"
msgstr "Identiteta je na ponudnika, nikoli administrator razporeditve"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Identity providers: separate scope"
msgstr "Ponudniki identitete: ločen obseg"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Identity-based secrets, PKI and encryption manager with OIDC login, group-mapped policies and static-seal auto-unseal"
msgstr "Skrivnosti, ki temeljijo na identiteti, PKI in upravljalnik šifriranja s prijavo OIDC, politikami, ki temeljijo na skupinah, in samodejnim odpiranjem statične zapore"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If CI fails, follow a clean debugging workflow:"
msgstr "Če KI ne uspe, sledite čistemu razhroščevalnemu delovnemu toku:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If IPv6 is active but misconfigured, Docker MAY attempt to pull over IPv6 and fail."
msgstr "Če je IPv6 je aktiven, vendar napačno nastavljen, Docker lahko poskusite ustaviti IPv6 in spodletelo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If `*.infinito.test` does not resolve correctly, check Windows-side [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System) or hosts configuration."
msgstr "Če `*.infinito.test` ne reši pravilno, preverite Windows stran [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System) ali nastavitve gostiteljev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If `false`, the local-form fallback at `/administrator?fallback=local` is disabled (Modus 1 in effect)."
msgstr "Če `false`, lokalne oblike nazaj na `/administrator?fallback=local` je onemogočen (modus 1 v veljavi)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If `make network-trust-ca` fails due to missing root permissions, you MUST use the alternative syntax `curl -k` (or `wget --no-check-certificate`) to skip certificate validation when checking URLs from the command line instead of fixing the trust store."
msgstr "Če `make network-trust-ca` ne uspe zaradi manjkajočih root dovoljenj, morate uporabiti alternativno sintakso `curl -k` (ali `wget --no-check-certificate`) za preskočitev potrditve potrdila pri preverjanju URL-jev iz ukazne vrstice, namesto da bi popravili skrbniško skladišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If `true`, skip TLS verification on outbound calls (for local CA)."
msgstr "Če `true`, preskoči preverjanje TLS na odhodnih klicih (za lokalni CA)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a CI run is still progressing and the user has not asked you to change course, you MUST wait for it to finish before starting triage."
msgstr "Če CI teče še vedno napreduje in uporabnik ni zahteval, da spremenite potek, MORATE počakati, da se konča pred začetkom triaže."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a Keycloak user is not present in OpenLDAP, OpenCloud auto-provisions the user on first login using the `preferred_username` claim. To keep usernames stable across Nextcloud, OpenCloud, and OpenTalk, all three apps share the same `OIDC.CLIENT.REALM` and the same `LDAP.DN.OU.USERS` source."
msgstr "Če je Keycloak uporabnik ni prisoten v OpenLDAP, OpenCloud Samodejno določa uporabnika ob prvi prijavi z uporabo `preferred_username` zahtevek. Za ohranitev stabilnosti uporabniških imen preko Nextcloud, OpenCloudin OpenTalk, vse tri aplikacije delijo enako `OIDC.CLIENT.REALM` in enako `LDAP.DN.OU.USERS` vir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a [Playwright](https://playwright.dev/) job fails, you MUST also download the Playwright assets, store them in `/tmp/`, and analyze them together with the logs."
msgstr "Če je [Playwright](https://playwright.dev/) delo ne uspe, morate prenesti tudi Playwright sredstva, jih shraniti v `/tmp/`, in jih analizirali skupaj z dnevniki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a backup validation fails due to infrastructure problems (for example timeouts or a missing validation tool), the cleanup service exits with a non-zero status. This allows systemd OnFailure handlers or monitoring systems to react accordingly."
msgstr "Če dodatna potrditev zaradi težav z infrastrukturo ne uspe (na primer timeouts ali manjkajoče orodje za potrjevanje), čiščenje storitev izhodov z ničelnim statusom. To omogoča sistemskim upravljalnikom OnFailure ali nadzornim sistemom ustrezno odzivanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a brand-new deployment must pass the `biber` end-to-end scenario on its first run, either:"
msgstr "Če mora povsem nova razporeditev prestati `biber` scenarij od konca do konca prve runde:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a contributor needs to tighten network policy locally (e.g. running on an untrusted network), they SHOULD do so via `.claude/settings.local.json` rather than weakening the project-level defaults that other contributors depend on."
msgstr "Če mora prispevajoči zaostriti lokalno politiko omrežja (npr. tek na nezaupanem omrežju), bi morali storiti preko `.claude/settings.local.json` namesto da bi oslabili neplačila na ravni projekta, od katerih so odvisni drugi akterji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a criterion is ambiguous, you MUST ask the user to clarify before proceeding."
msgstr "Če je merilo dvoumno, morate od uporabnika zahtevati, da pojasni, preden nadaljuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a fully offline or air-gapped setup is required, the role can be extended to use a locally vendored installer script with a pinned checksum."
msgstr "Če je potrebna popolnoma brez povezave ali zračna nastavitev, se lahko vloga razširi na uporabo lokalno prodajanega skripta monterja s pripeto kontrolno vsoto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a local deploy is still progressing and the user has not asked you to change course, you MUST wait for it to finish instead of interrupting it."
msgstr "Če lokalna uporaba še vedno napreduje in vas uporabnik ni prosil, da spremenite smer, MORATE počakati, da se konča, namesto da ga prekinete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a matching issue exists, you MUST add a comment via `gh issue comment <issue-number> --body-file <log-excerpt-file>` that contains the relevant log excerpt and links the full GitHub Actions run URL for every newly observed run."
msgstr "Če obstaja ustrezno vprašanje, MORATE dodati komentar preko `gh issue comment <issue-number> --body-file <log-excerpt-file>` ki vsebuje ustrezen odlomek dnevnika in povezuje celoten URL za zagon dejanj GitHub za vsako novo opaženo vožnjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a new test is created or an existing test has been changed since the last test run, you MUST rerun it after every subsequent action until it passes."
msgstr "Če se ustvari nov preskus ali se od zadnjega preskusa spremeni obstoječi test, ga MORATE ponoviti po vsakem naslednjem dejanju, dokler ne mine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a push to GHCR fails with `denied: denied`:"
msgstr "Če potisk na GHCR ne uspe z `denied: denied`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a reuse target aborts with \"inventory not found\", you MUST add `variant=<idx>` and re-run; do NOT work around the error by re-creating the unsuffixed folder by hand."
msgstr "Če se cilj ponovne uporabe prekine z \"inventarja ni moč najti\", morate dodati `variant=<idx>` in ponovno zažene; NE deluje okoli napake s ponovnim ustvarjanjem nepripojene mape ročno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a role cannot answer those questions, it is probably doing too much."
msgstr "Če neka vloga ne more odgovoriti na ta vprašanja, verjetno dela preveč."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a role uses another service around the application but the addon does not talk to that service directly, the service MUST stay in `meta/services.yml` and MUST NOT be listed in the addon's `bridges:`. Friendica's oauth2-proxy-backed `sso` service is such a front-door auth gate for `ldapauth`."
msgstr "Če vloga uporablja drugo storitev okoli aplikacije, vendar addon ne govori s to storitev neposredno, storitev mora ostati v `meta/services.yml` in NE SME biti naveden v dodatku `bridges:`. Friendica's oauth2-proxy-backed `sso` postrežba je kot vhodna vrata za `ldapauth`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a service can be removed without rewriting the whole stack, the design is usually healthy. If removing one part breaks everything else, the boundaries are probably too weak."
msgstr "Če se storitev lahko odstrani brez ponovnega pisanja celotnega sklada, je oblikovanje običajno zdravo. Če odstranitev enega dela zlomi vse ostalo, so meje verjetno prešibke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a single role defines the same credential key in both a schema definition and a runtime value, the loader MUST stop and surface the collision instead of silently merging."
msgstr "Če ena sama vloga definira isti ključ v definiciji sheme in vrednosti časa delovanja, mora nakladalnik zaustaviti in površiti trk, namesto da se tiho združuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a vaulted key exists → reuse (idempotent, address stability is the contract)."
msgstr "Če obstaja skrit ključ → ponovna uporaba (idempotent, stabilnost naslova je pogodba)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a warning points to an intentional exception, make the exception explicit and keep the follow-up visible."
msgstr "Če opozorilo kaže na namerno izjemo, naj bo izjema izrecna in naj bo vidna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If agent instructions change mid-conversation (AGENTS.md or any file referenced from it), the agent might not reload them automatically. Trigger a reload with:"
msgstr "Če navodila za sredstva spremenijo sredi pogovora (AGENTS.md ali katera koli datoteka, na katero se sklicuje), Agent jih mogoče ne bo napolnil samodejno. Sproži ponovno nalaganje z:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If any `make swarm-*` target aborts at **Set up job** with `mkdirat var/run...` on a recent Docker engine, point act at a fixed runner image per [Workflow Loop](workflow.md#act-fails-at-set-up-job-on-recent-docker)."
msgstr "Če obstaja `make swarm-*` cilj prekine na **Nastavi delo** z `mkdirat var/run...` na nedavnem motorju Docker, točka deluje na sliki s fiksnim tekačem na [Zanka za potek dela](workflow.md#act-fails-at-set-up-job-on-recent-docker)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If any precondition fails, you MUST return to [Compose Loop](compose.md) and re-establish the baseline before continuing."
msgstr "Če kateri koli predpogoj ne uspe, se morate vrniti [Zanka sestavljanja](compose.md) in ponovno vzpostavitev izhodišča pred nadaljevanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If automation logic is not shell-based, it MUST live outside `scripts/` and be called from a `.sh` wrapper when needed."
msgstr "Če logika avtomatizacije ne temelji na lupini, mora živeti zunaj `scripts/` in so poklicani iz `.sh` Ovitek, kadar je potrebno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If container or security setup behaves differently than on Linux, the WSL2 guide covers the usual [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), and [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)-related workarounds."
msgstr "Če se posoda ali varnostna nastavitev obnaša drugače kot na Linuxu, WSL2 vodnik zajema običajno [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), in [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)- v zvezi z delom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If disk space is tight, you SHOULD move Docker data, caches, and your working directory to the SSD."
msgstr "Če je prostor na disku tesen, bi morali premakniti Dockerjeve podatke, predpomnilnike in delovni imenik v SSD."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If inventory_file is provided, also removes the provider role for each service from the inventory (devices.yml)."
msgstr "Če inventory_file je zagotovljena, prav tako odstrani vlogo ponudnika za vsako storitev iz popisa (devices.yml)."

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span lost=['"']
# gained=['"neujemanje"']
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Če so zagotovljeni življenjski ciklusi, samo vloge,
# katerih galaxy_info.lifecycle je vključen v komplet. Manjkajoči življenjski
# cikel se obravnava kot "neujemanje".
msgid "If lifecycles is provided, only roles whose galaxy_info.lifecycle is in the set are included. Missing lifecycle is treated as \"not matching\"."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If mem_limit (container cgroup RAM) is smaller than ``min_mb`` an exception is raised, to prevent Node's heap from exceeding the cgroup and being OOM-killed."
msgstr "Če mem_limit (posoda cgroup RAM) je manjša od ``min_mb`` Izjema je, da se prepreči, da bi vozlov kup presegal skupino in da bi bil ubit OOM."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If multiple roles share the same root cause, you MUST first deploy them together via the `apps=\"<role-a> <role-b>\"` form described in [Compose Loop](../iteration/compose.md), then run the alphabetically first role of the batch individually as the exemplary single-app deploy."
msgstr "Če več vlog deli isti vzrok, jih morate najprej razporediti skupaj preko `apps=\"<role-a> <role-b>\"` oblika, opisana v [Zanka sestavljanja](../iteration/compose.md), nato pa po abecednem redu najprej vlogo serije posamično kot zgled eno-aplikacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If multiple runs across multiple branches share the same external failure, you MUST link all of them in the issue body or comment."
msgstr "Če več teče po več vej deli isto zunanjo napako, morate povezati vse od njih v organu izdaje ali komentar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If needed, also update the local part (username):"
msgstr "Po potrebi posodobite tudi lokalni del (uporabniško ime):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If neither step finds a logout control, the test MUST fail. The role's authenticated surface MUST expose an in-app logout button; navigating to a logout URL as a workaround is forbidden."
msgstr "Če noben korak ne najde kontrole odjave, mora preskus spodleteti. Overovana površina vloge MORA izpostaviti gumb za odjavo v aplikaciji; navigacija na URL za odjavo je prepovedana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no '--' is present: inventory_args = [], deploy_args = all rest."
msgstr "Če ne '--' je prisotna: inventory_args = [], deploy_args = vsi počitek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no ``web-app-mailu`` is present, the role can configure a local Postfix-based SMTP relay via ``sys-svc-mail-smtp``."
msgstr "Če ne ``web-app-mailu`` je prisotna, vloga lahko nastavite lokalni Postfix temelji SMTP rele preko ``sys-svc-mail-smtp``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no `web-app-mailu` is present, the role can configure a local Postfix-based SMTP relay via `sys-svc-mail-smtp`."
msgstr "Če ne `web-app-mailu` je prisotna, vloga lahko nastavite lokalni Postfix temelji SMTP rele preko `sys-svc-mail-smtp`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no match is found or if an error occurs while reading files."
msgstr "Če se med branjem datotek ne najde ujemanja ali če pride do napake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no matching issue exists, you MUST file a new one via `gh issue create --title <title> --body-file <body-file> --label <labels>`. The YAML issue form [bug_report.yml](../../../../.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml) cannot be populated headlessly through `--template`, so `<title>`, `<labels>`, and the section structure inside `<body-file>` MUST mirror exactly what that template prescribes. You MUST place the relevant log excerpt under the section that template dedicates to logs and link the full GitHub Actions run URL for every affected job."
msgstr "Če ni ustreznega vprašanja, MORATE vnesti novega preko `gh issue create --title <title> --body-file <body-file> --label <labels>`. Obrazec za izdajo YAML [bug_report.yml](../../../../.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml) ni mogoče brezglavo poseliti skozi `--template`, torej `<title>`, `<labels>`, in strukturo preseka znotraj `<body-file>` MORAJO zrcaliti točno to, kar ta predloga predpisuje. Ustrezni odlomek iz dnevnika morate postaviti v razdelek, ki je namenjen dnevnikom in povezati celotno GitHub dejanje zagnati URL za vsako prizadeto opravilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If security impact is present, explain:"
msgstr "Če je vpliv varnosti prisoten, pojasnite:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If similar logic exists elsewhere in the project, you SHOULD refactor it toward a shared implementation."
msgstr "Če v projektu obstaja podobna logika, bi jo morali spremeniti v skupno izvajanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If systemd is configured but not yet active, prints instructions to restart WSL2"
msgstr "Če je sistemd nastavljen, vendar še ni aktiven, natisni navodila za ponovni zagon WSL2"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If systemd is not configured at all, appends the `[boot]` section to `/etc/wsl.conf` and triggers `wsl --shutdown` to apply the change"
msgstr "Če sistemd sploh ni nastavljen, doda `[boot]` poglavje do `/etc/wsl.conf` in sprožilci `wsl --shutdown` za uporabo spremembe"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If that validation fails, you MUST run `make clean` and rerun it."
msgstr "Če ta potrditev ne uspe, MORATE zagnati `make clean` in ponovi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the **compose** step failed, switch to the [Compose Loop](compose.md): reproduce with `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=<app>`, inspect via `make compose-exec` / `make compose-inner-run`, apply the real fix in the repository, then re-run the roundtrip."
msgstr "Če **compose** korak ni uspel, prehod na [Zanka sestavljanja](compose.md): razmnoževanje z `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=<app>`, pregled preko `make compose-exec` / `make compose-inner-run`, uporabite pravo fiks v skladišču, nato ponovno teči povratno vožnjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the **swarm** step failed, the cluster is left up (fail-fast skips the release). Inspect it with `make swarm-exec node=<app>-swarm-mgr-01 cmd='...'` or `make swarm-shell name=<app>` per the [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), confirm the fix on the live cluster, then re-run. Release it manually with `make swarm-down name=<app>` when done."
msgstr "Če **roj** korak ni uspel, grozd je levo navzgor (neuspešno preskoči izpust). Preglejte z `make swarm-exec node=<app>-swarm-mgr-01 cmd='...'` ali `make swarm-shell name=<app>` na [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), potrdite fiks na živo kopico, nato ponovno teči. Spusti ga ročno z `make swarm-down name=<app>` ko končaš."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the app explicitly disables a token on the *base* (e.g. style-src.unsafe-inline: false), that token is removed from the merged base even if present in elem/attr."
msgstr "Če aplikacija izrecno onemogoči žeton na *osnova* (Npr. style-src.unsafe-Inline: lažno), da se žeton odstrani iz združene baze tudi, če je prisoten v elem/attr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the application's primary background is dark or black, you MUST use `--color-01-00` as the default theme color. If it is light or white, you MUST use `--color-01-99`. All other application colors MUST be mapped to one of these two anchors. Colors from categories `02`–`09` MUST be derived from and kept in visual relation to the chosen anchor."
msgstr "Če je osnovno ozadje programa temno ali črno, MORATE uporabiti `--color-01-00` kot privzeta barva teme. Če je svetlo ali belo, MORATE uporabiti `--color-01-99`. Vse druge barve programov MORAJO biti kartirane na eno od teh dveh sider. Barve iz kategorij `02`–`09` MORA biti v vidnem odnosu z izbranim sidrom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change adds or removes a repository variable, also update [configuration.md](configuration.md)."
msgstr "Če sprememba doda ali odstrani spremenljivko skladišča, tudi posodobi [configuration.md](configuration.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects **more than one role**, you MUST ask the user before proceeding:"
msgstr "Če sprememba vpliva na **več kot ena vloga**, morate vprašati uporabnika pred nadaljevanjem:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects an Ansible role, you MUST refactor and optimize the **entire role**, not only the files that were directly modified."
msgstr "Če sprememba vpliva na Ansible vlogo, MORATE refaktor in optimizirati **celotna vloga**, ne samo datoteke, ki so bile neposredno spremenjene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects the CI flow (stages, gates, order), also update [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."
msgstr "Če sprememba vpliva na tok CI (faze, vrata, red), tudi posodobitev [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects user-visible behavior, you MUST add or update the matching end-to-end coverage in [Role `playwright.spec.js`](playwright.spec.js.md)."
msgstr "Če sprememba vpliva na obnašanje uporabnika, morate dodati ali posodobiti ujemanje pokritost od konca do konca v [Vloga `playwright.spec.js`](playwright.spec.js.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the code is easy to explain, it is likely a good idea."
msgstr "Če je kodo enostavno razložiti, je verjetno dobra ideja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the code is hard to explain, rework it before merging."
msgstr "Če je kodo težko razložiti, jo ponovno obdelajte pred združitvijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the current branch is `main` or `master`, before any debug iteration begins you MUST file a tracking issue for every observed failure using the [External Failures](#external-failures) procedure (search first, comment if matched, otherwise create new). For branch-caused failures, the resulting issue number MUST be used as `<ticket-id>` when creating the working branch with the `fix/` prefix per [branch.md](../../../contributing/artefact/git/branch.md). All iteration work, commits, and the push at the end MUST happen on that fix branch."
msgstr "Če je trenutna veja `main` ali `master`, preden se začne katera koli ponovitev razhroščevanja morate vložiti vprašanje sledenje za vsako opaženo napako z uporabo [Zunanji neuspehi](#external-failures) postopek (iskanje najprej, komentar, če se ujema, drugače ustvarite novo). Za napake, ki jih povzroči podružnica, je treba posledično številko izdaje uporabiti kot `<ticket-id>` pri ustvarjanju delovne veje z `fix/` predpona na [branch.md](../../../contributing/artefact/git/branch.md). Vse iteracije delo, obveze, in potisk na koncu MORA zgoditi na tej fiksni veji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the failure needs a change **outside** `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` (role tasks, templates, vars, config, `javascript.js`, `style.css`, or any other role asset the deploy materializes), go to [Escape](#escape)."
msgstr "Če napaka potrebuje spremembo **zunaj** `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` (naloge vlog, predloge, vars, config, `javascript.js`, `style.css`, ali katero koli drugo sredstvo, ki se uporablja uresniči), pojdi na [Pobeg](#escape)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the failure says `service \"infinito\" is not running`, restart the stack with [Development Environment Setup](../../contributing/environment/setup.md) and retry the validation."
msgstr "Če napaka pove... `service \"infinito\" is not running`, ponovno zaženite kup z [Nastavitve razvojnega okolja](../../contributing/environment/setup.md) in ponovno preizkusite potrditev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the host is **not** running Mailu, it:"
msgstr "Če je gostitelj **ni** teče Mailu, da:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the host is part of the ``web-app-mailu`` group, it:"
msgstr "Če je gostitelj del ``web-app-mailu`` skupina:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the host is part of the `web-app-mailu` group, it:"
msgstr "Če je gostitelj del `web-app-mailu` skupina:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the last test run for a test failed, you MUST rerun it after every change until it succeeds."
msgstr "Če zadnji test za preizkus ni uspel, ga morate po vsaki spremembi ponoviti, dokler ne uspe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
