# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inline `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` MUST NOT be used: it scatters the path shape across dozens of files and makes future layout changes partial. Centralising the path in the plugin guarantees that a layout evolution stays a one-file change."
msgstr "Vstavljeno `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` NE UPORABLJAJTE: razprši obliko poti na desetine datotek in naredi prihodnje spremembe razporeda delne. Centralizacija poti v plugin zagotavlja, da postavitev evolucija ostane eno datoteko spremembo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
