# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inlined keys observed today (non-exhaustive): `plugins`, `plugins_enabled`, `email`, `ldap`, `accounts`, `scopes`, `alerting`, `languages`, `company`, `default_quota`, `legacy_login_mask`, `site_name`, `token`, `modules`, `network`, `performance`, `preload_models`, `provision`, `features`."
msgstr "Vstavljene tipke, opažene danes (Neizčrpen): `plugins`, `plugins_enabled`, `email`, `ldap`, `accounts`, `scopes`, `alerting`, `languages`, `company`, `default_quota`, `legacy_login_mask`, `site_name`, `token`, `modules`, `network`, `performance`, `preload_models`, `provision`, `features`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Input (env): ``APP_ID``. Optional ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (JSON ``{app_id: variant_index}``, set per round by the matrix orchestrator) selects the active variant so a variant that pins ``services.*`` flags to ``false`` prunes those providers from the closure instead of the provision step pulling them in from the variant-free base config. In-process callers that already hold the round map pass it as ``derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)``; the env var is read only when that argument is omitted."
msgstr "Vhod (env): ``APP_ID``. Neobvezno ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (JSON ``{app_id: variant_index}``, ki ga določi matrični orkestrator) izbere aktivno varianto tako, da zatiči ``services.*`` zastave za ``false`` obrezuje tiste dobavitelje iz zaprtja, namesto da bi jih umaknili iz osnovnega konfigata brez variant. V postopku klicatelji, ki že imajo okroglo karto mimo nje kot ``derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)``; env var se bere samo, če je ta argument izpuščen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Input name -> the literal its marker segment renders when set."
msgstr "Vhodno ime -> dobesedni njen označevalni segment izrisuje, ko je nastavljen."

