# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for Ansible-native artefacts: action plugins, filter plugins, lookup plugins, handlers, group_vars, inventory, Jinja templates, playbooks, and role-local [`vars/`](vars/) / `defaults/`."
msgstr "Integracija testi za Ansible-native artefacts: action plugins, filter plugins, iskanje plugins, upravljalniki, group_vars, popis, predloge Jinja, igralne knjige, in vloge-lokalne [`vars/`](vars/) / `defaults/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for `.github/workflows/*.yml` and supporting scripts: PR scope/branch-prefix resolvers, PR-run cancellation, Dependabot coverage of every ecosystem in the repo, and CodeQL security-workflow coverage."
msgstr "Preskusi vključevanja za `.github/workflows/*.yml` in podporne skripte: PR obseg/razreševalci predpono, PR-run preklic, Dependenabot pokritost vsakega ekosistema v repo, in CodeQL varnostno-delovno pokritost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for `.j2` templates across the repository: syntax validity, include-path resolution, and consistent variable definition and usage."
msgstr "Preskusi vključevanja za `.j2` predloge po vsem repozitoriju: veljavnost sintakse, vključno z ločljivostjo in dosledno spremenljivo opredelitvijo in uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for `utils/manager/inventory/InventoryManager` and related inventory-schema machinery: transitive provider-role resolution, schema apply, vault scalar round-trip."
msgstr "Preskusi vključevanja za `utils/manager/inventory/InventoryManager` in s tem povezani stroji za inventar-shema: prehodna resolucija ponudnika-role, shema velja, shramba skalarna okrogla pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for block-level `when:` hygiene across `roles/*/tasks/**`: max-three-task guard blocks, no duplicated when-conditions across tasks, and the pure-guarded-include pattern for role inclusion."
msgstr "Preskusi vključevanja za raven bloka `when:` higiena `roles/*/tasks/**`: max-tritaktni varovalni bloki, brez podvojenih pogojev med nalogami in popolnoma varovan vzorec za vključitev vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for cross-cutting metadata that describes the project itself: role categories, CLI entrypoints, domain declarations, and GitHub-side CI/CD artefacts (workflows, Dependabot)."
msgstr "Integracijski testi za medsektorske metapodatke, ki opisujejo sam projekt: kategorije vlog, vnosne točke CLI, izjave domen in artefakti CI/CD z GitHuba (delovni tokovi, Dependabot)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for cross-role variable and defaults hygiene: `TOP_LEVEL_CONSTANT` uniqueness across `roles/*/vars/**`, `roles/*/defaults/**`, and `group_vars/**`; and the prohibition against overriding Ansible facts via `vars:` or `set_fact:`."
msgstr "Integracijski testi za higieno navzkrižnih rol: `TOP_LEVEL_CONSTANT` edinstvenost čez `roles/*/vars/**`, `roles/*/defaults/**`, in `group_vars/**`; in prepoved prevladujočih nespornih dejstev prek `vars:` ali `set_fact:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for custom Jinja filter plugins under `plugins/filter/` and `roles/*/filter_plugins/`: every filter referenced in templates MUST be defined, and filters MUST behave correctly end-to-end (e.g. `strong_password`, `dotenv_quote`)."
msgstr "Integracijski testi za vstavke Jinja filter po meri `plugins/filter/` ter `roles/*/filter_plugins/`: vsak filter, naveden v predlogah, MORA biti opredeljen, filtri pa se obnašajo pravilno od konca do konca (Npr. `strong_password`, `dotenv_quote`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for identity and access surfaces: OAuth2 / OIDC configuration invariants (mutual exclusion, ACL shape, proxy port allocation, RBAC group-path declarations) and password / secret quoting rules."
msgstr "Integracijski testi za identiteto in dostopne površine: OAuth2 / Nastavitve OIDC invarianta (vzajemna izključenost, oblika ACL, dodelitev posredniških vrat, izjave RBAC skupinske poti) in geslo / skrivna pravila citiranja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for playbook-level wiring: `tasks/stages/**`, invokable-path coverage, and the dispatch between them."
msgstr "Preskusi integracije ožičenja na ravni igralne knjige: `tasks/stages/**`, brezvokable-pot pokritost, in pošiljanje med njimi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the `cli/` package: subcommand discovery and `--help` smoke tests for every invokable CLI entrypoint."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja za `cli/` paket: podpoveljniško odkritje in `--help` testiranje dima za vsako vstopno točko CLI, ki jo je mogoče priklicati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the `run_once_<role_name>` fact pattern: flag suffixes MUST match their role folder name, flags MUST be defined before use, and inclusion of `utils/once/flag.yml` MUST follow the schema."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja za `run_once_<role_name>` vzorec dejstev: pripone za zastave MORAJO ustrezati imenu njihove mape z vlogami, zastave MORAJO biti opredeljene pred uporabo in vključitev `utils/once/flag.yml` MORATE slediti shemi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the custom Ansible lookup plugins under `plugins/lookup/`: config-path validation against role schemas and runtime caching performance."
msgstr "Integracijski testi za vstavke Ansible lookup po meri `plugins/lookup/`: validacija konfig-pat proti shemam vlog in uspešnosti kaženja med potekom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the deployment substrate that every role shares: Docker Compose templates, Docker image consistency, container networks, the shared service registry, and the backups contract."
msgstr "Integracijski testi za podlago za uvajanje, ki ima vse skupne vloge: predloge Docker Compound, skladnost slike Docker, omrežja zabojnikov, skupni register storitev in pogodba o varnostnih kopijah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce contracts between tasks and handlers. One file per contract, no second opinion on the same rule:"
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki izvajajo pogodbe med nalogami in obdelovalci. En spis po pogodbi, brez drugega mnenja o istem pravilu:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce every `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target referenced from role tasks (and other project YAML) resolves to an existing file."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` cilj, naveden na podlagi nalog vloge (in drug projekt YAML) reši obstoječo datoteko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of `galaxy_info.run_after` in each role's `meta/main.yml`: every referenced name MUST resolve to an existing role directory, no role MUST list itself in `run_after`, and the resulting ordering graph MUST be acyclic."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo invariante `galaxy_info.run_after` v vsaki vlogi `meta/main.yml`: vsako referenčno ime SE MORA odločiti za obstoječo mapo vlog, nobena vloga SE NE MORA vpisati v `run_after`, in iz tega izhajajoči graf naročil mora biti acikličen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/main.yml`: the file MUST exist for every role under `roles/`, and `galaxy_info` MUST carry the fields the Sphinx generator expects (non-empty `description`, no `None` values)."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo spremenljivke vsake vloge `meta/main.yml`: datoteka MORA obstajati za vsako vlogo pod `roles/`, in `galaxy_info` MORAJO nositi polja pričakuje Sfinga generator (neprazno `description`, ne `None` vrednosti)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/services.yml`: the dynamic-flag form (`\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`) MUST be used wherever a service entry depends on a sibling role's deployment, and a role's `services.yml` MUST NOT reference itself as a sibling provider."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo spremenljivke vsake vloge `meta/services.yml`: dinamična plast (`\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`) SE MORAJO uporabljati povsod, kjer je vstop v službo odvisen od uporabe vloge brata ali sestre in vloge `services.yml` NE SME se navajati kot ponudnik bratov in sester."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/variants.yml`: the matrix-deploy variant list MUST exercise every dynamic flag declared in the role's `meta/services.yml` on both polarities, every service key referenced under `services:` in a variant MUST exist in `services.yml`, and the auth matrix (`oidc` / `oauth2` / `ldap`) MUST cover the LDAP-only branch."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo spremenljivke vsake vloge `meta/variants.yml`: seznam variant matrične sestave MORA izvajati vsako dinamično zastavo, navedeno v vlogi `meta/services.yml` na obeh polaritetah, vsak servisni ključ naveden pod `services:` v različici MORA obstajati v `services.yml`, in matrika avte (`oidc` / `oauth2` / `ldap`) MORAJO pokrivati samo podružnico LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of repository declarations in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: every `git clone`-style URL referenced from a role MUST be declared as an entity with a `repository:` key, and any entity that declares `repository:` MUST also pin a `ref:`."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo invariante deklaracij repozitorija v `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: vsak `git clone`-style URL, naveden iz vloge MORA biti deklariran kot subjekt z `repository:` ključ in vsak subjekt, ki prijavi `repository:` MORATE tudi pripeti `ref:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the `server:` block in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Content-Security-Policy structure (whitelist / flags / hashes), supported directives, valid URL / Jinja / wildcard entries."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo invariante `server:` blok v `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Struktura vsebine-varnost-politika (beli seznam / zastave / hashes), podprte direktive, veljaven URL / Jinja / Wildcard vnosi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the prometheus integration: every web-app/svc role declares the shared `prometheus` service entry, the prometheus role's own nginx + docker-health wiring is intact, and the native-metrics scrape contract (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` ⇔ `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) holds across the roles tree."
msgstr "Preizkusi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo spremenljivke integracije prometheus: vsaka spletna aplikacija/svc vloga razglasi skupno `prometheus` Vstop v službo, vloga prometheus je nginx + docker-zdravje ožičenje je nedotaknjena, in avtohtono-metrija praska pogodba (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) drži čez drevo vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the role dependency graph expressed via `meta/main.yml`: declared `dependencies:` targets MUST exist, the `dependencies:` graph MUST be acyclic, and meta dependencies MUST NOT be declared when a guarded `include_role` / `import_role` would suffice."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo spremenljivke grafa odvisnosti od vloge, izraženega z `meta/main.yml`: prijavljeno `dependencies:` cilji morajo obstajati, `dependencies:` Graf MORA biti acikličen, meta odvisnosti pa NE smejo biti prijavljene, ko je varovan `include_role` / `import_role` bi bilo dovolj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce per-role invariants of the unified ``services.sso`` block across roles, including normalization of ``allowed_groups`` paths and allocation of per-consumer SSO-proxy ports."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo invariante poenotenih ``services.sso`` blokiranje različnih vlog, vključno z normalizacijo ``allowed_groups`` poti in dodelitev pristanišč SSO-proxy na potrošnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce role naming conventions: folder names match the declared category prefix (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`, …), and roles do not collide on canonical identifiers."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo konvencije o poimenovanju vlog: imena map se ujemajo z deklarirano predpono kategorije (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`, ...), in vloge ne trčijo na kanonične identifikatorje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce rules about roles which represent deployable applications: `web-app-*` roles MUST ship a `README.md` (required for the Web App Dashboard), every literal name compared against `group_names` in playbooks/roles MUST resolve to a real `application_id`, every `applications['…']` / `applications.get('…')` / `applications.name` / `get_domain('…')` reference MUST name an existing application, and roles MUST NOT reach into `applications[...]` by subscript; they MUST use `lookup('applications', …)` or `utils.roles.applications.config.get` instead."
msgstr "Preskusi vključevanja, ki izvajajo pravila o vlogah, ki predstavljajo vloge, ki jih je mogoče razporediti: `web-app-*` Vloge MORAJO `README.md` (zahteva za spletno aplikacijo Dashboard), vsako dobesedno ime v primerjavi z `group_names` v igralnih knjigah/ rolah SE MORAJO odločiti za resnično `application_id`, vsak `applications['…']` / `applications.get('…')` / `applications.name` / `get_domain('…')` referenca MORA imenovati obstoječo aplikacijo in vloge ne smejo segati v `applications[...]` s podpisom; MORAJO uporabljati `lookup('applications', …)` ali `utils.roles.applications.config.get` Namesto tega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce safe handling of secrets across roles: env-file values MUST be quoted, shell tasks MUST quote password expansions, and password *definitions* MUST NOT apply the `quote` filter (which corrupts the stored value)."
msgstr "Integracijski testi, ki uveljavljajo varno ravnanje s skrivnostmi v različnih vlogah: env-file vrednosti MORAJO biti navedene, lupinske naloge MORAJO navajati razširitve gesel in geslo *opredelitev pojmov* NE SME uporabiti `quote` filter (ki kvari shranjeno vrednost)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce structural invariants of every role under `roles/`: folder-name conventions and `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo strukturne invariante vsake vloge pod `roles/`: konvencije o imenih map in `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` Ciljni obstoj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` and the roles that require a container network: subnets MUST be valid, unique, and non-overlapping, network names MUST map to an `application_id`, and every role that ships a `compose.yml.j2` with an `application_id` MUST have a network entry under `defaults_networks.local`."
msgstr "Preizkusi vključevanja, ki izvršujejo pogodbo med `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` in vloge, ki zahtevajo omrežje zabojnikov: podmrežje MORA biti veljavno, edinstveno, in ne-prekrivanje, imena omrežja MORAjo zemljevid na `application_id`, in vsako vlogo, ki ladja `compose.yml.j2` z `application_id` MORAJO imeti vnos omrežja pod `defaults_networks.local`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between a role's `services[*].backups.*` configuration and the backup infrastructure (enabled flag, `no_stop_required`, image consistency)."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo pogodbo med vlogo `services[*].backups.*` konfiguracija in rezervna infrastruktura (omogočena zastava, `no_stop_required`, skladnost slike)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between a role's folder name, its `application_id` in `vars/main.yml`, and the invokability classification from `plugins/filter/invokable_paths.py`."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo pogodbo med imenom mape vloge, njenim imenom `application_id` v `vars/main.yml`, in nedvoumno razvrstitev iz `plugins/filter/invokable_paths.py`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the dashboard-tile scope rule: only `web-app-*` roles may declare `dashboard.{enabled,shared}` truthy; non-`web-app-*` roles MUST drop the entry or ship a static `dashboard: { enabled: false, shared: false }`."
msgstr "Preskusi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo pravilo o obsegu armaturne plošče: samo `web-app-*` vloge lahko prijavijo `dashboard.{enabled,shared}` Resnični; ne-`web-app-*` Vloge MORAJO spustiti vstop ali ladjo statika `dashboard: { enabled: false, shared: false }`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the shape and uniqueness of `domains.{canonical,aliases}` across all roles and validate that `get_domain()` references point to real `application_id`s."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki uveljavljajo obliko in edinstvenost `domains.{canonical,aliases}` v vseh vlogah in potrdite, da `get_domain()` Sklici na resnično `application_id`s. s."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that exercise custom Ansible action plugins end-to-end through real playbook runs (e.g. retry behavior of `uri` / `get_url` wrappers)."
msgstr "Integracijski testi, ki izvajajo po meri Ansible action plugins end-to-end skozi prave igre knjige teče (npr. ponovno preizkusite vedenje `uri` / `get_url` ovitki)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that pin the `meta/services.yml` ↔ `templates/playwright.env.j2` ↔ `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parity contract: every enabled service surfaces as `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=`, every env line is consumed by a gating helper in the spec, and `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` / `# nocheck: playwright-service-gate` are the only suppressions."
msgstr "Integracija preskusi, ki pripenjajo `meta/services.yml` ↔ `templates/playwright.env.j2` ↔ `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` pogodba o pariteti: vsaka omogočena servisna površina `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=`, vsako env linijo porabi gating pomočnik v spektru, in `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` / `# nocheck: playwright-service-gate` so edina zatiranja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that pin the static contracts around the RBAC group-path layer shared by every OIDC-enabled role."
msgstr "Integracijski testi, ki povezujejo statične pogodbe okoli RBAC skupinske poti, ki jo deli vsaka OIDC-omogočena vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that statically validate every `lookup('config', application_id, …)` (and quoted-app variants) found in role YAML and Jinja templates against the role's effective configuration."
msgstr "Integracija preskusi, ki statično potrdi vsako `lookup('config', application_id, …)` (in variante kotirane aplikacije) našli v vlogi YAML in Jinja predloge proti učinkoviti konfiguraciji vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that validate Docker Compose templates across roles: every service MUST declare an `image`, templates MUST NOT call raw `docker` commands, and `build:` blocks MUST still carry an image reference."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki potrjujejo Docker Compose predloge med vlogami: vsaka storitev MORA razglasiti `image`, predloge NE smejo klicati surove `docker` ukazi in `build:` Bloki MORAjo še vedno imeti referenco slike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that validate Docker-level contracts for role services: compose template includes, declared service keys, and image/version validity."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki potrjujejo pogodbe na ravni Dockerja za storitve vlog: predloga za sestavljanje vključuje, prijavljene storitvene tipke in veljavnost slike/verzije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that validate `meta/categories.yml`: every declared category path MUST correspond to an existing directory under `roles/`, `invokable: true` MUST NOT appear on any descendant of an already-invokable ancestor, and every category MUST declare a `hanzi` label that is unique among its siblings."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki potrjujejo `meta/categories.yml`: vsaka prijavljena pot kategorije MORA ustrezati obstoječi mapi pod `roles/`, `invokable: true` NE SME se pojaviti na nobenem potomcu že nezaslišanega prednika in vsaka kategorija mora razglasiti `hanzi` nalepka, ki je edinstvena med svojimi brati in sestrami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that validate the contents of `group_vars/all/*.yml`: no Jinja recursion cycles, consistent user/application cross-references, and internal schema rules."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki potrjujejo vsebino `group_vars/all/*.yml`: ni Jinja rekurzijskih ciklov, dosledno uporabnik / aplikacija navzkrižne reference, in notranja pravila sheme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that validate the service registry discovered from `roles/*/config/main.yml`: canonical aliases are consistent, every service key resolves via `plugins/lookup/service.py`, `sys-svc-*` roles carry a `system_service_id` matching their folder, and transitive dependencies (e.g. dashboard → mailu) are declared correctly."
msgstr "Testi vključevanja, ki potrjujejo register storitev, odkrit iz `roles/*/config/main.yml`: kanonični vzdevki so dosledni, vsaka storitev ključ razreši preko `plugins/lookup/service.py`, `sys-svc-*` Vloge nosijo `system_service_id` ujemanje njihove mape in prehodnih odvisnosti (npr. armaturna plošča → mailu) so pravilno deklarirane."

