msgid "Leave `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` and `INCLUDE_PATHS` unset to cancel every matching run, as the lifecycle events do — a closed PR and a deleted branch have no run left that deserves to survive. A fallback also mirrors whatever gates its group: `global-ci-*` cancels on every ref except `main`, so the push job carries the same `github.ref_name != 'main'` guard, while `pr-ci-*` is declared `cancel-in-progress: true` unconditionally, so the pull request job is ungated too."
msgstr "Zapusti `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` ter `INCLUDE_PATHS` nenastavljeno za preklic vsakega ujemanja, kot to počnejo dogodki v življenjskem ciklu – zaprta PR in izbrisana veja nimata več teka, ki bi si zaslužil preživetje. Zaledje tudi zrcali vse izhode svoje skupine: `global-ci-*` prekliče na vsakem sodniku razen `main`, tako da push delo nosi enako `github.ref_name != 'main'` stražar, medtem ko `pr-ci-*` je deklariran `cancel-in-progress: true` Brezpogojno, zato je tudi služba za vleko razvezana."

