# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Neither correction works alone, which is why both ship. Declaring 8192 while still estimating 5461 leaves the model eligible; estimating 8192 while still declaring 16384 does the same. Together the demand becomes 8192 plus the 16 output tokens, which exceeds the honest window and excludes the route. The constant is therefore `services.litellm.router_min_chars_per_token`, named as a floor rather than an average, and it is rendered into both the hook and the probe so the two cannot drift."
msgstr "Noben popravek ne deluje sam, zato sta obe ladji. Razglasitev 8192 med še vedno ocenjevanjem 5461 model ostane upravičen; ocenjevanje 8192 med še vedno razglaša 16384 Enako. Skupaj povpraševanje postane 8192 in 16 izhodni žetoni, ki presegajo pošteno okno in izključuje pot. Zato je konstanta `services.litellm.router_min_chars_per_token`, ki se imenuje kot tla in ne povprečje, in je prevedena tako v kavelj in sondo tako, da dva ne more plavati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Neither lane alone closes a question. CI says whether a row comes up green on a clean host but hands you a log hours later. The local stack answers in minutes and lets you exec into the container, but it is one host with one slot and it never proves the swarm path the way five distros do."
msgstr "Noben pas sam ne zapre vprašanja. CI pravi, ali je vrsta zelena na čistem gostitelju, vendar vam da dnevnik ure kasneje. Lokalni sklad odgovarja v minutah in vam omogoča eksec v zabojnik, vendar je en gostitelj z eno režo in nikoli ne dokazuje roja pot, kot pet distros storiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Neither side wins by default. Decide per hunk:"
msgstr "Nobena stran ne zmaga privzeto. Odloči se na vrh:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Neither strategy is chosen by hand. `services.litellm.router_strategy` derives from `services.jeff.enabled`: with the System One service deployed the gateway asks it, and without it there is nothing to ask, so the gateway falls to the strategy it can compute itself. Reading the service flag rather than `group_names` keeps one path from the deployment to the behaviour."
msgstr "Nobena strategija ni izbrana ročno. `services.litellm.router_strategy` izvira iz `services.jeff.enabled`: z System One storitev razporejena vrata sprašuje, in brez nje ni ničesar vprašati, tako da prehod spada na strategijo, ki se lahko izračuna. Branje zastavice storitve namesto `group_names` ohranja eno pot od razporeditve do vedenja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Nested keys are walked transparently (e.g. `credentials.recaptcha.{key,secret}`)."
msgstr "Nested ključi so hodi pregledno (Npr. `credentials.recaptcha.{key,secret}`)."

