msgid "Network or DNS failures during a local deploy count as concrete evidence that the host stack is broken. In that case, the next retry MUST be `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<roles> full_cycle=true`."
msgstr "Network ali DNS napake med lokalno uporabo štejejo kot konkreten dokaz, da je sklad gostitelja pokvarjen. V tem primeru mora biti naslednja ponovitev `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<roles> full_cycle=true`."

