msgstr "Nikoli uporabljena"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never deployed: `lifecycle: pre-alpha`. The admission checks and the device binding are covered by static analysis and a compose-mode matrix round, but no run has attached real hardware, so the passthrough is proven only against a placeholder device."
msgstr "Nikoli uporabljena: `lifecycle: pre-alpha`. Pregledi vstopa in vezava naprave so zajeti s statično analizo in matrico komponiranja, vendar noben potek ni pritrjen na pravo strojno opremo, tako da je prehod dokazan le z napravo za okovje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never snapshot; always use the live two-pass copy."
msgstr "Nikoli posnetek; vedno uporabite živo dvopasovno kopijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never start while a sweep, deploy, or gate is reading the working tree — a merge swaps files under it and has already destroyed a running roundtrip once. Stop the run first or wait for it. Untracked leftovers from an aborted merge block the next attempt: verify each against `git ls-tree -r --name-only FETCH_HEAD` before deleting, then delete them, and do not start a second in-sandbox attempt that recreates them."
msgstr "Nikoli ne začnite, medtem ko nekdo odčitava, razporedi ali odčitava delovno drevo – pod njim združite datoteke o menjavi in enkrat že uničite rundo. Najprej ustavi tek ali pa počakaj. Nesledni ostanki iz prekinjene združitve blokirajo naslednji poskus: preverite vsak proti `git ls-tree -r --name-only FETCH_HEAD` preden jih izbrišete, jih izbrišete in ne začnite še enega poskusa, ki bi jih poustvaril."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never touch this service"
msgstr "Nikoli se ne dotikajte te storitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never, and only together with the username."
msgstr "Nikoli in samo skupaj z uporabniškim imenom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never."
msgstr "Nikoli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never. Both workflows declare the secret `required: false` and gate the login step on both values being non-empty."
msgstr "Nikoli. Oba poteka dela razglašata skrivnost `required: false` in vrata prijavni korak na obeh vrednosti, ki niso prazne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never. Unset leaves the route unpublished."
msgstr "Nikoli. Nenastavljena zapusti pot neobjavljena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New *unit_name* lookup plugin for consistent versioned systemd unit generation"
msgstr "Novo *unit_name* Iskalni vstavek za skladno sistemsko ustvarjanje enot"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New *web-app-n8n* role: n8n workflow automation (Community Edition). SSO is wired through a trusted-header edge hook that is copied and mounted only when SSO is enabled (native SSO is enterprise-only in CE), LDAP sign-in is supported, and per-scenario Playwright coverage exercises the CE edge-SSO model. Ships at lifecycle *alpha*; subnet and port collisions with the new *web-app-semaphore* role were resolved on the way in. See the [web-app-n8n README](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."
msgstr "Novo *web-app-n8n* vloga: n8n avtomatizacija delovnega toka (Izdaja Skupnosti). SSO je ožičen s pomočjo zaupanja vredno-glavni rob kavelj, ki se kopira in montira le, ko je omogočen SSO (domači SSO je podjetje-samo v CE), LDAP prijavo podpira, in na scenarij Playwright pokritost izvaja model CE Edge-SSO. Ladje v življenjskem ciklu *alfa*; podnetni in pristaniški trki z novim *web-app-semaphore* Vloga je bila rešena na poti noter. Glejte [web-app-n8n README](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Apps"
msgstr "Nove aplikacije"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New ERPNext role that ships the upstream Frappe Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task names at 120 characters."
msgstr "Novo ERPNext vloga, da ladje gornji Frappe Okvir v15 kup kot a web-app-erpnext vloga – hrbtenica, frontend, websocket, urniker in dva delavca v vrsti – povezana v osrednji Keycloak z vgrajenim Keycloak Ključ družbene prijave in v osrednji OpenLDAP preko dokumenta Nastavitve LDAP. Matriks s tremi spremenljivkami (SSO in LDAP, brez auth, LDAP samo) se izvajajo od konca do konca in po repo kape Ansible imena opravil na 120 like."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Jitsi Meet role that adds an oauth2-proxy gated meeting surface plus matching LDAP-variant Playwright coverage. The spec layout is reorganised into a shared module and per-scenario test files so future scenarios can be added without touching the monolith."
msgstr "Novo Jitsi Meet vloga, ki dodaja oauth2-Površina sejnega prostora in enak LDAP-variant Playwright. Specifična postavitev se reorganizira v skupni modul in testne datoteke po scenarijih, tako da se prihodnji scenariji lahko dodajo brez dotikanja monolita."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New OUs SHOULD NOT be invented. Place users under `OU.USERS`, RBAC roles under `OU.ROLES`, and organizational groups under `OU.GROUPS`."
msgstr "Nove OU ne bi smeli izumiti. Dodaj uporabnike pod `OU.USERS`, vloge RBAC v `OU.ROLES`, in organizacijske skupine v `OU.GROUPS`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Penpot role (web-app-penpot, requirement 235) that ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend, exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds, and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login, logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range."
msgstr "Novo Penpot vloga (web-app-penpotzahteva 235) da ladje v toku Penpot projektna platforma, ki obsega sprednji del, zadnji del, izvoznika in Redis pri različici slike 2.5.4, vezana na osrednji del Keycloak preko OIDC in v osrednji OpenLDAP. Native lokalno-geslo prijava je na voljo kot toggle, ki je samodejno onemogočen pod OIDC, z avtohtono-login in registracijske zastave, ki izhajajo iz zastave SSO. Po meri JVM truststore uvozi Infinito samopodpisan CA, tako da OIDC nad TLS uspe, vloga pa se izvaja od konca do konca s Playwrightom, ki zajema prijavo, odjavo in ustvarjanje projektov. Lokalna podmreža je bila premaknjena na 192.168.105.192/28 da se prepreči trčenje z ERPNext Doseg."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Pi-hole role (*web-app-pihole*) that ships the upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta."
msgstr "Nova vloga Pi-hole (*web-app-pihole*) da odda ponor Pi-hole DNS v smeri proti toku in omrežno blokado, s svojim admin spletnim vmesnikom, ki je za njim *oauth2-proksi* ter Keycloak RBAC in domača prijava admin-geslo (o *FTLCONF* splet API geslo) na voljo kot rezervna različica. Zgornji reševalec in časovni pas sta nastavljiva, vloga med uvajanjem čaka na končno točko P-hole HTTP in se izvaja od konca do konca z Playwrightom, ki pokriva OAuth2, domači login in dostop do gostov. Vloga ladij v življenjskem ciklu beta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New `--mirror` support for inventory generation"
msgstr "Novo `--mirror` podpora za izdelavo inventarja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New addon suggestions MUST include enough data for review: role id, addon id, upstream id, mechanism, source, catalog URL, and why the addon is considered relevant."
msgstr "Novi predlogi za dodatek MORAJO vključevati dovolj podatkov za pregled: ID vloge, ID addon, ID na začetku, mehanizem, vir, katalog URL, in zakaj se šteje, da je dodatek pomemben."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New centralized API single-point-of-truth: an *api* lookup plugin plus a global API dict so API tokens and endpoints (Cloudflare, the Nextcloud proprietary OAuth integrations) resolve from one place instead of scattered role lookups."
msgstr "Novo centralizirano API eno točko resnice: a *api* iskalni vstavek plus globalni API -Tako je. API žetone in končne točke (Cloudflare, Nextcloud lastniške integracije OAuth) namesto razpršenih iskalnikov vlog reši z enega mesta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New engine-agnostic object-store service (*web-app-seaweedfs*, backed by either *SeaweedFS* or *MinIO*) that exposes a shared S3 endpoint, now consumed across 14 web-app roles for media and asset storage. Nextcloud, Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon and Matrix route their uploads to the central bucket, each exercised end-to-end with a SeaweedFS consumer check that requires a fresh object key per upload."
msgstr "Nova agnostična storitev v trgovini z motorjem (*web-app-seaweedfs*, ki jo podpira bodisi *SeaweedFS* ali *MinIO*) ki razkriva skupni S3 končna točka, ki se zdaj porabi 14 vloge spletnih aplikacij za shranjevanje sredstev in medijev. Naslednji oblak. Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon ter Matrix preusmerite svoje prenose v centralno vedro, pri čemer se vsak izvaja od konca do konca z SeaweedFS Preverjanje potrošnikov, ki zahteva svež ključ predmeta na nalaganje."

