msgid "New lint: git branch names are validated against the naming convention. Agent docs gained a hard pre-redeploy verification gate in the role iteration loop."
msgstr "Nova pisava: imena podružnic git so potrjena glede na konvencijo o poimenovanju. Agent Docs dobil trdo pred-odredeploy preverjanje vrata v vlogi ponovitve zanke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New packaging lint: a *lint-packages* check, wired into *make lint* and its own CI workflow, validates the generated *debian/changelog* with *dpkg-parsechangelog*, the Fedora spec with *rpmspec* and the Arch *PKGBUILD* with a *bash -n* syntax pass, failing on any parser warning rather than only on a non-zero exit. A complementary *test-lint* check asserts that both package changelogs list every released version and that their inline window matches CHANGELOG.md. See [the workflow catalog](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "Nova plast embalaže: a *Embalaže za lino* ček, povezan v *naredi limeto* in lasten delovni tok KI, potrjuje ustvarjene *Debian/changelog* z *dpkg-parsechangelog*, Fedora Spec z *rpmspec* in Arch *PKGBUILD* z a *bash -n* Sintaksa podaja, ne upošteva opozorila o razčlenjevanju in ne le izhoda. Komplementarna *test-lint* check trdi, da oba dnevnika paketa navajata vsako objavljeno različico in da se njihovo notranje okno ujema CHANGELOG.md. Glej [katalog poteka dela](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New permanent team members should follow the [onboarding document](https://s.infinito.nexus/onboarding)."
msgstr "Novi stalni člani ekipe morajo slediti [Vstopni dokument](https://s.infinito.nexus/onboarding)."

