msgid "Nginx-based privacy proxy that mirrors whitelisted third-party assets under a first-party domain"
msgstr "Približek zasebnosti, ki temelji na Nginxu, ki zrcali sredstva tretjih oseb na beli listi v domeni prve stranke"

