msgid "Nix version to install via the official installer."
msgstr "Nix različica za namestitev preko uradnega monterja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No"
msgstr "Št."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No SSO. The application authenticates against its own user table and has no OIDC client, so the reverse proxy is not SSO-gated — federation endpoints must stay publicly reachable."
msgstr "Brez SSO-ja. Aplikacija overi svojo uporabniško tabelo in nima odjemalca OIDC, tako da obratni posrednik ni SSO-giran – federacijski opazovani dogodki morajo ostati javno dosegljivi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No Unsandboxed Escape Hatch 🚪"
msgstr "Ni neshranjene pasti za pobeg 🚪"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No `--mode`, `--tor`, `--distros` or `--filesystem`. Those inputs pin an axis for the whole run, which the tokens already do per row, and a run-level pool that disagrees with a token refuses it. The only reason to reach for them is a line where every row genuinely shares one value, and even then the token form is what the report has to show."
msgstr "Št. `--mode`, `--tor`, `--distros` ali `--filesystem`. Ti vhodi pin os za celotno vožnjo, ki žetoni storiti po vrsti, in run-nivo, ki se ne strinja z žeton ga zavrne. Edini razlog, da jih dosežemo, je vrstica, kjer si vsaka vrsta resnično deli eno vrednost, in tudi takrat je žetonska oblika tisto, kar mora poročilo pokazati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No ``__all__``: declaring the re-exported name makes autodoc document the class here as well as where it is defined, and sphinx then finds two targets for every ``ImageRef`` annotation."
msgstr "Št. ``__all__``: razglasitev ponovno izvoženo ime naredi avtodoc dokument razred tukaj, kot tudi kjer je opredeljena, in sfinga nato najde dve tarči za vsako ``ImageRef`` opomba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No `git commit` until every Acceptance Criterion is checked."
msgstr "Št. `git commit` dokler se ne preveri vsako merilo sprejemljivosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No additional bundle file format is required."
msgstr "Dodatna oblika paketne datoteke ni potrebna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No additional bundle manifest files are required."
msgstr "Dodatne manifestne datoteke paketa niso potrebne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No additional configuration is required."
msgstr "Dodatne nastavitve niso potrebne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No additional role variables are required; this role solely manages the installation of the editor."
msgstr "Dodatne spremenljivke vloge niso potrebne; ta vloga upravlja izključno montažo urejevalnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No agent needs host access to do agent work: OpenClaw's browser control and filesystem access run inside the guest, and Hermes' subagent execution runs inside the guest, so the agent runtime is fully isolatable. The only host-level demand is Hermes' web dashboard, which wants `network_mode: host` and a shared host PID namespace solely to display **host** metrics that an isolated guest cannot expose. That host-monitoring view is severable and MUST NOT pull the agent tier out of its isolated runtime: the agent runtime stays isolated, and the host-metrics dashboard is either run in Hermes' embedded/in-process mode (with reduced host stats) or split out to a separate non-isolated `runc` sidecar."
msgstr "Noben agent ne potrebuje dostopa gostitelja do dela agenta: OpenClawov nadzor brskalnika in dostop datotečnega sistema tečeta znotraj gosta, Hermesova podagentna izvedba pa teče znotraj gosta, tako da je čas delovanja agenta popolnoma izolabilen. Edina potreba na ravni gostitelja je Hermesova spletna armaturna plošča, ki želi `network_mode: host` in skupni imenski prostor PID za prikaz **gostitelj** Meritve, ki jih osamljeni gost ne more razkriti. Ta pogled, ki ga spremlja gostitelj, je razmakljiv in ga NE SME potegniti iz svojega izoliranega časa delovanja: čas delovanja ostane izoliran, in armaturna plošča za merjenje gostitelja se bodisi zažene v Hermesovem vgrajenem/v postopku (z zmanjšanim številom gostiteljev) ali razdeljena na ločeno neizolirano `runc` stranski prikolici."

