msgstr "Na macOS in Windows morate uporabljati nastavitve Docker Desktop namesto `daemon.json`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On macOS, use [Lima](https://lima-vm.io/) so the project runs inside a Linux environment instead of directly on the host system. Use [Homebrew](https://brew.sh/) on macOS to install and manage Lima, then run the normal [Linux-oriented project setup](../setup.md) inside the Lima environment. This keeps the development workflow closer to the Linux-first setup used by this repository."
msgstr "Na macOS, uporaba [Lima](https://lima-vm.io/) Tako projekt teče znotraj Linux okolja namesto neposredno na gostiteljskem sistemu. Uporaba [Domača hrana](https://brew.sh/) na MacOS za namestitev in upravljanje Lima, nato teči normalno [Nastavitev projekta, usmerjenega v Linux](../setup.md) znotraj Limskega okolja. To ohranja razvojno delo bližje nastavitvi Linux- first, ki jo uporablja to skladišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On platforms where distro packages are known to be problematic (e.g. Arch Linux ARM), the role deliberately avoids the system package and falls back to the official installer to ensure a working and up-to-date Nix installation."
msgstr "Na platformah, kjer so distro paketi znani kot problematični (npr. Arch Linux ARM), vloga namerno izogiba sistemski paket in pade nazaj na uradni monter, da se zagotovi delujoča in posodobljena Nix namestitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On platforms where distro packages are known to be problematic (e.g. Arch Linux ARM), the role deliberately avoids the system package and falls back to the official installer to ensure a working and up-to-date Nix installation."
msgstr "Na platformah, kjer so distro paketi znani kot problematični (npr. Arch Linux ARM), vloga namerno izogiba sistemski paket in pade nazaj na uradni monter, da se zagotovi delujoča in posodobljena Nix namestitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On small machines, you SHOULD limit validation to the role you are touching."
msgstr "Na majhnih strojih bi morali omejiti validacijo na vlogo, ki jo dotikate."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On the **first deployment**, or after a factory reset, the token does not yet exist because the bootstrap has not run yet. A second common cause is that [`roles/sys-service-loader/tasks/load_service.yml`](../../../roles/sys-service-loader/tasks/load_service.yml) skips `load/app.yml` when the Matomo container is already reachable. In that case the container is healthy but the token file is still absent from the token store, so the variable arrives empty."
msgstr "Na **prva razporeditev**, ali po ponastavitvi tovarne, žeton še ne obstaja, ker škornji Trap še ni tekel. Drugi skupni vzrok je, da [`roles/sys-service-loader/tasks/load_service.yml`](../../../roles/sys-service-loader/tasks/load_service.yml) skips `load/app.yml` ko Matomo Posoda je že dosegljiva. V tem primeru je posoda zdrava, vendar žetonska datoteka še vedno manjka v žetonski trgovini, tako da spremenljivka prispe prazna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On the next `make dotenv`"
msgstr "Na naslednjem `make dotenv`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On-target automation for creating and activating swap space via a cloned swapfile script"
msgstr "O-ciljna avtomatizacija za ustvarjanje in aktiviranje swap prostora preko kloniranega skripta swapfile"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once a compatible release ships, the next deploy run will install + enable + configure the plugin automatically without operator intervention."
msgstr "Ko je združljiv izpust ladje, bo naslednja uporaba pogon namestiti + omogočiti + nastavite plugin samodejno brez posredovanja upravljavca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once all branch-caused failures are addressed, you MUST `git push` the branch on which you iterated to the operator's fork. For any root cause you could not resolve, you MUST file a separate issue per [External Failures](#external-failures) describing what was attempted and why it remains unresolved."
msgstr "Ko so obravnavane vse napake, ki jih povzroči podružnica, morate `git push` Podružnico, na kateri ste pluli na vilice. Za vsak korenski vzrok, ki ga niste mogli rešiti, MORATE vložiti ločeno vprašanje na [Zunanji neuspehi](#external-failures) o tem, kaj se je poskušalo in zakaj ostaja nerešeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once enabled, you MUST:"
msgstr "Ko je omogočeno, MORATE:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once executed, the user becomes fully available in the system (for sharing, group membership, and permissions) even without logging in."
msgstr "Ko se uporabnik izvede, postane v celoti na voljo v sistemu (za delitev, članstvo v skupini in dovoljenja) Tudi brez prijave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once the DNS changes have propagated, **press Enter** in the Certbot terminal.   If successful, Certbot will save the certificates under:"
msgstr "Ko se DNS spremeni, **pritisnite Enter** v Certbot terminal. Če bo uspešen, Certbot bo potrdila shranil pod:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once the Matomo bootstrap has run, either later in the same play or on the next Ansible invocation, `sys-token-store` writes the token to disk. On the **next play run** the token is resolved from the store, the condition evaluates to false, and `inject.yml` executes normally: registering the site at Matomo and injecting the tracking code into the target application."
msgstr "Enkrat Matomo Boottrap je tekel, ali kasneje v isti igri ali na naslednji Ansible invoction, `sys-token-store` napiše žeton na disk. Na **Naslednja igra** žeton se reši iz trgovine, stanje oceni na napačno, in `inject.yml` običajno izvede: registrira mesto na Matomo in vbrizga sledilno kodo v ciljno aplikacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once the failing mode is green in its focused loop, you MUST resume the roundtrip over the failed app plus the apps that have not run yet (`apps=\"<failed-app> <still-untested apps in complexity order>\"`), and you MUST NOT restart the full sweep from the top. Apps that already went green earlier in the same run stay green; re-running them wastes one swarm rebuild each."
msgstr "Ko je okvarjeni način v ciljni zanki zelen, MORATE nadaljevati s preletom preko neuspešne aplikacije in aplikacij, ki še niso zagnane (`apps=\"<failed-app> <still-untested apps in complexity order>\"`), in ne smete ponovno polno čiščenje z vrha. Aplikacije, ki so že prej ozelenele v istem teku, ostanejo zelene; ponovno zaganjanje jih zavrže po en roj, vsako obnovi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once the machine is up, the repository checkout mounted into it is prepared with [scripts/tests/workspace/base/01_install.sh](../../../../../scripts/tests/workspace/base/01_install.sh), the same step the workspace suite uses: system packages through `INFINITO_PACKAGE_INSTALL_SCRIPT`, then `make install`. Only then is the block replayed, so it meets a machine prepared exactly the way the documentation tells a reader to prepare one."
msgstr "Ko je naprava vklopljena, je odjava v skladišču pripravljena z [scripts/tests/workspace/base/01_install.sh](../../../../../scripts/tests/workspace/base/01_install.sh), enak korak, kot ga uporablja delovna soba: sistemski paketi skozi `INFINITO_PACKAGE_INSTALL_SCRIPT`, potem `make install`. Šele potem se blok ponovno predvaja, tako da se sreča stroj pripravljen točno tako, kot dokumentacija naroči bralcu, da pripravi enega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once the root cause is understood, you MUST apply the real fix in the repository files and then continue the redeploy loop with the usual commands from this page. In-container fixes are only for diagnosis or short validation and MUST NOT replace the repo change."
msgstr "Ko je vzrok koren, morate uporabiti pravi popravek v datotekah skladišča in nato nadaljevati s prerazporeditvijo z običajnimi ukazi s te strani. Popravki v vsebniku so samo za diagnozo ali kratko validacijo in ne smejo nadomestiti spremembe repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once this role has been applied, you can run all CLI commands using:"
msgstr "Ko se ta vloga uveljavi, lahko zaženete vse ukaze CLI z uporabo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One Ansible module invocation the action plugin should execute."
msgstr "En Ansible modul invocation mora vstavek za dejanje izvesti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One OpenAI-compatible `/v1`, routes to any backend (headless, internal-only)"
msgstr "Eno z OpenAI združljivo `/v1`, poti do katere koli hrbtenice (brez glave, samo notranje)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One Pi joins as a `kata-capable` arm64 node; `web-app-hermes` deploys there under the isolating runtime selected by the preflight (Decision #4)."
msgstr "Ena Pi se pridruži kot `kata-capable` roka64 vozlišče; `web-app-hermes` razporedi v času izoliranega delovanja, ki ga izbere pred letom (Odločitev #4)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One `HiddenServicePort` covers all apps: every `<sub>.<NODE_ONION>.onion` request arrives on `127.0.0.1:80` where OpenResty routes by `Host`."
msgstr "Ena. `HiddenServicePort` zajema vse aplikacije: vsak `<sub>.<NODE_ONION>.onion` zahteva je prispela `127.0.0.1:80` pri čemer je OpenResty poti po `Host`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One ``package_name: \"<name>==<version>\"`` line."
msgstr "Ena. ``package_name: \"<name>==<version>\"`` Linija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One ``pg_dumpall`` dump of a whole instance inside a generation."
msgstr "Ena. ``pg_dumpall`` Celoten primerek v generaciji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One ``python:<version>-slim`` container runs the service in ``files/python/infinito_docs/``:"
msgstr "Ena. ``python:<version>-slim`` zabojnik vodi prevoz v ``files/python/infinito_docs/``:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "One ``{\"image\", \"track\", \"icon\", \"label\"}`` entry per image."
msgstr "Ena. ``{\"image\", \"track\", \"icon\", \"label\"}`` vnos na sliko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One `docker stack` per role, consistent with today's one-compose-project-per-role model. Granular `deploy / update / rm` per role is preserved. A single global stack across all Infinito services is explicitly rejected — it would couple update windows and rollback granularity across unrelated apps."
msgstr "Ena. `docker stack` V skladu z današnjim modelom enega samega projekta. Granular `deploy / update / rm` ohranjena je vsaka vloga. Enoten globalni kup vseh storitev Infinito je izrecno zavrnjen – to bi bilo nekaj posodobitev oken in rollback granularitete v nepovezanih aplikacijah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One `python:<version>-slim` container runs the service in `files/python/infinito_docs/`:"
msgstr "Ena. `python:<version>-slim` zabojnik vodi prevoz v `files/python/infinito_docs/`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One application role. The field order is the column order; legacy positional access (``row[0]`` … ``row[11]``) still resolves."
msgstr "Ena vloga. Vrstni red polja je vrstni red kolone; zapuščinski pozicijski dostop (``row[0]`` ... ``row[11]``) Še vedno je odločen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One axis' values from cheapest to dearest."
msgstr "Vrednosti ene osi od najcenejših do najdražjih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One builder per acquisition path."
msgstr "En graditelj na prevzemno pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One built version needs about 2.3 GB. Building every translated language up front multiplies that per language; `min_storage` MUST say so. `min_storage` also gates which roles a host deploys at all, so it counts the sites every deployment builds and names the growth per further language."
msgstr "Ena zgrajena različica potrebuje približno 2.3 GB. Graditi vsak prevedeni jezik spredaj množi, da na jezik; `min_storage` MORAJO tako reči. `min_storage` tudi vrata, ki imajo vlogo gostitelja razporedi sploh, tako da šteje lokacije vsako uporabo gradi in imenuje rast v nadaljnjem jeziku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One canonical place to map every Infinito.Nexus knob to its MDAD counterpart; keeps MDAD's own inventory hierarchy intact."
msgstr "Eno kanonično mesto za zemljevid vsakega Infinito.Nexus gumb na MDAD proti; ohranja hierarhijo inventarja MDAD."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One central role per engine, mirroring `svc-db-postgres`:"
msgstr "Ena osrednja vloga na motor, zrcaljenje `svc-db-postgres`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One collection pinned in both requirement files."
msgstr "Ena zbirka v obeh datotekah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One container (compose) or one single-replica service (swarm) per user and platform, named from the platform and a hash of the user id, labelled with owner and platform."
msgstr "Ena posoda (compose) ali ena storitev z eno repliko (roj) na uporabnika in platformo, ki se imenujeta s platforme in hašiša uporabniškega ID-ja, označena z lastnikom in platformo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One deploy job title, taken apart."
msgstr "En naslov za delovno mesto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One deploy job's title and artifact name: how they are built and read back."
msgstr "Ime in ime artefakta: kako so zgrajeni in nazaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One env setting: the process environment wins, ``default.env`` is the SPOT behind it."
msgstr "En env nastavitev: proces okolje zmaga, ``default.env`` je SPOT za njim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One format, two readers: the ``.env`` generator writes it to ``INFINITO_CACHE_UPSTREAMS`` for the dev stack, and the ``cache_records`` lookup hands the same string to the role's bootstrap task. Both resolve the Ubuntu mirror placeholders from ``INFINITO_APT_UBUNTU_MIRRORS``, which the image build reads too, so the mirror order has a single home."
msgstr "En format, dva bralca: ``.env`` generatorju piše, da ``INFINITO_CACHE_UPSTREAMS`` za dev sklad, in ``cache_records`` Poglej v roke isto struno za nalogo v zvezi s škornji. Oba rešita Ubuntu zrcalne ograde ``INFINITO_APT_UBUNTU_MIRRORS``, ki jih slika gradi tudi bere, tako da ima zrcalni red en sam dom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One host runs the whole fleet: the role builds the ``infinito-runner`` image locally, renders one compose project and starts ``RUNNER_COUNT`` instances."
msgstr "En gostitelj vodi celotno floto: vloga gradi ``infinito-runner`` slika lokalno, naredi en komponiran projekt in začne ``RUNNER_COUNT`` primere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One host runs the whole fleet: the role builds the `infinito-runner` image locally, renders one compose project and starts `RUNNER_COUNT` instances."
msgstr "En gostitelj vodi celotno floto: vloga gradi `infinito-runner` slika lokalno, naredi en komponiran projekt in začne `RUNNER_COUNT` primere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One hostname the frontend answers for, in place of its upstream."
msgstr "Eden od gostiteljev se je odločil za začetek, namesto za začetek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One integer CI setting, read through the shared env SPOT."
msgstr "Eno celo število nastavitev CI, preberite skozi skupno env SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One matrix row as the ``role#variant`` the sweep rotation cannot move."
msgstr "Ena matrična vrstica kot ``role#variant`` Vrtenje se ne more premakniti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One module per dynamically-computed variable. See [handlers README](handlers/README.md)."
msgstr "En modul na dinamično komputirano spremenljivko. Glej. [obdelovalci README](handlers/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One module per tool, each exposing `ensure()`. See [lint README](lint/README.md)."
msgstr "En modul na orodje, vsako izpostavljanje `ensure()`. Glej [lint README](lint/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One of `external`, `external_container`, `localhost`, `localhost_container`."
msgstr "Ena od `external`, `external_container`, `localhost`, `localhost_container`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One package id, declared either repository-wide or by one role."
msgstr "Identifikator enega paketa, deklariran bodisi po vsej zbirki bodisi po eni vlogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One post-application reconciliation stage runs after every selected provider role has provisioned and probed its endpoint, builds one immutable discovery snapshot, and reconciles every client from it. No provider or client `enabled` or `shared` expression enumerates concrete peer role names. The discovery result carries selected entries and rejected ones with a stable code such as `consumer_not_allowed`, `transport_unsupported`, `auth_unsupported`, `credential_missing` or `endpoint_unreachable`."
msgstr "Ena faza usklajevanja po uporabi poteka po tem, ko vsaka izbrana vloga ponudnika zagotovi in projicira svoj končni cilj, izdela en nespremenljiv posnetek odkritja in uskladi vse stranke iz njega. Brez ponudnika ali odjemalca `enabled` ali `shared` Izraz našteva konkretna imena vrstnikov. Rezultat odkritja nosi izbrane vnose in zavrnjene z stabilno kodo, kot so `consumer_not_allowed`, `transport_unsupported`, `auth_unsupported`, `credential_missing` ali `endpoint_unreachable`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One query per run, not one per deploy mode. Every row is a ``role#variant`` selection, so the row basis, the ranking and the budget cut all speak the same unit and the cut can select a subset of a role's variants. Which deploy mode a row actually runs in is decided afterwards by the rotation in ``utils.github.variant.bundles``; the query only decides which rows exist."
msgstr "Ena poizvedba na vožnjo, ne ena na način uporabe. Vsaka vrsta je ``role#variant`` selekcija, tako osnova vrstice, razvrstitev in proračun zmanjšati vse govorijo isto enoto in rez lahko izberete podskupino variant vloge. Kateri način uporabe vrsta dejansko teče, se odloči kasneje z rotacijo v ``utils.github.variant.bundles``; poizvedba določa samo, katere vrstice obstajajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One recovery type backed by a role's ``files/python/recover.py``."
msgstr "Ena vrsta izterjave, podprta z vlogo ``files/python/recover.py``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One repository Nexus proxies."
msgstr "Eno skladišče Nexus proxies."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One role's measured runtime within a deploy segment."
msgstr "Ena vloga se meri v segmentu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One row is decided once and then read by three consumers that MUST agree on it:"
msgstr "O eni vrstici odločajo trije potrošniki, ki se morajo z njo strinjati:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One row per ``meta/variants.yml`` variant of every application role."
msgstr "Ena vrstica na ``meta/variants.yml`` varianto vsake vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One search-only key and explicit collection list per application; no collection/schema/key administration"
msgstr "En iskalni in eksplicitni seznam za zbiranje na program; ne collection/schema/key uporaba"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One selection token as a :class:`Pin`."
msgstr "Ena izbira žeton kot :class:`Pin`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One selection token, taken apart."
msgstr "Žeton za izbiro, ki je razpadel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One service serves both block shapes, because the demands of the two overlap: a host install needs `/sbin/init` as the entrypoint and the cgroup mount to deploy systemd units, and it needs the daemon socket too, since a role without a compose template of its own still pulls in containerised dependencies. A containerised block needs that socket to nest its `docker run` one level below the machine, and a work directory mounted at the same absolute path on both sides so the bind sources it names resolve on the daemon. The union is the machine, and the block decides what it does with it."
msgstr "Ena storitev služi obema oblikama blokov, ker zahteve obeh prekrivanja: gostitelj namestitev potrebuje `/sbin/init` kot vstopna točka in cgroup priklop za uporabo sistemskih enot, in potrebuje vtičnico demona preveč, saj vloga brez sestaviti predlogo svoje še vedno vleče v kontejnerskih odvisnosti. Blok v zabojniku potrebuje vtičnico, da lahko gnezdi `docker run` ena raven pod strojem, in delovni imenik nameščen na isti absolutni poti na obeh straneh tako vezati vire, ki jih imena reši na demon. Sindikat je stroj in blok odloča, kaj naredi z njim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One sidecar per consuming application with a database-scoped read-only principal and only schema/SELECT/SHOW/DESCRIBE tools. Never a global server on the shared engine or the root credential."
msgstr "Ena stranska prikolica za enkratno uporabo z glavnim in edinim čitalnikom, ki je na voljo v podatkovni zbirki schema/SELECT/SHOW/DESCRIBE orodja. Nikoli globalni strežnik na skupnem motorju ali korenske poverilnice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One single-database dump inside a generation."
msgstr "Enopodatkovno odlagališče znotraj generacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One standard path lowers cognitive load."
msgstr "Ena standardna pot zmanjšuje kognitivno obremenitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One sweep proves one architecture and claims nothing about the other, which is the defect 0001 was written against."
msgstr "En pregled dokazuje eno arhitekturo in ne trdi nič o drugem, kar je napaka. 0001 je bilo napisano proti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One sweep proves one distribution and claims nothing about the other four, while reporting green."
msgstr "En pregled dokazuje eno distribucijo in ne trdi nič o ostalih štirih, medtem ko poroča zeleno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One table per role is what makes the rules composable. A fragment replaces its own table and touches no other, so two roles on one host neither overwrite nor merge into each other, and a broken fragment fails alone instead of freezing everyone's rules."
msgstr "Ena miza za vsako vlogo je tista, zaradi katere so pravila komponirana. Fragment nadomesti svojo mizo in se ne dotakne nobene druge, zato dve vlogi na enem gostitelju niti ne zamenjata niti se ne združita drug v drugega, zlomljen fragment pa propade sam, namesto da bi zamrznil pravila vseh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One table per role is what makes the rules composable. A fragment replaces its own table and touches no other, so two roles on one host neither overwrite nor merge into each other, and a broken fragment fails alone instead of freezing everyone’s rules."
msgstr "Ena miza za vsako vlogo je tista, zaradi katere so pravila komponirana. Fragment zamenja svojo mizo in se ne dotakne nobene druge, zato dve vlogi na enem gostitelju niti ne zamenjata niti se ne združita, zlomljen fragment pa propade sam, namesto da bi zamrznil pravila vseh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One translation per source, ``None`` where it was discarded, plus the counts that say which of the two reasons applied. The counts belong to this call: lanes share the client, so a field on the client would mix another catalog's numbers into this one's."
msgstr "En prevod na vir, ``None`` kjer je bila zavržena, plus navedbe, ki navajajo, kateri od teh dveh razlogov se je uporabil. Računi pripadajo temu klicu: pasovi delijo stranko, tako da bi polje na stranki mešalo številke drugega kataloga v to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-level-deep entry under a cli/ directory."
msgstr "Enostopenjski vnos pod kli/ imenikom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-liners such as a single `command:` or a short `shell:` pipeline MAY stay inline. The rule targets bodies that are themselves a program, not every shell call."
msgstr "Enovrstična plovila, kot je enojna `command:` ali kratek `shell:` cevovod LAHKO ostane v liniji. Pravilo meri na telesa, ki so sama program, ne pa na vsak klic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-shot containers (matomo bootstrap, erpnext configurator, shopware init). They exit 0 and must never be respawned."
msgstr "Enostrelne posode (matomo škornji Trap, erpnext konfigurator, trgovina init). Izstopijo. 0 in se ga ne sme nikoli ponoviti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-shot validation of a curated app shape (e.g. `education-suite`)."
msgstr "Enostrelno potrjevanje kurirane oblike aplikacije (Npr. `education-suite`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-time scan of all include_role/import_role"
msgstr "Enkratno skeniranje vseh include_role/import_role"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-time scan of all metadata"
msgstr "Enkratno skeniranje vseh metapodatkov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-time scan of include_tasks/import_tasks"
msgstr "Enkratno skeniranje include_tasks/import_tasks"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-time setup (run once after cloning, outside the Claude sandbox): `git-setup-remotes --canonical git@github.com:infinito-nexus/core.git`. See the tool's [README](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools#readme) for all flags, the `FORK_URL` environment variable, and the clone-from-canonical case."
msgstr "Enkratna nastavitev (teči enkrat po kloniranju, zunaj peskovnika Claude): `git-setup-remotes --canonical git@github.com:infinito-nexus/core.git`. Poglej orodje. [README](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools#readme) za vse zastave, `FORK_URL` Okoljska spremenljivka in klon iz kanoničnega primera."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Onion e2e (feature/svc-net-tor) — remaining failures"
msgstr "Čebula e2e (funkcija/svc-net-tor) — preostale napake"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Onion service extensions (phase 2, layered on a green onion core)"
msgstr "Razširitve storitev čebule (faza 2, plasti na zelenem čebulnem jedru)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Online retailers and businesses operating digital storefronts."
msgstr "Spletni trgovci na drobno in podjetja, ki upravljajo digitalne shrambe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only Assist-exposed entities are reachable"
msgstr "Dosegljive so samo entitete, ki so izpostavljene pomoči"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only CODEOWNERS matter"
msgstr "Samo KODEOKNERJI so pomembni"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only a clean sweep of successes retires the suite. A shard that failed, was cancelled, timed out or skipped did not run through, and a run that holds no job for the suite at all never started it -- none of those is evidence the suite is good, so the retrigger keeps asking for it."
msgstr "Samo čisti uspehi upokojijo apartma. Drobec, ki ni uspel, je bil preklican, časovno odmerjen ali preskočil ni tekel skozi, in tek, ki nima nobene službe za apartma sploh ni nikoli začel - nič od tega ni dokaz, da je apartma dober, zato retrigger kar naprej prosi za to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only a message that is nothing but the name qualifies. Inside a sentence the name is protected by the span machinery in :mod:`utils.i18n.placeholders`, and the sentence around it still needs translating."
msgstr "Samo sporočilo, ki ni nič drugega kot ime. Znotraj stavka je ime zaščiteno s kalibrirnim strojem v :mod:`utils.i18n.placeholders`, in stavek okoli njega še vedno potrebuje prevajanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only a role that declares nothing falls back on its shape: a stack role (ships a compose template) is offered ``compose`` and ``swarm``, anything else is offered ``host``."
msgstr "Le vloga, ki nič ne pade nazaj na svojo obliko. (ladje, ki sestavljajo predlogo) ponujeno ``compose`` ter ``swarm``, Vse drugo je na voljo. ``host``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only delete packages whose name starts with `<prefix>/`"
msgstr "Zbriši samo pakete, katerih ime se začne z `<prefix>/`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only enable WebSocket proxying (`ws.conf.j2`) for routes that actually require it, to avoid breaking buffering for standard HTTP."
msgstr "Omogoči le prenos WebSocket (`ws.conf.j2`) za poti, ki to dejansko zahtevajo, da se prepreči zlom odbojnika za standardno HTTP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only exact ``==`` pins are collected. A range or a VCS reference states an intent this cannot second-guess."
msgstr "Samo točen ``==`` Zatiči so zbrani. Razpon ali referenca VCS navaja namen, ki ga to ne more podvomiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only go back to `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<roles> full_cycle=true` if you have concrete evidence that the inventory or host stack is broken, or you intentionally need a fresh single-app baseline again."
msgstr "Samo vrni se. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<roles> full_cycle=true` če imate konkreten dokaz, da je inventar ali sklad gostitelja pokvarjen, ali če namerno ponovno potrebujete svežo osnovo za eno aplikacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only literal `https://<host>` tokens count as external assets:"
msgstr "Samo dobesedno. `https://<host>` žetoni se štejejo kot zunanja sredstva:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only one swarm cluster fits per worktree: the lab subnet is pinned to the worktree slot (`INFINITO_SWARM_LAB_SUBNET` in `scripts/system/worktree/up.sh`), so a second cluster in the same worktree fails at network creation with `invalid pool request: Pool overlaps`. `swarm-zombie` therefore reclaims whatever holds that subnet before it starts (`utils/clean/lab_subnet.sh`), so a cluster kept with `keep=true` survives only until the next swarm run in the same worktree. Inspect a kept cluster before starting the next run. Parallel clusters need separate worktrees (`make worktree-up`), which carry distinct lab octets and are left untouched by the reclaim; `make swarm-clean` is the deliberate exception that clears every worktree's clusters."
msgstr "Samo en roj se prilega na delovno drevo: laboratorijska mreža je pritrjena na režo delovnega drevesa (`INFINITO_SWARM_LAB_SUBNET` v `scripts/system/worktree/up.sh`), tako da drugi grozd na istem drevoredu ne uspe pri ustvarjanju omrežja z `invalid pool request: Pool overlaps`. `swarm-zombie` Zato izterja vse, kar ima podmrežo pred začetkom (`utils/clean/lab_subnet.sh`), tako grozd hranijo z `keep=true` preživi le, dokler naslednji roj ne teče na istem drevoredu. Pred začetkom naslednjega zagona preglejte ohranjeno skupino. Vzporedni grozdi potrebujejo ločena delovna drevesa (`make worktree-up`), ki imajo ločene laboratorijske oktete in so nepoškodovani zaradi izterjave; `make swarm-clean` je namerna izjema, ki očisti vse konce."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only return to `mode=reinstall` when you have concrete evidence that the inventory or the host stack itself is broken (for example DNS or network failures during the deploy)."
msgstr "Samo vrni se. `mode=reinstall` ko imate konkretne dokaze, da je inventar ali gostitelj sam kup razbit (na primer DNS ali napake v omrežju med uvajanjem)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only run_after edges pointing inside the selected set become edges, so a group resolves independently of the roles outside it."
msgstr "Samo run_after robovi, ki kažejo znotraj izbranega seta, postanejo robovi, tako da skupina rešuje neodvisno od vlog zunaj nje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only successful jobs count. A failed job stops early or runs into a timeout, so its duration measures the failure rather than the axis, and these axes are picked between to reach a verdict cheaply."
msgstr "Štejejo samo uspešna delovna mesta. Neuspešno delo se predčasno ustavi ali pa zapade v timeout, zato njegovo trajanje meri neuspeh in ne os, te osi pa se izbirajo med tem, da bi dosegli razsodbo poceni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only supplied values are checked: a generated one comes from the algorithm the same schema names, and the generators take no schema argument."
msgstr "Preverijo se samo podane vrednosti: ustvarjena je iz algoritma istih imen sheme, generatorji pa ne sprejemajo argumentov sheme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only the configuration is recovered, never the selection: ``whitelist`` and ``priority`` say which roles ran, and a retrigger computes those itself. Runs from any other entry point carry an unrelated title and yield nothing at all."
msgstr "Samo konfiguracija se povrne, nikoli izbor: ``whitelist`` ter ``priority`` Povej, katere vloge so tekle, in retrigger izračuna te same. Teče iz katere koli druge vstopne točke nosi nepovezan naslov in sploh ne daje ničesar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only the first entry of the chosen variant: a priority row runs every mode and onion state it offers, and replaying the same README block in each of them proves nothing the first replay did not. The glyph goes between the variant number and the ⭐ of a priority row, with no space between the two: they are one marker block, not two axes."
msgstr "Samo prvi vnos izbrane variante: prioritetna vrstica teče v vsakem načinu in stanju čebule, ki ga ponuja, in ponovno predvaja isti blok README v vsakem od njih ne dokazuje nič prvi ponovitev ni. Glif gre med variantno številko in."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only the mount that carries the docker data root matters. A btrfs partition elsewhere on the host changes nothing — the probe never looks at it."
msgstr "Pomembno je samo tisto, ki nosi doker podatke. Razdelek btrf drugje na gostitelju ne spremeni ničesar – sonda ga nikoli ne pogleda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only those two fields are read. Matching against every URL in the role sweeps in whatever its prose links to, and a reference to ``en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ Bourne_shell`` then turns ``Shell`` into a brand."
msgstr "Samo ti dve polji se bereta. Ujemanje z vsakim URL-jem v vlogi premetava ne glede na to, na kaj je povezana njegova proza, in sklicevanje na ``en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ Bourne_shell`` Nato se obrne ``Shell`` v znamko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Opaque, role-interpreted runtime payload. Lint does not constrain its inner shape beyond requiring a mapping. Secrets inside `config` MUST resolve through `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` and MUST NOT be inlined literally."
msgstr "Neprimeren, tolmačen čas dela. Lint ne omejuje svoje notranje oblike, razen če zahteva kartiranje. Skrivnosti znotraj `config` ZAGOTAVLJANJE `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` in NE SME biti dobesedno povezan."

