msgstr "OpenAI-združljiv LLM prehod usmerja eno /v1 končna točka lokalnih in gostujočih hrbtenic modelov s ključi na potrošnika"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenBao auto-unseals on every restart, so deploy and redeploy stay idempotent and no OpenBao-generated key material has to be written back into the inventory. The inventory is the \"existing source of trust\" upstream's caveat asks for."
msgstr "Samodejno izklopi OpenBao ob vsakem ponovnem zagonu, tako da uporabite in prerazporedite ostati idempotent in ne OpenBao-Glavni material mora biti napisan nazaj v inventar. Inventar je \"obstoječi vir zaupanja\" Touther's caveat zahteva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw consumes MCP. Every deployed shared MCP server role is discovered through `MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS` and written into the agent configuration."
msgstr "OpenClaw porabi MCP. Vsako uporabljeno skupno vlogo strežnika MCP se odkrije skozi `MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS` in vpisan v konfiguracijo agenta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw consumes MCP. Every deployed shared MCP server role is discovered through ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` and written into the agent configuration."
msgstr "OpenClaw porabi MCP. Vsako uporabljeno skupno vlogo strežnika MCP se odkrije skozi ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` in vpisan v konfiguracijo agenta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw exposes no administrator-visible list of configured MCP servers, so the configured set is proven by a CLI test instead: [`files/test/test.sh`](./files/test/test.sh) probes the agent's `mcp` surface and fails when the exec itself fails or the output carries a `failed to start server` line. The Playwright spec covers the complementary case, that the gateway holding the MCP credentials refuses an unauthenticated caller."
msgstr "OpenClaw ne razkriva nobenega administratorsko-vidnega seznama nastavljenih strežnikov MCP, zato je konfiguriran niz dokazan s testom CLI: [`files/test/test.sh`](./files/test/test.sh) Preiskuje agenta. `mcp` površina in ne uspe, kadar eksec sam odpove ali izhod nosi `failed to start server` Linija. Specifikacija Playwrighta zajema dopolnilni primer, da prehod, ki ima poverilnice MCP, zavrne nepriglašenega klicatelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw exposes no administrator-visible list of configured MCP servers, so the configured set is proven by a CLI test instead: ```files/test/test.sh`` <./files/test/test.sh>`__ probes the agent’s ``mcp`` surface and fails when the exec itself fails or the output carries a ``failed to start server`` line. The Playwright spec covers the complementary case, that the gateway holding the MCP credentials refuses an unauthenticated caller."
msgstr "OpenClaw ne razkriva nobenega administratorsko-vidnega seznama nastavljenih strežnikov MCP, zato je konfiguriran niz dokazan s testom CLI: ```files/test/test.sh`` <./files/test/test.sh>`__ probes the agent’s ``mcp`` surface and fails when the exec itself fails or the output carries a ``failed to start server`` Linija. Specifikacija Playwrighta zajema dopolnilni primer, da prehod, ki ima poverilnice MCP, zavrne nepriglašenega klicatelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw's own CLI reference says so directly: `openclaw mcp serve` \"starts a stdio MCP server\" whose process \"the MCP client owns\". Every HTTP transport in that document belongs to the opposite direction, `openclaw mcp add --url --transport streamable-http`, which is OpenClaw acting as a client. Hermes is the same shape: both entry points, `mcp_serve.py` and `agent/transports/hermes_tools_mcp_server.py`, run the MCP SDK's stdio transport, the repository defines neither `run_streamable_http_async` nor `sse_app`, and the user-facing MCP guide describes only Hermes consuming external servers."
msgstr "Lastna CLI referenca OpenClaw pravi tako neposredno: `openclaw mcp serve` \"zažene strežnik stdio MCP\" katerih postopek \"odjemalec MCP je lastnik\". Vsak HTTP prevoz v tem dokumentu pripada v nasprotno smer, `openclaw mcp add --url --transport streamable-http`, ki je OpenClaw deluje kot stranka. Hermes je enake oblike: obe vstopni točki, `mcp_serve.py` ter `agent/transports/hermes_tools_mcp_server.py`, teči MCP SDK je stdio transport, skladišče ne opredeljuje niti `run_streamable_http_async` niti `sse_app`, in uporabnik obrne MCP vodnik opisuje samo Hermesuffing zunanjih strežnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw: [openclaw.ai](https://openclaw.ai/)"
msgstr "OpenClaw: [openclaw.ai](https://openclaw.ai/)"

