msgstr "Poteka OpenResty `network_mode: host`, veže 80/443, `proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:<port>`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenTalk authenticates users against the central Keycloak realm via OIDC and looks up users via the Keycloak admin Web API (`keycloak_webapi` backend). OpenLDAP feeds OpenTalk transitively through Keycloak's federation."
msgstr "OpenTalk overja uporabnike proti osrednji Keycloak realm preko OIDC in išče uporabnike preko Keycloak admin Web API (`keycloak_webapi` hrbtenica). Viri OpenLDAP OpenTalk tranzitno skozi KeycloakFederacija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenTalk authenticates users via OIDC and resolves invitee searches via `https://<keycloak>/admin/realms/<realm>/users?search=…`."
msgstr "OpenTalk overja uporabnike prek OIDC in rešuje iskanje preko `https://<keycloak>/admin/realms/<realm>/users?search=…`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenTalk does not open LDAP connections itself. It relies on Keycloak's LDAP federation (`svc-db-openldap` is mapped into the central Keycloak realm) and queries Keycloak's admin Web API for user lookups. This avoids dual-source-of-truth problems and keeps LDAP credentials away from the OpenTalk service account."
msgstr "OpenTalk ne odpira samih povezav LDAP. Zanaša se na KeycloakZveza LDAP (`svc-db-openldap` v sredini Keycloak kraljestvo) in poizvedbe KeycloakAdmin Web API za iskanje uporabnikov. S tem se izognemo težavam z dvojnim virom resnice in ohranjamo zaupanje LDAP stran od OpenTalk servisni račun."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Opening the PR through a GitHub App installation token bypasses this restriction. The App counts as a distinct actor, so PR-lifecycle events fire normally and the full CI pipeline runs against every update PR."
msgstr "Odpiranje PR prek GitHub App naprave žeton zaobide to omejitev. Aplikacija se šteje za poseben akter, tako da PR-lifecycle dogodki običajno požar in celoten CI cevovod poteka v nasprotju z vsako posodobitev PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Opens an interactive shell in the running container or runs a one-off command."
msgstr "Odpre interaktivno lupino v tekoči posodi ali pa teče enkraten ukaz."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) and [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Upravljavci paketov operativnih sistemov, kot so [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) ter [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) vzdržujejo nameščeno programsko opremo v skladu z njihovimi skladišči za distribucijo na začetku dobavne verige. Vsaka ladja z drugačno komandno površino, vendar vsi služijo istemu cilju: osvežite indeks in nadgradite vsak nameščen paket na gostitelju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as `apt <https://wiki.debian.org/Apt>`__, `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman>`__ and `dnf <https://dnf.readthedocs.io/>`__ keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Upravljavci paketov operativnih sistemov, kot so `apt <https://wiki.debian.org/Apt>`__, `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman>`__ ter `dnf <https://dnf.readthedocs.io/>`__ vzdržujejo nameščeno programsko opremo v skladu z njihovimi skladišči za distribucijo na začetku dobavne verige. Vsaka ladja z drugačno komandno površino, vendar vsi služijo istemu cilju: osvežite indeks in nadgradite vsak nameščen paket na gostitelju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operational limits"
msgstr "Operativne omejitve"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operations 🛠️"
msgstr "Operacije 🛠️"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Operator decision: 100% open source, matches the platform; OIDC handled via the oauth2-proxy gate."
msgstr "Odločitev izvajalca: 100% odprte kode se ujema s platformo; OIDC se ravna prek oauth2-Posebna vrata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator decision: Keycloak SSO at the proxy, Checkmk trusts the proxy-supplied user, LDAP supplies the user record/roles/contact groups."
msgstr "Odločitev o operatorju: Keycloak SSO pri posredniku, Checkmk zaupa uporabniku, dostavljenemu posredniku, LDAP dobavlja uporabniku record/roles/contact skupine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator decision: LDAP gives every client (incl. native apps) a platform identity; the OIDC plugin adds one-click web sign-in."
msgstr "Odločitev upravljavca: LDAP daje vsakemu odjemalcu (vključno z domačimi aplikacijami) Identiteta platforme; vstavek OIDC dodaja spletni vpis z enim klikom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator decision: enable remote-host agent registration in v1."
msgstr "Odločitev upravljavca: omogočiti registracijo agenta oddaljenega gostitelja v v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator decision: self-contained v1; libraries added in-app."
msgstr "Odločitev o izvajalcu: samostojno v1; knjižnice dodane v aplikaciji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator decision: smallest, host-portable surface."
msgstr "Odločitev upravljavca: najmanjša, gostiteljsko prenosljiva površina."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator fork env handlers (INFINITO_FORK_*)."
msgstr "Upravljalci vil Env (INFINITO_FORK_*)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator messages MAY use the portable conversation shortcuts from the `shortcuts` skill (set up via `make install-skills`); agents MUST expand any matching shortcut before acting. The repository's own agent workflows live in the `i8-` skills catalogued in [cheatsheet.md](docs/contributing/tools/agents/cheatsheet.md)."
msgstr "Sporočila operaterja LAHKO uporabljajo prenosne bližnjice pogovora iz `shortcuts` spretnost (nastavljeno prek `make install-skills`); agenti MORAjo razširiti vse ujemajoče bližnjice pred delovanjem. Lastni agentski delovni tokovi skladišča živijo v `i8-` znanje, katalogizirano v [cheatsheet.md](docs/contributing/tools/agents/cheatsheet.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator phrasing: \"alle möglichen bridges und services sollen enabled, aktiviert und wenn möglich integriert sein incl. video conference\"; conservative default keeps first-deploy clean. Bridges that need an operator-issued token are documented as opt-in in the role README."
msgstr "Faza operatorja: \"alle möglichen mostovi und storitve solen omogočena, aktiviert und wenn möglich integriert sein vključno. video konferenca\"; konzervativno privzeto ohranja prvo-razporejanje čisto. Mostovi, ki potrebujejo žeton, ki ga izda operator, so dokumentirani kot možnost izbire v vlogi README."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator phrasing: \"deprecated flavor soll der alte compose bleiben\"."
msgstr "Faza operatorja: \"Zmanjšan okus sol der alte compose bleiben\"."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator phrasing: \"die variants sollen die neue integration testen\"."
msgstr "Faza operatorja: \"die variante sollen die neue integration testen\"."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator's signal that the flavor is production-intended from v1; promotion to `stable` is a separate, later milestone."
msgstr "Operaterjev signal, da je okus je proizvodnja-namerava iz v1; promocija na `stable` je ločen, poznejši mejnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator-confirmable; Frappe's Social Login Key alone does NOT consume group claims. Persisting the map in v1 unblocks the follow-up requirement without re-litigating the mapping table."
msgstr "Operater-potrjeno; Frappe's Social Logie Key sam NE porabi skupinskih zahtevkov. Vztrajanje na zemljevidu v v1 Odblokira zahtevo po spremljanju, ne da bi ponovno uredila tabelo za kartiranje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator-confirmable; matches the convention codified in [022 Zammad Decision #7](README.md#archive). No `svc-db-` role exists for Nginx frontend because it is Frappe-coupled, not a general-purpose service."
msgstr "Operator-potrjeno; ustreza konvenciji, kodificirani v [022 Zammad Odločitev #7](README.md#archive). Ne `svc-db-` Vloga za Nginx frontend obstaja, ker je Frappe-coupled, ne pa storitev splošnega pomena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator-confirmed: defer inbound; v1 = outbound only. The follow-up requirement will introduce the generic Mailu auto-mailbox hook and sweep this role at the same time."
msgstr "Operator-potrjen: odložitev vstopa; v1 = samo izhod. Nadaljnja zahteva bo uvedla splošno Mailu auto-mailbox kavelj in pometejo to vlogo hkrati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator-confirmed: keep this PR focused on the role itself. No `meta/services.yml::<app>.backup.pre_backup_hook` field is introduced here; central MariaDB + role volume snapshots are the v1 backup story."
msgstr "Operater-potrjen: naj bo ta PR osredotočen na samo vlogo. Št. `meta/services.yml::<app>.backup.pre_backup_hook` Polje je uvedeno tukaj; osrednje MariaDB + slike obsega vloge so v1 Rezervna zgodba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator-confirmed: track the actively maintained major. Self-built image (à la [015 Moodle](README.md#archive)) explicitly out of scope."
msgstr "Operator-potrjen: spremljajte aktivno vzdrževanega majorja. Samozgrajena slika (à la [015 Moodle](README.md#archive)) Izrecno izven obsega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
