# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux and Debian-based systems, this role ensures the presence of Node.js for use in Node-based applications or scripts. It serves as a foundational role for projects that depend on Node.js runtimes or utilities like Puppeteer."
msgstr "Optimizirano za Archlinux in Debian-based sistemov, ta vloga zagotavlja prisotnost Node.js za uporabo v aplikacijah ali skriptah, ki temeljijo na vozliščih. Služi kot temeljna vloga za projekte, ki so odvisni od Node.js Tekočine ali pripomočki, kot je Lutkar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for `.well-known` paths required by ACME challenges."
msgstr "Optimizirana za Archlinux okolja, ta vloga zagotavlja lahka, zanesljiva rešitev za serviranje statičnih spletnih strani. Samodejno nastavi NGINX, da služi datotekam iz vnaprej določenega imenika, vzpostavi varne povezave HTTPS in vključuje podporo za `.well-known` poti, ki jih zahtevajo izzivi ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for ``.well-known`` paths required by ACME challenges."
msgstr "Optimizirana za Archlinux okolja, ta vloga zagotavlja lahka, zanesljiva rešitev za serviranje statičnih spletnih strani. Samodejno nastavi NGINX, da služi datotekam iz vnaprej določenega imenika, vzpostavi varne povezave HTTPS in vključuje podporo za ``.well-known`` poti, ki jih zahtevajo izzivi ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux systems, this role installs the ``certbot-NGINX`` package, configures a dedicated ``systemd`` service for certificate renewal, and integrates with a ``sys-timer`` to schedule periodic renewals. After a renewal, NGINX is reloaded to apply the updated certificates immediately."
msgstr "Optimizirano za Archlinux sisteme, ta vloga namesti ``certbot-NGINX`` paket, konfigurira namenjen ``systemd`` storitev za podaljšanje veljavnosti certifikata in vključuje ``sys-timer`` načrtujejo periodična podaljšanja. Po obnovitvi se NGINX ponovno naloži za takojšnjo uporabo posodobljenih potrdil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux systems, this role installs the `certbot-NGINX` package, configures a dedicated `systemd` service for certificate renewal, and integrates with a `sys-timer` to schedule periodic renewals. After a renewal, NGINX is reloaded to apply the updated certificates immediately."
msgstr "Optimizirano za Archlinux sisteme, ta vloga namesti `certbot-NGINX` paket, konfigurira namenjen `systemd` storitev za podaljšanje veljavnosti certifikata in vključuje `sys-timer` načrtujejo periodična podaljšanja. Po obnovitvi se NGINX ponovno naloži za takojšnjo uporabo posodobljenih potrdil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role configures NGINX to act as a lightweight and efficient file server. It ensures that files are served securely, with optional directory browsing enabled, and proper MIME type handling for standard web clients."
msgstr "Optimizirana za Archlinux, ta vloga nastavlja NGINX, da deluje kot lahek in učinkovit datotečni strežnik. Zagotavlja, da se datoteke servirajo varno, z omogočenim neobveznim brskanjem po imenikih, in ustrezno ravnanje z vrsto MIME za standardne spletne stranke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role creates the required directory structure, installs and configures the sys-ctl-hlth-check script, and integrates with the **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** role. It uses the **sys-timer** role to schedule regular checks based on your customizable `OnCalendar` setting."
msgstr "Optimizirano za Archlinux, ta vloga ustvarja zahtevano strukturo imenika, namesti in konfigurira sys-ctl-hlth-check skripta, in se združuje z **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** vloga. Uporablja **sys-timer** vloga razporediti redne preglede na podlagi vaše prilagodljive `OnCalendar` Nastavitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role creates the required directory structure, installs and configures the sys-ctl-hlth-check script, and integrates with the **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** role. It uses the **sys-timer** role to schedule regular checks based on your customizable ``OnCalendar`` setting."
msgstr "Optimizirano za Archlinux, ta vloga ustvarja zahtevano strukturo imenika, namesti in konfigurira sys-ctl-hlth-check skripta, in se združuje z **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** vloga. Uporablja **sys-timer** vloga razporediti redne preglede na podlagi vaše prilagodljive ``OnCalendar`` Nastavitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role ensures secure SSL/TLS certificate generation with minimal manual intervention. It supports both ``webroot`` and ``DNS-01`` validation methods, providing flexibility based on your infrastructure needs."
msgstr "Optimizirana za Archlinux, ta vloga zagotavlja varno SSL/TLS ustvarjanje certifikatov z minimalnim ročnim posredovanjem. Podpira oboje. ``webroot`` ter ``DNS-01`` metode potrjevanja, ki zagotavljajo prožnost na podlagi potreb po infrastrukturi."

