msgid "Passing ``inventory_groups`` (the ``groups`` magic variable) drops the roles no host in the inventory carries, so they never enter the loop at all. That list is identical on every host, which is the whole point: 8aea5a9b35 measured that a per-host condition above the loop makes ansible insert blocks in host order rather than loop order, after which svc-storage-nfs-client mounted an export svc-storage-nfs-server had not deployed yet. Narrowing to a single host stays in the body's ``when``, never here."
msgstr "Prehajanje ``inventory_groups`` (o ``groups`` magična spremenljivka) opusti vloge, ki jih gostitelj v inventarju nosi, tako da nikoli ne vstopijo v zanko. Ta seznam je enak za vsakega gostitelja, kar je bistvo: 8aea5a9b35 izmerjeno, da stanje na gostitelja nad zanko naredi anzibilne bloke v zaporedju gostitelja in ne v vrstnem redu zanke, po katerem svc-storage-nfs-client montirani na izvoz svc-storage-nfs-server še niso bili razporejeni. Zoženje do enega gostitelja ostane v telesu. ``when``, Nikoli tukaj."

