# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Raft's BoltDB store is mmap + `fsync` based, so it hits exactly the locking and `fsync` semantics that keep the database engines off NFS. The deployment-modes volume model requires a placement constraint for any non-NFS volume under swarm, so the data cannot be lost on a reschedule. Same shape as [`svc-db-postgres`](../../roles/svc-db-postgres/) and the other engines."
msgstr "Raftova BoltDB trgovina je mmap + `fsync` temelji, tako da zadene točno zaklepanje in `fsync` semantika, ki preprečuje delovanje motorjev v bazi podatkov. Model volumske obremenitve uvajanja zahteva omejitev umeščanja za katero koli prostornino, ki ni manjša od NFS pod rojom, zato podatkov ob prestavitvi ni mogoče izgubiti. Enaka oblika kot [`svc-db-postgres`](../../roles/svc-db-postgres/) in druge motorje."

