msgstr "Dvigi ``ValueError`` (ni ``AnsibleError``) za prenosljivost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Raises on a duplicate id: two files declaring the same package is the missing-SPOT condition the uniqueness lint exists to prevent, so the runtime resolver must never silently pick one."
msgstr "Dvigi na dvojni ID: dve datoteki, ki razglašajo isti paket, je pogoj manjka-SPOT edinstvenost lint obstaja za preprečevanje, tako da razreševalec runtime ne sme nikoli tiho izbrati eno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
