# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Rate limiting is not among them. The proxy ships no `limit_req` or `limit_conn` anywhere, so a public MCP endpoint is only as protected as its own authentication and its declared `limits`. An operator exposing one to the open internet has to put a rate limiter in front of the vhost; the platform will not supply one."
msgstr "Med njimi ni omejitve stopnje. Posredniške ladje št. `limit_req` ali `limit_conn` kjer koli, tako da je javno MCP opazovani dogodek samo tako zaščiten kot njegova lastna avtentikacija in njegova deklarirana `limits`. Operater, ki izpostavi enega na odprtem internetu mora postaviti omejitev cen pred vhost; platforma ne bo zagotovila enega."

