msgstr "Preberi [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md), potem [Zanka vloge](../agents/action/iteration/README.md) in [Pogodba za predvajanje](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md). Preverite oblike bajtov in obnašanje vhost/TLS **v vsebniku DiD najprej**, potem pa prerazporeditev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read [Compose Loop](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) before starting."
msgstr "Preberi [Zanka sestavljanja](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) Pred začetkom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read [`.claude/settings.json`](.claude/settings.json) at every conversation start."
msgstr "Preberi [`.claude/settings.json`](.claude/settings.json) na vsakem začetku pogovora."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read [default.env](../../default.env) into `(values, comments)` tuples."
msgstr "Preberi [default.env](../../default.env) v `(values, comments)` Tupe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read [reset/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/reset/README.md), [purge/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/README.md), or [exec/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/README.md) before using the matching helper."
msgstr "Preberi [reset/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/reset/README.md), [purge/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/README.md), ali [exec/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/README.md) pred uporabo ustreznega pomočnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Read `${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/roundtrip-<app>-<mode>.log` to see which app and mode failed, and the first error."
msgstr "Preberi `${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/roundtrip-<app>-<mode>.log` videti, katera aplikacija in način nista uspela, in prvo napako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read `disable` from the environment and apply to host_vars and inventory."
msgstr "Preberi `disable` iz okolja in velja za host_vars inventar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read `docs/contributing/tools/agents/cheatsheet.md` (relative to the Infinito.Nexus repository root) and answer from it; that document is the source of truth and this skill only routes you there."
msgstr "Preberi `docs/contributing/tools/agents/cheatsheet.md` (glede na Infinito.Nexus Koren skladišča) in odgovorite iz nje; ta dokument je vir resnice in ta spretnost vas le vodi tja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read a fact from either the task_vars shape or the setup-module one."
msgstr "Preberite dejstvo iz obeh task_vars oblika ali način namestitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read a lint tool's pinned release from the ``sys-lint`` role."
msgstr "Preberite vtisnjeno orodje iz ``sys-lint`` vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read attribute names, DNs, and the server URI from `LDAP.*`. Never hardcode `uid`, `cn`, base DNs, or LDAP URIs."
msgstr "Preberite imena atributov, DNs, in strežnik URI iz `LDAP.*`. Nikoli težko kodo `uid`, `cn`, baznih DN ali URI LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read database credentials from the host's databases.csv."
msgstr "Preberite poverilnice za bazo podatkov iz gostiteljevih databases.csv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read endpoints, client identifiers, and claim names from `OIDC.*`. Never hardcode realm names, URLs, or claim strings."
msgstr "Preberite končne točke, identifikatorje strank in imena zahtevkov iz `OIDC.*`. Nikoli ne hardcode kraljestev imen, URL-jev, ali zahteva nizov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read every ``meta/packages.yml`` without deduplicating."
msgstr "Preberi vsakih ``meta/packages.yml`` brez deduplikacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read every ``services.<key>.bond`` and resolve it to a role-to-role edge."
msgstr "Preberi vsakih ``services.<key>.bond`` in ga razvozlati do meje vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read from the GHCR mirror when one is configured, falling back to the upstream registry only for images the mirror does not carry. Measured sizes are cached on disk (see :func:`_cache_dir`)."
msgstr "Preberite iz zrcala GHCR, ko je nastavljeno in pade nazaj v gornji register samo za slike, ki jih ogledalo ne nosi. Izmerjene velikosti so shranjene na disku (glej :func:`_cache_dir`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read from the generation's own manifest, so a tree written by any version is walked with the names that version used. Generations older than the manifest cannot say, and only for those does the fallback in :mod:`utils.recovery.layout` apply."
msgstr "Preberite iz lastnega manifesta generacije, tako da drevo, ki ga je napisala katera koli različica, hodi z imeni, ki se uporabljajo. Generacije starejše od manifesta ne morejo reči, in samo za tiste, ki se vrača v :mod:`utils.recovery.layout` se uporablja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read from the workflow rather than listed here, so an input added to the form is carried over without anyone remembering to teach this module about it -- the failure mode otherwise is silent: the retrigger runs with that input on its default and nothing says so."
msgstr "Berite iz delovnega toka in ne tukaj, tako da se vnos, dodan v obrazec, prenese, ne da bi se kdo spomnil, da bi učil ta modul o njem -- način okvare je sicer tih: retrigger teče s tem vhodom na privzetem in nič ne pravi tako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read or author the role's `templates/playwright.env.j2` first and keep every variable name aligned with the generated spec."
msgstr "Preberi ali avtor vloge `templates/playwright.env.j2` najprej in obdržite vsako ime spremenljivke poravnano z ustvarjenim spektrom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read strictly: a missing declaration must fail the render rather than emit a hardcoded address, which the repository forbids and lints for. Only the first entry is taken because a resolver list is capped at three and the bridge already holds one of those slots."
msgstr "Strogo preberite: manjkajoča deklaracija mora spodleteti, namesto da bi izdala kodiran naslov, ki ga repozitorij prepoveduje in prepoveduje. Samo prvi vnos je sprejet, ker je seznam reševalcev omejen na tri in most že drži eno od teh slotov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the MCP credential a provider issued, from its declared owner."
msgstr "Preberite MCP zaupanja ponudnika izdanega, od svojega prijavljenega lastnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the band for `<scope>.<category>` from `PORT_BANDS`. If absent and no `--range` is given, exit non-zero with a clear error listing the available categories."
msgstr "Preberi skupino za `<scope>.<category>` od `PORT_BANDS`. Če ga ni in ne `--range` je podano, izhod ni nič z jasno napako, ki navaja razpoložljive kategorije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the contributor SPOT and treat every MUST there as a non-negotiable acceptance criterion for the generated spec."
msgstr "Preberite prispevajoči SPOT in obravnava vsak MOUS tam kot netržno merilo sprejemljivosti za ustvarjeno specifikacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the deploy axes an operator pins in ``whitelist`` and ``priority``."
msgstr "Berite ose, če je upravljavec zatič v ``whitelist`` ter ``priority``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the gathered facts a package plan needs off either fact shape."
msgstr "Preberite zbrana dejstva. Načrt paketa je treba odstraniti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the manifest a baudolo generation carries, with nothing but ``json``."
msgstr "Preberite manifest baudolo generacije nosi, z nič drugega kot ``json``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the relay band from `PORT_BANDS.public.relay`."
msgstr "Preberite rele pas od `PORT_BANDS.public.relay`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the setup guides first if you are new to this environment."
msgstr "Najprej preberite navodila za nastavitev, če ste novi v tem okolju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the superuser of every instance that is dumped as a whole."
msgstr "Preberite superuporabnika vsakega primera, ki je odvržen kot celota."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read the template once per worker process instead of once per language."
msgstr "Predlogo preberite enkrat na delovni proces namesto enkrat na jezik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read 📖"
msgstr "Preberi 📖"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only API identity if enforceable; never disclose the global signature token or enable shorten, edit, or delete by default"
msgstr "Samo za branje API identiteta, če je izvršljiva; nikoli ne razkrije splošnega podpisa žeton ali omogoči skrajšanja, urejanja ali izbrisa privzeto"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only API user; no article, extension, template, configuration, or user mutation"
msgstr "Samo za branje API uporabnik; brez sestavka, razširitve, predloge, nastavitve ali uporabniške mutacije"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only HTTP fetches. Credentials in URLs are still discouraged. Egress is bounded by the sandbox network configuration (see [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) and any host-level firewall."
msgstr "Samo za branje HTTP prinaša. Poverilnice v URL-jih so še vedno zavrnjene. Izstop je omejen s konfiguracijo omrežja peskovnika (glej [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) in vsak požarni zid na nivoju gostitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only Mode 🔒"
msgstr "Način samo za branje 🔒"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only project identity; no task start, playbook, Terraform, shell, repository, key, inventory, environment, or user mutation"
msgstr "Identiteta projekta samo za branje; brez zagona nalog, predvajalne knjige, Terraform, lupin, skladišča, ključa, inventarja, okolja ali mutacije uporabnika"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only subcommands (`view`, `list`, `status`, `diff`, `checks`, `watch`, `download`, `clone`) do not match and remain auto-allowed via the sandbox, mirroring the GET-vs-mutation split used for `gh api`. The `deny` rules above take precedence for the highest-blast verbs (e.g. `gh repo delete`, `gh secret *`, `gh ssh-key *`)."
msgstr "Podukazi samo za branje (`view`, `list`, `status`, `diff`, `checks`, `watch`, `download`, `clone`) ne ujemajo in ostanejo samodejno dovoljeni prek peskovnika, zrcaljenje GET-vs-mutacija razcepa, ki se uporablja za `gh api`. O `deny` Zgornja pravila imajo prednost za glagole z najvišjim pritiskom (Npr. `gh repo delete`, `gh secret *`, `gh ssh-key *`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only token with field restrictions; no checkout/checkin, asset, license, accessory, user, or settings mutation"
msgstr "Žeton samo za branje z omejitvami na terenu; brez odjave/preverjanja, sredstva, licence, dodatka, uporabnika ali mutacije nastavitev"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only user restricted to named wikis/spaces; no page, attachment, script, rights, extension, or user mutation"
msgstr "Samo bralni uporabnik je omejen na imenovane wikis/prostore; brez strani, priloge, skripte, pravic, razširitve ali uporabniške mutacije"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Readable code is easier to trust."
msgstr "Branje kode je lažje zaupati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Readable code speeds review and debugging."
msgstr "Berljiva koda hitrosti pregled in razhroščevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading a Requirement"
msgstr "Branje zahteve"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading a failure 🔍"
msgstr "Branje napake 🔍"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading or mutating Actions environments."
msgstr "Branje ali mutiranje okolja dejanj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading or mutating Actions permissions on a repo."
msgstr "Branje ali mutiranje Dovoljenja dejanj na repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading or mutating GitHub releases."
msgstr "Branje ali mutira GitHub sprosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading or mutating branch protection on a specific branch."
msgstr "Branje ali mutirajoča zaščita podružnice na določeni veji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading or mutating branch/tag rulesets (branch protection successor)."
msgstr "Branje ali mutiranje pravil o podružnici/označitvi (Naslednik zaščite podružnice)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading or mutating repository webhooks."
msgstr "Branje ali mutiranje spletnih trnkov iz skladišča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading the block off the page rather than out of the tree is the point: a reader copies from the site, so that is what has to work. Nothing in the repository is consulted at replay time."
msgstr "Branje blok stran in ne iz drevesa je točka: bralec kopije iz strani, tako da je tisto, kar mora delovati. Ob ponovnem predvajanju se ne posvetuje z ničemer v skladišču."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading the result"
msgstr "Branje rezultata"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reading, merging and writing the gettext catalogs under ``locale/``."
msgstr "Branje, združevanje in pisanje katalogov Gettext pod ``locale/``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads"
msgstr "Branje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads 'applications' and 'group_names' from Ansible variables and discovers service providers from the role-local services metadata."
msgstr "Branje 'applications' ter 'group_names' iz nespremenljivih spremenljivk in odkriva ponudnike storitev iz metapodatkov o vlogah in lokalnih storitvah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads GitHub Actions runs via the ``gh`` CLI and maps the per-app compose (\"docker\") and swarm deploy jobs to pass/fail/abort states. A mode job that ran but did not finish successfully (cancelled, timed out, still running) counts as a failure; a mode the role has no job for is N/A and never fails the aggregated ``total`` column."
msgstr "Preberi dejanja GitHub teče preko ``gh`` CLI in zemljevid sestavljanja po aplikaciji (\"docker\") in roji napotijo delovna mesta na pass/fail/abort države. Opravilo načina, ki je potekalo, vendar ni uspešno končalo (preklicano, čas je potekel, še vedno teče) šteje za neuspeh; način, za katerega vloga nima zaposlitve, je N/A in nikoli ne odpove skupnemu ``total`` Kolumna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Reads ``services.sso.{enabled,shared,flavor,oauth2.*}`` from the merged applications payload and derives the semantic predicates and flavor-specific sub-values that the SSO-proxy wiring, the redis-sidecar gating, and the consumer-side playwright env all need."
msgstr "Branje ``services.sso.{enabled,shared,flavor,oauth2.*}`` iz združenih aplikacij tovor in izpelje semantične predikate in podvrednosti, značilne za okus, ki jih SSO-proxy ožičenje, redis-sidecar gating, in potrošniški dramatik env vse potrebe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads `default.env` plus the current runtime context (distro, GHA/Act flags, df/meminfo-derived sizes, sha256 secrets, ...) and writes the resulting `.env` at the repo root. Implementation lives in `utils.env`; this package is the CLI entry point."
msgstr "Branje `default.env` plus trenutni okvir časa delovanja (distro, zastavice GHA/Act, velikosti df/meminfo, ša256 skrivnosti, ...) in napiše nastalo `.env` na repo korenu. Izvajanje `utils.env`; Ta paket je vstopna točka CLI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads every ``*.xml`` under <reports-dir> (one per test target, written by scripts/tests/code/run.sh via ``--junitxml``). Per report: a headline with the pass/fail/skip counts and total time, failures rendered opened, and the full per-test table (name, status, duration) collapsed in a details block, slowest first."
msgstr "Vsak prebere ``*.xml`` pod <reports-dir> (eno na testno tarčo, ki jo je napisal scripts/tests/code/run.sh preko ``--junitxml``). Na poročilo: naslov z pass/fail/skip število in skupni čas, odkrite napake in celotna tabela na preskus (ime, status, trajanje) Najprej se je zrušila v bloku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads from `log_byte_offset` to end and asserts that every required role's body actually executed in that slice (i.e. at least one TASK block for the role ended with a non-skip status)."
msgstr "Beri od `log_byte_offset` za konec in trdi, da je vsako zahtevano telo vloge dejansko izvedeno v tem rezini (tj. vsaj en blok TASK za vlogo, ki se je končal s statusom brez zadrževanja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads from the mirror first and falls back to the upstream registry only for images the mirror does not carry, so a full sweep does not spend the upstream's rate limit. Determinate answers are cached on disk."
msgstr "Najprej se odčita iz ogledala in se vrne v gornji register samo za slike, ki jih ogledalo ne nosi, tako da celoten pregled ne porabi zgornje meje. Določeni odgovori so shranjeni na disku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Reads only ``roles/*/meta/{services,server}.yml`` files."
msgstr "Samo za branje ``roles/*/meta/{services,server}.yml`` datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads or mutates repository collaborator membership. Mutations escalate access; even GETs leak the contributor list. Access changes belong to a human reviewer."
msgstr "Čita ali mutira članstvo v repozitoriju. Mutacije stopnjujejo dostop; celo GET pušča seznam prispevajočih. Spremembe dostopa pripadajo človeškemu pregledovalcu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads or mutates repository deploy keys. Deploy keys are full-power repo-auth credentials: adding one creates a persistent backdoor; removing one breaks deployments. Manage out-of-band only."
msgstr "Prebere ali mutira skladišče razporediti ključe. Ključi za odpiranje so poverilnice za repo-avto s polno močjo: dodajanje enega ustvarja obstojna zadnja vrata; odstranjevanje enega odmora. Upravljajte samo izvenpasovno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads route through :func:`utils.cache.yaml.load_yaml_any` (already memoised per-path). :func:`get_role_types` caches its return per role-directory string so repeated calls during a single test sweep stay free."
msgstr "Prebere pot skozi :func:`utils.cache.yaml.load_yaml_any` (že zabeležen na poti). :func:`get_role_types` Ponavljajoč se klic med enim samim testom ostane prost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads the ``INFINITO_LIFECYCLES`` value from ``default.env`` so the envelope has a single source of truth instead of being duplicated as a hardcoded set at every consumer."
msgstr "Prebere ``INFINITO_LIFECYCLES`` vrednost od ``default.env`` Torej ima ovojnica en sam vir resnice, namesto da bi jo podvajali kot zakodirano zbirko pri vsakem potrošniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads the canonical dict-of-dicts shape from ``roles/<role>/meta/volumes.yml`` (YAML key = semantic short name; optional ``name:`` field = docker volume name). Entries with ``type: config`` / ``type: secret`` emit their respective top-level sections; everything else flows through the volumes section."
msgstr "Odčita obliko kanoničnega izreka ``roles/<role>/meta/volumes.yml`` (Ključ YAML = semantično kratko ime; neobvezno ``name:`` polje = ime glasnosti docker). Vpisi z ``type: config`` / ``type: secret`` oddajajo svoje odseke na najvišji ravni; vse ostalo teče skozi odsek obsega."

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span
# lost=['svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/services.yml.']
# gained=['svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/storitve.yml.']
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Prebere združeni-config SPOT z iskanjem('config');
# okus sam je deklariran v svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/storitve.yml.
msgid "Reads the merged-config SPOT through lookup('config'); the flavor itself is declared in svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/services.yml."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads variables from env file (default: .env, generated from default.env)"
msgstr "Prebere spremenljivke iz datoteke env (privzeto: .env, ustvarjen iz default.env)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real Nextcloud integration coupling: end-to-end tests now assert genuine two-way OAuth/API coupling for *gitlab*, *mattermost*, *openproject*, *zammad*, *peertube*, *discourse*, *github*, *google*, *jira*, *mastodon*, *matrix*, *moodle* and *suitecrm*, rather than the mere presence of a connect button. All integration OAuth credentials are stored Nextcloud-encrypted via ICrypto (sensitive app values), OpenProject and Zammad secrets survive a re-deploy, and OpenWebUI/Ollama is wired in as a real *integration_openai* chat backend. Bridges with no Nextcloud-33 plugin (Moodle, SuiteCRM) are disabled."
msgstr "Resnično Nextcloud integracijska spenjača: preskusi od konca do konca zdaj veljajo za resnično dvosmerno OAuth/API spenjača za *gitlab*, *snov*, *odprti projekt*, *zammad*, *peertube*, *diskurz*, *github*, *google*, *jira*, *mastodon*, *matrika*, *moodle* ter *suitecrm*, namesto zgolj prisotnost gumba za povezavo. Vse integracijske poverilnice OAuth so shranjene Nextcloud- šifriran preko ICrypto (občutljive vrednosti aplikacij), OpenProject ter Zammad skrivnosti preživijo ponovno postavitev in OpenWebUI/Ollama je povezan kot pravi *integration_openai* chat backend. Mostovi brez Nextcloud-Kaj?33 vstavek (Moodle, SuiteCRM) so onemogočeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real scenario where the component is the surface, OR `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` with a pointer to the role-local test that covers it."
msgstr "Realni scenarij, kjer je komponenta površina, ALI `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` s kazalcem na lokalni preskus vloge, ki ga zajema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real-Time Chat/App"
msgstr "Klepetanje/app v realnem času"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real-time collaboration over WebSockets through the proxy."
msgstr "Sodelovanje v realnem času preko WebSockets preko posrednika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Realm definition, including the `preferred_username` mapper"
msgstr "Opredelitev področja, vključno z `preferred_username` maper"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Realm of the broker's service account (typically the same as user realm)."
msgstr "Področje računa posredniške storitve (običajno enako kot uporabniško področje)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Realm the client is registered in"
msgstr "Realm stranka je registrirana v"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Realm where end-user accounts live (typically same as admin realm)."
msgstr "Realm, kjer živijo računi končnih uporabnikov (običajno enako kot admin sfera)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Razlog"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reason: pytest runs every test in one process. Without a shared cache each test re-walks the same tree and re-reads the same files; the walk cost multiplies by the number of tests that use it. Migrating a single test from a raw walk to `iter_project_files_with_content` dropped it from ~26 s to ~1.3 s because every subsequent test served the walk and the file contents from the process-level cache."
msgstr "Razlog: Pytest izvede vsak preskus v enem postopku. Brez skupnega predpomnilnik vsak test ponovno hodi isto drevo in ponovno bere iste datoteke; hoja stroški množijo s številom testov, ki ga uporabljajo. Premik enega testa iz surove hoje v `iter_project_files_with_content` odvrgel iz26 s to ~1.3 s ker je vsak naslednji test služil hoji in vsebine datoteke iz predpomnilnika ravni procesa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Rebuilds the local inventory and keeps the runtime `.password` file."
msgstr "Ponovno gradi lokalni inventar in ohranja čas delovanja `.password` Datoteka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Rebuilt the env pipeline around a SPOT default.env at the repository root, retired the env/ subtree and the env.development marker, folded ci.env into default.env, and put every runtime knob under the `INFINITO_` namespace (BUILDKIT_ENABLED, OUTER_NETWORK_MTU auto-detected from the host route, CONTAINER_CA_ENABLED, and the path/image overrides)"
