msgid "Recursive tree listing under ``cli/<parts>/`` with Unicode tree connectors, per-entry emoji glyphs, and multi-line wrapped descriptions aligned to a single description column. ``max_depth`` is 1-based: ``None`` (default) walks the full tree, ``1`` shows only the immediate children."
msgstr "Rekurzivni seznam dreves pod ``cli/<parts>/`` s priključki za drevesa Unicode, na vstopne emoji glife in večvrstičnimi zavitimi opisi, usklajenimi z enim samim opisnim stolpcem. ``max_depth`` m 1- osnovano: ``None`` (privzeto) hodi po polnem drevesu, ``1`` prikazuje le neposredne otroke."

