# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Replaces the tip commit instead of adding one. The agent cannot see whether the operator committed on top in the meantime (a release commit, a signed commit), so an amend can rewrite a commit it never authored and detach its tags and signature; on a pushed tip it forces a force-push. Follow-up changes land as a new commit."
msgstr "Zamenja konico, namesto da bi dodala eno. Zastopnik ne vidi, ali se je operater medtem zavezal na vrhu (zaveza za sprostitev, podpisana zaveza), tako da lahko sprememba prepiše obvezo, ki je ni nikoli avtor in odklopi svoje oznake in podpis; na potisnjeni konici prisili silo-push. Nadaljnje spremembe zemljišč kot nova zaveza."

