msgid "Run the role's deployed backup unit against the live data."
msgstr "Preveri, ali je rezervna enota v živo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential `backup-nfs-to-local` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (`rsync -a --delete`, with the shared `<state>/backup` root protected from deletion and never copied in). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Zaženi skript; najprej zažene varnostno enoto. (sveža razlika `backup-nfs-to-local` generacija živega izvoza), nato zrcali posnetek v tarčo (`rsync -a --delete`, s skupnim `<state>/backup` root zaščiten pred izbrisom in nikoli kopiran v). `--no-safety-backup` Preskoči delovanje enote, ko tarča nima ničesar, kar bi bilo vredno rešiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume's mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Zaženi skript; najprej zažene varnostno enoto. (sveže diferencialne baudolo generacije vsakega volumna in baze podatkov), reši glasnost nastavka in zrcali posnetek v njem (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` Preskoči delovanje enote, ko tarča nima ničesar, kar bi bilo vredno rešiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (``rsync -a --delete``, with the shared ``<state>/backup`` root protected from deletion and never copied in). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Zaženi skript; najprej zažene nameščeno varnostno enoto (sveža razlika ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generacija živega izvoza), nato zrcali posnetek v tarčo (``rsync -a --delete``, s skupnim ``<state>/backup`` root zaščiten pred izbrisom in nikoli kopiran v). ``--no-safety-backup`` Preskoči delovanje enote, ko tarča nima ničesar, kar bi bilo vredno rešiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume’s mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Zaženi skript; najprej zažene nameščeno varnostno enoto (sveže diferencialne baudolo generacije vsakega volumna in baze podatkov), razreši priklopno točko glasnosti in zrcali posnetek v njej (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` Preskoči delovanje enote, ko tarča nima ničesar, kar bi bilo vredno rešiti."

