# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Self-built and stdlib-only: the served surface is three JSON-RPC methods, and a dependency-free image has no transitive supply chain to audit per release. The container runs as a non-root user with a read-only root filesystem and all Linux capabilities dropped."
msgstr "Samozgrajena in stdlib-samo: servirana površina je tri metode JSON-RPC, slika brez odvisnosti pa nima tranzitne dobavne verige za revizijo na sprostitev. Vsebnik teče kot uporabnik, ki ni koreninski, z datotečnim sistemom, ki se uporablja samo za branje, in vse zmožnosti Linuxa padejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
