msgstr "Samogostiteljska infrastruktura CI za izvajanje dejavnosti GitHub"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Self-hosted CI runners: new *svc-runner* role plus *cli/deploy/runner* command spin up N containerised GitHub Actions runners on any server, adding to the 20 GitHub-hosted ones. Each runner is isolated (own subnet, ports, inventory, Docker volume, DNS) and auto-re-registers. Runs on Debian, Ubuntu and Arch, supports Docker-in-Docker, and ships a full in-runner E2E deploy test. See the *svc-runner* README."
msgstr "Samogostujoči tekači CI: novi *svc-runner* vloga plus *cli/deploy/runner* ukaz spin up N zabojniki GitHub Dejanja tekači na katerem koli strežniku, dodajanje na 20 Gostitelji GitHuba. Vsak tekač je izoliran. (lastni podmreža, pristanišča, inventar, docker prostornina, DNS) in avto-re-registre. Teče na Debian, Ubuntu in Arch, podpira Docker-in-Docker, in ladje polno v teku E2E preskus razporeditve. Glejte *svc-runner* -Preberi."

