msgstr "Brat ali sestra `container_address` za ukaze na ravni storitev. Medtem `container_address` se odloči za identifikacijo vsebnika za čas delovanja za `docker exec`, ta pogled vrne naslovljiv obrazec za `container service ps`, `container service logs`, in `container ps --filter \"label=com.docker.swarm.service.name=...\"`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Sidecars and adapters use an immutable version and digest, documented provenance and licence, a non-root user, a read-only root filesystem, dropped capabilities, no host or control-plane socket, explicit CPU/memory/PID limits, a provider-only network, and no unrelated outbound access."
msgstr "Stranski prikolici in adapterji uporabljajo nespremenljivo različico in prebavljivost, dokumentirano poreklo in licenco, uporabnik, ki ni koreninski datotečni sistem, samo za branje, spuščene sposobnosti, brez gostitelja ali vtičnice za nadzor, eksplicitno CPU/memory/PID omejitve, omrežje samo za ponudnike in brez nepovezanega zunanjega dostopa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Signal"
msgstr "Signal"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Silence errors only intentionally."
msgstr "Napake molka le namenoma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Silently exits if not running on WSL2"
msgstr "Tiho izstopi, če ne teče po WSL2"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Silently exits if systemd is already running (`/run/systemd/system` exists)"
msgstr "Tihi izhodi, če sistemd že teče (`/run/systemd/system` obstaja)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simple and lightweight"
msgstr "Enostaven in lahek"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simple code changes more safely."
msgstr "Enostavnejše spremembe kode so bolj varne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simple code is easier to change."
msgstr "Enostavno kodo je lažje spremeniti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simple override via templates in your role directory"
msgstr "Enostaven nadzor preko predlog v imeniku vlog"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simpleicons service (if services.simpleicons.enabled) for connect"
msgstr "Storitev s preprostimi ikonami (če services.simpleicons.enabled) za povezavo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simplified CI image publishing workflow Removed the ci-publish workflow to ensure images are always built on version tags, while keeping stable tagging gated on successful checks."
msgstr "Poenostavljen potek dela za založništvo slik CI je odstranil ci-objava, da se zagotovi, da so slike vedno zgrajene na oznakah različic, hkrati pa ohranja stabilno označevanje vrat ob uspešnih preverjanjih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simplifies first-time setup of Tor Browser"
msgstr "Poenostavi prvo nastavitev brskalnika Tor"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simplify event management with **Pretix**, an open-source ticketing system for conferences, workshops, and cultural events. Pretix empowers organizers with flexible ticket sales, attendee management, and secure payment integrations, all under your control."
msgstr "Poenostavljeno upravljanje dogodkov z **Pretix**, odprtokodni sistem vozovnic za konference, delavnice in kulturne prireditve. Pretix pooblašča organizatorje s fleksibilno prodajo vstopnic, vodenje udeležencev in varno integracijo plačil, vse pod vašim nadzorom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Simulates a full Docker Swarm cluster on a single CI runner (or host via `make swarm-zombie` / `make roundtrip`) and deploys one application through it end to end: provision an inventory, deploy every variant round with the in-deploy Playwright e2e, run the backup+restore DR drill between rounds, then prove state survives a worker reschedule."
msgstr "Simulira polno Docker Swarm grozd na enem zaganjalniku CI (ali preko gostitelja `make swarm-zombie` / `make roundtrip`) in uporablja eno aplikacijo, ki se konča s koncem: zagotavljanje inventarja, uporaba vseh različic krog z in-deploy Playwright e2e, zažene rezervno + restore DR vrtanje med naboji, nato dokazati stanje preživi delavca prestaviti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single"
msgstr "Enojna"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for \"which address block does role X own\". The block is declared once, in that role's ``meta/networks.yml``; anything that has to reason about the deployment's own address space reads it from here instead of repeating the literal, which is how a CIDR ends up stated twice and then drifts."
msgstr "Enojna SPOT za \"kateri naslovni blok ima vlogo X\"Blok je razglašen enkrat v tej vlogi. ``meta/networks.yml``; Vse, kar ima razlog za lastni naslov, ga bere od tu, namesto da bi se ponavljalo dobesedno, kar pomeni, da se CIDR konča dvakrat in nato odplava."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for every container probe in the repo. The service name is the only positional argument, everything else comes from the service's ``meta/services.yml`` entry:"
msgstr "Posamično za vsako sondo. Servisno ime je edini pozicijski argument, vse drugo prihaja iz servisa. ``meta/services.yml`` vnos:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for every published port in the repo. A term is either the short list form or the dict form; pass one or more."
msgstr "Enojni SPOT za vsako objavljeno pristanišče v repo. Izraz je bodisi oblika s kratkim seznamom ali dikt obrazec; mimo enega ali več."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for swarm replica calculation across the repo."
msgstr "Enojni SPOT za repliko rojev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for the address Docker assigns as the gateway of a role network, used where a container has to reach the host side of its own bridge."
msgstr "Enojni SPOT za naslov Docker dodeli kot prehod mreže vlog, ki se uporablja, kjer mora zabojnik doseči gostiteljsko stran lastnega mostu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for the file the ``msmtp_curl`` healthcheck touches after msmtp exits 0. A deploy-time assertion that the relay accepted the startup mail has to name the same path the probe writes, and a second literal would drift the moment the probe moves it."
msgstr "Enojna SPOT za datoteko ``msmtp_curl`` Pregled stanja po izhodih msmtp 0. Vzpostavljanje-čas trditev, da rele sprejel startup pošto mora imenovati isto pot, ki jo sonda piše, in drugi dobesedni bi odneslo trenutek, ko ga sonda premakne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for the swarm/compose split on container addressing."
msgstr "Enojni SPOT za roj/sestav na naslov zabojnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for turning `networks.local.subnet` into an address matcher. A swarm task carries an address on every network it joins, all of them site-local, so a service that must bind to one of them needs this rather than a generic \"site-local\" selector."
msgstr "Enojni SPOT za obračanje `networks.local.subnet` V naslov. Naloga roja nosi naslov na vsakem omrežju, ki se mu pridruži, vse to na kraju samem, zato storitev, ki se mora vezati na enega od njih, potrebuje to namesto generičnega. \"site-local\" selektor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single Sign-On"
msgstr "Enojni znak"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single Sign-On (SSO)"
msgstr "Enojni znak (SSO)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single commit (or a tight, related sequence) lands the whole ansible-flavor addition; no half-scaffolded intermediate commits."
msgstr "Enojna zaveza (ali tesno sorodno zaporedje) pristane celoten ansible-flavor dodatek; brez pol-kavarne vmesne obveznosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single point of truth for diagnose constants."
msgstr "Ena točka resnice za diagnosticiranje konstant."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single point of truth for proprietary / external API credentials. Resolves a dotted path against the effective ``API`` mapping: the declaration in group_vars/all/18_api.yml with the calling scope's override merged over it. Routing every access through this plugin keeps one place to change how proprietary API credentials are sourced (vault, env, secret manager, a different provider abstraction) without touching the call sites."
msgstr "Enotna točka resnice za lastniške / zunanje API poverilnice. Reši pikčasto pot proti učinkovitemu ``API`` Kartiranje: deklaracija group_vars/all/18_api.yml -Združena je. Routing vsak dostop skozi ta plugin ohranja eno mesto za spremembo, kako lastniško API Pridobivanje poverilnic (Trezor, env, tajni manager, druga zbirka ponudnikov) brez dotikanja klicnih mest."

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span lost=[] gained=['"']
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Enotna točka resnice za sidro repo korena, ki
# nadomešča ponavljajoče ``[playbook_dir, '<rel>'] | path_join`` kotlovna
# plošča na prečni roli include/template/script/src Klicne strani. Pridruži se
# vsakemu izrazu, tako da lahko pot mine celo ("roles/x/y.yml") ali razdeljena
