# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single responsibility per module:"
msgstr "Enotna odgovornost na modul:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single role"
msgstr "Enotna vloga"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single shared-service loader entry point"
msgstr "Enotna vstopna točka za nakladalnike z deljenimi storitvami"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single sign-on"
msgstr "Enojni vpis"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single sign-on is wired in by default whenever the upstream software supports it: the role MUST configure OIDC against [web-app-keycloak](../../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/) when an OIDC client adapter exists upstream, and MUST configure LDAP against [svc-db-openldap](../../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/) when an LDAP adapter exists upstream. If a role offers both, it MUST default to OIDC and MAY expose LDAP behind a service flag. Roles whose upstream ships neither MUST document the exception in their `README.md`."
msgstr "Enojni vpis je privzeto povezan, kadar ga podpira gornja programska oprema: vloga MORA nastaviti OIDC proti [web-app-keycloak](../../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/) ko OIDC odjemalec adapter obstaja v smeri proti toku, in MORA nastaviti LDAP proti [svc-db-openldap](../../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/) ko obstaja adapter LDAP proti toku. Če vloga ponuja oboje, MORA privzeto OIDC in MAY izpostaviti LDAP za zastavo storitev. Vloge, katerih gornje ladje niti ne smejo dokumentirati izjeme `README.md`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single sign-on via Keycloak"
msgstr "En sam podpis preko Keycloak"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single sign-out does not propagate"
msgstr "Enojni odpis se ne razmnožuje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source for the args shared by the standalone provider stack (``compose.yml.j2``) and the local sidecar (``service.yml.j2``). ``-ip=localhost`` is deliberate: the all-in-one server otherwise advertises the auto-detected swarm ingress IP, which is unreachable for gRPC and hangs ``weed shell`` during bucket provisioning."
msgstr "Enotni vir za zanke, ki jih deli samostojni kup ponudnika (``compose.yml.j2``) in lokalne stranske prikolice (``service.yml.j2``). ``-ip=localhost`` je namerno: strežnik vse-v-enem sicer oglašuje samodejno zaznani roj ingres IP, ki je nedostopen za gRPC in visi ``weed shell`` med oskrbo z vedrom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source for the two consumers that must agree: ``extend_inventory`` turns the placements into inventory groups, and ``matrix`` turns the same placements into ``remote-2-local.backup_providers``. Exception: the group membership is also what runs ``user-backup`` on that node, so a node named as a provider without its group has no authorized pull key, and ``roles/svc-bkp-remote-2-local/templates/script.sh.j2`` counts one error per failing provider and exits 1 for the whole unit."
msgstr "Enotni vir za oba potrošnika, ki se morata strinjati: ``extend_inventory`` spremeni umestitve v skupine zalog in ``matrix`` spremeni enake položaje v ``remote-2-local.backup_providers``. Izjema: članstvo v skupini je tudi tisto, kar teče ``user-backup`` na tem vozlišču, tako vozlišče imenovano kot ponudnik brez svoje skupine nima pooblaščenega ključa za vlečenje, in ``roles/svc-bkp-remote-2-local/templates/script.sh.j2`` šteje eno napako na neuspešnega ponudnika in izstopi 1 za celotno enoto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for \"service -> provider role(s)\" mapping."
msgstr "En sam vir resnice za \"storitev -> vloga ponudnika(s)\" Kartiranje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for both ends of the pipeline: the client drops a translation this rejects, and the release gate reports one that survived anyway. A check on one side only lets every run rewrite what the other side then condemns, which never converges."
msgstr "En sam vir resnice za oba konca cevovoda: stranka spusti prevod, ki ga ta zavrne, in izhodna vrata poročajo o enem, ki je vseeno preživel. Ček na eni strani samo omogoča, da vsak tek ponovno napiše tisto, kar druga stran nato obsodi, ki se nikoli ne združi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for the CI app-discovery query."
msgstr "En sam vir resnice za iskanje aplikacije CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Single source of truth for the node's onion identity: ``ensure_node_onion`` mints/reuses the key files here and the ``svc-net-tor`` role copies them into the running daemon. Lives outside anything the deploy regenerates and is mounted into the DiD at ``{playbook_dir}/.onion-identity/hs``."
msgstr "En sam vir resnice za identiteto čebule: ``ensure_node_onion`` kovnice/ponovno uporablja ključne datoteke tukaj in ``svc-net-tor`` Kopirajo jih v privrženca. Živi zunaj vsega, kar se regenerira in je vgrajeno v DiD na ``{playbook_dir}/.onion-identity/hs``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for the per-addon enable flags consumed by the Playwright addon-gating helper (``tests/addon-gating.js`` -> ``skipUnlessAddonEnabled``). Replaces the error-prone per-template Jinja loop: it resolves the materialised ``addons`` mapping for ``application_id`` and returns one ``<ADDON_ID>_ADDON_ENABLED=<true|false>`` line per declared addon (sorted by env key, newline-joined), where the env-key derivation matches addon-gating.js exactly."
msgstr "En sam vir resnice za vsak addon omogoča zastave, ki jih porabi Playwright addon-gating pomočnik (``tests/addon-gating.js`` - > ``skipUnlessAddonEnabled``). Zamenja napako-prone na-template Jinja zanko: to reši materializirano ``addons`` kartiranje za ``application_id`` in vrne eno ``<ADDON_ID>_ADDON_ENABLED=<true|false>`` vrstica na deklarirani dodatek (razvrščeno po env ključu, novi povezavi), kadar se izpeljava ključa env ujema addon-gating.js Točno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for: parsing raw service-config resource scalars, evaluating the enabled/shared/container predicates, walking a role's services (resolving template-gated shared services to the provider role's entity via the service registry, loading each service once unless ``dedup=False``), and aggregating the collected rows into a budget."
msgstr "Enotni vir resnice za: razčlenjevanje surovih storitev-zaupnih sredstev skalarjev, ocenjevanje enabled/shared/container predikati, hoja storitev vloge (reševanje s predlogo povezanih skupnih storitev subjektu vloge ponudnika prek registra storitev in nalaganje vsake storitve enkrat, razen če ``dedup=False``), in združevanje zbranih vrstic v proračun."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth mapping short words to display emojis, and back."
msgstr "En sam vir resnice, ki opisuje kratke besede za prikaz emojisa in nazaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single spot for the node Tor SOCKS endpoint so ``127.0.0.1:<port>`` and its siblings are never hand-composed: the port comes from ``svc-net-tor services.tor.ports.local.socks`` and callers only pass the host (default 127.0.0.1)."
msgstr "Eno mesto za končno točko vozlišča Tor SOCKS ``127.0.0.1:<port>`` in njegovi bratje in sestre niso nikoli ročno sestavljeni: pristanišče prihaja iz ``svc-net-tor services.tor.ports.local.socks`` in klicarji samo mimo gostitelja (privzeto 127.0.0.1)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single spot for the outbound Tor SOCKS proxy URL of a containerised client, so the swarm/compose split is not restated per consuming role."
msgstr "Eno samo mesto za URL posrednika Tor SOCKS za odjemalca, ki je v zabojniku, tako da se roj/sestava ne obnovi na porabniško vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single-container deployment via Docker Compose"
msgstr "Uporaba enojnih zabojnikov prek Docker Compose"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single-int TCP ports a deployed role asks for by name under ``ports.onion``."
msgstr "Enostranska pristanišča TCP, za katera se zahteva vloga po imenu ``ports.onion``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single-int TCP ports of every deployed service flagged ``exposed: true`` in the variant-merged ``applications`` view, sorted."
msgstr "Enostranska pristanišča TCP za vsako razporejeno storitev, ki je označena ``exposed: true`` v različici-zliti ``applications`` Pogled, urejeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single-port categories (everything except `relay`)"
msgstr "Kategorije enopristanišč (vse, razen `relay`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single-source-of-truth resolver for a role's unified SSO surface."
msgstr "Razreševalec enega samega vira resnice za enotno SSO površino vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single-task role with minimal overhead."
msgstr "Enojna vloga z minimalnimi režijskimi stroški."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single-user ActivityPub bookmarking site federating public bookmarks to Mastodon and the Fediverse"
msgstr "En uporabnik ActivityPub zaznamek stran federating javne zaznamke za Mastodon in Fediverse"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Site name MUST match the HTTP Host header. The Frappe site is created with ``bench new-site next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>`` and ``FRAPPE_SITE_NAME_HEADER`` on the frontend nginx maps Host → site."
msgstr "Ime mesta se mora ujemati z glavo HTTP. Frappe stran je ustvarjena z ``bench new-site next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>`` ter ``FRAPPE_SITE_NAME_HEADER`` na začetku ginx zemljevidi Gostitelj → stran."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Site name MUST match the HTTP Host header. The Frappe site is created with `bench new-site next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>` and `FRAPPE_SITE_NAME_HEADER` on the frontend nginx maps Host → site."
msgstr "Ime mesta se mora ujemati z glavo HTTP. Frappe stran je ustvarjena z `bench new-site next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>` ter `FRAPPE_SITE_NAME_HEADER` na začetku ginx zemljevidi Gostitelj → stran."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Situation"
msgstr "Situacija"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "Spretnost"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skills 🎓"
msgstr "Spretnosti 🎓"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skills 🗂️"
msgstr "Spretnosti 🗂️"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skip everything under ``<root>/tests/``."
msgstr "Preskoči vse pod ``<root>/tests/``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skip hostname configuration when running inside Docker containers"
msgstr "Preskoči nastavitev imena gostitelja med vožnjo znotraj zabojnikov Docker"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skipped ✓"
msgstr "Preskoči ✓"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skipped. Its implicit `if:` condition is `success() && (steps.diff.outputs.changed == 'true')`, and `success()` is false after the token step failed."
msgstr "Preskočil. Implicitno `if:` stanje `success() && (steps.diff.outputs.changed == 'true')`, in `success()` je lažen, ko je žeton korak spodletel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skips [orchestrator](../../../../.github/workflows/call-orchestrator.yml), finishes green through the lightweight scope gate."
msgstr "Preskoči [Orkester](../../../../.github/workflows/call-orchestrator.yml), konča zeleno skozi lahka vrata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skips a single `lookup('config', …)` call from path-validation passes. Use when the call resolves against runtime-only state, typically self-referential roles."
msgstr "Preskoči enega `lookup('config', …)` klic s prehodov za podaljšanje poti. Uporabite, ko se klic reši proti stanju, ki se uporablja samo za čas delovanja, običajno samoreferenčne vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skips any client that is not deployed on this host, or whose ``mcp`` block is disabled or unshared."
msgstr "Preskoči vse stranke, ki niso razporejeni na tem gostitelju, ali katerih ``mcp`` blok je onemogočen ali nedeljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skips any client that is not deployed on this host, or whose `mcp` block is disabled or unshared."
msgstr "Preskoči vse stranke, ki niso razporejeni na tem gostitelju, ali katerih `mcp` blok je onemogočen ali nedeljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skips both the live ref-update warning and the non-semver-pin lint for that entity's `ref:` key."
msgstr "Preskoči tako opozorilo v živo kot tudi nesemver-pin za to podjetje `ref:` Ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skips both the live version-update warning and the non-semver-pin lint for that image's `version:` key."
msgstr "Preskoči tako opozorilo v živo-posodobitev različice in ne-semver-pin lin za to sliko je `version:` Ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skips probing the literal HTTP(S) URL. Use for CDN roots and API base URLs that 4xx without a path."
msgstr "Preskoči preverjanje dobesednega HTTP(S) URL. Uporaba za korenine CDN in API osnovne URL- je, ki 4xx brez poti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Skips the live update warning for a pin that declares its upstream in an `update:` block."
msgstr "Preskoči opozorilo o posodobitvi v živo za zatič, ki ga objavi v zgornjem toku `update:` blok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Slack"
msgstr "Pomanjkanje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Slightly more latency for streaming data due to buffering"
msgstr "Nekoliko več latentnosti za pretakanje podatkov zaradi pufriranja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Slot"
msgstr "Reža"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Slot index of this checkout; 0 is the primary one."
msgstr "Indeks slota te odjavne pošte; 0 je glavna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Small and medium-sized enterprises that require secure collaboration and centralized authentication."
msgstr "Mala in srednje velika podjetja, ki zahtevajo varno sodelovanje in centralizirano avtentikacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Small cleanup reduces future friction."
msgstr "Majhno čiščenje zmanjša trenja v prihodnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Small test-local callbacks or path formatters where a named function would add noise."
msgstr "Majhni testno-lokalni klici ali potne formate, kjer bi imenovana funkcija dodala hrup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Smaller role fixes: ERPNext bypasses the v16 setup wizard per app and clears the Frappe cache after applying social-login, LDAP and email configuration; Friendica strips a trailing slash from the base URL and makes the admin-follow Playwright test idempotent; Funkwhale starts its API with gunicorn and binds the port."
msgstr "Manjša vloga določa: ERPNext obide v16 nastavite čarovnik za vsako aplikacijo in počisti predpomnilnik Frappe po uporabi družbene login, LDAP in e-poštne nastavitve; Frienica odstrani sledilno poševnico iz osnovnega URL-ja in naredi admin-slednjo Playwright test idempotent; Funkwhale začne svojo API s pištolo in veže vrata."

