# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``get_entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Razgreti način - `<stack>_<service_key>`, Kako se ujemata? Docker Swarm navaja vsako storitev in kako `container service ps` sprejme jih. Ime sklada izhaja iz ``application_id`` prek ``get_entity_name`` filter, zrcaljenje, kako ``docker stack deploy`` sestavi ime sklada ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Swarm mode - lupina subshell, ki razreši identifikacijsko oznako posode za tekoče opravilo ob času exec, npr. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Toplo imenuje vsako storitev ``<stack>_<key>`` in ne sprejema ujemanja predpone; pomočnik sestavi to ime iz STACK in SERVICE_KEY Args. Podloga prelaga resolucijo na trenutek exec, pri čemer se izogne zastareli ID in parcialnim pastem za vrnitev rešene vrednosti ob času var-resolucije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - the same reference, prefixed with the in-cluster registry host:port (e.g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) when ``swarm.registry.host`` and ``swarm.registry.port`` are set. With no registry configured, swarm falls back to the un-prefixed form."
msgstr "Swarm način - ista referenca, predpostavljena z gostiteljem registra in-cluster:port (Npr. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) ko ``swarm.registry.host`` ter ``swarm.registry.port`` so pripravljeni. Brez nastavljenega registra roj pade nazaj v nepopravljeno obliko."

