msgid "Taiga is ideal for developers, designers, and agile teams who want:"
msgstr "Taiga je idealen za razvijalce, oblikovalce in agilne ekipe, ki želijo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr "Taiga preusmeri `/` za javnost `/discover` izložba, ki omogoča golo prijavno povezavo, ne pa tudi vstopne točke OIDC; samo `/login` zavezuje direktivo SSO (glej opombo v [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). Skupna oseba kot vedno vstopi na mestu korena, tako da nikoli ne more doseči TaigaSSO gumb. Taiga's AngularJS lupina dodatno izpostavlja odjava samo skozi `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` Direktive, ki jih splošni pomočnik za odjavo v aplikaciji ne more aktivirati. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) zato izjavljam `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; enakovredno vožnjo vodi lokalna vloga; `test-login-oidc.js` ter `test-login-native.js` Specifikacije, ki vstopajo na `/login` in se odjaviti skozi TaigaLastni nadzor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects ``/`` to the public ``/discover`` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only ``/login`` binds the SSO directive (see the note in ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` and log out through Taiga’s own control."
msgstr "Taiga preusmeri ``/`` za javnost ``/discover`` izložba, ki omogoča golo prijavno povezavo, ne pa tudi vstopne točke OIDC; samo ``/login`` zavezuje direktivo SSO (glej opombo v ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` in se odjaviti skozi Taigalastni nadzor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role handles the installation of Firefox using the system’s package manager (``pacman``). It deploys a ``policies.json`` file to Firefox’s distribution directory, ensuring that critical extensions are automatically installed via Firefox Enterprise Policies."
msgstr "Prilagojena za Arch Linux, ta vloga ročaj namestitev Firefox uporaba upravljalnika paketov sistema (``pacman``). ``policies.json`` datoteko na FirefoxDistribucijska mapa, ki zagotavlja, da so kritične razširitve samodejno nameščene preko Firefox Podjetniška politika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role handles the installation of Firefox using the system’s package manager (`pacman`). It deploys a `policies.json` file to Firefox’s distribution directory, ensuring that critical extensions are automatically installed via Firefox Enterprise Policies."
msgstr "Prilagojena za Arch Linux, ta vloga ročaj namestitev Firefox uporaba upravljalnika paketov sistema (`pacman`). `policies.json` datoteko na FirefoxDistribucijska mapa, ki zagotavlja, da so kritične razširitve samodejno nameščene preko Firefox Podjetniška politika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role installs GCC and optionally sets up additional development utilities. It ensures the package is installed via the system package manager and ready to compile code in a variety of programming languages."
msgstr "Prilagojena za Arch Linux, ta vloga namesti GCC in neobvezno vzpostavlja dodatne razvojne storitve. Zagotavlja, da je paket nameščen preko sistemskega upravljalnika paketov in pripravljen za pripravo kode v različnih programskih jezikih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role monitors containers for failure states and initiates a controlled restart of affected Compose configurations. If port conflicts prevent recovery, the role stops the affected stack, restarts Docker, and recreates the container environment."
msgstr "Prilagojena za Arch Linux, ta vloga spremlja posode za stanja napak in sproži nadzorovan ponovni zagon prizadetih konfiguracij Compose. Če pristaniški konflikti preprečijo okrevanje, vloga ustavi prizadeti sklad, ponovno zažene Docker in ponovno ustvari kontejnersko okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for creative professionals and developers, this role streamlines the process of setting up a portfolio site. It automates tasks such as Docker container configuration, dynamic routing via NGINX, and repository integration, so you can concentrate on perfecting your content and design. Enjoy a responsive layout and easy-to-modify YAML files that let you rapidly update your online presence without deep technical intervention."
msgstr "Ta vloga, prilagojena ustvarjalnim strokovnjakom in razvijalcem, racionalizira proces vzpostavitve portfeljske spletne strani. Samodejno usklajuje naloge, kot so konfiguracija posode Docker, dinamično usmerjanje prek NGINX in povezovanje skladišča, tako da se lahko osredotočite na izpopolnitev vsebine in oblikovanja. Uživajte v odzivni razpored in enostavno modificirajte datoteke YAML, ki vam omogočajo hitro posodabljanje vaše spletne prisotnosti brez globoke tehnične intervencije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for environments that require a central data repository, this role:"
msgstr "Prilagojena za okolja, ki zahtevajo centralno podatkovno bazo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Take a deploy job title apart."
msgstr "Razčleni naslov za zaposlitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Take source 1 in full, then fill up to 20 from source 2. A row that source 1 already covers is not added twice."
msgstr "Vzemi vir 1 v celoti, nato napolnite do 20 iz vira 2Vrstica tega vira 1 pokrovi se ne dodajo dvakrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Take the roles in this order, and stop when the stack is busy rather than queueing them:"
msgstr "Vzemite vloge v tem vrstnem redu, in ustavite, ko sklad je zaseden, namesto da jih čakalno vrsto:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Takes a caller-supplied 32-byte AES-256-GCM-96 key via `current_key`, accepting a literal value or an `env://` / `file://` reference, plus a `current_key_id`. Upstream caveat: recommended only where an existing source of trust already holds the key."
msgstr "Za to je potreben klicar. 32- Byte AES-256-GCM...96 ključ prek `current_key`, sprejeti dobesedno vrednost ali `env://` / `file://` sklic, plus a `current_key_id`. Upstream caveat: priporoča samo, če obstoječi vir zaupanja že drži ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Takes a list of extension names and returns the subset that needs a custom library install on top of the official postgres base image (the contrib extensions bloom, pg_trgm and unaccent are already in the base — those are filtered out). Each returned entry is a dict with:"
msgstr "Vzame seznam imen razširitev in vrne podmnožico, ki potrebuje knjižnico po meri namesti na vrhu uradne osnovne slike postgres (podaljški korit cvetijo, pg_trgm in so že v bazi – te so filtrirane). Vsak vrnjen vnos je dikt z:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
