# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Targeting user environments on Arch Linux (e.g., Manjaro), this role sets up the official ``nextcloud-client`` and dynamically links key directories from the user’s home folder to Nextcloud. This makes it easy to use the Nextcloud client without needing to manually configure folders."
msgstr "Usmerjanje uporabniških okolij na Arch Linuxu (npr., Manjaro), ta vloga ustanovi uradnika ``nextcloud-client`` in dinamično povezuje ključne imenike iz uporabnikove domače mape na Nextcloud. To omogoča enostavno uporabo Nextcloud odjemalec brez potrebe po ročnem nastavljanju map."

