# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Frappe site-setup wizard is **bypassed** on first deploy via auto-bootstrap: `bench new-site` with `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` arguments, plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus a post-start API call from the role's `tasks/` to mark the wizard as completed (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). A fresh deploy lands directly on the ERPNext desk."
msgstr "Čarovnik za nastavitev lokacije Frappe je **obvozljena** ob prvem zagonu prek samodejnega zagona: `bench new-site` z `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` argumenti plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus po začetku API poziv iz vloge `tasks/` označiti čarovnika kot zaključenega (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). Sveža uporaba zemljišča neposredno na ERPNext miza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
