# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Infinito.Nexus API is a public, read-only REST service built with [FastAPI](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/). It answers every question an app built on Infinito.Nexus asks about the platform: which roles exist, what their metadata says, how they are categorised, which bundles combine them, what the history of the repository and its forks looks like, and how all of that reads in each of the 184 ISO 639-1 languages."
msgstr "– Infinito.Nexus API je javna, bralna storitev REST, zgrajena z [FastAPI](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/). Odgovori na vsako vprašanje aplikacija zgrajena na Infinito.Nexus sprašuje o platformi: katere vloge obstajajo, kaj pravijo njihovi metapodatki, kako so razvrščeni, kateri svežnji jih združujejo, kakšna je zgodovina skladišča in njegovih vilic ter kako se vse to glasi v vsakem od 184 ISO 639-Kaj?1 jeziki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Infinito.Nexus API is a public, read-only REST service built with `FastAPI <https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/>`__. It answers every question an app built on Infinito.Nexus asks about the platform: which roles exist, what their metadata says, how they are categorised, which bundles combine them, what the history of the repository and its forks looks like, and how all of that reads in each of the 184 ISO 639-1 languages."
msgstr "– Infinito.Nexus API je javna, bralna storitev REST, zgrajena z `FastAPI <https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/>`__. Odgovori na vsako vprašanje aplikacija zgrajena na Infinito.Nexus sprašuje o platformi: katere vloge obstajajo, kaj pravijo njihovi metapodatki, kako so razvrščeni, kateri svežnji jih združujejo, kakšna je zgodovina skladišča in njegovih vilic ter kako se vse to glasi v vsakem od 184 ISO 639-Kaj?1 jeziki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak **Userinfo** preview for the user contains a `groups` array with the full path. If it does not, the scope is not reaching the userinfo endpoint and the mapping will not fire."
msgstr "– Keycloak **Userinfo** ogled za uporabnika vsebuje a `groups` Razpored s polno potjo. Če se ne, obseg ne doseže končne točke uporabniškegainfo in kartiranje ne bo sprožilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak OIDC client for ERPNext is **auto-provisioned** via `web-app-keycloak`, consistent with every other OIDC-consuming role in the repo."
msgstr "– Keycloak Odjemalec OIDC za ERPNext m **Samodejno predvidena** preko `web-app-keycloak`, ki se ujema z vsako drugo OIDC-porabniško vlogo v repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree behind these paths is materialised by a per-application group-ldap-mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), anchored at `/<group_root>/<application_id>` with `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."
msgstr "– Keycloak skupinsko drevo za temi potmi se upodobi z vsako aplikacijo grupa-dramp-mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), zasidrana na `/<group_root>/<application_id>` z `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree is built by **per-application** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Each deployed application gets one mapper anchored at `/roles/<application_id>` whose LDAP filter `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` surfaces only that application's role groups. The mapper uses the LDAP `description` attribute as the visible Keycloak group name, so the resulting group paths carry no redundant prefix."
msgstr "– Keycloak skupinsko drevo je zgrajeno z **na uporabo** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Vsaka aplikacija dobi zasidrano karto `/roles/<application_id>` katerih filter LDAP `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` Površine le tiste vlogene skupine aplikacije. Mapper uporablja LDAP `description` atribut kot viden Keycloak ime skupine, tako da nastale skupinske poti ne nosijo odvečne predpone."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The MCP surface ships disabled by default and is independent of the host role's `lifecycle`: a `beta` host role MUST NOT imply that its MCP surface is stable. An MCP surface is only considered validated once its acceptance criteria are met end to end."
msgstr "MCP površinske ladje privzeto onemogočene in je neodvisna od vloge gostitelja `lifecycle`: a `beta` vloga gostitelja NE sme pomeniti, da je njegova MCP površina stabilna. Površina MCP se šteje za validirano šele, ko so izpolnjena merila sprejemljivosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The MDAD inventory is templated to enable a conservative-default bridge set plus Jitsi + Element Call. Bridge enablement is gated on `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.matrix.plugins.<bridge>')`. v1 default-ON set (operator-confirmed): `mautrix_signal`, `mautrix_telegram`, `mautrix_twitter`, `mautrix_slack`, `appservice_irc`, `heisenbridge`, `discord`, `gitter`, `hookshot`. Default-OFF (operator opts in): every bridge that needs a third-party API token the operator must obtain manually — `facebook`, `instagram`, `googlechat`, `mautrix_whatsapp`, `sms`, `appservice_kakaotalk`, and the superseded `mx_puppet_{slack,discord}`."
msgstr "Inventar MDAD je oblikovan tako, da omogoča konzervativno-privzeti mostni set plus Jitsi + Element Call. Omogočitev mostu je nastavljena `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.matrix.plugins.<bridge>')`. v1 privzeto-ON set (operator potrjen): `mautrix_signal`, `mautrix_telegram`, `mautrix_twitter`, `mautrix_slack`, `appservice_irc`, `heisenbridge`, `discord`, `gitter`, `hookshot`. Privzeto- OFF (operator se odloči v): vsak most, ki potrebuje tretjo osebo API Žeton, ki ga mora upravljavec pridobiti ročno – `facebook`, `instagram`, `googlechat`, `mautrix_whatsapp`, `sms`, `appservice_kakaotalk`, in nadomesti `mx_puppet_{slack,discord}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The MariaDB image tag to pull (e.g. `10.6`, `10.11`, or `latest`)."
msgstr "– MariaDB značka slike za vlečenje (Npr. `10.6`, `10.11`, ali `latest`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Matomo API token is generated during the Matomo bootstrap and persisted to disk by `sys-token-store`. It is then resolved through `lookup('users')`, which hydrates tokens from the store at runtime."
msgstr "– Matomo API žeton nastane med Matomo škornji past in vztraja na disku `sys-token-store`. Nato se reši skozi `lookup('users')`, ki vlaži žetone iz trgovine v teku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Matrix role gains an ansible flavor (requirement 025) built on a unified compose template, with full Docker-in-Docker isolation, host-network mode cascaded to the addons and Jitsi, a central Postgres backend sharing the MATRIX_POSTGRES variables, and a central coturn aligned to the shared coturn variables for the MASH role. A dedicated MDAD runner image (python 3.13-slim with docker 28.0.4 CLI, migration validated against v2026.05.18.0) mounts the Infinito self-signed CA into both the runner and Synapse, and bootstrap now recovers cleanly from a stale marker."
msgstr "– Matrix vloga pridobi lahkoten okus (zahteva 025) zgrajena na enotni komponirani predlogi, s popolno izolacijo Docker-in-Docker, način mreže gostitelja kaskadirano na addons in Jitsi, osrednji Postgres backend delitev MATRIX_POSTGRES spremenljivke in centralni koturn, usklajen s skupnimi spremenljivkami koturna za vlogo MASH. Namenska podoba gonilnika MDAD (piton 3.13-Slim z dockerjem 28.0.4 CLI, migracija potrjena proti v2026.05.18.0) priklopi Infinito samopodpisan CA v tekača in Synapse, in škornji Trap zdaj popolnoma izterja iz zastojev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Meta Infinite Graph is an essential tool for analyzing, auditing, and maintaining the modular structure of the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem. It provides a clear overview of all roles and how they are interconnected."
msgstr "Meta Infinite Graf je bistveno orodje za analizo, revizijo in vzdrževanje modularne strukture Infinito.Nexus ekosistem. Zagotavlja jasen pregled vseh vlog in njihove medsebojne povezanosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Certbot Automation role ensures that Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS certificates stay valid without manual intervention. It enhances the security and reliability of web services by automating certificate lifecycle management."
msgstr "– NGINX Certbot Automation vloga zagotavlja, da šifriranje potrdil SSL/TLS ostane veljavno brez ročnega posredovanja. Z avtomatizacijo upravljanja življenjskega cikla certifikatov povečuje varnost in zanesljivost spletnih storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Certbot Automation role ensures that Let’s Encrypt SSL/TLS certificates stay valid without manual intervention. It enhances the security and reliability of web services by automating certificate lifecycle management."
msgstr "– NGINX Certbot Automation vloga zagotavlja, da šifriranje potrdil SSL/TLS ostane veljavno brez ročnega posredovanja. Z avtomatizacijo upravljanja življenjskega cikla certifikatov povečuje varnost in zanesljivost spletnih storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX File Server role sets up a simple and secure static file server using [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/). It provides an easy way to serve files over HTTPS, including directory listing, `.well-known` support, and automatic SSL/TLS certificate integration via Let's Encrypt."
msgstr "NGINX File Server vloga vzpostavi preprost in varen statični datotečni strežnik z uporabo [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/). Zagotavlja enostaven način za serviranje datotek nad HTTPS, vključno z seznamom imenika, `.well-known` podpora, in avtomatska integracija certifikata SSL/TLS preko Šifrirajmo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX File Server role sets up a simple and secure static file server using `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__. It provides an easy way to serve files over HTTPS, including directory listing, ``.well-known`` support, and automatic SSL/TLS certificate integration via Let’s Encrypt."
msgstr "NGINX File Server vloga vzpostavi preprost in varen statični datotečni strežnik z uporabo `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__. Zagotavlja enostaven način za serviranje datotek nad HTTPS, vključno z seznamom imenika, ``.well-known`` podpora, in avtomatska integracija certifikatov SSL/TLS preko Šifrirajmo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX HTTPS Certificate Retrieval role ensures that your NGINX-served domains have valid, automatically issued SSL/TLS certificates, improving web security without manual intervention."
msgstr "– NGINX HTTPS Certificate Retrieval vloga zagotavlja, da imajo vaše domene, ki jih hrani NGINX, veljavne, samodejno izdane certifikate SSL/TLS, ki izboljšujejo spletno varnost brez ročnega posega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Static HTML Server role provides a simple and efficient method to publish static websites with HTTPS, perfect for personal homepages, landing pages, or small projects."
msgstr "Statika NGINX HTML Server vloga zagotavlja preprosto in učinkovito metodo za objavo statičnih spletnih strani s HTTPS, kot nalašč za osebne domače strani, strani za pristanek ali majhne projekte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NSS half of *sys-hostname* becomes its own role, *sys-svc-nss*."
msgstr "– NSS polovica *sys-hostname* postane njegova vloga, *sys-svc-nss*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC client used by the application has the `groups` client scope attached as a **default** scope (not optional). The design note in [RBAC design](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) explains why."
msgstr "Odjemalec OIDC, ki ga uporablja aplikacija, ima `groups` obseg stranke, povezan kot **privzeto** Področje uporabe (ni neobvezno). Projektna opomba v [Zasnova RBAC](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) pojasni zakaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC group path `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` already namespaces by application, so an `openbao-` prefix would be redundant, and the repo's other `meta/rbac.yml` files use bare role names."
msgstr "Pot skupine OIDC `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` že imenski prostori po aplikaciji, tako da `openbao-` predpona bi bila odveč, repo pa drugo `meta/rbac.yml` datoteke uporabljajo imena golih vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login + RBAC paths are covered by ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` / ``test-rbac-roles.js``, the Discourse round-trip by ``test-discourse-roundtrip.js``."
msgstr "OIDC login + RBAC poti so zajeti ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` / ``test-rbac-roles.js``, Discourse okrogla pot mimo ``test-discourse-roundtrip.js``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login + RBAC paths are covered by `test-admin-oidc-login.js` / `test-rbac-roles.js`, the Discourse round-trip by `test-discourse-roundtrip.js`."
msgstr "OIDC login + RBAC poti so zajeti `test-admin-oidc-login.js` / `test-rbac-roles.js`, Discourse okrogla pot mimo `test-discourse-roundtrip.js`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) are mandatory because they gate SSO login: when one of them is the selected flavor and the system hides the native login form, an un-installed OIDC app leaves the instance with no usable login path. Failing at install time surfaces the version-pin mismatch immediately rather than as a downstream login timeout in the Playwright e2e suite."
msgstr "Prijava OIDC (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) so obvezni, ker so vrata SSO prijava: ko je eden od njih izbrani okus in sistem skriva izvorni prijavni obrazec, nenameščen OIDC aplikacija zapusti primerek brez uporabne poti prijave. Neuspeh pri namestitvi časovnih površin neujemanje version-pin takoj in ne kot dolvodni čas prijave v Playwright e2E apartma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC role's `groups_claim` (JSON-pointer capable) names the claim holding the user's groups; those values resolve against identity groups of `type=external` via group aliases on the auth mount, which carry the policies."
msgstr "Vloga OIDC `groups_claim` (Sposobnost kazalca JSON) navaja terjatev, ki imajo skupine uporabnika; te vrednosti se rešujejo proti identitetnim skupinam `type=external` preko skupinskih vzdevkov na auth mount, ki nosijo police."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC username claim is paired with the LDAP login attribute by design. See [ldap.md](ldap.md) for the LDAP-side rule."
msgstr "Trditev o uporabniškem imenu OIDC je v paru z prijavnim atributom LDAP po zasnovi. Glej. [ldap.md](ldap.md) za pravilo na strani LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ONLY clean-skip mechanism is an EXPLICIT role-declared opt-out via env flag rendered in `templates/playwright.env.j2`:"
msgstr "Samo čistilni mehanizem je EXPLICIT-ova odločitev o izvzetju prek env zastave, ki je na voljo v `templates/playwright.env.j2`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Odoo configuration file is templated to `/etc/odoo/odoo.conf`"
msgstr "Nastavitvena datoteka Odoo je sporočena `/etc/odoo/odoo.conf`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Odoo configuration file is templated to ``/etc/odoo/odoo.conf``"
msgstr "Nastavitvena datoteka Odoo je sporočena ``/etc/odoo/odoo.conf``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The PR-scope short-circuits in [scope.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/pr/scope.sh) (documentation-only, agent-only) still apply at the entry layer. They skip the orchestrator entirely and are independent of the diff-driven whitelist resolution above."
msgstr "Kratka vezja PR-skopa v [scope.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/pr/scope.sh) (samo dokumentacija, agent) še vedno velja na vstopni plasti. Orkester preskočijo v celoti in so neodvisni od zgoraj diff vodene ločnice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright ``biber`` persona is blocked permanently. ``meta/services.yml`` restricts ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` to the ``web-app-baserow`` administrator RBAC group, so a non-admin identity is rejected by the oauth2-proxy before Baserow renders, and no deploy step provisions a Baserow account for that user."
msgstr "Playwright ``biber`` Persona je trajno blokirana. ``meta/services.yml`` omejitve ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` k ``web-app-baserow`` Skrbniška skupina RBAC, zato oauth zavrne identiteto, ki ni privzeta2-proksi pred Baserow določa in ne uvaja postopne določbe Baserow račun za tega uporabnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright `biber` persona is blocked permanently. `meta/services.yml` restricts `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` to the `web-app-baserow` administrator RBAC group, so a non-admin identity is rejected by the oauth2-proxy before Baserow renders, and no deploy step provisions a Baserow account for that user."
msgstr "Playwright `biber` Persona je trajno blokirana. `meta/services.yml` omejitve `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` k `web-app-baserow` Skrbniška skupina RBAC, zato oauth zavrne identiteto, ki ni privzeta2-proksi pred Baserow določa in ne uvaja postopne določbe Baserow račun za tega uporabnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright container image is declared in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` under the `playwright` service entry (`image:` + `version:`). CI mirrors that image into GHCR through the standard mirror pipeline before deploy tests run, so Playwright jobs do not depend on direct pulls from MCR during the test phase."
msgstr "Slika posode Playwright je deklarirana v `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` v okviru `playwright` vnos storitve (`image:` + `version:`). CI zrcali sliko v GHCR po standardnem zrcalnem cevovodu pred izvedbo preskusov, tako da Playwrightova opravila niso odvisna od neposrednih vlečenj iz MCR v preskusni fazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright per-test default of 30 s is too tight for several flows. Use `test.setTimeout(<ms>)` at the top of the test body (after the gates) and document the reason in a comment when the scenario includes any of:"
msgstr "Privzeto za Playwright na test 30 s je pretesno za več tokov. Uporaba `test.setTimeout(<ms>)` na vrhu preskusnega telesa (po vratih) in navesti razlog v pripombi, kadar scenarij vključuje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright spec at [`playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) currently exercises the **administrator** path only: Keycloak SSO into the admin backend plus the local form-login emergency hatch (`?fallback=local`). The non-admin RBAC path via the canonical `biber` user is not yet covered."
msgstr "Spec na Playwrightu [`playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) trenutno izvaja **upravitelj** samo pot: Keycloak SSO v hrbtenico admin in lokalno zasilno loputo (`?fallback=local`). Neadmin RBAC pot preko kanoničnega `biber` uporabnik še ni zajet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright spec at ```playwright.spec.js`` <./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__ currently exercises the **administrator** path only: Keycloak SSO into the admin backend plus the local form-login emergency hatch (``?fallback=local``). The non-admin RBAC path via the canonical ``biber`` user is not yet covered."
msgstr "Spec na Playwrightu ```playwright.spec.js`` <./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__ currently exercises the **administrator** path only: Keycloak SSO into the admin backend plus the local form-login emergency hatch (``?fallback=local``). The non-admin RBAC path via the canonical ``biber`` uporabnik še ni zajet."

