msgid "The Playwright suite is split per login surface **and persona** (the runner globs every ``*.js`` under ``files/playwright/``):"
msgstr "Apartma Playwright je razdeljen na prijavno površino **in persona** (Tekač se zgrudi. ``*.js`` pod ``files/playwright/``):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The PostgreSQL database is backed up by the central backup roles; the asset volume is backup-ready by convention."
msgstr "– PostgreSQL baza podatkov je podprta z osrednjimi rezervnimi vlogami; obseg sredstev je pripravljen na podlagi konvencije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Pull Request MUST be linked to the related work item in [project.infinito.nexus](https://project.infinito.nexus/) and back."
msgstr "Zahteva za vlečenje mora biti povezana s povezano delovno točko v [project.infinito.nexus](https://project.infinito.nexus/) In nazaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Python helper is intentionally self-contained and unit-testable"
msgstr "Python pomočnik je namerno samostojen in enosmerno testiran."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The REST API answers ``inputs: null`` for a finished workflow_dispatch, so the inputs are recovered from the run itself: short ones from the title (``config_from_title``), the long ones from a called job's log (``inputs_from_jobs``), which the title truncates."
msgstr "NAJBOLJŠI API Odgovori ``inputs: null`` za zaključeno workflow_dispatch, tako se vložki izterjajo iz samega teka: kratke iz naslova (``config_from_title``), Dolgi iz dnevnika službe. (``inputs_from_jobs``), ki je naslov skrajša."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Root CA private key is generated **unencrypted** (automation-friendly). Protect file permissions."
msgstr "Root CA zasebni ključ je ustvarjen **nešifrirano** (avtomatizacija prijazna). Zaščitite dovoljenja datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT declaration with the scope's override merged over it."
msgstr "SPOT deklaracija z obsegom je združena nad njim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, next to ``modes``: both state what the role CAN do, which is why the deploy matrix narrows a row by them. ``meta/tests.yml`` is the other kind of statement - what CI should skip exercising - and an image that exists for one architecture only is not a testing preference."
msgstr "SPOT je ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, poleg ``modes``: oba navajata, kaj vloga LAHKO naredi, zato uporaba matrice zoži vrsto z njima. ``meta/tests.yml`` je druga vrsta izjave - kaj naj KI preskoči izvajanje - in podoba, ki obstaja samo za eno arhitekturo, ni preferenca za testiranje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. A missing ``modes`` block, a missing ``<mode>`` entry, or a missing ``enabled`` key all mean the role participates in that mode (default ``True``)."
msgstr "SPOT je ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. Manjka. ``modes`` blok, manjka ``<mode>`` vnos ali manjka ``enabled`` vse pomeni vlogo, ki sodeluje v tem načinu (privzeto ``True``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is parsed with a plain-string line parser instead of PyYAML: the env build runs during bootstrap (make install-system-python) before any Python dependency exists, so this module must stay stdlib-only. Only plain ``KEY: \"value\"`` entries can be read this way; a Jinja expression or a missing key is a hard error."
msgstr "SPOT se razčlenjuje z navadnim razčlenjevalnikom vrvi namesto PyYAML: env build teče med boottrap (install-system-python) Preden obstaja odvisnost od Pythona, mora ta modul ostati samo stdlib. Samo navaden ``KEY: \"value\"`` vnose lahko preberete na ta način; Jinja izraz ali manjka ključ je težka napaka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSE session travels through the shared Redis channel layer, so the stream and the message POST may land on different replicas."
msgstr "Seja SSE potuje skozi skupno Redis kanalski sloj, tako da lahko tok in sporočilo POST pristaneta na različnih replikah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (``sociallogin``) and LDAP (``user_ldap``) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (``sociallogin``) in LDAP (``user_ldap``) prijavne površine so zajete v OIDC/LDAP Playwrightovih specifikacijah (zahteve 017/018)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (`sociallogin`) and LDAP (`user_ldap`) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (`sociallogin`) in LDAP (`user_ldap`) prijavne površine so zajete v OIDC/LDAP Playwrightovih specifikacijah (zahteve 017/018)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO back-channel pin, added automatically. On an onion deployment the OIDC endpoints handed to an application are public ``.onion`` authorities. That is right for the browser, which reaches them through Tor, but unroutable for the application's own server-side calls (code-to-token exchange, JWKS, userinfo): a container resolves ``.onion`` through Tor's resolver, not through DNS. Pinning the provider to a reachable address sends those calls over the local network to the proxy that already serves the vhost. Skipped unless the application has SSO enabled and the provider vhost is an ``.onion`` name, so it is a no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "Zatič SSO, dodan samodejno. Pri razporeditvi čebule so končni rezultati OIDC, ki so bili predloženi vlogi, javni. ``.onion`` organe. To je prav za brskalnik, ki jih doseže preko Tor, vendar neuspel za klice na strani strežnika aplikacije (izmenjava kode za žeton, JWKS, userinfo): posoda se reši ``.onion`` Skozi Torovo rešitev, ne skozi DNS. Pritrjevanje ponudnika na dosegljiv naslov pošlje te klice preko lokalnega omrežja posredniku, ki že služi vhost. Preskoči, razen če je aplikacija SSO omogočeno in ponudnik vhost je ``.onion`` Ime, tako da je ne-op na Clearnet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Sphinx configuration, extensions and generators live in [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Deploy that role to build and serve the site."
msgstr "Konfiguracija Sfinge, razširitve in generatorji živijo v [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Vključite to vlogo za gradnjo in služenje mestu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check emits warning annotations for HTTP `429`, `500`, and `503` (rate-limited or temporarily unavailable) via [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."
msgstr "Preverjanje dosegljivosti lokacije oddaja opozorilne oznake za HTTP `429`, `500`, in `503` (obrestna mera omejena ali začasno ni na voljo) preko [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check skips template placeholders and reserved local or example hosts such as `localhost` and `*.example`."
msgstr "Preverjanje dosegljivosti URL preskoči predlogo, ki se nahaja in rezervirane lokalne ali primerne gostitelje, kot so `localhost` ter `*.example`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check treats HTTP `401`, `403`, and `405` as reachable (auth-gated or method-restricted servers, not dead links)."
msgstr "Preverjanje dosegljivosti URL obravnava HTTP `401`, `403`, in `405` kot dosegljivo (strežniki z omejeno zmožnostjo upravljanja ali metodami, ne pa mrtve povezave)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check treats read and connect timeouts as warnings."
msgstr "Preverjanje dosegljivosti URL obravnava prebrane in povezane premore kot opozorila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The YAML key is the semantic short name. Each entry value MAY carry ``name`` (the docker volume name); when absent and ``type`` is ``volume``, callers default the docker name to the semantic key."
msgstr "Ključ YAML je semantično kratko ime. Vsaka vstopna vrednost LAHKO nosi ``name`` (ime glasnosti dockerja); kadar ni in ``type`` m ``volume``, klicarji privzeto ime docker na semantični ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Zammad helpdesk role completes its single-sign-on schema unification, with the variant matrix and Playwright test suite brought in line with the new shape."
msgstr "– Zammad vloga službe za pomoč uporabnikom dopolnjuje poenotenje sheme z enim samim znakom, pri čemer sta variantna matrika in testna suita Playwright usklajena z novo obliko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [GitHub Actions self-hosted runner](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners) is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "– [GitHub-ova dejanja samogostujoči tekač](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners) je agent, ki upravlja GitHub Actions delo potek delovnih mest na vaši infrastrukturi namesto GitHub-gostitelj strojev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [`apps/`](apps/) subtree is split by verb (the user intent) and scope:"
msgstr "– [`apps/`](apps/) poddrevo je razdeljeno z glagolom (namen uporabnika) in področje uporabe:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [`bundles/`](bundles/) subtree mirrors the same axes for inventory bundles (`fresh.sh` ≈ initialize, `update.sh` ≈ update)."
msgstr "– [`bundles/`](bundles/) poddrevesna ogledala enake osi za pakete inventarja (`fresh.sh` `update.sh` )."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [`container/`](container/) subtree holds the in-container halves invoked by the host wrappers and follows the same verb/scope layout; see [container/](container/README.md)."
msgstr "– [`container/`](container/) poddrevo ima polovice v zabojniku, na katere se sklicujejo ovoji gostitelja, in sledi istemu glagolu/postavitvi; glej [vsebnik/](container/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [alias](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) repository is the RECOMMENDED way to define CLI shortcuts so frequently used commands do not have to be retyped. The effective repository is the `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` value in the generated `.env`."
msgstr "– [vzdevek](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) Skladišče je način, kako definirati bližnjice CLI tako pogosto uporabljane ukaze, da jih ni treba pretipkati. Učinkovito skladišče je `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` vrednost ustvarjenega `.env`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [lint.md](testing/lint.md) page covers repository-wide code quality expectations such as diff quality, maintainability, and conventions."
msgstr "– [lint.md](testing/lint.md) stran zajema vsa pričakovanja glede kakovosti kode, kot so kakovost diff, trajnost in konvencije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [per-role meta layout](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) already lists `addons`, `plugins`, and `modules` among the keys *inlined* under the primary service entity. This requirement promotes that concept to a first-class, per-file `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` topic (one file per addon, file root IS the addon spec), the same move requirement 011 made for `meta/info.yml` and requirement 008/009 made for other meta topics."
msgstr "– [Metapostavitev na rolo](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) že na seznamu `addons`, `plugins`, in `modules` med ključi *vstavljen* v okviru primarne storitvene enote. Ta zahteva spodbuja ta koncept v prvorazredno datoteko na datoteko `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` tema (ena datoteka na addon, koren datoteke je addon spec), enaka zahteva po premiku 011 izdelan za `meta/info.yml` in zahteva 008/009 za druge meta teme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `.onion` is a **deploy-time input**: a CLI helper mints the v3 key offline during inventory build, vaults it, and sets `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. It must NOT be a runtime fact — `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` is consumed at build time (LDAP base, CA, applications cache). The role restores the minted key into the hidden-service volume before Tor starts."
msgstr "– `.onion` a **vnos časa uvajanja**: a CLI pomočnik meti v3 Ključ odklopljen med gradnjo inventarja, sef in set. `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. To ne sme biti čas delovanja dejstvo – `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` se porabi v času gradnje (Podlaga LDAP, CA, predpomnilnik programov). Vloga vrne ključ v skrito storitev, preden Tor začne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `@playwright/test` version pinned into the rendered `package.json` comes from `playwright.version` in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` via the `image_version` filter. That YAML value is the single source of truth for the Playwright version."
msgstr "– `@playwright/test` Verzija ukleščena v prevedeno `package.json` prihaja iz `playwright.version` v `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` prek `image_version` filter. Ta vrednost YAML je edini vir resnice za različico Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `API.cloudflare.api_token` value (declared in `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, read via `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) must contain a valid Cloudflare API Token.   This token is used for all DNS operations and ACME (SSL/TLS certificate) challenges that require access to your Cloudflare-managed domains."
msgstr "– `API.cloudflare.api_token` vrednost (prijavljeno v `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, berite preko `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) mora vsebovati veljavno Cloudflare API Token. Ta žeton se uporablja za vse operacije DNS in ACME (SSL/TLS certifikat) izzivi, ki zahtevajo dostop do domen, ki jih upravlja oblak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow grants broad access to the `docker` CLI (alongside every other shell command) under the assumption that no production containers share the host. Non-mutating-image subcommands (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) can disrupt or destroy container state. Under test-only usage, the blast radius is bounded to ephemeral state that can be recreated from the compose stack."
msgstr "– `Bash(*)` omogočiti donacijam širok dostop do `docker` CLI (poleg vseh drugih lupinskih ukazov) pod predpostavko, da se gostitelju ne bodo pridružili proizvodni zabojniki. Podukazi brez mutacije (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) lahko moti ali uniči stanje zabojnika. Pri uporabi samo za preskus je polmer eksplozije omejen na efemeralno stanje, ki ga je mogoče rekonstruirati iz skladalnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow lets the agent run any Makefile target without prompting. The `Makefile` is checked into git and reviewed on every pull request, so targets themselves are trusted. Every action a target performs still runs inside the sandbox."
msgstr "– `Bash(*)` dovoli agentu zagnati vsako Makefile tarčo brez takojšnjega. – `Makefile` se preverja v git in pregleda na vsako zahtevo pull, tako da so tarče same zaupa. Vsako dejanje, ki ga opravi tarča, še vedno teče v peskovniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `Corefile.tmpl` MUST be the source of truth. It is rendered to `Corefile` by [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), which substitutes its `${VAR}` placeholders in-process, using values from `.env` (generated from [default.env](../../default.env), overridable through the CLI's environment)."
msgstr "– `Corefile.tmpl` Mora biti vir resnice. Ustvarjeno je `Corefile` z [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), ki nadomesti svojo `${VAR}` imetniki v postopku, z uporabo vrednosti iz `.env` (ki nastanejo iz [default.env](../../default.env), preobremenjeno skozi okolje CLI-ja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "– `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ je agent, ki upravlja GitHub Actions delo potek delovnih mest na vaši infrastrukturi namesto GitHub-gostitelj strojev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Makefile` is the human-facing command surface for the repo. It MUST expose stable targets that people and CI are meant to run directly."
msgstr "– `Makefile` Poveljniška površina za repo. Mora izpostaviti stabilne cilje, da so ljudje in KI namenjeni za neposredno delovanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `OIDC` tree is a lazy group_var: it resolves in the consuming role's context, so the issuer family-aligns to that consumer (clearnet page → clearnet issuer, onion page → onion issuer). Inventory overrides therefore live under `OIDC_OVERRIDE:` — an inventory-level `OIDC:` block would shadow the lazy resolution and is rejected by a constructor assert."
msgstr "– `OIDC` Drevo je leno. group_var: rešuje v okviru potrošne vloge, tako da je izdajatelj družinski dogovor s tem potrošnikom (freenet page → firenet izdajatelj, čebula stran → čebula izdajatelj). Inventar prevlada zato živijo pod `OIDC_OVERRIDE:` — raven zalog `OIDC:` blok bi zasenčil leno resolucijo in je zavrnjen s trditvijo konstruktorja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Options` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see [NFS-backed volumes](#nfs-backed-volumes)): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "– `Options` Pravilo je, kaj ohranja gostitelja roja z zvezki, podprtimi z NFS na živo kopijo (glej [Količina, podprta s podporo NFS](#nfs-backed-volumes)): tak glasnost je ločen datotečni sistem, zato bi posnetek korena podatkov zajel kot prazen imenik in backup bi uspel, medtem ko ne bi imel ničesar. Deklaracija se preveri in ne miza za pritrditev, ker docker leno pritrdi te prostornine in jih odpne, ko se zadnja posoda ustavi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the `make runner-ci-deploy` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "– `RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` spremenljivka izbere distrospecifična opravila namestitve paketa (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux ali Fedora/EL). Vloga je zasnovana tako, da jo poganja `make runner-ci-deploy` cilj; glej spodnji vodnik od konca do konca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``(fqcn, version)`` pairs a requirements file declares, in order."
msgstr "– ``(fqcn, version)`` pari datoteke z zahtevami razglasi, po vrstnem redu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` ``roles/sys-lint`` pins for *tool*."
msgstr "– ``(owner/repo, version)`` ``roles/sys-lint`` igle za *orodje*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` an installer should fetch for *tool*."
msgstr "– ``(owner/repo, version)`` inštalator naj povleče *orodje*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``API`` mapping as declared in the group_vars SPOT."
msgstr "– ``API`` Kartiranje, kot je navedeno v group_vars SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` fallback declared in ``default.env``."
msgstr "– ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` rezervno ``default.env``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``Options`` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "– ``Options`` Pravilo je, kaj ohranja gostitelja roja z zvezki, podprtimi z NFS na živo kopijo (glej `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): tak glasnost je ločen datotečni sistem, zato bi posnetek korena podatkov zajel kot prazen imenik in backup bi uspel, medtem ko ne bi imel ničesar. Deklaracija se preveri in ne miza za pritrditev, ker docker leno pritrdi te prostornine in jih odpne, ko se zadnja posoda ustavi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the ``make runner-ci-deploy`` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "– ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` spremenljivka izbere distrospecifična opravila namestitve paketa (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux ali Fedora/EL). Vloga je zasnovana tako, da jo poganja ``make runner-ci-deploy`` cilj; glej spodnji vodnik od konca do konca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is **not** blocked: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The ``biber`` persona is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and ``biber`` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."
msgstr "– ``administrator`` persona je **ni** blokirano: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ semena avtohtona OpenProject račun, katerega geslo je Keycloak Skrbniška skrivnost, zato potovanje poteka v vsaki varianti. – ``biber`` persona je blokirana samo v ``sso: false`` različice – OpenProject se seja samo z upraviteljem in ``biber`` je samodejno zagotovljen izključno skozi oauth2-Poveljniški most na vir LDAP, ki ga te variante odstranijo. Obe zastavi sta izrecno navedeni v `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` provisions proxied identities with ``create_user(...)`` and no ``is_staff`` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "– ``administrator`` persona je dodatno blokirana, ker ta vloga nikoli ne ustvarja BookWyrm račun osebja. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` določbe o identiteti ``create_user(...)`` in ne ``is_staff`` zastava, in nobena naloga spodbuja obstoječi račun, tako da administrator prispe kot navaden član brez admin površine za vadbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked because Decidim’s admin is a Devise account seeded by ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role’s Playwright env therefore exposes ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` and no ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "– ``administrator`` je oseba blokirana, ker DecidimAdministracija je Devise račun, ki ga seje ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` in Devise podpise po elektronski pošti. Vloga Playwright env zato razkriva ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` in ne ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, ki je spremenljivka skupni admin pomočnik bere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` via ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, whose identifier is the ORM ``username`` rather than the e-mail Baserow’s own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "– ``administrator`` Persona je blokirana samo, ko je sistem SSO izključen. V tej sestavi ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` je lažen, zato je most nedejaven in edini račun je Django superuporabniški škornji, ki jih ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` preko ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, katerega identifikator je ORM ``username`` namesto elektronske pošte BaserowZa to zahteva lastni obrazec. S SSO je omogočil glavni most oskrbo seje in persona teče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` and ``administrator`` Playwright personas are gated on ``services.sso.enabled``. When SSO is off, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. Two reasons:"
msgstr "– ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` Predstava je zaklenjena. ``services.sso.enabled``- Ko SSO off, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``- Dva razloga:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim’s sign-out is a ``data-method`` link inside the account dropdown, so the role’s own tests navigate to ``/users/sign_out`` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "– ``biber`` persona se brez težav prijavi skozi OIDC; ne more se odjaviti. Decidimov podpis je ``data-method`` povezava znotraj spusta na računu, tako da je vloga lastnih testov navigirati ``/users/sign_out`` neposredno, namesto da bi kliknil na gumb, ki ga je našel skupni pomočnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``context_agent`` and ``contextagentmcp`` services in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` context, read-only with every capability dropped, and it is the only MCP endpoint clients are given."
msgstr "– ``context_agent`` ter ``contextagentmcp`` storitve v ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` kontekst, branje-samo z vsako sposobnost padla, in je edini MCP opazovanih strank so podani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dashboard`` service in ``meta/services.yml`` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG’s canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role’s contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "– ``dashboard`` storitev v ``meta/services.yml`` je samo potrošniška ploščica, ki kaže na MIGkanonična domena; ne gosti MIG. Pogodba o vlogi se v celoti izvaja na podlagi dosegljivih, kanoničnih domen in vsebinskih scenarijev v ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, In gostjo. Pot nazaj do generične osebe je avtentična MIG površino, ki nima toku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dsk-gnucash`` role ensures that GnuCash is installed and maintained at its latest available version in the Pacman repositories."
msgstr "– ``dsk-gnucash`` vloga zagotavlja, da GnuCash je nameščena in vzdrževana v najnovejši razpoložljivi različici v repozitorijih Pacman."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dsk-qbittorrent`` role is tailored for users who require a reliable and user-friendly torrent client for downloading and sharing files via the BitTorrent protocol. qBittorrent is known for its balance of features, simplicity, and minimal impact on system resources."
msgstr "– ``dsk-qbittorrent`` vloga je prilagojena uporabnikom, ki zahtevajo zanesljiv in uporabniku prijazen torrent za prenos in izmenjavo datotek prek protokola BitTorrent. qBittorrent je znan po ravnotežju značilnosti, preprostosti in minimalnem vplivu na sistemske vire."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dsk-torbrowser`` role uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to:"
msgstr "– ``dsk-torbrowser`` vloga uporablja ``community.general.pacman`` modul za:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``gitlab_repositories`` volume is declared ``nfs: false``, so in swarm mode it stays a plain node-local volume instead of being rewritten to the shared NFS backend. Gitaly is pinned to a single replica. When a swarm reschedule moves the gitaly task to another node, the repositories stay on the previous node’s local volume; move the volume data manually before rescheduling gitaly."
msgstr "– ``gitlab_repositories`` količina je deklarirana ``nfs: false``, tako da v načinu roja ostane navaden vozlišče-lokalno glasnost, namesto da se prepiše na skupno backend NFS. Gitaly je pripeta na eno samo repliko. Ko roj prestavi gitaly nalogo na drugo vozlišče, odložišča ostanejo na lokalnem volumnu prejšnjega vozlišča; podatke o prostornini premaknite ročno pred reprogramiranjem gitaly."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``guest`` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "– ``guest`` persona in izjave TLS in HSTS, ki jih je mogoče doseči na lokalni ravni, potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``guest`` persona is always live (no auth chain assumption) and the canonical-landing baseline test runs unconditionally."
msgstr "– ``guest`` persona je vedno živa (brez domneve v zvezi z auth verigo) in test kanoničnega pristanka poteka brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``hanzi`` label of every category the role id walks through."
msgstr "– ``hanzi`` oznaka vsake kategorije, skozi katero gre ID vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``ldap`` service block in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ is intentionally pinned to literal ``false`` (see `TODO.md <./TODO.md>`__): the ``jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth`` plugin breaks Discourse bootstrap on recent versions. ``discourse-ldap-auth`` therefore resolves to disabled until that block is flipped back to the dynamic group-membership form."
msgstr "– ``ldap`` servisni blok v ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ is intentionally pinned to literal ``false`` (see `TODO.md <./TODO.md>`__): the ``jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth`` plugin breaks Discourse bootstrap on recent versions. ``discourse-ldap-auth`` se zato odloči za invalidnost, dokler se blok ne obrne nazaj v dinamično obliko skupinskega članstva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``main.yml`` file in the ``dsk-docker`` role consists of two primary tasks:"
msgstr "– ``main.yml`` v datoteki ``dsk-docker`` vlogo sestavljata dve glavni nalogi:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``main.yml`` file in the ``dsk-qbittorrent`` role includes the following task:"
msgstr "– ``main.yml`` v datoteki ``dsk-qbittorrent`` vloga vključuje naslednje naloge:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``main.yml`` file in the ``hunspell`` role includes two primary tasks:"
msgstr "– ``main.yml`` v datoteki ``hunspell`` vloga vključuje dve glavni nalogi:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``main.yml`` file within the ``java`` role consists of a single, but crucial task:"
msgstr "– ``main.yml`` datoteka znotraj ``java`` vloga je sestavljena iz ene same, vendar ključne naloge:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``make runner-ci-deploy`` target invokes ``python -m cli.administration.deploy.runner``. You can also call it directly:"
msgstr "– ``make runner-ci-deploy`` cilj se sklicuje ``python -m cli.administration.deploy.runner``. Lahko jo tudi neposredno imenujete:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``oidc`` plugin (``pretix-oidc``, pinned to ``2.3.1``) is pip-installed at image build time and delivers Keycloak/OIDC login. It auto-enables whenever the SSO partner role (``web-app-keycloak``) is co-deployed and stays off otherwise."
msgstr "– ``oidc`` vstavek (``pretix-oidc``, pripeta na ``2.3.1``) je pik nameščen ob času izdelave slike in prinaša KeycloakPrijava OIDC. Auto-enables kadarkoli SSO partner vlogo (``web-app-keycloak``) je sorazporejena in ne dela drugače."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``owner/repo`` the current branch lives on, derived from its tracking remote (not gh's default repo, which may be the upstream)."
msgstr "– ``owner/repo`` sedanja veja živi naprej, ki izhaja iz njenega sledilnega daljnovoda (ne privzeto repo, ki je lahko v toku)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``role#variant`` selection token of one query row."
msgstr "– ``role#variant`` Izbor žetena ene vrste poizvedbe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``s3.configure`` grant is required since SeaweedFS 4.39: a server started without an ``-s3.config`` has zero identities, and ListBuckets then returns an empty list to the consumer's access key, so the consumer reads the bucket as missing even though it exists."
msgstr "– ``s3.configure`` je potrebna donacija, ker SeaweedFS 4.39: strežnik začel brez ``-s3.config`` Ima nič identitete, in ListBuckets nato vrne prazen seznam na dostop potrošnikov ključ, tako da potrošnik bere vedro manjka, čeprav obstaja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-front-inj-logout`` Ansible role automatically embeds a lightweight JavaScript snippet into your web application’s HTML responses. This script identifies logout links, buttons, forms, and other elements, overrides their target URLs, and ensures users are redirected to a central OIDC logout endpoint, providing a consistent single sign‑out experience."
msgstr "– ``sys-front-inj-logout`` Omogočena vloga samodejno vstavlja lahek JavaScript snippet v HTML odzive vaše spletne aplikacije. Scenarij določa odjavo povezav, gumbov, obrazcev in drugih elementov, prevlada nad njihovimi ciljnimi URL-ji in zagotavlja, da so uporabniki preusmerjeni na osrednji končni cilj odjave OIDC, kar zagotavlja dosledno eno samo izkušnjo odjave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-svc-mail-smtp`` role configures a **local SMTP relay** using `Postfix <https://www.postfix.org/>`__, listening exclusively on ``localhost``."
msgstr "– ``sys-svc-mail-smtp`` Vlogo nastavi a **lokalni rele SMTP** uporaba `Postfix <https://www.postfix.org/>`__, poslušanje izključno na ``localhost``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-svc-mail`` role acts as the **central mail orchestration layer** in the Infinito.Nexus stack."
msgstr "– ``sys-svc-mail`` vloga deluje kot **osrednji poštni orkestracijski sloj** v Infinito.Nexus kup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``tag_only=True`` kwarg returns the reference WITHOUT the swarm registry prefix. Use it when the ref must be interpolated inline against the upstream registry rather than the in-cluster mirror."
msgstr "– ``tag_only=True`` kwarg vrne referenco BREZ predpone registra rojev. Uporabite jo, kadar je treba ref interpolirati v linijo proti zgornjemu toku registra in ne v zrcalu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``want=`` kwarg is intentionally ignored: want-path is ALWAYS the first positional argument so callers can't accidentally pass it both ways."
msgstr "– ``want=`` Kwarg je namerno prezrt: hot-pot je vedno prvi pozicijski argument, tako da klicarji ne more po nesreči mimo obeh poti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `addons` key MUST be removed from the \"inlined under the primary entity\" set in [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) and documented as its own topic file."
msgstr "– `addons` tipka MORA biti odstranjena iz \"v okviru primarnega subjekta\" vstavljen [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) in dokumentirana kot lastna tematska datoteka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `administrator` persona MUST drive at least one admin-only interaction (admin panel toggle, realm settings change, user-management surface, …). Specs supply this via the `adminInteraction` callback on `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` under the same \"no generic default\" rule."
msgstr "– `administrator` persona MORA voziti vsaj eno interakcijo samo z adminom (admin panel toggle, spremembe nastavitev sfere, površina za upravljanje uporabnikov, ...). Specs to zagotavljajo preko `adminInteraction` Poklic nazaj `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` pod isto \"brez splošne privzetosti\" Pravilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is **not** blocked: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The `biber` persona is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and `biber` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."
msgstr "– `administrator` persona je **ni** blokirano: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) semena avtohtona OpenProject račun, katerega geslo je Keycloak Skrbniška skrivnost, zato potovanje poteka v vsaki varianti. – `biber` persona je blokirana samo v `sso: false` različice – OpenProject se seja samo z upraviteljem in `biber` je samodejno zagotovljen izključno skozi oauth2-Poveljniški most na vir LDAP, ki ga te variante odstranijo. Obe zastavi sta izrecno navedeni v [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. `files/sso/header_auth.py` provisions proxied identities with `create_user(...)` and no `is_staff` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "– `administrator` persona je dodatno blokirana, ker ta vloga nikoli ne ustvarja BookWyrm račun osebja. `files/sso/header_auth.py` določbe o identiteti `create_user(...)` in ne `is_staff` zastava, in nobena naloga spodbuja obstoječi račun, tako da administrator prispe kot navaden član brez admin površine za vadbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is blocked because Decidim's admin is a Devise account seeded by `files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role's Playwright env therefore exposes `ADMIN_EMAIL` and no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "– `administrator` je oseba blokirana, ker Decidim's admin je Devise račun, ki ga `files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb` in Devise podpise po elektronski pošti. Vlogo Playwright env zato izpostavlja `ADMIN_EMAIL` in ne `ADMIN_USERNAME`, ki je spremenljivka skupni admin pomočnik bere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` via `files/bootstrap_admin.py`, whose identifier is the ORM `username` rather than the e-mail Baserow's own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "– `administrator` Persona je blokirana samo, ko je sistem SSO izključen. V tej sestavi `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` je lažen, zato je most nedejaven in edini račun je Django superuporabniški škornji, ki jih `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` preko `files/bootstrap_admin.py`, katerega identifikator je ORM `username` namesto elektronske pošte BaserowVpis zahteva. S SSO je omogočil glavni most oskrbo seje in persona teče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `all` mode honors a per-interpreter stamp at `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (the suffix is the first 8 chars of `sha256(sys.executable)`, so host and container track independently even though `build/` is bind-mounted). Stamp dependencies are [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) and [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Group-targeted invocations always run and never touch the stamp."
msgstr "– `all` način spoštuje žig na tolmača `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (pripona je prva 8 znaki `sha256(sys.executable)`, tako gostitelj in zabojnik sledi samostojno, čeprav `build/` je vezan). Žig odvisnosti so [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) ter [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Skupinski poklici vedno tečejo in se nikoli ne dotaknejo znamke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `applications` lookup is the ONLY supported runtime entry point for merged application configuration."
msgstr "– `applications` iskanje je le podprta vstopna točka časa delovanja za združene nastavitve programov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `ask` rules on `docker run*` / `docker build*` / `docker push*` / `docker login*` only catch the outermost invocation. Because the project uses Docker-in-Docker (for example `docker exec <helper-container> docker run ...`), a `docker run` invoked inside an exec'd helper container bypasses the ask-gate. The helper container has its own Docker daemon or a bind-mounted host socket, so the inner `docker run` executes directly."
msgstr "– `ask` pravila o `docker run*` / `docker build*` / `docker push*` / `docker login*` Ujemite le najbolj oddaljenega. Ker projekt uporablja Docker-in-Docker (na primer `docker exec <helper-container> docker run ...`), a `docker run` V zabojniku za pomočnike se je oglasilo, da zaobide vrata. Posoda za pomoč ima svoj demon Docker ali gostiteljsko vtičnico, ki se veže, tako da je notranji `docker run` izvrši neposredno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `auto` alias exists and every other alias still resolves"
msgstr "– `auto` obstaja alias in vsi drugi alias še vedno rešuje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `biber` and `administrator` Playwright personas are gated on `services.sso.enabled`. When SSO is off, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Two reasons:"
msgstr "– `biber` ter `administrator` Predstava je zaklenjena. `services.sso.enabled`- Ko SSO off, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Izrisi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`- Dva razloga:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `biber` and `administrator` personas always end on a verified unauthenticated landing via the in-app logout button."
msgstr "– `biber` ter `administrator` oseba, ki se vedno konča na preverjenem pristanku preko gumba za odjavo v aplikaciji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `biber` persona MUST drive at least one role-specific interaction that a regular end-user would perform (post a message, open a settings tab, browse a content list, submit a form, …). Specs supply this via the `biberInteraction` callback on `runBiberFlow(page, { biberInteraction })`. There is NO generic default. A generic \"click any link\" assertion tests nothing role-specific, so the helper is a no-op until the spec provides a callback."
msgstr "– `biber` persona MORA poganjati vsaj eno interakcijo, specifično za vlogo, ki bi jo opravil redni končni uporabnik (objavi sporočilo, odpre zavihek z nastavitvami, brska po seznamu vsebin, predloži obrazec, ...). Specs to zagotavljajo preko `biberInteraction` Poklic nazaj `runBiberFlow(page, { biberInteraction })`. Ni splošnega privzetja. Splošno \"klikni katerokoli povezavo\" Trditve ne preizkušajo nobene vloge, zato je pomočnica neoperativna, dokler se spec ne vrne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `biber` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim's sign-out is a `data-method` link inside the account dropdown, so the role's own tests navigate to `/users/sign_out` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "– `biber` persona se brez težav prijavi skozi OIDC; ne more se odjaviti. Decidimov podpis je `data-method` povezava znotraj spusta računa, tako da je vloga lastnih testov navigirati `/users/sign_out` neposredno, namesto da bi kliknil na gumb, ki ga je našel skupni pomočnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `build-ci-images` stage uses [call-images-build-ci.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-images-build-ci.yml) to build Docker images for the target distributions (`arch`, `debian`, `ubuntu`, `fedora`, `centos`). These images are consumed by all subsequent test jobs."
