msgstr "– `guest` persona ne sme nikoli doseči avtenticirane površine vloge. Predaja praznih zapisov proti Keycloak IDP mora zavrniti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `guest` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "– `guest` persona in izjave TLS in HSTS, ki jih je mogoče doseči na lokalni ravni, potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `guest` persona is always live (no auth chain assumption) and the canonical-landing baseline test runs unconditionally."
msgstr "– `guest` persona je vedno živa (brez domneve v zvezi z auth verigo) in test kanoničnega pristanka poteka brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `infinito_` prefix in the filename MUST be present iff the owned key carries the `INFINITO_` prefix."
msgstr "– `infinito_` predpona v imenu datoteke MORA biti prisotna, če lastni ključ nosi `INFINITO_` Predpona."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `ldap` service block in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) is intentionally pinned to literal `false` (see [TODO.md](./TODO.md)): the `jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth` plugin breaks Discourse bootstrap on recent versions. `discourse-ldap-auth` therefore resolves to disabled until that block is flipped back to the dynamic group-membership form."
msgstr "– `ldap` servisni blok v [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) je namerno vezan na dobesedno `false` (glej [TODO.md](./TODO.md)): `jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth` prelomi vstavkov Discourse -Nedavne verzije. `discourse-ldap-auth` se zato odloči za invalidnost, dokler se blok ne obrne nazaj v dinamično obliko skupinskega članstva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `lint` job runs [call-lint.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-lint.yml): `make lint` fans every lint check out in parallel, plus a hadolint SARIF job. It MUST pass before the pipeline continues."
msgstr "– `lint` Poteka delo [call-lint.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-lint.yml): `make lint` Oboževalci, ki se vse odjavijo vzporedno, plus Hadolint SARIF služba. Mora iti, preden se cevovod nadaljuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `listmonk` service command runs `./listmonk --install --idempotent --yes` on every container start, so the schema is seeded automatically on the first deploy."
msgstr "– `listmonk` Servisni ukazi `./listmonk --install --idempotent --yes` Na vsaki posodi se začne, tako da se shema samodejno seje na prvi razpored."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `listmonk` service command runs `./listmonk --upgrade --yes` on every container start, so schema migrations apply automatically when a new image is deployed."
msgstr "– `listmonk` Servisni ukazi `./listmonk --upgrade --yes` na vsakem zagonu posode, tako da se selitve sheme uporabljajo samodejno, ko se namesti nova slika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
