# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js``, which drives the native form and the ``module=Login&action=logout`` sign-out. The same file owns the deny-probe proving biber cannot reach the admin surface — the provider-side assertion the persona helpers deliberately no longer duplicate. The path back to the generic personas is a Keycloak client for Matomo plus group-driven user provisioning."
msgstr "Pot administratorja je zajeta v ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js``, ki poganja domačo obliko in ``module=Login&action=logout`` Odjava. Ista datoteka ima v lasti odklonilno sondo, ki dokazuje biber, ne more doseči admin površine – trditev na strani ponudnika, da persona pomočniki namerno ne podvajajo več. Pot nazaj do splošne osebe je Keycloak odjemalec za Matomo plus skupinsko zagotavljanje uporabnikov."

