# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The axis is still pinned; the condition decides **which kind**. Pick the kind that satisfies both:"
msgstr "Os je še vedno pritrjena; pogoj določa **katere vrste**Izberite vrsto, ki izpolnjuje oboje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The axis suffix a CI selection token may carry (``#0,2@swarm+tor``) is split off before the lookup and re-attached after it, so translating a list never drops what the operator pinned on it."
msgstr "Pripona osi lahko nosi žeton za izbiro CI (``#0,2@swarm+tor``) je razdeljena pred iskanjem in ponovno pritrjena po njem, tako da prevod seznama nikoli ne pade tisto, kar je operater pritrjen na njem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The backup host is NOT appended to the cluster inventory: it lives in a sibling ``backup.yml`` next to ``INV_PATH`` (same host_vars dir), deployed as a second play after the cluster one. Without a svc-swarm-node group that play resolves DEPLOYMENT_MODE=compose and IS_STACK_HOST=true on the backup host, so the backup roles run without cluster-membership special cases."
msgstr "Rezervni gostitelj ni priložen inventarju grozdov: živi v bratovščini ``backup.yml`` poleg ``INV_PATH`` (enako host_vars dir), kot drugo igro po grozdu ena. Brez svc-swarm-node skupina, ki igra razreši DEPLOYMENT_MODE=sestavljeno in IS_STACK_HOST=pravilo na rezervnega gostitelja, tako da rezervne vloge tečejo brez grozdnih članov posebnih primerov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The base URL to translate against. The service answers only once it has installed its models, which the caller's readiness wait covers."
msgstr "Osnovni URL za prevajanje proti. Storitev odgovarja šele, ko je namestila svoje modele, ki jih pripravljenost klicatelja pokrije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The base layer of :mod:`utils.i18n.placeholders`: it knows the protection rules and nothing about damage or repair, so :mod:`utils.i18n.damage` can build on it without an import cycle."
msgstr "Osnovna plast :mod:`utils.i18n.placeholders`: pozna pravila varstva in nič o škodi ali popravilu, tako da :mod:`utils.i18n.damage` lahko gradijo na njem brez uvoznega cikla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The behaviour is fail-loud by design. Missing or mistyped secret names MUST surface as a failed workflow run rather than as a PR with an unintended author."
msgstr "Vedenje je neuspešno. Manjkajoča ali napačno natipkana skrivna imena MORAJO priti na površje kot neuspešen potek dela in ne kot PR z nenamernim avtorjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The block is replayed once systemd reports `running` or `degraded`. A block that opens with `git clone` is a host install: those two lines are dropped and the mounted checkout is used instead, so the replay runs against the tree under test."
msgstr "Blok se ponovno predvaja po sistemskih poročilih `running` ali `degraded`- Blok, ki se začne z `git clone` je gostitelj namestitev: ti dve vrstici se spusti in montirana odjava se uporablja namesto, tako da ponovitev teče proti drevesu, ki se preskuša."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The block then runs inside a throwaway machine, never on the stack host itself. [machine.sh](../../../../../roles/web-app-docs/files/test/machine.sh) brings it up through [files/test/compose.yml](../../../../../roles/web-app-docs/files/test/compose.yml) under the project `docs-guide-<role>`, and tears it down with `down -v --rmi local`."
msgstr "Blok nato teče v stroju za metanje, nikoli na samem gostitelju. [machine.sh](../../../../../roles/web-app-docs/files/test/machine.sh) Prinaša ga skozi [files/test/compose.yml](../../../../../roles/web-app-docs/files/test/compose.yml) v okviru projekta `docs-guide-<role>`, in jo raztrešči z `down -v --rmi local`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The branch MUST exist and MUST NOT be checked out anywhere else; resolve a collision with `make worktree-prune` or `make worktree-down` first. Pass `base=<dir>` only when the operator names a different parent directory, and then repeat that same `base=` in every later `make worktree-down` call."
msgstr "Veja mora obstajati in se NE sme preveriti nikjer drugje; razrešiti trk z `make worktree-prune` ali `make worktree-down` Najprej. Premik `base=<dir>` samo, če upravljavec imenuje drugo matično mapo in nato ponovi isto `base=` v vsakem poznejšem `make worktree-down` Pokliči."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The branch prefix MUST match the detected scope, otherwise the `validate-pr-branch-prefix` job fails."
msgstr "Predpona veje mora ustrezati odkritemu obsegu, sicer `validate-pr-branch-prefix` Delo ne uspe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The branch prefix MUST match the type of change. The [PR workflow](pull-request.md) uses it to classify the scope and decide which CI pipeline to run."
msgstr "Predpona veje SE MORA ujemati z vrsto spremembe. – [Delovni tok PR](pull-request.md) uporablja ga za razvrščanje področja uporabe in se odloči, kateri plinovod CI bo deloval."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The branch-name matcher normally also requires the run's head repository to be the pull request's own. Two cases relax that: a run whose `head_repository` the API omits, and a pull request whose head fork has been deleted, where the event payload carries no head repository either. Both are matched on the branch name alone, because otherwise their runs would keep going forever — and neither field is something a contributor can influence. The ambiguity check above is what makes that safe: it runs whenever a head branch is known, with or without a repository, so a shared branch name still disables the matcher rather than cancelling the wrong pull request."
msgstr "Podružnica običajno zahteva tudi, da je skladišče glave Run lastno zahtevo. Dva primera se sprostita. `head_repository` o API izpusti in zahteva po vleki, katere vilice za glavo so bile zbrisane, če tudi koristni tovor dogodka ne nosi skladišča glav. Oba se ujemata samo na ime podružnice, saj bi sicer njun tek trajal večno – na nobeno polje pa ne more vplivati. Preverjanje nejasnosti zgoraj je tisto, kar naredi, da je varno: teče, kadar je znana glavna veja, z ali brez skladišča, tako da skupno ime podružnice še vedno onemogoči ujemalec, namesto da prekliče napačno zahtevo za vlečenje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge activates only when `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` is truthy (derived from `lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')`); otherwise the middleware is a transparent pass-through and the native password form still guards `/admin`."
msgstr "Most se aktivira le, če `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` je resnica (pridobljeni iz `lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')`); v nasprotnem primeru je vmesna programska oprema pregleden prehod in izvorno geslo še vedno varovala `/admin`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge activates only when ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is truthy (derived from ``lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')``); otherwise the middleware is a transparent pass-through and the native password form still guards ``/admin``."
msgstr "Most se aktivira le, če ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` je resnica (pridobljeni iz ``lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')``); v nasprotnem primeru je vmesna programska oprema pregleden prehod in izvorno geslo še vedno varovala ``/admin``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge declaration is one-directional metadata (this role depends on that service). It MUST NOT be used to auto-enable the other role; enablement stays driven by group membership and the existing `run_after` ordering."
msgstr "Mostna deklaracija je enosmerni metapodatki (ta vloga je odvisna od te storitve). Ne sme se uporabljati za samodejno omogoÄ anje druge vloge; omogoÄ itev bivanja, ki ga poganjajo člani skupine in obstoječe `run_after` Naroči."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge ships as a **separate component** (own sidecar/role), not inside `web-app-atmo`, gated on `web-app-mobilizon in group_names`."
msgstr "Mostne ladje kot **ločena komponenta** (lastne stranske prikolice/role), ne znotraj `web-app-atmo`, zaklenjeno `web-app-mobilizon in group_names`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge's database password stays declared in [meta/secrets.yml](../../roles/web-app-matrix/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` and is referenced, never inlined. Each additional network (`whatsapp`, `signal`, `slack`, `facebook`, `instagram`) is its own `mechanism: bridge` addon."
msgstr "Geslo iz baze podatkov mostu ostane prijavljeno [meta/secrets.yml](../../roles/web-app-matrix/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` in je naveden, nikoli povezan. Vsako dodatno omrežje (`whatsapp`, `signal`, `slack`, `facebook`, `instagram`) je svoje `mechanism: bridge` Addon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broader CI debugging workflow is documented in [ci.md](../../../contributing/actions/debugging/ci.md). You MUST NOT proceed with partial coverage."
msgstr "Širši potek dela CI je dokumentiran v [ci.md](../../../contributing/actions/debugging/ci.md). Ne smete nadaljevati z delnim kritjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker MUST receive `X-Forwarded-User`, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, and `X-Forwarded-Email` from `oauth2-proxy`. On a user's first authenticated visit the broker calls the PDS `com.atproto.server.createAccount` endpoint with a synthesised app-password, encrypts that password with AES-256-GCM under a key from the project's credentials vault, and caches the ciphertext in the broker's in-process `sessionCache` keyed by Keycloak username. Subsequent visits decrypt the cached password in-broker, exchange it for a PDS session via `com.atproto.server.createSession`, and seed `localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]` so the social-app finds an authenticated session at boot. A broker restart drops the cache; the next SSO visit triggers a fresh `createAccount` and the previous app-password remains valid in PDS until rotated."
msgstr "Posrednik MORA prejeti `X-Forwarded-User`, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, in `X-Forwarded-Email` od `oauth2-proxy`. Ob prvem avtentičnem obisku uporabnika posrednik pokliče PDS `com.atproto.server.createAccount` končni rezultat s sintetiziranim geslom aplikacij, šifriranje tega gesla z AES-256-GCM pod ključem iz trezorja poverilnic projekta, in predpomni šiferno besedilo v postopku posrednika `sessionCache` tipka Keycloak uporabniško ime. Naslednji obiski dešifrirajo predpomnilno geslo v posredniku, ga izmenjujejo za sejo PDS preko `com.atproto.server.createSession`, in semena `localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]` Socialna app najde pristno sejo. Mešetar ponovno spusti predpomnilnik; naslednji obisk SSO sproži novo `createAccount` in prejšnje geslo aplikacije ostane veljavno v PDS, dokler se ne zavrti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker MUST receive ``X-Forwarded-User``, ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username``, and ``X-Forwarded-Email`` from ``oauth2-proxy``. On a user’s first authenticated visit the broker calls the PDS ``com.atproto.server.createAccount`` endpoint with a synthesised app-password, encrypts that password with AES-256-GCM under a key from the project’s credentials vault, and caches the ciphertext in the broker’s in-process ``sessionCache`` keyed by Keycloak username. Subsequent visits decrypt the cached password in-broker, exchange it for a PDS session via ``com.atproto.server.createSession``, and seed ``localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]`` so the social-app finds an authenticated session at boot. A broker restart drops the cache; the next SSO visit triggers a fresh ``createAccount`` and the previous app-password remains valid in PDS until rotated."
msgstr "Posrednik MORA prejeti ``X-Forwarded-User``, ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username``, in ``X-Forwarded-Email`` od ``oauth2-proxy``. Ob prvem overovljenem obisku uporabnika posrednik pokliče PDS ``com.atproto.server.createAccount`` končni rezultat s sintetiziranim geslom aplikacij, šifriranje tega gesla z AES-256-GCM pod ključem iz hrambe poverilnic projekta in predpomni šiferni stavek v postopku posrednika ``sessionCache`` tipka Keycloak uporabniško ime. Naslednji obiski dešifrirajo predpomnilno geslo v posredniku, ga izmenjujejo za sejo PDS preko ``com.atproto.server.createSession``, in semena ``localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]`` Socialna app najde pristno sejo. Mešetar ponovno spusti predpomnilnik; naslednji obisk SSO sproži novo ``createAccount`` in prejšnje geslo aplikacije ostane veljavno v PDS, dokler se ne zavrti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker forwards the request to the agent with the agent's own bearer key and streams the answer back unchanged."
msgstr "Posrednik posreduje zahtevo agentu z lastnim nosilnim ključem in pošlje odgovor nazaj nespremenjen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker looks up the caller's agent for that platform by name. When none exists it creates one; when it is stopped it starts it; it then waits until the agent answers its health endpoint."
msgstr "Posrednik išče klicatelja. Ko nobena ne obstaja, ustvari eno; ko se ustavi, se začne; nato počaka, da agent odgovori na svoj zdravstveni cilj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume it shares with the socket proxy. The proxy serves no TCP port; in compose it also runs with `network_mode: none`, while a swarm task carries the stack's default overlay attachment. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. The image, runtime, limits and mounts of an agent are fixed by the broker, never taken from the request."
msgstr "Mešetar doseže kontejnerski motor le skozi filtrirano unix vtičnico v prostornini, ki jo deli z vtičnico proxy. Proxy ne služi TCP vrata; v sestavi deluje tudi z `network_mode: none`, medtem ko naloga roj nosi privzeto pritrditev sklada. Proxy priznava samo zabojnik, storitev, naloga, omrežje, glasnost in sliko kliče posrednik naredi, in zavrne vse druge metode in poti, vključno exec in brisanje. Slika, čas delovanja, omejitve in nastavki agenta so določeni s strani posrednika, nikoli vzeti iz zahteve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker rejects any request whose bearer is not the broker key, and any request without a user id header."
msgstr "Mešetar zavrne vsako zahtevo, katere nosilec ni posrednik ključ, in vsako zahtevo brez uporabniškega ID glave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker resolves the caller's groups from Keycloak and refuses with HTTP 403 when the caller is not in the `agent-user` group of the requested platform."
msgstr "Posrednik rešuje skupine klicatelja iz Keycloak in zavrne s HTTP 403 ko klicatelj ni v `agent-user` skupina zahtevane platforme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker sits behind `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar and in front of the official `@bluesky-social/social-app` web client. On a user's first OIDC-authenticated visit, the broker:"
msgstr "Mešetar sedi zadaj. `web-app-keycloak`SSO-proxy sidecar in pred uradnim `@bluesky-social/social-app` spletna stranka. Na uporabnikovem prvem OIDC-avtentiziranem obisku, posrednik:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The browser console MUST be clean of errors when the flow depends on injected JavaScript."
msgstr "Ko je tok odvisen od injiciranega JavaScripta, mora biti konzola brskalnika čista napak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bucket is a name-prefix-derived loader phase; it only breaks ties among roles with no pending run_after prerequisite, so run_after stays bucket-agnostic (an edge orders across any bucket)."
msgstr "Vedro je faza nakladanja z imenom-predpono; prekine le vezi med vlogami brez čakanja run_after predpogoj, tako run_after ostane vedro-agnostikac (naročila na rob preko vsakega vedra)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The budget as a CLI table: per-job reservations, then the totals and the chunk arithmetic they leave room for."
msgstr "Proračun kot CLI tabela: rezervacije na delovno mesto, nato seštevki in del aritmetike, ki jih pustijo prostora za."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The build pipeline runs entirely on the operator's host, before any Ansible play starts. Three stages produce the inventory file plus the matching `host_vars/<host>.yml`:"
msgstr "Izgradnja cevovoda poteka v celoti na gostitelja operaterja, pred začetkom kakršne koli Ansible igre. Tri faze proizvajajo inventar datoteko plus ujemanje `host_vars/<host>.yml`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The built image **keeps the merge-SHA tag** (`ci-<merge_sha>`) so the `pull_request` orchestrator finds it unchanged — no consumer workflow has to know about the label."
msgstr "Zgrajena slika **ohranja oznako spajanje- SHA** (`ci-<merge_sha>`) tako `pull_request` Orkester meni, da je nespremenjen – o oznaki ni treba vedeti nobenega toka dela potrošnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The built site, or its build progress"
msgstr "Zgrajeno mesto ali njegov napredek pri gradnji"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The cache services are added."
msgstr "Dodane so storitve predpomnilnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The cache's path-keyed loader is bypassed on purpose — the caller mutates content per call, so each parse is intentionally fresh."
msgstr "Nakladalnik s predpomnilnikom se namenoma zaobide – klicatelj mutira vsebino na klic, zato je vsak parz namerno svež."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The callback names the file the role mounts"
msgstr "Poklic poimenuje datoteko, ki jo priklopi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The candidates become the choice options and the prompt becomes the state"
msgstr "Kandidati postanejo izbira možnosti in poziv postane država"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The canonical bands map lives there as a single key. The CLI helpers and the lint test consult this module so the bands stay in one place."
