# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The cluster consists of privileged systemd containers on a dedicated lab bridge (`192.168.244.0/24`, MTU 1400): three swarm nodes (1 manager + 2 workers), a non-swarm NFSv4 server serving the shared volume storage, and a non-swarm backup host for the DR drill. The node image ([`compose/swarm/Dockerfile`](../../../../compose/swarm/Dockerfile)) bakes python3 + dnsmasq and masks the zfs boot units the parent image's userland enables; the containers and the lab network are declared in [`compose/swarm/compose.yml`](../../../../compose/swarm/compose.yml) (project `${SWARM_NAME}`, backup host behind the `drill` profile) and started by one `docker compose up` in `routine/01_bootstrap.sh`. Lab DNS is provisioned by `compose/swarm/playbook.yml` over `ansible_connection: docker` (Ansible never uses ssh here); swarm init/join itself happens inside the deploy via the `svc-swarm-node` role, not in any bring-up script."
msgstr "Kopica je sestavljena iz privilegiranih sistemskih zabojnikov na namenskem laboratorijskem mostu (`192.168.244.0/24`, MTU 1400): tri vozle roja (1 upravitelj + 2 delavci), netoplo NFSv4 strežnik, ki služi skupni prostorninski shrambi, in netoplega rezervnega gostitelja za vrtalnik DR. Slika vozlišča ([`compose/swarm/Dockerfile`](../../../../compose/swarm/Dockerfile)) peče piton3 + dnsmasq in maske zfs škorenj enote matične slike je uporabnikland omogoča; zabojniki in laboratorij omrežja so prijavljeni v [`compose/swarm/compose.yml`](../../../../compose/swarm/compose.yml) (projekt `${SWARM_NAME}`, rezervni gostitelj za `drill` profil) in začel z eno `docker compose up` v `routine/01_bootstrap.sh`. Laboratorij DNS zagotavlja `compose/swarm/playbook.yml` več `ansible_connection: docker` (Ansible tukaj nikoli ne uporablja ssh.); roj init/pridružite se sami se zgodi znotraj uporabe preko `svc-swarm-node` vloga, ne v nobenem scenariju."

