msgstr "Zaradi razporeditve je eden ``ADAPTER_CONTRACT`` Dokument JSON na primer:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The description MUST use `kebab-case` (lowercase words separated by hyphens) and SHOULD be short enough to read at a glance."
msgstr "Opis `kebab-case` (male črke, ločene z vezaji) in bi morali biti dovolj kratki, da preberete na pogled."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The description paragraph MUST be a single paragraph (no blank lines inside it)."
msgstr "Opisni odstavek MORA biti en sam odstavek (V njej ni praznih vrstic.)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The design follows simple composition principles so environment state can be loaded safely and consistently without duplicating logic in many places. 🧱"
msgstr "Zasnova sledi preprostim principom kompozicije, tako da se lahko okolje varno in dosledno naloži brez podvajanja logike na mnogih mestih. 🧱"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The destructive drill, sync pass only. It proves the backup is restorable rather than merely present — the property a backup exists for."
msgstr "Uničevalni sveder, samo sinhroniziraj. Dokazuje, da je rezerva restorabilna, ne pa le prisotna – lastnina, za katero obstaja rezerva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The detection is line-based: the task block is the span between the nearest `- name:` (at indent N) above the offending line and the next top-level structural marker (`- name:` at indent <= N, or end of file). Within that span we look for any `when:` clause whose textual value names the compose-only boolean."
msgstr "Zaznavanje temelji na vrstici: blok opravil je razpon med najbližjim `- name:` (v alinei N) nad užalitveno črto in naslednjim najvišjim konstrukcijskim označevalcem (`- name:` v alinei, razen N, ali na koncu datoteke)V tem razponu iščemo kateregakoli. `when:` klavzula, katere besedilna vrednost označuje samo boolean."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The dev compose stack has no inventory and caches exactly what the roles declare. A deployed host caches what its configuration says, which starts from the same declarations and lets the inventory correct or extend them::"
msgstr "Dev sestav ni inventar in predpomni točno tisto, kar vloge deklarirajo. Postavljeni gostiteljski predpomnilniki, ki se začnejo z istimi izjavami in omogočajo, da se inventar popravi ali razširi:"

