msgstr "Viri dokumentacije imajo približno 300,000 besede (vloga README in `docs/`). Prevajanje v 47 jeziki trajajo dneve CPU, tako da dokumentacija domena teče na jezik in v ozadju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The dotted edge is the property the axes exist for: a red job's title carries enough to rebuild the selection that reproduces it."
msgstr "Pikčast rob je lastnost, za katero obstajajo osi: naziv rdeče zaposlitve nosi dovolj za obnovo selekcije, ki jo reproducira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The double-login is UX-hostile (creds typed twice) and the second hop silently bypasses any 2FA Keycloak enforced on the first hop — anyone with the LDAP password can reach the app even when WebAuthn/OTP is required at the IdP. Friendica's stock `saml` addon (already on disk under `/var/www/html/addon/saml/`) supports a SAML2 AuthnRequest → IdP-initiated SSO with auto-account-creation, which collapses the chain to a single 2FA-gated round-trip."
msgstr "Dvojna prijava je UX-sovražnica. (dvakrat natipkano) in drugi hop tiho obide vse 2FA Keycloak vsiljeni na prvi hop – vsakdo z geslom LDAP lahko doseže aplikacijo tudi, ko je WebAuthn/OTP zahteva na IDP. Delnice Friendice `saml` addon (že na disku pod `/var/www/html/addon/saml/`) podpira SAML2 AuthnRequest → IdP-zagnan SSO z avtoračunom-ustvarjanja, ki sesuje verigo na en sam 2Povratna vožnja z FA."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The drill owns the **lifecycle** and nothing else. Every restore is `python3 -m cli.administration.recover`, the same command an operator runs after a real loss, so the drill exercises that tool instead of a second implementation of it."
msgstr "Sveder je lastnik **življenjski cikel** In nič drugega. Vsaka obnovitev je `python3 -m cli.administration.recover`, isti ukaz upravljavec teče po resnični izgubi, tako da vaja vaje, da orodje namesto drugega izvajanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The drill proves the `svc-bkp-*` chain forward through the DEPLOYED systemd units (nfs on the export host, volume + secrets on the manager when the app's include closure pulls those roles in, remote pull + device sync on the backup host) and every `recover.py` back (device -> local root -> NFS export, docker volume and host secrets into the live system paths), with marker files that must survive the whole loop: the matrix update pass boots the recovered stack and `verify_recovered_marker.sh` asserts the marker on the live volume. It reuses the round-1 stack instead of spinning a dedicated cluster, and skips cleanly when the app declares no NFS-flagged volume. The backup host is started by `routine/01_bootstrap.sh` (drill profile) and receives its two roles via `extend_inventory`; the pull trust (backup keypair) and the device mount/target/source come from `utils/tests/swarm/write/extras.py`, while `remote-2-local.backup_providers` is derived per round by `utils/tests/swarm/backup_repos.py` from the same placements `extend_inventory` turns into inventory groups, and reaches the deploy through the provisioner's host_vars merge."
msgstr "Sveder dokazuje `svc-bkp-*` veriga naprej skozi sistemske enote DEPLOYED (nfs na izvoz gostitelja, glasnost + skrivnosti na upravitelja, ko aplikacija vključuje zaprtje potegne te vloge v, daljinsko pull + naprava sinhronizacijo na rezervnega gostitelja) in vsak `recover.py` Nazaj (naprava -> lokalni koren -> NFS izvoz, docker obseg in gostitelj skrivnosti v poti v živo sistema), z označevalniki datotek, ki morajo preživeti celotno zanko: matrika posodobitev podaja škornji izterjane sklada in `verify_recovered_marker.sh` uveljavlja označevalec na živi glasnosti. Ponovno uporabi krog-1 kup namesto vrtenja namenskega grozda, in preskoči čisto, ko aplikacija razglasi, da ni nastavljena glasnost NFS. Rezervni gostitelj se začne z `routine/01_bootstrap.sh` (profil vrtanja) in prejme dve vlogi prek `extend_inventory`; povleci zaupanje (backup keypair) in napravo mount/target/source prihajajo iz `utils/tests/swarm/write/extras.py`, medtem ko `remote-2-local.backup_providers` je izpeljan na krog z `utils/tests/swarm/backup_repos.py` iz istih delovnih mest `extend_inventory` se spremeni v skupine inventarja, in doseže razporeditev prek ponudnika host_vars združiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The drill runs whenever the app declares an NFS-flagged volume (`PRIMARY_NFS_VOLUME`); apps without one skip it, since there is nothing to prove a restore against."
msgstr "Vrtalnik teče vsakič, ko aplikacija razglasi glasnost, ki jo zazna NFS (`PRIMARY_NFS_VOLUME`); aplikacije brez enega preskočiti, saj ni ničesar dokazati obnovitev proti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The dump recreates roles and databases, which an application role may not do, so the credentials are the instance's superuser rather than an app's."
msgstr "Odpadnik ponovno ustvarja vloge in podatkovne zbirke, ki jih vloga prijave morda ne bo, zato so poverilnice superuporabnik in ne aplikacija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The edge map is built once at startup and kept in step with the writes this server performs, so a role file edited by hand elsewhere needs a restart."
msgstr "Zemljevid robov je zgrajen enkrat ob zagonu in se ohranja v koraku z zapisi, ki jih ta strežnik izvaja, tako da datoteka vlog, ki jo ureja ročno drugje, potrebuje ponovni zagon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The effective ``API`` mapping for a render scope."
msgstr "Učinkovitost ``API`` kartiranje za izdelavo področja uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The effective budget for the actual workload is lower than the table suggests because the runner itself plus the nested `infinito` container (systemd, nested Docker, Ansible) reserve a non-trivial baseline. Plan for roughly **1–2 GB of overhead** before any role deploys a service."
msgstr "Učinkovit proračun za dejansko delovno obremenitev je manjši, kot kaže tabela, ker je tekač sam in gnezdani `infinito` vsebnik (sistemsko, gnezdi Docker, Ansible) rezervirati netrivialno osnovo. Načrt za približno **1–2 GB režijskih stroškov** pred vsako vlogo razporedi storitev."

