msgid "The following roles have an upstream MCP path that this deployment cannot use. Each declares a `services.mcp` block carrying only `blocker`, `source_url` and `notes`, with `enabled` and `shared` false, so the role stays out of discovery while the audit still reports why it is not integrated:"
