# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gate is applied inside [push_ci_policy.sh](../../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/push_ci_policy.sh), which the `run-policy` job invokes. When `GITHUB_REF == refs/heads/main` and `CI_RUN_ON_MAIN != 'true'`, the job emits `should_run=false` and every downstream job is skipped."
msgstr "Vrata se uporabljajo znotraj [push_ci_policy.sh](../../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/push_ci_policy.sh), ki `run-policy` Izziv na delo. Kdaj `GITHUB_REF == refs/heads/main` ter `CI_RUN_ON_MAIN != 'true'`, delo oddaja `should_run=false` In vsako delo na koncu je preskočilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway is therefore pinned on **variant 2** for every consumer that ships three variants, and left on variant 0 for the two-variant roles, whose round 2 falls back to it. One `make compose-deploy variant=2` run exercises eight of the nine confirmed roles. `web-app-nextcloud` is the exception: its AI surface has always lived on its own variant 7, alongside the other bridged partners it distributes across budget bins."
msgstr "Prehod je zato pritrjen na **varianta 2** za vsakega potrošnika, ki prevaža tri variante in pusti na varianti 0 za dve različni vlogi, katerih krog 2 se je vrnil. Ena. `make compose-deploy variant=2` vodi vaje osem od devetih potrjenih vlog. `web-app-nextcloud` je izjema: njegova površina AI je vedno živela na svoji različici 7, skupaj z drugimi premostitvenimi partnerji, ki jih razdeljuje po proračunskih košah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway mints its virtual keys from the inventory it is deployed from, and a workstation is deployed from a different one. The key is therefore an operator-supplied credential on the workstation side: mint it on the server, then put it into the workstation inventory."
msgstr "Prehod kljuje svoje virtualne ključe iz inventarja, iz katerega je razporejen, in delovna postaja je nameščena iz drugega. Ključ je torej operator-dobavljeno credential na strani delovne postaje: mint na strežniku, nato pa ga vstavite v delovno postajo inventar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `anthropic/*` model"
msgstr "Prehod objavlja št `anthropic/*` model"

