# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The in-play loader (`utils.cache.applications.get_merged_applications`) uses each role's variant-free base config (the assembled `meta/<topic>.yml` payload) as the default and lets the inventory's `applications.<app>` overrides win via deep merge: the inventory itself is the source of truth for what variant a round runs against. Variant 0 enumerates every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` with `enabled: true, shared: true` so the \"all flags on\" baseline is explicit and deep-merge with a non-baseline override yields the expected variant-N shape (see [variants.md](../artefact/files/role/variants.md) for the file-format rule and [test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py](../../../tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py) for the lint guard)."
msgstr "Nalagalnik med igro (`utils.cache.applications.get_merged_applications`) uporablja osnovni konfig vsake vloge brez variante (sestavljeni `meta/<topic>.yml` koristni tovor) kot privzeto in omogoča popis `applications.<app>` Preglasi zmago preko globokega spajanja: inventar sam je vir resnice za katero varianto teče krog. Varianta 0 našteva vse dinamične tipke `meta/services.yml` z `enabled: true, shared: true` tako \"vse zastave na\" začetna vrednost je eksplicitna in se globoko zlije z neosnovno prepustnostjo, ki daje pričakovano obliko različice N. (glej [variants.md](../artefact/files/role/variants.md) za pravilo v obliki datoteke in [test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py](../../../tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py) za varovalko line)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The include set passed to stage 2 is built per round by the matrix planner: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) and [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) call `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` in [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), which resolves each round's include via `_resolve_round_include` in [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) using the [CombinedResolver](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) with `follow_run_after=False`. The swarm test path computes its include separately via [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), reading the active variant map from `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. Both expand the selection along two transitive paths:"
msgstr "Include set prenese na stopnjo 2 je izdelan na krog s strani načrtovalca matrike: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) ter [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) klic `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` v [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), ki rešuje vsako rundo, vključuje preko `_resolve_round_include` v [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) uporaba [Kombinirani resolver](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) z `follow_run_after=False`. Preskusna pot roja izračunava ločeno [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), branje aktivne variantne karte iz `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. Oba razširiti izbor po dveh tranzitnih poti:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The index is rebuilt on every run so it cannot drift from what is on disk: a manually deleted index gets restored, and a stale link to a removed archive gets dropped. The function stays byte-idempotent: when the resulting content matches what is already on disk, the file is not rewritten."
msgstr "Indeks je obnovljen na vsakem zagonu, tako da ne more odtegniti od tega, kar je na disku: ročno izbrisan indeks se obnovi, in stale povezave do odstranjenega arhiva se spusti. Funkcija ostane bajtov- idempotentna: ko se posledična vsebina ujema s tistim, kar je že na disku, datoteka ni ponovno napisana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The injector runs when `services.javascript.enabled` is enabled."
msgstr "Injektor teče, ko `services.javascript.enabled` je omogočeno."

