# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The instructions test used to be a job of its own that picked one random role per run. Riding along on a deploy row instead costs no extra runner and covers every role the sweep touches. The row it rides on is the role's smallest variant -- the one enabling the fewest services -- because that is the shape the README's Production block describes: the bare role, with the optional providers switched off."
msgstr "Test z navodili je bil včasih svoje delo, ki je izbralo eno naključno vlogo na vožnjo. Vožnja po razporeditveni vrsti ne stane dodatnega tekača in pokriva vsako vlogo, ki se je dotakne. Vrstica, po kateri se vozi, je najmanjša varianta vloge -- tista, ki omogoča najmanj storitev -- ker je to oblika, ki jo opisuje produkcijski blok README: gola vloga, z izključenimi neobveznimi ponudniki."

