# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The inverse of every other scenario, and deliberately so. Formalised as its own role in [034-svc-ai-robot.md](034-svc-ai-robot.md). Here Hermes is given full rights to explore and drive **one dedicated machine** so it can map its own hardware and act in the physical world: the robot platform idea. This is only coherent under Decision #12."
msgstr "Obrat vseh drugih scenarijev, in to namerno. Formalizirano kot svojo vlogo v [034-Kaj?svc-ai-robot.md](034-svc-ai-robot.md). Tukaj je Hermes dobil polne pravice za raziskovanje in vožnjo **en namenski stroj** da lahko začrta svojo strojno opremo in deluje v fizičnem svetu: ideja robotske platforme. To je samo skladno v skladu z odločbo #12."

