msgid "The machine starts from the **distribution base image**, not from an image this project publishes, so the replay also exercises the installation. `MACHINE_BASE_IMAGE` is read as `INFINITO_PARENT_IMAGE` out of the `.env` of the mounted checkout, where the env layer has already composed it from the [meta/distros.yml](../../../../../meta/distros.yml) SPOT and honoured any `custom.env` override. A missing `.env` fails the test with a pointer to `make dotenv`. The one build step of [files/test/Dockerfile](../../../../../roles/web-app-docs/files/test/Dockerfile) runs [init.sh](../../../../../roles/web-app-docs/files/test/init.sh), which returns immediately when the base already carries `/sbin/init`."
msgstr "Stroj se začne iz **slika osnovne porazdelitve**, ne iz slike, ki jo ta projekt objavlja, zato replay izvaja tudi instalacijo. `MACHINE_BASE_IMAGE` se bere kot `INFINITO_PARENT_IMAGE` ven iz `.env` za vgrajeno odjavo, kjer jo je env plast že sestavila iz [meta/distros.yml](../../../../../meta/distros.yml) SPOT in čast vsak `custom.env` Preglasi. Pogrešan `.env` ne opravi preskusa s kazalcem `make dotenv`. Eden gradi korak [files/test/Dockerfile](../../../../../roles/web-app-docs/files/test/Dockerfile) teče [init.sh](../../../../../roles/web-app-docs/files/test/init.sh), ki se vrne takoj, ko baza že nosi `/sbin/init`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The machine 🐳"
msgstr "Stroj 🐳"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The main entry points are:"
msgstr "Glavne vstopne točke so:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The main goals of this role are:"
msgstr "Glavni cilji te vloge so:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The main purpose of this role is to keep Docker environments clean by identifying and reporting orphaned anonymous volumes."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je ohraniti Dockerjeva okolja čista z identifikacijo osirotelih anonimnih zvezkov in poročanjem o njih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The main purpose of this role is to keep Docker environments clean by identifying and reporting orphaned anonymous volumes.   It supports a whitelist mechanism to avoid alerting on known or intentional volumes."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je ohraniti Dockerjeva okolja čista z identifikacijo osirotelih anonimnih zvezkov in poročanjem o njih. Podpira mehanizem bele liste, ki preprečuje opozarjanje na znane ali namerne količine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The main purpose of this role is to:"
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The maintained native path needs Kibana Agent Builder with its index privileges and licence; the older sidecar is deprecated."
msgstr "Ohranjena domača pot potrebuje Kibana Agent Builder s svojimi indeksnimi privilegiji in licenco; starejša stranska prikolica je odvzeta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The make target ultimately calls the same CLI, so any behaviour described here applies to both."
msgstr "Tarča znamke na koncu imenuje isti CLI, zato vsako tukaj opisano vedenje velja za oba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The manager legs of steps 2, 4 and 9 run only when the app's include closure contains `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` / `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`. `utils/tests/swarm/backup_repos.py` derives both the manager's inventory groups and the `remote-2-local` provider list from that closure; apps without those roles prove the chain through the nfs repository."
msgstr "Upravitelj noge korakov 2, 4 ter 9 Poženi le, če aplikacija vsebuje zaprtje `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` / `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`. `utils/tests/swarm/backup_repos.py` izpelje tako inventarno skupino upravljavca kot `remote-2-local` seznam ponudnikov iz tega zaprtja; aplikacije brez teh vlog dokazujejo verigo skozi skladišče nfs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The manifest document, or None when the generation carries none."
msgstr "Manifestni dokument ali ga ni, če generacija ne nosi nobenega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The manual entry workflow (`entry-manual-steer.yml`) sets `cancel-in-progress: true` on its own group, and the orchestrator's group cancels for `workflow_dispatch` regardless of ref, so a manual sweep supersedes on both levels, `main` included."
msgstr "Ročni potek dela za vstop (`entry-manual-steer.yml`) kompleti `cancel-in-progress: true` na lastno skupino, in skupina orkestra odpove za `workflow_dispatch` ne glede na sodnika, tako ročno čiščenje nadomesti na obeh ravneh, `main` vključno s tem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The map itself is generated, never tracked, so no second copy of a hostname can drift; ``utils.cache.render.render_artifacts`` writes it once the value-set is built."
msgstr "Sam zemljevid se ustvari, nikoli sledi, tako da nobena druga kopija imena gostitelja ne more drseti; ``utils.cache.render.render_artifacts`` Zapiše jo, ko je nastavljena vrednost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The marked row carries `instructions: <mode>` in the matrix JSON and a 📖 in its job title, between the variant number and the ⭐ of a priority row."
msgstr "Označena vrstica nosi `instructions: <mode>` v matrici JSON in a 📖 v svojem delovnem naslovu med številko variante in prednostno vrstico."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The marker adds `web-app-docs` to that row's `apps`, so the documentation is deployed beside the role under test. Its own CLI test then reads the role's page, takes the Production block out of the rendered HTML, and runs it."
msgstr "Marker dodaja `web-app-docs` do te vrste. `apps`, tako da je dokumentacija razporejena poleg vloge, ki se preskuša. Njen CLI test nato prebere stran vloge, vzame produkcijski blok iz prevedenega HTML in ga vodi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The marker file carries the same name as the swarm drill's (`scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/routine/backup/base.sh`) — one name for one concept. The implementations stay apart on purpose: the swarm drill follows a single token across five hops on four machines from the controller, which has nothing in common with marking every subject of one host beyond the three lines that write a file and read it back."
msgstr "Označevalna datoteka nosi isto ime kot rojevska vaja. (`scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/routine/backup/base.sh`) – eno ime za en koncept. Izvedbe ostanejo namenoma ločene: rojevska svedra sledi enemu samemu žetonu čez pet hmeljev na štirih strojih iz krmilnika, ki nima nič skupnega z označevanjem vsakega predmeta enega gostitelja onkraj treh vrstic, ki pišejo datoteko in jo berejo nazaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The match stream is built once per process by `_scan.iter_matches` and shared across the four test classes; the repo-derived context (application defaults, user defaults, per-role schemas, `application_id`-declaring role set) comes from `_scan.get_context`. Validation helpers live in `_validate.py`. Suppression is wired through the project's `noqa` / `nocheck` grammar; the rule key is `lookup-config-path` (see [suppression.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."
msgstr "Vžigalični tok je zgrajen enkrat na postopek z `_scan.iter_matches` in deljena med štirimi preskusnimi razredi; kontekst, pridobljen z repo (privzete aplikacije, privzete uporabniške napake, sheme na role, `application_id`-Prijava seta vlog) prihaja iz `_scan.get_context`. Potrditev pomočniki živijo v `_validate.py`. Zatiranje je povezano s projektom. `noqa` / `nocheck` slovnica; ključ pravila je `lookup-config-path` (glej [suppression.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The matcher itself lives in :mod:`utils.cache.gitignore` (single SPOT for ``.gitignore`` parsing and matching). :func:`iter_non_ignored_files` here composes the cached project walk with that matcher and is the recommended helper for lint tests that want the \"files git would track\" view without subprocessing."
msgstr "Sam tekmovalec živi v :mod:`utils.cache.gitignore` (enojni SPOT za ``.gitignore`` razčlenjevanje in ujemanje). :func:`iter_non_ignored_files` Tukaj sestavlja cached projekt sprehod s tem tekmo in je priporočljivo pomočnik za teste lin, ki želijo \"Datoteke bi sledile\" pogled brez podobdelave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The matching Pull Request template defines PR structure, required author input, and review context. You MUST use the guidance in [Pull Request Templates](../artefact/git/pull-request.md) and orient your Pull Request to it."
msgstr "Skladna predloga Pull Request določa strukturo PR, zahteva avtorski vnos in kontekst pregledovanja. Navodila morate uporabljati v [Potegni predloge za zahtevo](../artefact/git/pull-request.md) in usmerite svojo zahtevo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The materialised application payload exposes services under the bare ``services`` key (no ``compose.services`` wrapper). The function name is preserved for backwards compatibility with existing call sites."
msgstr "Utelešeni koristni tovor pri aplikaciji izpostavlja storitve v celoti ``services`` ključ (ni ``compose.services`` ovoj). Ime funkcije je ohranjena za vzvratno združljivost z obstoječimi klicnimi mesti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The matrix hands every row exactly one filesystem, so the value a deploy job sees is always narrow. Reading that narrowness as a demand would turn every condition the applying step is built to tolerate into a red row: a loop device it could not claim, a pool another job still holds, a kernel without the module."
msgstr "Matrika podaja vsako vrstico točno en datotečni sistem, tako da je vrednost razporedi delo vidi vedno ozko. Branje, da bi ozkost kot zahteva spremenila vsak pogoj uporabe korak je zgrajen za prenašanje v rdečo vrsto: zanka naprava, ki je ni mogel trditi, bazen drugo delo še vedno drži, jedro brez modula."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The matrix is **directional** (the row hosts the plugin/flag); bidirectional pairs such as `nextcloud`↔`openproject` carry a symbol in both cells. It is generated by [cli/build/docs/integration_matrix](../../cli/build/docs/integration_matrix/__main__.py): ☑️ edges are scanned from every role's `meta/services.yml` (the `sso`/`matomo`/`prometheus`/`email`/`dashboard`/`css`/`logout`/`cdn`/`coturn`/`collabora`/`onlyoffice`/`libretranslate` keys), and ✅/🪙 edges come from a curated, web-verified `EDGES` map. It MUST be regenerated rather than hand-edited. At creation time it covers 82 roles with **523 infinito-native (☑️) wired edges plus 96 curated upstream (✅/🪙) edges**. The ☑️ layer is exhaustive (it is scanned from the repo); the ✅/🪙 layer is **not yet exhaustive** and grows as each role's upstream plugin ecosystem is researched in depth (e.g. a MediaWiki deep-dive added `DiscourseSsoConsumer`, `PeerTubeEmbed`, `MachineTranslation`→libretranslate, `Extension:AWS`→minio, and an LLM editor→openwebui). The ✅/🪙 set is the **backlog**: every ✅ pair is an addon this requirement commits to declare and wire (see Acceptance Criteria), and completing the per-role upstream survey is itself an acceptance criterion."
msgstr "Matriks je **smerna** (vrstica gosti plugin/flag); dvosmerni pari, kot so `nextcloud`↔`openproject` nosite simbol v obeh celicah. To ustvarja [cli/build/docs/integration_matrix](../../cli/build/docs/integration_matrix/__main__.py): ☑️ Robovi so skenirani iz vsake vloge. `meta/services.yml` (o `sso`/`matomo`/`prometheus`/`email`/`dashboard`/`css`/`logout`/`cdn`/`coturn`/`collabora`/`onlyoffice`/`libretranslate` tipke)in ✅/🪙 robovi izvirajo iz kuriranega, preverljivega spleta `EDGES` zemljevid. Treba ga je regenerirati, ne ročno. V času ustvarjanja zajema 82 vloge z **523 brezkončno (☑️) žični robovi plus 96 kurirana proti toku (✅/🪙) robovi**. O ☑️ plast je izčrpna (je skeniran iz repo); ✅/🪙 plast **še ni izčrpno** in raste, saj je vsaka vloga je gornji plugin ekosistem je raziskan v globino (Npr. MediaWiki globoko diven `DiscourseSsoConsumer`, `PeerTubeEmbed`, `MachineTranslation`→libretranslate, `Extension:AWS`→minio, in LLM urednik →openwebui). O ✅/🪙 set je **zaostanek**: vsak ✅ par je dodatek te zahteve zavezuje k prijavi in žice (glej Merila sprejemljivosti), in dokončanje raziskave na role na začetku dobavne verige je samo po sebi sprejemljivo merilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The matrix is **directional**: the row hosts the plugin/flag. Bidirectional pairs (e.g. `nextcloud`↔`openproject`) carry a symbol in both cells, each linking to that side."
msgstr "Matriks je **smerna**: vrstica gosti plugin/flag. Dvosmerni pari (Npr. `nextcloud`↔`openproject`) v obeh celicah nosita simbol, ki se povezuje s to stranjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The matrix orchestrator (`utils/tests/swarm/matrix.py`) drives the deploy stage per variant round; `routine/00_one.sh` drives the surrounding stages for one distro, and the workflow `.github/workflows/call-test-deploy.yml` drives the distro loop. Run one app locally with `make swarm-zombie app=<id>` (keeps the cluster for inspection) or the whole matrix via `make roundtrip`."
msgstr "Matrični orkestrator (`utils/tests/swarm/matrix.py`) poganja fazo uvajanja na variantni krog; `routine/00_one.sh` poganja okoliške faze za eno distro, in potek dela `.github/workflows/call-test-deploy.yml` Poganja distro zanko. Poženi eno aplikacijo krajevno z `make swarm-zombie app=<id>` (ohranja grozd za pregled) ali celoten matriks prek `make roundtrip`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The matrix orchestrator needs these before it provisions, so that the authorized_keys reach host_vars through the merging ``--vars`` channel rather than through the replacing extra-vars file."
msgstr "Matrični orkestrator jih potrebuje, preden jih priskrbi. authorized_keys Doseg host_vars z združitvijo ``--vars`` kanal in ne preko datoteke, ki nadomešča dodatne spremenljivke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The matrix-variant planner (see [variants.md](variants.md)) calls the expansion once per round, so each round's inventory gets the right transitive closure for that round's variant set."
msgstr "Načrtovalec matričnih spremenljivk (glej [variants.md](variants.md)) Pokliče širitev enkrat na krog, tako da vsak krog inventar dobi pravo tranzitno zaprtje za to rundo variantni set."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The mautrix network bridges are declared in ``meta/addons/`` as ``mechanism: bridge`` addons (requirement 026, Decision 13). Each is ``required: false`` and **disabled by default**; its per-network DB password and its appservice ``as_token``/``hs_token`` pair are referenced from ```meta/secrets.yml`` <./meta/secrets.yml>`__ ``credentials:``, never inlined. The role renders each bridge’s ``config.yaml`` and the matching Synapse ``registration.yaml`` from the same tokens."
msgstr "Omrežni mostovi Mautrix so navedeni v ``meta/addons/`` kot ``mechanism: bridge`` Dodatki (zahteva 026, Sklep 13). Vsak je ``required: false`` ter **privzeto onemogočeno**; geslo DB na omrežje in aplikacija ``as_token``/``hs_token`` par je naveden od ```meta/secrets.yml`` <./meta/secrets.yml>`__ ``credentials:``, never inlined. The role renders each bridge’s ``config.yaml`` and the matching Synapse ``registration.yaml`` Iz istih žetonov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The mautrix network bridges are declared in `meta/addons/` as `mechanism: bridge` addons (requirement 026, Decision 13). Each is `required: false` and **disabled by default**; its per-network DB password and its appservice `as_token`/`hs_token` pair are referenced from [`meta/secrets.yml`](./meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:`, never inlined. The role renders each bridge's `config.yaml` and the matching Synapse `registration.yaml` from the same tokens."
msgstr "Omrežni mostovi Mautrix so navedeni v `meta/addons/` kot `mechanism: bridge` Dodatki (zahteva 026, Sklep 13). Vsak je `required: false` ter **privzeto onemogočeno**; geslo DB na omrežje in aplikacija `as_token`/`hs_token` par je naveden od [`meta/secrets.yml`](./meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:`, Nikoli ni bil vključen. Vloga naredi vsak most je `config.yaml` in ujemanje sinapse `registration.yaml` Iz istih žetonov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The measurement decides **which** value each axis takes, never **whether** it takes one:"
msgstr "Meritev se odloči **ki** vrednost vsake osi, nikoli **ali** Ena je potrebna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The merged map is what the inventory ALSO bakes into host_vars, so feeding the same dict into `CombinedResolver(services_overrides=...)` eliminates the topology-vs-host_vars drift that variant-blind resolution produced."
msgstr "Združeni zemljevid je tisto, v kar inventar TUDI peče host_vars, tako da hranijo isti dikt v `CombinedResolver(services_overrides=...)` odpravlja topologijo-vs-host_vars odnašam proizvedeno variantno slepo ločljivost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The metrics endpoint needs a server-generated token that cannot be pre-seeded into a static scrape config from the inventory. Same pattern as `web-app-gitea`. Gives the `openbao_core_unsealed` gauge."
msgstr "Metrična končna točka potrebuje strežniški žeton, ki ga ni mogoče vnaprej sejati v statično strgalo iz inventarja. Enak vzorec kot `web-app-gitea`. Daje `openbao_core_unsealed` merilnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The minimum env set for any spec following the persona flows is `APP_BASE_URL`, `CANONICAL_DOMAIN`, and `LOGOUT_URL`. `DASHBOARD_BASE_URL` is rendered only by the dashboard role's own spec, because consumer personas enter at `APP_BASE_URL` directly. Specs that gate on auth additionally read at least one of `OIDC_ISSUER_URL`, `KEYCLOAK_BASE_URL`, plus the persona credentials `ADMIN_USERNAME` / `ADMIN_PASSWORD` and `BIBER_USERNAME` / `BIBER_PASSWORD`. Specs that exercise integrations (Matomo, Discourse, Email, Prometheus, …) read the integration-specific keys defined in [Agent `playwright.env.j2`](../../../../agents/files/role/playwright.env.j2.md)."
msgstr "Minimalni env set za vsako specifikacijo, ki sledi persona tokov, je `APP_BASE_URL`, `CANONICAL_DOMAIN`, in `LOGOUT_URL`. `DASHBOARD_BASE_URL` je prevedena samo z lastno vlogo armaturne plošče, ker potrošniška oseba vstopi na `APP_BASE_URL` neposredno. Specifikacije, ki vrata na obodu dodatno preberejo vsaj eno od `OIDC_ISSUER_URL`, `KEYCLOAK_BASE_URL`, plus osebne poverilnice `ADMIN_USERNAME` / `ADMIN_PASSWORD` ter `BIBER_USERNAME` / `BIBER_PASSWORD`. Specs, ki izvajajo integracije (Matomo, Discourse, e-pošta, Prometheus, ...) Preberi tipke za integracijo, določene v [Agent `playwright.env.j2`](../../../../agents/files/role/playwright.env.j2.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The mirror workflow runs as stage 8 of the CI pipeline. See [ci.md](../git/pipeline.md). It runs in parallel with the DNS tests and MUST complete before deploy tests start."
msgstr "Zrcalni potek dela poteka kot faza 8 plinovoda CI. Glej. [ci.md](../git/pipeline.md). Poteka vzporedno s preskusi DNS in MORA zaključiti pred začetkom preskusov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The mirrors file is generated into the inventory directory. The inventory creator applies mirror image overrides to host variables via `cli/administration/inventory/provision/mirror_overrides.py`, which reads `mirrors.yml.applications` and writes `applications.{role}.services.{service}.image` (and `.version`) into host vars subject to the per-service `mirror_policy`."
msgstr "Datoteka z ogledali je ustvarjena v imeniku. Ustvarjalec inventarja uporablja zrcalno sliko, ki preko gostiteljskih spremenljivk prevlada nad spremenljivkami `cli/administration/inventory/provision/mirror_overrides.py`, ki se glasi `mirrors.yml.applications` in piše `applications.{role}.services.{service}.image` (ter `.version`) v gostiteljske vare, ki so predmet posamezne storitve `mirror_policy`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The mode is read as ``compose_mode_force or DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` rather than the bare cluster mode, because ``container_networks`` resolves attachments through that same effective mode: a role with an override must not lose its pin and its overlay at once."
msgstr "Način se bere kot ``compose_mode_force or DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` namesto načina golega grozda, ker ``container_networks`` reši priponke z enakim učinkovitim načinom: vloga s preklopom ne sme naenkrat izgubiti čepa in pokrova."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The mode selection is a *filter*, not an axis: ``--modes swarm`` keeps the rows whose role can be deployed as a swarm stack, ``--modes \"compose swarm\"`` keeps the rows at least one of the two can take. The shared filter is mode-clause + INFINITO_WHITELIST + INFINITO_BLACKLIST, the order is INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT, whose first key sorts clones last (one representative per dna cluster stays ahead of the budget cut, so redundant same-service-set variants fall behind it first), and the lifecycle envelope is INFINITO_LIFECYCLES."
msgstr "Izbira načina je *filter*, ni os: ``--modes swarm`` ohranja vrste, katerih vloga se lahko uporabi kot roj, ``--modes \"compose swarm\"`` ohranja vrstice vsaj ena od dveh lahko sprejmejo. Skupni filter je mode-klavzula + INFINITO_WHITELIST + INFINITO_BLACKLIST, Ukaz je: INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT, katerih prve tipke kloni trajajo (en predstavnik na skupino DNK ostane pred zmanjšanjem proračuna, tako da za njim najprej zaostajajo odvečne variante z istimi storitvami), in ovojnica življenjskega kroga je INFINITO_LIFECYCLES."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The mode sequence defaults to `compose swarm` and is overridable with `modes=\"compose swarm\"`. The order is always compose first, so the cheaper mode fails fast before the expensive swarm rebuild. Append `k8s` here once that mode exists."
msgstr "Privzeto zaporedje načina `compose swarm` in je preobremenjena z `modes=\"compose swarm\"`. Naročilo je vedno sestaviti najprej, tako da cenejši način hitro propade, preden drago roj obnoviti. Dodaj `k8s` Tukaj, ko ta način obstaja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The mode the guide would replay *app* in, or ``''`` when it cannot."
msgstr "Način, ki ga vodič ponavlja *aplikacija* v, ali ``''`` ko ne more."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The module is deliberately free of deploy-runtime imports: the CI selection resolves its closure on a runner that has no inventory, no container and no `INFINITO_SRC_DIR`."
msgstr "Modul je namerno prost uvoza z uporabo-tekočega časa: izbor CI odpravi zaprtje na tekaču, ki nima inventarja, zabojnika in ne `INFINITO_SRC_DIR`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The mount MUST be available before Docker starts. Otherwise the daemon may fall back to the system drive or fail to start cleanly."
msgstr "Priklop mora biti na voljo, preden se Docker zažene. V nasprotnem primeru lahko demon pade nazaj na sistemski pogon ali ne začne čisto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The name never holds a space: the ``whitelist`` and ``priority`` workflow inputs are space-separated lists, so a display name with a space in it would make a two-role list unparseable."
msgstr "Ime nikoli ne drži prostora: ``whitelist`` ter ``priority`` Vhodni podatki o delovnem toku so ločeni s presledkom, zato bi bilo ime zaslona s prostorom v njem neločljivo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The name of the matching role directory."
msgstr "Ime ujemajočega imenika vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The names in declaration order, aliases substituted."
msgstr "Imena v vrstnem redu deklaracije, nadomeščena z vzdevki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The names payload is stored under in THIS generation."
msgstr "Imena koristnega tovora so shranjena v THE generaciji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The naming conventions below are additionally checked locally by the lint test [test_branch_name.py](../../../../tests/lint/repository/naming/test_branch_name.py), which fails `make test-lint` when the checked-out branch uses an unknown prefix (e.g. `feat/` instead of `feature/`) or a non-kebab-case description."
msgstr "Spodnje dogovore o poimenovanju dodatno preverjamo na lokalni ravni s testom line [test_branch_name.py](../../../../tests/lint/repository/naming/test_branch_name.py), ki ne uspe `make test-lint` kadar odkljukana veja uporablja neznano predpono (Npr. `feat/` namesto `feature/`) ali opis primera brez kebaba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The narrow case is what a deploy job actually sees, because the matrix hands every row exactly one kind. Reading that narrowness as a demand would turn every condition the applying step tolerates into a red row on every deploy: a loop device it could not claim, a pool another job still holds. The run's own input decides instead."
msgstr "Ozek primer je tisto, kar dejansko vidi delovno mesto, ker matrika podaja vsako vrsto posebej. Branje, da ozkost kot povpraševanje bi spremenili vsak pogoj uporabe korak tolerira v rdečo vrsto na vsaki uporabi: zanka naprava, ki je ni mogel trditi, bazen drugo delo še vedno drži. Namesto tega se odloči lastni prispevek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The next `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=web-app-hugo` will pull the image, restart nginx, and serve the freshly rendered output."
msgstr "Naslednji `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=web-app-hugo` bo potegnila sliko, ponovno zagnala ginx in služila sveže prevedeni izhod."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The next stage in the pipeline MUST NOT execute when the previous stage classified the plugin as `incompatible`."
msgstr "Naslednja stopnja v cevovodu NE SME izvesti, ko je prejšnja stopnja razvrstila vstavek kot `incompatible`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The nfs-server uses the userspace `nfs-ganesha` (`ganesha`) flavor in every runtime; `services.nfs-server.flavor` in `roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/services.yml` is the SPOT, and `kernel` is a per-inventory override. Ganesha is packaged for the `Debian` and `RedHat` os families only. Kernel `nfsd` in a privileged DinD node is wedge-prone: the export can be present yet the controller mount returns ENOENT, and `exportfs` can stick in D-state. If a swarm step hangs at `Reload NFS exports` from a stuck kernel-NFS mount, you MUST recover with `make swarm-clean` on the host; see the NFS gotcha in [Roundtrip Loop](roundtrip.md). You MUST NOT fall back to a compose-only sweep while swarm is blocked."
msgstr "Nfs-strežnik uporablja uporabniški prostor `nfs-ganesha` (`ganesha`) okus v vsakem teku; `services.nfs-server.flavor` v `roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/services.yml` je SPOT in `kernel` je preklop na popis. Ganesha je pakiran za `Debian` ter `RedHat` Samo družine. Ječmen `nfsd` v privilegiranem DIND vozlišču je klin-pron: izvoz je lahko prisoten, vendar nadzornik mount vrne ENOENT, in `exportfs` Lahko ostane v državi D. Če korak roj visi na `Reload NFS exports` iz priključka za zataknjeno jedro-NFS, morate okrevati z `make swarm-clean` na gostitelja; glej NFS dobil v [Roundtrip Loop](roundtrip.md). Ne smete pasti nazaj v komponirano-samo čiščenje, medtem ko je roj blokiran."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The nginx upstream map, the consumer compose override and the package managers' client configuration all follow from the ``cache:`` declarations in the roles' `meta/networks.yml`. None of them is tracked; this package regenerates them. Implementation lives in `utils.cache.render`."
msgstr "Zemljevid ginx v zgornjem toku, kompost potrošnikov in konfiguracija odjemalca upravljalcev paketov sledijo ``cache:`` izjave v vlogah“ `meta/networks.yml`. Ta paket jih obnavlja. Izvajanje `utils.cache.render`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The nightly timers (volume 01:00, nfs 01:30, secrets 01:45, device 02:00, remote pull 00:30) run independently of every step above and never fire during a lab run."
msgstr "Nočne ure (glasnost 01:00, nfs 01:30, skrivnosti 01:45, naprava 02:00, daljinsko vlečenje 00:30) teči neodvisno od vsakega koraka zgoraj in nikoli ne streljati med poskusom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The node hidden service exposes Mailu's mail ports in addition to `80`, via extra `HiddenServicePort` entries: `HiddenServicePort 25`, `587`, `465`, `143`, `993` → Mailu's local front binds on `127.0.0.1`. Mailu is then reachable at `<node>.onion` for SMTP/submission/IMAP."
msgstr "Vozlišče skrito storitev razkriva Mailupoštnih vrat poleg `80`, preko ekstra `HiddenServicePort` vnosi: `HiddenServicePort 25`, `587`, `465`, `143`, `993` → MailuLokalna fronta se veže `127.0.0.1`. Mailu je nato dosegljiv na `<node>.onion` besedilo SMTP/submission/IMAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The number of discarded translations; their entries keep no ``msgstr``."
msgstr "Število zavrženih prevodov; njihovi vnosi ne vsebujejo ``msgstr``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The number of dumps replayed."
msgstr "Število smetišč se je ponovilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The oauth2 ACL in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) blacklists only `/login`, and `sys-svc-proxy` renders a blacklist as *expose everything by default, then protect the listed paths*. The helper lands on `/`, which is public, so the proxy never intercepts it and the Keycloak round trip never starts."
msgstr "Oauth2 ACL v [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) samo črni seznami `/login`, in `sys-svc-proxy` naredi črno listo kot *razkrije vse privzeto, nato zaščitite navedene poti*Pomočnik pristane na `/`, ki je javno, tako da pooblaščenec nikoli ne prestreže in Keycloak Polet se nikoli ne začne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The oauth2 ACL in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ blacklists only ``/login``, and ``sys-svc-proxy`` renders a blacklist as *expose everything by default, then protect the listed paths*. The helper lands on ``/``, which is public, so the proxy never intercepts it and the Keycloak round trip never starts."
msgstr "Oauth2 ACL v ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ blacklists only ``/login``, and ``sys-svc-proxy`` renders a blacklist as *expose everything by default, then protect the listed paths*. The helper lands on ``/``, ki je javno, tako da pooblaščenec nikoli ne prestreže in Keycloak Polet se nikoli ne začne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The offered modes are already narrowed by the run's ``--modes`` input, the onion states by its ``--tor`` input and the two pools by ``--distros`` and ``--filesystem``, so this catches a pin that fights the role, the variant, or the run's own axes with one check each."
msgstr "Ponujeni načini so že zoženi. ``--modes`` vložek, čebula države po svojih ``--tor`` vnos in oba sklada po ``--distros`` ter ``--filesystem``, tako da to ujame pin, ki se bori vlogo, varianto, ali run je lastne osi z enim preverjanjem vsak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The official Baserow SSO feature is Enterprise-only. This role instead gates the community image with the shared Keycloak oauth2-proxy and installs a small trusted-header bridge in the Baserow backend. The bridge trusts the identity headers injected by nginx after oauth2-proxy authentication and converts them into native Baserow JWT refresh/access tokens for the frontend."
msgstr "Uradnik Baserow SSO funkcija je samo Enterprise. Ta vloga namesto tega odpira podobo skupnosti s skupno Keycloak oauth2-proxy in vgradi majhno zaupanja vredno glavo most v Baserow Hrbtenica. Most zaupa glavam identitete, ki jih je vbrizgal ginx po Oauthu.2-proxy avtentikacija in jih pretvori v avtohtone Baserow JWT osvežitev/dostop žetoni za frontend."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The official WordPress MCP adapter pinned, its HTTP endpoint exposed, only reviewed Abilities with permission callbacks registered, authenticated as a real restricted user."
msgstr "Uradnik WordPress MCP adapter pripet, njegova HTTP končnica izpostavljena, samo pregledane sposobnosti z dovoljenji allbacks registrirani, overovljena kot resnično omejen uporabnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The official installer is **downloaded at runtime** and verified before execution:"
msgstr "Uradni monter je **preneseno med izvajanjem** in preverjeno pred izvršitvijo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The offset a run was given, as written. ``None`` reads ``INFINITO_CI_OFFSET``; :func:`offset_index` decides what it means."
msgstr "Odštevanje je bilo dano, kot je zapisano. ``None`` bere ``INFINITO_CI_OFFSET``; :func:`offset_index` Odloči se, kaj pomeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The one accepted ``--set`` key shape for a credential override."
msgstr "Tisti, ki je sprejel ``--set`` Ključna oblika za potrditev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The one-shot smoke mail the msmtp prefix puts in front of a probe."
msgstr "Enostrelna dimna pošta, ki jo postavi pred sondo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The onion axis of the CI deploy matrix: what it may do, and to which rows."
msgstr "Čebulna os KI uporablja matriko: kaj lahko stori in na katere vrstice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The onion identity (key files) is minted/reused by ``cli.administration.inventory.onion``; this provisioner is the single spot that writes the resulting address into ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` of the host_vars — so consumers read it via ``lookup('config', 'svc-net-tor', 'services.tor.node')`` with no env indirection."
msgstr "Identiteta čebule (ključne datoteke) kovanje/ponovna uporaba ``cli.administration.inventory.onion``; ta ponudnik je edini kraj, ki zapiše nastali naslov v ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` – host_vars — zato jo potrošniki preberejo prek ``lookup('config', 'svc-net-tor', 'services.tor.node')`` brez indirektive."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The onion key is minted offline during inventory build (``cli.administration.inventory.onion``) and stored in the inventory, so the address is stable across redeploys and restorable from a backup."
msgstr "Ključ čebule je odstranjen med izdelavo inventarja. (``cli.administration.inventory.onion``) in shranjena v inventarju, tako da je naslov stabilen po prerazporeditvah in ga je mogoče obnoviti iz varnostne kopije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The onion key is minted offline during inventory build (`cli.administration.inventory.onion`) and stored in the inventory, so the address is stable across redeploys and restorable from a backup."
msgstr "Ključ čebule je odstranjen med izdelavo inventarja. (`cli.administration.inventory.onion`) in shranjena v inventarju, tako da je naslov stabilen po prerazporeditvah in ga je mogoče obnoviti iz varnostne kopije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The onion state is spelled `+clearnet` rather than `-tor` because a role id may itself end in `-tor`."
msgstr "Čebulno stanje se črkuje `+clearnet` namesto `-tor` ker se lahko identična vloga sama konča `-tor`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The onion state spells out as ``+tor``/``+clearnet`` rather than as a ``-tor`` suffix: a role id may itself end in ``-tor`` (``svc-net-tor``), and a suffix that eats the tail of a role name selects a different role in silence."
msgstr "Čebula se glasi: ``+tor``/``+clearnet`` in ne kot ``-tor`` pripona: ID vloge se lahko sama konča v ``-tor`` (``svc-net-tor``), in pripona, ki poje rep imena vloge izbere drugačno vlogo v tišini."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The onion states one *mode* is worth running for a priority row."
msgstr "Čebula navaja enega. *način* Vredno je kandidirati za prednostno vrsto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The only account that form accepts is Checkmk's built-in `cmkadmin`, whose password comes from `credentials.cmk_password` (`CMK_PASSWORD` in the container env) — a site-local secret unrelated to the Keycloak credentials the personas use. No Checkmk user is provisioned for a non-admin identity at all. With SSO enabled both personas run through the header-auth chain."
msgstr "Edini račun, ki ga obrazec sprejme, je Checkmkje vgrajen `cmkadmin`, katere geslo prihaja iz `credentials.cmk_password` (`CMK_PASSWORD` v zabojniku env) – lokalno skrivnost, ki ni povezana z Keycloak poverilnice za uporabo osebe. Št. Checkmk uporabnik je na voljo za identifikacijo, ki ni dostava. S SSO je omogočil obema personas teči skozi glavo-auth verige."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The only account that form accepts is Checkmk’s built-in ``cmkadmin``, whose password comes from ``credentials.cmk_password`` (``CMK_PASSWORD`` in the container env) — a site-local secret unrelated to the Keycloak credentials the personas use. No Checkmk user is provisioned for a non-admin identity at all. With SSO enabled both personas run through the header-auth chain."
msgstr "Edini račun, ki ga obrazec sprejme, je CheckmkVgrajeni ``cmkadmin``, katere geslo prihaja iz ``credentials.cmk_password`` (``CMK_PASSWORD`` v zabojniku env) – lokalno skrivnost, ki ni povezana z Keycloak poverilnice za uporabo osebe. Št. Checkmk uporabnik je na voljo za identifikacijo, ki ni dostava. S SSO je omogočil obema personas teči skozi glavo-auth verige."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The operator MUST review the staged diff and message before committing."
msgstr "Operater MORA pregledati uprizorjeno diff in sporočilo pred izvedbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The orchestrator and the push entry workflow (`entry-push-latest.yml`) cancel in-progress runs on every ref except `main`, which no automatic trigger cancels. A `pull_request_target` run inherits `refs/heads/main` as its ref, so the orchestrator does not cancel there either; per-PR supersession is handled by the entry workflow's own `pr-ci-*` group. See [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Orkester in potek dela potisnega vhoda (`entry-push-latest.yml`) preklic zagona na vseh ref, razen `main`, ki ne samodejno sproži preklica. A `pull_request_target` zaženi podedovanje `refs/heads/main` kot njen ref, tako da orkestrator tudi tam ne odpove; per-PR supersession se ravna z vstopnim potekom dela `pr-ci-*` skupina. Glej. [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The orchestrator runs the following stages in order:"
msgstr "Orkester vodi naslednje faze:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The orchestrator's `wait-fork-prereq-run` job **skips the wait** for the privileged fork images."
msgstr "Orkester je. `wait-fork-prereq-run` opravilo **preskoči čakanje** za privilegirane vilice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The order in `ORDERED_HANDLERS` MUST respect data dependencies. Example: `infinito_container` runs after `passthrough` so it can read the resolved `INFINITO_DISTRO`."
msgstr "Vrstni red `ORDERED_HANDLERS` MORAJO spoštovati odvisnosti podatkov. Primer: `infinito_container` teče po `passthrough` Tako da lahko preberete rešeno `INFINITO_DISTRO`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The order is a precondition, not a preference. `baudolo-restore --empty` pre-cleans the schema in one psql session and replays in the next; a booting consumer recreates it in between and the dump's own `CREATE TABLE` fails — which is how zammad turned this drill red with `relation \"ar_internal_metadata\" already exists`. The chain refuses the replay while a consumer runs, so a drill that got the order wrong would fail loudly instead of flaking."
msgstr "Naročilo je predpogoj, ne prednost. `baudolo-restore --empty` pred-očisti shemo v eni seji psql in ponovno predvaja v naslednji; zagon potrošnik poustvarja vmes in smetišče je lastno `CREATE TABLE` neuspešno – tako je Zammad postal ta vrtalnik rdeč z `relation \"ar_internal_metadata\" already exists`. Veriga zavrne ponovitev, medtem ko potrošnik teče, tako da bi vrtalnik, ki je dobil naročilo narobe, glasno propadel, namesto da bi luščenje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The order of those mocks is load-bearing and the router is not what reads it. `AI_AGENT_MODEL` takes `AI_MOCK_ALIASES | first`, so the mock declared first becomes the agent broker's model and its window becomes the context the broker gates platforms on. Declaring the 4096 mock first withheld `hermes`, whose `min_context` is 64000, and the broker's CLI test failed with the reason spelled out. The widest mock therefore leads. A sharper fix would be to have `AI_AGENT_MODEL` pick the mock with the largest declared context instead of the first one, which would make the order irrelevant."
msgstr "Red tistih norčij je nosil in usmerjevalnik ni tisto, kar ga bere. `AI_AGENT_MODEL` privzemi `AI_MOCK_ALIASES | first`, tako da se norčevanje razglasili najprej postane model agenta posrednika in njegovo okno postane kontekst posrednik vrata platforme na. Razglasitev 4096 prvič zadržano `hermes`, katerih `min_context` m 64000, Posrednikov CLI test ni uspel z razlogom. Zato vodi najširši posmeh. Bolj oster bi bil. `AI_AGENT_MODEL` namesto prvega izberite posmeh z največjim prijavljenim kontekstom, zaradi česar bi bilo naročilo nepomembno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ordered ``role#variant`` tokens the query yields."
msgstr "Naročeno ``role#variant`` Žetonska poizvedba prinaša."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ordered candidate rows, each the complexity payload of one ``role#variant``. Uncapped: the chunker decides what a sweep spends."
msgstr "Naročene vrste kandidatov, vsaka kompleksnost koristnega tovora enega ``role#variant``. Odprta: Delček odloči, kaj zapravi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The outcome of comparing the two sources."
msgstr "Rezultat primerjave obeh virov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The output format is the docker-compose `.env`-subset that is also sourceable from bash (via `set -a; source .env; set +a`). Values that contain only \"safe\" characters are emitted bare; everything else is double-quoted with backslash-escaping of `\\` and `\"`."
msgstr "Izhodna oblika je docker-kompose `.env`-podnaprava, ki je tudi izvorna iz bash (preko `set -a; source .env; set +a`). Vrednosti, ki vsebujejo samo \"safe\" znaki se oddajajo goli; vse drugo je dvakrat citirano z hrbtno poševno-odstranjevanje `\\` ter `\"`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The output starts at column 0 (no caller-side indent)."
msgstr "Izhod se začne v stolpcu 0 (ni alinee s strani klicatelja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The override path is host-vars `applications.<role>.services.<service>.{image,version}`. The inventory mirror step (see [mirror.md](mirror.md)) writes there automatically; manual overrides go to the same key."
msgstr "Pot obvoznice je gostitelj-vars `applications.<role>.services.<service>.{image,version}`. Inventar ogledalo korak (glej [mirror.md](mirror.md)) piše tam samodejno; ročno upravljanje gre na isti ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "The override path lives at the caller because Jinja-scope `{% set %}` bindings are visible only in the rendering template, never in the Ansible variable context that the lookup sees."
msgstr "Preglasna pot živi pri klicarju, ker je Jinja-scope `{% set %}` vezave so vidne samo v predlogi za upodabljanje, nikoli v variabilnem kontekstu, ki ga vidi iskalnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The override value for one credential, or None when unset."
msgstr "Vrednost preglasitve za eno poverilnico ali pa je ni, ko je izključena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The package converts the committed [default.env](../../default.env) plus a small runtime context into the gitignored `.env` at the repo root. Every module here belongs to one of four roles: parse, resolve, orchestrate, write."
msgstr "Paket pretvori zavezano [default.env](../../default.env) Pa še majhen kontekst v gitignoredu. `.env` na repo korenu. Vsak modul pripada eni od štirih vlog: razčleniti, razrešiti, orkestrirati, pisati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The package installs the lint toolchain (actionlint, shfmt, ruff, ansible-lint, mbake, markdownlint-cli2, eslint, shellcheck, ansible-playbook, ansible-galaxy) using the right channel per tool (system package manager, pip, npm, or GitHub release). Modules at this level are channel-agnostic primitives; per-tool policy lives one level down in [lint/](lint/)."
msgstr "Paket vgradi orodno verigo (actionlint, shfmt, ruff, ansible-lint, mbake, markdownlint-cli2, eslint, lullcheck, ansible-playbook, ansible-galaxy) z uporabo pravega kanala na orodje (upravljalnik sistemskih paketov, pip, npm ali sprostitev GitHub). Moduli na tej ravni so kanalsko-agnostični primitivci; politika na orodje živi eno raven navzdol v [lint/](lint/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The package is split by concern: - ``vault``: vault block construction + detection - ``overrides``: ``--set`` parsing + per-key resolution - ``emit``: recursive credentials emission into ruamel CommentedMaps - ``prompts``: interactive operator prompts - ``__main__``: argparse + orchestration"
msgstr "Sveženj je razdeljen glede na zaskrbljenost: ``vault``: konstrukcija trezorja + odkrivanje - ``overrides``: ``--set`` razčlenjevanje + ločljivost na ključ ``emit``: Rekurzivno poverilnice emisij v ruamel KomentarjiMaps - ``prompts``: interaktivni operater poziva - ``__main__``: argparza + orkestracija"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The package metadata in these folders is used to keep Infinito.Nexus host dependencies explicit and distro-specific."
msgstr "Metapodatki paketa v teh mapah se uporabljajo za shranjevanje Infinito.Nexus odvisnost od gostitelja eksplicitna in distrospecifična."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The palette is generated from a base color through `colorscheme-generator`."
msgstr "Paleta je ustvarjena iz osnovne barve skozi `colorscheme-generator`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The part of the role id the category labels do not already carry."
msgstr "Del vloge ID oznake kategorije še nimajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The password is passed via environment variables (robust with special characters)."
msgstr "Geslo se prenaša preko okoljskih spremenljivk. (robustno s posebnimi znaki)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The path ``INFINITO_SRC_DIR`` names."
msgstr "Pot ``INFINITO_SRC_DIR`` imena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pattern for hyphenated role names, which hold wherever they appear, and the one for titles, which holds only on a capitalised occurrence."
msgstr "Vzorec za imena vlog, ki imajo kjerkoli se pojavijo, in za naslove, ki se držijo le kapitaliziranega dogodka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The people the roles name as their authors."
msgstr "Ljudje imajo vloge za svoje avtorje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The per-category port ranges that the suggester proposes from and that the lint check enforces live as a single `PORT_BANDS` map in [08_networks.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/08_networks.yml). Suggesters and lint pick up new entries automatically, with no second registration step. See `cli contributing network ports suggest` in [port.md](../../../tools/network/port.md)."
msgstr "Pristanišča na kategorijo, ki jih predlaga predlagatelj, in preverjanje line se izvaja kot enojna `PORT_BANDS` zemljevid v [08networks.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/08_networks.yml). Predlagatelji in lint pobere nove vnose samodejno, brez drugega koraka registracije. Glej. `cli contributing network ports suggest` v [port.md](../../../tools/network/port.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The per-role complexity score, its ``dna`` cluster key and ``siblings``."
msgstr "Rezultat kompleksnosti na role, njen ``dna`` ključ grozda in ``siblings``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants: as described above, Postmarks' sole native credential is the single shared `ADMIN_KEY` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. `biber` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application's administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks `X-Forwarded-Groups`, so `biber` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Zastave persona so deklarirane v [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` je blokiran samo v `sso: false` različice: kot je opisano zgoraj, Postmarks'Edina domača veroizpoved je ena skupna `ADMIN_KEY` geslo, ki ni Keycloak administrator skrivnost vrste persona, tako brez zaupanja-header most ni admin prijavo za vožnjo. `biber` je blokirana v vsaki varianti – oauth2-proxy priznava samo administratorja RBAC skupine in most ponovno preverjanje `X-Forwarded-Groups`, torej `biber` je zavrnjena pred Postmarks je doseženo, in s SSO off edini credential levo pripada nobenega uporabniškega računa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. ``administrator`` is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants: as described above, Postmarks’ sole native credential is the single shared ``ADMIN_KEY`` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. ``biber`` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application’s administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks ``X-Forwarded-Groups``, so ``biber`` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Zastave persona so deklarirane v `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. ``administrator`` je blokiran samo v ``sso: false`` različice: kot je opisano zgoraj, Postmarksedino naravno poverilnico je edina skupna ``ADMIN_KEY`` geslo, ki ni Keycloak administrator skrivnost vrste persona, tako brez zaupanja-header most ni admin prijavo za vožnjo. ``biber`` je blokirana v vsaki varianti – oauth2-proxy priznava samo administratorsko skupino RBAC aplikacije in ponovno preverjanje mostu ``X-Forwarded-Groups``, torej ``biber`` je zavrnjena pred Postmarks je doseženo, in s SSO off edini credential levo pripada nobenega uporabniškega računa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The persona scenarios MUST drive the journey from [Three personas, fixed flow](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) end to end. Per-service contract tests MUST exercise the [per-service assertion catalogue](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) entry that matches their gated service. The [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) lint hard-fails the build when a stub is detected, so the rule is enforced automatically."
msgstr "Persona scenariji MORAjo voziti od [Tri osebe, fiksni tok](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) Na koncu. Preskusi naročila na storitev MORAJO izvajati [Katalog izjav na storitev](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) Vstop, ki ustreza njihovi varovani službi. – [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) Ob odkritju odrezka se gradnja težko ustavi, zato se pravilo izvaja samodejno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pin lives in ``[project.optional-dependencies].dev`` (one SPOT, Dependabot keeps it current). Host venvs, the lint container and CI all read that same pin, so a rule that is preview-gated in one release and stable in the next (e.g. ISC004, or S310 firing on ``urllib.request.Request``) cannot disagree across environments."
msgstr "Zaponka živi v ``[project.optional-dependencies].dev`` (en SPOT, Dependenabot ga ohranja tok). Gostitelj venvs, posoda za lin in CI vsi preberejo, da je isti pin, tako pravilo, ki je predogled-nastavljen v enem izpustu in stabilen v naslednjem (npr. ISC004, ali S310 Streljanje ``urllib.request.Request``) se ne more nestrinjati z okoljem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned 6.7.8.2 predates the experimental native `/api/_mcp` server."
msgstr "Pripeta 6.7.8.2 Predhodno eksperimentalno avtohtono `/api/_mcp` strežnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned build is the amd64 AppImage, and the role refuses a host of another architecture rather than linking a binary that cannot run there."
msgstr "Podkovana zgradba je amd64 Aplikacija in vloga zavračata množico druge arhitekture, namesto da bi povezali binarno napravo, ki tam ne more delovati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned image runs on arm64"
msgstr "Ukleščena slika teče na roki64"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned release is inference-only; an MCP-capable one may be selected only after source inspection proves per-server routes, exact tool allowlists and the credential lifecycle."
msgstr "Izločitev, ki jo je mogoče izbrati z MCP-jem, se lahko izvede šele po tem, ko se izkaže, da so poti na strežnika, točni seznami orodnih dovoljenj in življenjski cikel zaupanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pins are parsed by hand instead of through ``utils.cache.yaml`` because every ``lint-*`` target depends on ``install-lint``, which bootstraps the toolchain on a bare interpreter -- PyYAML is not installed yet at that point, and importing it here fails the whole lint stage with ``ModuleNotFoundError``. ``_parse_pins`` therefore only understands the two-level shape this one file uses; ``tests/unit/python/utils/install/lint/test_pinned_versions.py`` cross-checks it against PyYAML so the two readings cannot drift apart."
msgstr "Čepi so razčlenjeni z roko namesto skozi ``utils.cache.yaml`` ker vsak ``lint-*`` cilj je odvisen od ``install-lint``, ki škornji zalepijo orodno verigo na golem tolmaču -- PyYAML še ni nameščen na tej točki, in ga uvoz tukaj propade celotno fazo z ``ModuleNotFoundError``. ``_parse_pins`` zato razume samo dvostopenjsko obliko, ki jo ta datoteka uporablja; ``tests/unit/python/utils/install/lint/test_pinned_versions.py`` navzkrižno ga primerja s PyYAML, tako da se odčitki ne moreta ločiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pins are read by ``utils/install/lint/pinned.py``, which every lint installer calls:"
msgstr "Zatiči se berejo po ``utils/install/lint/pinned.py``, ki ga vsak monter lint kliče:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pins are read by `utils/install/lint/pinned.py`, which every lint installer calls:"
msgstr "Zatiči se berejo po `utils/install/lint/pinned.py`, ki ga vsak monter lint kliče:"

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span lost=[]
# gained=['ops.yml']
# nocheck: url
