msgid "The pipeline is invoked from [06_plugin.yml](../06_plugin.yml), which in turn runs once per iteration of the `NEXTCLOUD_PLUGIN_ITEMS` loop in [02_manager_ops.yml](../../02_manager_ops.yml). The loop variable `plugin_item` is unpacked into `plugin_key` (the OCC app name) and `plugin_value` (its meta entry)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pipeline owns three responsibilities for one Nextcloud plugin (app):"
msgstr "Cevovod ima tri odgovornosti za enega Nextcloud vstavek (aplikacija):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The placement rule is per check. The catalog \"Position\" column uses these labels."
msgstr "Pravilo o namestitvi je odvisno od čeka. Katalog \"Position\" stolpec uporablja te oznake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plain image tag becomes a manifest list. Anything that inspects the tag expecting a single image manifest sees an index instead."
msgstr "Navadna grafična oznaka postane manifestni seznam. Vse, kar pregleda značko in pričakuje eno sliko, vidi indeks."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plain-scalar rule is deliberately narrower than YAML's: a plain scalar must start with a letter, an underscore or a slash, and may then carry only ``[A-Za-z0-9_./+@:-]`` and spaces. That excludes every leading character PyYAML's implicit resolvers key off, so no accepted plain scalar can come back as an int, float, bool, timestamp or null."
msgstr "Pravilo ravnine je namerno ožje od pravila YAML: navaden skalar se mora začeti s črko, podčrtajem ali poševnico, nato pa lahko nosi samo ``[A-Za-z0-9_./+@:-]`` in prostori. To izključuje vsak vodilni lik PyYAML implicitni reševalci ključ off, tako da noben sprejet navaden skalar lahko vrne kot int, plovec, bool, časovni žig ali nič."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plan runs the same pipeline the deploy jobs discover through (``cli.meta.ci.matrix``), so what the table shows and what CI deploys cannot diverge. One row per ``role#variant`` candidate in global query order, with the chunk it falls into and the axes it was assigned."
msgstr "Načrt vodi enak cevovod, kot ga je treba najti. (``cli.meta.ci.matrix``), kaj prikazuje tabela in kaj KI uporablja ne more razhajati. Ena vrstica na ``role#variant`` kandidat v svetovnem vrstnem redu poizvedb, z delčkom, v katerega pade, in sekirami, ki so mu bile dodeljene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The platform already reserves a user key per role, so `hermes` and `openclaw` existed as accounts, non-privileged and each with its own mailbox, before either role claimed one. Claiming the key is what turns a reservation into an identity the agent may authenticate as, and gives the account its description."
msgstr "Platforma si že pridržuje uporabniški ključ za vsako vlogo. `hermes` ter `openclaw` so obstajali kot računi, ki niso bili privilegirani, in vsak z lastnim poštnim predalom, preden je katera koli vloga zahtevala enega. Zahtevanje ključa je tisto, kar spremeni rezervacijo v identiteto, ki jo agent lahko potrdi in da račun njegov opis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The play used to consume a task file per group, generated at setup time. The order is derived from data that already lives in the roles, so it is resolved here instead and read through the `group_roles` lookup."
msgstr "Predvajanje, ki se uporablja za porabo opravilne datoteke na skupino, ustvarjene ob času nastavitve. Vrstni red izhaja iz podatkov, ki že živijo v vlogah, zato se razreši tukaj namesto in bere skozi `group_roles` Poglej."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The play's variable scope. Only the subset that `_stable_variables_signature` reads influences the key."
msgstr "Igra je spremenljiva. Samo podskupina, ki `_stable_variables_signature` Branje vpliva na ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The play-scoped carrier of the rendered applications payload: the fact name `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED`, `merged_applications_cache_key`, and the reader `get_merged_applications` consults before it renders."
msgstr "Nosilec oddanih aplikacij s predvajanjem: ime dejstva `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED`, `merged_applications_cache_key`, in bralec `get_merged_applications` se posvetuje, preden naredi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The play-scoped carrier: fact name, `merged_applications_cache_key`, and the reader that serves the carried payload."
msgstr "Nosilec s predvajanjem: ime, `merged_applications_cache_key`, In bralca, ki služi nosilnemu tovoru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The playbook is designed for developers who require Docker in their local development environments. It simplifies the process of Docker installation and configuration, making it straightforward for developers to start containerizing their applications without the complexities often encountered in a server or production environment."
msgstr "Predvajaj je namenjen razvijalcem, ki potrebujejo Dockerja v svojih lokalnih razvojnih okoljih. Poenostavlja postopek namestitve in konfiguracije Dockerja, zaradi česar lahko razvijalci enostavno začnejo povezovati svoje aplikacije brez zapletenosti, ki se pogosto pojavlja v strežniškem ali proizvodnem okolju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin answers ``initialize`` without credentials, because that call is capability negotiation and carries no data. Everything after it is guarded: an unauthenticated ``tools/list`` is refused and returns no tool inventory."
msgstr "Odgovor vstavka ``initialize`` brez poverilnic, ker je ta poziv pogajanje o sposobnosti in nima podatkov. Vse po tem, ko je varovano: neavtentiran ``tools/list`` je zavrnjen in ne vrne inventarja orodja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin answers `initialize` without credentials, because that call is capability negotiation and carries no data. Everything after it is guarded: an unauthenticated `tools/list` is refused and returns no tool inventory."
msgstr "Odgovor vstavka `initialize` brez poverilnic, ker je ta poziv pogajanje o sposobnosti in nima podatkov. Vse po tem, ko je varovano: neavtentiran `tools/list` je zavrnjen in ne vrne inventarja orodja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin lives in the `system` plugin group so it can intercept every request via `onAfterInitialise`. It MUST run BEFORE the Joomla local form-login plugin in the system event chain so the redirect short-circuits any local-account authentication attempt. System plugins are ordered alphabetically. `keycloak` ranks before `users`, which is the typical local-form gate."
msgstr "Vstavek živi v `system` skupina vstavkov, da lahko prestreže vsako zahtevo preko `onAfterInitialise`. Mora teči pred Joomla krajevna oblika-login plugin v sistemski verigi dogodkov tako preusmeri kratek stiki vsak lokalni račun preverjanje pristnosti poskus. Sistemski vstavki so urejeni po abecedi. `keycloak` vrste pred `users`, To so tipična lokalna vrata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin needs to be manually activated in the admin interface. would be nice if this is automatized as well"
msgstr "Vstavek mora biti ročno aktiviran v admin vmesniku. Bilo bi lepo, če bi bilo tudi to avtomatizirano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin reads its runtime config from the Joomla container's environment, so the same plugin code works against any Keycloak realm without manual reconfiguration through the Joomla admin UI."
msgstr "Vstavek bere svoj nastavitev časa delovanja iz Joomla okolje kontejnerja, tako da ista koda plugin deluje proti vsem Keycloak Realm brez ročne rekonfiguracije skozi Joomla admin UI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin trusts the Keycloak-issued ID token. The `jumbojett/openid-connect-php` library validates the JWT signature against the realm's JWKS, so the issuer URL MUST be reachable from the Joomla container at the time the user authenticates."
msgstr "Vstavek zaupa v Keycloak-Izdan žeton. – `jumbojett/openid-connect-php` Knjižnica potrdi podpis JWT proti kraljestvu JWKS, tako da mora biti izdajatelj URL dosegljiv iz Joomla vsebnik ob overitvi uporabnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin's PHP dependencies (`jumbojett/openid-connect-php`) are vendored at deploy time inside the Joomla container. Composer is baked into the role's custom image by `roles/web-app-joomla/files/Dockerfile`. The role-side `tasks/08_oidc_plugin.yml` copies the plugin source into the container, runs `composer install --no-dev`, and installs the plugin via the Joomla CLI:"
msgstr "Odvisnosti vstavka PHP (`jumbojett/openid-connect-php`) se prodajajo v času uporabe znotraj Joomla zabojnik. Skladatelja spečamo v podobo vloge po meri `roles/web-app-joomla/files/Dockerfile`. Stran vlog `tasks/08_oidc_plugin.yml` kopira vir vstavkov v vsebnik, teče `composer install --no-dev`, in namesti plugin preko Joomla CLI:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin's built-in fallback computed from `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`, the `web-app-mailu` group, the `no-reply` user, and related inputs."
msgstr "Vgrajena rezervna stran vstavka je izračunana iz `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`, `web-app-mailu` skupina, `no-reply` uporabnik in s tem povezane vložke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The point is to make the safe path the natural path."
msgstr "Bistvo je, da je varna pot naravna pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The point: an assistant with real reach into the home, but the agent runtime stays isolated and the Pi host stays untouched. Capabilities come through MCP tools, not host access."
msgstr "Bistvo: pomočnik z resničnim dosegom v dom, vendar agent runtime ostane izoliran in gostitelj Pi ostane nedotaknjen. Zmogljivosti pridejo preko MCP orodij, ne gostitelj dostop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The policy `.hcl` templates are rendered to the host config directory and mounted at `/openbao/policies/`, deliberately **outside** `/openbao/config/`: the server parses every file in its config directory as server configuration, so a policy file there breaks startup."
msgstr "Politika `.hcl` predloge so narejene v gostiteljsko nastavitveno mapo in nameščene na `/openbao/policies/`, namerno **zunaj** `/openbao/config/`: strežnik razčlenjuje vsako datoteko v svojem nastavitvenem imeniku kot nastavitve strežnika, tako da politika datoteka tam prekine zagon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pool's ``size`` bounds the slice docker hands the bridge, so the gateway is derived from that slice rather than from the enclosing supernet - they agree only while the pool starts on a slice boundary."
msgstr "Bazen je. ``size`` Meji rezina docker roko most, tako da je prehod izhaja iz tega rezine namesto iz oklepa supernet - se strinjajo samo, medtem ko bazen začne na rezino mejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The port is the single source of truth ``svc-net-tor services.tor.ports.local.socks``; only the host varies by caller context (loopback for host-network consumers, ``host.docker.internal`` for a bridged sibling container, ``0.0.0.0`` for the daemon bind)."
msgstr "Pristanišče je edini vir resnice ``svc-net-tor services.tor.ports.local.socks``; samo gostitelj razlikuje glede na kontekst kličočega (povratna povezava za potrošnike omrežja gostitelja, ``host.docker.internal`` za premostitveno posodo za brate in sestre, ``0.0.0.0`` za prižnico)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The post-login assertion MUST prove the session is real, in this order of preference: a user-menu or persona-name string visible in the DOM, a navigation element only rendered for authenticated users, a URL pattern unique to authenticated state. Stopping at a 2xx status code or a static text snippet that exists logged-out as well MUST NOT count as a session check."
msgstr "Trditev po prijavi MORA dokazati, da je seja resnična, v tem vrstnem redu želja: niz uporabniško-menu ali persona-name, ki je viden v DOM, navigacijski element, ki je narejen samo za avtentične uporabnike, vzorec URL, ki je edinstven za avtentično stanje. Ustaviti se pri 2xx statusna koda ali statični tekstovni odlomek, ki obstaja tudi odjavljen, NE SME šteti kot preverjanje seje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The prefixed form is byte-identical to the container's ``.Config.Image`` after deploy, so it can be matched against a running container exactly."
msgstr "Predpripravljena oblika je bajto-identična posodi. ``.Config.Image`` po namestitvi, tako da se lahko ujema z tek kontejnerja točno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary checkout's path, or ``repo_root`` when git cannot say."
msgstr "Pot primarnega preverjanja ali ``repo_root`` Ko ne moreš povedati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary objective of this role is to provide a straightforward and efficient method for setting up Java, specifically JDK 11, on personal computers or development environments. This setup is essential for developers who work with Java or run applications that require the Java runtime environment."
msgstr "Glavni cilj te vloge je zagotoviti enostavno in učinkovito metodo za vzpostavitev Java, posebej JDK 11, na osebnih računalnikih ali razvojnih okoljih. Ta nastavitev je bistvena za razvijalce, ki delajo z Java ali zažene programe, ki zahtevajo Java okolje delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to automate the process of swapfile creation, ensuring that the system has sufficient swap space to handle memory-intensive tasks and maintain overall performance."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je avtomatizacija procesa ustvarjanja swapfile, s čimer se zagotovi, da ima sistem dovolj prostora za zamenjavo, da lahko opravlja naloge, ki zahtevajo veliko spomina, in ohranja splošno zmogljivost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to configure WireGuard on a client by setting appropriate MTU values on network interfaces. This ensures a stable and optimized VPN connection."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je nastaviti WireGuard na odjemalcu z nastavljanjem ustreznih vrednosti MTU na omrežnih vmesnikih. To zagotavlja stabilno in optimizirano VPN povezavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to enable proper routing and connectivity for a WireGuard client situated behind a firewall or NAT device. By adapting iptables rules, it ensures that the client can communicate effectively with external networks."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je omogočiti pravilno usmerjanje in povezljivost za odjemalca WireGuard, ki se nahaja za požarnim zidom ali napravo NAT. S prilagoditvijo pravil za pttable zagotavlja, da lahko stranka učinkovito komunicira z zunanjimi omrežji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to enhance system performance by ensuring that Docker volumes are stored on the most appropriate storage medium, optimizing both speed and capacity."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je izboljšati delovanje sistema z zagotavljanjem, da so dockerjeve prostornine shranjene na najprimernejšem mediju za shranjevanje, z optimizacijo hitrosti in zmogljivosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to enhance the security of the system by ensuring that a valid SSH key is available for the [root user](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser). By automating the generation and output of the public key, it reduces manual intervention and helps maintain a secure configuration for administrative access."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je povečati varnost sistema z zagotavljanjem, da je za sistem na voljo veljaven ključ SSH. [uporabnik root](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser). Z avtomatizacijo proizvodnje in izhoda javnega ključa zmanjša ročno posredovanje in pomaga ohranjati varno konfiguracijo za upravni dostop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to enhance the security of the system by ensuring that a valid SSH key is available for the `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__. By automating the generation and output of the public key, it reduces manual intervention and helps maintain a secure configuration for administrative access."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je povečati varnost sistema z zagotavljanjem, da je za sistem na voljo veljaven ključ SSH. `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__. Z avtomatizacijo proizvodnje in izhoda javnega ključa zmanjša ročno posredovanje in pomaga ohranjati varno konfiguracijo za upravni dostop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that Docker-based services remain operational. By automatically monitoring container health, it enables administrators to react quickly to failures, reducing downtime and preventing unnoticed service degradation."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je zagotoviti, da storitve, ki temeljijo na Dockerju, še naprej delujejo. S samodejnim spremljanjem zdravja zabojnikov omogoča administratorjem, da se hitro odzovejo na napake, zmanjšajo čas izpada in preprečijo neopaženo degradacijo storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that all Docker Compose services are restarted consistently, resolving issues that may arise from partial restarts. This helps maintain overall service stability and minimizes downtime."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je zagotoviti, da Docker Compose storitve se stalno ponovno zaganjajo in rešujejo vprašanja, ki lahko nastanejo zaradi delnih ponovnih zagonov. To pomaga ohranjati splošno stabilnost storitev in zmanjšuje čas izpadov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that disk space remains within safe limits by automating cleanup tasks, thereby improving system performance and stability."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je zagotoviti, da prostor na disku ostane v varnih mejah z avtomatizacijo nalog čiščenja, s čimer se izboljša delovanje in stabilnost sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that the target system has a reliable sudo configuration. By installing the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploying a standard sudoers file, the role facilitates proper administrative access and minimizes potential security risks."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je zagotoviti, da ima ciljni sistem zanesljivo konfiguracijo sudo. Z namestitvijo [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) paket in uporaba standardne datoteke sudoers, vloga omogoča ustrezen upravni dostop in zmanjšuje morebitna varnostna tveganja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that the target system has a reliable sudo configuration. By installing the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploying a standard sudoers file, the role facilitates proper administrative access and minimizes potential security risks."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je zagotoviti, da ima ciljni sistem zanesljivo konfiguracijo sudo. Z namestitvijo `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ paket in uporaba standardne datoteke sudoers, vloga omogoča ustrezen upravni dostop in zmanjšuje morebitna varnostna tveganja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to guarantee that an SSH client is available on the system before executing any SSH-related operations, such as key generation, remote access, or automated provisioning."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je zagotoviti, da je odjemalec SSH na voljo v sistemu pred izvedbo vseh operacij, povezanih z SSH, kot so ključna generacija, daljinski dostop ali avtomatizirano zagotavljanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to maintain optimal backup storage by automatically removing outdated backup versions when disk usage exceeds a specified threshold."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je ohraniti optimalno rezervno shranjevanje s samodejno odstranitvijo zastarelih varnostnih različic, ko uporaba diska preseže določen prag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to maintain optimal performance of Btrfs file systems by automating balancing tasks, ensuring efficient storage allocation and performance."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je ohranjanje optimalne učinkovitosti datotečnih sistemov Btrfs z avtomatizacijo nalog izravnavanja, zagotavljanjem učinkovite razporeditve in izvedbe shranjevanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to prevent storage bloat caused by unused Docker images, volumes, and build artifacts. Regular pruning ensures:"
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je preprečiti shranjevalno napenjanje, ki ga povzročajo neuporabljene Dockerjeve slike, zvezki in graditi artefakte. Redno obrezovanje zagotavlja:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a centralized mechanism for service failure notifications. By integrating with both the Telegram and Email notifier roles, it delivers reliable alerts through multiple channels, enhancing overall system observability and responsiveness."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je zagotoviti centraliziran mehanizem za obvestila o odpovedi storitev. S povezovanjem z vlogama telegrama in e-poštnih prijaviteljev zagotavlja zanesljiva opozorila prek več kanalov, kar krepi splošno sistemsko opaznost in odzivnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a comprehensive solution for automated email notifications in a systemd environment. By integrating with msmtp and customizable templates, it delivers clear and timely alerts about service failures, thereby enhancing system reliability."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je zagotoviti celovito rešitev za avtomatizirana elektronska obvestila v sistemskem okolju. S povezovanjem z msmtp in prilagodljivimi predlogami zagotavlja jasna in pravočasna opozorila o okvarah storitev, s čimer povečuje zanesljivost sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a reliable installation of the Python package manager, pip, ensuring that subsequent Python package installations can proceed without issues."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je zagotoviti zanesljivo namestitev upravljavca paketa Python, Pip, s čimer se zagotovi, da lahko nadaljnje naprave paketa Python nadaljujejo brez težav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a reusable mechanism for scheduling recurring tasks on a system. By creating and managing a systemd timer unit, the role ensures that specified services are automatically started at defined intervals, enhancing system automation and reliability."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je zagotoviti mehanizem za ponovno uporabo pri razporejanju ponavljajočih se nalog na sistemu. Z ustvarjanjem in upravljanjem sistemadne časovne enote vloga zagotavlja, da se določene storitve samodejno zaženejo v določenih intervalih, kar povečuje avtomatizacijo in zanesljivost sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a robust solution for automated Telegram notifications in a systemd environment. By integrating with Telegram’s Bot API and using customizable message templates, it delivers clear and timely alerts about service failures, thereby enhancing system observability and reliability."
msgstr "Primarni namen te vloge je zagotoviti robustno rešitev za avtomatizirana telegramska obvestila v sistemskem okolju. Z integracijo s Telegramovim botom API in z uporabo prilagodljivih predlog za sporočila zagotavlja jasna in pravočasna opozorila o napakah v storitvah, s čimer povečuje sistemsko opaznost in zanesljivost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a secure and dedicated administrator account solely for running local administration tasks. This approach minimizes security risks associated with using the root account and enforces best practices in user privilege management."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je zagotoviti varen in namenski administratorski račun izključno za vodenje nalog lokalne uprave. Ta pristop zmanjšuje varnostna tveganja, povezana z uporabo temeljnega računa, in uveljavlja najboljše prakse pri upravljanju privilegijev uporabnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to safeguard system stability during maintenance by preventing conflicts with running services. It ensures that maintenance operations proceed only when the environment is ready."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je varovanje stabilnosti sistema med vzdrževanjem s preprečevanjem konfliktov z delujočimi storitvami. Zagotavlja, da se vzdrževalne operacije nadaljujejo šele, ko je okolje pripravljeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to set up and manage a Wireguard VPN configuration on the host. By automating package installation and configuration file deployment, it ensures that the VPN service is enabled with optimal network settings for secure connectivity."
msgstr "Glavni namen te vloge je vzpostavitev in upravljanje Wireguard Nastavitve VPN na gostitelju. Z avtomatizacijo namestitve paketa in konfiguracijske datoteke zagotavlja, da je storitev VPN omogočena z optimalnimi omrežnimi nastavitvami za varno povezljivost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary service entry is the role entity name returned by `get_entity_name`."
msgstr "Vnos primarne storitve je vloga, ki jo vrne ime subjekta `get_entity_name`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The private helpers (``_resolve_round_include`` and friends) are re-exported below because unit tests historically patch them under this package path. New tests SHOULD patch the submodule path directly (e.g. ``inventory.legacy_resolver._resolve_round_include``)."
msgstr "Zasebni pomočniki (``_resolve_round_include`` in prijatelji) se ponovno izvozijo spodaj, ker jih preskusi enote zgodovinsko zakrpajo pod to pot paketa. Novi testi MORAJO neposredno zakrpati pot podmodula (Npr. ``inventory.legacy_resolver._resolve_round_include``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The privileged `pull_request_target` build switches its **build source** from the base merge ref to the **raw PR head** (`head.repo.full_name` @ `head.sha`)."
msgstr "Privilegirani `pull_request_target` gradi stikala **gradi vir** iz osnove združijo ref v **surova glava PR** (`head.repo.full_name` @ `head.sha`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe runs inside the systemd unit, not at deploy time, because the set of docker volumes changes between deploys and a volume added afterwards would be an empty stub inside a snapshot. It refuses unless all of the following hold for the docker data root reported by ``docker info``:"
msgstr "Sonda teče znotraj sistemske enote, ne ob času uporabe, ker bi se nabor docker prostornin med razporeditvijo in količino, ki bi se nato dodala, bil prazen odrezek znotraj posnetka. Zavrne, razen če ima vse naslednje podatke o korenu za docker, ki jih poroča ``docker info``:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe runs inside the systemd unit, not at deploy time, because the set of docker volumes changes between deploys and a volume added afterwards would be an empty stub inside a snapshot. It refuses unless all of the following hold for the docker data root reported by `docker info`:"
msgstr "Sonda teče znotraj sistemske enote, ne ob času uporabe, ker bi se nabor docker prostornin med razporeditvijo in količino, ki bi se nato dodala, bil prazen odrezek znotraj posnetka. Zavrne, razen če ima vse naslednje podatke o korenu za docker, ki jih poroča `docker info`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe therefore builds a **throwaway** btrfs on a loop device and puts a stub on `PATH` in place of the docker daemon. The host's real data root is never touched, and no state survives the run."
msgstr "Sonda zato gradi a **metanje** btrfs na napravi za zanko in postavi štruco `PATH` namesto demona Dockerja. Pravega korena gostitelja se nikoli ne dotakne in nobena država ne preživi teka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe's own check was vacuous beside this: it compared a declared window against an estimated demand, both produced by this deployment, so it structurally could not observe a declaration the backend does not honour. It now also reads `usage.prompt_tokens` from the answer, the one number in the exchange that the backend produced."
msgstr "Poleg tega je bil lasten pregled sonde variabilen: primerjala je deklarirano okno z ocenjenim povpraševanjem, ki ga je proizvedla ta razporeditev, tako da strukturno ni mogla opazovati izjave, ki je hrbtenica ne spoštuje. Zdaj tudi bere. `usage.prompt_tokens` iz odgovora, ena številka v zameno, ki je hrbtenica."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe; with prefixes it is wrapped so ``test`` renders CMD-SHELL."
msgstr "Sonda; s predponami je zavita tako ``test`` naredi CMD-SHELL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The producer [build_ldap_role_entries](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/filter_plugins/build_ldap_role_entries.py) also emits a per-application `groupOfNames` container `cn=<application_id>,ou=roles,...` whose `member` attribute references every role group of that application, so an LDAP-only consumer can still navigate the hierarchy. Keycloak does not rely on those containers; it reconstructs `/roles/<application_id>/<role_name>` via per-application mappers (see below)."
msgstr "Proizvajalec [build_ldap_role_entries](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/filter_plugins/build_ldap_role_entries.py) oddaja tudi eno aplikacijo `groupOfNames` vsebnik `cn=<application_id>,ou=roles,...` katerih `member` pripiše reference za vsako vlogono skupino navedene aplikacije, tako da lahko samo potrošnik LDAP še vedno krmari po hierarhiji. Keycloak se ne zanaša na te posode; rekonstruira `/roles/<application_id>/<role_name>` preko maperjev po aplikaciji (glej spodaj)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The production-safe path MUST follow Mattermost's documented Agents and MCP deployment guidance."
msgstr "Varna proizvodna pot mora slediti MattermostDokumentirani agenti in MCP navodila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project tree's full path list (one walk per process) and per-file UTF-8 contents (`read_text`). Used by lint/integration tests and CLI tools that scan the repo."
msgstr "Celoten seznam poti drevesa projekta (en sprehod na proces) in na datoteko UTF-8 vsebina (`read_text`). Uporabljajo ga testi lin/integracije in orodja CLI, ki skenirajo repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project's environment is owned by a single generator, not scattered across shell modules. Every variable is documented INLINE next to its definition with a one-line `# ...` comment above the key. This page is just a map of where to look."
msgstr "Okolje projekta je v lasti enega samega generatorja, ne pa razpršenega po lupinskih modulih. Vsaka spremenljivka je dokumentirana INLINE poleg svoje opredelitve z eno vrstico `# ...` komentar nad ključem. Ta stran je samo zemljevid, kje iskati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project-owned plugin is unaudited: endpoint, transport, auth and tool scope are unverified in source."
msgstr "Vstavek v lasti projekta je nerevidiran: končna točka, transport, avt in obseg orodja so nepreverjeni v viru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project-owned server passes ownership, licence, pinning and read-only default, but its HTTP transport serves one session per process, which upstream asserts in `src/test/transport.test.ts` at `v0.3.1`; the deploy probe alone would leave it restart-required."
msgstr "Strežnik v lasti projekta sprejme lastništvo, licenco, pinning in samo bralno privzeto, vendar njegov HTTP transport služi eni seji na proces, ki na začetku uveljavlja `src/test/transport.test.ts` na dan `v0.3.1`; S sondo bi morali ponovno začeti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The prompt tracks a category stack: typing a bare category name cd's into it, ``..`` walks one level up, ``/`` returns to root, path tokens with ``/`` or ``..`` navigate, ``infinito [path]`` jumps absolute, ``ls`` lists the current folder, everything else runs with the current path prepended."
msgstr "Pogon sledi sklada kategorije: tipkanje golega imena kategorije cd je v njem, ``..`` hodi eno raven navzgor, ``/`` vrne v koren, pot žetone z ``/`` ali ``..`` navigacijo, ``infinito [path]`` skoki absolutno, ``ls`` navaja trenutno mapo, vse ostalo pa teče s trenutno pripravljeno potjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The propagation chain has four hops:"
msgstr "Razmnoževalna veriga ima štiri hmelje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The protection rules enforced on `main` are documented in [branch.md](../../tools/github/branch/security.md)."
msgstr "Izvršena pravila o varstvu `main` so dokumentirani v [branch.md](../../tools/github/branch/security.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The provider credential is whatever ``mcp.credential`` declares: ``owner`` names the principal, ``source`` where its secret lives (``token_store`` or the role's own ``credentials``), ``key`` the entry. No provider inherits the administrator's token."
msgstr "Ponudnik poverilnice je karkoli. ``mcp.credential`` razglasi: ``owner`` imenuje ravnatelja, ``source`` kjer njegovo skrivno življenje (``token_store`` ali lastno vlogo ``credentials``), ``key`` Vnos. Noben ponudnik ne podeduje administratorjevega žetona."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The provision CLI parses the JSON and forwards the per-app index as `--variant <N>` to each `infinito administration inventory credentials` subprocess call."
msgstr "Določba CLI razčleni JSON in posreduje indeks na app kot `--variant <N>` za vsakega `infinito administration inventory credentials` Podprocesni klic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The proxy config used to grow a loop per source, so the rule for \"how is this alias called\" lived in four places that drifted apart: the LM Studio branch published no context window although its README promised one, and a mock needed a fifth branch. Here the sources meet once, the template renders one loop, and every shape is a unit test instead of a rendered fixture."
msgstr "Konfig posrednika se uporablja za rast zanke na vir, tako da pravilo za \"Kako se imenuje to ime?\" živel v štirih krajih, ki so se oddaljili: LM Studio Podružnica ni objavila nobenega okvirnega okna, čeprav je to obljubila. Tu se viri srečajo enkrat, predloga naredi eno zanko, vsaka oblika pa je test enote namesto olepšane pritrditve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The proxy filters methods and paths, not request bodies. `POST /volumes/create` stays on the allowlist because the broker creates a volume per agent, and a local-driver volume with `o=bind,device=/` is a host bind mount that arrives as a volume. Fields such as `Privileged`, `PidMode` or `CapAdd` on `containers/create` are likewise unfiltered. The isolation therefore holds against a compromised **agent**, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised **broker**."
msgstr "Proxy filtrira metode in poti, ne zahteva telesa. `POST /volumes/create` ostane na seznamu dovoljenj, ker posrednik ustvari količino na agent, in lokalni voznik glasnosti z `o=bind,device=/` je gostitelj, ki se veže kot glasnost. Polja, kot so: `Privileged`, `PidMode` ali `CapAdd` o `containers/create` so prav tako nefiltrirani. Izolacija torej drži proti ogroženemu **agent**, ki sploh ne doseže vtičnice, ne proti ogroženi **posrednik**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The public entry point of three layers, each importable on its own:"
msgstr "Javna vstopna točka treh slojev, od katerih se vsaka uvaža sama:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The published (host) port is ``ports.local.<proto>`` when declared, else ``ports.public.<proto>``; the container port is ``ports.internal.<proto>``."
msgstr "Objavljena (gostitelj) pristanišče je ``ports.local.<proto>`` kadar je prijavljeno, drugače ``ports.public.<proto>``; pristanišče kontejnerja je ``ports.internal.<proto>``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The published image is multi-arch, but only `linux/amd64` has been exercised."
msgstr "Objavljena podoba je večnadstropna, vendar le `linux/amd64` se je izvajalo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this folder is to keep domain logic in one predictable place so different plugins, helpers, and automation paths can rely on the same behavior. Rather than being tied to one feature, the code here supports the broader shape of how domains are interpreted, normalized, collected, and reused across the project. 🧭"
msgstr "Namen te mape je ohraniti logiko domene na enem predvidljivem mestu, tako da lahko različni plugins, pomočniki, in avtomatizacija poti zanaša na enako vedenje. Namesto da bi bila ta koda vezana na eno značilnost, podpira širšo obliko razlage, normalizacije, zbiranja in ponovne uporabe domen v celotnem projektu. 🧭"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the configuration of cloud-integrated user directories by ensuring that common folders like `Downloads`, `Music`, and `Workspaces` are transparently redirected into a centralized cloud structure. This makes it easier to maintain sys-bkp-friendly, cloud-ready setups for homelab and professional workflows."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati konfiguracijo uporabniških map v oblaku z zagotavljanjem, da so skupne mape, kot so `Downloads`, `Music`, in `Workspaces` so pregledno preusmerjene v centralizirano strukturo oblaka. To omogoča lažje vzdrževanje sys-bkp prijaznih, oblačnih nastavitev za domače laboratorije in strokovne delovne tokove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the configuration of cloud-integrated user directories by ensuring that common folders like ``Downloads``, ``Music``, and ``Workspaces`` are transparently redirected into a centralized cloud structure. This makes it easier to maintain sys-bkp-friendly, cloud-ready setups for homelab and professional workflows."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati konfiguracijo uporabniških map v oblaku z zagotavljanjem, da so skupne mape, kot so ``Downloads``, ``Music``, in ``Workspaces`` so pregledno preusmerjene v centralizirano strukturo oblaka. To omogoča lažje vzdrževanje sys-bkp prijaznih, oblačnih nastavitev za domače laboratorije in strokovne delovne tokove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the deployment of a full-featured RetroArch environment, reducing manual setup and improving reproducibility across gaming setups."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati uporabo popolnoma oblikovanega RetroArch okolje, zmanjšanje ročnega postavljanja in izboljšanje ponovljivosti med igralnimi nastavitvami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the installation and configuration of Git for personal computers. By leveraging a custom git-configurator, it sets up essential Git settings such as merge options, rebase preferences, user information, and GPG signing, ensuring a consistent environment for version control operations."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati namestitev in konfiguracijo Git za osebne računalnike. Z izkoriščanjem prilagojenega git-konfiguratorja, vzpostavlja bistveno Git nastavitve, kot so združene možnosti, ponovna baza nastavitev, uporabniške informacije in podpisovanje GPG, ki zagotavljajo dosledno okolje za operacije nadzora različic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the installation and configuration of LibreOffice along with its language support on personal computers. This ensures that users have a consistent and fully functional office suite environment across their systems."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati namestitev in konfiguracijo LibreOffice skupaj z jezikovno podporo na osebnih računalnikih. To zagotavlja, da imajo uporabniki v svojih sistemih dosledno in popolnoma funkcionalno pisarniško okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the installation and update process for Infinito.Nexus-related applications or other managed packages using ``pkgmgr``. It simplifies package handling and enforces best practices for package deployment in automated environments."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati namestitev in posodobiti postopek za Infinito.Nexus-povezani programi ali drugi upravljani paketi z uporabo ``pkgmgr``. Poenostavlja ravnanje s paketi in uveljavlja najboljše prakse za uvajanje paketa v avtomatiziranih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the installation and update process for Infinito.Nexus-related applications or other managed packages using `pkgmgr`. It simplifies package handling and enforces best practices for package deployment in automated environments."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati namestitev in posodobiti postopek za Infinito.Nexus-povezani programi ali drugi upravljani paketi z uporabo `pkgmgr`. Poenostavlja ravnanje s paketi in uveljavlja najboljše prakse za uvajanje paketa v avtomatiziranih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the installation of Git in a consistent and idempotent manner. It is especially useful in environments where Git is a prerequisite for further automation or development tasks."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati namestitev Git na dosleden in navidezen način. To je še posebej koristno v okoljih, kjer Git je predpogoj za nadaljnjo avtomatizacijo ali razvojne naloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the installation of fakeroot so that users can simulate superuser operations without requiring elevated privileges. This is particularly useful in development environments and during package building processes."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati namestitev ponaredka, tako da lahko uporabniki simulirajo operacije superuporabnika brez potrebe po povišanih privilegijih. To je še posebej koristno v razvojnih okoljih in med postopki gradnje paketov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the provisioning of SSH agent capabilities and synchronize the `.ssh` directory from a Git repository. This enables users to access private repositories or authenticate with remote servers immediately after login."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati zagotavljanje zmogljivosti SSH agentov in sinhronizirati `.ssh` Mapa iz a Git Skladišče. To omogoča uporabnikom dostop do zasebnih arhivov ali overovitev z oddaljenimi strežniki takoj po prijavi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the provisioning of SSH agent capabilities and synchronize the ``.ssh`` directory from a Git repository. This enables users to access private repositories or authenticate with remote servers immediately after login."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati zagotavljanje zmogljivosti SSH agentov in sinhronizirati ``.ssh`` Mapa iz a Git Skladišče. To omogoča uporabnikom dostop do zasebnih arhivov ali overovitev z oddaljenimi strežniki takoj po prijavi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the provisioning of a development-ready environment by ensuring the GCC toolchain is properly installed and available."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati zagotavljanje okolja, ki je pripravljeno na razvoj, z zagotavljanjem GCC orodna veriga je pravilno nameščena in na voljo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the provisioning of a secure Chromium environment in a consistent and maintainable way. It reduces manual configuration steps and guarantees that critical browser extensions are enforced, making it ideal for both production and personal deployments."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizacija zagotavljanja varnega Chromium okolje na dosleden in vzdržljiv način. Zmanjšuje ročne konfiguracijske korake in zagotavlja, da se izvajajo kritične razširitve brskalnika, zaradi česar je idealen tako za proizvodnjo kot za osebno uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the setup of a lightweight SMTP client that acts as a sendmail replacement. By configuring msmtp, the role facilitates direct email sending using your SMTP server credentials, making it a simple yet effective solution for system notifications and other email-based communications."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je avtomatizirati nastavitev lahkega odjemalca SMTP, ki deluje kot zamenjava sendmail. Z nastavljanjem msmtp, vloga omogoča neposredno pošiljanje e-pošte z vašimi poverilnicami strežnika SMTP, zaradi česar je preprosta, vendar učinkovita rešitev za sistemska obvestila in druge komunikacije, ki temeljijo na e-pošti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to enforce a consistent and predictable lid switch behavior across power states, improving usability on laptops that otherwise behave unpredictably when the lid is closed."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je uveljaviti dosledno in predvidljivo preklapljanje pokrova preko stanja moči, izboljšati uporabnost na prenosnih računalnikih, ki se sicer obnašajo nepredvidljivo, ko je pokrov zaprt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to enhance and customize the GNOME desktop environment by managing shell extensions. It simplifies the process of installing and configuring extensions, thereby improving productivity and desktop functionality."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je povečati in prilagoditi namizno okolje GNOME z upravljanjem lupinskih razširitev. Poenostavlja postopek nameščanja in nastavljanja razširitev, s čimer izboljšuje produktivnost in namizno funkcionalnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to enhance the security of your backup system by providing a dedicated user with strict command restrictions. This controlled environment limits the potential damage from a compromised backup account while still allowing efficient backup operations."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je povečati varnost vašega rezervnega sistema z zagotavljanjem namenskega uporabnika s strogimi ukaznimi omejitvami. To nadzorovano okolje omejuje morebitno škodo iz ogroženega rezervnega računa, hkrati pa omogoča učinkovite rezervne operacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to ensure that GNOME Terminal is installed and properly configured on Arch Linux systems, providing users with a robust and fully featured terminal emulator that integrates seamlessly with the GNOME desktop."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti, da GNOME Terminal je nameščen in pravilno konfiguriran na Arch Linux sistemih, ki uporabnikom zagotavlja robusten in popolnoma specifičen terminalski emulator, ki se brezhibno povezuje z namizjem GNOME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to ensure uninterrupted workflow by keeping the desktop active during long-running tasks or presentations. By automatically starting caffeine-ng, it prevents unwanted screen locking or sleep modes on GNOME systems."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti neprekinjen potek dela z ohranjanjem delovanja namizja med dolgotrajnimi nalogami ali predstavitvami. S samodejnim zagonom kofeina-ng preprečuje neželeno zaklepanje zaslona ali način spanja na sistemih GNOME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to externalise the static-IP DNS resolver out of large multi-service stacks (such as mail) into a single-service stack. Keeping the static-IP allocation in a trivial 1-service / 1-network stack avoids the swarm VIP-allocation deadlock that a 13-service / 4-network stack triggers, and lets consumer roles stay stateless and unpinned."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je eksternalizirati statično-IP DNS iz velikih večstoritvenih skladov (kot je pošta) v sklad za eno storitev. Ohranjanje statične dodelitve IP v nepomembnosti 1-storitev / 1-omrežje sklad izogiba roj VIP-allokacija zastoj, da 13-storitev / 4-sproži omrežne sklope in omogoča, da potrošniške vloge ostanejo brez državljanstva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide a **generic, reusable Git pull primitive** for other roles in the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti **generično, ponovno uporabno Git vleči primitivno** za druge vloge v Infinito.Nexus ekosistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide a central E2E test primitive that can be executed at the end of a deployment (for example, as a post task), without hardcoding tests in the runner itself."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti osrednji E2E test primitivno, ki se lahko izvede na koncu uporabe (na primer, kot post naloga), brez preizkusov v samem tekaču."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide a complete GNOME desktop experience by orchestrating multiple sub-roles. This simplifies deployment and management by ensuring that all key components are installed and configured in a consistent, system-wide manner."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti popolno izkušnjo namizja GNOME z orkestriranjem več podrolet. To poenostavlja uvajanje in upravljanje z zagotavljanjem, da so vsi ključni sestavni deli nameščeni in konfigurirani na dosleden, sistemski način."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide a hands-off, production-ready Odoo ERP deployment that integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus platform. Organizations can leverage Odoo's comprehensive business management capabilities while benefiting from centralized authentication, backup, monitoring, and security features."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti predajo, pripravo proizvodnje Odoo ERP uvedba, ki se neopazno povezuje z Infinito.Nexus ploščad. Organizacije lahko izkoristijo Odoove celovite poslovne sposobnosti upravljanja, hkrati pa koristijo centralizirano avtentikacijo, varnostno kopiranje, spremljanje in varnostne funkcije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide a hands-off, production-ready Odoo ERP deployment that integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus platform. Organizations can leverage Odoo’s comprehensive business management capabilities while benefiting from centralized authentication, backup, monitoring, and security features."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti predajo, pripravo proizvodnje Odoo ERP uvedba, ki se neopazno povezuje z Infinito.Nexus ploščad. Organizacije lahko izkoristijo Odoove celovite poslovne sposobnosti upravljanja, hkrati pa koristijo centralizirano avtentikacijo, varnostno kopiranje, spremljanje in varnostne lastnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide a reliable, configurable, and secure PhpMyAdmin deployment out-of-the-box. It minimizes the need for manual setup, and integrates smoothly with other Infinito.Nexus infrastructure roles."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti zanesljivo, nastavljivo in varno PhpMyAdmin uvajanje izven okvirjev. Zmanjša potrebo po ročnih nastavitvah in se nemoteno povezuje z drugimi Infinito.Nexus vloge infrastrukture."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide an automated, idempotent installation of GNU Make, ensuring that the tool is available system-wide for building software. It is ideal for developers and system administrators who require a reliable build system."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti avtomatizirano, idempotentno namestitev GNU Make, s čimer se zagotovi, da je orodje na voljo po celotnem sistemu za gradnjo programske opreme. Idealen je za razvijalce in sistemske administratorje, ki zahtevajo zanesljiv sistem gradnje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide an effortless way to deploy a PostgreSQL database via Docker. It minimizes manual interventions while ensuring that your database is configured securely and reliably for both production and development scenarios."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je, da se zagotovi brez truda za uporabo PostgreSQL podatkovna baza preko Dockerja. Zmanjšuje ročne posege, hkrati pa zagotavlja, da je vaša podatkovna zbirka nastavljena varno in zanesljivo za proizvodne in razvojne scenarije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide an effortless way to deploy a Qdrant vector database via Docker. It minimizes manual interventions while ensuring that the engine is configured securely and reliably for both production and development scenarios."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je, da se zagotovi brez truda za uporabo Qdrant Vektorska baza podatkov preko Dockerja. Zmanjšuje ročne posege, hkrati pa zagotavlja, da je motor varno in zanesljivo konfiguriran za proizvodne in razvojne scenarije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide an effortless way to deploy a central Elasticsearch engine via Docker so that application roles stay stateless, unpinned and NFS-shareable in swarm while the engine keeps its on-disk index state node-local. See [docs/architecture/central-engines.md](../../docs/architecture/central-engines.md)."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti brez truda za uporabo osrednjega Elasticsearch motor prek Dockerja tako, da vloge uporabe ostanejo brez državljanstva, brez fiksiranja in NFS-deljene v roju, medtem ko motor ohranja svoj indeks stanja vozlišča-lokalno. Glej. [docs/architecture/central-engines.md](../../docs/architecture/central-engines.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide an effortless way to deploy a central Elasticsearch engine via Docker so that application roles stay stateless, unpinned and NFS-shareable in swarm while the engine keeps its on-disk index state node-local. See `docs/architecture/central-engines.md <../../docs/architecture/central-engines.md>`__."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti brez truda za uporabo osrednjega Elasticsearch motor prek Dockerja tako, da vloge uporabe ostanejo brez državljanstva, brez fiksiranja in NFS-deljene v roju, medtem ko motor ohranja svoj indeks stanja vozlišča-lokalno. Glej. `docs/architecture/central-engines.md <../../docs/architecture/central-engines.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide an effortless way to run a shared Typesense engine via Docker while giving each consumer its own isolated, scoped credential. It minimizes manual interventions while keeping engine on-disk state node-local (it cannot live on NFS)."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti brez truda za skupno delovanje Typesense motor preko Dockerja, hkrati pa vsakemu potrošniku daje svojo izolirano, obsežno poverilnico. Zmanjšuje ročne posege, medtem ko ohranja motor na disku stanje vozlišče-lokalno (ne more živeti na NFS)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to provide automated healing for Docker Compose environments, minimizing manual recovery effort and reducing downtime."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zagotoviti avtomatsko zdravljenje za Docker Compose okolja, zmanjšanje ročnega napora pri okrevanju in zmanjšanje izpada."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to reduce the complexity of setting up OpenProject with modern production-ready defaults. By combining Docker Compose and Ansible automation, it enables a hands-off setup for both small teams and larger internal infrastructures."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je zmanjšati zapletenost ustanovitve OpenProject s sodobnimi privzetimi produkti. Z združevanjem Docker Compose in Ansible avtomatizacija, omogoča ročno postavitev tako za majhne ekipe in večje notranje infrastrukture."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to simplify the installation of Kevin's Package Manager, reducing manual steps and ensuring a consistent setup across environments. Ideal for developers and system administrators, it helps integrate repository management seamlessly into your automation workflows."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je poenostaviti namestitev Kevinovega upravljalca paketov, zmanjšati ročne korake in zagotoviti dosledno postavitev po vseh okoljih. Idealno za razvijalce in sistemske administratorje, pomaga brezhibno integrirati upravljanje repozitorijev v delovne tokove avtomatizacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to simplify the installation of Kevin’s Package Manager, reducing manual steps and ensuring a consistent setup across environments. Ideal for developers and system administrators, it helps integrate repository management seamlessly into your automation workflows."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je poenostaviti namestitev Kevinovega Upravitelja paketov, zmanjšati ročne korake in zagotoviti dosledno postavitev v vseh okoljih. Idealno za razvijalce in sistemske administratorje, pomaga brezhibno integrirati upravljanje repozitorijev v delovne tokove avtomatizacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to unify shell environment setup across Bash and Zsh. It minimizes duplication and confusion by encouraging the use of `.profile` for shared configuration such as environment variables and agent settings."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je poenotenje postavitve lupinskega okolja čez Bash in Zsh. Podvajanje in zmedo zmanjšuje s spodbujanjem uporabe `.profile` za skupne nastavitve, kot so okoljske spremenljivke in nastavitve agentov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to unify shell environment setup across Bash and Zsh. It minimizes duplication and confusion by encouraging the use of ``.profile`` for shared configuration such as environment variables and agent settings."
msgstr "Namen te vloge je poenotenje postavitve lupinskega okolja čez Bash in Zsh. Podvajanje in zmedo zmanjšuje s spodbujanjem uporabe ``.profile`` za skupne nastavitve, kot so okoljske spremenljivke in nastavitve agentov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of tthis role is to simplify the deployment and management of a personal or professional portfolio. By focusing on usability and a clean presentation, the role helps you:"
msgstr "Namen te vloge je poenostaviti uvedbo in upravljanje osebnega ali poklicnega portfelja. S poudarkom na uporabnosti in čisti predstavitvi vam vloga pomaga:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The push entry synchronizes the current repository's `main` branch from the configured source repository before CI policy and deploy discovery run. The default source is `infinito-nexus/core`, and `CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY` MAY override or disable the sync as documented in [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md). This sync **force-overwrites** the local `main`, so on a synced repository you MUST NOT work directly in `main`; use a `feature/**`, `fix/**`, or `hotfix/**` branch and treat `main` as a read-only mirror."
msgstr "Potisni vnos sinhronizira trenutno skladišče `main` veja iz nastavljenega izvornega skladišča pred politiko CI in zagon iskanja. Privzeti vir je `infinito-nexus/core`, in `CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY` MOGOČE povoziti ali onemogočiti sinhronizacijo kot je dokumentirana v [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md). Ta uskladitev **Pretvorniki sile** lokalno `main`, tako da na sinhroniziranem skladišču ne smete delati neposredno v `main`; uporabite `feature/**`, `fix/**`, ali `hotfix/**` podružnica in zdravljenje `main` kot ogledalo samo za branje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The qualifier in parentheses is OPTIONAL. Use it only when two workflows share the same category and subject."
msgstr "Kvalifikator v oklepajih je NEOBVEZEN. Uporabljajte ga le, če si dva delovna toka delita isto kategorijo in predmet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The raw ``run-name:`` string declared by the manual CI workflow."
msgstr "Surovi ``run-name:`` niz, ki ga navaja ročni delovni tok CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reason is reviewability and tooling. Extracted assets get proper syntax highlighting, linting, and diffing. Inline heredocs and multi-line `query:` or `command:` blocks hide all three and make the task file harder to read."
msgstr "Razlog je recenzija in orodje. Izvlečena sredstva dobijo pravilno poudarjanje sintaks, linanje in diffing. Inline heredocs in multi-line `query:` ali `command:` Bloki skrijejo vse tri in otežijo branje datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reason is the endpoint's own shape: Baserow's `MCPEndpoint` carries no scope column, so the endpoint key grants every tool the backend implements — including the three write tools — with no way to narrow it. The adapter is what narrows it, by serving four read tools and refusing every other name."
msgstr "Razlog je oblika končne točke: Baserow's `MCPEndpoint` ne vsebuje stolpca obsega, zato končni cilj ključni dodeli vsako orodje, ki ga hrbtenica izvaja – vključno s tremi pisalnimi orodji – brez možnosti, da se zoži. Adapter je tisto, kar ga zoži, tako da servira štiri čitalna orodja in zavrača vsako drugo ime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reason is the endpoint’s own shape: Baserow’s ``MCPEndpoint`` carries no scope column, so the endpoint key grants every tool the backend implements — including the three write tools — with no way to narrow it. The adapter is what narrows it, by serving four read tools and refusing every other name."
msgstr "Razlog je oblika končne točke: Baserow’s ``MCPEndpoint`` ne vsebuje stolpca obsega, zato končni cilj ključni dodeli vsako orodje, ki ga hrbtenica izvaja – vključno s tremi pisalnimi orodji – brez možnosti, da se zoži. Adapter je tisto, kar ga zoži, tako da servira štiri čitalna orodja in zavrača vsako drugo ime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The recommended way to disable IPv6 for local development is via Make:"
msgstr "Priporočen način za onesposobitev IPv6 za lokalni razvoj prek Make:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The redeploy is NEVER the verification. \"The gate/reinstall has to run anyway\" or \"the next deploy will validate it\" is FORBIDDEN as a justification."
msgstr "Prerazporeditev ni nikoli potrditev. \"Vrata/ponovna namestitev morajo vseeno teči.\" ali \"bo naslednja akcija potrdila\" FORBIDEN kot utemeljitev."

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span lost=[] gained=['(', ')',
# '100000', '21', '3']
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Odpadni rez ne sledi sekiram. `covered_by` je število
# zahtevkov na ravni vloge, izračuni iz zaprtja storitev, tako da se vrstica,
# ki zajema skrajšano vrstico zdaj običajno pristane na drugi razdelitvi: na
# popolni prelet, 6 o 44 Rezane vrste si delijo distro. V skladu s členom
# 21(3) finančne uredbe se znesek namenskih prejemkov oceni na 100000 EUR.
# Doseganje rezane vrstice na lastnih oseh pomeni poimenovanje na prednostni
# liniji, kar je tisto, kar `⭐` Obstaja za.
msgid "The redundancy cut does not follow the axes. `covered_by` is a role-level claim discovery computes from the service closure, so the row that covers a cut row now usually lands on a different distribution: on a full sweep, 6 of 44 cut rows share their coverer's distro. The cut therefore asserts that the services were exercised, not that they were exercised on that row's distribution. Reaching a cut row on its own axes means naming it on the priority line, which is what `⭐` exists for."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The rejected text is a comment and never a ``msgstr``: it is what the consumers must not use, while an operator judging the criterion needs to read it. A newline is escaped because a ``.po`` comment ends at one. The ``nocheck`` goes on a line of its own above the quote, never behind it: a mangled link is exactly what a rejection quotes and the URL probe reads comments too, while a long quote is wrapped over several comment lines, which would carry the marker away from the URL it has to cover."
msgstr "Zavrnjeno besedilo je komentar in nikoli ``msgstr``: je tisto, česar potrošniki ne smejo uporabljati, medtem ko mora izvajalec, ki presoja merilo, to merilo prebrati. Nova linija je ušla, ker ``.po`` Komentar se konča ob enem. – ``nocheck`` gre na linijo svoje nad citatom, nikoli za njim: zmečkana povezava je točno tisto, kar zavrnitev citati in URL sonda bere komentarje preveč, medtem ko je dolg citat zavit čez več vrstic komentar, ki bi prenesli označevalec stran od URL, ki ga mora zajeti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The rejected text travels with the verdict so the catalog can record it: a bare mark says an entry is unanswerable, the text says what the server answered, which is what an operator needs to judge the criterion."
msgstr "Zavrnjeno besedilo potuje z razsodbo, da ga katalog lahko zapiše: gola oznaka pravi, da je vnos neodgovorljiv, besedilo pove, kaj je odgovoril strežnik, kar mora operator presoditi merilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The remaining reproductions of Jev, [open-alternative-jev](https://github.com/ikermoel/open-alternative-jev) on any open-weights model and OpenJev on DiffusionGemma 26B-A4B, are not used."
msgstr "Preostale reprodukcije Jeva, [odprto-alternativno-jev](https://github.com/ikermoel/open-alternative-jev) o katerem koli odprtem modelu in OpenJev na DifusionGemma 26B-A4B, se ne uporabljajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The remaining variables match the requirements of the delegated script. See its `README.md` for details."
msgstr "Preostale spremenljivke ustrezajo zahtevam prenesenega skripta. Glej jo. `README.md` za podrobnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The render runs once per play. The constructor stage parks the payload and its cache key in the host fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED`, and every task's worker process (Ansible forks one per task) serves that payload instead of rendering again. See [applications.md](../artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for the carrier contract."
msgstr "Remi teče enkrat na igro. Graditeljski oder parkira tovor in njegov predpomnilni ključ v gostiteljskem dejstvu `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED`, in vsaka naloga dela proces (Omogočene vilice ena na opravilo) Namesto, da bi ga spet opravljali. Glej. [applications.md](../artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) za prevozno pogodbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The renderable path"
msgstr "Okretna pot"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The rendered `Corefile` is build artefact and MUST stay in `.gitignore`."
msgstr "Prevedeno `Corefile` gradi artefakt in MORA ostati v `.gitignore`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The rendered fragment MUST start at the ``groups:`` item level (two-space indented ``- name: <group>`` entries), because it is concatenated into the single ``groups:`` list of the Prometheus rule file."
msgstr "Ustvarjen fragment MORA začeti na ``groups:`` stopnja postavke (dvoprostorski zamik ``- name: <group>`` vnosi), ker je sestavljen v samca ``groups:`` seznam Prometheus Datoteka s pravili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The replay is a second deploy on the same runner, so the row it picks must be one the guide can actually deploy: the role has to be invokable, because that is what makes the documentation build give it a Production block, and the guide's own mode (``compose`` for a role that ships a stack, ``host`` for one installed onto the machine) has to be a mode the role runs and tests."
msgstr "Ponovna igra je druga razporeditev na istem tekaču, zato mora biti vrstica, ki jo izbere, tista, ki jo lahko vodič dejansko razporedi: vloga mora biti brezpredmetna, ker je to tisto, zaradi česar je dokumentacija zgrajena, ji daje proizvodni blok, in način vodnika (``compose`` za vlogo, ki pošilja kup, ``host`` za enega, vgrajenega na stroj) mora biti način, v katerem poteka vloga in preskusi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The replay rides along on a deploy row of the sweep instead of holding a job of its own. [guide.py](../../../../../utils/roles/guide.py) marks one row per role:"
msgstr "Replay jezdi skupaj z razporedi vrsto pometa, namesto da bi imel svoje delo. [guide.py](../../../../../utils/roles/guide.py) označuje eno vrstico na vlogo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The replay used to be a job of its own, picking one random role per run. It rides on a deploy row instead: the role's smallest variant among the rows this sweep actually deploys, marked with ``instructions`` (the mode the replay runs in) and a 📖 in the job title. :mod:`utils.roles.guide` decides which variant that is; this module is what turns the decision into matrix entries."
msgstr "Replay je bil včasih svoje delo, izbira eno naključno vlogo na tek. Namesto tega se vozi po vrsti: najmanjša varianta vloge med vrsticami, ki jih ta pometa dejansko razporedi, označena z ``instructions`` (način, v katerem teče ponovitev) in a 📖 v delovnem naslovu. :mod:`utils.roles.guide` odloči, katera varianta je; ta modul spremeni odločitev v matrične vnose."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The repo treats `biber` as the canonical non-admin RBAC fixture: the user is provisioned by `roles/svc-db-openldap` and exposed to specs via the `lookup('users', 'biber')` filter. ~19 role specs already consume `BIBER_USERNAME` / `BIBER_PASSWORD` from `roles/<role>/templates/playwright.env.j2` and drive at least one non-admin scenario (typically: SSO login via Keycloak, land on the expected post-login surface, optionally assert that admin-only UI is absent)."
msgstr "Repo posli `biber` kot Canonical non-admin RBAC pritrditev: uporabnik je na voljo `roles/svc-db-openldap` in izpostavljena specifikacijam prek `lookup('users', 'biber')` filter. ~19 specifikacije vlog že porabijo `BIBER_USERNAME` / `BIBER_PASSWORD` od `roles/<role>/templates/playwright.env.j2` in vožnja vsaj enega scenarija, ki ni admin (tipično: prijava SSO preko Keycloak, zemljišča na pričakovani površini po prijavi, neobvezno trdijo, da je admin-le UI ni)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The repository already contains a modular environment test suite at [scripts/tests/workspace/](../../../scripts/tests/workspace/README.md). The commands from that suite are explained here as the intended end-to-end flow."
msgstr "Skladišče že vsebuje modularno okolje testni apartma na [scripts/tests/workspace/](../../../scripts/tests/workspace/README.md). Ukazi iz tega apartmaja so tukaj pojasnjeni kot načrtovani tok od konca do konca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The repository already deploys role-level extension units, but each role spells the same concept differently and stores it in a different place:"
msgstr "Repozitorij že uporablja razširitvene enote na ravni vloge, vendar vsaka vloga drugače določa isti koncept in ga shranjuje na drugem mestu:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The repository lint suite checks for `templates/Dockerfile.j2` files automatically:"
msgstr "Pregled lint suite skladišča za `templates/Dockerfile.j2` datoteke samodejno:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The repository no longer maintains a generated `05_applications.yml` artifact. Keeping defaults close to the owning role reduces duplication and avoids stale generated state."
msgstr "Skladišče ne vzdržuje več ustvarjenega `05_applications.yml` artefakt. Ohranjanje neplačila v bližini lastne vloge zmanjšuje podvajanje in preprečuje zastarano stanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The repository prefers many focused parts over one giant playbook."
msgstr "Skladišče ima raje veliko osredotočenih delov kot eno veliko igralno knjižico."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The repository working tree stays clean (no `vendor/` checked in) and the host MUST NOT need a PHP or Composer installation."
msgstr "Delovno drevo skladišča ostane čisto (ni `vendor/` preveri) in gostitelj ne sme potrebujejo PHP ali Sestavljalnik namestitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The repository working tree. Required for any code change."
msgstr "Skladišče dela drevo. Zahtevana za vsako spremembo kode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The requirements archive helper that used to live here has moved to [kpmx](https://pypi.org/project/kpmx/) so every kpmx-managed repository can rely on the same archival convention."
msgstr "Zahteve arhivski pomočnik, ki je živel tukaj, se je preselil na [kpmx](https://pypi.org/project/kpmx/) Zato se lahko vsako skladišče, ki ga upravlja Kpmx, zanese na isto arhivsko konvencijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The rescue-diagnostics artifact one deploy job uploads."
msgstr "Reševalna diagnostika, artefakt ena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The resolved block replaces the mapping rather than being written into it. ``_build_role_base_config`` parks the YAML cache's own object under ``mcp``, so an in-place write would inject these keys into every later raw read of ``meta/mcp.yml``."
msgstr "Razrešen blok namesto da bi bil vpisan vanj. ``_build_role_base_config`` Parkira lastni predmet predpomnilnika YAML pod ``mcp``, tako da bi na mestu pisanje vbrizgati te tipke v vsako kasneje surovo branje ``meta/mcp.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result MUST be visually appealing and pleasant for humans to look at."
msgstr "Rezultat mora biti vizualno privlačen in prijeten za ljudi, da gledajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result MUST feel like one coherent brand theme, not a collection of unrelated overrides."
msgstr "Rezultat SE MORA počutiti kot ena koherentna tema blagovne znamke, ne pa zbirka nepovezanih prekrškov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result feeds the web-svc-mirror privacy proxy: the mirror's nginx vhost whitelists exactly these hosts as proxy upstreams, and the body-filter rewrite maps `https://<host>/...` to `<mirror>/<host>/...` in served HTML."
msgstr "Rezultat hrani web-svc-mirror proxy zasebnosti: zrcalo ginx vhost whitelists točno te gostitelje kot proxy gornji, in telo-filter prepisati zemljevide `https://<host>/...` do `<mirror>/<host>/...` v serviranem HTML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is a complete, reproducible domain rollout in a single playbook task."
msgstr "Rezultat je popolna, ponovljiva domena rollout v eni nalogi playbook."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is canonical_domains_map(applications, DOMAIN_PRIMARY). Per-app domain declarations live in `applications.<app>.domains` (canonical/aliases) and flow through the regular applications-merge pipeline."
msgstr "Rezultat je canonical_domains_map(vloge, DOMAIN_PRIMARY). Izjave o domeni na aplikacijo živijo v `applications.<app>.domains` (canonical/alias) in teče po rednem cevovodu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is immutable and one source message is masked once per target language, so the same string arrives dozens of times per run."
msgstr "Rezultat je nespremenljiv in eno izvorno sporočilo je zakrito enkrat na ciljni jezik, tako da isti niz prispe več desetkrat na tek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is stored on the stack host and rendered back into `model_info.traits.speed` on the same deploy, so the gateway restarts once with the numbers it just produced. A re-measured rate that moved less than 10% keeps its stored value, because no two runs measure the same machine and an unclamped result would restart the gateway for nothing. A model the measurement could not reach keeps its stored rate rather than losing it, so one bad minute does not unrank a model against its peers."
msgstr "Rezultat se shrani na gostitelja sklada in prevede nazaj v `model_info.traits.speed` na isti razpored, tako da prehod ponovno enkrat s številkami, ki jih je pravkar ustvaril. Ponovno izmerjena hitrost, ki se je gibala manj kot 10% ohranja svojo shranjeno vrednost, ker nobena dva poteka ne merita istega stroja in bi nevgrajen rezultat zaman ponovno zagnal prehod. Model, ki ga meritev ni mogla doseči, ohranja shranjeno hitrost, namesto da bi jo izgubil, tako da ena slaba minuta ne razvrsti modela proti svojim vrstnikom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The resulting snippets cover every shared provider in the variant's closure, so the deploy stage finds the required `applications.<provider>.secrets.credentials` block in the inventory and `lookup('config', '<provider>', 'secrets.credentials.<key>')` succeeds."
msgstr "Nastali odrezki zajemajo vsakega skupnega ponudnika pri zaprtju variante, tako da faza uvajanja najde zahtevano `applications.<provider>.secrets.credentials` blok v inventarju in `lookup('config', '<provider>', 'secrets.credentials.<key>')` uspe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The resume offset a retrigger computes names a `role#variant` and carries no axes, because every axis rotates with the sweep number and a retrigger receives a fresh one."
msgstr "Retrigger izračunava imena a `role#variant` in ne nosi sekir, ker se vsaka os vrti s številko za čiščenje in retrigger dobi novo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The returned token names a place in the ranking, so it carries no axes, and neither does the membership test behind it (:func:`proven_rows`): the source run recorded its combinations under its own sweep number and the retrigger gets a fresh one, so comparing them row by row is the only comparison that survives the rotation."
msgstr "Vrnjeni žeton poimenuje mesto v razvrstitvi, zato ne nosi sekire, prav tako pa ne test članstva za njim (:func:`proven_rows`): vir teče zabeležene svoje kombinacije pod lastno številko pomete in retrigger dobi novo, tako da je primerjava med njimi zaporedoma edina primerjava, ki preživi rotacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reusable generator logic lives in `utils/domains/list.py`"
msgstr "Logika za ponovno uporabo generatorja živi v `utils/domains/list.py`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is fail-safe: any seed that is not modellable in the resolver (no `application_id` and not referenced by any role's `run_after`) MUST trigger a fall-back to a full deploy, as MUST any resolver runtime error. The closure MUST NOT silently shrink the deploy matrix on partial information. The variant narrowing follows the same rule: a role reached only through a `run_after` edge (which the round closure does not follow) keeps every variant, and so does a seed role itself, whose own files changed."
msgstr "Obratno zaprtje je varno: vsako seme, ki ga ni mogoče umiriti v reševalcu (ni `application_id` in brez sklicevanja na nobeno vlogo `run_after`) MORATE sprožiti nazaj na polno uporabo, kot mora biti vsaka napaka v delovanju reševalca. Zapiranje NE SME tiho skrčiti matrice za uporabo na delnih informacijah. Zožitev variante sledi istemu pravilu: vloga, dosežena le skozi `run_after` rob (ki je zaokroženo zaprtje ne sledi) ohranja vse variante, prav tako pa tudi semenska vloga sama, katere lastne datoteke so se spremenile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is implemented in [affected resolver](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/affected/__main__.py) and invoked from [affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh). The workflow glue lives in [effective_whitelist.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh)."
msgstr "Obratno zaprtje se izvaja v [prizadet reševalec](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/affected/__main__.py) in se nanjo sklicevali [affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh). Delovni tok lepilo živi v [effective_whitelist.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The right choice should be easiest."
msgstr "Prava izbira bi morala biti najlažja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST deploy cleanly under all four variants on a fresh box. V1 (ansible all-on) MUST additionally pass the biber + administrator Playwright personas plus the new `test-element-call` + `test-bridge-roster` specs."
msgstr "Vloga SE MORA uporabljati čisto pod vsemi štirimi variantami na svežem polju. V1 (anzibilni vse-na) MORAJO dodatno mimo biber + administrator Playwright personas plus novo `test-element-call` + `test-bridge-roster` Specifikacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST deploy cleanly under all three variants on a fresh box. V1 (sso + ldap) and V3 (ldap-only) additionally MUST pass the biber + administrator Playwright personas."
msgstr "Vloga SE MORA uporabljati čisto pod vsemi tremi variantami na sveže polje. V1 (sso + ldap) in V3 (samo ldap) Poleg tega mora mimo biber + administrator Playwright personas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST follow the standard role-meta layout described in [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/variants.yml`, `meta/info.yml`, `meta/main.yml`). [web-app-openproject](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) is the closest structural model — it combines PostgreSQL, a Redis `cache` service, background workers, an internal proxy, Keycloak SSO and LDAP — and SHOULD be used as the primary reference; [web-app-taiga](../../roles/web-app-taiga/) and [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) are secondary references."
msgstr "Vloga MORA slediti standardni razporeditvi za vlogo-meta, opisani v [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/variants.yml`, `meta/info.yml`, `meta/main.yml`). [web-app-openproject](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) je najbližji strukturni model – združuje PostgreSQL, a Redis `cache` služba, delavci v ozadju, notranji zastopnik, Keycloak SSO in LDAP – in bi se morala uporabljati kot primarna referenca; [web-app-taiga](../../roles/web-app-taiga/) ter [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) so sekundarne reference."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST template `sites/{{ canonical_domain }}/site_config.json` (or the equivalent common-site-config layer) so Frappe's three Redis logical roles all point at the shared `svc-db-redis` instance with distinct DB numbers:"
msgstr "Predloga za vlogo WASTE `sites/{{ canonical_domain }}/site_config.json` (ali ekvivalentna plast konfig na kraju samem) Torej Frappe je tri. Redis Logične vloge kažejo na skupno `svc-db-redis` primerek z različnimi številkami DB:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role abstracts package management operations using ``pkgmgr``. It ensures the package manager itself is updated once per run and provides idempotent installation and update routines for specified packages."
msgstr "Vloga povzetka operacij upravljanja paketa z uporabo ``pkgmgr``. Zagotavlja, da se sam vodja paketa posodobi enkrat na vožnjo in zagotavlja navidezno namestitev in posodobitev rutine za določene pakete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role abstracts package management operations using `pkgmgr`. It ensures the package manager itself is updated once per run and provides idempotent installation and update routines for specified packages."
msgstr "Vloga povzetka operacij upravljanja paketa z uporabo `pkgmgr`. Zagotavlja, da se sam vodja paketa posodobi enkrat na vožnjo in zagotavlja navidezno namestitev in posodobitev rutine za določene pakete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role also carries the editor extensions of the agents the same host deploys: when ``dsk-gnt-claude`` is in the host’s groups, the Claude Code extension is installed into the chosen flavor. Code - OSS and VSCodium resolve extensions through Open VSX, which carries that extension as well."
msgstr "Vlogo nosi tudi urednik razširitve agentov isti gostitelj razporedi: ko ``dsk-gnt-claude`` je v skupini gostitelja, Claude Code razširitev je nameščena v izbrani okus. Koda - OSS in VSCodium rešita razširitve preko Open VSX, ki nosi tudi to razširitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role also carries the editor extensions of the agents the same host deploys: when `dsk-gnt-claude` is in the host's groups, the Claude Code extension is installed into the chosen flavor. Code - OSS and VSCodium resolve extensions through Open VSX, which carries that extension as well."
msgstr "Vlogo nosi tudi urednik razširitve agentov isti gostitelj razporedi: ko `dsk-gnt-claude` je v skupini gostitelja, Claude Code razširitev je nameščena v izbrani okus. Koda - OSS in VSCodium rešita razširitve preko Open VSX, ki nosi tudi to razširitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role attaches to the shared overlay declared in ``meta/networks.yml`` so client containers can reach the endpoint container-to-container; the overlay alias resolves to workhorse."
msgstr "Vloga je povezana z deljenim prekrivanjem, prijavljenim v ``meta/networks.yml`` tako da odjemalci lahko dosežejo končni rezultat zabojnika-kontejnerju; prekrivanje alias odloči za delovni konj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role attaches to the shared overlay declared in `meta/networks.yml` so client containers can reach the endpoint container-to-container; the overlay alias resolves to workhorse."
msgstr "Vloga je povezana z deljenim prekrivanjem, prijavljenim v `meta/networks.yml` tako da odjemalci lahko dosežejo končni rezultat zabojnika-kontejnerju; prekrivanje alias odloči za delovni konj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role automates the provisioning of a secure Firefox environment, reducing manual configuration and ensuring consistency across deployments. It is ideal for environments where a standardized and secure browsing setup is required."
msgstr "Vloga avtomatizira zagotavljanje varnega Firefox okolje, zmanjšanje ročne konfiguracije in zagotavljanje doslednosti med uvajanjem. Idealno je za okolja, kjer je potrebna standardizirana in varna nastavitev brskanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role automatically selects the appropriate installation method:"
msgstr "Vloga samodejno izbere ustrezen način namestitve:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role box lists EVERY service the role declares. Around it:"
msgstr "Vložna skrinjica navaja VSAKO storitev, ki jo izjavlja. Okoli:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role brings up Penpot's containerized stack behind the standard Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy and wires it into central identity, backup, and dashboard infrastructure. It follows the per-role meta layout ([layout.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md)) and is modeled on [`web-app-openproject`](../web-app-openproject/) and [`web-app-baserow`](../web-app-baserow/)."
msgstr "Vloga se pojavlja PenpotPosoda za standardno Infinito.Nexus Povratni posrednik in žice v centralni identiteti, backup, in armaturna plošča infrastruktura. Sledi meta razporedu na role ([layout.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md)) in je po vzoru [`web-app-openproject`](../web-app-openproject/) ter [`web-app-baserow`](../web-app-baserow/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role brings up Penpot’s containerized stack behind the standard Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy and wires it into central identity, backup, and dashboard infrastructure. It follows the per-role meta layout (`layout.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md>`__) and is modeled on ```web-app-openproject`` <../web-app-openproject/>`__ and ```web-app-baserow`` <../web-app-baserow/>`__."
msgstr "Vloga se pojavlja PenpotPosoda je bila položena za standard Infinito.Nexus Povratni posrednik in žice v centralni identiteti, backup, in armaturna plošča infrastruktura. Sledi meta razporedu na role (`layout.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md>`__) in je po vzoru ```web-app-openproject`` <../web-app-openproject/>`__ and ```web-app-baserow`` <../web-app-baserow/>` ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to prevent `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Vloga gradi pusto po meri sliko na vrhu uradnika Jira Slika programske opreme, obstojne količine rezervacij in izpostavlja aplikacijo za vašim povratnim posrednikom. Nadzor spremenljivk image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM kup velikosti je avto-izpeljan iz gostitelja RAM z varnimi kape za preprečevanje `Xms > Xmx`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to prevent ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Vloga gradi pusto po meri sliko na vrhu uradnika Jira Slika programske opreme, obstojne količine rezervacij in izpostavlja aplikacijo za vašim povratnim posrednikom. Nadzor spremenljivk image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM kup velikosti je avto-izpeljan iz gostitelja RAM z varnimi kape za preprečevanje ``Xms > Xmx``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Vloga gradi minimalno podobo po meri na vrhu uradnika Confluence slike, pripravlja vztrajne količine in izpostavlja aplikacijo za vašim povratnim posrednikom. Nastavitve poganjajo spremenljivke (slike, različice, zvezki, domene, OIDC). JVM kup size je samodejno pridobljen iz gostitelja RAM z varnimi kape, da bi se izognili `Xms > Xmx`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Vloga gradi minimalno podobo po meri na vrhu uradnika Confluence slike, pripravlja vztrajne količine in izpostavlja aplikacijo za vašim povratnim posrednikom. Nastavitve poganjajo spremenljivke (slike, različice, zvezki, domene, OIDC). JVM kup size je samodejno pridobljen iz gostitelja RAM z varnimi kape, da bi se izognili ``Xms > Xmx``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether ``pip`` from ``ansible_python_interpreter`` supports ``--break-system-packages`` and only uses it (plus ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older ``pip`` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Vloga preverja, ali ``pip`` od ``ansible_python_interpreter`` podporo ``--break-system-packages`` in ga uporablja samo (plus ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) kadar je na voljo. To ohranja vlogo združljivo s starejšimi ``pip`` različice (npr. nekateri sistemi CentOS/RHEL)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether `pip` from `ansible_python_interpreter` supports `--break-system-packages` and only uses it (plus `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older `pip` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Vloga preverja, ali `pip` od `ansible_python_interpreter` podporo `--break-system-packages` in ga uporablja samo (plus `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) kadar je na voljo. To ohranja vlogo združljivo s starejšimi `pip` različice (npr. nekateri sistemi CentOS/RHEL)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role configures a systemd service and timer which executes the CSP crawler periodically against all NGINX domains."
msgstr "Vloga konfigurira sistemsko storitev in časovnik, ki izvaja CSP plaz redno proti vsem domenam NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role configures and deploys a containerized PhpMyAdmin instance using Docker Compose. It optionally integrates with a central database and uses dynamic Ansible variables to support flexible deployments in both production and homelab environments."
msgstr "Vloga konfigurira in razporedi zabojnike PhpMyAdmin primerek Docker Compose. Neobvezno se povezuje z osrednjo bazo podatkov in uporablja dinamične Ansible spremenljivke za podporo fleksibilne uporabe v proizvodnih in domačih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as ``http://jupyter:8888`` once it declares ``jupyter`` in its own ``meta/services.yml`` with ``enabled`` and ``shared`` set. ``web-app-openwebui`` ships that flag and sends ``CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter`` with it."
msgstr "Vloga ne izjavlja glasnosti: jedro, ki izvaja kodo, ki jo je napisal klepet, ob vsakem ponovnem zagonu dobi nov datotečni sistem. Porabnik ga doseže. ``http://jupyter:8888`` po razglasitvi ``jupyter`` v svojem ``meta/services.yml`` z ``enabled`` ter ``shared`` Pripravljeni. ``web-app-openwebui`` ladje, ki plujejo in pošiljajo ``CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter`` Z njo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as `http://jupyter:8888` once it declares `jupyter` in its own `meta/services.yml` with `enabled` and `shared` set. `web-app-openwebui` ships that flag and sends `CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter` with it."
msgstr "Vloga ne izjavlja glasnosti: jedro, ki izvaja kodo, ki jo je napisal klepet, ob vsakem ponovnem zagonu dobi nov datotečni sistem. Porabnik ga doseže. `http://jupyter:8888` po razglasitvi `jupyter` v svojem `meta/services.yml` z `enabled` ter `shared` Pripravljeni. `web-app-openwebui` ladje, ki plujejo in pošiljajo `CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter` Z njo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single ``registry:2`` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group’s host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` resolves to ``compose`` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Vloga je enotna ``registry:2`` primer v načinu potegovanja posrednika na gostitelju skupine inventarja. Ker ima skupina običajno točno enega gostitelja (upravljalnik rojov), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` odloči, da ``compose`` za vlogo; izpuh več gostiteljev za sam predpomnilnik je izven področja za v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single `registry:2` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group's host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` resolves to `compose` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Vloga je enotna `registry:2` primerek v načinu potegovanja posrednika na gostitelju skupine inventarja. Ker ima skupina običajno točno enega gostitelja (upravljalnik rojov), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` odloči, da `compose` za vlogo; izpuh več gostiteljev za sam predpomnilnik je izven področja za v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys end-to-end on the project's reference distribution and is covered by **at least** a smoke-level Playwright spec, but neither the deploy nor the spec depth is considered production-grade."
msgstr "Vloga se uporablja od konca do konca pri referenčni porazdelitvi projekta in je zajeta v **vsaj** Specično dimljenje Playwrighta, vendar se niti uporaba niti globina ne štejeta za proizvodno stopnjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the frontend and owns the templates and their tuning; the dev compose stack has no inventory to render them with and comes through here instead. Every value still has one home: the hosts and repositories come from the ``cache:`` declarations, the nginx tuning from the role's ``vars/main.yml``, and only the backend address differs, because the dev stack reaches Nexus over a compose network alias while the role reaches it by its configured container."
msgstr "Vloga uporablja frontend in ima v lasti predloge in njihovo uglaševanje; dev compose stack nima inventar, da bi jih z in namesto tega pride skozi. Vsaka vrednost ima še vedno en dom: gostitelji in skladišča prihajajo iz ``cache:`` izjave, uglasitev vloge ``vars/main.yml``, in samo naslov hrbtenice razlikuje, ker dev sklad doseže Nexus preko komponirati omrežja alias, medtem ko je vloga doseže z njegovo nastavljeno posodo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via `SEMAPHORE_*` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak `administrator` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via `semaphore user add --admin --external`; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "Vloga razporedi enojni vsebnik Semafor (z vgrajenim gonilnikom opravil) in ga z žico prek `SEMAPHORE_*` okoljske spremenljivke. Čarovnik nastavitev je zaobšel s sejanjem začetni admin iz prevedenih skrivnosti, tako da sveže razporedite zemljišča neposredno na Semafore prijavni strani. Ko je omogočen SSO, Keycloak `administrator` ustvari ob času uvajanja kot zunanji Semafor admin preko `semaphore user add --admin --external`; OIDC klic se ujema po e-pošti in se vpiše kot Semaphore admin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via ``SEMAPHORE_*`` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak ``administrator`` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "Vloga razporedi enojni vsebnik Semafor (z vgrajenim gonilnikom opravil) in ga z žico prek ``SEMAPHORE_*`` okoljske spremenljivke. Čarovnik nastavitev je zaobšel s sejanjem začetni admin iz prevedenih skrivnosti, tako da sveže razporedite zemljišča neposredno na Semafore prijavni strani. Ko je omogočen SSO, Keycloak ``administrator`` ustvari ob času uvajanja kot zunanji Semafor admin preko ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; OIDC klic se ujema po e-pošti in se vpiše kot Semaphore admin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys two containers on its inventory group's host: the repository manager and its nginx frontend. Both run in compose mode on the manager, like the sibling [svc-registry-cache](../svc-registry-cache/README.md)."
msgstr "Vlogo razporedi dva zabojnika na gostitelja skupine za inventar: upravitelj skladišča in njegovo začelje ginx. Oba tečeta v sestavnem načinu na upravitelju, kot brat in sestra [svc-registry-cache](../svc-registry-cache/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys two containers on its inventory group’s host: the repository manager and its nginx frontend. Both run in compose mode on the manager, like the sibling `svc-registry-cache <../svc-registry-cache/README.md>`__."
msgstr "Vloga vključuje dva zabojnika na gostitelja skupine inventarja: upravitelja skladišča in njegovo začelje ginx. Oba tečeta v sestavnem načinu na upravitelju, kot brat in sestra `svc-registry-cache <../svc-registry-cache/README.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role directory name is the `application_id`. For example `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` is exposed as `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` as `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, and so on."
msgstr "Ime imenika vloge je `application_id`. Na primer `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` je izpostavljena kot `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` kot `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, In tako naprej."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role does NOT carry \"known broken\" warnings in its `README.md`."
msgstr "Vloga NE nosi \"znan zlom\" opozorila v svoji `README.md`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role does not exist on disk yet (or only as a placeholder `meta/services.yml`). It is listed in this state so that contributors can discover what the project intends to ship next."
msgstr "Vloga še ne obstaja na disku (ali samo kot zamenjava `meta/services.yml`). To je navedeno v tej državi, tako da lahko prispevajoči odkrijejo, kaj projekt namerava poslati naprej."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role enables a ready-to-use Arduino development setup by installing necessary tools and configuring user permissions for serial access."
msgstr "Vloga omogoča pripravo Arduino za uporabo z namestitvijo potrebnih orodij in nastavljanjem uporabniških dovoljenj za serijski dostop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role ensures that Docker and Docker Compose are present, integrates essential backup, repair, and health check roles, and supports cleanup or full reset modes for a fresh Docker environment."
msgstr "Vloga zagotavlja, da Docker in Docker Compose so prisotni, vključuje bistvene varnostne kopije, popravila in vloge zdravstvenega pregleda in podpira čiščenje ali popolno ponastavitev načinov za sveže Docker okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role ensures that Docker and Docker Compose are present, integrates essential backup, repair, and health check roles, and supports cleanup or full reset modes for a fresh Docker environment.   When enabled via `MODE_CLEANUP` or `MODE_RESET`, it will automatically prune unused Docker resources.   `MODE_RESET` additionally restarts the Docker service after cleanup."
msgstr "Vloga zagotavlja, da Docker in Docker Compose so prisotni, vključuje bistvene varnostne kopije, popravila in vloge zdravstvenega pregleda in podpira čiščenje ali popolno ponastavitev načinov za sveže Docker okolje. Ko je omogočeno preko `MODE_CLEANUP` ali `MODE_RESET`, da bo samodejno obrezovati neporabljenih Docker sredstev. `MODE_RESET` dodatno ponovno zažene servis Docker po čiščenju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes Jenkins as an MCP server through the [MCP Server plugin](https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/), baked into the image alongside the other plugins in `files/plugins.txt`. The surface is declared as the `mcp` service in `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "Vloga razkriva Jenkins kot strežnik MCP skozi [MCP Vstavek za strežnik](https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/), pečen v sliko poleg drugih vstavkov v `files/plugins.txt`. Površina je deklarirana kot `mcp` storitev v `meta/services.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes Jenkins as an MCP server through the `MCP Server plugin <https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/>`__, baked into the image alongside the other plugins in ``files/plugins.txt``. The surface is declared as the ``mcp`` service in ``meta/services.yml``."
msgstr "Vloga razkriva Jenkins kot strežnik MCP skozi `MCP Server plugin <https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/>`__, pečen v sliko poleg drugih vstavkov v ``files/plugins.txt``. Površina je deklarirana kot ``mcp`` storitev v ``meta/services.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes a Model Context Protocol surface through the ``webservice_mcp`` protocol plugin, baked into the image at ``webservice/mcp`` and served by the NGINX sidecar."
msgstr "Vloga izpostavlja vzorčni protokol skozi ``webservice_mcp`` protokol vstavek, vžgan v sliko na ``webservice/mcp`` in postrežen z NGINX prikolico."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes a Model Context Protocol surface through the `webservice_mcp` protocol plugin, baked into the image at `webservice/mcp` and served by the NGINX sidecar."
