msgid "The role follows Infinito.Nexus conventions:"
msgstr "Vloga sledi Infinito.Nexus konvencije:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role has never been deployed. ``lifecycle`` is ``alpha``, so CI deploys it from the next run on; that run is its first execution. See `TODO.md <TODO.md>`__."
msgstr "Vloga ni bila nikoli uporabljena. ``lifecycle`` m ``alpha``, Zato ga CI razpošlje od naslednjega teka naprej. Glej. `TODO.md <TODO.md>`__."

