msgstr "Vloga ni bila nikoli uporabljena. `lifecycle` m `alpha`, Zato ga CI razpošlje od naslednjega teka naprej. Glej. [TODO.md](TODO.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role has reached end of life: it still ships in `roles/` for now but the project does NOT commit to testing or maintaining it (retired prototypes, proprietary products, superseded apps)."
msgstr "Vloga je dosegla konec življenja: še vedno ladje v `roles/` za zdaj, vendar se projekt NE zavezuje k testiranju ali vzdrževanju (upokojeni prototipi, lastniški izdelki, nadomestne aplikacije)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role id *text* names, or None when it names no role."
msgstr "ID vloge *besedilo* imena ali nobenega, če ne navaja nobene vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role id a deploy job ``name`` encodes, or None if it is not one."
msgstr "Vloga id razporejanje delovnih mest ``name`` kodiranje ali nič, če ni eno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role ids the pins select, deduplicated, in the order given -- what the discovery query filters on. The axes are applied afterwards, on the rows the query returned."
msgstr "Vloga ids zatiči izbrati, deduplicirano, v vrstnem redu dano -- kaj odkritje poizvedba filtrira na. Sekire se nato uporabijo v vrsticah, ki jih je poizvedba vrnila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes Matomo tracking configuration and injects the corresponding tracking script into your HTML."
msgstr "Vloga vključuje Matomo sledenje nastavitev in vbrizga ustrezno skripto sledenja v vaš HTML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes a custom ``auth_oauth_https`` addon that fixes OAuth redirect URIs when running behind a reverse proxy with TLS termination. The standard ``auth_oauth`` module may incorrectly generate HTTP redirect URIs. This addon overrides the behavior to use the ``web.base.url`` system parameter, ensuring HTTPS is always used."
msgstr "Vloga vključuje po meri ``auth_oauth_https`` addon, ki popravi OAuth preusmeri URI, ko teče za povratnim posrednikom s prekinitvijo TLS. Standard ``auth_oauth`` modul lahko nepravilno ustvari HTTP preusmeri URI. Ta dodatek prevlada vedenje za uporabo ``web.base.url`` parameter sistema, ki zagotavlja, da se HTTPS vedno uporablja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes a custom `auth_oauth_https` addon that fixes OAuth redirect URIs when running behind a reverse proxy with TLS termination. The standard `auth_oauth` module may incorrectly generate HTTP redirect URIs. This addon overrides the behavior to use the `web.base.url` system parameter, ensuring HTTPS is always used."
msgstr "Vloga vključuje po meri `auth_oauth_https` addon, ki popravi OAuth preusmeri URI, ko teče za povratnim posrednikom s prekinitvijo TLS. Standard `auth_oauth` modul lahko nepravilno ustvari HTTP preusmeri URI. Ta dodatek prevlada vedenje za uporabo `web.base.url` parameter sistema, ki zagotavlja, da se HTTPS vedno uporablja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role injects a global CSS link for consistent theming across your site."
msgstr "Vloga injicira globalno CSS povezavo za dosledno tematiko na vaši spletni strani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **Nix** using either the native package manager (where supported and reliable) or the **official installer** with **SHA256 verification**."
msgstr "Vloga je umeščena **Nix** z uporabo domačega upravljalnika paketov (kadar je podprta in zanesljiva) ali **uradni monter** z **SHA256 preverjanje**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **msmtp**, handles distro-specific package differences (including EPEL bootstrap on EL-family hosts when required), and deploys a pre-configured ``msmtprc`` file via Jinja2. For distros without a dedicated ``msmtp-mta`` package, it configures a direct ``/usr/bin/sendmail`` compatibility symlink to ``msmtp``."
msgstr "Vloga je umeščena **msmtp**, obravnava distrospecifične razlike v pakiranju (vključno z EPEL škornji na gostiteljih družine EL, kadar je to potrebno), in uporablja vnaprej nastavljeno ``msmtprc`` Datoteka via Jinja2. Za distroje brez posvečene ``msmtp-mta`` paket, nastavlja neposredno ``/usr/bin/sendmail`` Simpovezava združljivosti z ``msmtp``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **msmtp**, handles distro-specific package differences (including EPEL bootstrap on EL-family hosts when required), and deploys a pre-configured `msmtprc` file via Jinja2. For distros without a dedicated `msmtp-mta` package, it configures a direct `/usr/bin/sendmail` compatibility symlink to `msmtp`."
msgstr "Vloga je umeščena **msmtp**, obravnava distrospecifične razlike v pakiranju (vključno z EPEL škornji na gostiteljih družine EL, kadar je to potrebno), in uporablja vnaprej nastavljeno `msmtprc` Datoteka via Jinja2. Za distroje brez posvečene `msmtp-mta` paket, nastavlja neposredno `/usr/bin/sendmail` Simpovezava združljivosti z `msmtp`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs ``dockreap`` using Python tooling and runs it with the ``--no-confirmation`` flag to ensure automatic, non-interactive cleanup."
msgstr "Vloga je umeščena ``dockreap`` uporabo Python orodja in ga upravlja z ``--no-confirmation`` zastava za zagotovitev samodejnega, neinteraktivnega čiščenja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs `dockreap` using Python tooling and runs it with the `--no-confirmation` flag to ensure automatic, non-interactive cleanup."
msgstr "Vloga je umeščena `dockreap` uporabo Python orodja in ga upravlja z `--no-confirmation` zastava za zagotovitev samodejnega, neinteraktivnega čiščenja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a health check script along with a ``systemd`` service and timer to run these checks at scheduled intervals."
msgstr "Vloga namesti scenarij zdravstvenega pregleda skupaj z ``systemd`` storitev in časovnik za izvajanje teh pregledov v rednih časovnih presledkih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a health check script along with a `systemd` service and timer to run these checks at scheduled intervals.   If unhealthy or failed containers are detected, the configured failure notifier (via `sys-ctl-alm-compose`) is triggered."
msgstr "Vloga namesti scenarij zdravstvenega pregleda skupaj z `systemd` storitev in časovnik za izvajanje teh pregledov v rednih časovnih presledkih. Če se odkrije nezdrava ali neuspešna posoda, konfigurirani neuspešni prijavitelj (preko `sys-ctl-alm-compose`) se sproži."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a script and a ``systemd`` service with a timer to periodically scan for leftover anonymous volumes."
msgstr "Vloga namesti scenarij in a ``systemd`` storitev s časovnikom za redno skeniranje ostankov anonimnih količin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a script and a `systemd` service with a timer to periodically scan for leftover anonymous volumes.   This helps prevent wasted disk space and leftover resources from old deployments."
msgstr "Vloga namesti scenarij in a `systemd` storitev s časovnikom za redno skeniranje ostankov anonimnih količin. To pomaga preprečiti zapravljen prostor na disku in ostanke sredstev iz starih razporeditev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let's Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Vloga namesti sistemsko enoto, ki posname vsako nastavljeno izvorno mapo v `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, močno povezana s prejšnjo generacijo. Neobvezni viri se izpustijo, če jih ni (CA v načinu Šifrirajmo, ACME/certbot v načinu samopodpisa). Generacija se pridruži istemu rezervnemu drevesu poteg in vloge naprav porabijo, tako da teče do rezervnega gostitelja in šifrirane naprave samodejno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>``, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let’s Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Vloga namesti sistemsko enoto, ki posname vsako nastavljeno izvorno mapo v ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>``, močno povezana s prejšnjo generacijo. Neobvezni viri se izpustijo, če jih ni (CA v načinu Šifrirajmo, ACME/certbot v načinu, ki je samopodpisan). Generacija se pridruži istemu rezervnemu drevesu poteg in vloge naprav porabijo, tako da teče do rezervnega gostitelja in šifrirane naprave samodejno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the `@openai/codex` npm package and, when the workstation also runs [`svc-ai-litellm`](../svc-ai-litellm/), writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on `127.0.0.1`, so the workstation's virtual key never crosses a network."
msgstr "Vloga vgrajuje `@openai/codex` paket npm in, ko deluje tudi delovna postaja [`svc-ai-litellm`](../svc-ai-litellm/), piše profil ponudnika, ki pošilja vsako dokončanje na prehod preko zankaback naslov motor objavi na. Nič ne zapusti stroja. `127.0.0.1`, Torej virtualni ključ nikoli ne prečka omrežja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the ``@openai/codex`` npm package and, when the workstation also runs ```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__, writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on ``127.0.0.1``, so the workstation’s virtual key never crosses a network."
msgstr "Vloga vgrajuje ``@openai/codex`` paket npm in, ko deluje tudi delovna postaja ```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__, writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on ``127.0.0.1``, tako da virtualni ključ delovne postaje nikoli ne prečka omrežja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the correct SSH client package for the following platforms:"
msgstr "Vloga namesti pravilen paket SSH odjemalca za naslednje platforme:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the pinned upstream AppImage and puts it on `PATH`. Upstream signs its assets with the Tauri updater key and publishes no digest, so the role pins a sha256 taken from the released build itself and the download is verified against it. A rebuilt or replaced asset fails the deploy instead of being installed."
msgstr "Vloga namesti pripeto gornji AppImage in ga na `PATH`. Upstream podpisuje svoje premoženje s Tauri updaterja ključ in objavlja brez prebave, tako da vloga buns a sha256 vzeto iz sproščeni graditi sam in prenos je preverjen proti njemu. Predelano ali zamenjano sredstvo ne uspe uporabiti, namesto da bi bilo nameščeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the pinned upstream AppImage and puts it on ``PATH``. Upstream signs its assets with the Tauri updater key and publishes no digest, so the role pins a sha256 taken from the released build itself and the download is verified against it. A rebuilt or replaced asset fails the deploy instead of being installed."
msgstr "Vloga namesti pripeto gornji AppImage in ga na ``PATH``. Upstream podpisuje svoje premoženje s Tauri updaterja ključ in objavlja brez prebave, tako da vloga buns a sha256 vzeto iz sproščeni graditi sam in prenos je preverjen proti njemu. Predelano ali zamenjano sredstvo ne uspe uporabiti, namesto da bi bilo nameščeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role is a critical component in a secure backup scheme. By isolating backup operations to a dedicated user, it minimizes the risk of unauthorized actions. The role configures the SSH environment so that only specific, allowed commands can be executed, and it sets up passwordless sudo rights for rsync, ensuring smooth and secure backup operations."
msgstr "Vloga je ključni element v varni rezervni shemi. Z osamitvijo backupnih operacij za namenskega uporabnika zmanjša tveganje nepooblaščenih dejanj. Vloga konfigurira okolje SSH tako, da se lahko izvajajo samo posebni, dovoljeni ukazi, in postavlja brez gesel sudo pravice za rsync, ki zagotavljajo nemoteno in varno backup operacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role is designed to be **distribution-agnostic** and works on:"
msgstr "Vloga je namenjena **porazdelitev-agnostik** in deluje na:"

