# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provides the foundation for SSH-based workflows and is designed to be used as a dependency by other roles that require SSH functionality."
msgstr "Vloga je temelj za delovne tokove, ki temeljijo na SSH, in je namenjena uporabi kot odvisnost od drugih vlog, ki zahtevajo funkcionalnost SSH."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provisions new GitLab instances. Volumes, secrets and backups of a pre-CNG Omnibus deployment (``gitlab_config``, ``gitlab_data``, ``/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json``) are not migrated or restorable into the CNG layout; deploy against a fresh database and empty volumes."
msgstr "Vlogo določb novo GitLab primere. Obseg, skrivnosti in varnostne kopije uporabe pred CNG Omnibus (``gitlab_config``, ``gitlab_data``, ``/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json``) se ne premaknejo ali obnovijo v postavitev CNG; namestijo se na novo bazo podatkov in prazne količine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provisions new GitLab instances. Volumes, secrets and backups of a pre-CNG Omnibus deployment (`gitlab_config`, `gitlab_data`, `/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json`) are not migrated or restorable into the CNG layout; deploy against a fresh database and empty volumes."
msgstr "Vlogo določb novo GitLab primere. Obseg, skrivnosti in varnostne kopije uporabe pred CNG Omnibus (`gitlab_config`, `gitlab_data`, `/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json`) se ne premaknejo ali obnovijo v postavitev CNG; namestijo se na novo bazo podatkov in prazne količine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role publishes a public documentation site. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `sso.shared` to `false`, and the role ships no `meta/users.yml` and no account provisioning; [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) only configures the build service. [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the `biber` or `administrator` persona, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability and CSP assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Vloga objavlja spletno stran za javno dokumentacijo. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) zatiči `sso.enabled` ter `sso.shared` do `false`, in vlogo ladje `meta/users.yml` brez rezervacij računov; [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) Nastavite samo storitev gradnje. [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) samo žice zabojnik in posredniški sklad in stopnje Sfinx orodje v kontekstu graditi. Ni računa in ni auth verige za `biber` ali `administrator` Persona, torej [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) razglasi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. O `guest` persona in izhodiščna dosegljivost ter trditve CSP tečejo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role publishes a public documentation site. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled`` and ``sso.shared`` to ``false``, and the role ships no ``meta/users.yml`` and no account provisioning; ```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__ only configures the build service. ```tasks/main.yml`` <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability and CSP assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Vloga objavlja spletno stran za javno dokumentacijo. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled`` and ``sso.shared`` to ``false``, and the role ships no ``meta/users.yml`` and no account provisioning; ```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__ only configures the build service. ```tasks/main.yml`` <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona in izhodiščna dosegljivost ter trditve CSP tečejo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders ``settings.yml`` from the deployment’s own secret key and mounts it read-only. ``formats`` carries ``json`` next to ``html``, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "Vloga ima ``settings.yml`` iz lastnega skrivnega ključa in ga nastavlja samo za branje. ``formats`` Nosi ``json`` poleg ``html``, ker stroj potrošnik dobi HTTP 403 o končni točki JSON sicer in omejevalnik obrestne mere je izključen, saj so edini odjemalci storitve platforme na kontejnerskem omrežju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders `settings.yml` from the deployment's own secret key and mounts it read-only. `formats` carries `json` next to `html`, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "Vloga ima `settings.yml` Iz lastnega skrivnega ključa in ga nastavlja samo za branje. `formats` Nosi `json` poleg `html`, ker stroj potrošnik dobi HTTP 403 o končni točki JSON sicer in omejevalnik obrestne mere je izključen, saj so edini odjemalci storitve platforme na kontejnerskem omrežju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the `-full` image, which carries the OCR and language packs, and serves it on port 9998 inside the container network only. No port is published and no proxy entry is created."
msgstr "Vloga vodi `-full` slika, ki nosi OCR in jezikovnih paketov, in služi v pristanišču 9998 samo znotraj kontejnerskega omrežja. Vrata niso objavljena in ni ustvarjen noben posredniški vnos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the ``-full`` image, which carries the OCR and language packs, and serves it on port 9998 inside the container network only. No port is published and no proxy entry is created."
msgstr "Vloga vodi ``-full`` slika, ki nosi OCR in jezikovnih paketov, in služi v pristanišču 9998 samo znotraj kontejnerskega omrežja. Vrata niso objavljena in ni ustvarjen noben posredniški vnos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the upstream ``ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome`` image behind the central reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Everything the application keeps lives in one volume at ``/data``: the SQLite database, uploaded media, and installed apps. The administrator account is provisioned from the role’s generated credential, and the role finishes the upstream first-boot wizard over the API so the front page renders a login form instead of a setup screen."
msgstr "Vloga poteka v toku navzgor ``ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome`` slika za osrednjim obratnim posrednikom na svoji kanonični domeni. Vse, kar aplikacija ohranja živi v enem zvezku ``/data``: podatkovna zbirka SQLite, naloženi mediji in nameščene aplikacije. Administrativni račun je na voljo iz vloge je nastala poverilnica, in vloga konča gornji prvi-boot čarovnik nad API Tako na prvi strani izrisuje prijavni obrazec namesto nastavitvenega zaslona."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the upstream `ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome` image behind the central reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Everything the application keeps lives in one volume at `/data`: the SQLite database, uploaded media, and installed apps. The administrator account is provisioned from the role's generated credential, and the role finishes the upstream first-boot wizard over the API so the front page renders a login form instead of a setup screen."
msgstr "Vloga poteka v toku navzgor `ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome` slika za osrednjim obratnim posrednikom na svoji kanonični domeni. Vse, kar aplikacija ohranja živi v enem zvezku `/data`: podatkovna zbirka SQLite, naloženi mediji in nameščene aplikacije. Administrativni račun je zagotovljena iz vloge je nastala poverilnica, in vloga konča gorvodno prvo-boot čarovnik nad API Tako na prvi strani izrisuje prijavni obrazec namesto nastavitvenega zaslona."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role scans NGINX server block `.conf` files for domains, HEAD-requests each domain, compares the response against per-domain expected codes, and reports mismatches via `sys-ctl-alm-compose`. It is scheduled via a systemd timer for periodic health sweeps. Include this role and define `on_calendar_health_NGINX`. The role installs `requests` via `pip` automatically."
msgstr "Vloga skenira blok strežnika NGINX `.conf` datoteke za domene, HEAD-zahteva vsako domeno, primerja odziv s pričakovanimi kodami na domeno in poroča o neskladjih preko `sys-ctl-alm-compose`. Načrtovana je s sistemsko časovnico za periodične zdravstvene preglede. Vključi to vlogo in opredeli `on_calendar_health_NGINX`. Vloga namesti `requests` preko `pip` samodejno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role scans NGINX server block ``.conf`` files for domains, HEAD-requests each domain, compares the response against per-domain expected codes, and reports mismatches via ``sys-ctl-alm-compose``. It is scheduled via a systemd timer for periodic health sweeps. Include this role and define ``on_calendar_health_NGINX``. The role installs ``requests`` via ``pip`` automatically."
msgstr "Vloga skenira blok strežnika NGINX ``.conf`` datoteke za domene, HEAD-zahteva vsako domeno, primerja odziv s pričakovanimi kodami na domeno in poroča o neskladjih preko ``sys-ctl-alm-compose``. Načrtovana je s sistemsko časovnico za periodične zdravstvene preglede. Vključi to vlogo in opredeli ``on_calendar_health_NGINX``. Vloga namesti ``requests`` preko ``pip`` samodejno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role selections go out as display names (``utils.roles.display``), so the run title reads them back the way the deploy jobs are titled. The workflow decodes them again before any consumer sees a role id."
msgstr "Izbiranje vlog poteka kot imena prikaza (``utils.roles.display``), Naslov jih je prebral tako, kot se imenujejo delovna mesta. Delovni tok jih ponovno dekodira, preden kateri koli potrošnik vidi ID vloge."

