msgstr "Vloga addon-obdelovalna zanka MORA vključevati `tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml` kadar je prisoten in dopušča njegovo odsotnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role's documented integrations (OIDC, RBAC, email, dashboard, service-gating, etc., as applicable) are exercised end-to-end by its Playwright spec or by a peer role's spec when the integration is cross-role."
msgstr "Vloga je dokumentirana integracija (OIDC, RBAC, e-pošta, armaturna plošča, servisna oprema itd., kot je ustrezno) se izvajajo od konca do konca s svojim Playwright specifikacijo ali s specifikacijo vrstniške vloge, kadar je povezovanje navzkrižno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The role's name is implied by the path. There is NO `web-app-<role>` key inside the file. The materialised path is `applications.<role>.networks.local.{subnet,dns_resolver}`."
msgstr "Ime vloge je nakazano po poti. NE obstaja `web-app-<role>` Ključ v datoteki. Materializirana pot je `applications.<role>.networks.local.{subnet,dns_resolver}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role's playwright lint contracts (Tests A + B + env_keys_used) are green; role-closure remains pending the orchestration fix."
msgstr "Vlogo je dramaturg sklenil. (Preskusi A + B + env_keys_used) so zelene; zapiranje vlog ostane do določitve orkestracije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role's purpose is to automate the provisioning and configuration of a centralized database service. This not only reduces manual setup but also ensures consistent, reliable deployment across production and homelab environments."
msgstr "Namen vloge je avtomatizacija zagotavljanja in konfiguracije centralizirane storitve baze podatkov. To ne zmanjšuje samo ročnega nameščanja, ampak zagotavlja tudi dosledno in zanesljivo uporabo v proizvodnih in domačih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role's service config (file root IS the services map keyed by `<entity_name>`). For `svc-db-mariadb` this carries the entity-keyed image, version, and hostname:"
msgstr "Servisna naloga (datotečni koren je zemljevid storitev, ki ga je zaklenil `<entity_name>`). Za `svc-db-mariadb` ima sliko, različico in ime gostitelja na ključ entitete:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role-mapping schema decides which files MAY appear inside `roles/<role-name>/`, which MUST appear, and which dotted-path entries inside those files MUST be set per role type."
msgstr "Shema za določanje vlog določa, katere datoteke se lahko pojavijo znotraj `roles/<role-name>/`, ki se mora pojaviti, in ki pikčaste poti vnosi v teh datotekah MORAJO biti nastavljeni glede na vrsto vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role-specific interaction callbacks and the peer-exchange test are part of the persona contract. Specs that ship only the personas without an interaction callback fulfil the bare minimum, but SHOULD extend with bespoke role coverage during the role's rollout iteration."
msgstr "Interakcija, vezana na vlogo, in test medsebojne izmenjave sta del pogodbe o persona. Specifikacije, ki oddajajo le osebe brez vzajemnega klica, izpolnjujejo minimum, vendar bi jih bilo treba razširiti z ustrezno pokritostjo vlog med izvajanjem vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The roles below are database-backed and their upstream app can store objects in S3, so the integration is **fundamentally possible but not yet implemented**. Roles whose upstream has no S3 backend, or whose S3 client is incompatible with SeaweedFS path-style, are listed at the end."
msgstr "Vloge spodaj so podprte z zbirko podatkov in njihova aplikacija lahko shranjuje predmete v S3, tako je vključevanje **bistveno možno, vendar še ne izvedeno**. Vloge, katerih gornji tok nima S3 hrbtenica ali katere S3 stranka je nezdružljiva z SeaweedFS način poti, so navedeni na koncu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role’s purpose is to automate the provisioning and configuration of a centralized database service. This not only reduces manual setup but also ensures consistent, reliable deployment across production and homelab environments."
msgstr "Namen te naloge je avtomatizacija zagotavljanja in konfiguracije centralizirane storitve zbirke podatkov. To ne zmanjšuje samo ročnega nameščanja, ampak zagotavlja tudi dosledno in zanesljivo uporabo v proizvodnih in domačih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The root `index.rst` uses a `:glob:` toctree (`docs/**`) to automatically include every documentation page."
msgstr "Koren `index.rst` uporablja a `:glob:` toctree (`docs/**`) samodejno vključiti vsako stran dokumentacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The root causes that are still open without a run to point at: a fix landed whose effect nobody has seen, or a diagnosis that was never confirmed against the deployed code."
msgstr "Korenine, ki so še vedno odprta brez teče do točke na: fix pristal, katerih učinek ni nihče videl, ali diagnoza, ki ni bila nikoli potrjena proti razporejeno kodo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The root mapping, with every scalar as a ``str``."
msgstr "Kartiranje korenin, z vsakim skalarjem kot ``str``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The roundtrip is a gate, not a debugger: when a step goes red it stops and leaves the evidence in place. Do NOT just re-run the roundtrip; drop into the matching focused loop."
msgstr "Povratna pot je vrata, ne razhroščevalnik: ko korak postane rdeč, se ustavi in pusti dokaze na mestu. Ne samo ponovno zaženite roundtrip; spustite v ujemajočo osredotočeno zanko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The router runs init, then deploy. Init materialises the inventory under `${INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR}` (resolved by `make dotenv` via [resolve.sh](../../../scripts/inventory/resolve.sh); see [variables.md](../environment/variables.md))."
msgstr "Router teče noter, nato se razporedi. Init uresniči inventar pod `${INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR}` (zdravljenje `make dotenv` preko [resolve.sh](../../../scripts/inventory/resolve.sh); glej [variables.md](../environment/variables.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The router sits inside the gateway. No consumer learns a second endpoint."
msgstr "Router sedi znotraj vrat. Noben potrošnik se ne nauči drugega cilja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The row has to run in the guide's own mode. The replay is a second deploy on the same runner, so hanging it on a swarm row would ask that runner to bring a compose stack up beside a swarm one. Only rows in that mode count as deployed here either, so the variant search cannot settle on one that this sweep runs in swarm alone."
msgstr "Vrstica mora teči v svojem načinu. Replay je drugi razpored na istem tekaču, zato bi ga obesili na rojsko vrsto in prosili tekača, naj prinese skladalnik poleg enega. Samo vrstice v tem načinu se štejejo kot uporabljene tudi tukaj, tako da iskanje variante ne more poravnati na eni, da to čiščenje teče samo v roju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The row then draws from that intersection instead of the run's whole pool, and so does every row whose variant deploys that role, as the deploy planner resolves it. A role and a run that permit nothing in common abort the matrix rather than dropping the row."
msgstr "Vrstica nato črpa iz tega križišča namesto celotnega bazena teka, tako kot vsaka vrsta, katere varianta uporablja to vlogo, saj jo razporedi načrtovalec reši. Vloga in tek, ki ne dopuščata nič skupnega, raje prekineta matrico kot spustita vrstico."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The rows the source run proved, as ``role#variant``, axes dropped."
msgstr "Vrstice, v katerih teče vir, so se izkazale. ``role#variant``, Sekire so padale."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The rules were written first and the code audited against them afterwards. Each of the following was live at the time it was found, not a hypothetical the design ruled out:"
msgstr "Pravila so bila najprej napisana, pozneje pa revidiran kodeks proti njim. Vsako od naslednjih je bilo v živo v času, ko je bilo ugotovljeno, ne hipotetično oblikovanje izključeno:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The run is marked failed. GitHub notifies repository admins. No PR is created with a wrong identity."
msgstr "Tek je označen kot neuspešen. GitHub obvesti administratorje skladišča. Noben PR ni ustvarjen z napačno identiteto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The run leaves the cluster up (`INFINITO_KEEP_SWARM_NODES=true`). You MUST reproduce the failure on it via `make swarm-exec` / `make swarm-shell`, then release it with `make swarm-down`."
msgstr "Tek pušča grozd gor. (`INFINITO_KEEP_SWARM_NODES=true`). Morate reproducirati napako na njej preko `make swarm-exec` / `make swarm-shell`, nato ga sprostite z `make swarm-down`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The run this builds differs from a retrigger: a retrigger replays what a run already judged, this one asks about rows nobody has judged yet or whose verdict is still disputed. It therefore states its axes instead of carrying them over."
msgstr "Tek, ki ga ta gradi, se razlikuje od retriggerja: retrigger ponovno predvaja, kaj je tek že sodil, ta sprašuje o vrstah, ki jih še nihče ni sodil ali katerih razsodba je še vedno sporna. Zato navaja svoje osi, namesto da bi jih prenašala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The run's 256-job cap is the second ceiling. `slots` counts every non-deploy job the orchestrator chain spawns, subtracts the worst `entry-*.yml` overhead, and what remains is `available` — the rows one sweep may deploy across all its chunks. Rows beyond that roll into the next sweep, which starts reading the regular line at an offset (`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), so consecutive sweeps walk the whole list instead of re-testing the same head forever."
msgstr "Tek je. 256-Pokrov je drugi strop. `slots` Šteje vsako delo, ki ga ne opravi Orkester. `entry-*.yml` in kar ostane, je `available` – vrste, ki jih ena preišče, se lahko razporedijo po vseh delih. Vrstice, ki so višje od tistih, ki se zavihajo v naslednji zamah, ki začne z odčitavanjem pravilne vrstice (`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), tako da zaporedne preiskave hodi celoten seznam namesto ponovno testiranje iste glave za vedno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runnable journey lives in ``files/playwright/test-login-biber.js``, which first grants biber the KIX user group over the Keycloak Admin API and then drives ``runKixLoginLogoutFlow`` through both stages to the universal logout. The path back to the generic persona is a KIX build that accepts the proxy’s trusted headers instead of demanding its own login."
msgstr "Potovanje, ki ga je mogoče ubežati, živi v ``files/playwright/test-login-biber.js``, ki prvi dodeli biber KIX skupina uporabnikov nad skupino Keycloak Skrbnik API in potem vozi ``runKixLoginLogoutFlow`` skozi obe fazi do univerzalnega odjave. Pot nazaj do splošne osebe je KIX graditi, da sprejme pooblaščenca zaupanja vredne glave, namesto da zahteva svojo prijavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runnable journey lives in `files/playwright/test-login-biber.js`, which first grants biber the KIX user group over the Keycloak Admin API and then drives `runKixLoginLogoutFlow` through both stages to the universal logout. The path back to the generic persona is a KIX build that accepts the proxy's trusted headers instead of demanding its own login."
msgstr "Potovanje, ki ga je mogoče ubežati, živi v `files/playwright/test-login-biber.js`, ki prvi dodeli biber KIX skupina uporabnikov nad skupino Keycloak Skrbnik API in potem vozi `runKixLoginLogoutFlow` skozi obe fazi do univerzalnega odjave. Pot nazaj do splošne osebe je KIX graditi, da sprejme pooblaščenca zaupa glave, namesto da zahteva svojo prijavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner is intentionally test-agnostic at runtime: it executes only tests provided by application roles."
msgstr "Tekač je namerno testno-agnostičen v času delovanja: izvaja le teste, ki jih zagotavljajo vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner keeps Playwright traces, screenshots, and videos for every test only when the resolved environment variable `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` evaluates to `true` (case-insensitive). Any other value, including unset or empty, keeps artefacts only when a test fails."
msgstr "Tekač ohranja sledi, posnetke in videoposnetke Playwrighta za vsak preizkus samo takrat, ko se reši okoljska spremenljivka `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` oceni `true` (neobčutljiva na velikost črk). Kakršna koli druga vrednost, vključno z izklopljenimi ali praznimi, ohranja artefakte samo, če test ne uspe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner label *architecture* deploys on."
msgstr "Oznaka tekača *arhitektura* uporablja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner label each architecture deploys on."
msgstr "Zaznamek tekača, ki ga uporablja vsaka arhitektura."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner's `compose` wrapper at [roles/sys-svc-compose/files/python/compose.py](../../../roles/sys-svc-compose/files/python/compose.py) auto-detects compose files when invoked from per-app directories under `/opt/compose/<app>/`:"
msgstr "Tekač. `compose` Ovitek na [roles/sys-svc-compose/files/python/compose.py](../../../roles/sys-svc-compose/files/python/compose.py) Samodejno zazna sestavljanje datotek, ko se sklicuje na mape po aplikaciji `/opt/compose/<app>/`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner's `infinito` service receives:"
msgstr "Tekač. `infinito` storitev prejema:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The safety of this design comes entirely from **confinement of the device**, not from confinement of the agent: the machine is dedicated to Hermes, single-tenant, network-segmented, and physically separate from shared infrastructure. `svc-ai-robot` is the role that provisions that device and deploys Hermes on it in privileged mode. It builds on the [`web-app-hermes`](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) role rather than reimplementing the agent."
msgstr "Varnost tega modela je v celoti posledica **Zadržanje naprave**, ne iz zapora agenta: naprava je namenjena Hermesu, eno-tenenzivna, mrežasta in fizično ločena od skupne infrastrukture. `svc-ai-robot` je vloga, ki določa, da naprava in razporedi Hermes na njej v privilegiranem načinu. Gradi na [`web-app-hermes`](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) vlogo namesto ponovnega izvajanja agenta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same as JSON"
msgstr "Enako kot JSON"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same command as one shell string, so a prefix can compose with it."
msgstr "Isti ukaz kot en svetleči niz, tako da se lahko predpona sestavi z njim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same mapping."
msgstr "Isti zemljevid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same reachability problem exists without Tor wherever the host resolves through a listener of its own on loopback, which is how the simulated cluster nodes are wired. Handing containers the declared clearnet address there was what a literal bridge address in the inventory used to paper over, and that literal went stale the moment the daemon's address pool moved the bridge off Docker's default."
msgstr "Enak problem dosegljivosti obstaja brez Tor, kjer gostitelj reši preko svojega poslušalca na zanko, kar je način ožičenja simuliranih grozdnih vozlišč. Dobesedni naslov mostu v inventarju, ki se je uporabljal za papir, je izginil v trenutku, ko je Demonov naslov premaknil most."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same selections with every axis dropped, one entry per role."
msgstr "Isti izbori z vsako osjo padejo, en vnos na vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same shape serves the repository-root file, which holds the shared collection any role and any inventory bundle may install from, and a role's own file, which holds what only that role installs."
msgstr "Enaka oblika služi datoteki iz skladišča, ki ima skupno zbirko katero koli vlogo in kateri koli paket inventarja lahko namesti iz, in lastno datoteko vloge, ki ima tisto, kar samo ta vloga namesti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same string `.env` carries as ``INFINITO_CACHE_UPSTREAMS``, so the role's bootstrap task and the dev stack provision Nexus from one rendering. `utils.cache.records` owns the format."
msgstr "Isti niz `.env` nosi kot ``INFINITO_CACHE_UPSTREAMS``, tako naloga vloga je škornji past in Dev sklad določba Nexus iz enega upodabljanja. `utils.cache.records` Lastnik formata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`, see [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) bounds every write, every read, and every outbound connection. `deny` rules block destructive patterns unconditionally; `ask` rules force operator review on every mutating `gh`/`docker`/`git commit`/`Skill(update-config*)` invocation. The wildcard does **not** loosen any existing guardrail; it only drops the per-shape workarounds."
msgstr "Peskovnik (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`, Vidiš? [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) Obvezuje vsako pisanje, vsako branje in vsako povezavo. `deny` pravila brezpogojno blokirajo destruktivne vzorce; `ask` pravila od upravljavca zahtevajo pregled vsake mutacije `gh`/`docker`/`git commit`/`Skill(update-config*)` invokacija. Divja karta. **ni** Razrahljajo vse obstoječe varnostne ograje; spustijo se samo dela na obliko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox `denyRead: ~/.gnupg` rule blocks GPG access by design; agent commands must never touch private key material. This env override removes the resulting signing failure without weakening the credential-path protection. Agent-authored commits land unsigned; the `Co-Authored-By` trailer documents authorship."
msgstr "Peskovnik `denyRead: ~/.gnupg` Pravilo blokira dostop GPG po zasnovi; ukazi agenta se ne smejo nikoli dotikati gradiva zasebnega ključa. Ta env razveljavi odstrani nastalo napako pri podpisu brez oslabitve zaščite zaupanja. Pooblaščeni zastopnik se zavezuje, da ne bo podpisal zemljišča; `Co-Authored-By` avtorstvo dokumentov prikolice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox can connect to any Unix-domain socket on the host. Required so commands like `docker`, `systemctl`, and language servers continue to work; these all communicate over Unix sockets (e.g. `/var/run/docker.sock`)."
msgstr "Peskovnik se lahko poveže s katero koli vtičnico Unix domene na gostitelju. Zahtevan ukaz kot `docker`, `systemctl`, in jezikovni strežniki še naprej delujejo; ti vsi komunicirajo preko vtičnic Unix (Npr. `/var/run/docker.sock`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox cannot be escaped through the host daemon"
msgstr "Peskovnik ne more pobegniti skozi demon gostitelja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox has `sandbox.network.allowAllUnixSockets: true` so that normal workflow tools (`docker`, `systemctl`, language servers) continue to work. Any command that reaches `/var/run/docker.sock` can request a container with `-v /:/host --privileged`, which the Docker daemon executes as root and mounts the host filesystem. The sandbox's `allowWrite` does NOT protect against this path because Docker is a trusted service on the other end of the socket."
msgstr "Peskovnik ima `sandbox.network.allowAllUnixSockets: true` tako, da običajna orodja za potek dela (`docker`, `systemctl`, jezikovni strežniki) Nadaljujte z delom. Vsak ukaz, ki doseže `/var/run/docker.sock` lahko zahteva posodo z `-v /:/host --privileged`, ki ga demon Docker izvaja kot root in priklopi gostiteljski datotečni sistem. Peskovnik je. `allowWrite` ne ščiti pred to potjo, ker je Docker zaupanja vredna storitev na drugem koncu vtičnice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The sandbox is activated unconditionally via `\"sandbox\": { \"enabled\": true }`. This means filesystem and network restrictions below are enforced **at every session**, not only when the operator manually switches into sandbox permission mode. The OS-level sandbox is the source of truth for what commands may read, write, and reach over the network; the `allow`/`ask`/`deny` permission lists remain in force as a second line of defence for policy concerns the OS cannot express (e.g. requiring confirmation before publishing a commit)."
msgstr "Peskovnik se brezpogojno aktivira preko `\"sandbox\": { \"enabled\": true }`. To pomeni, da se spodaj izvajajo datotečni sistem in omejitve omrežja **ob vsaki seji**, ne samo, če upravljavec ročno preklopi v način dovoljenja peskovnika. OS-nivo peskovnik je vir resnice za to, kaj ukazi lahko berejo, pišejo in segajo preko omrežja; `allow`/`ask`/`deny` seznami dovoljenj ostanejo v veljavi, ker druga vrsta obrambe za politične zadeve, ki jih OS ne more izraziti (npr. zahteva potrditev pred objavo zaveze)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox's `denyRead` list (`~/.gnupg`, `~/.kube`, `~/.aws`, `~/.config/gcloud`) is the primary mechanism that prevents the agent from reading host credentials. Every credential store an operator uses on the host is assumed to be covered, **with the documented exception of `~/.ssh`** (see Assumption 10)."
msgstr "Peskovnik je. `denyRead` seznam (`~/.gnupg`, `~/.kube`, `~/.aws`, `~/.config/gcloud`) je primarni mehanizem, ki agentu preprečuje branje gostiteljskih poverilnic. Za vsako hrambo, ki jo upravljavec uporablja na gostitelju, se domneva, da je pokrita, **z dokumentirano izjemo `~/.ssh`** (glej predpostavko 10)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scan is cached behind a fresh list, because one source message is scanned once per target language and callers may sort or trim the result."
msgstr "Skeniranje se shrani za novim seznamom, saj se eno izvorno sporočilo skenira enkrat na ciljni jezik in klicatelji lahko razvrstijo ali skrajšajo rezultat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scheduled `🔄 Update versions` pipeline (version bumps and PR open/refresh)."
msgstr "Načrtovano `🔄 Update versions` cevovod (Odprte/sveže različice in PR)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scheduled update workflow MUST be able to reuse the same discovery logic in update mode. Version bumps MAY update `version`; new addon entries MAY be added with `enabled: false`, `required: false`, and complete `update` metadata."
msgstr "Načrtovani potek dela posodobitve MORA biti sposoben ponovno uporabiti isto logiko odkritja v načinu posodobitve. Izbokline različic MAY posodobitev `version`; novi vnosi za addon MAY se dodajo z `enabled: false`, `required: false`, in popolna `update` metapodatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The schema lives at ``meta/networks.yml.overlay`` per provider role, discovered into the service_registry by ``discover_role_services``. Keys:"
msgstr "Shema živi na ``meta/networks.yml.overlay`` po vlogi ponudnika, odkrit v service_registry z ``discover_role_services``. Ključi:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The schema rejects a generic URL, a runtime OpenAPI document, free-form GraphQL, a raw SQL tool, an unrestricted bucket, an arbitrary filesystem root, a shell command, a Docker socket, and implicit exposure of every operation an upstream upgrade adds."
msgstr "Shema zavrača generičen URL, dokument za OpenAPI, prosto obliko GraphQL, surovo orodje SQL, neomejeno vedro, poljubni koren datotečnega sistema, ukaz za lupino, vtičnico za Docker in implicitno izpostavljenost vsake operacije nadgradnja doda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope MUST be a **default** client scope on every OIDC client that needs group-based RBAC. Making it optional reintroduces a userinfo regression: when optional with `include.in.token.scope=false`, Keycloak drops the group-membership mapper from userinfo even when the scope is explicitly requested, so consumers receive no groups and fall back to `subscriber`."
msgstr "Področje uporabe mora biti **privzeto** obseg odjemalca za vsakega odjemalca OIDC, ki potrebuje RBAC na podlagi skupine. Če je možnost neobvezna, ponovno uvede regresijo uporabniškegainfo: kadar je možnost neobvezna z `include.in.token.scope=false`, Keycloak spusti zemljevid skupine-članov iz uporabniškeinfo tudi, ko je področje uporabe izrecno zahtevano, tako da potrošniki ne sprejemajo skupin in se vračajo na `subscriber`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is image handling. Workflow orchestration, metadata resolution, and generic waiting logic should live in other script directories."
msgstr "Obseg te mape je ravnanje s slikami. Orkestriranje delovnega toka, ločljivost metapodatkov in splošna logika čakanja bi morali živeti v drugih imenikih scenarijev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is installation and bootstrap. Lint execution, build workflows, and test orchestration should stay in their dedicated script directories."
msgstr "Obseg te mape je namestitev in škornjitrap. Izvedba Linta, izdelava delovnih tokov in testna orkestracija bi morali ostati v njihovih namenskih skriptnih imenikih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is lint execution. Tool installation belongs in `scripts/install`, while build and test workflows should stay in their dedicated script directories."
msgstr "Obseg te mape je izvajanje lit. Instalacija orodja spada v `scripts/install`, medtem ko graditi in testne delovne tokove ostanejo v svojih namenskih skriptnih imenikih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is missing-state resolution. Image build, release, and workflow orchestration should stay in their dedicated script or workflow locations."
msgstr "Obseg te mape je ločljivost manjkajoče države. Gradnja slik, sprostitev in orkestracija poteka dela bi morali ostati v njihovih namenskih skriptah ali lokacijah poteka dela."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is script organization at the repository level. Detailed responsibilities belong in the README files of the respective subdirectories."
msgstr "Obseg te mape je skriptna organizacija na ravni skladišča. Podrobne odgovornosti spadajo v datoteke README zadevnih podimenikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is value resolution. Build, release, and wait-oriented behavior should stay in their dedicated script directories."
msgstr "Obseg te mape je ločljivost vrednosti. Graditi, sprostiti, in wait-usmerjeno vedenje naj ostanejo v svojih namenskih skriptnih imenikih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is waiting and availability checks. Build, release, and resource-specific lifecycle operations should stay in their dedicated directories."
msgstr "Obseg te mape je čakanje in preverjanje razpoložljivosti. Graditi, sprostiti in za vire specifične življenjske dobe morajo ostati v svojih namenskih imenikih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script **prefers `/mnt`** when it is a separate partition (classic `ubuntu-latest` layout with `/dev/sdb` mounted at `/mnt`) and falls back to `/` otherwise. Current public runners no longer expose a separate `/mnt`, so the swapfile lands on `/` and must not starve the root filesystem."
msgstr "Scenarij **ima raje `/mnt`** kadar gre za ločeno razdelitev (klasična `ubuntu-latest` postavitev z `/dev/sdb` nameščen na `/mnt`) in pade nazaj v `/` sicer. Trenutni javni tekači ne izpostavljajo več ločenega `/mnt`, tako da swapfile pristane na `/` in ne sme stradati korenskega datotečnega sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential generation of the live material), then mirrors each present subtree back to its fixed system path (`rsync -a --delete`): `secrets` into `/var/lib/infinito/secrets`, `ca` into `/etc/<domain>/ca`, `acme` into `/etc/letsencrypt`, `certbot` into `/etc/certbot`. `--no-safety-backup` skips the pre-recover unit run. The `node` subtree (ssh host keys + machine-id) is restored only with `--restore-node-identity`, because overwriting the running machine-id / ssh host keys changes the host's identity mid-flight — do it on a fresh host after total loss."
msgstr "Scenarij se začne z rezervno enoto. (sveža diferencialna generacija živega materiala), nato zrcali vsako dano poddrevo nazaj na svojo fiksno sistemsko pot (`rsync -a --delete`): `secrets` v `/var/lib/infinito/secrets`, `ca` v `/etc/<domain>/ca`, `acme` v `/etc/letsencrypt`, `certbot` v `/etc/certbot`. `--no-safety-backup` Preskoči predobnovitev enote. – `node` poddrevo (tipke gostitelja ssh + stroj-id) je obnovljena samo z `--restore-node-identity`, ker prepisovanje tekoči stroj-id / ssh gostitelj ključi spremeni identiteto gostitelja sredi leta – to storite na svežem gostitelju po popolni izgubi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential generation of the live material), then mirrors each present subtree back to its fixed system path (``rsync -a --delete``): ``secrets`` into ``/var/lib/infinito/secrets``, ``ca`` into ``/etc/<domain>/ca``, ``acme`` into ``/etc/letsencrypt``, ``certbot`` into ``/etc/certbot``. ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the pre-recover unit run. The ``node`` subtree (ssh host keys + machine-id) is restored only with ``--restore-node-identity``, because overwriting the running machine-id / ssh host keys changes the host’s identity mid-flight — do it on a fresh host after total loss."
msgstr "Scenarij najprej začne vlogo je razporejeni backup enoto (sveža diferencialna generacija živega materiala), nato zrcali vsako dano poddrevo nazaj na svojo fiksno sistemsko pot (``rsync -a --delete``): ``secrets`` v ``/var/lib/infinito/secrets``, ``ca`` v ``/etc/<domain>/ca``, ``acme`` v ``/etc/letsencrypt``, ``certbot`` v ``/etc/certbot``. ``--no-safety-backup`` Preskoči predobnovitev enote. – ``node`` poddrevo (tipke gostitelja ssh + stroj-id) je obnovljena samo z ``--restore-node-identity``, ker prepisovanje tekoči stroj-id / ssh gostitelj ključi spremeni identiteto gostitelja sredi leta – to storite na svežem gostitelju po popolni izgubi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script must stay free of every shell ``$``: the compose and swarm render paths launder dollars differently (a ``$pid`` reached the container as ``\"\"`` and crash-looped the sidecar on a sh syntax error). The bucket bootstrap therefore polls ``/status`` from a backgrounded subshell while ``exec`` makes the server PID 1; the poll loop dies with the container and readiness is gated by the consumer's bounded wait."
msgstr "Scenarij mora ostati brez vsake lupine ``$``: sestav in roj naredi poti pranje dolarjev drugače (a ``$pid`` doseže vsebnik kot ``\"\"`` in crash-pooped stransko prikolico na sh sintakso napako). Vedra škornji Trap zato ankete ``/status`` iz ozadja subshell, medtem ko ``exec`` naredi strežnik PID 1; anketna zanka umre z zabojnikom in pripravljenost je zaprta zaradi omejenega čakanja potrošnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script opens the LUKS device (interactive passphrase prompt; `--passphrase-stdin` for automation), mounts it, picks the newest device snapshot across every machine hash (a fresh host after total loss has a new machine id), mirrors it into the target (`rsync -a --delete`) and unmounts/closes the device again. No pre-recover service backup runs: the device itself is the backup this role maintains. Afterwards restore individual applications from the backup root with the matching role's `recover.py` (`svc-bkp-volume-2-local` for docker volumes, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local` for NFS exports)."
msgstr "Scenarij odpre napravo LUKS (interaktivna šifrirna fraza; `--passphrase-stdin` za avtomatizacijo), ga priklopi, izbere najnovejšo napravo posnetek čez vsak stroj hašiš (svež gostitelj po popolni izgubi ima nov stroj ID)Zrcali so ga v tarčo. (`rsync -a --delete`) in napravo ponovno odklopi/zapre. Ni pre-recover storitev backup teče: naprava sama je backup ta vloga ohranja. Nato obnovi posamezne programe iz korena varnostne kopije z ustrezno vlogo `recover.py` (`svc-bkp-volume-2-local` za pikčaste volumne, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local` za izvoz NFS)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script opens the LUKS device (interactive passphrase prompt; ``--passphrase-stdin`` for automation), mounts it, picks the newest device snapshot across every machine hash (a fresh host after total loss has a new machine id), mirrors it into the target (``rsync -a --delete``) and unmounts/closes the device again. No pre-recover service backup runs: the device itself is the backup this role maintains. Afterwards restore individual applications from the backup root with the matching role’s ``recover.py`` (``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` for docker volumes, ``svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`` for NFS exports)."
msgstr "Scenarij odpre napravo LUKS (interaktivna šifrirna fraza; ``--passphrase-stdin`` za avtomatizacijo), ga priklopi, izbere najnovejšo napravo posnetek čez vsak stroj hašiš (svež gostitelj po popolni izgubi ima nov stroj ID)Zrcali so ga v tarčo. (``rsync -a --delete``) in napravo ponovno odklopi/zapre. Ni pre-recover storitev backup teče: naprava sama je backup ta vloga ohranja. Nato ponovno vzpostavi posamezne aplikacije iz korena varnostne kopije z vlogo ujemanja ``recover.py`` (``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` za pikčaste volumne, ``svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`` za izvoz NFS)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script type/extension (e.g., sh, py, yml)."
msgstr "Vrsta skripta/razširitev (Npr., sh, py, yml)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script-level references for `scripts/tests/deploy/act/` live in [scripts/tests/deploy/act/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/act/README.md). For broader test and validation guidance, see [Testing and Validation](../actions/testing.md)."
msgstr "Reference na ravni skripta za `scripts/tests/deploy/act/` živi v [scripts/tests/deploy/act/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/act/README.md). Za širše smernice za preskušanje in potrjevanje glej [Preskušanje in potrjevanje](../actions/testing.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The section titles are the classification vocabulary itself, and each role that ships a `meta/mcp.yml` is filed under the value that file declares. The authoritative disposition of a deployed surface is that file; this list is the record of the review, including the roles that deliberately carry no surface."
msgstr "Naslovi odseka so klasifikacijski besednjak sam, in vsaka vloga, da ladje a `meta/mcp.yml` je vložena pod vrednostjo, ki jo navaja datoteka. Avtoritativna razporeditev uporabljene površine je ta datoteka; ta seznam je zapis pregleda, vključno z vlogami, ki namerno ne nosijo površine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The security policies enforced on this repository are documented here:"
msgstr "Varnostne politike, ki se izvajajo v tem skladišču, so dokumentirane tukaj:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The selected deploy modes this row can actually run in. Never empty for a row the query returned -- the filter kept it precisely because at least one selected mode claims it."
msgstr "Izbrani načini uporabe, v katerih lahko ta vrstica dejansko deluje. Nikoli prazna za vrstico poizvedba vrnil -- filter jo je ohranil ravno zato, ker vsaj en izbran način trdi, da je."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The selection and retry logic is implemented in   `scripts/install/ansible.sh`."
msgstr "Izbor in ponovna uporaba logike se izvaja v `scripts/install/ansible.sh`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The selection tokens that reproduce exactly what did not pass."
msgstr "Izbirni žetoni, ki razmnožujejo točno tisto, kar ni minilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The selections of the last finished deploy run on the branch that are not green. `cli.administration.deploy.ci.selections.failed_selections` reads them straight out of the job titles, so each candidate arrives with the variant, mode and onion state it failed in."
msgstr "Izbire zadnjih končanih napoti na veje, ki niso zelene. `cli.administration.deploy.ci.selections.failed_selections` jih prebere naravnost iz nazivov delovnih mest, tako da vsak kandidat prispe z varianto, način in čebula stanje ni uspelo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sequenced flow lives in [`routine/`](routine/), the naming SPOT in `utils/topology/`, shared helpers in `utils/`, and the cluster declaration (image, containers, network, DNS play) in `compose/swarm/` + `compose/swarm/compose.yml`."
msgstr "Sekvenčni tok živi v [`routine/`](routine/), ime SPOT v `utils/topology/`, skupni pomočniki v `utils/`, in deklaracija grozda (slika, zabojniki, omrežje, predvajanje DNS) v `compose/swarm/` + `compose/swarm/compose.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The server answers with its input, lightly reworded, often enough that the result keeps every span and every markup character while still being English. Comparing scripts catches it wherever the target does not use the Latin one; for a Latin-script target it would need a language detector."
msgstr "Strežnik odgovarja s svojim vložkom, rahlo preoblikovan, pogosto dovolj, da rezultat ohranja vsak razpon in vsak označevalni znak, medtem ko je še vedno angleški. Primerjalne skripte ujamejo povsod, kjer tarča ne uporablja latinsko; za cilja z latinico bi potreboval detektor jezika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The server needs an active browser tab and plugin connection, and can execute powerful design-context operations."
msgstr "Strežnik potrebuje aktivni zavihek brskalnika in povezavo vstavkov, in lahko izvede močne design-kontekst operacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The server starts with a token from the deployment's credential store, binds to the container network and publishes no port. Cross-site request checking is off and any origin is accepted, because the caller is a service on the same network that presents the token rather than a browser carrying a cookie."
msgstr "Strežnik se začne z žetonom iz prodajalne, se veže na omrežje zabojnikov in ne objavi vrat. Navzkrižno preverjanje zahteve je izključeno in vsak izvor je sprejet, ker je klicatelj storitev na istem omrežju, ki predstavlja žeton in ne brskalnik, ki nosi piškotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The server starts with a token from the deployment’s credential store, binds to the container network and publishes no port. Cross-site request checking is off and any origin is accepted, because the caller is a service on the same network that presents the token rather than a browser carrying a cookie."
msgstr "Strežnik se začne z žetonom iz uvajalne hrambe, se veže na kontejnersko omrežje in ne objavi vrat. Navzkrižno preverjanje zahteve je izključeno in vsak izvor je sprejet, ker je klicatelj storitev na istem omrežju, ki predstavlja žeton in ne brskalnik, ki nosi piškotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The server's own thread count follows the CPUs its container may use, which a deploy decides; only the client side is free to vary per run. This sweeps it against real catalog entries and records the winner for the env builder, so a tuned host keeps its numbers across every `make dotenv`."
msgstr "Lastno število niti strežnika sledi CPU, ki ga lahko uporablja njegov zabojnik, ki ga razpored odloči; samo stran odjemalca se lahko prosto spreminja glede na vožnjo. To ga pomete proti pravih katalog vnosov in beleži zmagovalca za env graditelja, tako da uglašen gostitelj ohranja svoje številke čez vsako `make dotenv`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The service registry (service key -> provider role) stays built from the full rendered base set so provider discovery is unaffected by the active variants; only the dep-walk sees the variant configs (with the swarm force-shared DB view applied on top)."
msgstr "Register storitev (Servisni ključ -> vloga ponudnika) ostane zgrajeno iz celotne preslikane baze, tako da je odkritje ponudnika ne vpliva aktivne variante; samo Dep-walk vidi variantne konfigs (pri čemer je na vrhu nameščen pogled DB, deljen s silo roja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The service runs as a lightweight Node.js app backed by PostgreSQL."
msgstr "Storitev deluje kot lahka Node.js aplikacija s podporo PostgreSQL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The settings file additionally sets `\"sandbox\": { \"failIfUnavailable\": true }`. This prevents a dangerous false-security state: if the OS-level sandbox backend (e.g. `bwrap` on Linux, `sandbox-exec` on macOS) is missing or non-functional, Claude Code would otherwise silently fall back to no sandboxing while `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` continues to auto-approve commands as if they were confined. With `failIfUnavailable: true`, Claude Code refuses to proceed in that situation, forcing the operator to install the missing backend or explicitly downgrade the policy before any command runs. Contributors on systems without a working sandbox backend MUST install the appropriate binary rather than weakening this flag locally."
msgstr "Datoteka z nastavitvami se dodatno nastavi `\"sandbox\": { \"failIfUnavailable\": true }`. To preprečuje nevarno stanje lažne varnosti: če OS-nivo peskovnik backend (Npr. `bwrap` na Linuxu, `sandbox-exec` o macOS) manjka ali ni funkcionalen, Claude Code bi sicer tiho padla nazaj v brez peskovnika, medtem ko `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` nadaljuje s samodejnim odobravanjem ukazov, kot da so omejeni. Z `failIfUnavailable: true`, Claude Code zavrne nadaljevanje tega položaja, pri čemer operatorja prisili, da namesti manjkajočo hrbtenico ali izrecno zniža politiko pred vsakim vodenjem ukaza. Prispevalci na sisteme brez delovne backend peskovnika MORAJO namestiti ustrezno binarno, namesto da bi oslabili to zastavo lokalno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The setup tasks handle the full first-deploy bootstrap automatically:"
msgstr "Nastavitev opravil samodejno ročaj polno prvo aktiviranje škornjitrap:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shape each key must have is declared per role rather than here, in [roles/svc-ai-litellm/meta/secrets.yml](../../../../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/meta/secrets.yml) with a `type:` and a `regex:`. The pattern rejects a truncated or whitespace-carrying paste and deliberately accepts any vendor prefix, so a provider changing its issuance format cannot turn a valid key into a failed inventory run."
msgstr "Oblika vsakega ključa mora biti deklarirana po vlogi in ne tukaj, [roles/svc-ai-litellm/meta/secrets.yml](../../../../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/meta/secrets.yml) z a `type:` in a `regex:`. Vzorec zavrne okrnjeno ali whitespace-prenašalna pasta in namerno sprejme vsako predpono prodajalca, tako da ponudnik, ki spreminja svojo obliko izdaje ne more spremeniti veljavnega ključa v neuspešen inventar teči."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shape every consumer renders from: the ansible lookups, which then apply the inventory, and the dev stack, which does not."
msgstr "Oblika, iz katere izhaja vsak potrošnik: ansible lookups, ki nato uporablja inventar, in dev kup, ki ne."

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span lost=['apply_schema']
# gained=['apply_schemagenerirane']
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Oblika zrcali steblo sheme: ugnezdeni ključi ostanejo
# gnezdeni. Dobesedna struna je ohranjena dobesedno, brez prevajanja in
# potrjevanja. Listi BREZ ``default:`` so namerno odsotni, zato je inventar
# apply_schemagenerirane vrednote zmagajo v združitvi.
msgid "The shape mirrors the schema tree: nested keys stay nested. The literal string is preserved verbatim, with no rendering and no validation. Leaves WITHOUT ``default:`` are intentionally absent so the inventory's apply_schema-generated values win the merge."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona helpers are declared blocked in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. Nextcloud presents three different login surfaces depending on the variant (native, ``oidc_login``, ``sociallogin``), the native administrator authenticates with the role-local ``credentials.administrator_password`` rather than the Keycloak secret, and the ``#firstrunwizard`` modal intercepts the user-menu click the generic logout depends on. Both personas are therefore driven by the role’s own login specs — ``test-login-admin-native.js``, ``test-login-admin-oidc.js``, ``test-login-biber-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-biber-ldap.js`` under ``files/playwright/`` — which carry the flavor switch, the modal dismissal and the login retry the shared helper lacks."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. Nextcloud predstavlja tri različne prijavne površine glede na varianto (domači, ``oidc_login``, ``sociallogin``), domači administrator potrjuje z vlogo-lokalno ``credentials.administrator_password`` in ne Keycloak skrivnost, in ``#firstrunwizard`` Način prestreza uporabnik-menu kliknite generični odjava je odvisna. Zato obe osebi temeljita na lastnih podatkih o vlogi – ``test-login-admin-native.js``, ``test-login-admin-oidc.js``, ``test-login-biber-oidc.js`` ter ``test-login-biber-ldap.js`` pod ``files/playwright/`` – ki nosijo stikalo za okus, modalno odpoved in prijavo ponovno preizkusijo skupne pomočnika pomanjkanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona helpers are declared blocked in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. Odoo renders its SSO provider link only on ``/web/login`` inside the ``.o_login_auth`` container, not on the site root the persona helper starts from, and it exposes no in-app logout control — signing out means navigating to ``/web/session/logout``. The full Keycloak round trip for both users is covered by the role’s own ``odoo: admin sso login, verify ui, logout`` and ``odoo: biber sso login, verify ui, logout`` scenarios in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js <./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. Odoo svojo povezavo SSO ponudnik le na ``/web/login`` znotraj ``.o_login_auth`` zabojnik, ne na korenini mesta, oseba pomočnik začne od, in izpostavlja ni v aplikaciji odjava nadzor – odjava pomeni navigacija ``/web/session/logout``. Polno. Keycloak povratno potovanje za oba uporabnika je zajeto v vlogi ``odoo: admin sso login, verify ui, logout`` ter ``odoo: biber sso login, verify ui, logout`` scenariji v `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js <./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona helpers are declared blocked in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. OpenCloud Web answers Playwright’s headless Chromium user agent with a “browser not supported” splash unless ``forceAllowOldBrowser`` is seeded into ``localStorage`` before the first navigation, and its OIDC callback runs through OpenCloud’s own ``/oidc-callback`` → ``/web-oidc-callback`` routes instead of the oauth2-proxy pattern the shared helper detects. Both personas’ Keycloak round trip is covered by `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js <./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js>`__, which does that priming in `files/playwright/\\_shared.js <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. OpenCloud Spletni odgovori Playwright je brez glave Chromium uporabniški agent z “browser ni podprt” splash, razen če ``forceAllowOldBrowser`` se sejejo v ``localStorage`` pred prvo navigacijo, in njegov OIDC klic nazaj teče skozi OpenCloudlastne ``/oidc-callback`` → ``/web-oidc-callback`` poti namesto oauth2-Proxy vzorec skupni pomočnik zazna. Obe osebi“ Keycloak okroglo potovanje je zajeto z `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js <./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js>`__, ki ga to vodi v `files/playwright/\\_shared.js <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona helpers are declared blocked in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. Pixelfed’s login id is the account e-mail rather than the Keycloak username, and the artisan-bootstrapped administrator name is reserved, so pixelfed’s first-time OIDC registration cannot mint it either. ``biber`` additionally needs his Keycloak e-mail rewritten to a resolvable domain through the Keycloak admin API before the first OIDC login, because pixelfed’s ``dns,spoof`` validator rejects ``.example`` addresses. Both setups live in `files/playwright/\\_shared.js <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__ and drive the dedicated login specs in ``files/playwright/``."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. Pixelfedov prijavni ID je račun e-pošta namesto Keycloak uporabniško ime in ime upravitelja, ki je pod nadzorom obrtnika, je rezervirano, zato ga tudi registracija podjetja Pxelfed, ki je prvič registriralo OIDC, ne more spremeniti. ``biber`` dodatno potrebuje svojo Keycloak e-pošta, napisana na rešljivo domeno prek Keycloak admin API pred prvo prijavo OIDC, ker pixelfed je ``dns,spoof`` validator zavrne ``.example`` naslove. Obe ustanovi živita `files/playwright/\\_shared.js <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__ in pogon namenskih prijavnih specifikacij v ``files/playwright/``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona helpers are declared blocked in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. The OpenTalk frontend is a public-client OIDC single-page app — the container env carries nothing but the issuer and the client id, there is no server-side session and no HTML login form — so the role drives it with its own redirect-racing helper keyed on ``LOGIN_*`` / ``BIBER_*`` instead of the ``ADMIN_*`` pair the shared helper expects, and the browser-side session leaves the contract’s in-app logout leg without a target. Both personas’ Keycloak → dashboard chain is covered by `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js <./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js>`__."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. O OpenTalk frontend je javno-odjemalec OIDC enostransko aplikacijo – kontejner env nosi nič drugega kot izdajatelj in odjemalec ID, ni seje na strani strežnika in ni HTML prijavni obrazec – tako da vlogo poganja z lastno preusmeritve-rasing pomočnika keyed on ``LOGIN_*`` / ``BIBER_*`` namesto ``ADMIN_*`` par skupni pomočnik pričakuje, in brskalnik stran seje zapusti pogodbo in-app odjaviti nogo brez cilja. Obe osebi“ Keycloak → armaturna veriga je prekrita z `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js <./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona helpers are declared blocked in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. The role provisions no pretix account at all — `tasks/main.yml <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only deploys the stack — while pretix’s native auth backend authenticates a pretix ``User`` row that is created by the interactive first-run setup. The ``pretix-oidc`` backend added on top lives on pretix’s ``/control`` login page, whereas the role’s base URL serves the public ticket shop that the baseline scenarios in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js <./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__ assert. Seeding a backend user is the path back to a runnable persona journey."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. Vloga določbe ni pretix račun sploh – `tasks/main.yml <./tasks/main.yml>`__ Samo razporedi kup – medtem ko pretix je izvorna Auth backend overovi pretix ``User`` vrstica, ki je ustvarjena z interaktivno nastavitvijo v prvem teku. – ``pretix-oidc`` hrbtenica dodana na top življenja na pretix je ``/control`` Prijavna stran, medtem ko osnovni URL vloge služi javni trgovini vstopnic, da izhodiščni scenariji v `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js <./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__ trdi. Iskanje uporabnika hrbtenice je pot nazaj do utečene osebe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona journeys are opted out via ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. As soon as an IAM source is wired, the role sets ``GITEA__service__DISABLE_REGISTRATION`` (``templates/env.j2``, driven by ``GITEA_IAM_ENABLED`` in ``vars/main.yml``), and ``tasks/setup/oidc.yml`` registers only the auth source — never a Gitea user — so a Keycloak identity without a pre-linked Gitea account is bounced back to ``/user/login``. The opt-out lapses once the deploy provisions (or auto-links) Gitea accounts for the persona identities."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona potovanja so izbrana preko ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Takoj ko je vir IAM ozvočen, se vloga postavi ``GITEA__service__DISABLE_REGISTRATION`` (``templates/env.j2``, ki ga poganja ``GITEA_IAM_ENABLED`` v ``vars/main.yml``), in ``tasks/setup/oidc.yml`` Registrira samo izvor duše – nikoli Gitea uporabnik – tako Keycloak identiteti brez predhodno povezanega Gitea račun se odbije nazaj na ``/user/login``. Izvzetje preneha po uporabi določb (ali avtopovezave) Gitea Zasebne identitete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona journeys are opted out via ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Fider’s SSO entry is a two-step modal: the header “Sign in” button only opens the provider dialog, and a second click on “Continue with … SSO” performs the Keycloak redirect, whereas the shared helper clicks exactly once and never reaches the IdP. Both journeys are covered end-to-end by this role’s own ``fider: admin sso login`` and ``fider: biber sso login as regular user`` scenarios in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``; the opt-out lapses once the shared helper learns Fider’s modal."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona potovanja so izbrana preko ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Fider je SSO vnos je dvostopenjski modal: glava “Vpišite” gumb samo odpre pogovorno okno ponudnika, in drugi klik na “Nadaljujte z ... SSO” izvaja Keycloak preusmeri, medtem ko skupni pomočnik klikne točno enkrat in nikoli ne doseže IDP. Obe poti sta zajeti od konca do konca s to vlogo ``fider: admin sso login`` ter ``fider: biber sso login as regular user`` scenariji v ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``; izvzetje preneha, ko se skupni pomočnik nauči FiderNačin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona journeys are opted out via ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Flowise has no in-app OIDC adapter: SSO is an oauth2-proxy sidecar (``services.sso.flavor: oauth2``), and behind that gate Flowise still presents its own sign-in form for the single instance account seeded from ``FLOWISE_USERNAME`` / ``FLOWISE_PASSWORD`` in ``templates/env.j2``. ``biber`` has no Flowise identity at all, and the shared helpers only drive Keycloak forms while ``services.sso`` is enabled, so neither persona can reach an authenticated Flowise surface; the OIDC gate itself is covered by ``files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js``."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona potovanja so izbrana preko ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Flowise nima in-app OIDC adapter: SSO je oauth2-proxy sidecar (``services.sso.flavor: oauth2``), in za temi vrati. Flowise še vedno predstavlja lasten obrazec za vpis na enotni primerek računa, ki izhaja iz ``FLOWISE_USERNAME`` / ``FLOWISE_PASSWORD`` v ``templates/env.j2``. ``biber`` nima Flowise identiteta sploh, in skupni pomočniki samo voziti Keycloak oblike, medtem ko ``services.sso`` je omogočena, zato nobena oseba ne more doseči avtenticirane Flowise površina; sama OIDC vrata so prekrita z ``files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona journeys are opted out via ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Joomla’s site template ships no login/logout module, and ``plg_system_keycloak`` exposes sign-out only as the route ``index.php?option=keycloak&task=logout`` (``files/joomla-oidc-plugin/plg_system_keycloak/src/Extension/Keycloak.php``, ``handleLogout``) rather than as a rendered control, so the persona’s mandatory in-app logout click has no target and navigating a logout URL directly is forbidden by the contract. The OIDC handshake itself, the LDAP variant and the ``/administrator?fallback=local`` hatch are covered by ``files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js``, ``test-ldap-login.js`` and ``test-oidc-fallback.js``."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona potovanja so izbrana preko ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Joomlina predloga strani ladje ni prijavo / odjava modul, in ``plg_system_keycloak`` izpostavi podpis le kot pot ``index.php?option=keycloak&task=logout`` (``files/joomla-oidc-plugin/plg_system_keycloak/src/Extension/Keycloak.php``, ``handleLogout``) Namesto da bi se opravil nadzor, zato pogodba prepoveduje obvezno odjavo osebe v aplikaciji. OIDC rokovanje, LDAP varianta in ``/administrator?fallback=local`` lopute so prekrite z ``files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js``, ``test-ldap-login.js`` ter ``test-oidc-fallback.js``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona journeys are opted out via ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Outside the OIDC variant, ``templates/casc.yaml.j2`` selects the ``ldap`` or ``local`` security realm and Jenkins’ only login surface is its own Java-realm form, whose fields are named ``j_username`` / ``j_password`` (pinned by the LDAP scenario in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``) — names the shared native-login probe does not match, so the persona never authenticates. The flag is currently unconditional; narrowing it to ``{% if not JENKINS_OIDC_ENABLED %}`` once the OIDC persona journey has been verified end-to-end is the path back."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona potovanja so izbrana preko ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Zunaj OIDC variante, ``templates/casc.yaml.j2`` izbere ``ldap`` ali ``local`` področje varnosti in JenkinsEdina prijavljena površina je njena Java-realna oblika, katere polja so poimenovana ``j_username`` / ``j_password`` (podprto s scenarijem LDAP v ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``) – poimenuje sondo native-login ne ujema, zato oseba nikoli ne potrdi. Zastava je trenutno brezpogojna; zožitev na ``{% if not JENKINS_OIDC_ENABLED %}`` ko je potovanje OIDC persona preverjeno od konca do konca, je pot nazaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona journeys are opted out via ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. The oauth2-proxy sidecar only gates the vhost — FusionDirectory keeps its own LDAP-bind login behind it, which the role’s OIDC scenario in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`` asserts by expecting a “Sign in” button to still be visible after the Keycloak round-trip. ``tasks/main.yml`` provisions no FusionDirectory account, so the Keycloak identity maps to no directory session the shared helpers could carry through to an in-app logout."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona potovanja so izbrana preko ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Oauth.2-Posebna prikolica samo vrata vhost - FusionDirectory ohranja svojo lastno prijavo LDAP-bind za njo, ki je OIDC scenarij v ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`` trdi, da pričakuje, da bo gumb “Vpišite” še vedno viden po Keycloak Povratna vožnja. ``tasks/main.yml`` določbe FusionDirectory račun, tako da Keycloak identifikacijske zemljevide za nobeno sejo map, ki bi jo skupni pomočniki lahko prenesli do odjave v aplikaciji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` and ``administrator`` persona journeys are opted out via ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. web-app-hugo serves a statically built site: ``services.sso`` is hard-disabled in ``meta/services.yml``, the container is a Hugo build baked into nginx (``templates/compose.yml.j2``), and the Playwright env file renders no ``ADMIN_*`` / ``BIBER_*`` credentials. There is no session, no admin surface and no logout control to drive, so the ``guest`` persona plus the reachability, CSP and rendered-HTML assertions are the complete contract for this role."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` ter ``administrator`` persona potovanja so izbrana preko ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` / ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. web-app-hugo služi statično zgrajenem mestu: ``services.sso`` je težko onemogočen v ``meta/services.yml``, posoda je Hugo grajenje pečeno v ginx (``templates/compose.yml.j2``), in datoteka Playwright env izpiše ne ``ADMIN_*`` / ``BIBER_*`` poverilnice. Ni seje, admin površina in ni odjave za vožnjo, tako da ``guest`` Persona ter izjave o dosegljivosti, CSP in izdani-HTML so popolna pogodba za to vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared ``biber`` persona journey is opted out via ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. A Jellyfin account binds to exactly one authentication provider, so biber’s login is owned by the per-addon specs that know which provider is live: ``files/playwright/addons/sso-authentication.spec.js`` for OIDC and ``addons/ldap-authentication.spec.js`` for the LDAP-only matrix variant. The generic persona cannot pick between them and would duplicate or contradict that coverage; ``playwright.spec.js`` keeps the ``guest`` scenario and the native administrator login."
msgstr "Skupna ``biber`` oseba potovanje je izključeno preko ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. A Jellyfin račun je vezan na točno enega ponudnika avtentikacije, zato je Biberjeva prijava v lasti specifikacij per-addon, ki vedo, kateri ponudnik je v živo: ``files/playwright/addons/sso-authentication.spec.js`` za OIDC in ``addons/ldap-authentication.spec.js`` za varianto z matriko LDAP. generična oseba ne more izbirati med njima in bi to pokritost podvajala ali nasprotovala; ``playwright.spec.js`` obdrži ``guest`` Scenarij in prijava skrbnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Nextcloud presents three different login surfaces depending on the variant (native, `oidc_login`, `sociallogin`), the native administrator authenticates with the role-local `credentials.administrator_password` rather than the Keycloak secret, and the `#firstrunwizard` modal intercepts the user-menu click the generic logout depends on. Both personas are therefore driven by the role's own login specs — `test-login-admin-native.js`, `test-login-admin-oidc.js`, `test-login-biber-oidc.js` and `test-login-biber-ldap.js` under `files/playwright/` — which carry the flavor switch, the modal dismissal and the login retry the shared helper lacks."
msgstr "Skupna `biber` ter `administrator` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Nextcloud predstavlja tri različne prijavne površine glede na varianto (domači, `oidc_login`, `sociallogin`), domači administrator potrjuje z vlogo-lokalno `credentials.administrator_password` in ne Keycloak skrivnost, in `#firstrunwizard` Način prestreza uporabnik-menu kliknite generični odjava je odvisna. Obe osebi sta torej odvisni od lastnih prijavnih specifikacij – `test-login-admin-native.js`, `test-login-admin-oidc.js`, `test-login-biber-oidc.js` ter `test-login-biber-ldap.js` pod `files/playwright/` – ki nosijo stikalo za okus, modalno odpoved in prijavo ponovno preizkusijo skupne pomočnika pomanjkanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Odoo renders its SSO provider link only on `/web/login` inside the `.o_login_auth` container, not on the site root the persona helper starts from, and it exposes no in-app logout control — signing out means navigating to `/web/session/logout`. The full Keycloak round trip for both users is covered by the role's own `odoo: admin sso login, verify ui, logout` and `odoo: biber sso login, verify ui, logout` scenarios in [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js)."
msgstr "Skupna `biber` ter `administrator` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Odoo svojo povezavo SSO ponudnik le na `/web/login` znotraj `.o_login_auth` zabojnik, ne na korenini mesta, oseba pomočnik začne od, in izpostavlja ni v aplikaciji odjava nadzor – odjava pomeni navigacija `/web/session/logout`. Polno. Keycloak povratno potovanje za oba uporabnika je zajeto v vlogi `odoo: admin sso login, verify ui, logout` ter `odoo: biber sso login, verify ui, logout` scenariji v [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). OpenCloud Web answers Playwright's headless Chromium user agent with a \"browser not supported\" splash unless `forceAllowOldBrowser` is seeded into `localStorage` before the first navigation, and its OIDC callback runs through OpenCloud's own `/oidc-callback` → `/web-oidc-callback` routes instead of the oauth2-proxy pattern the shared helper detects. Both personas' Keycloak round trip is covered by [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js), which does that priming in [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js)."
msgstr "Skupna `biber` ter `administrator` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). OpenCloud Spletni odgovori Playwright je brez glave Chromium uporabniški zastopnik z \"brskalnik ni podprt\" pljusk, razen če `forceAllowOldBrowser` se sejejo v `localStorage` pred prvo navigacijo, in njegov OIDC klic nazaj teče skozi OpenCloudLastna. `/oidc-callback` → `/web-oidc-callback` poti namesto oauth2-Proxy vzorec skupni pomočnik zazna. Obe osebi. Keycloak okroglo potovanje je zajeto z [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js), ki ga to vodi v [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Pixelfed's login id is the account e-mail rather than the Keycloak username, and the artisan-bootstrapped administrator name is reserved, so pixelfed's first-time OIDC registration cannot mint it either. `biber` additionally needs his Keycloak e-mail rewritten to a resolvable domain through the Keycloak admin API before the first OIDC login, because pixelfed's `dns,spoof` validator rejects `.example` addresses. Both setups live in [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js) and drive the dedicated login specs in `files/playwright/`."
msgstr "Skupna `biber` ter `administrator` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Pixelfed je prijavni ID je račun e-mail in ne Keycloak uporabniško ime in ime upravitelja, ki ga je zagnal obrtnik, je rezervirano, zato ga tudi registracija OIDC s pixelfed-om prvič ne more spremeniti. `biber` dodatno potrebuje svojo Keycloak e-pošta, napisana na rešljivo domeno prek Keycloak admin API pred prvo prijavo OIDC, ker pixelfed je `dns,spoof` validator zavrne `.example` naslove. Obe ustanovi živita [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js) in pogon namenskih prijavnih specifikacij v `files/playwright/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). The OpenTalk frontend is a public-client OIDC single-page app — the container env carries nothing but the issuer and the client id, there is no server-side session and no HTML login form — so the role drives it with its own redirect-racing helper keyed on `LOGIN_*` / `BIBER_*` instead of the `ADMIN_*` pair the shared helper expects, and the browser-side session leaves the contract's in-app logout leg without a target. Both personas' Keycloak → dashboard chain is covered by [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js)."
msgstr "Skupna `biber` ter `administrator` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). O OpenTalk frontend je javno-odjemalec OIDC enostransko aplikacijo – kontejner env nosi nič drugega kot izdajatelj in odjemalec ID, ni seje na strani strežnika in ni HTML prijavni obrazec – tako da vlogo poganja z lastno preusmeritve-rasing pomočnika keyed on `LOGIN_*` / `BIBER_*` namesto `ADMIN_*` par skupni pomočnik pričakuje, in brskalnik stran seje zapusti pogodbo in-app odjavite nogo brez cilja. Obe osebi. Keycloak → armaturna veriga je prekrita z [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). The role provisions no pretix account at all — [tasks/main.yml](./tasks/main.yml) only deploys the stack — while pretix's native auth backend authenticates a pretix `User` row that is created by the interactive first-run setup. The `pretix-oidc` backend added on top lives on pretix's `/control` login page, whereas the role's base URL serves the public ticket shop that the baseline scenarios in [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) assert. Seeding a backend user is the path back to a runnable persona journey."
msgstr "Skupna `biber` ter `administrator` persona pomočniki so razglašeni za blokirane [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Vloga določbe ni pretix račun sploh – [tasks/main.yml](./tasks/main.yml) Samo razporedi kup – medtem ko pretix je izvorna Auth backend overovi pretix `User` vrstica, ki je ustvarjena z interaktivno nastavitvijo v prvem teku. – `pretix-oidc` hrbtenica dodana na vrhu življenja na pretix je `/control` Prijavna stran, medtem ko osnovni URL vloge služi javni trgovini vstopnice, da osnovne scenarije v [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) trdi. Iskanje uporabnika hrbtenice je pot nazaj do utečene osebe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. As soon as an IAM source is wired, the role sets `GITEA__service__DISABLE_REGISTRATION` (`templates/env.j2`, driven by `GITEA_IAM_ENABLED` in `vars/main.yml`), and `tasks/setup/oidc.yml` registers only the auth source — never a Gitea user — so a Keycloak identity without a pre-linked Gitea account is bounced back to `/user/login`. The opt-out lapses once the deploy provisions (or auto-links) Gitea accounts for the persona identities."
msgstr "Skupna `biber` ter `administrator` persona potovanja so izbrana preko `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Takoj ko je vir IAM ozvočen, se vloga postavi `GITEA__service__DISABLE_REGISTRATION` (`templates/env.j2`, ki ga poganja `GITEA_IAM_ENABLED` v `vars/main.yml`), in `tasks/setup/oidc.yml` Registrira samo izvor duše – nikoli Gitea uporabnik – tako Keycloak identiteti brez predhodno povezanega Gitea račun se odbije nazaj na `/user/login`. Izvzetje preneha po uporabi določb (ali avtopovezave) Gitea Zasebne identitete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Fider's SSO entry is a two-step modal: the header \"Sign in\" button only opens the provider dialog, and a second click on \"Continue with … SSO\" performs the Keycloak redirect, whereas the shared helper clicks exactly once and never reaches the IdP. Both journeys are covered end-to-end by this role's own `fider: admin sso login` and `fider: biber sso login as regular user` scenarios in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`; the opt-out lapses once the shared helper learns Fider's modal."
msgstr "Skupna `biber` ter `administrator` persona potovanja so izbrana preko `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Fider je SSO vnos je dvostopenjski modal: glava \"Vpišite se\" gumb odpre samo pogovorno okno ponudnika, in drugi klik na \"Nadaljujte z ... SSO\" izvaja Keycloak preusmeri, medtem ko skupni pomočnik klikne točno enkrat in nikoli ne doseže IDP. Obe poti potekata od konca do konca. `fider: admin sso login` ter `fider: biber sso login as regular user` scenariji v `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`; izvzetje preneha, ko se skupni pomočnik nauči FiderTo je modal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Flowise has no in-app OIDC adapter: SSO is an oauth2-proxy sidecar (`services.sso.flavor: oauth2`), and behind that gate Flowise still presents its own sign-in form for the single instance account seeded from `FLOWISE_USERNAME` / `FLOWISE_PASSWORD` in `templates/env.j2`. `biber` has no Flowise identity at all, and the shared helpers only drive Keycloak forms while `services.sso` is enabled, so neither persona can reach an authenticated Flowise surface; the OIDC gate itself is covered by `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`."
