msgid "This Ansible role deploys EspoCRM using Docker. It handles:"
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga se uporablja EspoCRM Uporaba zdravila Docker. To drži:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys SuiteCRM using Docker and the Infinito.Nexus shared stack. It handles:"
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga se uporablja SuiteCRM Uporaba zdravila Docker in Infinito.Nexus -Skupen kup. To drži:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys Taiga in a Docker-based environment, allowing fast, reproducible, and secure installations. Authentication defaults to Taiga's own OpenID Connect integration against Keycloak, which federates users from OpenLDAP."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga se uporablja Taiga v Dockerjevem okolju, ki omogoča hitre, ponovljive in varne naprave. Privzeta overitev TaigaLastna integracija OpenID Connect proti Keycloak, ki napaja uporabnike iz OpenLDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys Taiga in a Docker-based environment, allowing fast, reproducible, and secure installations. Authentication defaults to Taiga’s own OpenID Connect integration against Keycloak, which federates users from OpenLDAP."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga se uporablja Taiga v Dockerjevem okolju, ki omogoča hitre, ponovljive in varne naprave. Privzeta overitev TaigaLastna integracija OpenID Connect proti Keycloak, ki napaja uporabnike iz OpenLDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) using Docker Compose. It includes support for Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN/STUN, health checks, and a modular `.env` setup. This role is ideal for educational institutions and teams requiring a self-hosted video conferencing solution."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga se uporablja [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) uporaba Docker Compose. Vključuje podporo za Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN/STON, zdravstvene preglede in modularno `.env` Nastavitev. Ta vloga je idealna za izobraževalne ustanove in ekipe, ki potrebujejo rešitev videokonference, ki jo vodi sam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys [PhpMyAdmin](https://www.phpmyadmin.net/) in a secure Docker environment, complete with optional OAuth2 proxy support. It enables seamless management of MariaDB/MySQL databases via a web-app-based interface."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga se uporablja [PhpMyAdmin](https://www.phpmyadmin.net/) v varnem okolju Docker, skupaj z možnostjo OAuth2 podpora posrednika. Omogoča nemoteno upravljanje MariaDB/MySQL baze podatkov preko spletnega vmesnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ using Docker Compose. It includes support for Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN/STUN, health checks, and a modular ``.env`` setup. This role is ideal for educational institutions and teams requiring a self-hosted video conferencing solution. > 🔧 **Note**: The database layer should be decoupled in a future release to improve modularity and integration. >"
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga se uporablja `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ uporaba Docker Compose. Vključuje podporo za Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN/STON, zdravstvene preglede in modularno ``.env`` Nastavitev. Ta vloga je idealna za izobraževalne ustanove in ekipe, ki potrebujejo samogostoljubno rešitev videokonference. > 🔧 **Opomba**: Plast baze podatkov je treba ločiti v prihodnjem izpustu za izboljšanje modularnosti in integracije. >"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys `PhpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net/>`__ in a secure Docker environment, complete with optional OAuth2 proxy support. It enables seamless management of MariaDB/MySQL databases via a web-app-based interface."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga se uporablja `PhpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net/>`__ v varnem okolju Docker, skupaj z možnostjo OAuth2 podpora posrednika. Omogoča nemoteno upravljanje MariaDB/MySQL baze podatkov preko spletnega vmesnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys a central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver (Unbound) in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs as a trivial single-service stack with a static IP on its own network, so consumer stacks can point their ``dns:`` at it instead of embedding their own resolver."
msgstr "Ta neobvezna vloga uvaja centralni rekurzivni/predhodni reševalec DNSSEC (Unbound) v vsebniku z zdravilom Docker Docker Compose. To deluje kot trivialna enostoritve kup s statičnim IP na svojem omrežju, tako da lahko potrošniki nizov kažejo svoje ``dns:`` namesto, da bi vgradili svojega razreševalca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys a central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver (Unbound) in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs as a trivial single-service stack with a static IP on its own network, so consumer stacks can point their `dns:` at it instead of embedding their own resolver."
msgstr "Ta neobvezna vloga uvaja centralni rekurzivni/predhodni reševalec DNSSEC (Unbound) v vsebniku z zdravilom Docker Docker Compose. To deluje kot trivialna enostoritve kup s statičnim IP na svojem omrežju, tako da lahko potrošniki nizov kažejo svoje `dns:` namesto, da bi vgradili svojega razreševalca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a PostgreSQL database in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify database administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and essential database tasks (such as database and user creation) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo uporablja in konfigurira a PostgreSQL podatkovna zbirka v vsebniku Docker z uporabo Docker Compose. Namenjen je poenostavitvi upravljanja podatkovnih baz z avtomatizacijo ustvarjanja omrežij, zabojnikov in bistvenih nalog podatkovnih baz (kot je zbirka podatkov in ustvarjanje uporabnikov) za varno in visoko zmogljivo okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a Qdrant vector database in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs Qdrant as a central, pinned engine that many application roles share over the cross-stack network, keeping the consumer roles stateless and NFS-shareable in swarm."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo uporablja in konfigurira a Qdrant vektorska zbirka podatkov v vsebniku Docker z uporabo Docker Compose-Teče. Qdrant kot osrednji, pritrjen motor, ki ima veliko vlog pri uporabi, ki so skupne prek mreže za prenos moči, pri čemer so potrošniške vloge brez države in NFS delljive v roju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Elasticsearch search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify search administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and per-consumer index namespaces (a role and user scoped to `<entity>-*` indices) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo razporedi in konfigurira osrednjo Elasticsearch iskalnik v vsebniku Docker z uporabo Docker Compose. Namenjen je poenostavitvi upravljanja iskanja z avtomatizacijo ustvarjanja omrežij, zabojnikov in indeksnih imenskih prostorov na potrošnika (vloga in uporabnik, ki je na področju `<entity>-*` indeksi) za varno in visoko zmogljivo okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Elasticsearch search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify search administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and per-consumer index namespaces (a role and user scoped to ``<entity>-*`` indices) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo razporedi in konfigurira osrednjo Elasticsearch iskalnik v vsebniku Docker z uporabo Docker Compose. Namenjen je poenostavitvi upravljanja iskanja z avtomatizacijo ustvarjanja omrežij, zabojnikov in indeksnih imenskih prostorov na potrošnika (vloga in uporabnik, ki je na področju ``<entity>-*`` indeksi) za varno in visoko zmogljivo okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Typesense search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed as a central engine: many application roles share one pinned Typesense stack instead of each embedding its own sidecar, keeping the application roles stateless, unpinned and NFS-shareable in swarm."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo razporedi in konfigurira osrednjo Typesense iskalnik v vsebniku Docker z uporabo Docker Compose. Zasnovan je kot osrednji motor: številne vloge aplikacije imajo eno pripeto Typesense namesto da bi vsak vgradil svojo stransko prikolico, ohranjal vloge brez državljanstva, nepovezane in skupne NFS v rojih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and manages a containerized [Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) server, providing easy access to over 2,000 SVG and PNG icons for use in web projects, documentation, and branding."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo razporedi in upravlja kontejnersko [Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) strežnik, ki omogoča enostaven dostop do več 2,000 Ikone SVG in PNG za uporabo v spletnih projektih, dokumentaciji in blagovni znamki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and manages a containerized `Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org/>`__ server, providing easy access to over 2,000 SVG and PNG icons for use in web projects, documentation, and branding."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo razporedi in upravlja kontejnersko `Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org/>`__ strežnik, ki omogoča enostaven dostop do več 2,000 Ikone SVG in PNG za uporabo v spletnih projektih, dokumentaciji in blagovni znamki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys the ONLYOFFICE Document Server in Docker to provide real-time, in-browser editing for documents, spreadsheets, and presentations. It automates the setup of the Document Server container, NGINX reverse proxy configuration, network isolation via Docker networks, and environment variable management for secure integration with Nextcloud or other WOPI-compatible platforms."
msgstr "Ta neobvezna vloga uporablja strežnik SLUDOFFICE Dokument v Dockerju, da zagotovi urejanje dokumentov, preglednic in predstavitev v realnem času, in-browser. Avtomatizira nastavitev zabojnika Document Server, NGINX obratno posredniško konfiguracijo, osamitev omrežja preko Docker omrežij in upravljanje okoljskih spremenljivk za varno integracijo z Nextcloud ali drugih platform, združljivih z WOPI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures **consistent global theming** across all NGINX-served applications by injecting CSS files."
msgstr "Ta nespremenljiva vloga zagotavlja **dosledne globalne teme** z vbrizgavanjem datotek CSS v vse aplikacije, ki so namenjene NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures **consistent global theming** across all NGINX-served applications by injecting CSS files.   The role leverages [`colorscheme-generator`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/colorscheme-generator/) to generate a dynamic, customizable color palette for light and dark mode, compatible with popular web tools like **Bootstrap**, **Keycloak**, **Nextcloud**, **Taiga**, **Mastodon**, and many more."
msgstr "Ta nespremenljiva vloga zagotavlja **dosledne globalne teme** z vbrizgavanjem datotek CSS v vse aplikacije, ki so namenjene NGINX. Vloga vzvodov [`colorscheme-generator`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/colorscheme-generator/) ustvariti dinamično, prilagodljivo barvno paleto za svetel in temen način, ki je združljiva s priljubljenimi spletnimi orodji, kot so **Čevlji**, **Keycloak**, **Nextcloud**, **Taiga**, **Mastodon**In še veliko več."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that [.profile](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) is sourced in both [Bash](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) and [Zsh](https://www.zsh.org/) environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) to a centralized `.profile`."
msgstr "Ta neobvezna vloga zagotavlja, da [.profil](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) izvira v obeh [Bash](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) ter [Zsh](https://www.zsh.org/) okolja. Omogoča dosledno nalaganje spremenljivk okolja preko različnih prijavnih lupin tako, da povezuje datoteke profilov, specifične za lupino (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) na centralizirano `.profile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ is sourced in both `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ and `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) to a centralized ``.profile``."
msgstr "Ta neobvezna vloga zagotavlja, da `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ izvira v obeh `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ ter `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ okolja. Omogoča dosledno nalaganje spremenljivk okolja preko različnih prijavnih lupin tako, da povezuje datoteke profilov, specifične za lupino (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) na centralizirano ``.profile``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that the target host’s system hostname is set to the inventory hostname."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga zagotavlja, da je ime gostitelja sistema ciljnega gostitelja nastavljeno na ime gostitelja inventarja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures the ``doli`` (dotlinker) CLI is installed (via ``pkgmgr``) and applies dotlinker mappings provided by the calling role."
msgstr "To lahko vlogo zagotavlja ``doli`` (dotlinker) CLI je nameščen (preko ``pkgmgr``) in uporablja mapiranje pik, ki ga zagotavlja klicna vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures the `doli` (dotlinker) CLI is installed (via `pkgmgr`) and applies dotlinker mappings provided by the calling role."
msgstr "To lahko vlogo zagotavlja `doli` (dotlinker) CLI je nameščen (preko `pkgmgr`) in uporablja mapiranje pik, ki ga zagotavlja klicna vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local ``pyproject.toml`` (using ``playbook_dir``) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into ``/etc/environment`` on the managed host."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga izlušči različico projekta iz lokalnega ``pyproject.toml`` (uporaba ``playbook_dir``) in ga zapiše kot sistemsko okoljsko spremenljivko v ``/etc/environment`` na upravljanega gostitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local `pyproject.toml` (using `playbook_dir`) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into `/etc/environment` on the managed host."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga izlušči različico projekta iz lokalnega `pyproject.toml` (uporaba `playbook_dir`) in ga zapiše kot sistemsko okoljsko spremenljivko v `/etc/environment` na upravljanega gostitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role facilitates the deployment of a MariaDB server using Docker. It is designed to ensure ease of installation and configuration, with the flexibility to adapt to different environments."
msgstr "Ta neobvezna vloga olajšuje uvajanje MariaDB strežnik z Dockerjem. Zasnovan je tako, da zagotavlja enostavno namestitev in konfiguracijo, s prožnostjo prilagajanja različnim okoljem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role guarantees that a target resolves the `*.localhost` names it serves, without going through DNS."
msgstr "Ta negotova vloga zagotavlja, da cilj reši `*.localhost` Imena, ki jih služi, brez DNS-a."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role guarantees that a target resolves the ``*.localhost`` names it serves, without going through DNS."
msgstr "Ta negotova vloga zagotavlja, da cilj reši ``*.localhost`` Imena, ki jih služi, brez DNS-a."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into all HTML responses served by NGINX. It leverages NGINX’s ``sub_filter`` to seamlessly insert your application-specific script just before the closing ``</head>`` tag, ensuring that your code runs on every page load, which is useful for global feature flags, analytics, or UI enhancements."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga vbrizga javascript po meri v vse HTML odzive, ki jih služi NGINX. To vpliva na NGINX-ovo ``sub_filter`` brezhibno vstavite skripte, specifične za program tik pred zaključkom ``</head>`` tag, zagotavljanje, da vaša koda teče na vsako obremenitev strani, ki je uporabna za globalne značilnosti zastave, analitike, ali UI izboljšave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into all HTML responses served by NGINX. It leverages NGINX’s `sub_filter` to seamlessly insert your application-specific script just before the closing `</head>` tag, ensuring that your code runs on every page load, which is useful for global feature flags, analytics, or UI enhancements."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga vbrizga javascript po meri v vse HTML odzive, ki jih služi NGINX. To vpliva na NGINX-ovo `sub_filter` brezhibno vstavite skripte, specifične za program tik pred zaključkom `</head>` tag, zagotavljanje, da vaša koda teče na vsako obremenitev strani, ki je uporabna za globalne značilnosti zastave, analitike, ali UI izboljšave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a small JavaScript snippet into your HTML responses that enables parent pages to get notified whenever the iframe’s location changes and forces external links to open in a new tab."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga vbrizga majhen JavaScript snippet v vaše HTML odzive, ki omogoča, da se matične strani obvestijo, kadar koli se lokacija iframe spremeni in prisili zunanje povezave odpreti v novem zavihku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs **fakeroot** for the current Linux distribution. Fakeroot enables non-privileged users to simulate root-level file manipulations, making it ideal for building packages or performing file operations that normally require root permissions."
msgstr "Ta neoporečna vloga **ponaredek** za trenutno distribucijo Linuxa. Fakeroot omogoča neprivilegiranim uporabnikom, da simulirajo manipulacije datotek na korenski ravni, zaradi česar je idealen za gradnjo paketov ali izvajanje operacij datotek, ki običajno zahtevajo root dovoljenja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs GNU Make on Arch Linux systems using the Pacman package manager. GNU Make is a build automation tool that automatically builds executable programs and libraries from source code by reading files called Makefiles."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga namesti sistem GNU Make na Arch Linux s pomočjo upravljalnika paketov Pacman. GNU Make je orodje za avtomatizacijo gradnje, ki samodejno gradi izvedljive programe in knjižnice iz izvorne kode z branjem datotek, imenovanih Makefile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager. It ensures that Git is installed only once, even when the role is applied to multiple hosts or executed in a multi-task scenario."
msgstr "Ta neoporečna vloga Git na ciljnem sistemu z uporabo upravljalnika paketov Pacman. Zagotavlja, da Git je nameščen samo enkrat, tudi če se vloga uporablja za več gostiteljev ali se izvaja v scenariju več nalog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs Node.js on the target system using the native package manager."
msgstr "Ta neoporečna vloga Node.js na ciljnem sistemu z uporabo domačega upravitelja paketov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs [Kevin's Package Manager](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) and updates packages using `pkgmgr` on Arch Linux systems. It provides a unified interface for package installation and update management, ensuring consistent deployment across environments."
msgstr "Ta neoporečna vloga [Kevinov upravitelj paketov](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) in posodablja pakete z uporabo `pkgmgr` na Arch Linux sistemih. Zagotavlja enoten vmesnik za upravljanje s paketno namestitvijo in posodabljanjem, kar zagotavlja dosledno uvajanje v vseh okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ and updates packages using ``pkgmgr`` on Arch Linux systems. It provides a unified interface for package installation and update management, ensuring consistent deployment across environments."
msgstr "Ta neoporečna vloga `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ in posodablja pakete z uporabo ``pkgmgr`` na Arch Linux sistemih. Zagotavlja enoten vmesnik za upravljanje s paketno namestitvijo in posodabljanjem, kar zagotavlja dosledno uvajanje v vseh okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures **NGINX** as a core HTTP/stream server on Arch Linux systems. It provides:"
msgstr "Ta lahkotna vloga namesti in nastavi **NGINX** kot osrednji HTTP/stream strežnik na Arch Linux sistemih. Določa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures **msmtp** (plus optional sendmail compatibility) across the default Infinito distro set: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora and CentOS. It provides a lightweight SMTP client that serves as a drop-in replacement for traditional sendmail workflows, enabling reliable email delivery via an external SMTP server. For more background on SMTP, see [SMTP on Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP)."
msgstr "Ta lahkotna vloga namesti in nastavi **msmtp** (plus neobvezna združljivost sendmaila) preko privzetega nabora Infinito distro: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora in CentOS. Zagotavlja lahek odjemalec SMTP, ki služi kot spustna zamenjava za tradicionalne delovne tokove sendmaila, kar omogoča zanesljivo dostavo elektronske pošte prek zunanjega strežnika SMTP. Za več informacij o SMTP glej [SMTP na Wikipediji](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures **msmtp** (plus optional sendmail compatibility) across the default Infinito distro set: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora and CentOS. It provides a lightweight SMTP client that serves as a drop-in replacement for traditional sendmail workflows, enabling reliable email delivery via an external SMTP server. For more background on SMTP, see `SMTP on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP>`__."
msgstr "Ta lahkotna vloga namesti in nastavi **msmtp** (plus neobvezna združljivost sendmaila) preko privzetega nabora Infinito distro: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora in CentOS. Zagotavlja lahek odjemalec SMTP, ki služi kot spustna zamenjava za tradicionalne delovne tokove sendmaila, kar omogoča zanesljivo dostavo elektronske pošte prek zunanjega strežnika SMTP. Za več informacij o SMTP glej `SMTP on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures Firefox on Arch Linux systems, enforcing Enterprise Policies to automatically install key browser extensions. It ensures that Firefox is installed and set up with policies that force-install uBlock Origin and the KeePassXC Browser extension, delivering a secure and consistent browsing experience."
msgstr "Ta lahkotna vloga namesti in nastavi Firefox na Arch Linux sistemov, uveljavljanje podjetniške politike za samodejno namestitev razširitve brskalnika. Zagotavlja, da Firefox je nameščen in vzpostavljen s politikami, ki silijo uBlock izvor in KeePassXC Razširitev brskalnika, ki zagotavlja varno in dosledno izkušnjo brskanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures [Kevin's Package Manager](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) - a configurable Python tool designed to manage multiple repositories and automate common Git operations. The role clones the repository from GitHub, sets the executable permissions for the main script, and runs the installation command to set up command aliases."
msgstr "Ta lahkotna vloga namesti in nastavi [Kevinov upravitelj paketov](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) - nastavljivo Python orodje za upravljanje več arhivov in avtomatizacijo skupnih Git operacije. Vloga klonira skladišče iz GitHuba, nastavi izvedljiva dovoljenja za glavni skript in za nastavitev ukaza za namestitev uporabi ukaz alias."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ - a configurable Python tool designed to manage multiple repositories and automate common Git operations. The role clones the repository from GitHub, sets the executable permissions for the main script, and runs the installation command to set up command aliases."
msgstr "Ta lahkotna vloga namesti in nastavi `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ - nastavljivo Python orodje za upravljanje več arhivov in avtomatizacijo skupnih Git operacije. Vloga klonira skladišče iz GitHuba, nastavi izvedljiva dovoljenja za glavni skript in za nastavitev ukaza za namestitev uporabi ukaz alias."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures all the software required for Blu-ray playback on Arch Linux–based systems. It ensures that VLC and the necessary libraries for Blu-ray disc decryption and playback (``libaacs``, ``libbluray``) are present, and provides hooks for optional AUR packages."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga namesti in konfigurira vso programsko opremo, potrebno za Blu-ray predvajanje na Arch Linux-based sistemov. Zagotavlja, da VLC in potrebne knjižnice za dešifriranje in predvajanje diska Blu-ray (``libaacs``, ``libbluray``) so prisotni in zagotavlja kavlje za neobvezne pakete AUR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures all the software required for Blu-ray playback on Arch Linux–based systems. It ensures that VLC and the necessary libraries for Blu-ray disc decryption and playback (`libaacs`, `libbluray`) are present, and provides hooks for optional AUR packages."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga namesti in konfigurira vso programsko opremo, potrebno za Blu-ray predvajanje na Arch Linux-based sistemov. Zagotavlja, da VLC in potrebne knjižnice za dešifriranje in predvajanje diska Blu-ray (`libaacs`, `libbluray`) so prisotni in zagotavlja kavlje za neobvezne pakete AUR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Chromium browser along with essential security and productivity extensions. It ensures that Chromium is installed and properly set up with forced installation of uBlock Origin and the KeePassXC browser extension via Enterprise Policies, providing a secure and streamlined browsing experience."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga namesti in nastavi Chromium brskalnik skupaj z bistvenimi varnostnimi in produktivnostnimi razširitvami. Zagotavlja, da Chromium je nameščen in pravilno nameščen z prisilno namestitvijo uBlock Origin in KeePassXC razširitev brskalnika prek Enterprise Policy, ki zagotavlja varno in poenostavljeno izkušnjo brskanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Nextcloud desktop client on Arch Linux systems. It also manages symbolic links from commonly used user directories (like `Documents`, `Pictures`, etc.) to the respective folders inside a cloud-synced Nextcloud directory. This ensures user data is seamlessly integrated into the synchronized cloud folder."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga namesti in nastavi Nextcloud namizni odjemalec na Arch Linux sistemih. Upravlja tudi simbolične povezave iz splošno uporabljenih uporabniških map (kot `Documents`, `Pictures`, itd.) za ustrezne mape znotraj oblaka Nextcloud Mapa. To zagotavlja, da so uporabniški podatki brezhibno vgrajeni v sinhronizirano mapo v oblaku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Nextcloud desktop client on Arch Linux systems. It also manages symbolic links from commonly used user directories (like ``Documents``, ``Pictures``, etc.) to the respective folders inside a cloud-synced Nextcloud directory. This ensures user data is seamlessly integrated into the synchronized cloud folder."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga namesti in nastavi Nextcloud namizni odjemalec na Arch Linux sistemih. Upravlja tudi simbolične povezave iz splošno uporabljenih uporabniških map (kot ``Documents``, ``Pictures``, itd.) za ustrezne mape znotraj oblaka Nextcloud Mapa. To zagotavlja, da so uporabniški podatki brezhibno vgrajeni v sinhronizirano mapo v oblaku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Tor service and the Tor Browser Launcher, providing a privacy-focused web browsing environment on Pacman-based Linux distributions."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga namesti in konfigurira storitev Tor in zaganjalnik brskalnika Tor, kar zagotavlja okolje spletnega brskanja, osredotočeno na zasebnost, na distribucijah Linuxa, ki temeljijo na Pacmanu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and executes [`dockreap`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner), a tool designed to clean up unused anonymous Docker volumes (including symlinks and their targets) to maintain a tidy Docker environment."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga namesti in izvrši [`dockreap`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner), orodje za čiščenje neporabljenih anonimnih Docker zvezkov (vključno s simpovezavami in njihovimi cilji) za vzdrževanje urejenega okolja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and executes ```dockreap`` <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner>`__, a tool designed to clean up unused anonymous Docker volumes (including symlinks and their targets) to maintain a tidy Docker environment."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga namesti in izvrši ```dockreap`` <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner>` , orodje za čiščenje neuporabljenih anonimnih Docker zvezkov (vključno s simpovezavami in njihovimi cilji) za vzdrževanje urejenega okolja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and makes the Infinito.Nexus CLI available on your system."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo namesti in naredi Infinito.Nexus CLI na voljo v vašem sistemu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs everything needed for Arduino development on Arch Linux. It includes the official Arduino IDE, documentation, and user group configurations to enable serial port access for uploading code to boards."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga namesti vse potrebno za Arduino razvoj na Arch Linux. Vključuje uradne konfiguracije Arduino IDE, dokumentacijo in uporabniške skupine, ki omogočajo serijski dostop do vrat za nalaganje kode na deske."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs non-free GPU drivers on Arch Linux systems by invoking the ``mhwd`` utility. It ensures that the appropriate proprietary drivers for your PCI graphics hardware are installed and ready for use."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga namesti nefree GPU gonilniki na Arch Linux sistemov, tako da se sklicuje na ``mhwd`` uporabnost. Zagotavlja, da so ustrezni lastniški gonilniki za vašo grafično strojno opremo PCI nameščeni in pripravljeni za uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs non-free GPU drivers on Arch Linux systems by invoking the `mhwd` utility. It ensures that the appropriate proprietary drivers for your PCI graphics hardware are installed and ready for use."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga namesti nefree GPU gonilniki na Arch Linux sistemov, tako da se sklicuje na `mhwd` uporabnost. Zagotavlja, da so ustrezni lastniški gonilniki za vašo grafično strojno opremo PCI nameščeni in pripravljeni za uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs npm and optionally runs ``npm ci`` within a given project directory. It is intended to streamline dependency installation for Node.js applications."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo namesti npm in neobvezno teče ``npm ci`` v določenem projektnem imeniku. Namenjen je racionalizaciji sistema za odvisnost za Node.js aplikacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs npm and optionally runs `npm ci` within a given project directory. It is intended to streamline dependency installation for Node.js applications."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo namesti npm in neobvezno teče `npm ci` v določenem projektnem imeniku. Namenjen je racionalizaciji sistema za odvisnost za Node.js aplikacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the GNU Compiler Collection (GCC) on Arch Linux systems. GCC is a standard compiler suite supporting C, C++, and other programming languages. It is a core component for compiling and building software from source."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga namesti zbirko GNU Compiler (GCC) na Arch Linux sistemih. GCC je standardna zbirka prevajalcev, ki podpira C, C++ in druge programske jezike. Je jedro za pripravo in gradnjo programske opreme iz vira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the Intel VA-API media driver for the current Linux distribution."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga namesti Intel VA-API gonilnik za trenutno distribucijo Linuxa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the [AUR (Arch User Repository)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo namesti [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) namizni odjemalec na Arch Linux sistemih z uporabo [AUR (Arch User Skladišče)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the `Spotify <https://www.spotify.com/>`__ desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the `AUR (Arch User Repository) <https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/>`__."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo namesti `Spotify <https://www.spotify.com/>`__ namizni odjemalec na Arch Linux sistemih z uporabo `AUR (Arch User Repository) <https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role is responsible for installing GnuCash, a free and open-source financial management software, on systems utilizing the Pacman package manager. It's particularly useful for setting up GnuCash in a Linux environment with minimal manual intervention."
msgstr "Ta vloga je odgovorna za namestitev GnuCash, brezplačno in odprtokodno finančno upravljanje programske opreme, na sistemih, ki uporabljajo Pacman paket upravitelja. To je še posebej koristno za postavitev GnuCash v okolju Linuxa z minimalnim ročnim posredovanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role is responsible for installing GnuCash, a free and open-source financial management software, on systems utilizing the Pacman package manager. It’s particularly useful for setting up GnuCash in a Linux environment with minimal manual intervention."
msgstr "Ta vloga je odgovorna za namestitev GnuCash, brezplačno in odprtokodno finančno upravljanje programske opreme, na sistemih, ki uporabljajo Pacman paket upravitelja. To je še posebej koristno za ustanovitev GnuCash v okolju Linuxa z minimalnim ročnim posredovanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages Docker Compose project structures and workflows for applications on Arch Linux. It creates dedicated instance directories, manages `.env` and `compose.yml` files, and provides automation logic for project reset, rebuild, and startup sequences."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga upravlja Docker Compose projektne strukture in potek dela za aplikacije na Arch Linuxu. Ustvarja namenske imenike primerkov, upravlja `.env` ter `compose.yml` datoteke, in zagotavlja logiko avtomatizacije za ponastavitev, obnovo in zagon zaporedij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages Docker Compose project structures and workflows for applications on Arch Linux. It creates dedicated instance directories, manages ``.env`` and ``compose.yml`` files, and provides automation logic for project reset, rebuild, and startup sequences."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga upravlja Docker Compose projektne strukture in potek dela za aplikacije na Arch Linuxu. Ustvarja namenske imenike primerkov, upravlja ``.env`` ter ``compose.yml`` datoteke, in zagotavlja logiko avtomatizacije za ponastavitev, obnovo in zagon zaporedij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages the configuration of ``systemd-journald`` on target hosts."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo upravlja konfiguracijo ``systemd-journald`` na gostitelje tarče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages the configuration of `systemd-journald` on target hosts."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo upravlja konfiguracijo `systemd-journald` na gostitelje tarče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages the system locale configuration by deploying ``locale.gen`` and ``locale.conf``, then generating the requested locales."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga upravlja konfiguracijo krajev sistema z uporabo ``locale.gen`` ter ``locale.conf``, nato generiranje zahtevanih krajev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages the system locale configuration by deploying `locale.gen` and `locale.conf`, then generating the requested locales."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga upravlja konfiguracijo krajev sistema z uporabo `locale.gen` ter `locale.conf`, nato generiranje zahtevanih krajev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides Redis in two interchangeable shapes, selected per consumer with the ``shared`` flag (mirroring ``svc-db-postgres``):"
msgstr "Ta lahkotna vloga zagotavlja Redis v dveh zamenljivih oblikah, izbranih na potrošnika z ``shared`` zastava (zrcaljenje ``svc-db-postgres``):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides Redis in two interchangeable shapes, selected per consumer with the `shared` flag (mirroring `svc-db-postgres`):"
msgstr "Ta lahkotna vloga zagotavlja Redis v dveh zamenljivih oblikah, izbranih na potrošnika z `shared` zastava (zrcaljenje `svc-db-postgres`):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a **robust, reusable Git pull utility** for system automation. It performs shallow clones or updates of Git repositories and optionally **pins the working tree to a specific tag** (e.g. `stable`) in a detached HEAD state."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo zagotavlja **robustno, ponovno uporabno Git Povleci pripomoček** za avtomatizacijo sistema. Izvaja plitve klone ali posodobitve Git repozitoriji in neobvezno **prilepi delovno drevo na posebno oznako** (Npr. `stable`) v ločenem stanju HEAD."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a **robust, reusable Git pull utility** for system automation. It performs shallow clones or updates of Git repositories and optionally **pins the working tree to a specific tag** (e.g. ``stable``) in a detached HEAD state."
msgstr "Ta lahko vlogo zagotavlja **robustno, ponovno uporabno Git Povleci pripomoček** za avtomatizacijo sistema. Izvaja plitve klone ali posodobitve Git repozitoriji in neobvezno **prilepi delovno drevo na posebno oznako** (Npr.``stable``) v ločenem stanju HEAD."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a central RabbitMQ message broker that many roles share. It runs the broker inside a Docker container and isolates each consumer with its own virtual host and user, making it suitable for production or local development."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga zagotavlja osrednjo RabbitMQ posrednik sporočil, ki si jih deli veliko vlog. Vodi posrednika v posodi Docker in izolira vsakega potrošnika z lastnim virtualnim gostiteljem in uporabnikom, zaradi česar je primeren za proizvodnjo ali lokalni razvoj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a generic, reusable Playwright end-to-end (E2E) test runner for the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Ta neobvezna vloga zagotavlja generično, ponovno uporabno igro Playwright od konca do konca (E2E) testni tekač za Infinito.Nexus ekosistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you're consolidating your application's data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloge določbe centraliziran sistem zbirke podatkov v vaši Docker Compose okolje. Podpira oboje. MariaDB ter PostgreSQL, zagotavlja robustno, razširljivo in nizko vzdrževanje podatkovne zbirke rešitev. Ne glede na to, ali utrjujete podatke vaše aplikacije ali ustvarjate namensko centralno shranjevanje, ta vloga poenostavlja nastavitev in integracijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you’re consolidating your application’s data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloge določbe centraliziran sistem zbirke podatkov v vaši Docker Compose okolje. Podpira oboje. MariaDB ter PostgreSQL, zagotavlja robustno, razširljivo in nizko vzdrževanje podatkovne zbirke rešitev. Ne glede na to, ali utrjujete podatke vaše aplikacije ali ustvarjate namensko centralno shranjevanje, ta vloga poenostavlja nastavitev in integracijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role removes NGINX configuration files and revokes and deletes Certbot certificates for domains marked as deprecated."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga odstrani nastavitvene datoteke NGINX ter prekliče in izbriše Certbot potrdila za domene, označene kot amortizirane."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (``svc-db-postgres``). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, ``shared: false``) or from this central pinned stack (``shared: true``)."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga teče Memcached kot osrednja odvisnost od motorja, ki odraža vzorec centralne podatkovne baze (``svc-db-postgres``). Potrošnik doseže bodisi vgrajen (stransko prikolico znotraj lastnega kupa, ``shared: false``) ali iz tega osrednjega sklopa (``shared: true``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (`svc-db-postgres`). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, `shared: false`) or from this central pinned stack (`shared: true`)."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga teče Memcached kot osrednja odvisnost od motorja, ki odraža vzorec centralne podatkovne baze (`svc-db-postgres`). Potrošnik doseže bodisi vgrajen (stransko prikolico znotraj lastnega kupa, `shared: false`) ali iz tega osrednjega sklopa (`shared: true`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sends periodic health check emails using **msmtp** to verify that your mail transport agent is operational. It deploys a simple script and hooks it into a systemd service and timer, with failure notifications sent via Telegram."
msgstr "Ta Ansible vloga pošilja periodične zdravstvene preglede e-pošte z uporabo **msmtp** da preveri, ali vaš agent za poštni prevoz deluje. Uporablja preprost skript in ga pripne v sistemsko storitev in časovnik, z obvestili o napakah, poslanimi preko Telegrama."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up a Python development environment on Arch Linux. It includes Python itself, the ``pip`` package manager, and builds on the general developer persona to support scripting, application development, data science, and more."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga postavlja Python razvojno okolje na Arch Linuxu. Vključuje Python sam, ``pip`` vodja paketa, in gradi na splošni razvijalec persona za podporo scenarija, razvoj aplikacij, znanost podatkov, in še več."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up a Python development environment on Arch Linux. It includes Python itself, the `pip` package manager, and builds on the general developer persona to support scripting, application development, data science, and more."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga postavlja Python razvojno okolje na Arch Linuxu. Vključuje Python sam, `pip` vodja paketa, in gradi na splošni razvijalec persona za podporo scenarija, razvoj aplikacij, znanost podatkov, in še več."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up and manages Akaunting, an innovative online accounting software, using Docker and Docker Compose. Empower your financial management with Akaunting, a dynamic and feature-rich accounting platform designed to simplify your bookkeeping and boost your business growth. Enjoy intuitive tools, real-time insights, and an energetic approach to your finances."
msgstr "Ta nevidna vloga vzpostavlja in upravlja Akaunting, inovativno spletno računovodsko programsko opremo, z uporabo Docker in Docker Compose. Okrepiti svoje finančno poslovodenje z Akaunting, dinamična in s funkcijami bogata računovodska platforma, namenjena poenostavitvi vašega knjigovodstva in povečanje vaše poslovne rasti. Uživajte v intuitivnih orodjih, vpogledih v realnem času in energičnem pristopu k vašim financam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Code of Conduct applies to all spaces managed by the Infinito.Nexus project, including GitHub repositories, mailing lists, chat rooms, and other communication channels."
msgstr "Tole. Code Vodenje se uporablja za vse prostore, ki jih upravlja Infinito.Nexus projekt, vključno z arhivi GitHub, poštnimi seznami, klepetalnicami in drugimi komunikacijskimi kanali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker Compose deployment automates the installation and operation of a Pixelfed instance."
msgstr "Tole. Docker Compose uporaba avtomatizira namestitev in delovanje a Pixelfed Primer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker Compose deployment sets up PeerTube with integrated support for essential services such as a PostgreSQL database, Redis cache, and an NGINX reverse proxy for secure HTTPS termination and domain routing. The configuration supports advanced security settings, modular service scaling, and automated environment injection."
msgstr "Tole. Docker Compose vzpostavitev uvajanja PeerTube z integrirano podporo za bistvene storitve, kot so PostgreSQL podatkovna zbirka, Redis predpomnilnik in obratni posrednik NGINX za varno zaključevanje HTTPS in usmerjanje domene. Konfiguracija podpira napredne varnostne nastavitve, modularno servisno povečevanje in avtomatizirano vbrizgo okolja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker Compose deployment uses Ansible automation to launch pgAdmin together with necessary network and volume configurations. It enables you to centrally manage your PostgreSQL databases with the following core software features:"
msgstr "Tole. Docker Compose uporaba uporablja Anzibilno avtomatizacijo za zagon pgAdmin skupaj s potrebnimi konfiguracijami omrežja in glasnosti. Omogoča vam centralno upravljanje PostgreSQL podatkovne zbirke z naslednjimi osnovnimi značilnostmi programske opreme:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker deployment uses Ansible automation to set up Snipe‑IT along with necessary services such as a MariaDB database, an optional OAuth2 proxy for additional security, and a reverse proxy configuration. The system is built for reliable asset management in various environments."
msgstr "Ta docker namestitev uporablja Ansible avtomatizacijo za vzpostavitev Snipe‑IT skupaj s potrebnimi storitvami, kot so MariaDB podatkovna zbirka, neobvezna OAuth2 posrednik za dodatno varnost in obratno konfiguracijo posrednika. Sistem je zgrajen za zanesljivo upravljanje premoženja v različnih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README accompanies the Hunspell Playbook, located within the ``infinito`` repository. The playbook is focused on installing Hunspell, a widely-used spell checker, along with various language packages to enhance its functionality."
msgstr "Ta README spremlja Hunspell Playbook, ki se nahaja znotraj ``infinito`` Skladišče. Knjiga predvajanja je osredotočena na namestitev Hunspell, široko uporablja preverjanje črkovanja, skupaj z različnimi jezikovnimi paketi za izboljšanje svoje funkcionalnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README accompanies the Hunspell Playbook, located within the `infinito` repository. The playbook is focused on installing Hunspell, a widely-used spell checker, along with various language packages to enhance its functionality."
msgstr "Ta README spremlja Hunspell Playbook, ki se nahaja znotraj `infinito` Skladišče. Knjiga predvajanja je osredotočena na namestitev Hunspell, široko uporablja preverjanje črkovanja, skupaj z različnimi jezikovnimi paketi za izboljšanje svoje funkcionalnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README file is for the Java role, which is part of the ``infinito``. The role is specifically designed to automate the installation of Java on a system, focusing on the OpenJDK 11 version."
msgstr "Ta datoteka README je za Java vloga, ki je del ``infinito``. Vloga je posebej zasnovan za avtomatizacijo namestitev Java na sistemu, ki se osredotoča na OpenJDK 11 verzija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README file is for the Java role, which is part of the `infinito`. The role is specifically designed to automate the installation of Java on a system, focusing on the OpenJDK 11 version."
msgstr "Ta datoteka README je za Java vloga, ki je del `infinito`. Vloga je posebej zasnovan za avtomatizacijo namestitev Java na sistemu, ki se osredotoča na OpenJDK 11 verzija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README is for the ``dsk-qbittorrent`` role within the ``infinito`` repository. This role is specifically crafted for installing qBittorrent, a popular open-source torrent client, on personal computers."
msgstr "Ta README je za ``dsk-qbittorrent`` vloga v okviru ``infinito`` Skladišče. Ta vloga je posebej oblikovana za namestitev qBittorrenta, priljubljenega odjemalca torrentov, na osebne računalnike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README is for the `dsk-qbittorrent` role within the `infinito` repository. This role is specifically crafted for installing qBittorrent, a popular open-source torrent client, on personal computers."
msgstr "Ta README je za `dsk-qbittorrent` vloga v okviru `infinito` Skladišče. Ta vloga je posebej oblikovana za namestitev qBittorrenta, priljubljenega odjemalca torrentov, na osebne računalnike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This WordPress setup integrates several powerful plugins to extend functionality with authentication, federation, and external discussion platforms:"
msgstr "Tole. WordPress nastavitev vključuje več zmogljivih plugins razširiti funkcionalnost z avtentikacijo, federacija, in zunanje diskusije platforme:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This also enables **fork PRs** to pull images without needing upstream credentials, because the mirror is public."
msgstr "To omogoča tudi **vilice za PR** da bi slikali brez poverilnic, ker je ogledalo javno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This also restarts `docker.service` and then calls `make network-refresh`, so the running Infinito development stack is recreated when one is active and the new setting reaches fresh container network namespaces."
msgstr "To tudi ponovno zažene `docker.service` In potem pokliče `make network-refresh`, tako da je tekoči Infinito razvoj sklad ponovno, ko je eden aktiven in nova nastavitev doseže sveže kontejnerske mreže imenski prostori."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This automated Docker Compose deployment streamlines the process by building a custom WordPress image (which includes tools like msmtp for email delivery) and configuring the necessary PHP settings, ensuring that your WordPress site is secure, scalable, and always up to date."
msgstr "To avtomatsko Docker Compose uporaba racionalizira proces z oblikovanjem po meri WordPress slika (ki vključuje orodja, kot so msmtp za elektronsko dostavo) in nastavitev potrebnih nastavitev PHP, ki zagotavljajo, da vaš WordPress mesto je varno, razkošno in vedno posodobljeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This avoids ABI and SONAME mismatches on rolling or less frequently rebuilt distributions."
msgstr "To preprečuje neskladja med ABI in SONAME pri rolkanju ali manj pogosto obnovljene distribucije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This avoids brittle parents[N] assumptions and fixes \"cli/cli/...\" path bugs."
msgstr "Tako se izognemo krhkim staršem[N] predpostavke in popravki \"cli/cli/...\" Žužki."

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span lost=['cli/cli/...']
# gained=['poticli/cli/...Težave.']
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: To preprečuje krhko gradnjo in popravke datotečne
# poticli/cli/...Težave.
msgid "This avoids fragile file path construction and fixes 'cli/cli/...' issues."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This behavior is controlled via:"
msgstr "To vedenje je nadzorovano z:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This bundle activates the following Infinito.Nexus roles:"
msgstr "Ta sveženj aktivira naslednje Infinito.Nexus vloge:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This command displays a list of all users."
msgstr "Ta ukaz prikazuje seznam vseh uporabnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This command lets you access the bash shell inside the `application` Docker container where Pixelfed is running."
msgstr "Ta ukaz vam omogoča dostop do bash lupine znotraj `application` Posoda za doke, kjer Pixelfed Beži."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This command will prompt you to enter the user's details like username, email, and password."
msgstr "Ta ukaz vas bo spodbudil, da vnesete podatke uporabnika, kot so uporabniško ime, e- pošta in geslo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you're looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Posoda je bila zapakirana YOURLS rešitev je zgrajena na robustnem Docker Compose in Anzibilna avtomatizacija. Poenostavlja proces uvajanja s povezovanjem s centralizirano MariaDB upravljanje in zagotavljanje vnaprej določenih zdravstvenih pregledov in okolja. Ne glede na to, ali želite hitro ustvariti nepozabne povezave ali pa potrebujete podrobno analitiko, ta uvedba brez težav podpira vašo digitalno strategijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you’re looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Posoda je bila zapakirana YOURLS rešitev je zgrajena na robustnem Docker Compose in Anzibilna avtomatizacija. Poenostavlja proces uvajanja s povezovanjem s centralizirano MariaDB upravljanje in zagotavljanje vnaprej določenih zdravstvenih pregledov in okolja. Ne glede na to, ali želite hitro ustvariti nepozabne povezave ali pa potrebujete podrobno analitiko, ta uporaba brez težav podpira vašo digitalno strategijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This decision is **load-bearing**: openresty owns the `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body-rewriting pipeline (CSP-meta stripping, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injection). Migrating to Traefik in v1 would silently drop that pipeline — it has no equivalent in Traefik without a non-trivial Yaegi-plugin port. Traefik migration is tracked as a Future Extension once edge-HA becomes worth the porting effort."
msgstr "Ta odločitev je **nosilnost**: Openresty je lastnik `sys-front-inj-*` Plinovod za popravilo telesa Lua (odstranjevanje CSP-meta, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Odjava snippet injekcija). Selitev na Traefik in v1 bi tiho spustili ta cevovod – v Traefiku nima ekvivalenta brez netrivialnega pristanišča Yaegi-plugin. Preseljevanje traefika se sledi kot razširitev prihodnosti, ko bo rob-HA vreden truda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This declares two variants. Variant 0 pins every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` to `enabled: true, shared: true` so the maximum-footprint baseline is explicit. Variant 1 keeps the same dynamic flags on and additionally flips Multisite on against three canonical domains."
msgstr "To razglaša dve varianti. Varianta 0 zatiči vsak dinamični delovni ključ od `meta/services.yml` do `enabled: true, shared: true` Tako da je osnova maksimalnega odtisa eksplicitna. Varianta 1 ohranja iste dinamične zastave na in dodatno preklopi Multisite na tri kanonične domene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This deployment simplifies LDAP management by presenting a modern web interface that lets you search, modify, and manage directory entries easily. It supports integration with external LDAP servers and works seamlessly behind a reverse proxy, allowing administrators to focus on core directory tasks rather than deployment intricacies."
msgstr "Ta uvedba poenostavi upravljanje LDAP s predstavitvijo sodobnega spletnega vmesnika, ki vam omogoča iskanje, spreminjanje in enostavno upravljanje vnosov v imenik. Podpira integracijo z zunanjimi LDAP strežniki in deluje brezhibno za obratnim posrednikom, kar administratorjem omogoča, da se raje osredotočijo na glavne naloge imenika kot pa na zaplete pri uvajanju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST NOT host application logic that belongs to an Ansible role."
msgstr "Ta imenik NE SME gostiti logike aplikacij, ki pripada neoporečni vlogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST NOT host host-side tooling. Scripts that run on the developer or CI host belong under their workflow-specific path (for example `scripts/tests/`, `scripts/image/`, `scripts/meta/`)."
msgstr "Ta imenik NE MORE gostiti orodja na strani gostitelja. Skripti, ki delujejo na razvijalcu ali gostitelju CI, spadajo pod njihovo delovno pot, specifično za potek dela (na primer `scripts/tests/`, `scripts/image/`, `scripts/meta/`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST contain only files consumed by the `coredns` compose service."
msgstr "Ta imenik MORA vsebovati samo datoteke, ki jih porabi `coredns` compose storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST contain only scripts that execute inside the `infinito` container, either as the container entrypoint, as a Docker `HEALTHCHECK`, or as a `systemd` unit hook."
msgstr "Ta imenik MORA vsebovati samo skripte, ki se izvajajo znotraj `infinito` zabojnik, bodisi kot vstopna točka zabojnika, kot docker `HEALTHCHECK`, ali kot `systemd` kljuka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Ansible collection requirement files used by the installation logic."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje datoteke z zahtevami za zbiranje Ansible, ki jih uporablja logika namestitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Jinja2 templates for different NGINX `location` blocks, each designed to proxy and optimize different types of web traffic. These templates are used by the `sys-svc-proxy` role to modularize and standardize reverse proxy configuration across a wide variety of applications."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje Jinjo2 predloge za različne NGINX `location` blokov, vsak je zasnovan tako, da omogoča in optimizira različne vrste spletnega prometa. Te predloge uporabljajo `sys-svc-proxy` vlogo za modularizacijo in standardizacijo konfiguracije povratnih posrednikov v različnih aplikacijah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Pull Request-specific resolver scripts used by the PR workflow."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte, specifične za Pull Request, ki jih uporablja delovni tok PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains action-oriented runbooks for agent work. Its scope is how agents should develop, debug, test, refactor, commit, and handle pull requests while staying aligned with repository policy."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje akcijsko usmerjene runbooks za delo agenta. Njegovo področje uporabe je, kako naj bi se agenti razvili, razhroščevali, preizkušali, refaktorirali, se zavezali in obvladovali zahteve po vleki, medtem ko bi ostali usklajeni s politiko skladišča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains administrator-facing configuration references for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is the global and per-application settings operators adjust through inventory, group vars, and application overrides."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje administrator-privzete nastavitve reference za Infinito.Nexus. Njegov obseg je globalnih in na aplikacijo nastavitve upravljavci prilagodijo z inventarjem, skupine vars, in aplikacija razveljavi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains administrator-facing operational guides for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is CLI installation, inventory creation, and deploy and redeploy flows for running environments."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje operativne smernice za administratorje Infinito.Nexus. Njegov obseg je namestitev CLI, ustvarjanje inventarja in uporabo in prerazporeditev tokov za tekoče okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains agent guidance for `group_vars` files. Its scope is how automated changes should handle shared application inventory data, lookup overrides, and related variable definitions."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje navodila za agente za `group_vars` datoteke. Njegovo področje uporabe je način, kako naj bi avtomatizirane spremembe obravnavale skupne podatke popisa aplikacij, nadzor nad iskanjem in s tem povezane opredelitve spremenljivk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains agent guidance for role-local implementation files. Its scope is CSS, JavaScript, Playwright, and other role-specific files that require consistent behavior during automated edits."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje navodila za vlogo-lokalno izvajanje datotek. Njegov obseg je CSS, JavaScript, Playwright, in druge datoteke, specifične za vlogo, ki zahtevajo dosledno vedenje med avtomatizirano urejanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains all deployable bundles for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje vse pakete, ki jih je mogoče razporediti za Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains automation scripts used across the project."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte avtomatizacije, ki se uporabljajo v celotnem projektu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for GitHub Container Registry usage. Its scope is authentication, cleanup, and other GHCR-specific operational concerns in the repository."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje navodila za uporabo GitHub Container Register. Njegovo področje uporabe je avtentikacija, čiščenje in drugi operativni pomisleki, specifični za GHCR, v repozitoriju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for GitHub governance and repository controls. Its scope is branch protection, repository settings, GitHub Actions workflows and variables, and other platform rules that affect contributions."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje smernice za upravljanje in nadzor skladišča GitHub. Njegov obseg je zaščita podružnic, nastavitve skladišča, GitHub Actions delovni tokovi in spremenljivke, in druga pravila platforme, ki vplivajo na prispevke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for Infinito.Nexus shared services. Its scope is the model that defines how shared services are declared, discovered, loaded, injected, and consumed, plus the per-service contracts that role authors and consumers MUST follow."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje navodila za prispevke za Infinito.Nexus skupne storitve. Njegov obseg je model, ki opredeljuje, kako so skupne storitve prijavljene, odkrite, naložene, vbrizgane in porabljene, ter pogodbe na storitev, ki jim morajo slediti avtorji in potrošniki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for automated tests. Its scope is how lint, unit, integration, regression, and Playwright coverage should be structured, selected, and validated."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje navodila za avtomatizirane teste. Njegov obseg je način, kako naj bi bila pokritost z vodo, enoto, integracijo, regresijo in Playwrightom strukturirana, izbrana in potrjena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for code design and implementation. Its scope is architecture, service wiring, coding principles, exceptions, and the boundaries that shape maintainable changes."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje smernice za oblikovanje in izvajanje kod. Njegov obseg je arhitektura, ožičenje storitev, načela kodiranja, izjeme in meje, ki oblikujejo trajne spremembe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for container image artefacts. Its scope is how images are declared, discovered, mirrored, and maintained across the repository and CI flow."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje navodila, ki prispevajo za vsebniške slike artefaktov. Njegov obseg je, kako so slike deklarirane, odkrite, zrcaljene in vzdrževane po celotnem skladišču in CI toku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for local environments. Its scope is setup, supported operating systems, variables, and resource constraints for running the project safely on a workstation."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje smernice za lokalna okolja. Njegov obseg je nastavitev, podprti operacijski sistemi, spremenljivke in omejitve virov za varno vodenje projekta na delovni postaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for project tools. Its scope is how repository-standard tools should be used, when they apply, and where they fit into the wider workflow."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje smernice za projektna orodja. Njegovo področje uporabe je način uporabe orodij, ki so standardna za shranjevanje, kadar se uporabljajo in kjer se prilegajo širšemu poteku dela."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for team collaboration, communication, and organisational processes. Its scope is how contributors communicate, document their work, and apply agile principles across the project lifecycle."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje smernice za sodelovanje, komunikacijo in organizacijske procese. Njegov obseg je način, kako prispevajoči komunicirajo, dokumentirajo svoje delo in uporabljajo agilna načela v celotnem življenjskem ciklu projekta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for Ansible lookup plugins under [plugins/lookup/](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/). Its scope is how the project exposes merged configuration data to runtime consumers without materializing repository-wide facts."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pravila prispevanja za Ansible lookup vstavke pod [vstavki/pogled/](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/). Njegov obseg je način, kako projekt izpostavlja združene konfiguracijske podatke za potrošnike v času delovanja, ne da bi se uresničila dejstva na ravni skladišča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for Git-managed artefacts and CI/CD pipeline conventions. Its scope is how branches, commits, pull requests, the CI/CD pipeline, and the maintainer's fork-based remote layout MUST be structured and used in this repository."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pravila prispevanja za Git- upravlja artefakte in konvencije CI/CD plinovod. Njegovo področje uporabe je, kako morajo biti veje, obveze, zahteve za vlečenje, cevovod CI/CD in daljinska postavitev vzdrževalca na vilicah strukturirani in uporabljeni v tem skladišču."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for `README.md` files stored inside documentation directories. Its scope is purpose, scope, and navigation behavior for docs-scoped READMEs."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pravila prispevanja za `README.md` datoteke, shranjene v imenikih dokumentacije. Njegov obseg je namen, obseg in navigacijsko vedenje za docs-scoped READMEs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for files under [plugins/](../../../../../plugins/). Its scope is how Ansible plugin sources MUST be structured so that runtime consumers, tests, and documentation stay aligned."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pravila prispevanja za datoteke pod [vstavki/](../../../../../plugins/). Njegov obseg je, kako Ansible plugin viri morajo biti strukturirani tako, da čas delovanja potrošnikov, testi, in dokumentacija ostanejo usklajeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for project artefacts. Its scope is how repository-managed files and generated delivery artefacts should be documented, structured, and maintained."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pravila prispevanja za projektne artefakte. Njegovo področje uporabe je način vodenja datotek in generiranih dostavnih artefaktov, ki jih je treba dokumentirati, strukturirati in vzdrževati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for role-local files. Its scope is how key artefacts inside roles should be written so generated behavior, documentation, and frontend overrides stay consistent."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pravila prispevanja za lokalne datoteke. Njegov obseg je, kako ključne artefakte znotraj vlog je treba napisati tako generirano vedenje, dokumentacija, in frontend prevlada ostati skladen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for specific repository file types. Its scope is authoring expectations for human-facing files whose structure and meaning must stay consistent across the project."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pravila prispevanja za določene vrste datotek skladišča. Njegov obseg je ustvarjanje pričakovanj za človeka obrnjene datoteke, katerih struktura in pomen morata ostati skladna v celotnem projektu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor workflow guidance. Its scope is branch strategy, commits, testing, local deploys, CI, review, pull requests, releases, and the end-to-end path from local change to merged contribution."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje navodila za potek dela. Njegovo področje uporabe so podružnična strategija, zaveze, testiranje, lokalne razporeditve, CI, pregled, zahtevki za umik, izpusti in pot od konca do konca od lokalne spremembe do združenega prispevka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor-facing repository rules and workflows. Its scope is how humans and agents set up the environment, write documentation, communicate, define requirements, and contribute safely through the project lifecycle."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pravila in delovne tokove arhiva, ki se nanašajo na prispevke. Njegov obseg je način, kako ljudje in agenti postavljajo okolje, pišejo dokumentacijo, komunicirajo, opredeljujejo zahteve in varno prispevajo skozi življenjski cikel projekta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible filter plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje po meri **Vstavki za Ansible filter** uporabljeno v okviru Infinito.Nexus projekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible lookup plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje po meri **Vstavki za iskanje po možnosti** uporabljeno v okviru Infinito.Nexus projekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains debugging guidance for contributor workflows. Its scope is how to investigate failures in CI, networking, and related development loops."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje navodila za razhroščevanje za delo, ki prispeva. Njegov obseg je, kako raziskati napake v KI, mreženju in povezanih razvojnih zank."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains default variable definition files for the `svc-db-mariadb` Ansible role. It centralizes all configurable values related to MariaDB deployment and can be adjusted without modifying task logic."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje privzete datoteke z opredelitvijo spremenljivk za `svc-db-mariadb` Negotova vloga. Centralizira vse nastavljive vrednosti, povezane z MariaDB uporaba in se lahko prilagodi brez spreminjanja logike nalog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains documentation for contributors working alongside AI coding agents in this project. It covers shared agent guidelines that apply regardless of the AI tool used, as well as tool-specific permission references and security rationale for each supported agent."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje dokumentacijo za prispevajoče, ki delajo poleg AI kodnih agentov v tem projektu. Zajema smernice za deljena sredstva, ki se uporabljajo ne glede na uporabljeno orodje AI, pa tudi reference za posebna dovoljenja in varnostne utemeljitve za vsakega podprtega agenta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains file-scoped guidance for automated edits. Its scope is machine-readable rules that apply when an agent modifies specific repository file types or configuration areas."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje datotečno podprte smernice za samodejno urejanje. Njegovo področje uporabe so strojno berljiva pravila, ki se uporabljajo, ko agent spremeni določene vrste datotek v skladišču ali konfiguracijska področja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains gating helpers that decide whether a tagged commit is eligible for release. The current gate enforces that the version-tag commit is contained in `origin/main`, so version tags pushed from feature branches cannot trigger a release. Helpers MUST be invoked from release-related workflows only and MUST NOT be treated as a substitute for branch protection; the gate is an additional check on top of, not a replacement for, the repository's branch-protection rules."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje gating pomočniki, ki se odločijo, ali a tagged zaveza je primerna za sprostitev. Trenutna vrata uveljavljajo, da je zaveza z oznako različice vsebovana v `origin/main`, tako različice značke potiskane iz funkcijskih vej ne more sprožiti sprostitev. Pomočnikov se je treba sklicevati samo na poteke dela, povezane z izdajo, in NE SME biti obravnavan kot nadomestilo za zaščito podružnic; vrata so dodatna kontrola poleg pravil o zaščiti podružnic v repozitoriju, ne pa kot zamenjava."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains generic wait and polling scripts used by workflow automation."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje generično čakanje in anketne skripte, ki jih uporablja avtomatizacija delovnega toka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helper scripts and binaries that are installed on the host to provide **container-related runtime functionality** for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte pomočnika in binare, ki so nameščeni na gostitelju za zagotavljanje **Funkcionalnost delovanja v zvezi s posodo** besedilo Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helpers invoked from workflows that listen on `pull_request_target`, `push`, and `delete`. The helpers call the GitHub Actions API to cancel runs made obsolete by a closed PR, a deleted branch, or a newer commit on the same PR or branch. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows that have not received one of those events, because cancelling unrelated runs would mask real failures and waste accumulated work."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pomočnike, ki se sklicujejo na delovne tokove, ki poslušajo `pull_request_target`, `push`, in `delete`. Pomočniki pokličejo dejanja GitHub API za preklic potov, ki so zastareli zaradi zaprtega PR, izbrisane podružnice ali novejše obveznosti za isto PR ali podružnico. Pomočnikov NE SME klicati iz delovnih tokov, ki niso prejeli enega od teh dogodkov, saj bi preklic nepovezanih tekov prikril resnične napake in odpadke, ki so nakopičeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helpers that mutate persistent on-host state during purge flows."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pomočnike, ki mutirajo stalno stanje na gostitelju med čiščenjem tokov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains host-level helpers: disk-space reclamation and reporting, swap-file enlargement, Docker-daemon cleanup, and post-failure diagnostic dumps. Helpers MUST be invoked from workflow `run:` blocks under [`.github/workflows/`](../../../.github/workflows/) and MUST NOT be called from application code, Ansible roles, or any runtime path outside CI. They assume a GitHub-hosted Ubuntu runner and modify host-kernel state (mount points, swap, Docker storage) that does not exist inside the `infinito` container."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje pomočnike na ravni gostitelja: reklamacija diska in poročanje, širitev datotek swap-daemon, čiščenje Docker-daemon in diagnostične smetišča po neuspehu. Pomočnike je treba opozoriti na potek dela `run:` bloki pod [`.github/workflows/`](../../../.github/workflows/) in NE SME se pozvati iz prijavne kode, Ansible vlog ali katere koli poti poteka zunaj CI. Prevzemajo GitHub-gostuje Ubuntu tekač in spremeniti stanje gostitelj-jekel (priklopne točke, zamenjava, skladišče Docker) ki ne obstaja znotraj `infinito` zabojnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains language-specific coding guidance. Its scope is conventions that only apply to particular implementation languages when the general code rules need narrower detail."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje jezikovne smernice za kodiranje. Njegovo področje uporabe so konvencije, ki se uporabljajo samo za določene izvedbene jezike, kadar je treba pravila splošnega kodeksa bolj podrobno opredeliti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains machine-readable guidance for AI agents working in this repository. Its scope is agent behavior, required workflows, and specialized instruction files that extend [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for automated execution."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje strojno berljiva navodila za agente AI, ki delajo v tem skladišču. Njegov obseg je agent vedenje, zahteva potek dela, in specializirana navodila datotek, ki širijo [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) za avtomatsko izvedbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains meta-level guidance for agent behavior. Its scope is purpose, ethics, help paths, communication style, and other repository-wide framing for automated contributors."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje meta-ravni smernice za vedenje agenta. Njegov obseg je namen, etika, poti pomoči, komunikacijski slog in drugo oblikovanje po vsej zbirki za avtomatizirane prispevajoče osebe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains operational documentation for the Nextcloud role in Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje operativno dokumentacijo za Nextcloud vloga v Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific environment setup guidance. Its scope is operating-system differences that affect local development and execution."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje smernice za nastavitev okolja za posamezne platforme. Njegov obseg so razlike v operativnem sistemu, ki vplivajo na lokalni razvoj in izvajanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for enabling systemd in environments where it is not active by default. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte za posamezne platforme za omogočanje sistema v okoljih, kjer privzeto ni aktiven. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for setting up local DNS resolution for the `infinito.test` domain (and subdomains) on the development machine."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte za posamezne platforme za nastavljanje lokalne ločljivosti DNS za `infinito.test` domena (in poddomene) na razvojni napravi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for trusting the Infinito Root CA certificate on the developer's machine. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte za posamezne platforme za zaupanje certifikata Infinito Root CA na stroju razvijalca. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project requirements documents. Its scope is user stories and acceptance criteria that define what the project must do and that guide agent-assisted implementation."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje dokumente o projektnih zahtevah. Njegov obseg so uporabniške zgodbe in merila sprejemljivosti, ki določajo, kaj mora projekt storiti in kaj vodi izvajanje s pomočjo posrednika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project-specific Ansible modules used by Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje projektno specifične Ansible module, ki jih uporablja Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains pure resolvers that read repository state (git history, role metadata, version tags, input environment variables) and emit resolved values either via `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` or stdout. Resolvers MUST be idempotent and MUST NOT mutate repository or registry state beyond writing to `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`. The covered concerns are diff-driven app whitelist resolution, the `🧩 Subset` label dispatch (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, which picks between the PR-body subset and the diff resolver), release-tag detection, app discovery for the deploy matrix, and change detection that gates the update pipeline."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje čiste reševalce, ki berejo stanje skladišča (zgodovina git, metapodatki o vlogi, oznake različic, spremenljivke vhodnega okolja) in oddajajo odpravljene vrednosti bodisi preko `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` ali stdout. Reševalci morajo biti idempotentni in ne smejo mutirati skladišča ali registra države, ki presega pisno `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`. Obravnavani pomisleki so na diff pogon aplikacija beli seznam ločljivosti, `🧩 Subset` odprema nalepke (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, ki izbira med podskupino PR-telesa in diff reševalcem), zaznavanje opozorilnih oznak, odkrivanje aplikacij za matriko in spreminjanje zaznav, ki odpirajo plinovod."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains repository-specific resolvers used across workflows and shell helpers."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje reševalce, specifične za skladišče, ki se uporabljajo med delovnimi tokovi in pomočniki školjk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains resolver scripts for detecting missing derived artifacts and release metadata."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje razreševalne skripte za odkrivanje manjkajočih izpeljanih artefaktov in metapodatkov o izdaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing TLS/PKI concerns in the Infinito Nexus development environment. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte za upravljanje TLS/PKI skrbi v razvojnem okolju Infinito Nexus. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing systemd across different platforms and environments used in Infinito Nexus development. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte za upravljanje sistema po različnih platformah in okoljih, ki se uporabljajo v razvoju Infinito Nexus. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts related to the image lifecycle used by the project."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte, povezane z življenjskim ciklom slike, ki ga uporablja projekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that install and bootstrap host-side tooling used by the project."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte, ki namestijo in bootstrap gostitelj-side orodje, ki ga uporablja projekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that resolve metadata and derived values used by the project."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte, ki rešujejo metapodatke in izpeljane vrednosti, ki jih uporablja projekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that run repository lint checks."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skripte, ki poganjajo preverjanja odložišča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains security guidance for Infinito.Nexus users and administrators. Its scope is operational security expectations, reporting paths, and role-specific hardening advice."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje varnostne smernice za Infinito.Nexus uporabniki in administratorji. Njegovo področje uporabe so pričakovanja glede operativne varnosti, načini poročanja in svetovanje za krepitev vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains shared Python helpers used by custom modules and plugins."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skupne Python pomočnike, ki jih uporabljajo moduli in vstavki po meri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains shell helpers that synchronize repository refs before later workflow jobs derive CI scope from git history."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje lupinske pomočnike, ki sinhronizirajo skladišče refs pred kasnejšimi delovnim potekom opravil, ki izhajajo iz obsega CI iz zgodovine git."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the AppArmor-facing maintenance layer for the local and CI development experience."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje na AppArmor obrnjeno vzdrževalno plast za lokalno in CI razvojno izkušnjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the [Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` applied to every host in the inventory. It holds the shared baseline that every role and every host-specific var can build on top of."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje [Anzible](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` se nanaša na vsakega gostitelja v popisu. To je skupna osnova, ki jo lahko vsaka vloga in vsak posamezni gostitelj var graditi na vrhu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the helpers invoked by [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) to bump pinned upstream versions and open a pull request once per day. The helpers are thin wrappers: the image-version and repository-ref bumpers delegate to Python CLIs under [cli/contributing/](../../../cli/contributing/) that scan `roles/*/meta/services.yml` and rewrite version pins in place; the PR-open helper commits, force-pushes the update branch, and creates or refreshes the PR via `gh`. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows other than `🔄 Update versions`; the `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` gate is enforced once, at the workflow's job level, and bypassing it from another caller would create PRs even when auto-updates are intentionally disabled."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pomočnike, ki se jih sklicuje [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) enkrat na dan. Pomočniki so tanki ovitki: odbijači iz različice slike in odbijači iz skladišča prenesejo na Python CLIS pod [kli/prispevek/](../../../cli/contributing/) Ta slika. `roles/*/meta/services.yml` in prepisati različice zatiči na mestu; PR-odprti pomočnik se zavezuje, sila-pushes posodobitev veje, in ustvarja ali osveži PR preko `gh`. Pomočnikov ne smemo klicati iz delovnih tokov razen `🔄 Update versions`; `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` Vrata se uveljavijo enkrat, na ravni delovnega procesa, in zaostanek iz drugega klicatelja bi ustvaril PR, tudi če so avtomatske posodobitve namerno onemogočene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the iteration loops agents follow while driving a role end to end: the [Compose Loop](compose.md), the [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), the [Playwright Spec Loop](playwright.md), the [Workflow Loop](workflow.md), and the cross-mode [Roundtrip Loop](roundtrip.md) gate that runs compose then swarm. Its scope is the mechanics of those loops."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje iteracijske zanke agenti sledijo med vožnjo vlogo konec: [Zanka sestavljanja](compose.md), [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), [Predvajaj Spec Loop](playwright.md), [Zanka za potek dela](workflow.md), in prečno stanje [Roundtrip Loop](roundtrip.md) Vrata, ki tečejo, sestavljajo roj. Njegov obseg je mehanika teh zank."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the modular workspace test suite for Infinito.Nexus. It validates the full local development flow from a clean state."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje modularni preizkusni apartma delovnega prostora za Infinito.Nexus. To potrjuje celoten lokalni razvoj iz čiste države."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the repository documentation published for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is contributor guidance, agent instructions, operational guides, requirements, and security guidance across the project."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje dokumentacijo skladišča, objavljeno za Infinito.Nexus. Njegovo področje uporabe so smernice, ki prispevajo k projektu, navodila zastopnikov, operativni vodniki, zahteve in varnostne smernice v celotnem projektu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the shared environment bootstrap layer for Infinito.Nexus scripts. ✨"
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje skupno okolje bootstrap plast za Infinito.Nexus Scenariji. ✨"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the shell helpers that [entry-pr-translate.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-translate.yml) calls: resolving the languages LibreTranslate supports into the job matrix, merging the source strings of the `core` and `docs` domains into `locale/`, and machine-translating one language per runner."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje pomočnike lupin, ki [entry-pr-translate.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-translate.yml) pozivi: reševanje jezikov LibreTranslate podpira v matriko opravil, združuje izvorne nize `core` ter `docs` domene v `locale/`, in strojno prevajanje enega jezika na tekača."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains variable definition files for the `svc-db-mariadb` Ansible role. It centralizes all configurable values related to MariaDB deployment and can be adjusted without modifying task logic."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje datoteke s spremenljivo opredelitvijo za `svc-db-mariadb` Negotova vloga. Centralizira vse nastavljive vrednosti, povezane z MariaDB uporaba in se lahko prilagodi brez spreminjanja logike nalog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains workstation bundle skeletons."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje okostnjake z delovno postajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory documents GitHub Actions in this repository."
msgstr "Ta mapa dokumentira dejanja GitHub v tem skladišču."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory documents how agents MUST debug failures during agent work. Its scope covers three independent workflows: local deploys (debugged from live local output and local logs), GitHub Actions / CI run failures (fully automated triage that fetches logs and artefacts itself via `gh`), and ad-hoc inspection of log files manually placed in the repository workdir by the operator."
msgstr "Ta mapa dokumentira, kako agenti MORAjo razhroščevati napake med delom agenta. Njegovo področje uporabe zajema tri neodvisne delovne tokove: lokalne napotitve (brisan iz lokalnega izpisa v živo in krajevnih dnevnikov), Dejanja GitHub / napake delovanja CI (popolnoma avtomatizirana triaža, ki prinaša dnevnike in artefakte sama preko `gh`), in ad-hoc pregled dnevniških datotek ročno dal v skladišču, ki ga upravlja operator."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory follows the same high-level structure as `package-manager`:"
msgstr "Ta imenik sledi isti strukturi na visoki ravni kot `package-manager`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds DNS helpers used during development and environment preparation. The folder contains the local name-resolution setup and teardown logic used during development and environment preparation. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik ima DNS pomočnike, ki se uporabljajo med pripravo na razvoj in okolje. Mapa vsebuje lokalno nastavitev imena-resolucije in rušenje logike, ki se uporablja med pripravo razvoja in okolja. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds Docker-related network helpers. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik ima pomočnike omrežja, povezane z Dockerjem. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds IPv6 enable and restore helpers for local development. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md). For the generic stack refresh helper used by `make network-refresh`, see [../docker/README.md](../docker/README.md)."
msgstr "Ta mapa ima IPv6 omogočiti in obnoviti pomočnike za lokalni razvoj. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md). Za splošni sklad osvežitveni pomočnik, ki ga uporablja `make network-refresh`, Vidiš? [../docker/README.md](../docker/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds PHP files that the [web-app-wordpress](../../) role copies into the running container at `/var/www/html/wp-content/mu-plugins/`."
msgstr "Ta imenik ima PHP datoteke, ki [web-app-wordpress](../../) kopije vlog v tekoči posodi na `/var/www/html/wp-content/mu-plugins/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds container-side helpers grouped by area. Use the README in each child directory as the canonical entry point for that area. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje pomočnike ob zabojnikih, združene po področjih. Uporabite README v vsakem imeniku otrok kot kanonično vstopno točko za to področje. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds host and system cleanup helpers. For container-local cleanup helpers, see [../../container/purge/README.md](../../container/purge/README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik ima pomočnike za čiščenje gostitelja in sistema. Za čistilce vsebnikov glej [../../container/purge/README.md](../../container/purge/README.md). Za kanonično Naredite ciljni indeks, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds network helpers grouped by area. Use the child README files for the DNS, Docker, and IPv6 details. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje omrežne pomočnike, združene po področjih. Uporabite datoteke otrok README za DNS, Docker in IPv6 podrobnosti. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds system-facing helpers grouped by area. Use the README in each child directory as the canonical entry point for that area. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik vsebuje sistemsko obrnjene pomočnike, združene po področjih. Uporabite README v vsakem imeniku otrok kot kanonično vstopno točko za to področje. Za indeks kanoničnih Naredite cilj, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the Git workflow helper scripts. These helpers own the Git operations that the Claude sandbox denies, so they run under the operator's control with access to `~/.gnupg` and interactive `pinentry`. For the canonical command index, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje Git skripti za pomoč pri delu. Ti pomočniki imajo v lasti Git operacije, ki jih Claude Sandbox zanika, zato delujejo pod nadzorom operaterja z dostopom do `~/.gnupg` in interaktivno `pinentry`. Za indeks kanoničnega ukaza glej [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the architecture decision records of Infinito.Nexus. A record states one decision that shapes the system, the forces that constrain it, and what living with it costs."
msgstr "Ta imenik ima evidenco arhitekturnih odločitev Infinito.Nexus. V zapisu je navedena ena odločitev, ki oblikuje sistem, sile, ki ga omejujejo in koliko stane življenje z njim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the cleanup helpers under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/`. For other local helpers, use [../README.md](../README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta imenik ima pomočnike za čiščenje pod `scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/`. Za druge lokalne pomočnike uporabite [../README.md](../README.md). Za kanonično Naredite ciljni indeks, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the container execution helpers under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/`. For other local helpers, use [../README.md](../README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta mapa vsebuje vsebniške pomočnike `scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/`. Za druge lokalne pomočnike uporabite [../README.md](../README.md). Za kanonično Naredite ciljni indeks, ki se sklicuje na te pomočnike, glej [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the contributor guidance for how Infinito.Nexus integrates applications with the shared identity providers, Keycloak (OIDC) and OpenLDAP. Read the pages here before adding or changing any login, user-provisioning, or role-mapping code in a role."
msgstr "V tej mapi so navodila za prispevanje, kako Infinito.Nexus vključuje aplikacije s skupnimi ponudniki identitete, Keycloak (OIDC) ter OpenLDAP. Preberite strani tukaj pred dodajanjem ali spreminjanjem vse prijave, uporabnik-zagotavljanje, ali načrtovanje vlog kodo v vlogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable CI deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/ci/`."
msgstr "Ta imenik ima izvedljive tokove CI `scripts/tests/deploy/ci/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable act deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/act/`."
msgstr "Ta mapa ima izvedljivo dejanje, ki uporablja tokove pod `scripts/tests/deploy/act/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable local deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`."
