# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is the ``core`` domain's counterpart to the sphinx transform the ``docs`` domain carries: ``core`` never passes through sphinx, so a message that is nothing but a name would otherwise reach its catalog while the same message is withheld from the other domain."
msgstr "To je ``core`` domena proti sfingi preoblikovanje ``docs`` prenosi domen: ``core`` nikoli ne gre skozi sfingo, tako sporočilo, ki ni nič drugega kot ime bi sicer dosegla svoj katalog, medtem ko je isto sporočilo zadržano iz druge domene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This is the mechanism that lets variants control whether a shared service is pulled in: a variant override pins `services.<service>.{enabled,shared}` to a literal boolean; the round's include resolution reads the variant-merged services map; the provider role's group materialises in (or drops out of) the inventory accordingly."
msgstr "To je mehanizem, ki omogoča variantam nadzor nad tem, ali je skupna storitev potegnjena noter: zatiči za nadzor različic `services.<service>.{enabled,shared}` Do dobesednega booleana; v krog je vključena resolucija, ki se glasi zemljevid storitev, povezanih z varianto, skupina ponudnikov pa se uresniči v (ali kapljic iz) popisu ustrezno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is the one clause that carries a hard guarantee, so it is enforced rather than asserted. In compose the agent role reads the runtime the container actually received and refuses the deploy when it is `runc`. In swarm the node reads its own default runtime and refuses the sandbox label while that is still `runc`, because the label is what routes sandboxed services to it. A lint additionally refuses a privileged container, a host network, pid, ipc or user namespace, and a host docker socket in any role that declares the sandbox, since any one of those hands the workload back to the host and cancels the runtime."
msgstr "To je tista klavzula, ki nosi trdno jamstvo, zato se izvaja namesto uveljavlja. Pri sestavljanju vloge povzročitelja se prebere čas delovanja vsebnika, ki ga je dejansko prejel, in zavrne uporabo, ko je `runc`. V roju vozlišče prebere svoj privzeti čas delovanja in zavrne oznako peskovnika, medtem ko je to še vedno `runc`, ker je nalepka tisto, kar je peščene škatle storitev za to. Lint dodatno zavrne privilegiran zabojnik, gostiteljsko omrežje, pid, ipc ali uporabniški imenski prostor in gostiteljsko vtičnico v kateri koli vlogi, ki razglasi peskovnik, saj kateri koli od teh poda delovno obremenitev nazaj na gostitelja in prekliče čas delovanja."

