msgid "This lookup is the single sanctioned way to derive the Keycloak group path that an application role maps to. It replaces the scattered `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` idiom so the per-application OU hierarchy has one authoritative producer."
msgstr "To iskanje je edini sankcioniran način za izpeljavo Keycloak skupinska pot, na katero se nanašajo zemljevidi vlog programa. Nadomesti raztresene `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` idiom, tako da ima hierarhija OU na aplikacijo enega avtoritativnega proizvajalca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This major release migrates every role to the new meta/ layout with explicit per-role networks, ports, run_after, and info.yml metadata, introduces a variant-aware matrix-deploy planner, ships a process-wide YAML / file / registry caching stack, promotes 13+ apps from alpha to beta, and adds a lint corpus that pins the new conventions in CI."
msgstr "Ta večji izpust prenese vsako vlogo na novo meta/ postavitev z eksplicitno na role omrežja, pristanišča, run_after, in info.yml metapodatkov, uvaja načrtovalnik matrice za uporabo variant, ladje po celotnem postopku YAML / datoteko / register caching sklad, spodbuja 13+ aplikacije od alfa do beta in doda lit corpus, ki veže nove konvencije v CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This makes Home Assistant a natural [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **MCP server role** and the concrete backend for the isolated-home-assistant scenario in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): the agent stays kernel-isolated and reaches the home only through this MCP surface, never through host access. Home Assistant runs natively on `arm64`/Raspberry Pi, so it co-locates with the Pi agent story."
msgstr "To naredi Home Assistant naravni [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **Vloga strežnika MCP** in betonsko podporo za izolirano-doma-pomožni scenarij v [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): agens ostane jedrno izoliran in doseže dom samo skozi to MCP površino, nikoli skozi dostop gostitelja. Domov Pomočnik teče doma na `arm64`Jagodna pita, torej se solašča z zgodbo o pi agentu."

