msgid "This maps all `@cymais.cloud` addresses to their equivalents under `@infinito.nexus`."
msgstr "To je zemljevid. `@cymais.cloud` naslovi enakovrednih naslovov `@infinito.nexus`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This means mirrored images are published as public packages without any additional configuration."
msgstr "To pomeni, da so zrcalne slike objavljene kot javni paketi brez kakršne koli dodatne konfiguracije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This means:"
msgstr "To pomeni:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This minor release adds Mattermost deployment support, improves release image automation, and hardens CI, Ansible plugin handling, and application deployment reliability across the stack."
msgstr "Ta manjši izpust dodaja Mattermost podpora za uporabo, izboljša sprostitev avtomatizacijo slik, in utrdi CI, Ansible plugin ravnanje, in aplikacija uvajanje zanesljivost po nizu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This minor release improves cross-distro package handling, hardens CI reliability, fixes Ansible compatibility issues, and adds clearer contributor and local test workflows."
msgstr "Ta manjša sprostitev izboljša navzkrižno ravnanje z distro paketi, utrjuje zanesljivost KI, določa vprašanja o nezanesljivi združljivosti, ter dodaja jasnejše prispeva in lokalne testne delovne tokove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module exposes a single cached `load_yaml(path)` so each absolute path is parsed at most once per Python process. `dump_yaml` writes through and evicts the cached entry. `invalidate(path)` is the explicit escape hatch when a caller knows a file was changed externally."
msgstr "Ta modul izpostavlja en predpomnilnik `load_yaml(path)` Tako se vsaka absolutna pot razčleni največ enkrat na Python proces. `dump_yaml` Zapiše in izseli skriti vnos. `invalidate(path)` je izrecna loputa za zasilni izhod, ko klicatelj ve, da je bila datoteka zunaj spremenjena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module finds those declarations, indexes them by id and resolves one for a target distribution. The declaration shape itself lives in :mod:`utils.packages.schema`."
msgstr "Ta modul najde te deklaracije, jih indeksira z ID in reši eno za porazdelitev ciljev. Deklaracija sama po sebi živi v :mod:`utils.packages.schema`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module is intentionally ansible-free and dependency-light so it can be imported from the lint layer, the external test layer, and the update automation without dragging deploy-time machinery in."
msgstr "Ta modul je namerno neranljiv in odvisen od svetlobe, tako da ga je mogoče uvoziti iz plasti line, zunanjega preskusnega sloja in avtomatizacijo posodobitev brez vlečenja uvajalnega časa stroj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module is the single source of truth for role-level dependencies: the paths inside a role directory, the role types each path may legitimately appear under, the mandatory shape of those paths, and the ``marker`` entries that drive role-type detection itself. Both lint tests and the role-type predicate live downstream of this file:"
msgstr "Ta modul je edini vir resnice za odvisnosti na ravni vloge: poti znotraj imenika vlog, vrste vlog, pod katerimi se lahko upravičeno pojavi vsaka pot, obvezna oblika teh poti in ``marker`` vnosi, ki same zaznavajo vlogo. Testi linte in predikat tipa vlog živijo v smeri toka od te datoteke:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module is the single source of truth for that rule. The Keycloak realm group builder, the LDAP role entry builder and the Open WebUI group reconciler all resolve membership through it, so the three paths cannot drift."
msgstr "Ta modul je edini vir resnice za to pravilo. – Keycloak realm grup builder, LDAP graditelj vlog vstop in Open WebUI skupinski spravnik vse razreši članstvo skozi njega, tako da tri poti ne morejo zaiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module owns the file's location and the tree-walking primitives. Consumers MUST resolve the path through :func:`categories_file` rather than spelling it themselves, so a future move touches one line."
msgstr "Ta modul je lastnik lokacije in primitivcev. Potrošniki morajo rešiti pot skozi :func:`categories_file` Namesto da bi jo črkovali sami, se bodoča poteza dotakne ene vrstice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This opens the Playwright Inspector alongside a browser. Every interaction is recorded and emitted as a runnable spec. Use the output as a starting draft and clean it up according to the authoring rules in [`playwright.spec.js`](../../artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md)."
msgstr "To odpre Playwright inšpektor poleg brskalnika. Vsaka interakcija je zabeležena in oddana kot specifikacija. Uporabite izhod kot začetni osnutek in ga očistite v skladu z avtorskimi pravili v [`playwright.spec.js`](../../artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This package contains shared Python helpers that operate on the central `applications` configuration dictionary."
msgstr "Ta paket vsebuje skupne Python pomočnike, ki delujejo na osrednji `applications` konfiguracijski slovar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This package contains shared domain-related utility code for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Ta paket vsebuje skupno domensko komunalno kodo za Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This package contains the in-process cache layers Infinito.Nexus uses to keep CLI tools, lookup plugins, and Ansible filters fast without re-reading or re-merging the same data multiple times per Python process."
msgstr "Ta paket vsebuje plasti predpomnilnika v postopku Infinito.Nexus uporablja za vzdrževanje CLI orodja, iskanje plugins in Ansible filtri hitro brez ponovnega branja ali ponovno združevanje istih podatkov večkrat na Python proces."

