msgid "This page collects the places to go when you need help, a professional setup, or a path into the project."
msgstr "Ta stran zbira mesta, da gredo, ko potrebujete pomoč, strokovno nastavitev, ali pot v projekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers IAM rules that span both providers. Provider-specific guidance lives in [oidc.md](oidc.md) and [ldap.md](ldap.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema pravila IAM, ki zajemajo oba ponudnika. Smernice za posameznega ponudnika [oidc.md](oidc.md) ter [ldap.md](ldap.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers Playwright end-to-end test requirements, runner integration, and file contracts. For implementation guidance when writing or updating role-local files, see [Agent `playwright.spec.js`](../../../agents/files/role/playwright.spec.js.md) and [Agent `playwright.env.j2`](../../../agents/files/role/playwright.env.j2.md). For what the `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` of a role MUST contain, see [`playwright.spec.js` (role file rules)](../../artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema Playwrightove zahteve za preizkuse od konca do konca, integracijo tekačev in pogodbe za datoteke. Za navodila za izvajanje pri pisanju ali posodabljanju lokalnih datotek o vlogi glej [Agent `playwright.spec.js`](../../../agents/files/role/playwright.spec.js.md) ter [Agent `playwright.env.j2`](../../../agents/files/role/playwright.env.j2.md). Za kaj? `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` vlogo, ki jo mora vsebovati, glej [`playwright.spec.js` (pravila datotek vlog)](../../artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers `README.md` files stored inside `cli/` category folders (directories under `cli/` that group sub-commands but do not themselves contain a `__main__.py`). For general documentation rules such as links, writing style, RFC 2119 keywords, and emoji placement, see [documentation.md](../../../documentation.md)."
msgstr "Naslovnice te strani `README.md` datoteke, shranjene znotraj `cli/` Mape kategorije (Imeniki `cli/` podpoveljniki skupine, vendar sami ne vsebujejo a `__main__.py`). Za splošna pravila dokumentacije, kot so povezave, slog pisanja, RFC 2119 ključne besede in emoji umestitev, glej [documentation.md](../../../documentation.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers `README.md` files stored inside `docs/` directories. For general documentation rules such as links, writing style, RFC 2119 keywords, and Sphinx behavior, see [documentation.md](../../../documentation.md)."
msgstr "Naslovnice te strani `README.md` datoteke, shranjene znotraj `docs/` Imeniki. Za splošna pravila glede dokumentacije, kot so povezave, slog pisanja, RFC 2119 ključne besede in vedenje sfinge, glej [documentation.md](../../../documentation.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers automatically generating and updating role-local `javascript.js`, `javascript.js.j2`, and equivalent injected browser entry files. Use this page for implementation scope, DOM strategy, and live review. For injector wiring, activation, and repository-wide behavior rules, see [Contributing `javascript.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/javascript.js.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema samodejno ustvarjanje in posodabljanje lokalnih vlog `javascript.js`, `javascript.js.j2`, in enakovredno vbrizgane datoteke za vnos brskalnika. Uporabite to stran za obseg izvajanja, strategijo DOM, in v živo pregled. Za injektorske napeljave, aktivacijo in pravila obnašanja v skladišču glej [Prispevanje `javascript.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/javascript.js.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers automatically generating and updating role-local `playwright.env.j2` files. Use this page for the rendered test input surface, variable naming, and entry-point selection. For runner discovery, staging, and repository-side contract rules, see [Playwright Tests](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md). For the matching scenario implementation, see [Role `playwright.spec.js`](playwright.spec.js.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema samodejno ustvarjanje in posodabljanje lokalnih vlog `playwright.env.j2` datoteke. Uporabite to stran za obdelano preskusno vhodno površino, spremenljivo poimenovanje in izbiro vstopnih točk. Za pogodbena pravila za odkrivanje tekačev, postavitev in shranjevanje podatkov glej [Preizkusi predvajanja](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md). Za izvedbo ustreznega scenarija glej [Vloga `playwright.spec.js`](playwright.spec.js.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers automatically generating and updating role-local `style.css`, `style.css.j2`, and equivalent CSS entry files. Use this page for implementation scope, override strategy, and live review. For repository wiring, inventory keys, and the generated palette contract, see [Contributing `style.css`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/style.css.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema samodejno ustvarjanje in posodabljanje lokalnih vlog `style.css`, `style.css.j2`, in enakovrednih CSS vnos datotek. Uporabite to stran za obseg izvajanja, prevlada strategijo, in v živo pregled. Za ožičenje skladišča, inventarne ključe in ustvarjeno pogodbo o paleti glej [Prispevanje `style.css`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/style.css.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers file placement rules inside the repository `scripts/` tree. For workflow-specific extraction rules, see [workflow.md](files/github/workflow.md). For Python helper placement, see [utils.md](utils.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema pravila za namestitev datotek znotraj skladišča `scripts/` Drevo. Za pravila za ekstrakcijo, specifična za potek dela, glej [workflow.md](files/github/workflow.md). Za Python pomočnik umestitev, glej [utils.md](utils.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers file placement rules inside the repository `utils/` tree. For shell-script placement rules, see [scripst.md](scripst.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema pravila za namestitev datotek znotraj skladišča `utils/` Drevo. Za pravila namestitve s svetlečimi črkami glej [scripst.md](scripst.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers integration testing requirements, framework, and structure. Run integration tests with `make test-integration`."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema zahteve za preskušanje vključevanja, okvir in strukturo. Zaženite integracijske teste z `make test-integration`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers regression-guard rules in tests. For general integration-test requirements and structure, see [Integration Tests](integration.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema pravila regresijske straže v preskusih. Za splošne zahteve za preskus integracije in strukturo glej [Preskusi vključevanja](integration.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers role-local CSS and theming. Use this page for repository wiring, inventory keys, and palette mapping. For implementation scope, override strategy, and live review, see [Agent `style.css`](../../../../agents/files/role/style.css.md). For browser-side validation requirements after visible UI changes, see [Playwright Tests](../../../actions/testing/playwright.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema lokalni CSS in tematiko. Uporabite to stran za ožičenje skladišča, inventar ključe, in paleta kartiranje. Za obseg izvajanja, strategijo razveljavitve in pregled v živo glej [Agent `style.css`](../../../../agents/files/role/style.css.md). Za zahteve za potrjevanje na strani brskalnika po vidnih spremembah uporabniškega vmesnika glej [Preizkusi predvajanja](../../../actions/testing/playwright.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers role-local Dockerfiles. Use this page for placement rules, variable handling, and build wiring. For the agent-side review workflow during development, see [Development](../../../../agents/action/develop.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema lokalne Dockerfile. Uporabite to stran za pravila umeščanja, spremenljivo rokovanje, in graditi žice. Za potek dela na strani agenta med razvojem glej [Razvoj](../../../../agents/action/develop.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers the agent procedure when generating or updating a role-local `playwright.spec.js`. It does NOT restate what the file must contain. Those rules are authoritative in [Contributing `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md) and MUST be consulted before every task."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema postopek zastopnika pri ustvarjanju ali posodabljanju lokalne vloge `playwright.spec.js`. Ne ponovno, kaj mora datoteka vsebovati. Ta pravila veljajo za [Prispevanje `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md) in se je treba posvetovati pred vsako nalogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers the repository rules that govern GitHub Actions workflow files under `.github/workflows/`. For the catalog of every workflow (description, triggers, inputs) see [workflows.md](../../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md). For the script placement rule that applies to extracted shell helpers, see [scripst.md](../../scripst.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema pravila skladišča, ki urejajo delovne datoteke GitHub Actions pod `.github/workflows/`. Za katalog vsakega delovnega toka (opis, sprožilci, vnosi) glej [workflows.md](../../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md). Za pravilo o umestitvi skripta, ki se uporablja za ekstrahirane pomočnike školjk, glej [scripst.md](../../scripst.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers the rules that govern how the repository `Makefile` is written and structured. For the full index of available `make` targets, see [make.md](../../tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema pravila, ki urejajo način shranjevanja `Makefile` je napisana in strukturirana. Za celoten indeks na voljo `make` tarče, glej [make.md](../../tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers unit testing requirements, framework, and structure. Run unit tests with `make test-unit`."
msgstr "Ta stran zajema zahteve za preskušanje enote, okvir in strukturo. Preskusi delovanja enote z `make test-unit`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page defines the inner loop for iterating on a role-local `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` against an already-running app stack, without redeploying between edits."
msgstr "Ta stran določa notranjo zanko za iteriranje na lokalni vlogi `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` proti že teče app sklad, brez prerazporeditve med urejanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page defines which operating systems deployments, scripts, and programs MUST support. Following this policy ensures that Infinito Nexus runs reliably across a broad range of server environments, from community-managed long-term-support servers to enterprise [Red Hat](https://www.redhat.com) deployments and cutting-edge rolling-release development machines."
msgstr "Ta stran določa, katere razporeditve operacijskih sistemov, skripte in programe MORA podpirati. V skladu s to politiko zagotavlja, da Infinito Nexus zanesljivo teče v širokem razponu strežniških okolij, od strežnikov, ki jih upravlja skupnost, do strežnikov za dolgoročno podporo podjetjem [Rdeča kapa](https://www.redhat.com) uporaba in najsodobnejši stroji za razvoj kotalnega sproščanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes how Docker images are declared, read, overridden, discovered, and mirrored. For the mirroring pipeline, see [mirror.md](mirror.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran opisuje, kako se Dockerjeve podobe razglašajo, berejo, prevračajo, odkrivajo in zrcalijo. Glede zrcalnega cevovoda glej [mirror.md](mirror.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes how agents handle application defaults after the removal of `group_vars/all/05_applications.yml`."
msgstr "Ta stran opisuje, kako agenti obravnavajo aplikacije privzeto po odstranitvi `group_vars/all/05_applications.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes how application roles consume the platform's LDAP provider, [OpenLDAP](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/). The variable tree lives in [12_ldap.yml](../../../../group_vars/all/12_ldap.yml) under `LDAP`. For the cross-cutting IAM principles, including the paired identifier rule shared with OIDC, see [common.md](common.md). For OIDC-side details see [oidc.md](oidc.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran opisuje, kako vloge aplikacij porabijo ponudnika LDAP platforme, [OpenLDAP](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/). Spremenljivo drevo živi v [12ldap.yml](../../../../group_vars/all/12_ldap.yml) pod `LDAP`. Za medsektorska načela IAM, vključno s pravilom o parnih identifikatorjih, ki se delijo z OIDC, glej [common.md](common.md). Za podrobnosti na strani OIDC glej [oidc.md](oidc.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes how application roles consume the platform's OIDC provider, [Keycloak](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). The variable tree lives in [11_oidc.yml](../../../../group_vars/all/11_oidc.yml) under `defaults_oidc`. For the cross-cutting IAM principles, including the paired identifier rule shared with LDAP, see [common.md](common.md). For LDAP-side details see [ldap.md](ldap.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran opisuje, kako vloge aplikacij porabijo ponudnika OIDC platforme, [Keycloak](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Spremenljivo drevo živi v [11oidc.yml](../../../../group_vars/all/11_oidc.yml) pod `defaults_oidc`. Za medsektorska načela IAM, vključno s pravilom o parnih identifikatorjih, ki se delijo z LDAP, glej [common.md](common.md). Za podrobnosti na strani LDAP glej [ldap.md](ldap.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes how shared services are declared, discovered, ordered, loaded, and injected."
msgstr "Ta stran opisuje, kako so skupne storitve deklarirane, odkrite, naročene, naložene in vbrizgane."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes the design of the Infinito.Nexus RBAC layer that provisions LDAP groups, synchronises them to Keycloak, and emits them as the OIDC `groups` claim. For IAM fundamentals that span both providers, see [common.md](common.md). For the LDAP server layer, see [ldap.md](ldap.md). For the OIDC client layer, see [oidc.md](oidc.md). Operator-facing steps live in [Administration RBAC](../../../administration/configuration/rbac.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran opisuje zasnovo Infinito.Nexus RBAC plast, ki zagotavlja LDAP skupine, jih sinhronizira Keycloakin jih oddaja kot OIDC `groups` zahtevek. Za osnove IAM, ki zajemajo oba ponudnika, glej [common.md](common.md). Za sloj strežnika LDAP glej [ldap.md](ldap.md). Za sloj odjemalca OIDC glej [oidc.md](oidc.md). Proti upravljavcu obrnjene stopnice živijo v [Način uporabe RBAC](../../../administration/configuration/rbac.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes the on-disk shape of every role's metadata. All role-owned metadata lives under `roles/<role>/meta/<topic>.yml`."
msgstr "Ta stran opisuje on-disk obliko metapodatkov vsake vloge. Vsi metapodatki v lasti vlog živijo pod `roles/<role>/meta/<topic>.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes what every role's `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` MUST contain: file placement, the two persona flows, per-service assertions, technical rules, and final-state guarantees."
msgstr "Ta stran opisuje, kaj vsaka vloga je `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` MORAJO vsebovati: namestitev datotek, pretok dveh oseb, izjave na storitev, tehnična pravila in jamstva končne države."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents known cases where an Ansible role deliberately skips its work instead of failing, and explains the conditions under which the skipped work will be completed on a subsequent run."
msgstr "Ta stran dokumentira znane primere, v katerih nevidna vloga namerno preskoči svoje delo, namesto da bi ji spodletelo, in pojasnjuje pogoje, pod katerimi bo preskočilo delo opravljeno v naslednjem teku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents role-local JavaScript injection and browser-side integration behavior. Use this page for injector wiring, activation, and repository-wide behavior rules. For implementation scope, DOM strategy, and live review, see [Agent `javascript.js`](../../../../agents/files/role/javascript.js.md). For browser-side validation requirements after visible behavior changes, see [Playwright Tests](../../../actions/testing/playwright.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran dokumentira vlogo-local JavaScript injekcija in obnašanje vključevanja na strani brskalnika. Uporabite to stran za injektor ožičenje, aktivacijo, in skladišča pravila obnašanja. Za področje uporabe, strategijo DOM in pregled v živo glej [Agent `javascript.js`](../../../../agents/files/role/javascript.js.md). Za zahteve validacije na strani brskalnika po vidnih spremembah vedenja glej [Preizkusi predvajanja](../../../actions/testing/playwright.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the OS-level sandbox configuration for Claude Code. The relevant keys live under `sandbox` in [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). The sandbox is the **primary** containment layer in this project: because the allowlist uses the wildcard `Bash(*)` (with `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` as defence-in-depth), sandbox confinement, not the per-command allowlist, is what bounds the blast radius of Bash. The `allow`/`ask`/`deny` lists described in [settings.md](settings.md) remain in force on top of it as the policy gate."
msgstr "Ta stran dokumentira nastavitve peskovnika OS za Claude Code. Ustrezni ključi živijo pod `sandbox` v [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). Peskovnik je **primarna** zadrževalni sloj v tem projektu: ker seznam dovoljenj uporablja prosto karto `Bash(*)` (z `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` kot obramba poglobljena)V peskovniku, ne pa v seznamu dovoljenj. – `allow`/`ask`/`deny` seznami, opisani v [settings.md](settings.md) Ostanite v veljavi na vrhu kot vrata politike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the administrator-facing surface of outgoing email configuration. For the plugin contract and extension rules, see [email.md](../../contributing/design/role/services/email.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran dokumentira administrativno obrnjeno površino izhodne nastavitve e-pošte. Za pogodbo o vstavku in pravila o razširitvi, glej [email.md](../../contributing/design/role/services/email.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
