# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page is the administration SPOT for granting and revoking application role memberships via Keycloak. It covers the **how**; for the **why** (design, schema, LDAP layout, client-scope contract) see [RBAC design](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran je administracija SPOT za podeljevanje in preklic prijavnih vlog članstva preko Keycloak. Zajema **Kako**; za **Zakaj** (projektiranje, shema, postavitev LDAP, pogodba o odjemalstvu) glej [Zasnova RBAC](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page lists every repository secret that GitHub Actions workflows in this repository consume, and documents the failure mode when a secret is missing. For repository **variables** see [configuration.md](configuration.md). For the workflow catalog see [workflows.md](workflows.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran navaja vsako skrivnost skladišča, ki jo GitHub Actions v tem skladišču porabi, in dokumentira način napake, ko skrivnost manjka. Za skladišče **spremenljivke** glej [configuration.md](configuration.md). Za katalog delovnih tokov glej [workflows.md](workflows.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page lists every repository variable that controls GitHub Actions CI behaviour in this repo. For the workflow catalog see [workflows.md](workflows.md); for the CI flow see [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."
msgstr "Ta stran navaja vsako spremenljivko skladišča, ki nadzoruje obnašanje CI GitHub v tem repo. Za katalog delovnih tokov glej [workflows.md](workflows.md); za pretok CI glej [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page owns framework and runner mechanics only. The procedure for writing, deploying, and reviewing a role-local spec lives in the dedicated SPOTs:"
msgstr "Ta stran ima samo okvir in mehaniko tekačev. Postopek za pisanje, uvajanje in pregled lokalnih posebnih življenj v posebnih SPOT:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This platform tries to connect existing services instead of demanding a full rewrite."
msgstr "Ta platforma poskuša povezati obstoječe storitve, namesto da zahteva popolno spremembo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This playbook is tailored for users who need a powerful and flexible spell-checking tool on their systems. Hunspell is particularly popular among writers, editors, and developers who work with text in various languages. By automating the installation of Hunspell and its language-specific packages, this playbook simplifies the setup process, allowing users to quickly get up and running with an advanced spell-checking tool."
msgstr "Ta Playbook je prilagojen za uporabnike, ki potrebujejo močno in prilagodljivo orodje za preverjanje črkovanja na svojih sistemih. Hunspell je še posebej priljubljen med pisatelji, uredniki in razvijalci, ki z besedilom sodelujejo v različnih jezikih. Z avtomatizacijo namestitve Hunspell in njegovi jezikovno specifični paketi, ta Playbook poenostavlja postopek nastavitve, ki omogoča uporabnikom, da hitro vstanejo in tečejo z naprednim orodjem za preverjanje črkovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This playbook, ``dsk-docker``, is part of a larger collection housed within the ``infinito`` repository. It is specifically tailored for setting up Docker and Docker Compose on personal computers (PCs) used for development purposes. The primary goal is to facilitate a development environment on individual workstations rather than configuring servers for hosting or distributing Docker images."
msgstr "Ta knjiga iger, ``dsk-docker``, je del večje zbirke, ki se nahaja znotraj ``infinito`` Skladišče. Je posebej prilagojen za postavitev Docker in Docker Compose na osebnih računalnikih (PC-ji) se uporabljajo za razvojne namene. Primarni cilj je olajšati razvojno okolje na posameznih delovnih postajah in ne nastavljati strežnikov za gostovanje ali distribucijo Dockerjevih slik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This playbook, `dsk-docker`, is part of a larger collection housed within the `infinito` repository. It is specifically tailored for setting up Docker and Docker Compose on personal computers (PCs) used for development purposes. The primary goal is to facilitate a development environment on individual workstations rather than configuring servers for hosting or distributing Docker images."
msgstr "Ta knjiga iger, `dsk-docker`, je del večje zbirke, ki se nahaja znotraj `infinito` Skladišče. Je posebej prilagojen za postavitev Docker in Docker Compose na osebnih računalnikih (PC-ji) se uporabljajo za razvojne namene. Primarni cilj je olajšati razvojno okolje na posameznih delovnih postajah in ne nastavljati strežnikov za gostovanje ali distribucijo Dockerjevih slik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This prepares the repository for local development."
msgstr "To pripravlja skladišče za lokalni razvoj."

