msgstr "To preprečuje napake kot:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This process provides a streamlined way to manage Pixelfed users directly from the CLI in a Dockerized environment, ensuring that you can efficiently administer your Pixelfed instance without needing to access the Pixelfed web interface."
msgstr "Ta proces zagotavlja poenostavljen način upravljanja Pixelfed uporabniki neposredno iz CLI v dockeriziranem okolju, ki zagotavljajo učinkovito uporabo Pixelfed primer brez potrebe po dostopu Pixelfed spletni vmesnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This pulls in [git-maintainer-tools](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools) through the project's `dev` extras and puts `git-setup-remotes` and `git-sign-push` on `$PATH`."
msgstr "To se vleče. [orodje za vzdrževanje zobnikov](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools) preko projekta. `dev` dodatki in vložki `git-setup-remotes` ter `git-sign-push` o `$PATH`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This purges the app's containers + volumes + Ansible-managed state on the host, then re-deploys. Use it once, then return to `mode=update` without `purge=true`. Do NOT loop with `purge=true`; if the failure survives a single purge it is not a state issue."
msgstr "To očisti vsebnike aplikacije + volumne + stanje z nespremenljivim upravljanjem na gostitelju, nato pa ponovno razpade. Uporabi ga enkrat, potem pa se vrni na `mode=update` brez `purge=true`. Ne zanke z `purge=true`Če neuspeh preživi eno samo čistko, to ni vprašanje države."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release delivers a major stability and reliability upgrade across the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem. It focuses on **deterministic deployments**, **robust TLS/CA handling**, **mirror-aware inventories**, and **CI/CD resilience**, while standardizing Docker service configuration across roles."
msgstr "Ta sprostitev zagotavlja veliko stabilnost in zanesljivost nadgradnjo v vseh Infinito.Nexus ekosistem. Osredotoča se na **deterministična razporeditev**, **robustno ravnanje s TLS/CA**, **Inventure zrcalne opreme**in **Odpornost CI/CD**, medtem ko standardizacijo Docker konfiguracijo storitev med vlogami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release ensures that commits carrying a version tag trigger the full distro test matrix by detecting tags pointing at the current commit, while regular commits continue to run on a single random distro."
msgstr "Ta sprostitev zagotavlja, da se zavezuje, da nosi oznako različice sproži celoten distro test matrice z odkrivanjem oznake, ki kažejo na trenutno obvezo, medtem ko se redno zavezuje, da še naprej teče na eno samo naključno distro."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release expands the application portfolio with new civic, ERP, feedback, and observability roles, replaces legacy generated runtime data with lookup-driven configuration and service loading, broadens Playwright end-to-end coverage across the stack, and hardens CI, local development, and deployment reliability."
msgstr "Ta objava razširja portfelj aplikacij z novo državljansko, ERP, povratne informacije, in vloge za opazovanje, nadomesti zapuščine generirane podatke za čas delovanja z lookup vodene konfiguracije in nakladanje storitev, širi Playwright od konca do konca pokritost po kupa, in utrja CI, lokalni razvoj in zanesljivost uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release focuses on improving Matomo installation stability, aligning base images, and introducing automated CI image cleanup. **Improvements**"
msgstr "Ta sprostitev se osredotoča na izboljšanje Matomo stabilnost namestitve, usklajevanje baznih slik in uvajanje avtomatiziranega čiščenja slik CI. **Izboljšave**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release improves CI and developer tooling robustness by fixing hardlink-related errors, stabilizing workflow triggers, resolving type-checking import cycles, and hardening cleanup and teardown logic across the CLI and templating utilities."
msgstr "Ta sprostitev izboljša CI in razvijalec orodja robustnost z določitvijo trde povezave, povezane napake, stabilizacijo delovnih tokov sprožilcev, reševanje preverjanja tipa uvoznih ciklov, in utrjevanje čiščenje in rušenje logike v CLI in templating komunalnih storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release lands the matrix-deploy hardening pass, an interactive console for the CLI, the bundles workflow, a per-consumer Postgres builder, a shared Playwright persona library across every web role, a SPOT env pipeline under the `INFINITO_` namespace, and a new education-suite bundle (openwebui + mailu) alongside the KIX Service Management role."
msgstr "Ta objava pristane matrice-deploy ojačevalno prepustnico, interaktivna konzola za CLI, paketi delovni tok, na potrošnika Postgres graditelj, skupna Playwright persona knjižnica po vsaki spletni vlogi, SPOT env cevovod pod `INFINITO_` imenski prostor in nov paket za izobraževanje (openwebui + mailu) Poleg KIX Vloga upravljanja storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This repository uses a fork-based workflow. Contributors MUST NOT configure the remote layout by hand. Remote setup and signed pushes are handled by [git-maintainer-tools](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools), declared as a dev dependency in [pyproject.toml](../../../../pyproject.toml)."
msgstr "To skladišče uporablja delovni tok, ki temelji na vilicah. Prispevalci NE SMEjo ročno nastaviti oddaljene razporeditve. Oddaljene nastavitve in podpisani potiski se obravnavajo z [orodje za vzdrževanje zobnikov](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools), razglašen kot dev odvisnost v [pyproject.toml](../../../../pyproject.toml)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This repository uses a strict fork-first workflow. You MUST NOT commit directly to `main`. You MUST do all work in your own fork and MUST open Pull Requests from your fork back to the main repository."
msgstr "To skladišče uporablja strog potek dela. NE SMETE se neposredno zavezati `main`. Vse delo morate opraviti v svoji vilici in MORATE odpreti Pull Prošnje iz vaše vilice nazaj v glavno skladišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This repository uses several test and validation types:"
msgstr "To skladišče uporablja več vrst preskusov in potrjevanja:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement closes that gap consistently across the role tree rather than role by role."
msgstr "Ta zahteva dosledno odpravlja to vrzel na drevesu vloge in ne po vlogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement covers requirement and design work only. It does not authorize enabling a new MCP endpoint, upgrading an application, installing an upstream plugin, or widening a credential in the same change that introduces this document."
msgstr "Ta zahteva zajema samo zahteve in projektiranje. To ne odobri omogoča novo končno točko MCP, nadgradnjo aplikacije, namestitev vtičnice na zgornjem delu, ali razširitev poverilnice v isti spremembi, ki uvaja ta dokument."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement covers the catalogs, their extraction, their machine translation and their validation. Serving the catalogs is [038 - web-svc-api](README.md#archive); consuming them inside core roles is [039 - Core i18n Consumers](039-core-i18n-consumers.md). The consumer repositories (infinito-nexus-gui, meta-infinite-graph, portfolio) keep their own interface strings in their own gettext catalogs and switch only after 037 to 039 are green."
msgstr "Ta zahteva zajema kataloge, njihovo ekstrakcijo, strojno prevajanje in njihovo potrjevanje. Služiti katalogom je [038 -Kaj? web-svc-api](README.md#archive);uživanje jih znotraj glavnih vlog je [039 Jedro i18n Potrošniki](039-core-i18n-consumers.md). Repozitoriji potrošnikov (Infinito-nexus-gui, meta-neskončni-graf, portfelj) imajo svoje vmesnik nize v svojih katalogih getext in stikalo šele po 037 do 039 so zelene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement covers two related but separable deliverables:"
msgstr "Ta zahteva zajema dva povezana, vendar ločena cilja:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement extends [025 - MCP Role Integration](025-mcp-role-integration.md). Requirement 025 defines the initial MCP metadata and the first Open WebUI integration; this requirement drives the exhaustive role audit, the proxy and workflow-adapter contract, client reconciliation, and the conditions under which the remaining roles may be integrated."
msgstr "Ta zahteva se razširi [025 - MCP integracija vlog](025-mcp-role-integration.md). Zahteva 025 določa začetne metapodatke MCP in prve Open WebUI integracija; ta zahteva spodbuja izčrpno revizijo vloge, pogodbo o posredniku in adapterju za potek dela, usklajevanje strank in pogoje, pod katerimi se lahko vključijo preostale vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement moves the core roles that render translated text onto the catalogs of [037 - Gettext Catalogs with LibreTranslate Autotranslation](037-gettext-catalogs-libretranslate.md) and opens the API of [038 - web-svc-api](README.md#archive) to browser consumers. The consumer repositories change afterwards and are not part of this requirement."
msgstr "Ta zahteva premika ključne vloge, ki prevajajo besedilo v katalogih [037 - Gettext Katalogi z LibreTranslate Samodejno prevajanje](037-gettext-catalogs-libretranslate.md) in odpre API o [038 -Kaj? web-svc-api](README.md#archive) za brskanje po potrošnikih. Repozitoriji potrošnikov se pozneje spremenijo in niso del te zahteve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This restore path also restarts `docker.service` and then calls `make network-refresh`, so the running Infinito development stack is recreated when one is active and the restored setting reaches fresh container network namespaces."
msgstr "Ta obnova poti se tudi ponovno zažene `docker.service` In potem pokliče `make network-refresh`, tako da je tekoči Infinito razvoj sklad ponovno, ko je eden aktiven in obnovljena nastavitev doseže sveže kontejner omrežja imenski prostori."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role **does not ship the installer script** and therefore requires network access during installation."
msgstr "Ta vloga **ne pošilja skripta monterja** in zato zahteva dostop do omrežja med namestitvijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role adapts iptables rules to enable proper connectivity for a WireGuard client running behind a NAT or firewall. It ensures that traffic is forwarded correctly by applying necessary masquerading rules."
msgstr "Ta vloga prilagaja pravila pttable, da se omogoči ustrezna povezljivost za odjemalca WireGuard, ki teče za NAT ali požarnim zidom. Zagotavlja, da se promet pravilno posreduje z uporabo potrebnih pravil masquerading."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role addresses a common issue on Linux laptops: closing the lid while docked or plugged in leads to unintended sleep or hibernation. It installs the necessary hibernation tools and updates `/etc/systemd/logind.conf` to:"
msgstr "Ta vloga obravnava skupno vprašanje na prenosnih računalnikih Linux: zapiranje pokrova, medtem ko zasidrana ali priključena v vodi do nenamernega spanja ali hibernacije. Namesti potrebna orodja za hibernacijo in posodobitve `/etc/systemd/logind.conf` za:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role addresses a common issue on Linux laptops: closing the lid while docked or plugged in leads to unintended sleep or hibernation. It installs the necessary hibernation tools and updates ``/etc/systemd/logind.conf`` to:"
msgstr "Ta vloga obravnava skupno vprašanje na prenosnih računalnikih Linux: zapiranje pokrova, medtem ko zasidrana ali priključena v vodi do nenamernega spanja ali hibernacije. Namesti potrebna orodja za hibernacijo in posodobitve ``/etc/systemd/logind.conf`` za:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role aggregates essential GNOME desktop roles (including caffeine, extensions, and terminal) for a complete GNOME environment on Linux."
msgstr "Ta vloga združuje bistvene namizne vloge GNOME (vključno s kofeinom, razširitvami in terminalom) za popolno GNOME okolje na Linuxu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role aggregates various GNOME desktop components to ensure a cohesive and fully functional GNOME environment on Arch Linux. It includes the installation and configuration of several sub-roles:"
msgstr "Ta vloga združuje različne namizne komponente GNOME, da se zagotovi kohezivno in popolnoma funkcionalno okolje GNOME na Arch Linuxu. Vključuje vgradnjo in konfiguracijo več podvlog:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role asserts that the mount, source, and target configuration values are present, deploys the rsync-driver script, and installs a systemd mount unit plus a oneshot service. The oneshot service is triggered automatically when the configured mount path appears, so the only operator action is to physically plug the device in."
msgstr "Ta vloga trdi, da so priklop, vir in ciljne nastavitvene vrednosti prisotne, uporablja rsync-diver skript in namesti sistemsko priklopno enoto plus enostrelno storitev. Storitev za enkraten posnetek se sproži samodejno, ko se pojavi nastavljena priklopna pot, tako da je edino dejanje upravljavca fizično vklop naprave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the cleanup of old backups by executing a Python script that deletes outdated backup versions based on disk usage thresholds. It ensures that backup storage does not exceed a defined usage percentage."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira čiščenje starih varnostnih kopij z izvajanjem Python skripta, ki izbriše zastarele varnostne različice, ki temeljijo na pragovih uporabe diska. Zagotavlja, da rezervno shranjevanje ne presega določenega odstotka uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the creation of a swapfile on the target system by cloning a swapfile creation script from a Git repository and executing it with the specified swapfile size."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira ustvarjanje swapfile na ciljnem sistemu s kloniranjem scenarija za ustvarjanje swapfile iz Git odloži in izvrši z določeno velikostjo swapfile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment and configuration of a complete, production-ready Taiga stack using Docker Compose. It ensures integration with common infrastructure tools such as NGINX, PostgreSQL, and RabbitMQ, while optionally enabling OpenID Connect authentication for enterprise-grade SSO."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira uvajanje in konfiguracijo popolnega, pripravljenega na proizvodnjo Taiga kupček Docker Compose. Zagotavlja povezovanje s skupnimi infrastrukturnimi orodji, kot je NGINX, PostgreSQLin RabbitMQ, medtem ko neobvezno omogoča overovitev OpenID Connect za podjetje-grade SSO."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Kevin's Package Manager by:"
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira razporeditev Kevinovega upravljalca paketov, tako da:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Kevin’s Package Manager by:"
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira razporeditev Kevinovega upravitelja paketov tako, da:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Odoo in a containerized Docker environment with PostgreSQL database integration, OIDC/LDAP authentication support, and full Infinito.Nexus stack integration including reverse proxy, CSP configuration, and centralized identity management."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira razporeditev Odoa v kontejnerskem okolju s PostgreSQL integracija podatkovne zbirke, podpora za avtentikacijo OIDC/LDAP in popolna Infinito.Nexus integracija sklada, vključno z obratnim posrednikom, konfiguracijo CSP in centraliziranim upravljanjem identitete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of Jrnl using the ``community.general.pacman`` module for systems that support the Pacman package manager, ensuring that Jrnl is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira namestitev Jrnl uporaba ``community.general.pacman`` modul za sisteme, ki podpirajo upravljavca paketa Pacman, pri čemer se zagotovi, da Jrnl je nameščen in posodobljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of Jrnl using the `community.general.pacman` module for systems that support the Pacman package manager, ensuring that Jrnl is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira namestitev Jrnl uporaba `community.general.pacman` modul za sisteme, ki podpirajo upravljavca paketa Pacman, pri čemer se zagotovi, da Jrnl je nameščen in posodobljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of fakeroot via the OS package manager, ensuring that users can simulate superuser operations without requiring elevated privileges."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira namestitev ponaredkov preko upravljalnika paketov OS, kar zagotavlja, da lahko uporabniki simulirajo operacije superuporabnika brez potrebe po povišanih privilegijih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of micro, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira namestitev mikro, urejevalnika besedil CLI, na Pacmanovih sistemih. Uporablja ``community.general.pacman`` modul za zagotovitev, da je urednik nameščen in posodobljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of micro, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the `community.general.pacman` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira namestitev mikro, urejevalnika besedil CLI, na Pacmanovih sistemih. Uporablja `community.general.pacman` modul za zagotovitev, da je urednik nameščen in posodobljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of neovim, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira namestitev neovima, urejevalnika besedil CLI, na Pacmanovih sistemih. Uporablja ``community.general.pacman`` modul za zagotovitev, da je urednik nameščen in posodobljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of neovim, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the `community.general.pacman` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira namestitev neovima, urejevalnika besedil CLI, na Pacmanovih sistemih. Uporablja `community.general.pacman` modul za zagotovitev, da je urednik nameščen in posodobljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the [auto-btrfs-balancer](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira upravljanje in uravnoteženje datotečnih sistemov Btrfs. To klonira najnovejšo različico [auto-btrfs-uravnoteževalnik](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) odloži in nastavi sistemsko storitev in časovnik za samodejno poganjanje skripta za izravnavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira upravljanje in uravnoteženje datotečnih sistemov Btrfs. To klonira najnovejšo različico `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ odloži in nastavi sistemsko storitev in časovnik za samodejno poganjanje skripta za izravnavo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the process of setting up and running the Infinito.Nexus presentation in a Docker container, ensuring a reproducible and isolated environment for displaying the content."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira proces vzpostavljanja in vodenja Infinito.Nexus predstavitev v vsebniku Docker, ki zagotavlja ponovljivo in izolirano okolje za prikaz vsebine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the removal of orphaned Docker volumes that consume unnecessary disk space. It is especially useful in backup, CI/CD, or maintenance routines."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira odstranjevanje osirotelih Dockerjevih volumnov, ki porabijo nepotrebno prostor na disku. To je še posebej koristno pri backup, CI/CD, ali vzdrževanje rutine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the restart process for Docker Compose instances within a specified directory. It deploys a Python script that checks for the presence of compose.yml files and restarts the associated services. A hard restart is applied for certain directories if needed."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira proces ponovnega zagona za Docker Compose primeri znotraj določenega imenika. Uporablja Python skripto, ki preverja prisotnost compose.yml datoteke in ponovno zažene povezane storitve. Za nekatere mape se po potrebi uporabi težek ponovni zagon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) SSL/TLS certificates using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira priklic [Šifrirajmo](https://letsencrypt.org/) Potrdila SSL/TLS [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) za domene preko NGINX. Podpira tako enodomna kot prostovoljska potrdila in lahko uporablja metode DNS ali webroot ACME izziv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ SSL/TLS certificates using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira priklic `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ Potrdila SSL/TLS `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ za domene preko NGINX. Podpira tako enodomna kot prostovoljska potrdila in lahko uporablja metode DNS ali webroot ACME izziv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) certificate renewal system for NGINX using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira nastavitev avtomata [Šifrirajmo](https://letsencrypt.org/) sistem za obnovitev certifikata za NGINX z uporabo [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). Zagotavlja, da se certifikati SSL/TLS brezhibno obnavljajo v ozadju in da se NGINX po uspešnih obnovitvah samodejno ponovno naloži."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ certificate renewal system for NGINX using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "Ta vloga avtomatizira nastavitev avtomata `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ sistem za obnovitev certifikata za NGINX z uporabo `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. Zagotavlja, da se certifikati SSL/TLS brezhibno obnavljajo v ozadju in da se NGINX po uspešnih obnovitvah samodejno ponovno naloži."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small ``nginx:alpine`` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Ta vloga peče touch javnost artefact v majhno ``nginx:alpine`` slika in nosilci **več sten na uporabo**: vsak vnos pod ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` prikazuje seznam povezav vseh nastavljenih sten."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small `nginx:alpine` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) materializes as its own path under `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` with its own baked-in `wall-config.json`. The root `/` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Ta vloga peče touch javnost artefact v majhno `nginx:alpine` slika in nosilci **več sten na uporabo**: vsak vnos pod [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) uresniči kot svojo pot pod `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` z lastno pečenko `wall-config.json`. Korenina `/` prikazuje seznam povezav vseh nastavljenih sten."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps **per-domain NGINX configuration**: it requests TLS certificates, applies global modifiers, deploys a ready-made vHost file, and can optionally lock down access via OAuth2."
msgstr "Ta vloga se skriva. **konfiguracija NGINX na domeno**: zahteva potrdila TLS, uporablja globalne modifikatorje, uporablja pripravljeno datoteko vHost in lahko prostovoljno zaklene dostop prek OAuth2."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node``. The manager is the single host in ``svc-swarm-manager``; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in ``group_vars``. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "To vlogo škornji past in upravlja Docker Swarm grozd po gostiteljih v skupini Ansible ``svc-swarm-node``. Upravitelj je edini gostitelj v ``svc-swarm-manager``; vsak drugi član skupine se pridruži kot delavec. Članstvo je izraženo samo s članstvom v skupini, nikoli s podvojenimi seznami ``group_vars``. Oznake inventarnega vozlišča so potisnjene v grozd po fazi pridružitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node`. The manager is the single host in `svc-swarm-manager`; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in `group_vars`. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "To vlogo škornji past in upravlja Docker Swarm grozd po gostiteljih v skupini Ansible `svc-swarm-node`. Upravitelj je edini gostitelj v `svc-swarm-manager`; vsak drugi član skupine se pridruži kot delavec. Članstvo je izraženo samo s članstvom v skupini, nikoli s podvojenimi seznami `group_vars`. Oznake inventarnega vozlišča so potisnjene v grozd po fazi pridružitve."

