# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds Postmarks from source into a custom image, wires it to the standard reverse proxy, and persists its SQLite data. Postmarks is single-user: there are no accounts, only “the owner”. The upstream login is a single shared-secret password form that flips one session boolean (``req.session.loggedIn``)."
msgstr "Ta vloga gradi Postmarks iz vira v sliko po meri, ga povežite s standardnim obratnim posrednikom, in vztraja svoje podatke SQLite. Poštne znamke so enouporabniki: računov ni, samo »lastnik«. Prijavna prijava je en sam obrazec za skupno skrivnost gesla, ki obrne eno sejo boolean (``req.session.loggedIn``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds and runs Bridgy Fed as a Docker container behind the project's front-proxy. An optional Firestore-emulator sidecar in Datastore mode provides the storage backend for non-production deployments."
msgstr "Ta vloga gradi in deluje Bridgy Fed kot Dockerjev zabojnik za projektno fronto. Neobvezna stranska prikolica iz Firestore v načinu Datastore zagotavlja hrbtenico za shranjevanje za neproizvodne uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds and runs Bridgy Fed as a Docker container behind the project’s front-proxy. An optional Firestore-emulator sidecar in Datastore mode provides the storage backend for non-production deployments."
msgstr "Ta vloga gradi in deluje Bridgy Fed kot zabojnik za prednji del projekta. Neobvezna stranska prikolica iz Firestore v načinu Datastore zagotavlja hrbtenico za shranjevanje za neproizvodne uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds its own Moodle image from upstream Moodle source on top of the official ``php:8.3-fpm`` base."
msgstr "Ta vloga gradi svojo lastno Moodle slika iz zgornjega toka Moodle vir na vrhu uradnika ``php:8.3-fpm`` baza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds its own Moodle image from upstream Moodle source on top of the official `php:8.3-fpm` base."
msgstr "Ta vloga gradi svojo lastno Moodle slika iz zgornjega toka Moodle vir na vrhu uradnika `php:8.3-fpm` baza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds on ``sys-stk-backend`` by adding a reverse-proxy frontend for HTTP access to your database service."
msgstr "Ta vloga temelji na ``sys-stk-backend`` z dodajanjem vmesnika za HTTP za dostop do vaše storitve zbirke podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds on `sys-stk-backend` by adding a reverse-proxy frontend for HTTP access to your database service."
msgstr "Ta vloga temelji na `sys-stk-backend` z dodajanjem vmesnika za HTTP za dostop do vaše storitve zbirke podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds the API image from ``files/Dockerfile``, bakes a snapshot of the deployed working tree into it and serves it at ``api.<domain>``. The container keeps one bare git repository with the branches and tags of core, of every public fork (discovered through the GitHub forks endpoint) and the snapshot as the ref ``deployed``, and fetches on a fixed interval. Every data endpoint takes a ``ref``: ``deployed``, a commit SHA, a branch or tag of core, or ``<owner>:<branch or tag>`` of a fork. Translations come from the ``core`` gettext catalogs under ``locale/``, which ``make i18n-extract`` and ``make i18n-translate`` maintain."
msgstr "Ta vloga gradi API slike iz ``files/Dockerfile``, peče posnetek razporejeno delovno drevo vanj in ga služi na ``api.<domain>``. Posoda hrani eno golo skladišče git z vejami in oznakami jedra, vseh javnih vilic (odkrita z GitHub vilicami) in posnetek kot ref ``deployed``, in prinaša na določen interval. Za vsak opazovani dogodek so potrebni ``ref``: ``deployed``, obveznost SHA, vejo ali oznako jedra, ali ``<owner>:<branch or tag>`` Vilice. Prevodi prihajajo iz ``core`` pod katalogi gettext ``locale/``, ki ``make i18n-extract`` ter ``make i18n-translate`` Nadaljujte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds the API image from `files/Dockerfile`, bakes a snapshot of the deployed working tree into it and serves it at `api.<domain>`. The container keeps one bare git repository with the branches and tags of core, of every public fork (discovered through the GitHub forks endpoint) and the snapshot as the ref `deployed`, and fetches on a fixed interval. Every data endpoint takes a `ref`: `deployed`, a commit SHA, a branch or tag of core, or `<owner>:<branch or tag>` of a fork. Translations come from the `core` gettext catalogs under `locale/`, which `make i18n-extract` and `make i18n-translate` maintain."
msgstr "Ta vloga gradi API slike iz `files/Dockerfile`, peče posnetek razporejeno delovno drevo vanj in ga služi na `api.<domain>`. Posoda hrani eno golo skladišče git z vejami in oznakami jedra, vseh javnih vilic (odkrita z GitHub vilicami) in posnetek kot ref `deployed`, in prinaša na določen interval. Za vsak opazovani dogodek so potrebni `ref`: `deployed`, obveznost SHA, vejo ali oznako jedra, ali `<owner>:<branch or tag>` Vilice. Prevodi prihajajo iz `core` pod katalogi gettext `locale/`, ki `make i18n-extract` ter `make i18n-translate` Nadaljujte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds upon core workstation and package management components to deliver a clean, editor-ready base for developers. It installs core tools and editors necessary to begin building, editing, and managing source code projects."
msgstr "Ta vloga temelji na osrednjih delovnih postajah in komponentah upravljanja paketov, da se zagotovi čista, urejevalna osnova za razvijalce. Vgradi osnovna orodja in urednike, ki so potrebni za začetek gradnje, urejanje in upravljanje projektov izvorne kode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role can optionally bootstrap a Django superuser inside the Baserow container (useful for initial setup and automation)."
msgstr "Ta vloga lahko po želji škornji past Django superuporabnik znotraj Baserow vsebnik (uporabno za začetno nastavitev in avtomatizacijo)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role cleans up failed Docker backups by configuring a systemd service and timer to execute the cleanup operations periodically."
msgstr "Ta vloga očisti neuspešne varnostne kopije Docker z nastavljanjem sistemske storitve in časovnega razporeda za redno izvajanje operacij čiščenja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role cloudflare DNS bootstrap: parent host A/AAAA (and optional CAA), runs once per play."
msgstr "Ta vloga cloudflare DNS boottrap: matični gostitelj A/AAAA (in neobvezna CAA), Enkrat na igro."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role combines Docker Compose with a central RDBMS role to automatically provision database containers with backup, user, and permission management."
msgstr "Ta vloga združuje Docker Compose z osrednjo vlogo RDBMS za avtomatsko zagotavljanje posod za zbirke podatkov z varnostno kopijo, uporabnikom in upravljanjem dovoljenj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role combines the central RDBMS role (``sys-svc-rdbms``) with Docker Compose to deliver a ready-to-use containerized database environment."
msgstr "Ta vloga združuje osrednjo vlogo RDBMS (``sys-svc-rdbms``) z Docker Compose da se zagotovi okolje, pripravljeno za uporabo zabojnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role combines the central RDBMS role (`sys-svc-rdbms`) with Docker Compose to deliver a ready-to-use containerized database environment."
msgstr "Ta vloga združuje osrednjo vlogo RDBMS (`sys-svc-rdbms`) z Docker Compose da se zagotovi okolje, pripravljeno za uporabo zabojnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures GNOME Shell extensions and installs the CLI GNOME Extension Manager for managing extensions."
msgstr "Ta vloga nastavlja GNOME Shell razširi in namesti upravljalnik razširitve CLI GNOME za upravljanje razširitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures Nginx to perform 301 redirects based on a list of source→target domain mappings."
msgstr "Ta vloga nastavlja Nginx za izvedbo 301 preusmeri na podlagi seznama izvornih in ciljnih map."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a basic user environment (shell dotfiles and SSH authorized_keys) for a user selected via ``user_key``."
msgstr "Ta vloga nastavlja osnovno uporabniško okolje (lupinske pike in SSH authorized_keys) za uporabnika, izbranega preko ``user_key``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a basic user environment (shell dotfiles and SSH authorized_keys) for a user selected via `user_key`."
msgstr "Ta vloga nastavlja osnovno uporabniško okolje (lupinske pike in SSH authorized_keys) za uporabnika, izbranega preko `user_key`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a systemd timer to periodically start a corresponding service. It uses a Jinja2 template to create a timer unit file that specifies the scheduling parameters (such as OnCalendar and RandomizedDelaySec) and then restarts the timer service accordingly."
msgstr "Ta vloga nastavi sistemski časovnik, da se občasno zažene ustrezna storitev. Uporablja Jinjo.2 predlogo za ustvarjanje datoteke timer enote, ki določa parametre razporeda (kot so OnCalendar in RandomizedDelaySec) in nato ustrezno ponovno zažene časovno storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/) server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/), and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "Ta vloga nastavlja [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/) strežnik za gostovanje statične HTML domače strani varno nad HTTPS. Avtomatizira nastavitve domen, priklic certifikata SSL/TLS z uporabo [Šifrirajmo](https://letsencrypt.org/), in zagotavlja, da je vaša lokacija pripravljena za proizvodnjo z minimalno nastavitvijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "Ta vloga nastavlja `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ strežnik za gostovanje statične HTML domače strani varno nad HTTPS. Avtomatizira nastavitve domen, priklic certifikata SSL/TLS z uporabo `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, in zagotavlja, da je vaša lokacija pripravljena za proizvodnjo z minimalno nastavitvijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role core role for Nginx HTML injection of Matomo, theming, iFrame and JS snippets based on application feature flags."
msgstr "Ta vloga osrednje vloge za Nginx HTML injiciranje Matomo, teating, iFrame in JS snippets, ki temeljijo na zastavic funkcij programov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role create Cloudflare wildcard DNS records (*.parent) for parent hosts; no base or*.apex records."
msgstr "Ta vloga ustvariti Cloudflare Wildcard DNS zapisi (*.starševski) za matične gostitelje; brez osnove ali*.apex zapisi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "Ta vloga ustvarja namenskega administratorja uporabnika za lokalne upravne naloge. Skrbniški račun je nastavljen tako, da pri izvajanju zahteva geslo [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), zagotavljanje varne privilegij stopnjevanje. Iz varnostnih razlogov se priporoča uporaba tega namenskega administratorja namesto privzetega korenskega računa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "Ta vloga ustvarja namenskega administratorja uporabnika za lokalne upravne naloge. Skrbniški račun je nastavljen tako, da pri izvajanju zahteva geslo `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, zagotavljanje varne privilegij stopnjevanje. Iz varnostnih razlogov se priporoča uporaba tega namenskega administratorja namesto privzetega korenskega računa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a flexible directory layout for managing Docker Compose projects across environments. It ensures directories are initialized, optionally reset, and kept clean using internal flags like `MODE_RESET` or `MODE_CLEANUP`."
msgstr "Ta vloga ustvarja prilagodljivo postavitev imenika za upravljanje Docker Compose projekti v različnih okoljih. Zagotavlja, da so imeniki inicializirani, neobvezno resetirani in čisti z uporabo notranjih zastav, kot so `MODE_RESET` ali `MODE_CLEANUP`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a flexible directory layout for managing Docker Compose projects across environments. It ensures directories are initialized, optionally reset, and kept clean using internal flags like ``MODE_RESET`` or ``MODE_CLEANUP``."
msgstr "Ta vloga ustvarja prilagodljivo postavitev imenika za upravljanje Docker Compose projekti v različnih okoljih. Zagotavlja, da so imeniki inicializirani, neobvezno resetirani in čisti z uporabo notranjih zastav, kot so ``MODE_RESET`` ali ``MODE_CLEANUP``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user defined by *WORKSTATION_USER* and configures its basic environment. It integrates with the shared ``user`` role to deploy shell dotfiles and SSH ``authorized_keys``."
msgstr "Ta vloga ustvarja uporabnika delovne postaje, ki ga opredeljuje *WORKSTATION_USER* in konfigurira svoje osnovno okolje. Združuje se s skupnimi ``user`` vloga za uporabo lupinskih datotek in SSH ``authorized_keys``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user defined by *WORKSTATION_USER* and configures its basic environment. It integrates with the shared `user` role to deploy shell dotfiles and SSH `authorized_keys`."
msgstr "Ta vloga ustvarja uporabnika delovne postaje, ki ga opredeljuje *WORKSTATION_USER* in konfigurira svoje osnovno okolje. Združuje se s skupnimi `user` vloga za uporabo lupinskih datotek in SSH `authorized_keys`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user selected via WORKSTATION_USER and configures the user environment."
msgstr "Ta vloga ustvari uporabnika delovne postaje, izbrane preko WORKSTATION_USER in nastavlja uporabniško okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` in `templates/env.j2`); the resulting entry point is `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, relabelled \"SSO with Infinito.Nexus\" by `templates/javascript.js.j2`, which the shared helper's name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a `/landing` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2` za isti mehanizem. Najvažnejša ekipa Edition ladje ni domači OIDC ponudnik, tako da je vloga prašički Keycloak na GitLab Reža OAuth (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` v `templates/env.j2`); nastala vstopna točka je `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, ponovno označena \"SSO z Infinito.Nexus\" z `templates/javascript.js.j2`, ki jih skupni pomočnik na osnovi imena prijavitelja ne prepozna. Snov v11+ služi tudi `/landing` intersticijski do neavtentiranih obiskovalcev, ki se očistijo samo enkrat `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` je posejana pred navigacijo, in skupni pomočnik nima init-script kavelj za to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same reason. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` and `sso.shared: false`: MIG serves the pre-rendered Meta Infinite Graph over its own compose stack and has no login surface, no accounts, and no authenticated state at all. Consequently the env file renders no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` or `BIBER_PASSWORD` for the shared helpers to read."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2` Iz istega razloga. `meta/services.yml` zatiči `sso.enabled: false` ter `sso.shared: false`: MIG služi vnaprej rendered Meta Infinite Graph preko lastnega sklada in nima prijavno površino, nobenih računov, in brez overovano stanje sploh. Zato je v env datoteki `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` ali `BIBER_PASSWORD` za skupne pomočnike za branje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — `/api/v1/login` answers `redirectRules: null` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because the only MinIO policy the role creates is the administrator RBAC group path (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` in `vars/main.yml`, attached in `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2` Iz dveh različnih razlogov. – MinIO Console verzija pripeta tukaj nikoli ne naredi SSO gumb – `/api/v1/login` Odgovori `redirectRules: null` vendar je ponudnik identitete registriran na strani strežnika – tako da ni na strani OIDC vstopna točka za skupni pomočnik za klik. Biber je blokiran, ker je edini MinIO politika, ki jo ustvarja vloga, je pot skupine upravitelja RBAC (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` v `vars/main.yml`, priložen `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) ter MinIO nima samopostrežnih prijav, tako da biber zemljevidi brez politike in nima overjene površine na nobeni stopnji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The wiki's bureaucrat and sysop is a local account created by `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` in `tasks/04_admin.yml` with `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` — the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`, not the Keycloak secret the persona helper carries in `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` is false, so no native form accepts that password anyway, and `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` lands the Keycloak identity on a separate, e-mail-named wiki account that holds no sysop rights."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2` Iz dveh različnih razlogov. Wikijev birokrat in sisop je lokalni račun, ki ga ustvarja `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` v `tasks/04_admin.yml` z `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` — vloga-lokalna `credentials.administrator_password`, ne Keycloak skrivnost, ki jo nosi persona pomočnik `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` je napačna, zato nobena domača oblika ne sprejme tega gesla in `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` pristane Keycloak identiteta na ločenem, e-pošti imenovanem Wiki računu, ki nima pravic do sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: `meta/services.yml` carries no `sso` block (the `keycloak` service declares `provides: sso`) and pins `logout.enabled: false`, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak's only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in `vars/main.yml`, backed by the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`) and not the normal-realm `ADMIN_PASSWORD` the helper types."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak zagotavlja SSO namesto uporabe: `meta/services.yml` nosi št. `sso` blok (o `keycloak` Izjave o storitvah `provides: sso`) in zatiči `logout.enabled: false`, tako da kanonični URL nima niti oauth2-proxy vrata niti in-app OIDC prijavna povezava za skupno osebo pomočnikov klikniti ali odjaviti. Upravitelj persona je dodatno izven dosega, ker KeycloakEdina admin površina je master-realm konzola, ki sprejema stalni super-admin račun (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` v `vars/main.yml`, ki ga podpira lokalna vloga `credentials.administrator_password`) in ne normalno `ADMIN_PASSWORD` tipe pomočnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu's OIDC fork interposes its own `/sso/login` page that carries a local login form next to an `openid-connect/auth` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an `openid-connect/logout` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu's admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), not the `/webmail/` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailujeve vilice OIDC posegajo v svoje `/sso/login` stran, ki nosi lokalni prijavni obrazec poleg `openid-connect/auth` povezava, medtem ko overovana površina okrogle kocke nosi `openid-connect/logout` povezava; skupni pomočnik ujema prijavne kontrole z dostopnim imenom in ne more razlikovati med dvema, zato klikne odjavo. Administrator persona je blokiran iz drugega, neodvisnega razloga: Mailu je admin površina je ločena Flask aplikacija nameščena na `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), ne `/webmail/` Na površini OIDC pristanejo klici."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` — Matomo holds no Keycloak client, so the OIDC round-trip the shared helper waits for never happens; the administrator signs in on Matomo's native `index.php?module=Login` form against the local superuser configured in `vars/main.yml`. Biber is blocked for a different reason: the role provisions exactly one Matomo account, that same superuser, and has no per-user provisioning, so biber has no Matomo identity at all."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` zatiči `sso.enabled: false` — Matomo ne vsebuje Keycloak odjemalec, tako da OIDC krog-trip deljen pomočnik čaka na nikoli se ne zgodi; administrator se prijavite v Matomoje domorodna `index.php?module=Login` oblika proti lokalnemu superuporabniku, nastavljen v `vars/main.yml`. Biber je blokiran iz drugega razloga: vloga določbe točno eno Matomo račun, ta isti superuporabnik, in nima rezervacije na uporabnika, tako da biber nima Matomo identiteto sploh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle's site administrator is created by `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` and realigned on every pass, both from the `administrator` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant `tasks/04_oidc.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` bounces to the OIDC plugin and rewrites every `mdl_user` row to `auth='oidc'`, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in `meta/variants.yml` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodlov skrbnik strani je ustvarjen z `install_database.php` v `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` in ponovno na vsakem prehodu, tako iz `administrator` uporabnik, tako da je domača oblika in ponudnik identitete nosi eno skrivnost. V različici SSO `tasks/04_oidc.yml` kompleti `alternateloginurl` tako `/login/index.php` odbija na OIDC plugin in prepiše vsak `mdl_user` vrstica za `auth='oidc'`, tako da nobena oblika ne sprejme nobene skrivnosti; SSO-off variante v `meta/variants.yml` nimajo OIDC verige nadomestiti. Ena env datoteka je prikazana po vlogi, ne po varianti, zato mora zastava držati za najslabši primer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at `/auth` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sedi za oauthom2-proksi, katerih `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` v `meta/services.yml` prizna samo `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` ter `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber pripada nič, tako proxy ga zanika prej KIX To naredi vse. Premikaj posrednika KIX je dvostopenjska prijava: SPA še vedno predstavlja svoj zastopnik obrazec na `/auth` ki se veže na LDAP in skupni persona pomočnik nima druge stopnje po Keycloak Povratna vožnja."

