# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploy Decidim, an open-source participatory democracy platform for public consultations, civic processes, community voting, and collaborative policy creation."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Decidim, odprtokodna platforma participativne demokracije za javna posvetovanja, državljanske procese, glasovanje v skupnosti in oblikovanje skupne politike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **LibreTranslate** as a containerized web service using Docker Compose. It is designed to integrate seamlessly into the Infinito.Nexus stack, including optional Redis and database backends, CSP handling, and analytics integration."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja **LibreTranslate** kot internetna storitev v zabojnikih Docker Compose. Zasnovan je za nemoteno vključitev v Infinito.Nexus sklad, vključno z neobvezno Redis in baze podatkov, ravnanje s CSP in povezovanje analitike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Magento 2** via Docker Compose. It is aligned with the Infinito.Nexus stack patterns:"
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja **Magento 2** preko Docker Compose. Je usklajen z Infinito.Nexus vzorci sklada:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja **Shopware 6** uporaba **Docker**. Avtomatizira namestitev, migracijo in konfiguracijo vašega skladišča, povezovanje z osrednjim **MariaDB** podatkovna baza. Neobvezne komponente **Redis** ter **Odpri iskanje** izboljšati zmogljivost in zmogljivosti iskanja, **OIDC** integrira hrbtenico administracije z **Keycloak**. Mapa računov znak na enak način: Shopware nima admin-LDAP razširitev to vlogo lahko namestite, tako LDAP identitete priti skozi KeycloakUporabniška federacija namesto skozi svoj plugin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak’s user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja **Shopware 6** uporaba **Docker**. Avtomatizira namestitev, migracijo in konfiguracijo vašega skladišča, povezovanje z osrednjim **MariaDB** podatkovna baza. Neobvezne komponente **Redis** ter **Odpri iskanje** izboljšati zmogljivost in zmogljivosti iskanja, **OIDC** integrira hrbtenico administracije z **Keycloak**. Mapa računov znak na enak način: Shopware nima admin-LDAP razširitev to vlogo lahko namestite, tako LDAP identitete priti skozi Keycloakje uporabniška federacija namesto skozi plugin svoje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Baserow using Docker Compose, integrating key components such as PostgreSQL for the database, Redis for caching, and NGINX for secure domain management and certificate handling. It is designed to offer a robust, scalable solution for running your own Baserow instance in a containerized environment."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Baserow uporaba Docker Compose, ki vključuje ključne komponente, kot so PostgreSQL za zbirko podatkov, Redis za caching in NGINX za varno upravljanje domen in ravnanje s certifikati. Zasnovan je tako, da ponuja robustno, raztegljivo rešitev za delovanje svojega Baserow primer v kontejnerskem okolju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Coturn via Docker Compose using the ``sys-stk-semi-stateless`` stack."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Coturn preko Docker Compose uporaba ``sys-stk-semi-stateless`` kup."

