msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Coturn preko Docker Compose uporaba `sys-stk-semi-stateless` kup. Samodejno nastavlja:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Discourse using Docker, automating tasks such as container orchestration, service configuration, and routine administrative operations. It integrates key components like Redis and PostgreSQL, sets up domain routing with NGINX, and ensures streamlined updates for a reliable forum experience."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Discourse uporaba Dockerja, avtomatizacija nalog, kot so orkestracija zabojnikov, konfiguracija storitev in rutinske upravne operacije. Vključuje ključne komponente, kot so Redis ter PostgreSQL, vzpostavi domene usmerjanje z NGINX, in zagotavlja poenostavljene posodobitve za zanesljivo forum izkušnje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ERPNext as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream ``frappe/erpnext`` single-image multi-role pattern from `frappe_docker <https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker>`__: one Docker image, different commands per container (backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socketio, scheduler, two queue workers, plus a one-shot configurator). MariaDB and Redis come from the central ``svc-db-mariadb`` and ``svc-db-redis`` providers — the three Frappe Redis logical roles (``cache``, ``queue``, ``socketio``) share one central Redis instance via DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Authentication uses Frappe’s built-in Social Login Key against the shared Keycloak OIDC client without an oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federation and outbound SMTP via Mailu are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja ERPNext kot Infinito.Nexus spletna aplikacija, ki uporablja gornji tok ``frappe/erpnext`` vzorec več rolov z eno sliko `frappe_docker <https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker>`__: ena slika Docker, različni ukazi na posodo (hrbtni punirog, frontend ginx, websocket vtičnica, urniker, dva delavca v vrsti, plus enostrelni konfigurator). MariaDB in Redis prihajajo iz središča ``svc-db-mariadb`` ter ``svc-db-redis`` ponudniki – trije Frappe Redis Logične vloge (``cache``, ``queue``, ``socketio``) delež enega centralnega Redis primerek prek delitve števila DB (0 / 1 / 2). Overovitev uporablja Frappe je vgrajen v socialno prijavni ključ proti skupni Keycloak Odjemalec OIDC brez oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federacija in zunanji SMTP preko Mailu so povezani, ko so prisotni njihovi ponudniki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ERPNext as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream `frappe/erpnext` single-image multi-role pattern from [frappe_docker](https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker): one Docker image, different commands per container (backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socketio, scheduler, two queue workers, plus a one-shot configurator). MariaDB and Redis come from the central `svc-db-mariadb` and `svc-db-redis` providers — the three Frappe Redis logical roles (`cache`, `queue`, `socketio`) share one central Redis instance via DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Authentication uses Frappe's built-in Social Login Key against the shared Keycloak OIDC client without an oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federation and outbound SMTP via Mailu are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja ERPNext kot Infinito.Nexus spletna aplikacija, ki uporablja gornji tok `frappe/erpnext` vzorec več rolov z eno sliko [frappe_docker](https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker): ena slika Docker, različni ukazi na posodo (hrbtni punirog, frontend ginx, websocket vtičnica, urniker, dva delavca v vrsti, plus enostrelni konfigurator)MariaDB in Redis prihajajo iz središča `svc-db-mariadb` ter `svc-db-redis` ponudniki – trije Frappe Redis Logične vloge (`cache`, `queue`, `socketio`) delež enega centralnega Redis primerek prek delitve števila DB (0 / 1 / 2). Overovitev uporablja Frappejev vgrajen socialni ključ proti skupnemu Keycloak Odjemalec OIDC brez oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federacija in zunanji SMTP preko Mailu so povezani, ko so prisotni njihovi ponudniki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Fider as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using a single Docker Compose container backed by PostgreSQL. It configures SSO via Keycloak automatically on first deploy, optional email notifications via Mailu, and HTTPS via NGINX reverse proxy."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Fider kot del Infinito.Nexus kup z uporabo enega Docker Compose posoda s PostgreSQL. Nastavlja SSO preko Keycloak samodejno ob prvi uporabi, neobvezna elektronska obvestila preko Mailu, in HTTPS preko NGINX povratnega posrednika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Friendica using Docker, managing the Friendica application container alongside a central MariaDB instance. It provides tools for full resets, manual and automatic database reinitialization, email and general configuration debugging, and autoinstall processes, all to ensure your Friendica installation remains reliable and easy to maintain."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Friendica uporaba zdravila Docker, upravljanje Friendica Nanosni vsebnik poleg osrednjega MariaDB Primer. Zagotavlja orodja za popolno ponastavitev, ročno in avtomatsko ponovno vzpostavitev baze podatkov, e-pošto in splošne nastavitve razhroščevanje, in samodejno namestitev procesov, vse za zagotovitev vaše Friendica namestitev ostaja zanesljiva in enostavna za vzdrževanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Funkwhale using Docker. It orchestrates multiple services (including the API, Frontend, Celery Worker, Celery Beat, and Typesense) integrating with centralized PostgreSQL and Redis services for a fully containerized music sharing experience."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Funkwhale Uporaba zdravila Docker. Orkestruje več storitev (vključno z API, Frontend, Celery Worker, Celery Beat, in Typesense) povezovanje s centralizirano PostgreSQL ter Redis storitve za popolno izkušnjo souporabe glasbe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys FusionDirectory on Docker Compose against the project's central `svc-db-openldap` server. The OIDC variant gates the FusionDirectory web UI through `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar for SSO; the LDAP variant relies on the same FusionDirectory binding to `svc-db-openldap` as its primary auth path. RBAC follows the LDAP group model that FusionDirectory already understands natively, so no glue layer is required for authorisation mapping."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja FusionDirectory o Docker Compose proti središču projekta `svc-db-openldap` strežnik. OIDC varianta vrata FusionDirectory spletni uporabniški vmesnik `web-app-keycloak`SSO-proxy sidecar za SSO; LDAP varianta se opira na isto FusionDirectory vezan na `svc-db-openldap` Kot njegova glavna pot. RBAC sledi modelu skupine LDAP, ki FusionDirectory Že razume domače, zato za kartiranje dovoljenj ni potrebna lepilna plast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys FusionDirectory on Docker Compose against the project’s central ``svc-db-openldap`` server. The OIDC variant gates the FusionDirectory web UI through ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar for SSO; the LDAP variant relies on the same FusionDirectory binding to ``svc-db-openldap`` as its primary auth path. RBAC follows the LDAP group model that FusionDirectory already understands natively, so no glue layer is required for authorisation mapping."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja FusionDirectory o Docker Compose proti središču projekta ``svc-db-openldap`` strežnik. OIDC varianta vrata FusionDirectory spletni uporabniški vmesnik ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’ SSO-proxy stranska prikolica za SSO; LDAP varianta se opira na isto FusionDirectory vezan na ``svc-db-openldap`` Kot njegova glavna pot. RBAC sledi modelu skupine LDAP, ki FusionDirectory Že razume domače, zato za kartiranje dovoljenj ni potrebna lepilna plast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` as separate services: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (sole HTTP entry point), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot ``migrations`` job. All images share a single version pin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja GitLab iz uradne Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) Slike CE na ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` kot ločene storitve: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (edina vstopna točka HTTP), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) in en strel. ``migrations`` Služba. Vse slike delijo eno različico pin (``services.webservice.version``)PostgreSQL, Redis in S3-združljivo shranjevanje predmetov je povezano z iskanjem platforme (osrednje ali stranske prikolice), OIDC in SMTP prek platforme SSO in e-poštnih storitev. Sprednji posrednik prekine TLS in HTTP pošlje na delo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at `registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/` as separate services: `webservice` (puma), `sidekiq`, `workhorse` (sole HTTP entry point), `gitaly`, `shell` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot `migrations` job. All images share a single version pin (`services.webservice.version`). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja GitLab iz uradne Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) Slike CE na `registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/` kot ločene storitve: `webservice` (puma), `sidekiq`, `workhorse` (edina vstopna točka HTTP), `gitaly`, `shell` (gitlab-sshd) in en strel. `migrations` Služba. Vse slike delijo eno različico pin (`services.webservice.version`)PostgreSQL, Redis in S3-združljivo shranjevanje predmetov je povezano z iskanjem platforme (osrednje ali stranske prikolice), OIDC in SMTP prek platforme SSO in e-poštnih storitev. Sprednji posrednik prekine TLS in HTTP pošlje na delo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Gitea using Docker. It automates the setup and update processes for your self-hosted Git service, integrating with a central MariaDB for the database. With functionalities for updating, recreating the container, variable management, database access, and shell access to the application container, this role streamlines the management of your Gitea instance. With Hermes Agent or OpenClaw deployed alongside it, the role adds a ``gitea-mcp`` sidecar and declares it as the MCP server of the deployment: an internal ``/mcp`` endpoint on the container network plus the Gitea personal access token that MCP clients present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Gitea Uporaba zdravila Docker. To avtomatizira nastavitev in posodobitev procesov za vaš samogosti Git storitev, povezovanje z osrednjim MariaDB za bazo podatkov. S funkcionalnostmi za posodabljanje, poustvarjanje vsebnika, spremenljivo upravljanje, dostop do baze podatkov in lupinski dostop do vsebnika aplikacij, ta vloga racionalizira upravljanje vašega Gitea Primer. Z Hermes Agent ali OpenClaw Poleg tega je vloga še dodatna ``gitea-mcp`` stranska prikolica in jo razglasi za strežnik MCP uporabe: notranji ``/mcp`` končna točka omrežja zabojnikov in Gitea Osebni dostop, ki ga imajo stranke MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Gitea using Docker. It automates the setup and update processes for your self-hosted Git service, integrating with a central MariaDB for the database. With functionalities for updating, recreating the container, variable management, database access, and shell access to the application container, this role streamlines the management of your Gitea instance. With Hermes Agent or OpenClaw deployed alongside it, the role adds a `gitea-mcp` sidecar and declares it as the MCP server of the deployment: an internal `/mcp` endpoint on the container network plus the Gitea personal access token that MCP clients present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Gitea Uporaba zdravila Docker. To avtomatizira nastavitev in posodobitev procesov za vaš samogosti Git storitev, povezovanje z osrednjim MariaDB za bazo podatkov. S funkcionalnostmi za posodabljanje, poustvarjanje vsebnika, spremenljivo upravljanje, dostop do baze podatkov in lupinski dostop do vsebnika aplikacij, ta vloga racionalizira upravljanje vašega Gitea Primer. Z Hermes Agent ali OpenClaw Poleg tega je vloga še dodatna `gitea-mcp` stranska prikolica in jo razglasi za strežnik MCP uporabe: notranji `/mcp` končna točka omrežja zabojnikov in Gitea Osebni dostop, ki ga imajo stranke MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Hermes Agent in gateway mode as a Docker service, published behind the reverse proxy on its own subdomain, with its compose service pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host. The API server is protected by a generated bearer key, and when the LiteLLM Gateway is part of the deployment the agent's model endpoint is pointed at that gateway with a per-consumer virtual key. Agent state lives in a named volume that the Backup Docker Volumes service captures when it is enabled."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Hermes Agent v načinu prehoda kot Docker storitev, objavljena za povratnim posrednikom na svoji poddomi, s svojo komponiranje storitev, pripete na izolirani čas delovanja, da Kata & gVisor izbira vloge za gostitelja. – API strežnik je zaščiten z ustvarjenim nosilnim ključem, in ko LiteLLM Gateway je del razporeditve, na katero je opozoril modelni opazovani dogodek agenta na tem prehodu z virtualnim ključem na potrošnika. Agent država živi v imenovanem zvezku, da Backup Docker Volumes storitev zajema, ko je omogočena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Hermes Agent in gateway mode as a Docker service, published behind the reverse proxy on its own subdomain, with its compose service pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host. The API server is protected by a generated bearer key, and when the LiteLLM Gateway is part of the deployment the agent’s model endpoint is pointed at that gateway with a per-consumer virtual key. Agent state lives in a named volume that the Backup Docker Volumes service captures when it is enabled."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Hermes Agent v načinu prehoda kot Docker storitev, objavljena za povratnim posrednikom na svoji poddomi, s svojo komponiranje storitev, pripete na izolirani čas delovanja, da Kata & gVisor izbira vloge za gostitelja. – API strežnik je zaščiten z ustvarjenim nosilnim ključem, in ko LiteLLM Gateway je del razporeditve, na katero je opozoril modelni opazovani dogodek agenta na tem prehodu z virtualnim ključem na potrošnika. Agent država živi v imenovanem zvezku, da Backup Docker Volumes storitev zajema, ko je omogočena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Home Assistant as a container on its own canonical domain behind the reverse proxy, with the configuration directory kept in a persistent volume. It renders a ``configuration.yaml`` that trusts the proxy through ``use_x_forwarded_for`` and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs, and it attaches the hub to a shared overlay network. With Hermes Agent deployed alongside it, the role declares the hub as the MCP server of the deployment: an internal ``/api/mcp`` endpoint plus the long-lived access token that MCP clients present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Home Assistant kot vsebnik na svoji kanonični domeni za obratnim posrednikom, z nastavitveno mapo, ki se hrani v vztrajnem volumnu. To naredi a ``configuration.yaml`` ki zaupa posredniku skozi ``use_x_forwarded_for`` in projektno-zaupne CIDR-e, ki povezuje vozlišče s skupnim omrežjem. Z Hermes Agent ponujena poleg nje, vloga razglasi vozlišče kot MCP strežnik uporabe: notranji ``/api/mcp`` končna točka in dolgotrajen dostop, ki ga imajo stranke MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Home Assistant as a container on its own canonical domain behind the reverse proxy, with the configuration directory kept in a persistent volume. It renders a `configuration.yaml` that trusts the proxy through `use_x_forwarded_for` and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs, and it attaches the hub to a shared overlay network. With Hermes Agent deployed alongside it, the role declares the hub as the MCP server of the deployment: an internal `/api/mcp` endpoint plus the long-lived access token that MCP clients present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Home Assistant kot vsebnik na svoji kanonični domeni za obratnim posrednikom, z nastavitveno mapo, ki se hrani v vztrajnem volumnu. To naredi a `configuration.yaml` ki zaupa posredniku skozi `use_x_forwarded_for` in projektno-zaupne CIDR-e, ki povezuje vozlišče s skupnim omrežjem. Z Hermes Agent ponujena poleg nje, vloga razglasi vozlišče kot MCP strežnik uporabe: notranji `/api/mcp` končna točka in dolgotrajen dostop, ki ga imajo stranke MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, and ``configuration-as-code`` plugins, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or ``svc-db-openldap`` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Jenkins o Docker Compose. To gradi običaj Jenkins slika, ki pred namestitvijo ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, in ``configuration-as-code`` vstavki, nato priklopi JCSC YAML datoteko, ki žice varnostno kraljestvo proti Keycloak (varianta 0, OIDC) ali ``svc-db-openldap`` (varianta 1, LDAP). Čarovnik nastavitev je preskočil preko ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` Tako da JCSC config prevzame od prvega škornja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the `oic-auth`, `ldap`, `role-strategy`, and `configuration-as-code` plugins, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or `svc-db-openldap` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via `JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Jenkins o Docker Compose. To gradi običaj Jenkins slika, ki pred namestitvijo `oic-auth`, `ldap`, `role-strategy`, in `configuration-as-code` vstavki, nato priklopi JCSC YAML datoteko, ki žice varnostno kraljestvo proti Keycloak (varianta 0, OIDC) ali `svc-db-openldap` (varianta 1, LDAP). Čarovnik nastavitev je preskočil preko `JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false` Tako da JCSC config prevzame od prvega škornja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role's database, and installs the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla's core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Joomla o Docker Compose. To gradi običaj Joomla slika, ki peče v Composer za podaljšanje časa delovanja gradi, deluje Joomla CLI monter z bazo podatkov o vlogi, install in-role `plg_system_keycloak` vstavek tako mesto govori OIDC proti Keycloak z RBAC skupinskim kartiranjem. Različica z matrico preklopi vlogo na LDAP preko JoomlaNamesto jedrnega vstavka za avtentikacijo LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role’s database, and installs the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla’s core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Joomla o Docker Compose. To gradi običaj Joomla slika, ki peče v Composer za podaljšanje časa delovanja gradi, deluje Joomla CLI monter z bazo podatkov o vlogi, install in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` vstavek tako mesto govori OIDC proti Keycloak z RBAC skupinskim kartiranjem. Različica z matrico preklopi vlogo na LDAP preko JoomlaJedro LDAP vstavek za avtentikacijo namesto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project's standard `sys-stk-front-proxy` and `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream `kix-on-premise` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. The backend initialises its schema (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) against the central `svc-db-postgres` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with `pg_trgm` pre-activated via `services.postgres.extensions`; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`). Initial admin credentials are seeded via `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` on first start (see `meta/secrets.yml`)."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja KIX kot Infinito.Nexus spletna aplikacija za standardom projekta `sys-stk-front-proxy` ter `web-app-keycloak`SSO-proxy bočna veriga. Po toku navzgor `kix-on-premise` ladja za zabojnike posrednika, hrbtenjače in čelnice `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. Hrbtenica iniciira svojo shemo (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) proti sredini `svc-db-postgres` grozd ali proti vgrajeni prikolici, če v popisu ni centralnega ponudnika, `pg_trgm` predaktivirano prek `services.postgres.extensions`; predpomnilnik je lokalna vloga brez gesla redis sidecar (Začelje prezre `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`). Začetni admin poverilnice so sejali preko `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` ob prvem zagonu (glej `meta/secrets.yml`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project’s standard ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` and ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream ``kix-on-premise`` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from ``docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/``. The backend initialises its schema (``scripts/database/kix-schema.xml``) against the central ``svc-db-postgres`` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with ``pg_trgm`` pre-activated via ``services.postgres.extensions``; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores ``REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD``). Initial admin credentials are seeded via ``INITIAL_ADMIN_PW`` on first start (see ``meta/secrets.yml``)."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja KIX kot Infinito.Nexus spletna aplikacija za standardom projekta ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` ter ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’ SSO-proxy stranske verige. Po toku navzgor ``kix-on-premise`` ladja za zabojnike posrednika, hrbtenjače in čelnice ``docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/``. Hrbtenica iniciira svojo shemo (``scripts/database/kix-schema.xml``) proti sredini ``svc-db-postgres`` grozd ali proti vgrajeni prikolici, če v popisu ni centralnega ponudnika, ``pg_trgm`` predaktivirano prek ``services.postgres.extensions``; predpomnilnik je lokalna vloga brez gesla redis sidecar (Začelje prezre ``REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD``). Začetni admin poverilnice so sejali preko ``INITIAL_ADMIN_PW`` ob prvem zagonu (glej ``meta/secrets.yml``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Keycloak in a Docker environment, integrating it with a PostgreSQL database and enabling operation behind a reverse proxy such as NGINX. It manages container orchestration and configuration via Docker Compose and environment variable templates, ensuring a secure and scalable identity management solution."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Keycloak v okolju Docker, ki ga povezuje z PostgreSQL baze podatkov in omogoča delovanje za povratnim posrednikom, kot je NGINX. Upravlja orkestracijo in konfiguracijo zabojnikov preko Docker Compose in predloge okoljskih spremenljivk, ki zagotavljajo varno in razširljivo rešitev za upravljanje identitete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LAM in a Docker environment and integrates it with an NGINX reverse proxy to provide secure access. It leverages environment variable templates to configure LDAP connection settings and administrative credentials, ensuring a smooth and customizable installation of LDAP Account Manager."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja LAM v okolju Docker in ga združuje z obratnim posrednikom NGINX za zagotovitev varnega dostopa. Prilagaja okoljske predloge spremenljivk za nastavitev nastavitev priključkov LDAP in administrativnih poverilnic, kar zagotavlja nemoteno in prilagodljivo namestitev upravljalnika računov LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LM Studio as a headless model server in a single container, in both Docker Compose and Docker Swarm deployments. The server listens on port 1234 on the internal container network and is not published through the reverse proxy, while downloaded models and server settings persist in a dedicated volume. The role downloads its declared models at deploy time and the LiteLLM Gateway publishes them under the same aliases Ollama uses, so a consumer asks for one model name and reaches whichever backend the deployment provides."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja LM Studio kot brezglavi modelni strežnik v eni posodi, v obeh Docker Compose ter Docker Swarm razporeditve. Strežnik posluša na vratih 1234 na notranjem kontejnerskem omrežju in se ne objavlja prek povratnega posrednika, medtem ko preneseni modeli in strežniške nastavitve vztrajajo v namenskem obsegu. Vloga prenese svoje deklarirane modele ob uporabi in LiteLLM Gateway jih objavlja pod enakimi vzdevki Ollama uporablja, zato potrošnik zahteva eno ime modela in doseže, kar koli je v njegovi hrbtni strani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Listmonk using Docker, ensuring a robust and scalable setup for your newsletter management needs. Listmonk’s architecture supports a dedicated PostgreSQL database and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure access. To configure and manage your instance, use the provided configuration files:"
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Listmonk uporaba Dockerja, zagotavljanje robustne in razširljive nastavitve za potrebe upravljanja novic. Arhitektura Listmonk podpira namensko PostgreSQL podatkovna baza in integracija z NGINX obratnim posrednikom za varen dostop. Če želite nastaviti in upravljati svoj primerek, uporabite dane nastavitvene datoteke:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LiteLLM as a shared gateway container in Compose and Swarm deployments, backed by the central PostgreSQL service. The gateway is headless: it binds its HTTP port on the container host and claims no domain of its own, and the browser-facing surface is published separately by the LiteLLM Admin UI. It renders the model list from the interchangeable local backends available on the host, Ollama and LM Studio, and adds the OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter entries whose API key is configured. Once the gateway is up, it provisions one virtual key per consuming application through the gateway admin API."
msgstr "Ta vloga uvaja LiteLLM kot skupni prehodni vsebnik v Sestavljenih in Swarm razporeditve, ki jih podpira osrednji PostgreSQL storitev. Prehod je brez glave: svojo HTTP vrata veže na gostitelja zabojnika in trdi, da ni domeno svoje, in je brskalnik obrnjena površina objavi ločeno LiteLLM Admin UI. Omogoča, da je seznam modelov iz zamenljivih lokalnih hrbtenic na voljo na gostitelju, Ollama ter LM Studio, in doda OpenAI, Anthropic in OpenRouter vnosi, katerih API ključ je nastavljen. Ko je prehod odprt, zagotavlja en virtualni ključ za uporabo preko portala admin API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Mastodon using Docker, streamlining the installation and configuration of a full-featured social networking platform. Mastodon is built to support federation across multiple instances, offering robust content moderation, real-time updates, and flexible API integrations. Its advanced architecture includes separate services for the web frontend, streaming API, and background job processing, ensuring high performance and scalability for large communities."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Mastodon uporaba Dockerja, racionalizacija namestitve in konfiguracije platforme za polno družbeno mreženje. Mastodon je zgrajen tako, da podpira federacijo v več primerih, ponuja robustno vsebinsko zmernost, posodobitve v realnem času in fleksibilne API integracije. Njegova napredna arhitektura vključuje ločene storitve za spletno frontend, pretakanje API, in obdelavo delovnih mest v ozadju, ki zagotavlja visoko učinkovitost in razširljivost za velike skupnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Matomo using Docker, automating the setup of your analytics platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for configuration and data, and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Matomo is configured to provide reliable and scalable analytics for your digital presence."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Matomo uporaba Docker, avtomatizacija nastavitev vaše platforme analitike skupaj z njeno bazo podatkov. s podporo za zdravstvene preglede, trajno shranjevanje konfiguracije in podatkov ter povezovanje z obratnim posrednikom NGINX, Matomo je konfigurirana tako, da zagotavlja zanesljivo in razširljivo analitiko za vašo digitalno prisotnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys MediaWiki using Docker, automating the setup of your wiki instance along with its underlying MariaDB database. It handles generating the essential configuration file (LocalSettings.php) from a seeded template and integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure, efficient web access."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja MediaWiki uporaba Docker, avtomatizacija nastavitev vašega wiki primera skupaj z njegovim osnovnim MariaDB podatkovna baza. Ukvarja se z ustvarjanjem bistvene nastavitvene datoteke (LocalSettings.php) iz posejane predloge in se združuje z obratnim posrednikom NGINX za varen, učinkovit spletni dostop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Mobilizon using Docker, automating the setup of your event management platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for uploads and configuration, and seamless integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Mobilizon is configured to provide reliable and scalable event hosting for your community."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Mobilizon z uporabo Docker, avtomatizacijo nastavitev vaše platforme za upravljanje dogodkov skupaj z njegovo bazo podatkov. s podporo za zdravstvene preglede, trajno shranjevanje za nalaganje in konfiguracijo ter brezhibno integracijo z NGINX obratnim posrednikom, Mobilizon je konfigurirana tako, da zagotavlja zanesljivo in razširljivo gostovanje dogodkov za vašo skupnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Moodle using Docker, automating the setup of both the Moodle application and its underlying MariaDB database. It integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy to ensure secure and efficient web access and uses persistent storage to safeguard your data and configuration."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Moodle z uporabo Docker, avtomatizacijo nastavitev obeh Moodle uporaba in njena osnova MariaDB podatkovna baza. Združuje se z NGINX reverznim posrednikom, ki zagotavlja varen in učinkovit spletni dostop ter uporablja trajno shranjevanje za zaščito vaših podatkov in konfiguracij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Ollama as a local model server using Docker Compose. It integrates with Open WebUI for chat and Flowise for AI workflow automation, and configures local model caching so models can be reused across sessions or run fully offline."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Ollama kot krajevni modelni strežnik z uporabo Docker Compose. Združuje z Open WebUI za klepet in Flowise za avtomatizacijo AI delovnega toka, in konfigurira lokalni model caching, tako da se modeli lahko ponovno uporabijo med sejami ali teče popolnoma offline."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at ``openbao.<domain>``, behind the platform’s HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao’s own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja OpenBao kot Infinito.Nexus uporaba ``openbao.<domain>``, za platformo HTTPS povratnega posrednika. Ljudje se vpišejo skozi Keycloak z OIDC in prejmejo natančno privilegije njihove donacije RBAC skupine; stroji overijo ločeno prek AppRole. Država živi v OpenBaoLastna trgovina s splavi na trdovratni prostornini in statični pečat avto-odpečati vozlišče na vsakem ponovnem zagonu, tako da operaterju ni treba posredovati po prerazporeditvi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at `openbao.<domain>`, behind the platform's HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao's own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja OpenBao kot Infinito.Nexus uporaba `openbao.<domain>`, Za diskontom HTTPS. Ljudje se vpišejo skozi Keycloak z OIDC in prejmejo natančno privilegije njihove donacije RBAC skupine; stroji overijo ločeno prek AppRole. Država živi v OpenBaoLastna trgovina s splavi na trdovratni prostornini, in statični pečat avto-odpečati vozlišče na vsakem ponovnem zagonu, tako da nobenemu operaterju ni treba posredovati po prerazporeditvi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenClaw as a gateway container behind the reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Its compose service is pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host, its gateway configuration file is rendered from the role, and its state directory is kept in a persistent volume. Access is fronted by an OAuth2 proxy with Keycloak sign-in when Keycloak is part of the deployment."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja OpenClaw kot prehodni vsebnik za povratnim posrednikom na svoji kanonični domeni. Njegova komponirana storitev je vezana na izolirani čas, da Kata & gVisor vloga izbira za gostitelja, njegova nastavitvena datoteka je narejena iz vloge, njen imenik stanja pa se ohranja v vztrajnem obsegu. Dostop ima OAuth2 posrednik z Keycloak vpišite se, ko Keycloak je del razporeditve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenCloud using Docker Compose in single-binary mode and exposes it under ``open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It wires the deployment to the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC, sources users and groups from the central ``svc-db-openldap`` directory, and runs side by side with ``web-app-nextcloud`` so both file platforms can coexist on the same host. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja OpenCloud uporaba Docker Compose v enokomponentnem načinu in ga izpostavlja pod ``open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` skozi osrednji obratni posrednik. Preusmerja uporabo na skupno Keycloak Realm prek OIDC, viri uporabniki in skupine iz osrednjega ``svc-db-openldap`` imenik, in teče drug ob drugem z ``web-app-nextcloud`` tako da lahko obe datotečni platformi sobivata na istem gostitelju. Za podrobnosti o ožitvi identitete glej `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ ter `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenCloud using Docker Compose in single-binary mode and exposes it under `open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` through the central reverse proxy. It wires the deployment to the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC, sources users and groups from the central `svc-db-openldap` directory, and runs side by side with `web-app-nextcloud` so both file platforms can coexist on the same host. For identity wiring details see [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) and [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja OpenCloud uporaba Docker Compose v enokomponentnem načinu in ga izpostavlja pod `open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` skozi osrednji obratni posrednik. Preusmerja uporabo na skupno Keycloak Realm prek OIDC, viri uporabniki in skupine iz osrednjega `svc-db-openldap` imenik, in teče drug ob drugem z `web-app-nextcloud` tako da lahko obe datotečni platformi sobivata na istem gostitelju. Za podrobnosti o ožitvi identitete glej [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) ter [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Pi-hole as a containerized service within the Infinito.Nexus platform. Access is protected by OAuth2/Keycloak SSO, with RBAC enforced via OpenLDAP group membership."
msgstr "Ta vloga uporablja Pi-hole kot kontejnersko storitev v Infinito.Nexus ploščad. Dostop je zaščiten z OAuth2/Keycloak SSO, z uporabo RBAC OpenLDAP članstvo v skupini."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Pretix using Docker, automating the installation, configuration, and management of your Pretix server. It integrates with an external PostgreSQL database, Redis for caching and sessions, and an NGINX reverse proxy. The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo analytics, OIDC authentication, and centralized logout, making it a powerful and customizable solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Pretix uporaba Dockerja, avtomatizacija namestitve, nastavitev in upravljanje vašega Pretix strežnik. Vključuje se z zunanjim PostgreSQL podatkovna zbirka, Redis za caching in seje, in NGINX obratno posrednik. Vloga podpira napredne lastnosti, kot je globalna injekcija CSS, Matomo analitike, OIDC avtentikacijo, in centralizirano odjavo, zaradi česar je močna in prilagodljiva rešitev znotraj Infinito.Nexus ekosistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Prometheus as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using Docker Compose. It exposes the Prometheus web UI at ``prometheus.<domain>`` and protects it with SSO via Keycloak using oauth2-proxy. Universal logout is integrated for session termination."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Prometheus kot del Infinito.Nexus kupček Docker Compose- Razkrinkal je Prometheus Spletni vmesnik na ``prometheus.<domain>`` in ga ščiti s SSO preko Keycloak uporaba oauth2- Proxy. Univerzalna odjava je vključena za prekinitev seje."

