# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys and configures the Roulette Wheel application using Docker Compose. It pulls the latest source code from a Git repository, builds a Docker image from a configurable Node.js base, and starts the application on a user-defined local HTTP port."
msgstr "Ta vloga uporablja in konfigurira Roulette Wheel uporaba Docker Compose. To potegne najnovejšo izvorno kodo iz Git odložišče, zgradi sliko Docker iz nastavljive Node.js osnova in zažene program na krajevnih vratih HTTP, ki jih določi uporabnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project's standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd's `auth_method` to `svc-db-openldap` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project's central LDAP. The OIDC variant additionally loads `mod_oauth2_client` so a Keycloak-issued bearer token can be exchanged for an ejabberd session, but most XMPP clients still rely on SCRAM-SHA-256 over LDAP, which remains the interoperable default."
msgstr "Ta vloga se širi naprej Docker Compose s standardno ožičenjem za vlogo. Veže Ejabberdovo. `auth_method` do `svc-db-openldap` tako XMPP stranke potrdijo pri centralni LDAP projekta. Različica OIDC dodatno obremeni `mod_oauth2_client` Torej Keycloak-Izdano nosilno žeton lahko zamenjamo za ejabberd sejo, vendar večina XMPP Stranke se še vedno zanašajo na SCRAM-SHA-256 nad LDAP, ki ostaja interoperabilno privzeto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project’s standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd’s ``auth_method`` to ``svc-db-openldap`` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project’s central LDAP. The OIDC variant additionally loads ``mod_oauth2_client`` so a Keycloak-issued bearer token can be exchanged for an ejabberd session, but most XMPP clients still rely on SCRAM-SHA-256 over LDAP, which remains the interoperable default."
msgstr "Ta vloga se širi naprej Docker Compose s standardnim ožičenjem z vložkom. Veže ejabberdovo ``auth_method`` do ``svc-db-openldap`` tako XMPP stranke potrdijo pri osrednjem LDAP projekta. Različica OIDC dodatno obremeni ``mod_oauth2_client`` Torej Keycloak-Izdano nosilno žeton lahko zamenjamo za ejabberd sejo, vendar večina XMPP Stranke se še vedno zanašajo na SCRAM-SHA-256 nad LDAP, ki ostaja interoperabilno privzeto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys n8n Community Edition using the upstream ``docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n`` image backed by a PostgreSQL database (consumed from the central ``svc-db-postgres`` via ``sys-stk-full``). Authentication is handled by an **oauth2-proxy** sidecar (Keycloak OIDC) in V1, or left to n8n’s own user-management UI in V2. n8n Community Edition does not support LDAP — it is gated behind n8n’s Enterprise license (``ldap.controller.ee.js`` is not registered in CE) — so no LDAP variant is offered. Credentials stored inside n8n are encrypted at rest with a stable ``N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY``."
msgstr "Ta vloga uvaja n8n izdaja Skupnosti z uporabo zgornjega toka ``docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n`` slika, podprta z a PostgreSQL podatkovna zbirka (porabljene iz centralne ``svc-db-postgres`` preko ``sys-stk-full``). Overovitev se ravna z **oauth2-proksi** stranska prikolica (Keycloak OIDC) v V1, ali levo na n8Lastni uporabniško upravljanje UI v V2. n8n Skupnost izdaja ne podpira LDAP – je vrata za n8n’ Podjetniška licenca (``ldap.controller.ee.js`` ni registrirana v CE) – torej ni ponujena nobena varianta LDAP. Imetja, shranjena znotraj n8n so šifrirani v mirovanju s hlevom ``N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
