# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys no AI surface and declares no ``litellm`` service, because EspoCRM’s open-source distribution does not ship one. At the pinned version ``10.0.4``, ``application/Espo/Modules`` contains only ``Crm``, ``application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json`` declares no AI key, and the release ZIP the image is built from leaves ``custom/Espo/Modules`` empty. The AI features (Summary, Intelligent Paste, AI Email Composer, AI formula functions) live exclusively in the commercial `Intelligence extension <https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/>`__, which is closed source, requires a purchased license, and is published in no ``espocrm`` GitHub repository. Bumping the version does not change this: the extension is documented as requiring EspoCRM 10.0.3 or greater, so newer cores stay hosts for it rather than absorbing it."
msgstr "Ta vloga ne uporablja površine AI in navaja ``litellm`` storitev, ker EspoCRMOdprtokodna distribucija ga ne oddaja. Na pripeti različici ``10.0.4``, ``application/Espo/Modules`` vsebuje samo ``Crm``, ``application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json`` izjavlja, da ključ AI, in javnost ZIP slika je zgrajena iz listov ``custom/Espo/Modules`` Prazno. Lastnosti AI (Povzetek, Inteligentna leska, AI email Sestavljalnik, funkcije formule AI) živijo izključno v komercialnem `Intelligence extension <https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/>`__, ki je zaprt vir, zahteva kupljeno licenco, in se objavi v ``espocrm`` Skladišče GitHub. Odbijanje različice tega ne spremeni: razširitev je dokumentirana kot zahteva EspoCRM 10.0.3 ali več, zato novejša jedra ostanejo gostitelji zanjo, namesto da jo absorbirajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys no AI surface and declares no `litellm` service, because EspoCRM's open-source distribution does not ship one. At the pinned version `10.0.4`, `application/Espo/Modules` contains only `Crm`, `application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json` declares no AI key, and the release ZIP the image is built from leaves `custom/Espo/Modules` empty. The AI features (Summary, Intelligent Paste, AI Email Composer, AI formula functions) live exclusively in the commercial [Intelligence extension](https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/), which is closed source, requires a purchased license, and is published in no `espocrm` GitHub repository. Bumping the version does not change this: the extension is documented as requiring EspoCRM 10.0.3 or greater, so newer cores stay hosts for it rather than absorbing it."
msgstr "Ta vloga ne uporablja površine AI in navaja `litellm` storitev, ker EspoCRMOdprtokodna distribucija ni na ladji. Na pripeti različici `10.0.4`, `application/Espo/Modules` vsebuje samo `Crm`, `application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json` izjavlja, da ključ AI, in javnost ZIP slika je zgrajena iz listov `custom/Espo/Modules` Prazno. Lastnosti AI (Povzetek, Inteligentna leska, AI email Sestavljalnik, funkcije formule AI) živijo izključno v komercialnem [Razširitev obveščevalnih podatkov](https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/), ki je zaprt vir, zahteva kupljeno licenco, in se objavi v `espocrm` Skladišče GitHub. Odbijanje različice tega ne spremeni: razširitev je dokumentirana kot zahteva EspoCRM 10.0.3 ali več, zato novejša jedra ostanejo gostitelji zanjo, namesto da jo absorbirajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the LiteLLM admin UI as the browser-facing entry point of the headless LiteLLM Gateway. It runs in host mode and starts no container of its own: it claims a canonical domain, terminates TLS, applies the platform Content-Security-Policy, and reverse-proxies that domain to the local HTTP port the gateway publishes. Visitors sign in with the gateway's own UI credentials."
msgstr "Ta vloga uvaja uporabniški vmesnik LiteLLM admin kot vstopno točko brezglavega brskalnika LiteLLM Gateway. Deluje v gostiteljskem načinu in ne zažene nobenega zabojnika lastnega: trdi kanonično domeno, prekine TLS, uporabi platformo Content-Security-Policy in obratno-proksije, da domena za lokalni HTTP vrata, ki jih portal objavi. Obiskovalci se prijavijo z lastnimi izkaznicami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the LiteLLM admin UI as the browser-facing entry point of the headless LiteLLM Gateway. It runs in host mode and starts no container of its own: it claims a canonical domain, terminates TLS, applies the platform Content-Security-Policy, and reverse-proxies that domain to the local HTTP port the gateway publishes. Visitors sign in with the gateway’s own UI credentials."
msgstr "Ta vloga uvaja uporabniški vmesnik LiteLLM admin kot vstopno točko brezglavega brskalnika LiteLLM Gateway. Deluje v gostiteljskem načinu in ne zažene nobenega zabojnika lastnega: trdi kanonično domeno, prekine TLS, uporabi platformo Content-Security-Policy in obratno-proksije, da domena za lokalni HTTP vrata, ki jih portal objavi. Obiskovalci se vpišejo z lastnimi poverilnicami UI portala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the OpenTalk stack using Docker Compose and exposes the web frontend at ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It runs the Rust controller, the LiveKit WebRTC media server, the React web frontend, a dedicated Redis, a dedicated MinIO bucket for controller assets, a RabbitMQ broker, and the OpenTalk recorder for meeting MP4 archives. The deployment integrates with the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC and reuses ``svc-db-postgres`` and ``web-svc-coturn`` for relational data and STUN/TURN. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "Ta vloga vključuje OpenTalk kupček Docker Compose in razkriva spletno ospredje na ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` skozi osrednji obratni posrednik. Vodi Rust krmilnik, večpredstavnostni strežnik LiveKit, React webfrondend, namenjen Redis, posvečen MinIO vedro za sredstva upravljavcev, a RabbitMQ posrednika in OpenTalk zapisovalnik za sejo MP4 arhivi. Postavitev je povezana s skupno Keycloak kraljestvo prek OIDC in ponovne uporabe ``svc-db-postgres`` ter ``web-svc-coturn`` za relacijske podatke in STUN/TURN. Za podrobnosti o ožitvi identitete glej `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ ter `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the OpenTalk stack using Docker Compose and exposes the web frontend at `open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` through the central reverse proxy. It runs the Rust controller, the LiveKit WebRTC media server, the React web frontend, a dedicated Redis, a dedicated MinIO bucket for controller assets, a RabbitMQ broker, and the OpenTalk recorder for meeting MP4 archives. The deployment integrates with the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC and reuses `svc-db-postgres` and `web-svc-coturn` for relational data and STUN/TURN. For identity wiring details see [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) and [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."
msgstr "Ta vloga vključuje OpenTalk kupček Docker Compose in razkriva spletno ospredje na `open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` skozi osrednji obratni posrednik. Vodi Rust krmilnik, večpredstavnostni strežnik LiveKit, React webfrondend, namenjen Redis, posvečen MinIO vedro za sredstva upravljavcev, a RabbitMQ posrednika in OpenTalk zapisovalnik za sejo MP4 arhivi. Postavitev je povezana s skupno Keycloak kraljestvo prek OIDC in ponovne uporabe `svc-db-postgres` ter `web-svc-coturn` za relacijske podatke in STUN/TURN. Za podrobnosti o ožitvi identitete glej [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) ter [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the Python pull script that talks to each remote provider, installs the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL`), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock`. The remote side must expose a chrooted SSH/SFTP endpoint that publishes its backup tree: deploy [user-backup](../user-backup/) for the chrooted pull account and [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the published tree bounded."
msgstr "Ta vloga uporablja Python pull skripta, ki govori z vsakim oddaljenim ponudnikom, namesti sistemsko storitev, ki ga poganja na nastavljen urnik (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL`), in sešteva tek proti preostali skupini manipulacije preko `sys-lock`. Oddaljena stran mora izpostaviti zakoreninjeno SSH/SFTP končno točko, ki objavlja svoje rezervno drevo: uporabite [user-backup](../user-backup/) za ukoreninjeni račun in [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) da bo objavljeno drevo omejeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the Python pull script that talks to each remote provider, installs the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL``), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via ``sys-lock``. The remote side must expose a chrooted SSH/SFTP endpoint that publishes its backup tree: deploy `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ for the chrooted pull account and `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the published tree bounded."
msgstr "Ta vloga uporablja Python pull skripta, ki govori z vsakim oddaljenim ponudnikom, namesti sistemsko storitev, ki ga poganja na nastavljen urnik (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL``), in sešteva tek proti preostali skupini manipulacije preko ``sys-lock``. Oddaljena stran mora izpostaviti zakoreninjeno SSH/SFTP končno točko, ki objavlja svoje rezervno drevo: uporabite `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ za ukoreninjeni račun in `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ da bo objavljeno drevo omejeno."

