# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role detects unused **anonymous Docker volumes** that are not bound to any running container."
msgstr "Ta vloga zazna neuporabljeno **anonimni docker zvezki** ki niso vezani na tekoči vsebnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role detects unused **anonymous Docker volumes** that are not bound to any running container.   It can optionally exclude specific volumes from the check using a configurable whitelist."
msgstr "Ta vloga zazna neuporabljeno **anonimni docker zvezki** ki niso vezani na tekoči vsebnik. Iz preverjanja lahko neobvezno izključi določene količine z uporabo nastavljivega belega seznama."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role disk-space usage monitor; alerts when usage exceeds threshold."
msgstr "Ta nadzor uporabe diska-prostora; opozorila, ko uporaba preseže prag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does **not** sign leaf certificates. It only provisions the Root CA."
msgstr "To vlogo ima **ni** podpišite listna potrdila. To samo določa koren CA."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does NOT configure OIDC against ``web-app-keycloak``, LDAP against ``svc-db-openldap``, or any role-claim / LDAP-group RBAC mapping. Bridgy Fed authenticates users via their fediverse or atproto credentials at the source platform, not via local accounts. There is no local user table to bind an external IdP to, and no in-app authorisation tier to map a Keycloak role or LDAP group onto. Placing Bridgy Fed behind ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic and MUST NOT be done. This SSO and RBAC exception is documented per `lifecycle.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md>`__."
msgstr "Ta vloga NE nastavlja OIDC proti ``web-app-keycloak``, LDAP proti ``svc-db-openldap``, ali kateri koli nosilec vloge / RBAC skupine LDAP. Bridgy Fed overovi uporabnike prek njihovih fediverznih ali aproto poverilnic na izhodni platformi, ne prek lokalnih računov. Ni tabele krajevnih uporabnikov, ki bi vezala zunanji IDP na, in ni in-app dovoljenje stopnje za kartiranje a Keycloak vlogo ali skupino LDAP. Dajanje Bridgy Fed Zadaj ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’ SSO-proxy stranska prikolica bi prekinila vstop federacijski promet in se ne sme storiti. Ta izjema SSO in RBAC je dokumentirana na `lifecycle.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md>`__."

