# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role letsEncrypt TLS provider for sys-front-tls. Ensures certificate presence."
msgstr "Ta vloga omogoča šifriranje ponudnika TLS za sys-front-tls. Zagotavlja prisotnost certifikata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages GNOME Shell extensions by ensuring user extensions are enabled and by installing the CLI GNOME Extension Manager. The CLI tool facilitates the configuration and control of GNOME extensions via the command line."
msgstr "Ta vloga upravlja GNOME Shell razširitve z zagotavljanjem uporabniških razširitev so omogočene in z namestitvijo CLI GNOME Extension Manager. Orodje CLI omogoča konfiguracijo in nadzor razširitve GNOME preko ukazne vrstice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages WireGuard on a client system. It sets up essential services and scripts to configure and optimize WireGuard connectivity."
msgstr "Ta vloga upravlja WireGuard na odjemalskem sistemu. Nastavlja bistvene storitve in skripte za konfiguriranje in optimizacijo povezljivosti WireGuard."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages [Wireguard](https://www.wireguard.com/) on the host. It installs the necessary Wireguard packages, configures sysctl settings for IPv4/IPv6 forwarding, and deploys the Wireguard configuration file to enable the VPN service using [wg-quick](https://www.wireguard.com/quickstart/)."
msgstr "Ta vloga vodi [Wireguard](https://www.wireguard.com/) Na gostitelja. Vgradi potrebno Wireguard pakete, nastavi nastavitve sysctl za IPv4/IPv6 posredovanje in napotitev Wireguard nastavitvena datoteka, ki omogoča uporabo storitve VPN [wg-hiter](https://www.wireguard.com/quickstart/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages `Wireguard <https://www.wireguard.com/>`__ on the host. It installs the necessary Wireguard packages, configures sysctl settings for IPv4/IPv6 forwarding, and deploys the Wireguard configuration file to enable the VPN service using `wg-quick <https://www.wireguard.com/quickstart/>`__."
msgstr "Ta vloga vodi `Wireguard <https://www.wireguard.com/>`__ Na gostitelja. Vgradi potrebno Wireguard pakete, nastavi nastavitve sysctl za IPv4/IPv6 posredovanje in napotitev Wireguard nastavitvena datoteka, ki omogoča uporabo storitve VPN `wg-quick <https://www.wireguard.com/quickstart/>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the [root user](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Ta vloga vodi ustvarjanje in upravljanje ključa SSH za [uporabnik root](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) na ciljnem sistemu. Zagotavlja, da se ključ SSH ustvari, če še ne obstaja in če ne ustvari javnega ključa, kar omogoča varen dostop SSH za uporabnika korenin v avtomatiziranih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Ta vloga vodi ustvarjanje in upravljanje ključa SSH za `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ na ciljnem sistemu. Zagotavlja, da se ključ SSH ustvari, če še ne obstaja in če ne ustvari javnega ključa, kar omogoča varen dostop SSH za uporabnika korenin v avtomatiziranih okoljih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role monitors the health status of Docker containers on the system. It detects containers that are either **unhealthy** or have **exited with a non-zero code**, and triggers alerts if issues are found."
msgstr "Ta vloga spremlja zdravstveno stanje zabojnikov Docker na sistemu. Zaznava zabojnike, ki so bodisi **nezdravo** ali so **izhodno s kodo, ki ni nič**, in sproži opozorila, če se odkrijejo težave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role no longer ships its own local recording wrapper."
msgstr "Ta vloga ne pošilja več svojega lokalnega ovoja za snemanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role now supports OpenID Connect (OIDC) authentication with [Mailu-OIDC](https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC)! 🎉"
msgstr "Ta vloga zdaj podpira OpenID Connect (OIDC) avtentikacija z [Mailu-OIDC](https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC)! 🎉"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role optimizes storage allocation for Docker volumes by migrating volumes between SSD (rapid storage) and HDD (mass storage) based on container image types. It creates symbolic links to maintain consistent storage paths after migration."
msgstr "Ta vloga optimizira dodeljevanje skladišč za Docker s selitvijo količin med SSD (hitro shranjevanje) in HDD (skladiščenje mase) temelji na tipih slik zabojnikov. Ustvarja simbolne povezave za ohranjanje doslednih poti shranjevanja po selitvah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role owns the ``css`` service flag and declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate CSS-dependent surfaces on ``'web-svc-css' in group_names`` via their own ``meta/services.yml``. The role’s canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN’s canonical domain so health probes against the CSS hostname return a valid response."
msgstr "Ta vloga ima v lasti ``css`` oznaka službe in izjave ``web-svc-cdn`` kot toku, ki služi dejanskim CSS bajtom. Potrošniške vloge ``'web-svc-css' in group_names`` po svoje ``meta/services.yml``. Vloga je kanonična domena 301-preusmeri v kanonično domeno CDN, tako da zdravstvene sonde proti imenu gostitelja CSS vrnejo veljaven odgovor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role owns the `css` service flag and declares `web-svc-cdn` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate CSS-dependent surfaces on `'web-svc-css' in group_names` via their own `meta/services.yml`. The role's canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN's canonical domain so health probes against the CSS hostname return a valid response."
msgstr "Ta vloga ima v lasti `css` oznaka službe in izjave `web-svc-cdn` kot toku, ki služi dejanskim CSS bajtom. Potrošniške vloge `'web-svc-css' in group_names` po svoje `meta/services.yml`. Vloga je kanonična domena 301- Preusmeri na CDN-jevo kanonično domeno, tako da zdravstvene sonde proti gostitelju CSS vrnejo veljaven odgovor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role performs a complete cleanup of Docker resources by invoking a systemd-managed script. It removes unused Docker images, stopped containers, networks, build cache, and anonymous volumes. The cleanup is fully automated and can run on a schedule or be triggered manually."
msgstr "Ta vloga opravlja popolno čiščenje Docker virov s sklicevanjem na sistemsko vodeno skripto. Odstranjuje neuporabljene Docker slike, ustavi zabojnike, omrežja, gradi predpomnilnik in anonimne zvezke. Čiščenje je popolnoma avtomatizirano in lahko teče po urniku ali se sproži ročno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a **unified mail setup** for your hosts:"
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja **enotna nastavitev pošte** za vaše gostitelje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a comprehensive Dockerized environment for running Akaunting. It deploys the Akaunting application alongside a MariaDB database, configures environment variables, and integrates with NGINX as a reverse proxy. This setup is ideal for both production and development environments."
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja celovito okolje za vožnjo Akaunting. To uporablja Akaunting uporaba poleg MariaDB baze podatkov, konfigurira okoljske spremenljivke in se združuje z NGINX kot obratni posrednik. Ta nastavitev je idealna tako za proizvodno kot razvojno okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a fully automated deployment of [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) using Docker Compose on Arch Linux. It manages the entire lifecycle of the deployment, from cloning the upstream Docker repository and generating the `.env` configuration to customizing `compose.yml` for volume usage, WebSocket proxying, and optional LDAP/OIDC integration. The setup includes conditional Greenlight activation, WebRTC support via TURN/STUN, and various fixes for known container orchestration issues. The role is modular and integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus infrastructure, including reverse proxy configuration, domain management, and secrets templating. By default, BigBlueButton is deployed with best-practice hardening, modular secrets, and support for multiple authentication methods and scalable storage backends."
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja popolnoma avtomatizirano uvajanje [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) uporaba Docker Compose Na Arch Linuxu. Upravlja celoten življenjski cikel uporabe, od kloniranja zgornjega skladišča Docker in ustvarjanja `.env` nastavitev za prilagajanje `compose.yml` za uporabo glasnosti, prenos WebSocket in neobvezno integracijo LDAP/OIDC. Nastavitev vključuje pogojno aktivacijo Greenlight, podporo WebRTC preko TURN/STON in različne rešitve za znane težave z orkestracijo zabojnikov. Vloga je modularna in integrira brezhibno z Infinito.Nexus infrastrukturo, vključno z konfiguracijo povratnih posrednikov, upravljanjem domen in hrambo skrivnosti. Privzeto BigBlueButton se uporablja z najboljšo prakso utrjevanje, modularne skrivnosti, in podporo za več metod avtentikacije in razširljivi shranjevanje backends."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a fully automated deployment of `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ using Docker Compose on Arch Linux. It manages the entire lifecycle of the deployment, from cloning the upstream Docker repository and generating the ``.env`` configuration to customizing ``compose.yml`` for volume usage, WebSocket proxying, and optional LDAP/OIDC integration. The setup includes conditional Greenlight activation, WebRTC support via TURN/STUN, and various fixes for known container orchestration issues. The role is modular and integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus infrastructure, including reverse proxy configuration, domain management, and secrets templating. By default, BigBlueButton is deployed with best-practice hardening, modular secrets, and support for multiple authentication methods and scalable storage backends."
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja popolnoma avtomatizirano uvajanje `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ uporaba Docker Compose Na Arch Linuxu. Upravlja celoten življenjski cikel uporabe, od kloniranja zgornjega skladišča Docker in ustvarjanja ``.env`` nastavitev za prilagajanje ``compose.yml`` za uporabo glasnosti, prenos WebSocket in neobvezno integracijo LDAP/OIDC. Nastavitev vključuje pogojno aktivacijo Greenlight, podporo WebRTC preko TURN/STON in različne rešitve za znane težave z orkestracijo zabojnikov. Vloga je modularna in integrira brezhibno z Infinito.Nexus infrastrukturo, vključno z konfiguracijo povratnih posrednikov, upravljanjem domen in hrambo skrivnosti. Privzeto BigBlueButton se uporablja z najboljšo prakso utrjevanje, modularne skrivnosti, in podporo za več metod avtentikacije in razširljivi shranjevanje backends."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a locking mechanism to ensure that critical services are not interrupted during maintenance activities such as updates, backups, or patch applications. It waits for specified services to stop and prevents conflicting operations."
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja mehanizem zaklepanja, ki zagotavlja, da se ključne storitve med vzdrževanjem ne prekinejo, kot so posodobitve, varnostne kopije ali aplikacije obližev. Čaka, da se določene storitve ustavijo in preprečijo nasprotujoče si operacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides assets"
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja sredstva"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides the essential tooling for Python developers, enabling immediate use of ``python`` and ``pip`` from the command line. It supports both general-purpose scripting and advanced software engineering workflows."
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja bistveno orodje za razvijalce Python, kar omogoča takojšnjo uporabo ``python`` ter ``pip`` iz ukazne linije. Podpira tako skripte za splošno uporabo kot tudi delovne tokove napredne programske opreme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides the essential tooling for Python developers, enabling immediate use of `python` and `pip` from the command line. It supports both general-purpose scripting and advanced software engineering workflows."
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja bistveno orodje za razvijalce Python, kar omogoča takojšnjo uporabo `python` ter `pip` iz ukazne linije. Podpira tako skripte za splošno uporabo kot tudi delovne tokove napredne programske opreme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into ``config.php``, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Ta vloga je popolna Nextcloud uporaba Docker Compose. To avtomatizira nastavitev Nextcloud uporaba skupaj s podlago MariaDB podatkovna baza in konfigurira sistem za varen javni dostop prek povratnega posrednika NGINX. Uvedba vključuje samodejno konfiguracijo, ki se združuje v ``config.php``, zdravstveni pregledi rutine, in integrirana podpora za backup in okrevanje operacij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into `config.php`, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Ta vloga je popolna Nextcloud uporaba Docker Compose. To avtomatizira nastavitev Nextcloud uporaba skupaj s podlago MariaDB podatkovna baza in konfigurira sistem za varen javni dostop prek povratnega posrednika NGINX. Uvedba vključuje samodejno konfiguracijo, ki se združuje v `config.php`, zdravstveni pregledi rutine, in integrirana podpora za backup in okrevanje operacij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a dedicated machine as one or more GitHub Actions self-hosted CI runners for Infinito.Nexus. Each runner instance runs as an ephemeral Docker container (DooD — Docker out of Docker): the container mounts the host's `/var/run/docker.sock` and uses it to start a fresh Infinito DinD container for each CI job, then tears it down when the job finishes."
msgstr "Ta vloga določa namenski stroj kot eden ali več GitHub Dejanja samogostoljubnih CI tekačev za Infinito.Nexus. Vsak tekalni primerek teče kot efemerni zabojnik Docker (DooD – Docker iz Dockerja): posoda priklopi gostitelja `/var/run/docker.sock` in ga uporablja za začetek svežo posodo Infinito DIND za vsako delo CI, nato pa jo podre, ko se delo konča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
