# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role sets up a dedicated backup user (``backup``) for performing secure backup operations. It creates the user, configures a restricted SSH environment with a custom ``authorized_keys`` template and an SSH wrapper script, and grants necessary sudo rights for executing rsync. This configuration helps ensure controlled and secure access specifically for backup processes."
msgstr "Ta vloga postavlja namenskega rezervnega uporabnika (``backup``) za izvajanje varnih varnostnih ukrepov. Ustvarja uporabnika, nastavlja omejeno SSH okolje po meri ``authorized_keys`` predlogo in scenarij ovitka SSH, in dodeli potrebne pravice sudo za izvajanje rsync. Ta konfiguracija pomaga zagotoviti nadzorovan in varen dostop posebej za varnostne postopke."

