# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Those three ask whether the application is *served* over the self-signed CA. An application that only *calls* one has no domain of its own and would be skipped, so a service may declare ``ca_client: true`` and be answered on the deployment's TLS mode alone. Without it such a container verifies against an empty trust store and fails every outbound call at the TLS handshake."
msgstr "Ti trije se sprašujejo, ali je vloga *vročeno* nad samopodpisanim CA. Vloga, ki je samo *klici* Nihče nima svoje domene in bi bil preskočil, zato lahko storitev razglasi ``ca_client: true`` in je odgovor na način uporabe TLS sam. Brez njega takšen zabojnik preveri proti prazni trgovini zaupanja in ne opravi vsakega odhodnega klica na TLS rokovanje."

