# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tool categories exposed at the pinned version cover issues and work items, merge requests (including diffs and conflicts), pipelines and jobs, labels, project and group search, repository files and commits, and instance metadata. The set includes mutating tools (``create_merge_request``, ``create_workitem_note``, ``link_work_items``). GitLab enforces no server-side read-only mode: the ``mcp`` scope grants both read and create access, and the only restriction mechanism is the per-request ``X-Gitlab-Enabled-Mcp-Server-Tools`` header, which the clients in this repository do not send. ``mcp.tools.read_only_default`` and ``mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled`` are declarative metadata, not an enforced policy. Every tool call runs with the blast radius of the ``root`` account."
msgstr "Kategorije orodij, ki so izpostavljene na podprti različici, zajemajo vprašanja in delovne elemente, združujejo zahteve (vključno z diffs in konflikti), cevovodi in delovna mesta, oznake, iskanje projektov in skupin, shranjevanje datotek in zavez, in primer metapodatki. Komplet vključuje mutirajoča orodja (``create_merge_request``, ``create_workitem_note``, ``link_work_items``). GitLab uveljavlja noben način branja na strani strežnika: ``mcp`` obseg nepovratnih sredstev tako branje in ustvarjanje dostopa, in edini mehanizem omejitve je na zahtevo ``X-Gitlab-Enabled-Mcp-Server-Tools`` glave, ki jih stranke v tem skladišču ne pošiljajo. ``mcp.tools.read_only_default`` ter ``mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled`` so deklarativni metapodatki, ne uveljavljena politika. Vsak klic na orodje teče s polmerom eksplozije ``root`` račun."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tool categories exposed at the pinned version cover issues and work items, merge requests (including diffs and conflicts), pipelines and jobs, labels, project and group search, repository files and commits, and instance metadata. The set includes mutating tools (`create_merge_request`, `create_workitem_note`, `link_work_items`). GitLab enforces no server-side read-only mode: the `mcp` scope grants both read and create access, and the only restriction mechanism is the per-request `X-Gitlab-Enabled-Mcp-Server-Tools` header, which the clients in this repository do not send. `mcp.tools.read_only_default` and `mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled` are declarative metadata, not an enforced policy. Every tool call runs with the blast radius of the `root` account."
msgstr "Kategorije orodij, ki so izpostavljene na podprti različici, zajemajo vprašanja in delovne elemente, združujejo zahteve (vključno z diffs in konflikti), cevovodi in delovna mesta, oznake, iskanje projektov in skupin, shranjevanje datotek in zavez, in primer metapodatki. Komplet vključuje mutirajoča orodja (`create_merge_request`, `create_workitem_note`, `link_work_items`). GitLab uveljavlja noben način branja na strani strežnika: `mcp` obseg nepovratnih sredstev tako branje in ustvarjanje dostopa, in edini mehanizem omejitve je na zahtevo `X-Gitlab-Enabled-Mcp-Server-Tools` glave, ki jih stranke v tem skladišču ne pošiljajo. `mcp.tools.read_only_default` ter `mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled` so deklarativni metapodatki, ne uveljavljena politika. Vsak klic na orodje teče s polmerom eksplozije `root` račun."

