# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two budgets bound the step. A measured request may take `services.litellm.router_speed_timeout` (60s); the discarded first request gets `services.litellm.upstream_timeout` instead, because it pays the model load and holding it to the sample budget would time out exactly the models worth measuring. A request that exceeds its budget raises, which abandons that model rather than the deploy."
msgstr "Dva proračuna sta pomenila korak. Izmerjena zahteva lahko zahteva `services.litellm.router_speed_timeout` (60s); zavržena prva zahteva dobi `services.litellm.upstream_timeout` namesto tega, ker plačuje modelno obremenitev in jo drži v vzorčnem proračunu, bi bilo treba natančno določiti modele, ki jih je treba izmeriti. Zahteva, ki presega njen proračun, se nanaša na opustitev tega modela in ne na uporabo."

