# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two controls stack. The actuating tools are named in ``tools.mutating``, and ``mutating_tools_enabled: false`` withholds them from every client’s include list, so an agent is offered ``GetDateTime``, ``GetLiveContext`` and ``todo_get_items`` only. Entity exposure bounds those: only entities exposed to Assist are reachable, and the role exposes none. Setting ``mutating_tools_enabled: true`` offers the actuating tools as well; entity exposure then decides what they can reach."
msgstr "Dve kontroli. Orodja za aktiviranje so navedena v ``tools.mutating``, in ``mutating_tools_enabled: false`` jih zadrži pred seznamom strank, zato se agentu ponudi ``GetDateTime``, ``GetLiveContext`` ter ``todo_get_items`` Samo. Izpostavljenost subjekta je vezana na to: samo subjekti, izpostavljeni Assisstu, so dosegljivi, vloga pa ne izpostavlja nobene. Nastavitev ``mutating_tools_enabled: true`` ponuja tudi orodja za aktiviranje; izpostavljenost podjetju se nato odloči, kaj lahko doseže."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two controls stack. The actuating tools are named in `tools.mutating`, and `mutating_tools_enabled: false` withholds them from every client's include list, so an agent is offered `GetDateTime`, `GetLiveContext` and `todo_get_items` only. Entity exposure bounds those: only entities exposed to Assist are reachable, and the role exposes none. Setting `mutating_tools_enabled: true` offers the actuating tools as well; entity exposure then decides what they can reach."
msgstr "Dve kontroli. Orodja za aktiviranje so navedena v `tools.mutating`, in `mutating_tools_enabled: false` odreka jih seznamu strank, zato se agentu ponudi `GetDateTime`, `GetLiveContext` ter `todo_get_items` Samo. Izpostavljenost subjekta je vezana na to: samo subjekti, izpostavljeni Assisstu, so dosegljivi, vloga pa ne izpostavlja nobene. Nastavitev `mutating_tools_enabled: true` ponuja tudi orodja za aktiviranje; izpostavljenost podjetju se nato odloči, kaj lahko doseže."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two credentials, in two directions."
msgstr "Dve poverilnici v dve smeri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two decisions are worth naming. The rate is `concurrent_requests` requests per second with an equal burst and `nodelay`, rather than an eighth declared limit: a client allowed N calls in flight, each bounded by `timeout_seconds`, cannot sustain more than N/s unless every call returns instantly, so the rate is derived from the contract instead of being a number invented per role and drifting from it. And a refusal answers `429` rather than nginx's default `503`, because a client that should back off must not read the refusal as an outage. The location strips a trailing slash from the declared path so a request to the path without it cannot walk past the limits."
msgstr "Dve odločitvi sta vredni poimenovanja. Stopnja je: `concurrent_requests` zahteve na sekundo z enakim pokom in `nodelay`, namesto osme deklarirane omejitve: stranka je dovolila klice N med letom, vsak omejen z `timeout_seconds`, ne more vzdrževati več kot N/s, razen če se vsak klic takoj vrne, zato je stopnja izpeljana iz pogodbe, namesto da bi bila številka, ki je bila izmišljena za posamezno vlogo in se oddalji od nje. In zavrnitev odgovorov `429` namesto ginxovega privzetega `503`, ker stranka, ki bi se morala umakniti ne sme brati zavrnitev kot izpad. Na lokaciji se od deklarirane poti odcepi poševnica, zato prošnja za pot brez nje ne more iti mimo meja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two discovery queries, keeping today's filter semantics: the priority line is queried on its own whitelist so priority roles run even when the diff-derived whitelist would not have selected them, and the regular line is queried on the effective whitelist with the priority rows withdrawn. Concatenated, they are the sweep's ordered candidate list. Both lists are selection tokens (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`): what a token pins narrows the row, what it leaves open the line decides as it always did."
msgstr "Dve odkriti poizvedbe, vodenje današnji filter semantika: prednostna vrstica je povprašana na lastni beli listi, tako da prednostne vloge tečejo tudi, ko diff-pridobljena bela lista ne bi jih izbrali, in redna linija je povprašana na učinkoviti beli listi z umaknjenimi prednostnimi vrsticami. So naročeni kandidati. Oba seznama sta selekcijski žetoni (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`): kar žeton zatiči zožijo vrsto, kar pusti odprto črto odloči tako kot vedno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two distinct meanings of \"bridge\" MUST NOT be conflated:"
msgstr "Dva različna pomena \"bridge\" NE SMEJO biti povezani:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two further properties of the environment shaped the reconciliation design. Open WebUI stores tool servers in its own configuration and answers every later read with them, so a client that adopts that answer as the desired state leaves a newly declared provider registered nowhere and a rotated bearer registered stale, in both cases without a failure. And [`roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2`](../../../roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2) sets `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`, so API changes to environment-backed connection state are runtime state that has to be reconciled after every container restart."
msgstr "Dve nadaljnji lastnosti okolja sta oblikovali spravo. Open WebUI shranjuje orodne strežnike v svoji konfiguraciji in odgovarja na vsako kasnejše branje z njimi, tako da odjemalec, ki sprejme ta odgovor kot želeno stanje, zapusti novo prijavljenega ponudnika, registriranega nikjer in rotiranega nosilca registrirani zastoj, v obeh primerih brez neuspeha. In [`roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2`](../../../roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2) kompleti `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`, torej API spremembe stanja povezave z okoljem so stanje delovanja, ki ga je treba uskladiti po vsakem ponovnem zagonu posode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two helpers, both pure: `_resolve_variant_payloads` picks the variant payload for each app in a round's include set, and `_bake_overrides` merges those payloads under `applications:` inside the `--vars` JSON the inventory provision step consumes. Caller-supplied `extra_vars` always win over the variant bake — that's the documented \"user vars always win\" rule."
msgstr "Dva pomočnika, oba čista: `_resolve_variant_payloads` izbere koristni tovor variante za vsako aplikacijo v rundi vključuje set in `_bake_overrides` združi te tovore pod `applications:` znotraj `--vars` JSON stopnja inventarja porabi. Dobavljeno po klicu `extra_vars` Vedno zmagajo nad različico pečenke – to je dokumentirano \"uporabniški vars vedno zmaga\" Pravilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two host- and swarm-level facts constrain the design and are settled below: swarm's stack deploy drops the compose `runtime:` key, so the runtime has to become a node-wide default, and every deploy path in this repository runs inside a privileged container, so a hypervisor-backed runtime cannot be exercised here at all."
msgstr "Dva dejstva na ravni gostitelja in rojov omejujeta zasnovo in sta poravnana spodaj: rojev sklad razporedi spusti sestavljalnik `runtime:` ključ, tako da mora čas delovanja postati privzeto vozlišče, in vsaka pot uporabe v tem skladišču teče v privilegiranem zabojniku, tako da hipervizor-backtime ni mogoče izvajati tukaj sploh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two integration tests consume `ROLE_FILES` directly so adding or moving a file in the schema propagates the constraint without further edits:"
msgstr "Dva integracijska testa porabita `ROLE_FILES` neposredno tako dodajanje ali premikanje datoteke v shemi širi omejitev brez nadaljnjih urejanje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two joins carry the whole design and neither is accidental. The branch ends in ``; `` so a relay that refuses the message cannot decide liveness -- that verdict belongs to the probe this prefixes, and coupling them once left live web apps marked dead until the swarm converge gate gave up (ebdadd91b). The ``&&`` before ``touch`` stays, so a refused mail leaves no marker and the next probe retries instead of the smoke test becoming one-shot."
msgstr "Dva sestava nosita celotno zasnovo in nobena ni naključna. Veja se konča ``; `` Tako rele, ki zavrne sporočilo, ne more odločati o življenju -- da sodba pripada sondi te predpone, in jih spojiti, ko so pustili žive spletne aplikacije označene mrtve, dokler se rojska vrata niso predala. (ebdadd91b). O ``&&`` Pred uporabo ``touch`` ostane, tako da zavrnjena pošta ne pušča marker in naslednja sonda retries namesto da bi dim test postal en strel."

