# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Navzgor ``host:port``: sestavi ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; roj ``<entity>:<internal>`` (deljeni alias) za začetek aplikacije ali ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` za imenovane stranske prikolice (sso-proksi). A ``host_gateway`` app vodi vozlišče-lokalno pod rojem in objavi svoje lokalno pristanišče gostitelju, tako da prekrivni posrednik doseže na ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` preko gostiteljskega prehoda (Klicatelj sproži to stvar. DEPLOYMENT_MODE, ker takšne aplikacije silijo v komponiranje)-Pogrešana notranja vrata."

