msgid "Use this page for iterating on GitHub Actions workflows locally through Act. For role-level and spec-level iteration, see [Compose Loop](compose.md) and [Playwright Spec Loop](playwright.md). For the swarm deploy loop, see [Swarm Loop](swarm.md)."
msgstr "Uporabite to stran za iterating na GitHub Dejanja delo teče lokalno z zakonom. Za iteracijo na ravni vloge in na ravni spektrov glej [Zanka sestavljanja](compose.md) ter [Predvajaj Spec Loop](playwright.md). Za roj uporabljati zanko, glej [Swarm Loop](swarm.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Use this page for iterating on a local compose app deploy during role-level debugging or development. For spec-level inner-loop iteration, see [Playwright Spec Loop](playwright.md). For the swarm deploy of the same role, see [Swarm Loop](swarm.md). For iterating on GitHub Actions workflows with Act, see [Workflow Loop](workflow.md)."
msgstr "Uporabite to stran za iteriranje na lokalni komponiraj aplikacijo uporabo med razhroščevanjem ali razvojem na ravni vloge. Za notranjo iteracijo spektrov glej [Predvajaj Spec Loop](playwright.md). Za roj razporediti enako vlogo, glej [Swarm Loop](swarm.md). Za iteracijo o dejavnostih GitHub z zakonom glej [Zanka za potek dela](workflow.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Use this page for shell-script-specific guidance."
msgstr "Uporabite to stran za navodila, specifična za lupino."

