# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Use this when the YAML payload comes from somewhere other than a file (HTTP response body, stdin, an intermediate buffer). The path-keyed cache cannot help here — every call parses afresh — but the helper exists for symmetry with :func:`dump_yaml_str` so callers never have to ``import yaml`` directly."
msgstr "Uporabite to, ko koristni tovor YAML ne prihaja iz datoteke (Odzivno telo HTTP, stdin, vmesni pufer). Predpomnilnik na ključ ne more pomagati tukaj – vsak klic razčlenjuje na novo – ampak pomočnik obstaja za simetrijo z :func:`dump_yaml_str` Zato klicateljem ni treba. ``import yaml`` neposredno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Use this when you changed Ansible roles, inventories, or playbook-related files."
