# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Use this when you need live external verification. It is intentionally excluded from `make test`."
msgstr "Uporabite to, ko potrebujete živo zunanje preverjanje. Namerno je izključen iz `make test`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Use this when you want CI-like lint validation."
