# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Use this when your local inventory is broken or you want a clean reset."
msgstr "Uporabite to, ko je vaš lokalni inventar pokvarjen ali želite čisto reset."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Use this whenever a change touches at least one file that is not `.md` or `.rst`, or before opening a Pull Request."
msgstr "Uporabite to vsakič, ko se sprememba dotakne vsaj ene datoteke, ki ni `.md` ali `.rst`, ali pred odprtjem Pull zahteva."

