msgid "Variant 2 also pins `services.jeff.enabled` true, which is what selects the strategy and what `test_bond_baseline` requires of a loose-bond partner: a service nothing ever enables is a service nothing ever tests. Variant 1 keeps `weighted` with three real models, so each strategy owns one observable round."
msgstr "Varianta 2 tudi zatiči `services.jeff.enabled` Res je, kar izbere strategijo in kaj `test_bond_baseline` zahteva neobveznega partnerja: storitev, ki je nikoli ne omogoča, je storitev, ki je ni nikoli preizkusil. Varianta 1 Obdrži `weighted` s tremi pravimi modeli, tako da ima vsaka strategija v lasti en opazen krog."

