# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Verify in a swarm cluster that the `force_bridge` upstream actually reaches the gateway: openresty resolves `host.docker.internal` to the host gateway, while `svc-ai-litellm` publishes `{{ DOCKER_BIND_HOST }}:8081:4000`. On a real host `DOCKER_BIND_HOST` is `127.0.0.1`, and the assumption is that `docker stack deploy` drops the bind IP from the short port syntax and publishes on all interfaces via the routing mesh. If that assumption fails, publish the gateway port in host mode (long syntax) or give openresty a `litellm` consumer flag instead."
msgstr "Preveriti v roj grozdu, da `force_bridge` v smeri proti toku dejansko doseže prehod: odprte rešitve `host.docker.internal` do vhoda gostitelja, medtem ko `svc-ai-litellm` objavlja `{{ DOCKER_BIND_HOST }}:8081:4000`. Na pravega gostitelja. `DOCKER_BIND_HOST` m `127.0.0.1`, in predvidevamo, da `docker stack deploy` spusti vezni IP iz sintaksa kratkih vrat in objavlja na vseh vmesnikih preko mrežnega očesa za usmerjanje. Če ta predpostavka ne uspe, objavi vrata vrat v gostiteljskem načinu (dolga sintaksa) ali openresty a `litellm` Zastava za potrošnike."

