# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Hodi (morda gnezdi) poverilnice shema in oddajajo en trezor blok na skalarni list v ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (Npr. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) vgnezdene KomentiraneZemljevide, tako da vsak list postane svoj šifriran vstop, namesto da se sesuje preko ``str(dict)`` v Python-repr mehur (regresija, ki je prekinila potek 26428080957 delovna mesta 77797371397 ter 77797371442 besedilo web-app-espocrm ter web-app-listmonk)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walk every `roles/*/meta/server.yml` and collect occupied CIDRs from `networks.local.subnet`."
msgstr "Hodi vsak `roles/*/meta/server.yml` in zbiranje zasedenih CIDR iz `networks.local.subnet`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walk every `roles/*/meta/services.yml` and collect ints under `<entity>.ports.<scope>.<category>` (across ALL entities and ALL roles)."
msgstr "Hodi vsak `roles/*/meta/services.yml` in zbiranje intov pod `<entity>.ports.<scope>.<category>` (vse entitete in vse vloge)."

