# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What a token leaves open belongs to the line it stands in: `priority` covers every remaining combination in one sweep, `whitelist` keeps the rotation and the row's position in the matrix. A pin the row cannot take aborts the matrix rather than dropping the row, because a dropped row would report a green run for a combination that never ran. Such a pin is `@swarm` on a role without its own stack, `+tor` on a variant that pins `services.tor.enabled` false, or any axis that fights the run's own `mode`, `tor`, `distros`, `filesystem` or `architectures` input, or `:arm64` on a role whose `meta/services.yml` declares `architectures: [amd64]`."
msgstr "Odprti listi pripadajo vrsti, v kateri stoji: `priority` zajema vse preostale kombinacije v enem pregledu, `whitelist` ohranja vrtenje in položaj vrste v matriki. Priponka v vrstici ne more prekiniti matrike, namesto da bi spustila vrstico, ker bi spuščena vrsta sporočila zeleni tek za kombinacijo, ki ni nikoli tekla. Taka igla je `@swarm` na vlogo brez lastnega sklada, `+tor` na različici, ki zatiči `services.tor.enabled` Napačna, ali katera koli os, ki se bori proti begu. `mode`, `tor`, `distros`, `filesystem` ali `architectures` vnos ali `:arm64` o vlogi, katere `meta/services.yml` razglasi `architectures: [amd64]`."

