msgid "What the decision cost"
msgstr "Koliko stane odločitev?"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the decision cost and what enforcing it uncovered"
msgstr "Koliko je odločitev stala in kakšno uveljavljanje je razkrila"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the deploy axes may draw from, and how they draw."
msgstr "Iz česa lahko črpajo osi in kako jih vlečejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the rejection got right still holds and is now a cost rather than an argument. jeff ships no container image, so the role builds one from a pinned commit. It answers over a 575M GLiFormer encoder, so it carries a checkpoint. And the `auto` alias now depends on a service that can be unavailable, which is why an unreachable decider rejects loudly instead of falling back."
msgstr "Kar je zavrnitev dobila prav, še vedno drži in je zdaj cena namesto argumenta. Jeff ladje brez slike zabojnika, tako da vloga gradi eno iz pripete zaveze. To je odgovor na 575Kodirnik M GLiFormer, zato nosi kontrolno točko. In `auto` alias je zdaj odvisen od storitve, ki je lahko nedosegljiva, zaradi česar nedosegljiv odločevalec glasno zavrne, namesto da bi padel nazaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the rejection got wrong was the reach of its last point. A learned decider does make a CI row speak less directly for production, but only for the rounds that deploy it; the `weighted` strategy still decides every round that does not, and it remains reproducible."
msgstr "Zavrnitev se je zmotila. Izučeni odločevalec naredi vrsto CI govorijo manj neposredno za proizvodnjo, vendar samo za kroge, ki ga uporabljajo; `weighted` strategija še vedno odloča o vsakem krogu, ki ne, in ostaja ponovljiva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the role declares wins. A role that names its modes gets exactly those, which is how an injector without a stack of its own can still be deployed into compose and swarm alongside the partner that carries one."
msgstr "Kar je v vlogi, zmaga. Vloga, ki imenuje svoje načine, dobi točno tiste, kar je, kako lahko injektor brez sklad lastnega še vedno razporedijo v komponiranje in roj poleg partnerja, ki nosi enega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the role does"
msgstr "Kakšna je vloga?"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the role does not do"
msgstr "Kaj vloga ne počne"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the row does 🚀"
msgstr "Kaj počne vrsta? 🚀"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the source asked for does not enter that decision: the run's own jobs are the evidence. A suite reached on the ``auto`` default is the common case -- ``call-orchestrator.yml`` reads ``auto`` as global scope off the ``whitelist`` alone, so a ``--failed`` retrigger, which puts its selection on ``priority`` and leaves the whitelist empty, would run every green suite again for as long as the retrigger chain lasts."
msgstr "Kar je vir zahteval, ne gre v to odločitev: lastne službe teka so dokazi. Apartma dosegel na ``auto`` privzeto je pogost primer -- ``call-orchestrator.yml`` bere ``auto`` kot globalni obseg off ``whitelist`` sam, tako da ``--failed`` retrigger, ki daje svojo izbiro na ``priority`` in pusti belo listo prazno, bi tekel vsak zeleni apartma znova za toliko časa, dokler je veriga retrigger traja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What the token narrows, as the key two tokens are equal under."
msgstr "Kaj žeton zoži, kot ključni dve žetoni so enaki pod."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What this does:"
msgstr "Kaj to pomeni?"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What this gives up is the guarantee the pinned form exists for: the combination that failed may not be among the ones the retrigger draws."
msgstr "To se odreče jamstvu, za katerega obstaja pripeta oblika: kombinacija, ki je spodletela, morda ne bo med tistimi, ki jih vleče retrigger."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What this role does"
msgstr "Kakšna je ta vloga?"

