# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME is set to a non-default value (e.g. \"runner-1\" for self-hosted runner instances), the project name is incorporated so runner CI jobs don't conflict with the always-running dev container."
msgstr "Kdaj COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME je nastavljen na vrednost, ki ni neplačila (Npr. \"runner-1\" za samogostujoče tekače), Ime projekta je vključeno, da ne bi bilo težav z dev kontejnerjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When Jinja gets rendered ⏱️"
msgstr "Ko bo Jinja rešena.️"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When NO primary app ships a `meta/variants.yml`, the planner falls back to this path — the `CombinedResolver` walks `dependencies` and `shared:`-edges in the variant-merged services map and Jinja flags are evaluated at deploy time against `group_names`. `run_after` is NOT followed for inclusion (it is a pure ordering hint), so a variant that disables a service does not get the provider re-added through the ordering edge. This module owns the include resolution that path needs and nothing else; the round's variant-merged services maps come from `utils.roles.applications.variants`, which the CI selection resolves its closure from as well."
msgstr "Ko NI primarne aplikacije pošilja a `meta/variants.yml`, planer pade nazaj na to pot – `CombinedResolver` sprehodi `dependencies` ter `shared:`-robe na zemljevidu storitev, ki se uporabljajo za variante, in zastave Jinja se ocenijo ob času uvajanja proti `group_names`. `run_after` se ne upošteva za vključitev (To je čisti namig.), tako varianta, ki onemogoči storitev ne dobi ponudnika ponovno dodan skozi rob naročila. Ta modul ima v lasti tudi ločljivost, ki jo pot potrebuje, in nič drugega; zemljevidi različnih storitev kroga prihajajo iz `utils.roles.applications.variants`, iz katerega izbor CI tudi razreši njegovo zaprtje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When OIDC and/or LDAP are enabled, local password login is deprioritised; users authenticate via the configured provider(s)."
msgstr "Ko sta OIDC in/ali LDAP omogočena, je krajevna prijava gesla depriorised; uporabniki overijo preko nastavljenega ponudnika(s)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When OIDC is enabled, you MUST disable or hide the normal login form in the UI if the target application does not already provide a dedicated configuration switch for that behavior."
msgstr "Ko je OIDC omogočen, MORATE onemogočiti ali skriti običajen prijavni obrazec v uporabniškem vmesniku, če ciljna aplikacija že ne zagotavlja namenskega nastavitvenega stikala za to vedenje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When Playwright coverage is included"
msgstr "Ko je vključena pokritost z Playwrightom"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When To Use Which 🎯"
msgstr "Kdaj uporabiti 🎯"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `Dockerfile.j2` Is Acceptable 🤔"
msgstr "Kdaj `Dockerfile.j2` Ali je sprejemljivo 🤔"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is deployed, the node’s ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` is the minted ``.onion`` address, so the whole stack (web vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) resolves onion domains consistently. The Tor daemon runs as a host-network compose sidecar and maps one hidden service to the host OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); per-app subdomains (``<app>.<node>.onion``) are routed by the ``Host`` header. TLS is off on the onion side (onion v3 already provides transport encryption + server authentication); apps still receive ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` because ``.onion`` is a browser Secure Context."
msgstr "Kdaj ``svc-net-tor`` je razporejeno, vozlišče ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` je kovano ``.onion`` naslov, tako da celoten sklad (spletni vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) dosledno rešuje čebulne domene. Ozadnji program Tor deluje kot gostitelj-omrežje, sestavlja stransko prikolico in mapira eno skrito storitev gostitelju OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); poddomene po aplikaciji; (``<app>.<node>.onion``) jih vodi ``Host`` Glava. TLS je izključen na čebulni strani. (čebula v3 že zagotavlja šifriranje prenosa + avtentikacijo strežnika); aplikacije še vedno prejemajo ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` ker ``.onion`` je brskalnik Secure Context."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is in the deploy, mint (or reuse) the node onion and set ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` in the host_vars."
msgstr "Kdaj ``svc-net-tor`` je v uporabi, metin (ali ponovno uporabo) vozlišče in komplet ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` v host_vars."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``tor_node`` is set (svc-net-tor deployed) and the URL's host is the ``primary_domain`` or a subdomain of it, swap that suffix for ``tor_node`` and force the ``http`` scheme (onion services are plaintext-only). Anything else — empty inputs, a host not under ``primary_domain``, an unparseable value — is returned unchanged, so the filter is a safe no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "Kdaj ``tor_node`` je nastavljen (svc-net-tor razporejeno) in gostitelj URL je ``primary_domain`` ali poddomino, zamenjaj to pripono za ``tor_node`` in prisili ``http`` shema (Čebulne storitve so samo besedilo). Vse drugo – prazni vložki, gostitelj ni pod ``primary_domain``, nespremenljiva vrednost – se vrne nespremenjena, tako da filter je varen brez-op na jasno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``version`` is unset (no services value, no override), the lookup returns the bare ``<image>`` (unpinned) and emits a ``display.warning`` so the operator notices the unpinned reference without aborting the play."
msgstr "Kdaj ``version`` je izključen (brez vrednosti storitev, brez razveljavitve), iskanje vrne goli ``<image>`` (nevezan) in oddaja a ``display.warning`` tako da operater opazi nevezano referenco brez prekinitve igre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for `--clients N` and calls `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` to fill in `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` automatically. The contributor MAY override the suggestion interactively. See [port.md](port.md) for the matching ports flow."
msgstr "Kdaj `cli create role` Odra ima novo vlogo. `--clients N` in klici `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` Izpolniti `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` samodejno. Prispevek lahko interaktivno prevlada nad predlogom. Glej. [port.md](port.md) za pretok ustreznih vrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for required port categories per service entity and calls `cli contributing network ports suggest --scope <…> --category <…> --count 1` per slot to fill in the entity's `ports` map. The contributor MAY override either suggestion interactively. See [address.md](address.md) for the matching subnet flow."
msgstr "Kdaj `cli create role` Odseki imajo novo vlogo, kar spodbuja zahtevane kategorije pristanišč po storitvenih enotah in klicih `cli contributing network ports suggest --scope <…> --category <…> --count 1` na režo za izpolnitev obveznosti subjekta `ports` zemljevid. Prispevek lahko interaktivno prevlada nad vsakim predlogom. Glej. [address.md](address.md) za ujemanje podmrežnega toka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `container` is given, `log_path` is interpreted as a path INSIDE that container and read via `docker exec tail`. When `container` is None, `log_path` is read directly from the host filesystem."
msgstr "Kdaj `container` se daje, `log_path` se razlaga kot pot, ki se nahaja v tem vsebniku, in bere preko `docker exec tail`. Kdaj? `container` ni nobenega, `log_path` se bere neposredno iz gostiteljskega datotečnega sistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `default:` is present, the credential generator MUST NOT generate a new value via `algorithm:`. It writes the literal `default:` string verbatim."
msgstr "Kdaj `default:` je prisoten, generator zaupanja ne sme ustvariti nove vrednosti preko `algorithm:`. Piše dobesedno `default:` niz dobesedno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `lookup('users', 'administrator').tokens['web-app-matomo']` is empty, `sys-front-inj-matomo` sets `inj_enabled.matomo = false` for the current domain. This prevents the NGINX template from rendering the Matomo body snippet (which would reference `matomo_site_id`) and skips `inject.yml` entirely. The play continues without error."
msgstr "Kdaj `lookup('users', 'administrator').tokens['web-app-matomo']` je prazna, `sys-front-inj-matomo` kompleti `inj_enabled.matomo = false` za trenutno domeno. To preprečuje, da bi NGINX predlogo Matomo snipet telesa (ki bi se sklicevala `matomo_site_id`) in preskoči `inject.yml` Popolnoma. Igra se nadaljuje brez napak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `meta/variants.yml` declares variant-specific behaviour (WordPress Multisite, Moodle LDAP-only, …), the spec MAY add scenarios that gate on a variant-specific env var via `test.skip(!process.env.<VARIANT>_ENABLED, \"<reason naming the variant flag>\")`. Variant-gated scenarios MUST surface in the reporter as `skipped` with a reason naming the flag, never as silent no-ops."
msgstr "Kdaj `meta/variants.yml` razglasi obnašanje, specifično za varianto (WordPress multisite, Moodle LDAP-samo, ...), Spec lahko dodate scenarije, ki vrata na variantno specifičnega env var preko `test.skip(!process.env.<VARIANT>_ENABLED, \"<reason naming the variant flag>\")`. Variant-gated scenariji MORAjo nastati v novinarju kot `skipped` Z razlogom imenuje zastavo, nikoli kot tiho brez-ops."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `services.talk.enabled` is true, Nextcloud Talk MUST use the dedicated `web-svc-coturn` service for STUN and TURN instead of the HPB port exposed by `web-app-nextcloud`."
msgstr "Kdaj `services.talk.enabled` je res, Nextcloud Talk MORA uporabljati namenske `web-svc-coturn` storitev za STUN in TURN namesto vrat HPB, izpostavljenih z `web-app-nextcloud`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `svc-net-tor` is deployed, the node's `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` is the minted `.onion` address, so the whole stack (web vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) resolves onion domains consistently. The Tor daemon runs as a host-network compose sidecar and maps one hidden service to the host OpenResty (`HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80`); per-app subdomains (`<app>.<node>.onion`) are routed by the `Host` header. TLS is off on the onion side (onion v3 already provides transport encryption + server authentication); apps still receive `X-Forwarded-Proto: https` because `.onion` is a browser Secure Context."
msgstr "Kdaj `svc-net-tor` je razporejeno, vozlišče je `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` je kovano `.onion` naslov, tako da celoten sklad (spletni vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) dosledno rešuje čebulne domene. Ozadnji program Tor deluje kot gostitelj-omrežje, sestavlja stransko prikolico in mapira eno skrito storitev gostitelju OpenResty (`HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80`); poddomene po aplikaciji; (`<app>.<node>.onion`) jih vodi `Host` Glava. TLS je izključen na čebulni strani. (čebula v3 že zagotavlja šifriranje prenosa + avtentikacijo strežnika); aplikacije še vedno prejemajo `X-Forwarded-Proto: https` ker `.onion` je brskalnik Secure Context."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `timings.fastest` returns `None`, the measurement has too few samples to choose. That is not permission to leave the axis open; it moves the choice one rung down:"
msgstr "Kdaj `timings.fastest` vrne `None`, meritev ima premalo vzorcev za izbiro. To ni dovoljenje, da pustite os odprto; premakne izbiro eno rung navzdol:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a Playwright scenario exercises the OIDC/LDAP path as `biber` (or any non-administrator persona) against a freshly provisioned Nextcloud stack, the very first login can fail or stall because the Nextcloud internal account has not yet been materialized from LDAP; this matches the situation described above. On subsequent logins the account exists and the flow behaves normally."
msgstr "Ko scenarij Playwright izvaja pot OIDC/LDAP kot `biber` (ali katera koli oseba, ki ni direktorica) proti sveže preskrbljeni Nextcloud kup, prva prijava lahko spodleti ali zavlačuje, ker Nextcloud notranji račun še ni bil uprizorjen iz LDAP; to se ujema z zgoraj opisanim položajem. Ob naslednjih prijavah račun obstaja in tok se obnaša normalno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a TODO is completed, you MUST promote the finished capability into `README.md` and remove the TODO entry from `TODO.md`."
msgstr "Ko je TODO končan, MORATE promovirati končno sposobnost v `README.md` in odstranite vnos TODO iz `TODO.md`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a TODO is completed, you MUST remove it from `TODO.md`."
msgstr "Ko je TODO končan, ga morate odstraniti iz `TODO.md`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a change touches multiple test families, you MUST run every affected suite."
msgstr "Ko se sprememba dotakne več testnih družin, morate zagnati vsak prizadeti apartma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a credential must be compared, compute and compare digests inside the container; never emit the value. If a credential does reach the transcript, agents MUST say so in the same message and list it for rotation."
msgstr "Ko je treba primerjati kredenco, izračunajte in primerjajte prebavne podatke v posodi; nikoli ne izpustite vrednosti. Če zapisek res doseže transkript, agenti MORAjo to povedati v istem sporočilu in ga navesti za rotacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a custom image is required"
msgstr "Ko se zahteva slika po meri"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a development run fails, you MUST switch to [Debugging](debug/README.md) and follow the local-deploy or GitHub-log path that matches the failure source."
msgstr "Ko potek razvoja ne uspe, MORATE preklopiti na [Razhroščevanje](debug/README.md) in sledite lokalni-razpored ali GitHub-log poti, ki se ujema z virom napake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a flow runs inside an iframe and login or OIDC clicks can reload it, the spec MUST treat the reload as a navigation event: await the next visible state or the new iframe URL, then reacquire the frame and rebuild locators before the next interaction. A stale iframe handle MUST NOT be reused across redirects."
msgstr "Ko tok teče znotraj iframe in prijava ali OIDC kliki lahko ponovno naloži, Spec mora obravnavati ponovno nalaganje kot navigacijski dogodek: čakati naslednje vidno stanje ali nov URL iframe, nato ponovno zahteva okvir in obnoviti lokatorje pred naslednjo interakcijo. Zastareli ifram ročaj NE SME ponovno uporabiti med preusmeritvami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a host runs Docker Swarm with NFSv4-backed shared volumes (see [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) and [svc-storage-nfs-client](../svc-storage-nfs-client/)), this role **does not capture them** - provided some host is in the [svc-bkp-nfs-2-local](../svc-bkp-nfs-2-local/) inventory group. The lookup checks that group, not whether the role's last run actually succeeded, so a cluster whose export repository has never been deployed keeps that assumption unverified. The `backup_volume` lookup asks the same `swarm_nfs_backed()` predicate that drives the compose rewrite (`utils/storage/nfs.py`) and hands every export-backed volume to baudolo's `--volumes-no-backup-required`. Their single capture is then the export host's repository, which reads the same bytes from the server's own filesystem - no NFS round trip, no second copy racing the `link-dest` target."
msgstr "Ko gostitelj teče Docker Swarm z NFSv4-podprte skupne količine (glej [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) ter [svc-storage-nfs-client](../svc-storage-nfs-client/)), ta vloga **jih ne zajame** - če je kakšen gostitelj v [svc-bkp-nfs-2-local](../svc-bkp-nfs-2-local/) inventarno skupino. Vzorci preverjajo to skupino, ne glede na to, ali je ta vloga dejansko uspela, tako da skupina, katere izvozni repozitorij ni bil nikoli uporabljen, to domnevo ne preverja. – `backup_volume` iskanje sprašuje enako `swarm_nfs_backed()` predikat, ki poganja prepisovanje sklada (`utils/storage/nfs.py`) in izroči vse izvozne količine baudolo je `--volumes-no-backup-required`. Njihov enkratni zajem je potem skladišče izvoz gostitelja, ki bere iste bajte iz strežnikovega lastnega datotečnega sistema - brez NFS povratno potovanje, brez druge kopije dirke `link-dest` Tarča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a host runs Docker Swarm with NFSv4-backed shared volumes (see `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ and `svc-storage-nfs-client <../svc-storage-nfs-client/>`__), this role **does not capture them** - provided some host is in the `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local <../svc-bkp-nfs-2-local/>`__ inventory group. The lookup checks that group, not whether the role’s last run actually succeeded, so a cluster whose export repository has never been deployed keeps that assumption unverified. The ``backup_volume`` lookup asks the same ``swarm_nfs_backed()`` predicate that drives the compose rewrite (``utils/storage/nfs.py``) and hands every export-backed volume to baudolo’s ``--volumes-no-backup-required``. Their single capture is then the export host’s repository, which reads the same bytes from the server’s own filesystem - no NFS round trip, no second copy racing the ``link-dest`` target."
msgstr "Ko gostitelj teče Docker Swarm z NFSv4-podprte skupne količine (glej `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ ter `svc-storage-nfs-client <../svc-storage-nfs-client/>`__), ta vloga **jih ne zajame** - če je kakšen gostitelj v `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local <../svc-bkp-nfs-2-local/>`__ inventarno skupino. Pregledi te skupine, ne glede na to, ali je vloga v zadnjem poteku dejansko uspela, tako da skupina, katere izvozni repozitorij ni bil nikoli vzpostavljen, to domnevo ohranja nepreverjeno. – ``backup_volume`` iskanje sprašuje enako ``swarm_nfs_backed()`` predikat, ki poganja prepisovanje sklada (``utils/storage/nfs.py``) in izroči vsako izvozno podprto količino baudolo’s ``--volumes-no-backup-required``. Njihov enkratni zajem je nato skladišče izvoz gostitelja, ki bere iste bajte iz lastnega datotečnega sistema strežnika - brez NFS povratno potovanje, nobena druga kopija dirke ``link-dest`` Tarča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a local deploy fails, you MUST validate the proposed fix inside a sidecar against the same image via `make compose-inner-run` (or `make compose-exec` against the live container) BEFORE starting another deploy, whenever the failure is reproducible there. The reproducible-there set includes: a container that crashes at startup, a misconfigured env var, an image-side bug, an in-container script that fails, or any failure whose root cause was traced to runtime state of the container. The only exception is failures that genuinely depend on multi-container or post-deploy state (network neighbours, persistent volumes, post-deploy Ansible hooks) — call that out explicitly in the iteration narrative."
msgstr "Ko lokalna uporaba ne uspe, MORATE potrditi predlagano pritrditev znotraj prikolice proti isti sliki preko `make compose-inner-run` (ali `make compose-exec` proti živemu zabojniku) PRED začetkom druge uporabe, kadar je napaka ponovljiva. Ponovljiv-tabor vključuje: posodo, ki se sesuje ob zagonu, napačno nastavljen env var, napako ob sliki, skripto v zabojniku, ki ne uspe, ali kakršno koli napako, katere vzrok je bil zasledjen v stanju delovanja posode. Edina izjema so napake, ki so resnično odvisne od stanja več zabojnikov ali stanja po odpremi (omrežne sosede, vztrajne količine, neoporečni trnki) – to izrecno povej v iteracijski pripovedi."

