msgstr "Kadar vzdrževalec uporabi `🛡️ Trusted` oznaka, vilice PR se obravnava kot namerno sproščena koda:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a new package manager or upstream needs caching:"
msgstr "Kadar je treba novega upravitelja paketa ali predpomnilnika:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a new script is added with a bind-mount target, its purpose and in-container target path SHOULD be documented at the call site (the matching `compose/<service>/` README, or [compose.yml.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/compose.yml.md))."
msgstr "Ko se doda nov skript z vezanim ciljem, bi bilo treba njegov namen in ciljno pot v zabojniku dokumentirati na klicnem mestu. (ujemanje `compose/<service>/` README ali [compose.yml.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/compose.yml.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a plugin is marked `enabled: false`, `06_plugin.yml` runs `occ app:disable` for that plugin instead of entering the pipeline."
msgstr "Ko je vstavek označen `enabled: false`, `06_plugin.yml` teče `occ app:disable` za ta vstavek namesto vstopa v cevovod."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a role in the include set declares `run_after: [<other>]`, `<other>` is added to the include set."
msgstr "Ko je vloga v vključeni sklop izjav `run_after: [<other>]`, `<other>` doda se na nabor."

