# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a user logs in via Keycloak for the first time, Fider matches their email to the existing admin user and links the OIDC provider automatically. To enable SSO, set `services.sso.enabled: true` (the default) and ensure `OIDC.CLIENT.SECRET` is configured."
msgstr "Ko se uporabnik prijavi preko Keycloak prvič, Fider se ujema z njihovo e-pošto obstoječemu uporabniku admin in samodejno poveže ponudnika OIDC. Da bi omogočili SSO, nastavite `services.sso.enabled: true` (privzeto) in zagotoviti `OIDC.CLIENT.SECRET` je konfigurirana."

