msgstr "Brez `apps=`, zanka privzeto **vsaka aplikacija, najbolj kompleksna najprej** (o `complexity` CLI: `infinito meta roles applications complexity --sort \"desc weight\" --format string`). To je velik tek. (en kompon in en roj se uporabi na aplikacijo), tako tesno z `apps=` med pomikanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the broker deployed, Open WebUI runs with `BYPASS_MODEL_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`. A deploy-time step grants every LiteLLM model public read access and each agent model read access for its `agent-user` group only. A `svc-ai-litellm` deploy repeats that step in a running Open WebUI, so a model added to the gateway is visible to every user without an Open WebUI deploy."
msgstr "S posrednikom razporejeno, Open WebUI teče z `BYPASS_MODEL_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`. Čas uvajanja dotacije vsak model LiteLLM javno branje dostop in vsak model agent prebral dostop za svoje `agent-user` Samo za skupine. A `svc-ai-litellm` sproži ponovi to korak v teku Open WebUI, tako da je model dodan na portalu je vidna za vsakega uporabnika brez Open WebUI Namestite."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the label set, the `detect-affected-roles` job in [entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml) calls [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh), which runs the [cli.meta.ci.subset_roles](../../../../cli/meta/ci/subset_roles.py) module. The module reads the first fenced block whose YAML carries a `roles:` key (the heading text is not matched) and emits that list as the `whitelist` output, which flows into the deploy tests as precedence rung 2 above. Without the label, the diff-driven precedence applies."
msgstr "Z oznako set, `detect-affected-roles` zaposlitev [entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml) klici [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh), ki vodi [cli.meta.ci.subset_roles](../../../../cli/meta/ci/subset_roles.py) modul. Modul prebere prvi ograjeni blok, katerega YAML nosi `roles:` ključ (besedilo naslova se ne ujema) in oddaja ta seznam kot `whitelist` izhod, ki teče v preizkuse uporabe kot prednost rung 2 zgoraj. Brez oznake velja prednost, ki jo poganja diff."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the service enabled, ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` reads the token stored for ``administrator`` under this role’s id, probes it against the running instance with a JSON-RPC ``initialize`` call, mints a replacement through ``gitlab-rails runner`` when the stored token is missing or rejected, writes the fresh token back through ``sys-token-store``, and fails the deploy when the re-probe is still rejected. The minted token is a personal access token carrying the ``mcp`` scope with a 364-day expiry. That scope is filtered out of the interactive token picker, so tokens for this endpoint are created programmatically."
msgstr "Ko je storitev omogočena, ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` bere žeton, ki je shranjen za ``administrator`` pod identifikacijo te vloge ga sondira proti primerku, ki teče z JSON-RPC ``initialize`` klic, kovnice zamenjava skozi ``gitlab-rails runner`` ko shranjeni žeton manjka ali je zavrnjen, napiše svež žeton nazaj skozi ``sys-token-store``, in ne uporabi, ko je ponovno sonda še vedno zavrnjena. Kovani žeton je osebni dostop žeton nosi ``mcp`` področje uporabe 364-Dan izteka. Ta obseg je filtriran iz interaktivnega žetona, zato so žetoni za to končno točko ustvarjeni programsko."

