# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT break a single sentence across multiple lines in `.md` files. Each sentence MUST stay on one logical line so readers see the full statement at once and reflowable Markdown viewers do not introduce stray line breaks. A new line in the source MUST mean a new sentence, a new paragraph, or a structural element (heading, list item, table row, fenced block); never a soft wrap inside one sentence."
msgstr "Niti enega stavka ne smete prelomiti čez več vrstic v `.md` datoteke. Vsak stavek MORA ostati na eni logični liniji, tako da bralci vidijo celotno izjavo naenkrat in povratno Markdown gledalci ne uvajajo prelomov zablodelih linij. Nova vrstica v viru MORA pomeni nov stavek, nov odstavek ali strukturni element (naslov, postavka seznama, vrstica tabele, ograjeni blok); V enem stavku nikoli ni bil nežen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT close or skip a criterion that has not been explicitly verified, even if the implementation looks complete."
msgstr "Ne smete zapreti ali preskočiti merila, ki ni bilo izrecno preverjeno, tudi če je izvajanje videti popolno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit automatically without explicit confirmation from the user. You MUST ask before committing."
msgstr "NE SMETE se samodejno zavezati brez izrecne potrditve uporabnika. MORATE vprašati, preden se zavežete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit during an active iteration, because a live deploy makes the pre-commit hook stash the files it reads. If a commit is unavoidable, you MUST pass `--no-verify`."
msgstr "NE MORATE se zavezati med aktivno ponovitev, ker live uporabo naredi pred-obvezni kavelj skriti datoteke, ki jih bere. Če je obveza neizogibna, MORATE opraviti `--no-verify`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit log files to the repository."
msgstr "V skladišče NE SMETE vnesti dnevniških datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT create `group_vars/all/04_users.yml` or any similar generated users dictionary."
msgstr "NE SMETE ustvariti `group_vars/all/04_users.yml` ali kateri koli podoben slovar ustvarjenih uporabnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT create `group_vars/all/05_applications.yml` or any similar generated applications dictionary."
msgstr "NE SMETE ustvariti `group_vars/all/05_applications.yml` ali kateri koli podoben slovar ustvarjenih aplikacij."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT debug from screenshots alone. Use raw logs."
msgstr "Ne smete razhroščevati samo od posnetkov zaslona. Uporabi surove hlode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT delete the main branch"
msgstr "Ne smete zbrisati glavne veje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT enter the inner loop unless all of the following hold:"
msgstr "Notranje zanke NE smete vnesti, razen če imajo:"

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span lost=['"']
# gained=['"SPOT"']
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: NE SMETE eksplicitno prijaviti strani dokumentacije
# kot "SPOT", "Enotna točka resnice", ali katero koli enakovredno
# samooznačevanje. SPOT status je podeljen z bralci navzkrižno povezavo na
# stran od drugod, ne s strani, ki trdijo, da o sebi. Opišite temo neposredno.
msgid "You MUST NOT explicitly declare a documentation page as \"the SPOT\", \"Single Point of Truth\", or any equivalent self-label. SPOT status is conferred by readers cross-linking to the page from elsewhere, not by the page asserting it about itself. Describe the subject directly instead."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT fall back to `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` unless the reuse path has concrete evidence of a broken inventory or host stack, per [Compose Loop](compose.md)."
msgstr "NE SMEŠ se vrniti `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` razen če ima pot ponovne uporabe konkretne dokaze o uničenem inventarju ali kupu gostiteljev na [Zanka sestavljanja](compose.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT filter applications inside the lookup. The lookup returns the full set; filtering by enabled or allowed apps stays a caller concern (for example [applications_current_play.py](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/applications_current_play.py))."
msgstr "Aplikacij ne smete filtrirati znotraj iskalnika. Vpogled vrne celoten nabor; filtriranje z omogočenimi ali dovoljenimi aplikacijami ostane skrb klicatelja (na primer [applications_current_play.py](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/applications_current_play.py))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT hard-code values that come from `meta/services.yml` or `vars/main.yml` directly in `files/Dockerfile`."
msgstr "NE SMETE trdih vrednosti, ki prihajajo iz `meta/services.yml` ali `vars/main.yml` neposredno v `files/Dockerfile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT hardcode values that differ between operators (paths, image tags, CPU or memory caps)."
msgstr "NE SMETE zakodirati vrednosti, ki se med operaterji razlikujejo (poti, slikovne oznake, CPE ali pomnilniške kapice)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce a new keying scheme."
msgstr "Ne smete uvesti nove sheme tipkanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce a parallel cache. The variants are cached per `roles_dir` inside `utils/cache/applications.py` and returned as deep copies; mutating the result MUST NOT corrupt subsequent lookups."
msgstr "Ne smete uvesti vzporednega predpomnilnika. Različice so shranjene na `roles_dir` znotraj `utils/cache/applications.py` in vrnjene kot globoke kopije; mutiranje rezultat NE SME pokvariti naknadno iskanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce a runtime variant-selector extra-var. Variant data lives in the inventory after init; the deploy stage reads it as plain `applications.<app>` overrides."
msgstr "NE SMETE vpeljati dodatne različice-selektorja. Variantni podatki živijo v popisu po initvi; stopnja razporeditve se glasi kot navadna `applications.<app>` Preklopi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce a third parallel cache for the same concern. If you need to cache a derived shape, add a getter to the appropriate domain module (`applications`, `users`, or `domains`) that builds on the existing primitives."
msgstr "Ne smete uvesti tretjega paralelnega predpomnilnika za isto skrb. Če želite predpomniti izpeljano obliko, dodajte atelje v ustrezni modul domene (`applications`, `users`, ali `domains`) Ki gradi na obstoječih primitivcih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce an alternative key source. The `application_id` is always the role directory name."
msgstr "Ne smete uvesti alternativnega vira ključa. – `application_id` je vedno ime imenika vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce conditionals or templating tricks at the variant-list level. The deep-merge is straight YAML; complex shape decisions belong inside the role itself."
msgstr "Ne smete uvesti pogoje ali skušnjava trikov na stopnji variantnega seznama. Globok spoj je ravna YAML; kompleksne odločitve o obliki spadajo znotraj same vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce duplicate, conflicting, or purely cosmetic churn unless formatting cleanup is part of the task."
msgstr "Ne smete uvesti podvojenega, nasprotujočega ali čisto kozmetičnega churn, razen če je oblikovanje čiščenje del naloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce new override mechanisms (e.g. per-role variable mappings) that bypass the existing environment-variable interface."
msgstr "NE SMETE uvesti novih mehanizmov za upravljanje (n. r.) ki zaobidejo obstoječi okoljsko spremenljiv vmesnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT invent commands, workflows, or files that do not exist."
msgstr "Ne smete izumljati ukazov, delovnih tokov ali datotek, ki ne obstajajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT key user overrides by `username`; use the canonical key."
msgstr "Ne smete zakleniti uporabnika preko `username`; uporabi kanonični ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT mark a criterion as done (`- [x]`) until its behavior is verified end to end."
msgstr "Ne smete označiti merila, kot je bilo storjeno (`- [x]`) Dokler se njegovo vedenje ne konča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT mock collaborators that are part of the integration boundary being tested. The point is to verify real interaction."
msgstr "Ne smete se posmehovati sodelavcem, ki so del meje integracije, ki se preskuša. Bistvo je preveriti pravo interakcijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT move an external test into `tests/lint/`, `tests/unit/`, or `tests/integration/` just for convenience when it still depends on live third-party state."
msgstr "Ne smete premakniti zunanjega testa v `tests/lint/`, `tests/unit/`, ali `tests/integration/` samo za udobje, ko je še vedno odvisna od živih tretjih držav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT mutate values returned by `utils.cache.yaml.load_yaml`. The same dict instance is returned to every caller; callers that need to mutate MUST `copy.deepcopy()` the result first. Each domain getter documents whether it returns a fresh deep copy or the cached instance; respect that contract."
msgstr "NE SMETE mutirati vrednosti, ki so jih vrnili `utils.cache.yaml.load_yaml`. Isti dikt instance se vrne vsakemu klicarju; klicarji, ki morajo mutirati `copy.deepcopy()` prvi rezultat. Vsaka domena dobi dokumente, ali vrne svežo globoko kopijo ali predpomnjeni primerek; spoštovati to pogodbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT name the file `meta/inventory.yml` for any reason. See the placement rule."
msgstr "Ne smete poimenovati datoteke `meta/inventory.yml` Iz kakršnega koli razloga. Glej pravilo umeščanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT pass more than 7 roles to a single `apps=...` invocation, regardless of how many roles share the same root cause. If more than 7 roles share a root cause, you MUST split them into batches of at most 7. Within each batch, list roles in ascending alphabetical order. Process batches in ascending alphabetical order of their first role, sequentially. Once the shared root cause is verified fixed in one batch, you MUST skip all remaining batches that share that same root cause."
msgstr "Ne smete prestati več kot 7 vloge na enega `apps=...` invokacija, ne glede na to, koliko vlog ima isti temeljni vzrok. Če več kot 7 vloge delijo glavni vzrok, jih je treba razdeliti na serije največ 7. V vsaki seriji navedite vloge v naraščajočem abecednem redu. Procesne serije po naraščajočem abecednem redu po njihovi prvi vlogi, zaporedno. Ko skupni vzrok korena je preverjeno fiksna v eni seriji, MORATE preskočiti vse preostale serije, ki delijo ta isti vzrok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT place emojis before the headline text, as this interferes with heading hierarchy rendering in some tools."
msgstr "Emojisa ne smete postaviti pred naslovno besedilo, saj to ovira hierarhijo naslovov v nekaterih orodjih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT post follow-up messages to the main timeline if they belong to an ongoing thread."
msgstr "Ne smete objaviti nadaljnjih sporočil v glavni časovnici, če spadajo v trenutno nit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT push directly to `main`"
msgstr "NE SMETE neposredno potisniti `main`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT push, directly or through wrappers that push implicitly."
msgstr "Ne smete potisniti, neposredno ali skozi ovoje, ki potiskajo implicitno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT put per-environment overrides into `inventories/<env>/default.yml` for cases that belong to a single role; use this file instead. The environment inventory keeps only cross-cutting environment knobs."
msgstr "NE SMETE vnašati preglasov na okolje `inventories/<env>/default.yml` za primere, ki pripadajo eni vlogi; namesto tega uporabite to datoteko. Okoljski inventar hrani le prečne okoljske gumbe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT read from role `vars/main.yml` mappings of consuming roles (e.g. `test_e2e_playwright.*`) to override runner behaviour."
msgstr "Ne smete brati iz vloge `vars/main.yml` Kartiranje porabniških vlog (Npr. `test_e2e_playwright.*`) Preglasiti vedenje tekača."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT reference requirement files from code (comments, docstrings, error / log messages, prose inside templates). Tokens such as `req 019`, `req 019 Rule 3`, `requirement-005`, or path references like `docs/requirements/019-...md` MUST NOT appear in `.js`, `.py`, `.yml`, `.j2`, `.sh`, or any other non-Markdown source file. Requirements are an authoring contract enforced by lint and integration tests; comments anchored to requirement numbers rot when requirements are renumbered, restructured, or rewritten, and they conflate the *what is true now* (which the comment should describe) with the *audit trail of how we got here* (which belongs in commit messages, pull request descriptions, and the requirement file itself). Describe the *why* of the code in present-state language; the contract enforcement lives in tests, not folklore."
msgstr "Datoteke s kodo NE SMEte navajati (komentarji, dokstringe, napake / log sporočila, proza znotraj predloge). Žetoni, kot so `req 019`, `req 019 Rule 3`, `requirement-005`, ali reference poti kot `docs/requirements/019-...md` NE SME se pojaviti `.js`, `.py`, `.yml`, `.j2`, `.sh`, ali katero koli drugo datoteko, ki ni Markdown izvorno. Zahteve so avtorske pogodbe, ki se izvršujejo s testom line in integracije; pripombe, ki so zasidrane z zahtevanimi številkami, ko se zahteve preštevilčijo, prestrukturirajo ali prepišejo, in konfundirajo *kaj je sedaj res* (ki jih mora opisati pripomba) z *revizijska sled o tem, kako smo prišli sem* (ki spada v sporočila, povlecite opise zahtev in datoteko z zahtevami sama). Opišite *Zakaj* kodeksa v sedanjem jeziku; uveljavljanje pogodbe živi v preizkusih, ne v folklori."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT register runners against `infinito-nexus/core` from fork CI — the `GITHUB_TOKEN` there lacks organisation-level `administration` scope. The env-var override in `vars/main.yml` handles this automatically."
msgstr "Ne smete registrirati tekačev proti `infinito-nexus/core` iz vilic CI – `GITHUB_TOKEN` pomanjkanje organizacijske ravni `administration` obseg. Env-var razveljavitev v `vars/main.yml` To opravi samodejno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT reintroduce `default_users` or `defaults_users` references; they do not exist anymore."
msgstr "NE SMETE ponovno uvesti `default_users` ali `defaults_users` reference; ne obstajajo več."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT replace layout, spacing, sizing, positioning, z-index, overflow, animation timing, or component structure."
msgstr "Ne smete zamenjati razporeda, razmika, velikosti, pozicioniranja, z-indeksa, prelivanja, animacije čas, ali komponent strukturo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT replace semantic behavior, JavaScript hooks, or framework-specific class wiring."
msgstr "Ne smete zamenjati semantično vedenje, JavaScript kavlji, ali okvir-specific razred ožičenja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT report the task complete until all of the following hold:"
msgstr "Ne smete poročati o opravljenem opravilu, dokler vse naslednje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT rewrite history on protected branches"
msgstr "Zgodovine ne smete prepisati na zaščitene veje"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT rewrite large upstream style blocks when a focused override or token remapping is enough."
msgstr "NE SMETE prepisati velikih slogovnih blokov v zgornjem toku, ko je želeno spreminjanje ali žeton dovolj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT run more than one deploy command at the same time. Deployments MUST be executed serially, never in parallel."
msgstr "Ne smete hkrati zagnati več ukazov. Postavitev mora biti izvedena serijsko, nikoli vzporedno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT run more than one unit test command at the same time. Unit tests MUST be executed serially, never in parallel."
msgstr "Ne smete hkrati zagnati več kot eno enoto. Preskusi enote morajo biti izvedeni serijsko, nikoli vzporedno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT skip the inter-round purge."
msgstr "Ne smete preskočiti inter-round čistko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT use `--no-verify` unless the user gives a direct, unambiguous instruction to bypass the hook (e.g. \"skip the hook\", \"bypass pre-commit\")."
msgstr "NE UPORABLJAJTE `--no-verify` razen če uporabnik da neposreden, nedvoumen navodila za zavijanje trnka (Npr. \"preskoči trnek\", \"bypass pre-commit\")."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT use `.md` files to describe implementation logic that is already visible in the code."
msgstr "NE UPORABLJAJTE `.md` datoteke za opis logike izvajanja, ki je že vidna v kodeksu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "You MUST NOT use `templates/Dockerfile.j2` unless the Dockerfile requires Jinja2 control-flow logic (e.g. `{% if %}`, `{% for %}`)."
msgstr "NE UPORABLJAJTE `templates/Dockerfile.j2` razen če Dockerfile zahteva Jinjo2 logika pretoka nadzora (Npr. `{% if %}`, `{% for %}`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT use em dashes (—) as thought breaks or clause separators. You SHOULD prefer complete sentences. Hyphens (-) MAY be used for compound words and list items."
msgstr "Ne smete uporabljati pomišljajev (—) kot prelomi misli ali ločevalniki klavzul. Raje imaš popolne stavke. Vezalke (-Kaj?) SE LAHKO uporablja za sestavljene besede in sezname."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT use the full URL as link text. Use the domain name, `here`, or the filename instead. Never use the full path."
msgstr "Celotnega URL- ja ne smete uporabiti kot besedilo povezave. Uporabi ime domene, `here`, ali namesto imena datoteke. Nikoli ne uporabi celotne poti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT write tests for non-executable files such as `.yml` or `.j2`. Test the code that consumes them instead."
msgstr "Ne smete pisati testov za neizvedljive datoteke, kot so `.yml` ali `.j2`. Preizkusite kodo, ki jih porabi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT write tests only for non-executable files such as `.yml` or `.j2`. Test the behavior that consumes them."
msgstr "Ne smete pisati testov samo za neizvedljive datoteke, kot so `.yml` ali `.j2`- Preizkusite vedenje, ki jih porabi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT write tests that only assert a file contains a string."
msgstr "NE SMETE pisati testov, ki samo trdijo, da datoteka vsebuje niz."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT write unit tests for integration test logic. Integration tests verify real runtime boundaries; extracting that logic into unit tests defeats the purpose and duplicates coverage. The integration test itself is the specification."
msgstr "Ne smete pisati preizkusov enote za logiko integracijski test. Integracijski testi preverjajo meje časa delovanja v realnem času; izvlečenje te logike v preizkuse enote izniči namen in podvoji pokritost. Sam integracijski test je specifikacija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT write values back from those UI fields to OIDC or LDAP through injected JavaScript. Treat those fields as externally managed and read-only in the application UI."
msgstr "Vrednosti ne smete zapisati nazaj iz teh polj UI na OIDC ali LDAP z injiciranjem JavaScript. Ta polja obravnavajte kot zunanja in bralna samo v uporabniškem vmesniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT:"
msgstr "Ne smete:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST `git fetch` the resolved comparison branch and inspect its recent commits and CI history."
msgstr "Moraš. `git fetch` rešena primerjalna podružnica ter pregleda njene nedavne zaveze in zgodovino KI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add code comments only when an exception, edge case, or surprising decision would otherwise confuse readers."
msgstr "Kodne komentarje morate dodati le, če bi izjema, primer robov ali presenetljiva odločitev drugače zmedla bralce."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add new application defaults in the owning role:"
msgstr "V lastni vlogi morate dodati nove privzete programe:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add new user defaults in the owning role:"
msgstr "V lastni vlogi morate dodati nove uporabniške privzete vrednosti:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add or update integration tests for every `*.py` file you touch when the change affects behavior across module or runtime boundaries."
msgstr "MORATE dodati ali posodobiti integracijske teste za vsako `*.py` datoteko, ki se je dotaknete, ko sprememba vpliva na vedenje preko modula ali meja časa delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add or update unit tests for every `*.py` file you touch."
msgstr "MORATE dodati ali posodobiti teste enote za vsako `*.py` Dotakni se datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add the smallest possible theming layer on top of the role's existing CSS."
msgstr "MORATE dodati najmanjšo možno tematsko plast na vrhu obstoječe CSS vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST also enumerate any failed sibling runs dispatched from the same commit via `gh run list --commit \"$(gh run view <run-id> --json headSha --jq .headSha)\" --json databaseId,name,conclusion --jq '.[] | select(.conclusion==\"failure\")'`, then repeat the job enumeration for each."
msgstr "Prav tako morate naštevati vse neuspešne linije bratov in sester, poslane iz iste obveznosti prek `gh run list --commit \"$(gh run view <run-id> --json headSha --jq .headSha)\" --json databaseId,name,conclusion --jq '.[] | select(.conclusion==\"failure\")'`, nato ponovite število delovnih mest za vsako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST analyze the Playwright assets together with the matching job logs under `/tmp/logs/<child-run-id>/logs/`."
msgstr "Morate analizirati sredstva Playwright skupaj z ujemanje dnevniki delovnih mest pod `/tmp/logs/<child-run-id>/logs/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST apply all rules from `AGENTS.md` and `docs/contributing/` to every affected file, not only code rules, but also documentation, naming, structure, and any other applicable guidelines."
msgstr "Morate uporabiti vsa pravila od `AGENTS.md` ter `docs/contributing/` za vsako prizadeto datoteko, ne samo pravila kod, ampak tudi dokumentacijo, poimenovanje, strukturo in vse druge veljavne smernice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST apply these repo-wide rules when you add, move, or review files:"
msgstr "Uporabljati morate ta pravila za repo po vsej državi, ko dodajate, premikate ali pregledujete datoteke:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST apply this moral principle when you make decisions:"
msgstr "To moralno načelo morate upoštevati, ko se odločate:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST at minimum inspect and compare the start page and the login page because these pages usually expose the most important navigation, authentication, and first-load behavior."
msgstr "MORATE vsaj pregledati in primerjati začetno stran in prijavno stran, ker te strani običajno izpostavljajo najpomembnejše navigacije, avtentikacijo in vedenje prve obremenitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST build filesystem paths with `path_join` instead of concatenating path segments as strings."
msgstr "Morate zgraditi datotečne poti z `path_join` namesto da bi združili segmente poti kot strune."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST capture open development requirements for a role in its `TODO.md` file so the remaining work stays visible."
msgstr "MORATE zajeti odprte razvojne zahteve za vlogo v `TODO.md` datoteko, tako da ostalo delo ostane vidno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST capture system-wide development requirements in the root `TODO.md` file so global work stays visible in one place."
msgstr "V korenu morate zajeti sistemske razvojne zahteve `TODO.md` datoteko tako globalno delo ostane vidno na enem mestu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check off each criterion in the requirement file as soon as it is verified. Do not batch them."
msgstr "Vsako merilo v datoteki z zahtevami morate preveriti takoj, ko je preverjeno. Ne napolnite jih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check that `APP_BASE_URL`, app URLs, issuer URLs, and feature toggles match the deployed role."
msgstr "To morate preveriti. `APP_BASE_URL`, URL-ji aplikacij, URL-ji izdajateljev in datoteke se ujemajo z uporabljeno vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check that every environment variable referenced in `playwright.spec.js` is present in the rendered `.env` (the name-alignment MUST is owned by the contrib SPOT Environment Contract)."
msgstr "Morate preveriti, da je vsaka okoljska spremenljivka v `playwright.spec.js` je prisoten v preslikanem `.env` (ime-poravnava MUS je v lasti contrib SPOT Environmental Contract)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check that persona-specific credentials such as `biber` and `administrator` map to the intended scenarios."
msgstr "Preveriti morate osebne podatke, kot so `biber` ter `administrator` načrt predvidenih scenarijev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check that the final JavaScript still feels like a small role-local adaptation of the target application, not a forked frontend implementation."
msgstr "Preveriti morate, da se končno JavaScript še vedno zdi kot majhna prilagoditev vloge za ciljno aplikacijo, ne pa implementacija v naprej."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check the browser console for JavaScript errors or repeated side effects after the script is injected."
msgstr "Po injiciranju skripta morate preveriti JavaScriptske napake ali ponavljajoče stranske učinke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check the result with live inspection in the running application, not only by reading the JavaScript file."
msgstr "Rezultat morate preveriti z živo inšpekcijo v tekoči aplikaciji, ne le z branjem datoteke JavaScript."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST choose the matching Pull Request template before you write a PR description."
msgstr "Preden napišete opis PR, morate izbrati ustrezno predlogo Pull Request."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST classify each failure into one of two buckets:"
msgstr "Vsako napako morate razvrstiti v eno od dveh veder:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "You MUST cluster the downloaded logs by their shared failing task via `python -m cli.meta.ci.logs.analyze /tmp/logs/<child-run-id>`, then for each cluster you MUST perform static analysis of the repository code, the job logs, the downloaded artefacts, and any relevant external code until you are at least 99% certain of the root cause before you change anything. If the error class is a Playwright failure, you MUST follow [Playwright Failures](#playwright-failures) for the asset analysis before continuing."
msgstr "Prenesene dnevnike morate združiti z njihovo skupno neuspešno nalogo preko `python -m cli.meta.ci.logs.analyze /tmp/logs/<child-run-id>`, potem za vsako skupino morate opraviti statično analizo kode skladišča, dnevnikov opravil, prenesenih artefaktov, in vse ustrezne zunanje kode, dokler ste vsaj 99% prepričanega vzroka, preden kaj spremenite. Če je razred napak napaka, morate slediti [Neuspehi predvajanja](#playwright-failures) za analizo sredstev pred nadaljevanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST combine the matching `--color-XX-*` and `--color-rgb-XX-*` tokens in a way that is both meaningful and aesthetically coherent so semantic mappings, surfaces, gradients, borders, and overlays work together as one design system."
msgstr "Združevati morate ujemanje `--color-XX-*` ter `--color-rgb-XX-*` žetoni na način, ki je smiseln in estetsko skladen, tako da semantične karte, površine, gradienti, meje in prekrivanja delujejo skupaj kot en sistem oblikovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST commit only after all required checks pass."
msgstr "Zavezati se morate šele po vseh zahtevanih čekih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST compare the implemented behavior against the rendered UI so missing hooks, duplicate handlers, broken selectors, and unexpected side effects become visible."
msgstr "MORATE primerjati implementirano vedenje proti UI tako manjkajo kavlji, dvojni upravljalniki, zlomljeni izbirniki, in nepričakovane stranske učinke postanejo vidni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You MUST consume tunable runtime parameters via strict substitution `${VAR:?Run 'make dotenv' to generate the .env single source of truth}`; the default lives in [default.env](../../../../default.env). Inline `${VAR:-default}` forms are forbidden and enforced by [test_no_default_substitutions.py](../../../../tests/integration/infrastructure/compose/test_no_default_substitutions.py)."
msgstr "S strogo nadomestitvijo morate porabiti oranžne parametre časa delovanja `${VAR:?Run 'make dotenv' to generate the .env single source of truth}`; privzeto živi v [default.env](../../../../default.env). Vstavljeno `${VAR:-default}` oblike so prepovedane in uveljavljene z [test_no_default_substitutions.py](../../../../tests/integration/infrastructure/compose/test_no_default_substitutions.py)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST cross-link from the implementing PR template back to the requirement file."
msgstr "Morate navzkrižno povezavo od izvedbene predloge PR nazaj do datoteke zahteve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST cross-link from the requirement to any PR or issue that implements it."
msgstr "Morate navzkrižno povezavo od zahteve do katerega koli PR ali vprašanje, ki ga izvaja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST debug from the live local output and local logs."
msgstr "MORATE razhroščevati iz lokalnih izhodov v živo in lokalnih dnevnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST declare each external value as a Docker `ARG` without a default value so the build always requires the value to be passed explicitly."
msgstr "Vsako zunanjo vrednost morate prijaviti kot docker `ARG` brez privzete vrednosti, zato zgradba vedno zahteva, da se vrednost izrecno prenese."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST define `APP_BASE_URL` consistent with the Entry Point rules in the contrib SPOT, in particular the dashboard routing rule when `services.dashboard.enabled` is set."
msgstr "Morate opredeliti `APP_BASE_URL` v skladu s pravili za vstopno točko v contrib SPOT, zlasti pravilo o usmerjanju armaturne plošče, kadar `services.dashboard.enabled` Pripravljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST describe only the current state of the subject. You MUST NOT carry historical context, migration notes, or comparisons to former implementations into documentation. Phrases such as \"this replaces X\", \"previously X did Y\", \"formerly known as X\", \"the legacy X\", or \"after the refactor\" MUST NOT appear in documentation. Readers arrive in the present and need to know how the subject works now, not how it used to work. Historical context belongs in commit messages, pull request descriptions, and changelogs, where it is anchored to a point in time and ages gracefully. Documentation that carries history rots as soon as the next refactor lands."
msgstr "MORATE opisati samo trenutno stanje predmeta. Zgodovinskega konteksta, migracijskih zapiskov ali primerjav z nekdanjimi implementacijami ne smete prenesti v dokumentacijo. Frasi, kot so \"To nadomesti X\", \"Prej X je Y\", \"prej znan kot X\", \"zapuščina X\", ali \"po refaktorju\" NE SME se pojaviti v dokumentaciji. Bralci prihajajo v sedanjost in morajo vedeti, kako tema deluje zdaj, ne kako je nekoč delovala. Zgodovinski kontekst spada v sporočila, opise zahtev in dnevnike, kjer je zasidran do točke v času in starosti. Dokumentacija, ki nosi zgodovino, zgnije takoj, ko naslednji refaktor pristane."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You MUST determine the comparison branch automatically when possible (the PR base branch from `gh pr view --json baseRefName`, or the configured upstream from `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref @{u}`). If neither is available, you MUST ask the operator which branch to compare against before proceeding."
msgstr "Če je mogoče, morate samodejno določiti primerjalno podružnico. (osnovna podružnica PR iz `gh pr view --json baseRefName`, ali nastavljeno navzgor od `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref @{u}`). Če ni na voljo nič od tega, morate vprašati upravljavca, s katero podružnico je treba primerjati pred postopkom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST determine whether each failure is specific to the current branch or also reproduces elsewhere:"
msgstr "MORATE ugotoviti, ali je vsaka napaka specifična za trenutno vejo ali se reproducira tudi drugje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST disable UI fields that are authored by OIDC or LDAP so users do not edit values locally that are managed by the identity provider or directory."
msgstr "MORATE onemogočiti polja UI, ki jih je avtor OIDC ali LDAP, tako da uporabniki ne urejajo vrednosti lokalno, ki jih upravlja ponudnik identitete ali imenik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST document every new env var by adding the row below AND committing a one-line `# ...` comment above its key in [default.env](../../../../default.env)."
msgstr "Morate dokumentirati vsako novo env var z dodajanjem vrstice spodaj IN izvedbo enovrstice `# ...` komentar nad svojim ključem [default.env](../../../../default.env)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST document in the test file why the check is external and what live dependency it contacts."
msgstr "V testno datoteko morate dokumentirati, zakaj je preverjanje zunaj in kakšna odvisnost od življenja je povezana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST drive the scenarios through a real browser session against the deployed role. A green local file-lint does not satisfy this step."
msgstr "Scenarije morate voziti skozi pravo sejo brskalnika proti uporabljeni vlogi. Zelena krajevna datoteka ne izpolnjuje tega koraka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST enumerate every failed job under the parent run, including matrix jobs and reusable-workflow jobs, via `gh run view <run-id> --json jobs --jq '.jobs[] | select(.conclusion==\"failure\")'`."
msgstr "Naštevati morate vsako neuspešno delo v okviru starševskega delovanja, vključno z matričnimi in večkrat uporabnimi delovnimi mesti, prek `gh run view <run-id> --json jobs --jq '.jobs[] | select(.conclusion==\"failure\")'`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST evaluate whether the failure could plausibly originate from commits on the current branch."
msgstr "MORATE oceniti, ali napaka lahko zanesljivo izvira iz obveznosti na trenutni veji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST extract non-trivial non-YAML code out of task files into a dedicated role asset instead of inlining it:"
msgstr "Morate izvleči netrivialno neYAML kodo iz datotek opravil v namensko vlogo sredstvo, namesto da ga vstavite:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST fix code quality issues before merge"
msgstr "Morate popraviti vprašanja kakovosti kode pred združitvijo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST fix nearby wording and semantic issues when you touch a file, and correct obvious nearby issues proactively in the same pass."
msgstr "Morate popraviti v bližini besedilo in semantična vprašanja, ko se dotaknete datoteke, in popraviti očitno blizu vprašanja proaktivno v istem prehodu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST follow [Compose Loop](iteration/compose.md) for the edit-deploy-validate loop while implementing criteria."
msgstr "Morate slediti [Zanka sestavljanja](iteration/compose.md) za zanko za urejanje-razveljavitev med izvajanjem meril."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST follow the template selection guidance in [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md)."
msgstr "Morate upoštevati smernice za izbiro predloge v [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST follow these ethics when you execute instructions:"
msgstr "Te etike morate upoštevati, ko izvajate navodila:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST get **2 approvals** before merging"
msgstr "Moraš dobiti **2 odobritve** pred združitvijo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST get approvals again"
msgstr "Ponovno morate dobiti odobritev"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST have a **classic Personal Access Token (PAT)** with the `delete:packages` scope. The `gh auth token` and `GITHUB_TOKEN` issued by GitHub Actions do NOT include this scope and will fail with HTTP 403."
msgstr "Moraš imeti **klasičen žeton osebnega dostopa (PAT)** z `delete:packages` obseg. – `gh auth token` ter `GITHUB_TOKEN` ki jih je izdal GitHub Actions NE vključujejo tega področja uporabe in ne bodo uspeli s HTTP 403."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST identify the User Story and every Acceptance Criterion before acting."
msgstr "Morate identificirati User Zgodbo in vsako merilo sprejemanja pred nastopom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST identify the failing parent run from the GitHub Actions URL the operator provided. Extract `<run-id>` from the last numeric path segment of `.../actions/runs/<run-id>`."
msgstr "Morate identificirati neuspešnega matičnega pogona z URL- ja za dejanja GitHub, ki ga je zagotovil operater. Izvleček `<run-id>` od zadnjega numeričnega segmenta poti `.../actions/runs/<run-id>`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST inspect the relevant logs in the provided `*job-logs.txt` or `*.log` files."
msgstr "MORATE pregledati ustrezne dnevnike v priloženih `*job-logs.txt` ali `*.log` datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST inspect the running application, at minimum the start page and login page."
msgstr "MORATE pregledati zagnan program, vsaj začetno stran in prijavno stran."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST inspect the start page AND the login page of the role as part of the end-to-end run. These two pages surface most navigation, authentication, and first-load regressions that later assertions would only catch indirectly."
msgstr "Ogledati morate začetno stran in prijavno stran vloge kot del konca do konca. Ti dve strani se nanašata na večino navigacije, avtentikacije in regresije prve obremenitve, ki bi jih kasnejše trditve ujele le posredno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST iterate on each branch-caused failure per [Compose Loop](../iteration/compose.md), processing affected roles in ascending alphabetical order until the root cause is fixed."
msgstr "Morate iterirati na vsaki podružnici povzročene napake na [Zanka sestavljanja](../iteration/compose.md), obdelavo prizadetih vlog v naraščajočem abecednem redu, dokler se temeljni vzrok določi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep `services.css.enabled` enabled in the role configuration or override it in the inventory when CSS injection should run."
msgstr "Ostati morate. `services.css.enabled` omogočena v konfiguraciji vloge ali jo prevlada v inventarju, ko naj teče vbrizgavanje CSS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep `services.javascript.enabled` enabled in the role configuration or override it in the inventory when JavaScript injection should run."
msgstr "Ostati morate. `services.javascript.enabled` omogočena v konfiguraciji vloge ali jo obvelja v inventarju, ko naj teče injiciranje JavaScript."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep a shebang at the top of executable shell scripts."
msgstr "Morate obdržati shebang na vrhu izvedljivih lupin skripte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep all changes to this role minimal and non-invasive."
msgstr "Vse spremembe te vloge morate ohraniti minimalne in neinvazivne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep code and comments in English."
msgstr "Morate obdržati kodo in komentarje v angleščini."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep commit history clear and reviewable."
msgstr "Zgodovino morate voditi jasno in pregledno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep core information inside the repository, either in code or in `.md` files."
msgstr "Osrednje podatke morate hraniti v skladišču, bodisi v kodi ali v `.md` datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep cross-links between `.md` files up to date so readers can navigate between related pages."
msgstr "MORATE ohraniti navzkrižne povezave med `.md` datoteke posodobljene, tako da lahko bralci krmarijo med povezanimi stranmi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep dependencies inside this package minimal. Cache primitives MUST remain importable from filter plugins, lookup plugins, and CLI tools without dragging in heavy dependencies. **Specifically: `applications.py` MUST stay ansible-free at import time.** See CI runs 24934007615 / 24935979190 for the regression that motivated the split. Tests in `tests/unit/python/utils/cache/test_data.py::TestImportableWithoutAnsible` pin both the import-time and call-time invariants."
msgstr "Morate ohraniti odvisnosti v tem paketu minimalno. Cache primitivci MORAjo ostati uvozljivi iz filter plugins, iskati plugins, in CLI orodja brez vlečenja v težkih odvisnosti. **Zlasti: `applications.py` OB UVOZU MORA ostati brez snovi.** Glej potek CI 24934007615 / 24935979190 za regresijo, ki je spodbudila razcep. Preskusi `tests/unit/python/utils/cache/test_data.py::TestImportableWithoutAnsible` Pripnite tako invariante za uvoz in klicni čas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep diffs focused, readable, and easy to review."
msgstr "Morate ohraniti diffs osredotočen, berljiv in enostaven za pregled."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep event handlers, observers, and DOM mutations idempotent because injected scripts may run on dynamic pages or be triggered repeatedly."
msgstr "Imeti morate skrbnike dogodkov, opazovalce in DOM mutacije idempotent, ker lahko injicirani skripti tečejo na dinamičnih straneh ali se sprožijo večkrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep explanations simple and explicit."
msgstr "Morate ohraniti pojasnila preprosta in jasna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep external tests outside the default `make test` flow so normal validation stays reproducible without third-party network access."
msgstr "Zunanji testi morajo ostati zunaj privzetega `make test` pretok, tako da običajno potrjevanje ostane ponovljivo brez dostopa tretjih strani do omrežja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep helper-only logic, plumbing, and intermediate steps in `scripts/` or other implementation files."
msgstr "MORATE ohraniti logiko, vodovod in vmesne korake samo za pomočnike `scripts/` ali druge datoteke za izvajanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep public targets stable, named clearly, and documented."
msgstr "MORATE ohraniti javne cilje stabilne, jasno imenovane in dokumentirane."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep refactoring changes small enough to review and validate."
msgstr "MORATE ohraniti refactoring spremembe dovolj majhne za pregled in potrditev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep role-local or component-specific shell helpers in their owning area, such as `roles/.../files/`, when they belong to a single role."
msgstr "MORATE obdržati lokalne pomočnike ali pomočnike, specifične za posamezne komponente, na svojem področju, kot so `roles/.../files/`, ko pripadajo eni vlogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep semver-like image versions current when the upstream image publishes matching newer tags."
msgstr "Morate ohraniti semver podobne različice slik aktualno, ko gornja slika objavi ujemanje novejših oznak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep shell entrypoints in `scripts/` so they stay easy to discover and reuse."
msgstr "MORATE ohraniti vstopne točke v lupini `scripts/` tako da ostanejo enostavni za odkrivanje in ponovno uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep the command surface small enough that contributors can discover the obvious path quickly."
msgstr "Poveljniško površino morate obdržati dovolj majhno, da lahko prispevajoči hitro odkrijejo očitno pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST load the following pages before editing any file, in this order:"
msgstr "Pred urejanjem datoteke morate naložiti naslednje strani:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST map `--color-01-*` and `--color-rgb-01-*` onto existing framework or app variables first. Add selector-level overrides only when variable mapping is insufficient."
msgstr "NAMESTITEV `--color-01-*` ter `--color-rgb-01-*` najprej na obstoječi okvir ali spremenljivke aplikacij. Dodaj izbirnik-nivo povozi le, če ni dovolj variabilnega kartiranja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST mark the PR **ready for review** before requesting a review. CI starts automatically at that point."
msgstr "Označevati morate PR **Pripravljen za pregled** pred zahtevo za pregled. CI se na tej točki začne samodejno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST open a PR to merge into `main`"
msgstr "Morate odpreti PR, da se združi v `main`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST open a Pull Request only when it is ready for real review."
msgstr "Morate odpreti zahtevo Pull samo, ko je pripravljen za pravi pregled."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST open the browser console during runs that depend on injected JavaScript and confirm it is free of unhandled errors before reporting success."
msgstr "Med vožnjo morate odpreti konzolo brskalnika, ki je odvisna od injiciranega JavaScripta in potrditi, da je pred poročanjem o uspehu brez napak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST output the storage path of the Playwright assets for the affected `<child-run-id>`."
msgstr "MORATE ustvariti pot shranjevanja sredstev Playwright za prizadete `<child-run-id>`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST override application values through the normal Ansible variable `applications`:"
msgstr "MORATE preglasiti vrednosti programov z normalno spremenljivko Ansible `applications`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST override user values through the normal Ansible variable `users`:"
msgstr "MORATE preglasiti uporabniške vrednosti z običajno spremenljivko Ansible `users`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST pass every `ARG` via the `args:` block in `templates/compose.yml.j2`, directly after the `{{ lookup('template', 'roles/sys-svc-container/templates/build.yml.j2') }}` call."
msgstr "Vsakega moraš prehiteti. `ARG` prek `args:` blok v `templates/compose.yml.j2`, takoj po `{{ lookup('template', 'roles/sys-svc-container/templates/build.yml.j2') }}` Pokliči."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST pass only the runtime values that the browser logic actually needs. Keep the rendered template surface small and explicit."
msgstr "PRETISNITE le vrednosti časa delovanja, ki jih logika brskalnika dejansko potrebuje. Ohranjena površina predloge naj bo majhna in izrecna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST pick the template that matches your change. The table below links the actual templates."
msgstr "Izbrati morate predlogo, ki ustreza vaši spremembi. Spodnja tabela povezuje dejanske predloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST place role-local Dockerfiles at `files/Dockerfile`."
msgstr "Morate postaviti vloge lokalni Docker datoteke na `files/Dockerfile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST place the emoji before the category, never after."
msgstr "Emoji morate postaviti pred kategorijo, nikoli kasneje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer `make` targets over raw `docker`/`docker compose`/`ansible-playbook`/`python`/shell invocations whenever an equivalent target exists in the [`Makefile`](Makefile). Inspect the `Makefile` first; fall back to the raw command only when no target covers the operation. The reason is operational consistency, not permissioning. Raw commands also auto-allow under the sandbox."
msgstr "Moraš imeti raje `make` cilji nad surovimi `docker`/`docker compose`/`ansible-playbook`/`python`/navedbe, kadar koli v enakovrednem cilju obstaja [`Makefile`](Makefile). Preglejte `Makefile` prvi; vrnite se na surovo poveljstvo samo, če noben cilj ne pokriva operacije. Razlog je operativna doslednost, ne dovoljenje. Surovi ukazi omogočajo tudi samodejno pod peskovnikom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer commands permitted in [.claude/settings.json](.claude/settings.json) over commands that require interactive approval when an equivalent exists."
msgstr "Morate raje ukazi dovoljeni v [.claude/settings.json](.claude/settings.json) nad ukazi, ki zahtevajo interaktivno odobritev, kadar obstaja enakovredno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer defining shared fixed role variables once in `vars/main.yml` as the single source of truth instead of recomputing them with `lookup()` or dotted variable composition in `*.j2` or `*.yml`."
msgstr "MORATE raje opredeliti spremenljivke deljene stalne vloge enkrat v `vars/main.yml` kot edini vir resnice, namesto da bi jih ponovno povezal z `lookup()` ali pikčasta spremenljiva sestava v `*.j2` ali `*.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer stable selectors and narrow hooks over text matching or timing-based hacks."
msgstr "MORATE raje stabilne selekcije in ozke kljuke nad ujemanje besedila ali čas temelji krampi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer token mapping over selector rewrites so the role keeps its native structure."
msgstr "MORATE raje žeton kartiranje nad izbirnik prepiše tako vloga ohranja svojo naravno strukturo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prepend `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP=true` to every `make compose-deploy` command in the iteration (any mode), so trace, screenshot, and video of passing Playwright tests stay inspectable. Omit only when the user has explicitly opted out of per-test artefacts. For the full propagation chain see [Playwright Tests](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."
msgstr "Moraš se pripraviti. `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP=true` za vsakega `make compose-deploy` ukaz pri ponovitvi (kateri koli način), tako sledi, screenshot, in video poteka Playwright testi ostanejo pregledni. Omite le, če se uporabnik izrecno odloči, da ne bo uporabil predmetov na test. Za celotno razmnoževalno verigo glej [Preizkusi predvajanja](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST process the buckets in order: first complete the initial-pass actions under [External Failures](#external-failures) for every failure classified as external, then iterate over [Branch-Caused Failures](#branch-caused-failures). Issues filed afterwards for unresolvable branch-caused failures (per the last bullet of [Branch-Caused Failures](#branch-caused-failures)) reuse the External Failures procedure but are NOT part of this initial pass."
msgstr "Vedra morate obdelati po vrstnem redu: najprej dokončajte začetni prehod [Zunanji neuspehi](#external-failures) za vsako napako, ki je razvrščena kot zunanja, se nato ponovi [Neuspehi zaradi veje](#branch-caused-failures). Izdaje , vložene pozneje zaradi nerešljivih napak v podružnici (na zadnjo kroglo [Neuspehi zaradi veje](#branch-caused-failures)) ponovno uporabi postopek Zunanji neuspehi, vendar niso del tega začetnega prehoda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST provide Playwright tests for every `web-*` role."
msgstr "Morate zagotoviti Playwright teste za vsako `web-*` vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST provide only the environment values that the role-local Playwright suite actually needs."
msgstr "Morate zagotoviti le okoljske vrednosti, ki jih vloga-lokalno Playwright apartma dejansko potrebuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST quote the `name:` value in double quotes because the colon (`:`) in the name is a reserved YAML character."
msgstr "Morate citirati `name:` vrednost v dvojnih narekovajih, ker je debelo črevo (`:`) v imenu je rezerviran znak YAML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST re-read `AGENTS.md` and follow all instructions in it before proceeding."
msgstr "Ponovno morate prebrati `AGENTS.md` in sledite vsem navodilom, preden nadaljujete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST re-run the full no-`apps=` sweep only as the final end-to-end parity confirmation, after the tail has gone green."
msgstr "Moraš ponovno zagnati polno ne-`apps=` Preiščite samo kot končno potrditev paritete od konca do konca, potem ko rep postane zelen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read [Role `javascript.js`](../files/role/javascript.js.md) BEFORE you implement role-local JavaScript so you can see how browser-side behavior should be implemented before you add or rewrite injected scripts."
msgstr "PREBERI MORATE [Vloga `javascript.js`](../files/role/javascript.js.md) PREDEN izvajate vlogo-local JavaScript, tako da lahko vidite, kako naj se izvaja obnašanje na strani brskalnika, preden dodate ali ponovno napišete injicirane skripte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read [Role `playwright.env.j2`](../files/role/playwright.env.j2.md) BEFORE you implement role-local Playwright environment templates so the rendered test inputs match the supported user journey."
msgstr "PREBERI MORATE [Vloga `playwright.env.j2`](../files/role/playwright.env.j2.md) KAJ MORATE VEDETI, PREDEN izvajate lokalne predloge za Playwrightovo okolje, tako da se preskušeni vnosi ujemajo s podprtim potovanjem uporabnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read [Role `playwright.spec.js`](../files/role/playwright.spec.js.md) BEFORE you implement or refactor role-local Playwright specs so end-to-end coverage stays aligned with the role behavior."
msgstr "PREBERI MORATE [Vloga `playwright.spec.js`](../files/role/playwright.spec.js.md) PREDEN izvajate ali refaktor vlogo-lokalni Playwright Spects tako da od konca do konca pokritost ostane usklajena z vedenjem vloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read [Role `style.css`](../files/role/style.css.md) BEFORE you implement role-local CSS so you can see how CSS should be implemented before you add or rewrite overrides."
msgstr "PREBERI MORATE [Vloga `style.css`](../files/role/style.css.md) PREDEN izvajate vlogo-lokalno CSS, tako da lahko vidite, kako je treba CSS izvajati, preden dodate ali prepišete razveljavitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read every file under [`docs/agents/`](docs/agents/) (full directory walk, including subdirectories) for the agent execution flow, EXCEPT [`docs/agents/action/`](docs/agents/action/)."
msgstr "PREBERI MORATE vsako datoteko pod [`docs/agents/`](docs/agents/) (poln sprehod po imeniku, vključno s podimeniki) za pretok izvrševanja sredstva, RAZEN [`docs/agents/action/`](docs/agents/action/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read every file under [`docs/contributing/`](docs/contributing/) (full directory walk, including subdirectories) for the full contributor guidance."
msgstr "PREBERI MORATE vsako datoteko pod [`docs/contributing/`](docs/contributing/) (poln sprehod po imeniku, vključno s podimeniki) za vse smernice, ki prispevajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read the full requirement file before writing any code or plan."
msgstr "Pred pisanjem kode ali načrta morate prebrati celotno datoteko z zahtevami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read the per-test logs for every run: the `list` reporter output, `playwright-report/index.html`, and `test-results/<test>/error-context.md` for any failed test."
msgstr "Morate prebrati dnevnike na test za vsak tek: `list` poročevalski izhod, `playwright-report/index.html`, in `test-results/<test>/error-context.md` za kateri koli neuspeli preskus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST render the real entry point, URLs, feature flags, and credentials that the deployed role exposes."
msgstr "MORATE ustvariti pravo vstopno točko, URL-je, zastavice funkcij in poverilnice, ki jih razporejena vloga izpostavlja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST replace hard-coded theme values: colors, RGB channels, gradients, borders, shadows, overlays, placeholder and focus colors."
msgstr "MORATE zamenjati težko kodirane vrednosti teme: barve, kanale RGB, gradiente, meje, sence, prekrivne plasti, prostorske in fokusne barve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST replace related values together: surface color, text color, border, hover, active, disabled, and alpha variants."
msgstr "MORATE zamenjati povezane vrednosti skupaj: barva površine, barva besedila, meja, lebdenje, aktivne, onemogočene in alfa različice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST reply in a thread when responding to a specific message or topic."
msgstr "MORATE odgovoriti v niti, ko se odzivate na določeno sporočilo ali temo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST run `make autoformat` before every commit. If `make autoformat` modifies any files that were already staged, you MUST re-stage those files before running the commit."
msgstr "Moraš teči. `make autoformat` Pred vsako obvezo. Če `make autoformat` spremeni vse datoteke, ki so že bile uprizorjene, morate ponovno vdelati te datoteke pred izvajanjem obveznosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST run `make test` before every deploy. Only proceed with the deploy if all tests pass."
msgstr "Moraš teči. `make test` Pred vsakim premikom. Nadaljujte z uporabo le, če so vsi preskusi opravljeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST set `design.css.colors.base` in the inventory as the single base color."
msgstr "Nastaviti morate `design.css.colors.base` v inventarju kot ena osnovna barva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST set the executable bit on shell scripts that are meant to run directly."
msgstr "Morate nastaviti izvedljivi bit na lupinske skripte, ki so namenjeni za neposredno delovanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST state assumptions clearly."
msgstr "Jasno morate navesti predpostavke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST stop the inner loop. Inner-loop runs do NOT pick up role changes."
msgstr "Ustaviti morate notranjo zanko. Notranja zanka ne zazna sprememb vlog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST store general `.sh` scripts for infinito.nexus administration under `scripts/`."
msgstr "Shranjevati morate splošno `.sh` skripti za infinito.nexus uporaba `scripts/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat AI output as a draft that must be reviewed for wrong assumptions, duplicate logic, and security mistakes."
msgstr "AI izhod morate obravnavati kot osnutek, ki ga je treba pregledati za napačne predpostavke, podvojiti logiko in varnostne napake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat [AGENTS.md](../../../../AGENTS.md) as the single, runtime-agnostic source of agent-specific execution instructions. There are no tool-specific extension files."
msgstr "Morate zdraviti [AGENTS.md](../../../../AGENTS.md) kot enoten, agnostični vir navodil za izvajanje, specifičnih za agenta. Ni posebnih datotek za orodje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat [AGENTS.md](../../../AGENTS.md) as the entry point for all agent-specific execution instructions."
msgstr "Morate zdraviti [AGENTS.md](../../../AGENTS.md) kot vstopna točka za vsa navodila za izvedbo, specifična za agenta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat each unchecked criterion (`- [ ]`) as a discrete unit of work."
msgstr "Vsako nenadzorovano merilo morate obravnavati (`- [ ]`) kot samostojna enota dela."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat the matching Pull Request template described in [Pull Request Templates](../../contributing/artefact/git/pull-request.md) and stored in `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE` as the SPOT for requirements, file checks, validation expectations, and the Definition of Done."
msgstr "Obravnavati morate predlogo povleci zahtevo, opisano v [Potegni predloge za zahtevo](../../contributing/artefact/git/pull-request.md) in shranjeni v `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE` kot SPOT za zahteve, preverjanja datotek, validacijskih pričakovanj in opredelitev opravljenega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat the provided log files as the source of truth for the failure they describe."
msgstr "Priložene dnevniške datoteke morate obravnavati kot vir resnice za neuspeh, ki ga opisujejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat the selected template as the SPOT for PR structure, author input, and review context."
msgstr "Izbrano predlogo morate obravnavati kot SPOT za strukturo PR, avtorski vnos in kontekst pregledovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat warnings about the concrete implementation, wiring, or runtime behavior as bugs that should be fixed."
msgstr "Morate obravnavati opozorila o izvajanju betona, ožičenje, ali delovanje kot hroščev, ki jih je treba določiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST update your branch before merging"
msgstr "Pred združitvijo morate posodobiti svojo podružnico"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use Python `unittest` as the test framework."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati Python `unittest` kot preskusni okvir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md) as the SPOT for the general development workflow, testing, review, and the code and development guides."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md) kot SPOT za splošni razvoj delovni tok, testiranje, pregled, ter kodeks in smernice za razvoj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md) for local development setup, contribution workflow, testing, and review."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md) za lokalni razvoj, potek dela, testiranje in pregled."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [RFC 2119](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2119) keywords in all documentation to express requirement levels unambiguously:"
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati [RFC 2119](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2119) ključne besede v vsej dokumentaciji za nedvoumno izražanje ravni zahtev:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [SECURITY.md](../../../SECURITY.md) for vulnerability reporting."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati [SECURITY.md](../../../SECURITY.md) za poročanje o ranljivosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [SUPPORT.md](../../../SUPPORT.md) for project help and participation."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati [SUPPORT.md](../../../SUPPORT.md) za pomoč pri projektu in sodelovanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [agents.md](https://agents.md/) as the external meta reference for AGENTS files."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati [agents.md](https://agents.md/) kot zunanja meta referenca za datoteke AGENTS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `# nocheck: docker-version` directly above a `version:` key only for intentional exceptions that should not be flagged by the external image-version check."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati `# nocheck: docker-version` neposredno nad a `version:` ključ samo za namerne izjeme, ki jih ne bi smeli označiti s preverjanjem zunanje različice slike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `--color-01-*` and `--color-rgb-01-*` as the primary palette. They MUST cover the majority of themed surfaces."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati `--color-01-*` ter `--color-rgb-01-*` kot primarno paleto. MORAJO pokrivati večino tematskih površin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `.md` files for commands, workflows, setup, and contributor guidance."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati `.md` datoteke za ukaze, poteke dela, nastavitve in navodila za prispevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `chmod +x` for those scripts so they can be invoked as executables."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati `chmod +x` za te skripte, da jih je mogoče uporabiti kot izvedljive."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `dotenv_quote` for values that may contain spaces, special characters, or shell-sensitive content."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati `dotenv_quote` za vrednosti, ki lahko vsebujejo prostore, posebne znake ali vsebino, občutljivo na lupino."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `files/javascript/javascript.js` when the script is static and does not depend on templating."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati `files/javascript/javascript.js` ko je skripta statična in ni odvisna od zamika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `javascript.js.j2` when the script depends on role variables or inventory values, and use `files/javascript/javascript.js` when the script is static."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati `javascript.js.j2` kadar je skripta odvisna od spremenljivk vloge ali vrednosti inventarja in uporabe `files/javascript/javascript.js` ko je scenarij statičen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `templates/javascript.js.j2` when runtime values from the inventory or role variables must be rendered into the browser code."
msgstr "MORATE uporabljati `templates/javascript.js.j2` kadar je treba vrednosti časa delovanja iz inventarja ali spremenljivke vloge vnesti v kodo brskalnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use a Pull Request (PR)"
msgstr "MORATE uporabiti zahtevo za vlečenje (PR)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use comments to explain why something is unusual, not to restate what obvious code already does."
msgstr "MORATE uporabiti komentarje, da pojasnite, zakaj je nekaj nenavadnega, ne pa, da ponovite, kaj očitno kodo že počne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use external tests only when the behavior depends on a live third-party system and a hermetic unit, lint, or integration test would not verify the real condition."
msgstr "Uporabljati morate zunanje teste samo, če je vedenje odvisno od živega sistema tretje osebe in hermetična enota, lint ali integracijski test ne bi preverili resničnega stanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use role-local JavaScript only for browser-side gaps that cannot be solved cleanly through app configuration, server configuration, or CSS alone."
msgstr "Uporabiti morate vlogo-lokalni JavaScript samo za vrzeli na strani brskalnika, ki jih ni mogoče rešiti čisto z nastavitvami aplikacij, nastavitvami strežnika ali samo CSS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use role-local JavaScript only for browser-side integration gaps that cannot be solved cleanly through app configuration or CSS alone."
msgstr "Uporabiti morate vlogo-lokalno JavaScript samo za vrzeli v integraciji ob strani brskalnika, ki jih ni mogoče rešiti čisto z nastavitvami aplikacij ali samo CSS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use the AI forum at [s.infinito.nexus/aihub](https://s.infinito.nexus/aihub) as the companion guidance and support resource."
msgstr "Uporabiti morate forum AI na [s.infinito.nexus/aihub](https://s.infinito.nexus/aihub) kot spremljevalno vodilo in podporni vir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use the templates from `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE`."
msgstr "Uporabiti morate predloge iz `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use these linting and quality tools where applicable:"
msgstr "Ta orodja za likanje in kakovost morate uporabljati, kjer je primerno:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use these markers only when the check genuinely does not apply. You MUST NOT use them to silence legitimate issues."
msgstr "Te oznake MORATE uporabiti le, če preverjanje resnično ne velja. Ne smete jih uporabljati, da bi utišali legitimna vprašanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST verify readable contrast for normal, hover, focus, active, and disabled states."
msgstr "Morate preveriti berljiv kontrast za normalno, lebdenje, fokus, aktivno in onemogočeno stanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST verify schema conformance per [Contributing `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): persona names match `<persona>: <flow>`, every skip routes through `PERSONA_<X>_BLOCKED=true` or `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false` (never runtime detection), and every persona reaches an authenticated surface and drives a role-specific interaction."
msgstr "Preveriti morate skladnost sheme na [Prispevanje `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): persona imena ujemajo `<persona>: <flow>`, vsak preskok poti skozi `PERSONA_<X>_BLOCKED=true` ali `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false` (nikoli ne zaznavaj časa delovanja), in vsaka oseba doseže avtentično površino in poganja interakcijo za vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST verify that primary actions, links, forms, cards, dialogs, navigation, and overlays still belong to the same visual system."
msgstr "MORATE preveriti, da primarna dejanja, povezave, obrazci, kartice, pogovorna okna, navigacijo in prekrivanja še vedno spadajo v isti vizualni sistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST verify that the new app behaves correctly end to end, not just whether it compiles or deploys."
msgstr "MORATE preveriti, ali se nova aplikacija obnaša pravilno do konca, ne samo, ali sestavlja ali uporablja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST wait for the DOM before touching elements, and guard missing elements so unrelated pages do not break."
msgstr "MORATE počakati na DOM, preden se dotaknete elementov, in čuvajte manjkajoče elemente, tako da nepovezane strani ne počijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST write in English in all public channels and threads."
msgstr "Morate pisati v angleščini v vseh javnih kanalih in niti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD add `design.font.import_url` when typography and colors should be controlled together."
msgstr "Moral bi dodati `design.font.import_url` ko je treba tipografijo in barve nadzorovati skupaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD annotate non-obvious keys with a short inline comment that explains why they exist, not what they do."
msgstr "Moral bi opozoriti ne-očitne tipke s kratkim inline komentar, ki pojasnjuje, zakaj obstajajo, ne kaj počnejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD attach screenshots, traces, logs, and migration notes when they materially help validate the change."
msgstr "Priložiti morate posnetke zaslona, sledi, dnevnike in selitvene zapiske, ko materialno pomagajo potrditi spremembo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD avoid creating or maintaining manual per-directory indexes when automatic indexing already covers the same pages. An additional `index.rst` inside a `docs/` subdirectory is NOT RECOMMENDED because the root index already covers those pages automatically, but it MAY be added when a focused local entry point materially improves navigation. If such a local `index.rst` is added, it SHOULD stay minimal and MUST NOT duplicate a manually curated page inventory that the automatic index already provides."
msgstr "Če samodejno indeksiranje že pokriva iste strani, bi se morali izogibati ustvarjanju ali vzdrževanju kazalcev po navodilih. Dodatno `index.rst` znotraj a `docs/` podimenik NI PRIPOROČAN, ker korenski indeks že samodejno pokriva te strani, vendar se lahko doda, ko usmerjena lokalna vstopna točka bistveno izboljša navigacijo. Če je tako lokalno `index.rst` je dodan, mora ostati minimalen in NE sme podvajati ročno kurirane strani inventar, ki ga samodejni indeks že zagotavlja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD avoid jumping straight to repeated remote CI reruns when `make act-workflow` can validate the workflow locally and the user agreed to use it."
msgstr "Izogibati bi se morali skokom na ponavljajoče se ponovitve oddaljenega CI-ja, ko `make act-workflow` lahko lokalno potrdi potek dela in uporabnik se je strinjal z njegovo uporabo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD check what is actually consuming space before cleaning up:"
msgstr "Pred čiščenjem preverite, kaj dejansko zaužije prostor:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD cover edge cases: empty inputs, missing keys, and boundary values, not only the happy path."
msgstr "Pokrivati morate robove: prazne vnose, manjkajoče tipke in mejne vrednosti, ne le srečno pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD group them by dependency family such as `tests/external/update/` or `tests/external/github/` when more than one test exists."
msgstr "Moral bi jih razvrstiti po odvisnih družinah, kot so `tests/external/update/` ali `tests/external/github/` če obstaja več preskusov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD keep each test focused on one integration boundary."
msgstr "Vsak test bi moral biti osredotočen na eno mejo integracije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD keep external tests focused, advisory, and easy to run on demand."
msgstr "Zunanji testi naj bodo osredotočeni, svetovalni in enostavni za vožnjo na zahtevo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD keep messages concise and on-topic."
msgstr "Sporočila bi morala biti jedrnata in na temi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD keep network traffic narrow and query each external dependency only as much as needed for a meaningful result."
msgstr "Omrežni promet bi moral biti ozek in vsako zunanjo odvisnost povprašati le toliko, kolikor je potrebno za smiseln rezultat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD name test methods after the behavior they verify, not the function name alone (e.g. `test_needed_false_when_disabled`)."
msgstr "Poimenovati bi morali testne metode po vedenju, ki ga preverijo, ne samo ime funkcije. (Npr. `test_needed_false_when_disabled`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD open a Pull Request as a **draft** while your change is still in progress. CI will not run and no reviewer time is spent until you mark it ready."
msgstr "Moral bi odpreti zahtevo za vlečenje kot **osnutek** dokler je sprememba še v teku. CI ne bo tekel in noben pregledovalec ne bo preživel časa, dokler ga ne označite pripravljenega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD place emojis after the headline text to visually highlight headings and improve scannability."
msgstr "Emojis bi morali postaviti po naslovnem besedilu, da bi vizualno poudarili naslove in izboljšali skeniranje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer `Dockerfile` over `Dockerfile.j2`; only use `Dockerfile.j2` when build-time templating is genuinely required."
msgstr "Raje bi videl. `Dockerfile` več `Dockerfile.j2`; samo uporaba `Dockerfile.j2` ko je čas gradnje resnično potreben."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer `README.md` for directory-level documentation when a human-facing entry point already exists."
msgstr "Raje bi videl. `README.md` za dokumentacijo na ravni imenika, kadar že obstaja vstopna točka, usmerjena v človeka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer explicit version pinning over drifting tags when the role depends on stable, reproducible deploys."
msgstr "Če je vloga odvisna od stabilnih, ponovljivih aplikacij, bi morali imeti raje eksplicitno različico, ki se prilepi na viseče oznake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer semantic improvements that reduce maintenance effort."
msgstr "Vi bi morali raje semantične izboljšave, ki zmanjšujejo napor vzdrževanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer smaller, more focused folders over dumping many unrelated files into one directory."
msgstr "Raje bi imeli manjše, bolj osredotočene mape kot pa, da bi odvrgli veliko nepovezanih datotek v en imenik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer targets that compose smaller scripts instead of embedding large shell fragments in the `Makefile`."
msgstr "Vi bi morali raje cilje, ki sestavljajo manjše skripte namesto vgrajevanje velikih lupin fragmentov v `Makefile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer the explicit cached getter over re-implementing the same memoisation in a calling module."
msgstr "Moral bi imeti raje eksplicitno predpomnilno točko, kot pa da ponovno vneseš iste spomine v klicni modul."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD run `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=<role>` for the redeploy."
msgstr "Moral bi teči. `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=<role>` Za redeploy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD run sandbox-confined commands directly on the host. The sandbox bounds what they can read, write, and reach. See [sandbox.md](docs/contributing/tools/agents/claude/sandbox.md)."
msgstr "Moral bi teči s peskovnikom konfinirane ukaze neposredno na gostitelja. Peskovnik veže, kar znajo brati, pisati in doseči. Glej. [sandbox.md](docs/contributing/tools/agents/claude/sandbox.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD separate mechanical cleanup from behavior changes when that lowers risk."
msgstr "Moral bi ločiti mehansko čiščenje od vedenja spremeni, ko to zmanjša tveganje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD set `INFINITO_MEMSWAP_LIMIT` to the same value as `INFINITO_MEM_LIMIT` to disable swap inflation. Allowing swap masks OOM conditions that the real runner would hit."
msgstr "Moral bi nastaviti. `INFINITO_MEMSWAP_LIMIT` v isto vrednost kot `INFINITO_MEM_LIMIT` onemogočiti zamenjavo inflacije. Dovoliti zamenjavo mask OOM pogoje, da bi pravi tekač zadel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD start a new thread for every distinct topic rather than continuing an unrelated conversation inline."
msgstr "Za vsako posamezno temo bi morali začeti novo nit, namesto da nadaljujete nepovezan pogovor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD test realistic inputs that match what Ansible would pass at runtime."
msgstr "Morali bi preizkusiti realistične vnose, ki se ujemajo s tem, kaj bi Ansible prestal med izvajanjem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD use `make compose-deploy` (full discovery) only when you need broad coverage and have enough time and resources."
msgstr "Uporabljati bi morali `make compose-deploy` (popolno odkritje) samo kadar potrebujete široko pokritost in imate dovolj časa in sredstev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD use emojis when they make the text more visually appealing, improve the mood, and increase readability."
msgstr "Emojis morate uporabljati, ko je besedilo bolj vizualno privlačno, izboljšate razpoloženje in povečate berljivost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD use targeted manual CI jobs instead of rerunning the full pipeline if you only need one focused check."
msgstr "Namesto ponovnega zagona celotnega cevovoda bi morali uporabiti ciljno usmerjena delovna mesta za ročne KI, če potrebujete le en osredotočen pregled."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD write code so it is logical and self-explanatory and usually does not need comments."
msgstr "Moral bi napisati kodo, tako da je logično in samoumevno in običajno ne potrebuje komentarjev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You access the app directly by URL"
msgstr "Aplikacijo dostopate neposredno po URL- ju"

