msgid "You can customize the tracking script and the noscript image tracker by editing the ``matomo-tracking.js.j2`` and ``matomo.subfilter.conf.j2`` templates."
msgstr "Lahko prilagodite skript za sledenje in sledilnik slik noscript z urejanjem ``matomo-tracking.js.j2`` ter ``matomo.subfilter.conf.j2`` predloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You can customize the tracking script and the noscript image tracker by editing the `matomo-tracking.js.j2` and `matomo.subfilter.conf.j2` templates."
msgstr "Lahko prilagodite skript za sledenje in sledilnik slik noscript z urejanjem `matomo-tracking.js.j2` ter `matomo.subfilter.conf.j2` predloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Your OIDC-authenticated user is now a full **global admin** and has access to all administrative functions in the Mailu interface."
msgstr "Vaš OIDC-priznan uporabnik je zdaj polno **globalni admin** in ima dostop do vseh upravnih funkcij v Mailu vmesnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Your PR MUST pass CI before merging"
msgstr "Vaš PR mora pred združitvijo opraviti KI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Your branch MUST be up to date with `main`."
msgstr "Vaša podružnica mora biti na tekočem z `main`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Your change SHOULD be small and focused."
msgstr "Vaša sprememba bi morala biti majhna in osredotočena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Zero Vendor Lock-In"
msgstr "Zero Productor Lock- In"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Zero per-image configuration: any image normally pulled from Docker Hub is cached on first access and served from local disk afterwards."
msgstr "Konfiguracija nič na sliko: vsaka slika, ki je običajno potegnjena iz Docker Huba, se shrani ob prvem dostopu in se nato postreže z krajevnega diska."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Zero the variable — all CI reverts to GitHub-hosted runners."
msgstr "Zero spremenljivka – vse CI vrne na tekače, ki gostijo GitHub."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Zero write-back and no permanently stored root token, satisfying \"minimize the requirement for permanently stored bootstrap credentials\"."
msgstr "Nič odpisa in brez trajno shranjenega korenskega žetona, zadovoljivo \"čim bolj zmanjšati potrebo po trajno shranjenih poverilnicah za škornje\"."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Zero-pad each numeric component of *version* to three digits."
msgstr "Zero-pad vsaka številčna komponenta *Različica* na tri številke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Zone"
msgstr "Cona"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] \"Sign in with Bluesky\" completes an AT Protocol OAuth round-trip against the platform PDS provided by [`web-app-bluesky`](../../roles/web-app-bluesky/), and an authenticated user can create a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record that is written to their PDS repo."
msgstr "[ ] \"Vpišite se z Bluesky\" opravi krožni let po protokolu AT OAuth proti platformi PDS, ki jo zagotavlja [`web-app-bluesky`](../../roles/web-app-bluesky/), in overovljeni uporabnik lahko ustvarite `community.lexicon.calendar.event` zapis, ki je napisan njihovim PDS repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] (Phase 2) A Flowise supervisor flow runs a cross-agent pipeline that hands a result from one agent to the other and returns a combined output; single-agent use still works without Flowise. **Blocked:** depends on the criterion above."
msgstr "[ ] (Faza 2) A Flowise pretok nadzornika vodi cevovod za navzkrižne agente, ki je rezultat enega agenta v drugega in vrne kombinirani izhod; uporaba enega agenta še vedno deluje brez Flowise. **Blokirani:** je odvisno od zgoraj navedenega merila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] (Phase 2) Hermes' and OpenClaw's MCP-server mode is enabled; Flowise connects to both as MCP clients and delegates a task to each. **Blocked:** `stdio_only`, see [Blocked on hardware and on Phase 2](#blocked-on-hardware-and-on-phase-2)."
msgstr "[ ] (Faza 2) Hermes' in OpenClawMCP-server način je omogočen; Flowise povezuje tako kot MCP stranke in prenese nalogo na vsakega. **Blokirani:** `stdio_only`, Vidiš? [Blokiran na strojni opremi in na Fazi 2](#blocked-on-hardware-and-on-phase-2)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. how the worker join tokens are persisted, exact NFS export options per distro, how the per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` opt-out is plumbed, exact placement-constraint shape for the swarm-without-nfs warning path, exact openresty `upstream` resolution syntax for swarm-internal DNS) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched question round, BEFORE any file is changed. Once those questions are answered, the agent MUST NOT pause for further clarification. Additional ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the affected role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[ ] **Pojasnite vprašanja šele na začetku.** Vsako odprto vprašanje, nejasnost ali manjkajoča odločitev (npr. kako se delavec pridruži žetonom vztraja, točne možnosti NFS izvoza na distro, kako je na rolo `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` opt-out je ohlapna, natančna oblika, ki omejuje namestitev za roy-brez-nfs opozorilne poti, točna odprtost `upstream` sintaksa ločljivosti za roj-notranje DNS) MORAJO dvigniti enkrat na samem začetku teče, v enem skupnem vprašanje krog, preden se spremeni vsaka datoteka. Ko se odgovori na ta vprašanja, se agent NE SME ustaviti za nadaljnja pojasnila. Dodatne dvoumnosti, odkrite v srednji fazi, mora agent rešiti po najboljši presoji, zabeleženi v prizadeti vlogi. `README.md` ali komentar kodeksa in ponovno pregledan samo pri pregledu PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Every ✅ cell is wired**: for each ✅ pair (row → column), the row role declares an addon in its `meta/addons/` that integrates the column role, with `mechanism` set appropriately and (when the column role is an in-repo role) a `bridges:` entry resolving to the row role's `meta/services.yml` service for that target."
msgstr "[ ] **Vsak ✅ celica je ozvočena**: za vsakega ✅ par (vrstica → stolpec), vrsta vloga razglasi dodatek v svojem `meta/addons/` ki vključuje vlogo stolpca z `mechanism` ustrezno in (kadar je vloga v stolpcu vloga v repo) a `bridges:` vnos za razrešitev vrstne vloge `meta/services.yml` storitev za to tarčo."

