# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[ ] A sealed instance is detectable: `/v1/sys/health` returns 503 (asserted by `test-seal-status.js`) and an alert rule fires on that condition. *An `OpenBaoSealed` alert now ships with the role itself, in `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, which the `alert_rule_roles` lookup concatenates into the Prometheus rule file. The health-code contract is asserted by the spec suite and the healthy path was confirmed live (200 in both compose and swarm), but the **firing** condition was never observed — that needs an instance deliberately sealed, which the AppRole-only admin model makes awkward to arrange in a test.* **Correction from implementation:** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, so the gauge is `vault_core_unsealed`, not `openbao_core_unsealed` — and it is unusable as an alert source here: on a healthy, demonstrably unsealed node it is emitted as `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so `== 0` would fire permanently. Use the health endpoint as the primary signal, with `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` as the metric-side corroboration. The alert rule itself is still outstanding."
msgstr "[ ] Zatesnjen primerek je zaznaven: `/v1/sys/health` vrne 503 (trdi `test-seal-status.js`) In pod tem pogojem izstreli alarmno pravilo. *A `OpenBaoSealed` opozarjati zdaj ladje s samo vlogo, v `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, ki `alert_rule_roles` iskati concatenates v Prometheus Datoteka s pravili. Pogodba o zdravstvenem zakoniku velja za poseben apartma in zdrava pot je bila potrjena v živo (200 v sestavi in roju), ampak **Streljanje** pogoj ni bil nikoli opažen – da je potreben primer namerno zapečaten, ki ga model AppRole-le admin naredi nerodno urediti v test.* **Popravek zaradi izvajanja:** OpenBao ohranja Vaultov metrični imenski prostor, tako da je merilnik `vault_core_unsealed`, ne `openbao_core_unsealed` – in je neuporabna kot opozorilni vir tukaj: na zdravem, očitno nezapečatenem vozlišču se oddaja kot `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, torej `== 0` bi streljal za vedno. Kot primarni signal uporabite končno točko zdravstvenega stanja z `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` kot metrična potrditev. Pravilo pripravljenosti je še vedno izjemno."

