# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Creating an agent optionally provisions a dedicated platform user account via the existing `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mechanism; the agent authenticates as that account (OIDC dashboard login, MCP `auth_subject: user`), and deploying against an existing account instead also works. **Partly done:** the account half is implemented and linted (see [Agent identity](#agent-identity)); the MCP half is **blocked** on no deployed provider offering per-user OAuth, which is the bar [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) sets before `auth_subject: user` may be declared."
msgstr "[ ] Ustvarjanje zastopnika neobvezno določbe namenskega uporabniškega računa platforme prek obstoječega `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mehanizem; zastopnik overi kot ta račun; (Prijava na OIDC armaturno ploščo, MCP `auth_subject: user`), namesto tega deluje tudi uporaba proti obstoječemu računu. **Delno opravljeno:** se polovica računa izvaja in linera (glej [Identiteta zastopnika](#agent-identity)); MCP polovica je **blokiran** na nobenega ponudnika, ki ponuja na uporabnika OAuth, ki je bar [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) nizov pred `auth_subject: user` se lahko prijavi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Zaznamki in skrivni deli URL-ja so odsotni iz dnevnikov, ustvarjene netajne konfiguracije, API odzivi, izhod naloge, sledi Playwrighta in besedilo izjeme. **Tri od šestih površin se držijo statično:** dnevniki in izhod opravil po [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), ki zahteva `no_log` ali `mask_values` na vsaki nalogi MCP, ki obravnava skrivnost in odtise; Sledovi predvajanja po [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), ki prepoveduje `playwright.env.j2` iz upodabljanja `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` skrivnost ali `key_credential` Komponenta URL. Generirana netajna konfiguracija potrebuje tajno/netajno klasifikacijo prevedenih datotek, ki še ne obstajajo; API odzivi in izjemno besedilo so opazovanja časa delovanja za fazo uvajanja."

