# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When OIDC is enabled, the role creates the Keycloak `administrator` as an external Semaphore admin at deploy time (`semaphore user add --admin --external`, matching `preferred_username` + email), so the OIDC callback elevates that operator to admin (verified for the `administrator` persona). Upstream has no native claim→admin mapping; this deploy-time external-admin seed is the documented smallest reconciliation step (README)."
msgstr "[ ] Ko je omogočen OIDC, vloga ustvarja Keycloak `administrator` kot zunanji semafor admin ob času uvajanja (`semaphore user add --admin --external`, ujemanje `preferred_username` + e-pošta), tako da OIDC klic dvigne, da operater za upravljanje (preverjeno za `administrator` persona). Upstream nima avtohtone trditve ›admin kartiranje; to uvajanje-čas zunanje-admin seme je dokumentiran najmanjši korak usklajevanja (README)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
