msgstr "[ ] Ko je omogočen SSO, oauth2-proxy vrata spredaj Checkmk in potrjuje proti Keycloak (odjemalec samodejno zagotovljen preko `redirect_uris` filter)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When `svc-db-openldap` is in `group_names`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ENABLE=true` plus `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SERVER` (host:port), `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_BIND_DN` / `_BIND_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_DN` / `_SEARCH_FILTER`, and the `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_*` attributes are rendered from the central LDAP vars (env names per the v2.x config schema)."
msgstr "[ ] Kdaj `svc-db-openldap` je v `group_names`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ENABLE=true` plus `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SERVER` (gostitelj:port), `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_BIND_DN` / `_BIND_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_DN` / `_SEARCH_FILTER`, in `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_*` atributi so ustvarjeni iz centralnih LDAP vars (env imena per v2.x konfig shema)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When `svc-db-openldap` is in `group_names`, an LDAP connection is provisioned (`files/configure-sso.sh`) so LDAP users (matching the `X-Remote-User`) exist with roles/contact groups. LDAP is a backend identity source behind the oauth2 gate — there is no separate LDAP login surface, so it is exempted from a Playwright gate (`# nocheck: playwright-service-flag`), mirroring [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."
msgstr "[ ] Kdaj `svc-db-openldap` je v `group_names`, je zagotovljena povezava LDAP (`files/configure-sso.sh`) tako uporabniki LDAP (ustreza `X-Remote-User`) obstajajo z vlogami/kontaktnimi skupinami. LDAP je izvor identitete za oauthom2 vrata – ni ločene prijavne površine LDAP, zato je izvzeta iz vrat Playwright (`# nocheck: playwright-service-flag`), zrcaljenje [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
