msgstr "[ ] `README.md` Dokumenti slika + buck politika, auth pristop + njen odjemalec-coverage caveat (splet-le proti vsem strankam), odločitev o shranjevanju medijev, transkodiranje in oblikovanje brez zunanjega DB."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` and the cookie hash/encryption secrets are generated once and persisted in the role's secret store (idempotent across redeploys)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` in skrivnosti piškotkov hašiš/šifriranje nastanejo enkrat in vztrajajo v skrivni trgovini vloge (idempotent na vseh prerazporeditvah)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed a break-glass local admin (dedicated `breakglass` login + dedicated email, no collision with the SSO/LDAP identities) in **every** variant; no setup wizard is presented on first load. Its form login is reachable only when LDAP is disabled (Semaphore forces LDAP-only form auth otherwise)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seme lomno steklo lokalni admin (namenski `breakglass` prijava + namenska e-pošta, brez trka z identitetami SSO/LDAP) v **vsak** varianta; pri prvi obremenitvi ni predstavljen noben čarovnik za nastavitev. Prijava je dosegljiva le, če je LDAP onemogočen (Semaforne sile LDAP-samo tvorijo Auth drugače)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` plus `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` are wired; when `services.postgres.shared=true` the role consumes the central `svc-db-postgres` (no per-role engine), else `sys-svc-rdbms` templates a per-role Postgres."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` plus `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` so ožičeni; kadar `services.postgres.shared=true` vloga porabi osrednjo `svc-db-postgres` (brez motorja na rolo), drugače `sys-svc-rdbms` predloge na role Postgres."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` is rendered as valid JSON (`keycloak` provider: `display_name`, `provider_url`=realm issuer, `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` je preveden kot veljaven JSON (`keycloak` ponudnik: `display_name`, `provider_url`= stvarni izdajatelj, `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`)."

