# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Jira](https://www.atlassian.com/) is Atlassian’s issue and project-tracking platform. This role deploys Jira via Docker Compose, connects it to PostgreSQL, and adds proxy awareness, optional OIDC SSO, health checks, and production-oriented defaults for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "[Jira](https://www.atlassian.com/) je atlasijska platforma za spremljanje in sledenje projektov. Ta vloga se uporablja Jira preko Docker Compose, ga povezuje z PostgreSQL, in dodaja proxy ozaveščenost, neobvezno OIDC SSO, zdravstvene preglede, in proizvodnje usmerjene privzete Infinito.Nexus."

