# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Kata Containers](https://katacontainers.io/) is an OCI container runtime that starts each container inside a lightweight virtual machine with its own kernel instead of sharing the host kernel. [gVisor](https://gvisor.dev/) is a second isolating runtime, shipped as the single `runsc` binary, that intercepts container syscalls in a userspace kernel and runs without hardware virtualization."
msgstr "[Zabojniki Kata](https://katacontainers.io/) je posoda za OCI, ki zažene vsako posodo znotraj lahkega virtualnega stroja z lastnim jedrom, namesto da bi delila jedro gostitelja. [gVisor](https://gvisor.dev/) je drugi izolirani čas delovanja, poslan kot samski `runsc` binarno, ki prestreže kontejner syscals v uporabniškem prostoru jedra in teče brez strojne virtualizacije."

