# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[LiteLLM](https://docs.litellm.ai/) is an LLM gateway that puts a single OpenAI-compatible API in front of many model providers. Its admin UI is the gateway's built-in web interface for virtual API keys, teams, budgets and rate limits, model routing, and request and spend logs."
msgstr "[LiteLLM](https://docs.litellm.ai/) je LLM prehod, ki postavlja eno OpenAI-združljiv API pred številnimi ponudniki modelov. Njegov admin UI je vgrajen spletni vmesnik za virtualno API tipke, ekipe, proračuni in omejitve obrestnih mer, model usmerjanja, in zahteva in porabi dnevnike."

