msgid "[`mcp_authorization`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/authorization.py) raises for `auth: oidc`, because a rendered config cannot carry a caller's token, and `mcp_authorization_is_renderable` returns `false` so the static-config clients drop the server instead of presenting a wrong secret."
