msgid "[`mcp_tool_server_connections`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/tool_server_connections.py) emits `auth_type: system_oauth` with an empty `key` for those servers, so Open WebUI resolves the caller's own token per request."
msgstr "[`mcp_tool_server_connections`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/tool_server_connections.py) oddaja `auth_type: system_oauth` s praznim `key` za te strežnike, tako Open WebUI reši klicni znak na zahtevo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the Prometheus administrator RBAC group through the oauth2-proxy gate, so the `biber` persona is denied before it ever reaches a Prometheus page: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. That denial is not lost coverage — this role's own spec asserts it for every consumer, together with the admin reach and scrape-target parity checks. The `administrator` persona is blocked only when `services.sso.enabled` is false: without the co-deployed Keycloak there is no proxy in front of Prometheus, hence no login round-trip and no logout control to drive. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) prizna samo Prometheus administrator RBAC skupina prek Oauth2Proxy vrata, tako da `biber` persona je zavrnjena, preden sploh doseže Prometheus Stran: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) razglasi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. To zanikanje ni izgubljena pokritost – ta naloga sama določa za vsakega potrošnika, skupaj z doseg in strga-ciljne paritete preverjanja. – `administrator` persona je blokirana le, če `services.sso.enabled` je napačna: brez sorazporejene Keycloak ni posrednika pred Prometheus, zato ni prijavo povratno in brez odjave za vožnjo. – `guest` persona in osnovne izjave o dosegljivosti potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the `web-app-lam` administrator RBAC group to the oauth2-proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), and `biber` carries an empty role list in the development inventory. The proxy denies `biber` before LAM is ever reached, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) prizna samo `web-app-lam` skupina upraviteljev RBAC za oauth2-proksi (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`)in `biber` ima prazen seznam vlog v inventarju razvoja. Proxy zanika `biber` Pred uporabo LAM je kdaj dosežen, tako da [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) razglasi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) declares no `sso` service, so this role is never registered as a Keycloak client. Its only HTTP surface is the anonymous logout conductor and the `/logout` endpoints proxied by [`templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2`](./templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2) — there is no login form, no account and no session to end. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The service's real coverage is per consumer: [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) parameterises the injected logout JS over `roles_with_service('logout')`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) izjavljam, da ne `sso` storitev, tako da ta vloga nikoli ni registrirana kot Keycloak Stranka. Njegova edina HTTP površina je anonimni prevodnik in `/logout` opazovane dogodke, [`templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2`](./templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2) — ni prijavnega obrazca, računa in seje, ki bi se končala. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) zato izjavljam `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Resnična pokritost storitve je na potrošnika: [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) parameterizira injicirano odjavo JS preko `roles_with_service('logout')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `logout.enabled` to `false`, and the role seeds no chess account — [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) renders only the `APP_ADMIN_URL` / `APP_ADMIN_EMAIL` contact pair. Neither the `biber` nor the `administrator` persona has a login surface here, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) zatiči `sso.enabled` ter `logout.enabled` do `false`, in vloge semena ni šah račun – [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) naredi samo `APP_ADMIN_URL` / `APP_ADMIN_EMAIL` kontaktni par. Niti `biber` niti `administrator` Persona ima tukaj prijavno površino. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) razglasi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. O `guest` persona in osnovne izjave o dosegljivosti potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `logout.enabled` to `false`; the navigator is a read-only front-end over the role graph with no accounts and no auth layer. There is nothing for the `biber` or `administrator` persona to log in to, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) zatiči `sso.enabled` ter `logout.enabled` do `false`; navigator je bralno-samo sprednji del nad grafom vlog brez računov in brez auth plast. Nič ni za... `biber` ali `administrator` oseba za prijavo v, tako da [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) razglasi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. O `guest` persona in osnovne izjave o dosegljivosti potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `logout.enabled` to `false`; the role serves the upstream LittleJS build from a static nginx image and ships no auth layer at all. There is nothing for the `biber` or `administrator` persona to log in to, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) zatiči `sso.enabled` ter `logout.enabled` do `false`; vloga služi toku navzgor LittleJS graditi iz statične nginx slike in ladje brez auth plasti sploh. Nič ni za... `biber` ali `administrator` oseba za prijavo v, tako da [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) razglasi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. O `guest` persona in osnovne izjave o dosegljivosti potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` to `false` and [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) provisions no Confluence account — account creation belongs to the licensed first-run setup wizard. Neither the `biber` nor the `administrator` persona has credentials to sign in with, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
