# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) is an open-source, AT-Protocol-native event platform. Its defining property is that **events live on the user's account, not on the app**: an event is a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record and an RSVP is a `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` record, both stored in the user's Personal Data Server (PDS) repo. The atmo app itself is \"just a view\" (an appview/aggregator) over those records, so RSVPs and events are portable across any app on the open social web."
msgstr "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) je odprtokodna platforma AT-Protocol. Njena značilnost je, da **dogodki v živo na uporabniškem računu, ne v aplikaciji**: dogodek je a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` zapis in RSVP je `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` zapis, oba shranjena v uporabniškem strežniku osebnih podatkov (PDS) Zaplemba. Aplikacija atmo je \"samo pogled.\" (Aplikacija/agregator) preko teh zapisov, tako RSVP in dogodki so prenosni preko katere koli aplikacije na odprtem socialnem spletu."

