# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] A deployment-managed Flowise fixture executes a deterministic MCP tool successfully and contains no plaintext MCP credential. The fixture is an Agentflow whose Tool node invokes one named tool with fixed arguments through `customMcpServerTool`, so the call is deterministic rather than left to a model, and the deploy runs it through `/api/v1/prediction` and fails on a non-200 answer or an error body. The node carries only the registry entry id: the bearer stays in Flowise's encrypted `authConfig`, which a unit test holds by asserting the serialised flow contains neither the token nor the word `Bearer`. The candidates are the three providers that admit Flowise, each with a read tool that takes no arguments; the first one registered is built and executed and stale fixtures from earlier runs are removed."
msgstr "[x] Upravljanje z uvajanjem Flowise namestitev izvede deterministično MCP orodje uspešno in ne vsebuje navadnega MCP credential. Priključek je agentflow, katerega orodje se sklicuje na orodje z nespremenljivimi argumenti `customMcpServerTool`, tako da klic je deterministično namesto prepustiti modelu, in uporaba teče skozi `/api/v1/prediction` in ne uspe pri ne-200 odgovor ali telo za napake. Vozlišče ima samo identifikacijsko oznako registra: nosilec ostane v Flowiseje šifriran `authConfig`, ki ga ima preskus enote s trditvijo serijski tok ne vsebuje niti žetona niti besede `Bearer`. Kandidati so trije ponudniki, ki priznavajo Flowise, vsak z orodjem za branje, ki ne zahteva argumentov; prva registrirana je zgrajena in izvedena in stale priključki iz prejšnjih teče so odstranjeni."

