# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] A new GitHub Actions workflow at `.github/workflows/test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` (path to be created) provisions a multi-node Swarm cluster on a single **GitHub-hosted** runner using Docker-in-Docker with multiple Docker daemons. The topology is fixed at **three simulated nodes**: exactly one manager (`swarm-mgr-01`) plus exactly two workers (`swarm-wrk-01`, `swarm-wrk-02`). Three nodes are mandatory so that the rescheduling test has a genuine choice of target (drain the worker running the MediaWiki application service → scheduler MUST pick the OTHER worker, not the manager). One additional container hosts the NFS server reachable from all three simulated nodes. Then the workflow deploys `web-app-mediawiki` as a Swarm stack with the MariaDB service pinned to the manager and the application service free to schedule on either worker."
msgstr "[x] Nov potek dela dejavnosti GitHub na `.github/workflows/test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` (pot, ki jo je treba ustvariti) določbe o grozdu več vozlišč na enem samem **Gostitelj GitHub** zaganjalnik, ki uporablja Docker-in-Docker z več demoni Docker. Topologija je določena na **tri simulirana vozlišča**: točno en upravitelj (`swarm-mgr-01`) plus točno dva delavca (`swarm-wrk-01`, `swarm-wrk-02`). Tri vozlišča so obvezna tako, da test reprogramiranja ima resnično izbiro cilj (izčrpati delavca, ki vodi MediaWiki Aplikacijska storitev → Razporejevalnik MORA izbrati DRUGI delavec, ne pa upravitelj). Ena dodatna posoda gosti NFS strežnik dosegljiv iz vseh treh simuliranih vozlišč. Nato se začne delovni tok `web-app-mediawiki` kot Swarm kup z MariaDB storitev, pripeta na upravitelja in aplikacijsko službo, ki se lahko brezplačno razporedi na katerega koli delavca."

