# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] A restore procedure is documented and executed once end to end: restore the volume, redeploy, and confirm the instance auto-unseals and a previously stored secret is still readable. Drill run on the variant-2 stack: container quiesced, `openbao_data` archived (33 MB), the live volume **wiped to zero entries**, restored from the archive, and restarted — OpenBao came back `initialized: true, sealed: false` with the secret, the PKI root CA and all five policies recovered. This also confirms the documented dependency: the restored store is only readable because the seal key in the inventory was unchanged."
msgstr "[x] Postopek obnove se dokumentira in izvede, ko se konča: obnovitev glasnosti, prerazporeditev in potrditev primera avto-odpečate in prej shranjena skrivnost je še vedno berljiva. Vrtalni sistem na varianti...2 kup: posoda tiha, `openbao_data` arhivirano (33 MB), živi volumen **izbrisani vnosi do nič**, obnovljeni iz arhiva in ponovno začeti – OpenBao se je vrnil `initialized: true, sealed: false` s skrivnostjo, PKI koren CA in vseh pet politik izterja. To potrjuje tudi dokumentirano odvisnost: obnovljena trgovina je berljiva le zato, ker je bil ključ pečata v inventarju nespremenjen."

