# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Every MCP server role declares an application-scoped `mcp` RBAC role, and each client enforces the corresponding server grant. Open WebUI MAY resolve or create its unpredictable local group identifier by group name and apply `access_grants` through the API, but unscoped `roles: [mcp]`, wrong-application membership, last-group removal, and post-restart reconciliation MUST be fixed and tested as defined by requirement 035. All four hold: `granted_roles` drops an `APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES` name declared unscoped (`test_rbac_scoped.py::test_an_unscoped_scoped_role_grants_nothing_anywhere`); a scoped grant reaches only its own application, and another provider's group id does not enable a connection (`test_mcp_tool_server_connections.py`); `reconcile_members` sets a group to exactly the entitled set rather than relying on the claim sync (`test_provision_mcp_grants.py::test_a_group_that_lost_its_last_member_is_emptied`); and the grant travels in `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`, so a restart restores it. The declaration itself is held by [test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py)."
msgstr "[x] Vsaka vloga strežnika MCP se razglasi za programsko-skopsko `mcp` Vloga RBAC, in vsak odjemalec uveljavlja ustrezno podporo strežnika. Open WebUI MAY rešiti ali ustvariti svojo nepredvidljivo lokalno skupino identifikator po imenu skupine in uporablja `access_grants` skozi API, vendar brez mikroskopa `roles: [mcp]`, članstvo v napačni vlogi, odstranitev zadnje skupine in uskladitev po ponovnem zagonu morajo biti določeni in preskušeni, kot je določeno z zahtevo 035. Vsi štirje počakajte: `granted_roles` kapljice `APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES` ime deklarirano neskončno (`test_rbac_scoped.py::test_an_unscoped_scoped_role_grants_nothing_anywhere`); obseg nepovratnih sredstev doseže samo lastno uporabo in identifikator skupine drugega ponudnika ne omogoča povezave (`test_mcp_tool_server_connections.py`); `reconcile_members` določi skupino za točno upravičeni niz, namesto da se zanaša na uskladitev zahtevka (`test_provision_mcp_grants.py::test_a_group_that_lost_its_last_member_is_emptied`)in donacije potuje v `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`, Torej ga ponovno zaženemo. Izjavo ima [test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Every MCP server role documents whether calls execute as the requesting user, a service account, or an administrator, and the implementation verifies the real provisioned identity. The lookup named here has since been replaced: `lookup('mcp_credential')` resolves the provider's declared `mcp.credential.owner`, `tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_no_administrator_token.py` forbids that owner from being `administrator` and forbids task code from reading `users.administrator.tokens`, and all 24 server roles declare `auth_subject: service_account` against a role-scoped `mcp-<application_id>` account. The deploy-time probe authenticates *as* that owner before asserting the tool contract, so a token belonging to anyone else fails the deploy."
msgstr "[x] Vsi dokumenti o vlogah strežnika MCP, ali se klici izvajajo kot uporabnik, ki zahteva storitev, račun ali administrator, in izvajanje preveri pravo zagotovljeno identiteto. Vpogled, ki se tukaj imenuje, je bil od takrat nadomeščen: `lookup('mcp_credential')` razreši prijavljenega ponudnika `mcp.credential.owner`, `tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_no_administrator_token.py` prepoveduje temu lastniku biti `administrator` in prepoveduje branje kode opravila `users.administrator.tokens`, in vse 24 Vloge strežnikov deklarirajo `auth_subject: service_account` proti mikroskopu vlog `mcp-<application_id>` račun. Sonda za čas uvajanja overi *kot* Ta lastnik pred uveljavitvijo pogodbe z orodjem, tako da žeton, ki pripada komurkoli drugemu ne uspe."

