# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Lint accepts `implementation: adapter` only with one allowed adapter type and all mandatory immutable-source, credential, endpoint, limit, and tool-contract fields. [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) rejects a type outside `MCP_ADAPTER_TYPES`, a `specification_path` that is not a checked-in file under `roles/<role>/files/`, a missing `specification_sha256`, and a server-capable block missing `credential`, `endpoint` or `limits` — each with its required sub-keys."
msgstr "[x] Lint sprejme `implementation: adapter` samo z enim dovoljenim tipom adapterja in vsemi obveznimi nespremenljivimi viri, poverilnimi točkami, končnimi točkami, mejnimi točkami in področji orodnih pogodb. [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) zavrne tip zunaj `MCP_ADAPTER_TYPES`, a `specification_path` ki ni prijavljena datoteka pod `roles/<role>/files/`, manjka `specification_sha256`, in manjka blok s strežnikom `credential`, `endpoint` ali `limits` — vsak z zahtevanimi podključi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Lint allows role-level service dependencies that are not addon bridges, such as Friendica's `sso` front-door auth gate, to remain in `meta/services.yml` without appearing under an unrelated addon's `bridges:`."
msgstr "[x] Lint omogoča odvisnosti storitev na ravni vloge, ki niso dodatni mostovi, kot so Friendica's `sso` vhodna vrata, da ostanejo v `meta/services.yml` brez pojavljanja pod nepovezanim addonom `bridges:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Lint fails when an addon's `bridges:` entry names a service key absent from the same role's `meta/services.yml`, and the error message names the role, addon id, and missing service key."
msgstr "[x] Lint ne uspe, če je addon `bridges:` vnesite ime storitvenega ključa, ki ni vključen v isto vlogo `meta/services.yml`, in sporočilo o napaki imenuje vlogo, addon ID, in manjka ključ storitev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Lint rejects every generic URL/spec/query/SQL/filesystem/shell/socket/unrestricted-bucket surface described in the ADR."
msgstr "[x] Lint zavrne vse splošne URL/spec/query/SQL/filesystem/shell/socket/unrestricted-bucket površino, opisano v ADR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Lint verifies that every bridged service block carries `enabled` and `shared` flags."
msgstr "[x] Lint preveri, da vsak premostitveni servisni blok nosi `enabled` ter `shared` Zastave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] MCP credentials follow their origin. A secret this deployment generates (an endpoint key, a shared app secret) is declared in the role's [`meta/secrets.yml`](../../roles/web-app-baserow/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` block and consumed via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. A credential the application itself issues (an API token, a personal access token, an app password) MUST NOT be declared there, because the vault cannot generate it; it is minted against the running instance and persisted through `sys-token-store` under the consuming user. Either way the value is never written into `README.md`, Playwright traces, or non-secret env vars."
msgstr "[x] MCP poverilnice sledijo svojemu izvoru. Skrivnost, ki jo ta razporeditev ustvari (ključ končne točke, skupna skrivnost aplikacije) je prijavljen v vlogi [`meta/secrets.yml`](../../roles/web-app-baserow/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` blokirajo in porabijo prek `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. Zaupnost aplikacija sama izdaja (a API žeton, osebni dostop žeton, geslo aplikacije) NE SME se tam razglasiti, ker ga trezor ne more ustvariti; skovan je proti tekočemu primeru in vztraja skozi `sys-token-store` pod porabnikom. V vsakem primeru vrednost ni nikoli zapisana. `README.md`, Playwright sledovi, ali netajne env vars."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] MCP is served under the role's existing `domains.canonical` origin at `mcp.endpoint.path`; any new MCP subdomain is justified by an upstream limitation and registered in `domains.canonical`."
msgstr "[x] MCP je v okviru obstoječe vloge `domains.canonical` izvor `mcp.endpoint.path`; vsaka nova poddomina MCP je upravičena z zgornjo mejo in registrirana v `domains.canonical`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] MDAD's `ansible-playbook` is invoked inside a dedicated runner sub-container (image: `services.matrix.runner.image`, built locally from `files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile`) so its Ansible runtime is isolated from Infinito-Nexus's. The runner mounts the Docker socket, systemd dirs, `/matrix`, `/usr/local/bin`, and the MDAD checkout from the deploy container. A `mount --make-rshared /` runs once in the deploy container before the runner starts because MDAD's systemd units bind-mount with `bind-propagation=slave`."
msgstr "[x] MDAD's `ansible-playbook` se sklicuje na namenski podzabojnik (slika: `services.matrix.runner.image`, zgrajena lokalno iz `files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile`) Zato je njegov negibni čas izoliran od Infinito-Nexusa. Tekač nastavlja Dockerjevo vtičnico, sistemsko krmilo, `/matrix`, `/usr/local/bin`, in MDAD odjava iz zabojnika. A `mount --make-rshared /` teče enkrat v posodi za uporabo pred zagonom tekača, ker MDAD-jeve sistemske enote vežejo z `bind-propagation=slave`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] MDAD's `matrix_synapse_oidc_*` keys are templated from `OIDC.CLIENT.*` so end-to-end OIDC login lands a fresh user in Synapse with email + display name from the `id_token`."
msgstr "[x] MDAD's `matrix_synapse_oidc_*` tipke so predloge iz `OIDC.CLIENT.*` tako končno-to-end OIDC prijava pristane nov uporabnik v Synapse z e-pošto + ime prikaza iz `id_token`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] MDAD's bundled traefik is disabled in the rendered inventory."
msgstr "[x] MDAD-jev snop traefik je onemogočen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Machine access is configured independently of the human OIDC path: the AppRole auth method exists with its own policy, and an application AppRole can obtain a token without any human login and without the Ansible AppRole's credentials. Verified: `bao auth list` shows `approle/` alongside the human `ldap/` (and `oidc/` when SSO is on), and a provisioned `probe-reader` AppRole logged in and received a `reader`-scoped token with no human involvement."
msgstr "[x] Strojni dostop je nastavljen neodvisno od človeške poti OIDC: metoda AppRole auth obstaja z lastno politiko, aplikacija AppRole pa lahko dobi žeton brez človeške prijave in brez poverilnic Ansible AppRole. Preverjeno: `bao auth list` kaže `approle/` poleg človeka `ldap/` (ter `oidc/` ko je sistem SSO vključen), in predvideni `probe-reader` AppRole prijavljen in prejel `reader`-Skozi žeton brez človeške vpletenosti."

