# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] TLS termination, certificate handling (Let's Encrypt + project CA stack via `sys-front-tls-*`), and all `sys-front-inj-*` snippets continue to operate inside openresty unchanged. Compose and Swarm modes differ only in how the backend port is reached, not in how the response is rewritten — the `body_filter.lua` pipeline (CSP-meta stripping, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injection) is byte-for-byte identical across modes."
msgstr "[x] Izključitev TLS, ravnanje s potrdili (Šifrirajmo + projektni nabor CA preko `sys-front-tls-*`), in vse `sys-front-inj-*` odrgnine še naprej delujejo znotraj odprtine nespremenjene. Sestavite in Swarm načini razlikujejo le v tem, kako je hrbtni vrat dosežen, ne v načinu, kako je odgovor na novo napisano – `body_filter.lua` cevovod (odstranjevanje CSP-meta, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Odjava snippet injekcija) je bajt za bajt identičen med različnimi načini prevoza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Tasks are scheduled freely across the role's declared hosts under v1; no per-role `deploy.placement.constraints` is rendered by default. Pinning is reintroduced only via NFS-driver vs local-volume choice (see [Docker volume integration](#docker-volume-integration))."
msgstr "[x] Naloge so prosto razporejene po vseh prijavljenih gostiteljih v vlogi v1; ni na rolu; `deploy.placement.constraints` je privzeto prevedeno. Pinning se ponovno uvede samo prek NFS-prevoznika v primerjavi z izbiro lokalnega obsega (glej [Integracija doker volumna](#docker-volume-integration))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The Ansible inventory MUST express swarm topology purely through group membership. Example:"
msgstr "[x] Anzibilni inventar MORA izražati topologijo rojev izključno s članstvom v skupini. Primer:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The Frappe `Administrator` user is seeded by `bench new-site --admin-password=$ERPNEXT_INITIAL_ADMIN_PASSWORD`; the `test-login-native-administrator.js` Playwright spec exercises the break-glass local login in every variant (passed in matrix r3)."
msgstr "[x] Frappe `Administrator` uporabnik posejano z `bench new-site --admin-password=$ERPNEXT_INITIAL_ADMIN_PASSWORD`; `test-login-native-administrator.js` Playwright spec vaje lom-glass lokalna prijava v vsaki varianti (v matriki r3)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The Keycloak client is provisioned automatically through the existing client-import path; no manual Keycloak setup is required."
msgstr "[x] – Keycloak odjemalec se samodejno zagotovi po obstoječi poti odjemalca-uvoza; brez priročnika Keycloak nastavitev je potrebna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The MCP endpoint is authenticated; an unauthenticated probe is rejected, and the credential lives in the platform token store — `meta/mcp.yml` `credential.source: token_store`, written by `sys-token-store` — never in a README, an env file or a Playwright trace. *(Revised: 025 and 035 moved MCP bearers out of `meta/secrets.yml` into the token store after this criterion was written.)*"
msgstr "[x] Končna točka MCP je overovljena; neavtentirana sonda je zavrnjena, kredenca pa živi v žetonski trgovini na ploščadi – `meta/mcp.yml` `credential.source: token_store`, napisal `sys-token-store` – nikoli v readme, env datoteko ali Playwright sled. *(Revidirana: 025 ter 035 premaknili nosilce MCP iz `meta/secrets.yml` v žetonsko trgovino po tem merilu.)*"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The README prominently warns that physical hardware safety (e-stop, motion/current limits, fail-safe wiring) is the operator's responsibility and out of platform scope; the role claims no safety guarantee it does not enforce."
msgstr "[x] README jasno opozarja, da fizikalna varnost strojne opreme (e-ustava, omejitve gibanja/toka, varovalna napeljava) je odgovoren operator in zunaj področja uporabe platforme; vloga trdi, da ne zagotavlja varnosti, ki je ne uveljavlja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The README states explicitly that the volume backup is **worthless without the seal key**, that the seal key's authoritative home is the encrypted inventory (it is not covered by `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, whose sources are `DIR_SECRETS`, the CA and the ACME material), and what the recovery keys can and cannot do."
msgstr "[x] README izrecno navaja, da je obseg varnostne kopije **ničvreden brez ključa pečata**, da je avtoritativni dom pečata šifriran inventar (ni zajeta z `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, katerih viri so `DIR_SECRETS`, CA in material ACME), in kaj ključi za okrevanje lahko in ne more storiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The README states the consequence of Decision #2 that surfaced during implementation: because the root token is revoked and the recovery keys are **not** persisted (persisting them would be the write-back the AppRole bootstrap exists to avoid), the Ansible AppRole is the *only* administrative path into the instance. Losing or out-of-band-changing those credentials means rebuilding from the volume backup plus the seal key."
msgstr "[x] README navaja posledice Sklepa #2 ki se je pojavila med izvajanjem: ker je korenski žeton preklican in ključi za obnovitev so **ni** stalen (vztrajanje bi bilo odpis nazaj AppRole škornji obstaja, da bi se izognili), Ansible AppRole je *samo* upravna pot v primer. Izguba ali zamenjava teh poverilnic pomeni obnovo iz varnostne kopije in ključa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The [`roles_with_service`](../../plugins/lookup/roles_with_service.py) lookup, extended for `direction in [server, both]` and endpoint metadata, returns the connection data client roles need for enabled shared MCP server roles, without adding a generated repository-wide application dictionary."
msgstr "[x] – [`roles_with_service`](../../plugins/lookup/roles_with_service.py) iskanje, podaljšano za `direction in [server, both]` in končni metapodatki, vrne vloge podatkov o povezavah, ki jih potrebujejo za omogočene skupne vloge strežnikov MCP, ne da bi dodali ustvarjen slovar aplikacij za celotno skladišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The `agent-broker.agents` keys reach the running broker from `meta/services.yml`, so an inventory override changes its behaviour."
msgstr "[x] – `agent-broker.agents` tipke dosežejo tekoči posrednik iz `meta/services.yml`, Torej inventar spremeni svoje obnašanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The `container_backup` service is wired with `backup.no_stop_required: false`, so the container is quiesced for a consistent copy of the raft volume."
msgstr "[x] – `container_backup` servis je povezan z `backup.no_stop_required: false`, tako da je posoda moleduje za dosledno kopijo splav prostornine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The `seal \"static\"` stanza reads its key via `env://OPENBAO_SEAL_KEY`; the key is a `meta/secrets.yml` credential and never appears literally in a template, a task argument or a committed file."
msgstr "[x] – `seal \"static\"` Stanza bere svoj ključ preko `env://OPENBAO_SEAL_KEY`; ključ je `meta/secrets.yml` credential in nikoli ne pojavi dobesedno v predlogo, argument naloge ali predano datoteko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The `test-e2e-playwright` role stages `files/playwright/` recursively and discovers specs recursively, so `files/playwright/addons/*.spec.js` are staged and run."
msgstr "[x] – `test-e2e-playwright` faze vloge `files/playwright/` Rekurzivno in odkrije spektre rekurzivno, tako da `files/playwright/addons/*.spec.js` so uprizorjeni in tečejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The agent MUST iterate on this workflow per [Workflow Loop](../agents/action/iteration/workflow.md) until it passes end to end on the default branch's runner. The requirement is NOT closed while the workflow is red."
msgstr "[x] Agent MORA iterirati na ta delovni tok na [Zanka za potek dela](../agents/action/iteration/workflow.md) dokler se ne konča na privzetem tekaču podružnice. Zahteva NI zaključena, medtem ko je potek dela rdeč."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The agent runtime stays isolated; any host-metrics dashboard is either embedded or a separate `runc` sidecar and does not force the agent tier out of the isolated runtime."
msgstr "[x] Čas delovanja agenta ostane izoliran; vsaka armaturna plošča za merjenje gostitelja je vgrajena ali ločena `runc` stranske prikolice in ne silijo agenta iz izoliranega časa delovanja."

