msgstr "[x] Nakladalnik programov se glasi `meta/addons/` za vsako vlogo in izpostavlja `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>` skozi `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The asset-storage volume is backed up via the existing backup role(s)."
msgstr "[x] Obseg shranjevanja sredstev je podprt z obstoječo rezervno vlogo(s)."

