# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The operational metadata stays role-local: authoritative source, transport, authentication, real credential subject, read/write scope, tool allowlist, proposed implementation, selected consumers, and blocker all live in the role's own `meta/mcp.yml`, and [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) enforces their shape there. A generated report aggregating them was removed: scope and credential subject were identical for every role, so the table restated its sources instead of deriving anything from them."
