# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] [web-app-jira](../../roles/web-app-jira/) and [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) remain disabled for MCP unless a self-hosted Atlassian MCP path is documented or the role explicitly integrates with Atlassian Cloud as an external connector."
