# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n 1.100.1 is declared as an SSE client and a Streamable HTTP server, and its managed credentials and workflows are idempotently provisioned through supported public APIs. The server moved from 1.95.3's SSE-only trigger because Open WebUI 0.11.0 ships only a Streamable HTTP client and answered the SSE route with a POST that n8n refused with 404. `meta/mcp.yml` declares `direction: both` and `transport: streamable_http` at `/mcp/infinito-mcp`; `files/python/provision/mcp.py` renders the server workflow and `files/python/provision/client.py` the agent workflow, both through `/api/v1/workflows`. Credentials go through `/rest` because the public API of that tag exposes only create and delete for them, which cannot converge an existing one. Two idempotence defects were fixed here: the run reported `CHANGED` forever, because the public-API key it minted was found again on the next run and counted as a change, and that key was left standing in n8n afterwards although nothing read it. It is now minted per run, revoked before the run ends, and no longer reported."
msgstr "[x] n8n 1.100.1 je deklariran kot odjemalec SSE in stražni strežnik HTTP, njegova upravljana poverilnice in delovni tokovi pa so idempotentno zagotovljeni prek podprtih javnih API. Strežnik se je premaknil 1.95.3Sprožilec samo za SSE. Open WebUI 0.11.0 ladje samo Streable HTTP odjemalec in odgovoril na SSE poti s POST, da n8n zavrnjen z 404. `meta/mcp.yml` razglasi `direction: both` ter `transport: streamable_http` na dan `/mcp/infinito-mcp`; `files/python/provision/mcp.py` prikaže potek dela strežnika in `files/python/provision/client.py` delovni tok agenta, oba skozi `/api/v1/workflows`- Zaupanja gredo skozi `/rest` ker je javnost API Ta oznaka izpostavlja le ustvarjanje in brisanje za njih, ki ne more uskladiti obstoječe. Tukaj sta bili določeni dve napaki idempotence: prijavljen potek `CHANGED` Za vedno, ker javnost...API ključ, ki ga je skoval, je bil ponovno najden v naslednjem teku in šteje kot sprememba, in da ključ je ostal v n8n kasneje, čeprav ga ni nič prebralo. Zdaj je skovana na tek, preklicana pred koncem in ni več prijavljena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n client nodes use exact tool include lists; server triggers require Bearer auth, expose only connected checked-in tools, and remain disabled until operator opt-in. Each client node renders `include: selected` with the provider's own `mcp.tools.allowlist`, which the discovery snapshot now carries; the node's default is `all`, so an omitted list would hand the agent every tool an upstream happens to serve. The server trigger pins `authentication: bearerAuth` against a managed `httpBearerAuth` credential, and the surface ships `enabled: false`. \"Only connected checked-in tools\" is upstream's own mechanism: `getConnectedTools` in `@utils/helpers` collects exactly what reaches the trigger over an `ai_tool` connection, so the workflow's connection map is the allowlist. The workflow previously connected nothing at all, so the trigger served an empty tool set; it now carries one checked-in read tool, `infinito_health`, with an explicit input schema."
msgstr "[x] n8n vozlišča uporabljajo natančno orodje vključujejo sezname; strežniški sprožilci zahtevajo Bearer auth, izpostavljajo le povezana odjavljena orodja, in ostanejo onemogočeni, dokler se operater ne odloči. Vsako vozlišče izrisuje `include: selected` s svojim ponudnikom `mcp.tools.allowlist`, ki ga sedaj posnetek odkritja nosi; vozlišče je privzeto `all`, tako da bi izpuščen seznam dal agentu vsako orodje na toku se zgodi, da služijo. Strežnikovi sprožilci `authentication: bearerAuth` proti upravljanemu `httpBearerAuth` spričevalo in površinske ladje `enabled: false`. \"Samo povezana orodja za preverjanje\" je mehanizem na začetku dobavne verige: `getConnectedTools` v `@utils/helpers` zbira točno tisto, kar doseže sprožilec nad `ai_tool` povezava, tako da je zemljevid povezave delovnega toka seznam. Delovni tok prej ni povezal ničesar, zato je sprožilec služil praznemu naboru orodja; sedaj nosi eno preverjeno orodje za branje, `infinito_health`, z eksplicitno vhodno shemo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n tests cover creation, update, activation, authenticated tool listing and call, wrong/missing bearer rejection, rerun idempotence, and cleanup limited to managed resources. Creation, update, activation, rerun idempotence and the cleanup boundary are unit-tested in [test_mcp.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_mcp.py) and [test_client.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_client.py), including that a converged deployment reports `OK`, that a credential or workflow outside the managed names is never touched, and that a provider which vanished loses only its own credential. The authenticated half runs at deploy time through the shared contract probe, which opens an MCP session, lists tools against the declared allowlist, calls the read tool, and separately proves that an anonymous and a wrong-bearer probe are both refused a session. It cannot be a browser test: the bearer must not reach a Playwright environment file."
msgstr "[x] n8n testi zajemajo ustvarjanje, posodabljanje, aktivacijo, avtentičen seznam orodij in klic, napačno/manjkajočo zavrnitev nosilca, ponovno idempotenca in čiščenje, omejeno na upravljane vire. Ustvarjanje, posodabljanje, aktivacija, ponovna idempotenca in meja čiščenja se preskusijo v enoti [test_mcp.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_mcp.py) ter [test_client.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_client.py), vključno z usklajenimi poročili o uporabi `OK`, da se nikoli ne dotaknejo zaupanja ali dela zunaj upravljanih imen in da ponudnik, ki je izginil, izgubi samo svojo verodostojnost. Overovljena polovica teče v času razporeditve skozi skupno pogodbeno sondo, ki odpre sejo MCP, našteva orodja proti deklariranemu seznamu dopustov, kliče bralno orodje in ločeno dokazuje, da se anonimna in napačna sonda zavrneta sejo. To ne more biti test brskalnika: nosilec ne sme doseči datoteke Playwright okolja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] openresty does NOT swarm-render itself. Its inventory group lists only the manager, so `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` for `svc-prx-openresty` resolves to `compose`. The role keeps its `network_mode: host` + docker-socket mount + Lua body-rewriting pipeline intact. Operationally openresty is implicitly pinned to the manager node (the only long-lived swarm node in v1 that runs host-level compose projects). Edge HA via Traefik (which requires porting the Lua injection pipeline) is tracked under [Future Extensions](#future-extensions)."
msgstr "[x] Openresty se NE renderira. Njegova inventarna skupina navaja samo upravitelja. `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` besedilo `svc-prx-openresty` odloči, da `compose`. Vloga ohranja svojo `network_mode: host` + docker-socket montaža + Lua cevovod za pisanje telesa nedotaknjen. Operativno odprtost je implicitno povezana z upravljalnim vozliščem (edini dolgoživi roj vozlišče v v1 ki vodi komponirane projekte na ravni gostitelja). Rob HA preko Traefik (ki zahteva prenos plinovoda Lua) sledi pod [Prihodnje razširitve](#future-extensions)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[x] openresty's existing per-app `upstream <service> { server <host>:<port>; }` block shape is identical under both modes. Under compose the `<host>` is the container DNS name on the per-app default network; under swarm the routing mesh makes `localhost:<port>` route to a healthy task. v1 uses default round-robin distribution (the routing mesh's L4 balancer for swarm; openresty's built-in for compose); weighted / sticky / least-conn strategies are out of scope and tracked under [Future Extensions](#future-extensions)."
msgstr "[x] obstoječa openresty na aplikacijo `upstream <service> { server <host>:<port>; }` oblika bloka je pri obeh načinih enaka. Pod sestavo `<host>` ime vsebnika DNS na privzetem omrežju za vsako aplikacijo; pod rojem mreža routing naredi `localhost:<port>` pot do zdrave naloge. v1 uporablja privzeto distribucijo okroglorobina (mrežna očesa L4 balancer za roj; odprtina je vgrajena za sestavljanje); ponderirane / lepljive / najmanj vezane strategije so izven področja uporabe in sledijo pod [Prihodnje razširitve](#future-extensions)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] v1 scope is single-manager. Multi-manager Raft-quorum HA (3+ managers) is explicitly out of scope for this requirement and tracked under [Future Extensions](#future-extensions)."
msgstr "[x] v1 Obseg je samostojen. Večvodstveni raft-quorum HA (3+ menedžerji) je izrecno izven področja uporabe te zahteve in sledi v skladu [Prihodnje razširitve](#future-extensions)."

