# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`.env` (gitignored) is generated by `make dotenv`, which delegates to `python -m cli.meta.env`. It combines `default.env` with runtime-resolved values (selected distro, GHA/Act flags, df/meminfo-derived cache sizes, sha256 secrets, repository owner, ...). Each line in `.env` is preceded by its own comment, so the file is self-describing. Open it after `make dotenv` to inspect the effective value-set together with its documentation."
msgstr "`.env` (gitignored) ustvari `make dotenv`, na katere delegati `python -m cli.meta.env`. Združuje. `default.env` z rešetami med delovanjem (izbrane distro, zastavice GHA/Act, velikosti predpomnilnikov df/meminfo,256 skrivnosti, lastnik skladišča, ...). Vsaka vrstica v `.env` je pred njo lasten komentar, tako da je datoteka samopopis. Odpri potem. `make dotenv` pregled dejanskega stanja vrednosti skupaj z njegovo dokumentacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`.env` is consumed by bash `source` and docker-compose `--env-file`, neither of which round-trips multi-line values; the writer therefore rejects them. Other NIX_CONFIG settings (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`, …) belong in `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile injects them inside the dev container; host operators set them once in `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."
msgstr "`.env` se uživa z bash `source` in docker-compose `--env-file`, od tega nobena ne pomeni večvrstičnih vrednosti; pisatelj jih zato zavrne. Drugo NIX_CONFIG nastavitve (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`, ...) sodite v `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile jih vbrizga v dev posodo; gostiteljski operaterji jih nastavijo enkrat v `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."

