# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Bluesky <https://bsky.social/>`__ is a decentralized social network that runs on the open AT Protocol. Each user account lives on a Personal Data Server (PDS) that holds the user’s posts, replies, and follows as signed records, and any number of independent app views can read those records to render a timeline."
msgstr "`Bluesky <https://bsky.social/>`__ je decentralizirano socialno omrežje, ki deluje na odprtem protokolu AT. Vsak uporabniški račun živi na strežniku osebnih podatkov (PDS) ki hrani uporabnikove objave, odgovore in sledi kot podpisani zapisi ter lahko vsako število neodvisnih pogledov aplikacij prebere te zapise, da se določi časovni okvir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Bridgy Fed <https://fed.brid.gy/>`__ is a federation bridge between ActivityPub (the Fediverse), the AT Protocol (Bluesky), and the IndieWeb (webmentions and microformats2). It mirrors identities and cross-network interactions so a post on one network reaches followers on the others."
msgstr "`Bridgy Fed <https://fed.brid.gy/>`__ je federacijski most med ActivityPub (Fediverse), protokol AT (Bluesky)in IndieWeb (spletne strani in mikroformati2). To zrcali identitete in medomrežja interakcije tako delovno mesto na enem omrežju doseže sledilce na drugih."

