msgid "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ is Docker’s built-in clustering and container-orchestration mode. It groups multiple Docker hosts into a single virtual host that can schedule services, replicate tasks, and route traffic via an internal mesh."
