msgid "`GH_TOKEN` must be available on the Ansible control node (`delegate_to: localhost`) for the `gh api` registration call to succeed. In CI this is forwarded into the DinD container by `cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/run.py`."
msgstr "`GH_TOKEN` mora biti na voljo na vozlišču Ansible control (`delegate_to: localhost`) za `gh api` registerski klic za uspeh. Pri CI to posredujete v vsebnik DIND z `cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/run.py`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), from `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` in [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) belongs to GitLab's built-in `root` account, not to the Keycloak `administrator` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for `biber` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), iz `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` v [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) pripada GitLabje vgrajen `root` račun, ne račun Keycloak `administrator` uporabniško ime osebe z in št GitLab račun je predviden za `biber` Sploh – OmniAuthov podpis je edina pot, ki bi ustvarila enega. V `services.sso.enabled: false` matrične variante, ki se odstranijo, tako da [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Izrisi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. O `guest` persona in osnovne trditve potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GRAPH_LDAP_SERVER_WRITE_ENABLED=false` keeps OpenCloud from modifying the directory. User lifecycle is owned by the LDAP and Keycloak side."
msgstr "`GRAPH_LDAP_SERVER_WRITE_ENABLED=false` Obdrži OpenCloud od spreminjanja imenika. Življenjska doba uporabnika je v lasti LDAP in Keycloak Stransko."

