msgid "`HOST`, `DISTRO`, `COUNT` (optional), `PORT`, `OWNER`, `REPO`"
msgstr "`HOST`, `DISTRO`, `COUNT` (neobvezno), `PORT`, `OWNER`, `REPO`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an agent runtime from Nous Research that runs tool-using agent sessions against OpenAI-compatible model backends. In gateway mode it serves an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, where clients address the agent with the same request shape they use for a plain model."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ je agent, ki teče od Nous Research, ki uporablja orodja agent seje proti OpenAI-združljiv model backends. V načinu prehoda služi z OpenAI združljiv HTTP API, kadar stranke nagovarjajo agenta z enako obliko zahteve, kot jo uporabljajo za navaden model."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an autonomous agent runtime. This role runs it in embodied mode: on a machine that is dedicated to it, with direct access to the hardware of that machine. Where the container roles put a kernel boundary between the agent and its host, here the boundary is the device itself."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ je avtonomna agentka. Ta vloga jo vodi v utelešenem načinu: na stroju, ki ji je namenjen, z neposrednim dostopom do strojne opreme tega stroja. Kjer so vloge zabojnika postavile mejo jedra med agentom in njegovim gostiteljem, tukaj je meja sama naprava."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ je odprtokodna platforma za avtomatizacijo doma, ki povezuje pametne naprave mnogih ponudnikov za enim samim lokalnim vmesnikom. Ohranja stanje naprave, armaturne plošče in pravila avtomatizacije na stroju, ki ga upravlja, in jih izpostavlja prek spletnega vmesnika, REST API, in vgrajen MCP strežnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ is a fast, single-binary static site generator written in Go. This role builds a Hugo site from any upstream Git repository (default: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) at image-build time and serves the rendered HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. There is no database, no application server, and no dynamic backend at runtime."
msgstr "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ je hiter, enokomponentni statični generator napisana v Go. Ta vloga gradi Hugo mesto iz katerega koli zgornjega toka Git Skladišče (privzeto: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) ob času izdelave slik in služi preslikava HTML/CSS/JS preko ginxa. Ni baze podatkov, ni strežnika aplikacij in ni dinamične hrbtenice v času delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — newline-separated workflow paths, the members of the concurrency group being backed up. Without it the helpers would also cancel runs the group never governed, such as the `cron-*` workflows that listen on `push`. Derive the list from the `concurrency:` blocks, not from what looks related: `entry-delete-branch.yml` keys its group on the *deleted* ref, so it is not a member of a push's group, and listing it would make a push to `main` cancel an unrelated branch cleanup. A value that lists no path at all aborts rather than silently matching nothing."
msgstr "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — nove ločene delovne poti, pri čemer so člani skupine za sofinanciranje podprti. Brez njega bi pomočniki tudi preklicali teče nikoli urejena skupina, kot so `cron-*` delovni tokovi, ki poslušajo `push`. Pridobiti seznam iz `concurrency:` blokira, ne od tistega, kar izgleda povezano: `entry-delete-branch.yml` ključe svoje skupine na *črtano* Sodnik, torej to ni član skupine push, in naštevanje bi naredilo spodbudo, da `main` preklicati nepovezano čiščenje podružnice. Vrednost, ki ne navaja nobene poti, se prej prekine, kot pa tiho ujemanje ničesar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_FRONTEND_IP` env var for the inner compose wrapper"
msgstr "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_FRONTEND_IP` env var za notranji ovitek sestavljanke"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_MAX_AGE_MIN` (default `8640` = 6 days) controls how long every Nexus proxy repo holds an upstream response before revalidating. The bootstrap helper applies it as `contentMaxAge`, `metadataMaxAge`, and `negativeCache.timeToLive`. The default is intentionally one day below the 7-day `Valid-Until` window Debian and Ubuntu generate in their apt `Release` files, so Nexus always refreshes the manifest before `apt-get update` would see it expired. Raise it for slow-moving upstreams when staleness is preferable to upstream load; lower it further for fast-moving feeds (`apt-debian-security`, branch-pinned tarballs) when staleness becomes visible."
msgstr "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_MAX_AGE_MIN` (privzeto `8640` = 6 dni) nadzoruje, kako dolgo ima vsak repo posrednik Nexus pred ponovnim validiranjem odgovor na začetku. Pomočnik jo uporablja kot `contentMaxAge`, `metadataMaxAge`, in `negativeCache.timeToLive`. Privzeto je namerno en dan pod 7-dan `Valid-Until` okno Debian in Ubuntu ustvarjajo v svojem apt `Release` datoteke, tako da Nexus vedno osveži manifest pred `apt-get update` Potekel bi. Dvigajte ga za počasno premikanje proti toku, ko je stalenost boljša od torne obremenitve; spustite ga še naprej za hitro premikanje krmil (`apt-debian-security`, vejaste katranske kroglice) ko postane vidna postanost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_DISTRO`, `INFINITO_CONTAINER`, optional `INSPECT_CMD` or positional args"
msgstr "`INFINITO_DISTRO`, `INFINITO_CONTAINER`, neobvezno `INSPECT_CMD` ali pozicijske zanke"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_DNS_HOSTS` can still override the generated list explicitly"
msgstr "`INFINITO_DNS_HOSTS` še vedno lahko izrecno razveljavite ustvarjeni seznam"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_VERSION_ENV_NAME` (default: `INFINITO_VERSION`)"
msgstr "`INFINITO_VERSION_ENV_NAME` (privzeto: `INFINITO_VERSION`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Integration tests` verify behavior across modules and runtime boundaries."
msgstr "`Integration tests` preveri obnašanje v modulih in mejah časa delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager` resolves the root role's config via `get_variants(roles_dir)[app_id][N]` so `resolve_schema_includes_recursive` sees the variant-merged `services` map and discovers every shared provider the variant enables."
msgstr "`InventoryManager` reši konfig temeljne vloge preko `get_variants(roles_dir)[app_id][N]` tako `resolve_schema_includes_recursive` vidi različico-zvezd `services` zemljevid in odkrije vsakega skupnega ponudnika, ki ga varianta omogoča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager` skips the variants overlay and reads the role's base `meta/<topic>.yml` payload directly via `_meta_role_config`."
msgstr "`InventoryManager` preskoči prekrivnost variant in prebere osnovo vloge `meta/<topic>.yml` koristni tovor neposredno prek `_meta_role_config`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager`-backed credential generator; `--variant N` selects which `variants.yml` overlay applies."
msgstr "`InventoryManager`-backed credential generator; `--variant N` izbere, kateri `variants.yml` Prekrivanje velja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`JELLYFIN_*` env (double-underscore nesting), `JELLYFIN_PublishedServerUrl`, `TZ`; runs as `PUID/PGID`."
msgstr "`JELLYFIN_*` env (gnezdenje z dvojnim podčrtanjem), `JELLYFIN_PublishedServerUrl`, `TZ`; teče kot `PUID/PGID`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jellyfin <https://jellyfin.org>`__ is a free, open-source media server. This role deploys the official ``jellyfin/jellyfin`` container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy, with Keycloak OIDC (web) and central LDAP authentication provisioned via the Jellyfin auth plugins."
msgstr "`Jellyfin <https://jellyfin.org>`__ je brezplačen, odprtokodni medijski strežnik. Ta vloga napoti uradnika ``jellyfin/jellyfin`` vsebnik za Infinito.Nexus obratni posrednik z Keycloak OIDC (splet) in centralno avtentikacijo LDAP, zagotovljeno prek Jellyfin vstavki za outh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jenkins <https://www.jenkins.io/>`__ is an open-source automation server that orchestrates the build, test, and deployment of software through pipelines, freestyle jobs, and a large plugin ecosystem."
msgstr "`Jenkins <https://www.jenkins.io/>`__ je odprtokodni strežnik za avtomatizacijo, ki vodi gradnjo, testiranje in uvajanje programske opreme po cevovodih, prosti slog delovnih mest in velik plugin ekosistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ is Atlassian’s issue and project-tracking platform. This role deploys Jira via Docker Compose, connects it to PostgreSQL, and adds proxy awareness, optional OIDC SSO, health checks, and production-oriented defaults for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ je atlasijska platforma za spremljanje in sledenje projektov. Ta vloga se uporablja Jira preko Docker Compose, ga povezuje z PostgreSQL, in dodaja proxy ozaveščenost, neobvezno OIDC SSO, zdravstvene preglede, in proizvodnje usmerjene privzete Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ is an open-source, end-to-end-encryptable video conferencing platform. Rooms run over WebRTC with a central Selective Forwarding Unit (jvb), an XMPP server (prosody) for signalling, and a conference focus daemon (jicofo)."
msgstr "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ je odprtokodna videokonferenčna platforma, ki jo je mogoče šifrirati od konca do konca. Sobe potekajo preko WebRTC z osrednjo selektivno enoto za posredovanje (jvb), XMPP strežnik (prozodija) za signalizacijo in program konferenčnega fokusa (jokofo)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ is a free and open-source content management system that lets users build and run websites, intranets, and online applications without writing code. It exposes a component, module, and plugin architecture that authors and developers extend with custom content types, layouts, and integrations."
msgstr "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ je brezplačen in odprtokoden sistem upravljanja vsebin, ki uporabnikom omogoča gradnjo in upravljanje spletnih strani, intranetov in spletnih aplikacij brez zapisa kode. Izpostavlja komponento, modul, in plugin arhitekture, ki jih avtorji in razvijalci razširijo s po meri vrste vsebin, razporedi, in integracije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ is a simple and effective command-line journal application that allows users to create and manage personal journal entries."
msgstr "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ je preprosta in učinkovita aplikacija ukazne vrstice, ki uporabnikom omogoča ustvarjanje in upravljanje vnosov osebnih dnevnikov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ runs code in a managed kernel and returns its output. This role provides that kernel as a backend for other services rather than as a notebook UI for people."
msgstr "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ teče kodo v upravljanem jedru in vrne svoj izhod. Ta vloga zagotavlja to jedro kot hrbtenico za druge storitve in ne kot prenosni uporabniški vmesnik za ljudi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` — keeps the newest run of each group instance alive and cancels only the older ones, which is the rule the concurrency group itself applies. It is what makes the fallback safe against races: the head SHA from the event payload goes stale while the job waits for a runner, and a `[skip ci]` or `GITHUB_TOKEN` push moves the branch tip without creating a run at all. Selecting by \"not the current head\" would then cancel the newest commit's CI and spare the stale one, or leave the branch with no CI at all. Selecting by \"not the newest run\" cannot, in any ordering."
msgstr "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` – ohranja najnovejši potek vsakega primera skupine pri življenju in prekliče samo starejše, kar je pravilo, ki ga uporablja soglasna skupina sama. To je tisto, kar naredi nazaj varno proti dirkam: glava SHA iz koristnega tovora dogodek je zastarela, medtem ko delo čaka na tekača, in `[skip ci]` ali `GITHUB_TOKEN` potisni premakne vejo, ne da bi sploh ustvaril tek. Izbira za \"ne trenutna glava\" Potem bi preklicala ovaduha in prizanesla ali pa zapustila podružnico brez ovaduha. Izbira za \"ne najnovejši\" ne more, v nobenem ukazu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEY` MUST be the owned variable's name."
msgstr "`KEY` Ime spremenljivke v lasti mora biti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ is an open-source IT service management and helpdesk platform forked from OTRS. It provides ticket management, configuration management, knowledge base, and reporting for IT service teams."
msgstr "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ je odprtokodno upravljanje storitev IT in platforma za pomoč uporabnikom, ki je na voljo OTRS. Zagotavlja upravljanje vozovnic, upravljanje konfiguracij, bazo znanja in poročanje za informacijske službene ekipe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ is an OCI container runtime that starts each container inside a lightweight virtual machine with its own kernel instead of sharing the host kernel. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ is a second isolating runtime, shipped as the single ``runsc`` binary, that intercepts container syscalls in a userspace kernel and runs without hardware virtualization."
msgstr "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ je posoda za OCI, ki zažene vsako posodo znotraj lahkega virtualnega stroja z lastnim jedrom, namesto da bi delila jedro gostitelja. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ je drugi izolirani čas delovanja, poslan kot samski ``runsc`` binarno, ki prestreže kontejner syscals v uporabniškem prostoru jedra in teče brez strojne virtualizacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ is a free, open-source, cross-platform password manager that stores credentials in an encrypted local database compatible with the KeePass format."
msgstr "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ je brezplačen, odprtokoden, medplatformni upravljalnik gesel, ki shranjuje poverilnice v šifrirani lokalni bazi podatkov, združljivi z obliko KeePass."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.BIND_CREDENTIAL` (Vault)"
msgstr "`LDAP.BIND_CREDENTIAL` (Vault)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.FILTERS.USERS` provides reusable LDAP search filters:"
msgstr "`LDAP.FILTERS.USERS` zagotavlja ponovno uporabne filtre za iskanje LDAP:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.RBAC` controls how application roles are represented:"
msgstr "`LDAP.RBAC` nadzoruje, kako so vloge vlog zastopane:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES` lists the LDAP attribute names that applications query:"
msgstr "`LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES` navaja imena atributov LDAP, ki jih programi iščejo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.USER.OBJECTS` lists the structural and auxiliary object classes attached to user entries:"
msgstr "`LDAP.USER.OBJECTS` navaja strukturne in pomožne razrede objektov, priložene uporabniškim vnosom:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP_DN_BASE`, user/admin emails, oauth2-proxy `email_domains`, CA identity: all onion, mutually consistent (users `@<NODE_ONION>.onion` pass the oauth2-proxy email filter)"
msgstr "`LDAP_DN_BASE`, uporabnik / skrbnik e-pošte, oauth2-proksi `email_domains`, CA identiteta: vse čebule, medsebojno skladne (uporabniki `@<NODE_ONION>.onion` mimo oauth2-proxy email filter)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ is a runtime for open large language models. Its headless server mode loads models from a local store and answers chat and completion requests over an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, so prompts and model weights stay on the machine that runs them."
msgstr "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ je čas delovanja za odprte velike jezikovne modele. Njegov način brezglavega strežnika nalaga modele iz krajevne trgovine in odgovarja na zahteve za klepet in dokončanje preko z OpenAI združljivega HTTP API, tako da je spodbuda in model uteži ostanejo na stroju, ki jih upravlja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ is a local-first notification command center that aggregates Slack, mail, issue trackers and calendars into approvable action cards."
msgstr "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ je lokalno-prvi center za obveščanje, ki združuje Slack, pošto, izdajanje sledilnikov in koledarjev v primerne akcijske kartice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Lint and syntax checks` catch style, formatting, and Ansible syntax problems early."
msgstr "`Lint and syntax checks` ulov slog, oblikovanje in Ansible sintaksa težave zgodaj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that exposes an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API and forwards each request to a configured model backend, local or hosted. Clients authenticate with virtual API keys that the gateway issues and stores in its own database."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ je LLM vrata, ki razkriva OpenAI-združljiv HTTP API in posreduje vsako zahtevo na nastavljen model backend, lokalni ali gostiteljski. Odjemalci overijo z virtualnim API ključe, ki jih vrata izdajajo in shranjujejo v svoji bazi podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that puts a single OpenAI-compatible API in front of many model providers. Its admin UI is the gateway’s built-in web interface for virtual API keys, teams, budgets and rate limits, model routing, and request and spend logs."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ je LLM prehod, ki postavlja eno OpenAI-združljiv API pred številnimi ponudniki modelov. Njegov admin UI je vgrajen spletni vmesnik za virtualno API tipke, ekipe, proračuni in omejitve obrestnih mer, model usmerjanja, in zahteva in porabi dnevnike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Local deploy and E2E validation` checks whether apps and deployment flows work in a realistic local stack."
msgstr "`Local deploy and E2E validation` preverja, ali aplikacije in tokovi uvajanja delujejo v realističnem lokalnem nizu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MODE_CLEANUP`: Removes unused Docker containers, networks, images, and volumes."
msgstr "`MODE_CLEANUP`: Odstrani neuporabljene posode Docker, omrežja, slike, in zvezki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MODE_RESET`: Performs cleanup and restarts the Docker service."
msgstr "`MODE_RESET`: Opravlja čiščenje in ponovno zažene servis Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Mailu <https://mailu.io/>`__ as a full-featured mail server (when available),"
msgstr "`Mailu <https://mailu.io/>`__ kot popolni poštni strežnik (kadar je na voljo),"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MaxDirectMemorySize`. Mirrors `INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_HEAP`."
msgstr "`MaxDirectMemorySize`. Ogledala `INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_HEAP`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MemAvailable` from /proc/meminfo in MB. 0 on failure."
msgstr "`MemAvailable` od /proc/meminfo v MB. 0 na neuspeh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MemTotal` from /proc/meminfo in MB. 0 on failure."
msgstr "`MemTotal` od /proc/meminfo v MB. 0 na neuspeh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Metadata`: **Read** (default, cannot be removed)."
msgstr "`Metadata`: **Preberi** (privzeto, ni mogoče odstraniti)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Network File System) is a kernel-level protocol for sharing files over a network. The server exports a directory tree under defined access rules; clients mount it as if it were a local filesystem."
msgstr "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Datotečni sistem omrežja) je osnovni protokol za izmenjavo datotek preko omrežja. Strežnik izvozi imeniško drevo v skladu z opredeljenimi pravili dostopa; odjemalci ga priklopijo, kot da bi bil krajevni datotečni sistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Network File System) lets a host mount a directory exported by a remote server as if it were a local filesystem. The client packages provide the kernel helpers and userspace tools to perform that mount."
msgstr "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Datotečni sistem omrežja) omogoča gostitelju priklop imenika, ki ga izvozi oddaljeni strežnik, kot da bi bil krajevni datotečni sistem. Paketi odjemalca zagotavljajo jedra in orodja uporabniškega prostora za izvedbo tega priklopa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`N` → route a share of deploy jobs to your `[self-hosted, linux]` runners."
msgstr "`N` → pot delež razporeditve delovnih mest v vaš `[self-hosted, linux]` Tekači."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nexus Repository <https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-nexus-repository>`__ is a repository manager that proxies package registries and serves an artefact it has already fetched from local disk. `nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ sits in front of it and answers for the upstream hostnames themselves, so a package manager keeps the URLs it was built with and still reads through the proxy."
msgstr "`Nexus Repository <https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-nexus-repository>`__ je upravljalnik skladišča, ki podpira registre paketov in služi artefaktu, ki ga je že dobil z lokalnega diska. `nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ sedi pred njim in odgovarja za touch hostnames sami, tako da vodja paketa hrani URL-je, ki je bil zgrajen z in še vedno bere prek posrednika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy. This role wraps Nginx as a first-party mirror for the third-party assets other web applications declare in their CSP whitelists, so browsers fetch those assets from the deployment itself instead of contacting external hosts."
msgstr "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ je visoko zmogljiv spletni strežnik in obratno posrednik. Ta vloga zavija Nginx kot zrcalo prve stranke za sredstva tretjih oseb druge spletne aplikacije prijavijo na svojih belih seznamih CSP, zato brskalniki pridobivajo ta sredstva iz same razporeditve, namesto da bi kontaktirali zunanje gostitelje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy. This role wraps Nginx as an internal Content Delivery Network that serves static assets such as CSS and JavaScript bundles for other web applications in the stack."
msgstr "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ je visoko zmogljiv spletni strežnik in obratno posrednik. Ta vloga zavija Nginx kot notranji Content Delivery Network ki služi statičnim sredstvom, kot so paketi CSS in JavaScript za druge spletne aplikacije v kupu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`__ is a free, open-source application for video recording and live streaming, widely used for screencasts, broadcasting, and content creation."
msgstr "`OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`__ je brezplačna, odprtokodna aplikacija za video snemanje in pretakanje v živo, ki se široko uporablja za televizijske oddaje, oddajanje in ustvarjanje vsebin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME` and `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID` are paired on purpose. They MUST resolve to the same logical user on both sides so that an account created in OpenLDAP can sign in through Keycloak without an extra mapping step. Changing one without the other breaks LDAP-OIDC correlation."
msgstr "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME` ter `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID` sta nalašč par. Morajo se odločiti za istega logičnega uporabnika na obeh straneh, tako da račun ustvarjen v OpenLDAP lahko se prijavite skozi Keycloak brez dodatnega koraka kartiranja. Spreminjanje enega brez drugega prekine korelacijo LDAP-OIDC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES` lists the claim names that downstream applications read out of the userinfo response and ID token:"
msgstr "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES` navaja imena zahtevkov, ki jih nadaljnji programi preberejo iz uporabniškega odgovora in ID žetona:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Ollama <https://ollama.com>`__ is a local model server that runs open LLMs on your hardware and exposes a simple HTTP API. Prompts and data stay on your machines, making it the backbone for privacy-first AI."
msgstr "`Ollama <https://ollama.com>`__ je lokalni model strežnik, ki poganja odprt LLMs na vaši strojni opremi in izpostavlja preprost HTTP API-Ponudbe in podatki ostanejo na vaših strojih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Open PR if … changed` step"
msgstr "`Open PR if … changed` korak"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenBao <https://openbao.org/>`__ is an identity-based secrets and encryption manager governed by the Linux Foundation. It stores application credentials, API keys, service and database credentials, automation and agent identities, short-lived tokens and encryption keys behind a policy engine, and can act as an internal certificate authority."
msgstr "`OpenBao <https://openbao.org/>`__ je na identiteti temelječa skrivnost in upravljalnik šifriranja, ki ga upravlja fundacija Linux. Shranjuje poverilnice za prijave. API ključi, poverilnice storitev in podatkovne zbirke, avtomatizacija in agentske identitete, kratkotrajni žetoni in šifrirni ključi za političnim motorjem in lahko delujejo kot notranji organ za potrjevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenClaw <https://openclaw.ai/>`__ is an open-source personal AI agent that runs on hardware you control. It ships a gateway process with a browser Control UI next to its CLI and TUI, keeps persistent memory and a workspace on disk, and performs browser and filesystem tasks inside its own sandbox."
msgstr "`OpenClaw <https://openclaw.ai/>`__ je odprtokodni osebni agent, ki deluje na strojni opremi, ki jo nadziraš. Odda proces prehoda z brskalnikom Control UI poleg svojega CLI in TUI, ohranja obstojen pomnilnik in delovni prostor na disku, ter opravlja brskalnik in datotečne naloge znotraj lastnega peskovnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenCloud <https://opencloud.eu/>`__ is a sovereign self-hosted file sync, share, and collaboration platform maintained by the Heinlein Group. It is a fork of the OpenCloud Infinite Scale codebase and is published as the ``opencloudeu/opencloud`` container image."
msgstr "`OpenCloud <https://opencloud.eu/>`__ je suverena samogostoljubna datoteka, sinhronizacija, souporaba in platforma za sodelovanje, ki jo vzdržuje skupina Heinlein. To je vilica OpenCloud Infinite Scale kodebase in je objavljena kot ``opencloudeu/opencloud`` slika posode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenTalk <https://opentalk.eu/>`__ is a sovereign open-source video conferencing platform developed by the Heinlein Group. It combines a Rust controller, a LiveKit-based WebRTC media server, and a React web frontend."
msgstr "`OpenTalk <https://opentalk.eu/>`__ je suverena odprtokodna videokonferenčna platforma, ki jo je razvila skupina Heinlein. Združuje Rust krmilnik, spletni strežnik WebRTC, ki temelji na LiveKit, in React spletni vmesnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` : Social Home 2026.6.16 imports `logout` from `client/src/store/auth.ts` in exactly one place —   `client/src/main.tsx` wires it as the 401 handler via `setUnauthorizedHandler(logout)`. No   component renders a logout control, so `personas/utils/logout.js` has nothing to click and the   admin journey cannot complete. The alternative — injecting a `[data-injected-logout]` button via   `templates/javascript.js.j2` — was rejected: the model   (`roles/web-app-prometheus/templates/javascript.js.j2`) points the button at   `OIDC.CLIENT.LOGOUT_URL`, which only exists for OIDC-gated roles, and this role deliberately runs   without SSO. Path back: upstream ships a logout control (or an in-app logout endpoint we can   target), then drop the flag and keep the `adminInteraction` already wired in the spec."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` : Socialni dom 2026.6.16 uvoz `logout` od `client/src/store/auth.ts` na točno enem mestu – `client/src/main.tsx` ga žice kot 401 upravljalec preko `setUnauthorizedHandler(logout)`. Nobena komponenta ne omogoča nadzora odjave, tako da `personas/utils/logout.js` nima ničesar za klik in admin potovanje ne more dokončati. Druga možnost – injiciranje `[data-injected-logout]` gumb preko `templates/javascript.js.j2` — je bil zavrnjen: model (`roles/web-app-prometheus/templates/javascript.js.j2`) pokaže gumb na `OIDC.CLIENT.LOGOUT_URL`, ki obstaja samo za OIDC-agirane vloge, in ta vloga namerno teče brez SSO. Pot nazaj: gornje ladje nadzor odjave (ali končni cilj v aplikaciji.), nato spustite zastavo in obdržite `adminInteraction` Je že vklopljen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` is declared because the shared helper cannot reach Shopware's logout, not because the journey is untestable. The only logout control lives in `.sw-admin-menu__user-actions`, which the administration stylesheet keeps at `display: none` until its toggle is clicked, and that toggle is a bare `div` carrying no role, no `aria-haspopup` and no dropdown class — nothing in the helper's trigger set matches it. Its second fallback, following a same-origin settings link, misses as well because the administration is hash-routed and every settings target is `#/sw/settings/...`."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` je deklariran, ker skupni pomočnik ne more doseči ShopwareOdjavi se, ne zato, ker potovanje ni mogoče. Edini nadzor odjavi živi v `.sw-admin-menu__user-actions`, ki jih administracijska slogovna predloga hrani na `display: none` dokler se ne klikne njen toggle, in da je toggle gola `div` brez vloge, ne `aria-haspopup` Nič na sprožilcu se ne ujema. Njegova druga rezerva, po nastavitveni povezavi istega porekla, zgreši tudi zato, ker je administracija hašiša in vsaka nastavitev cilj je `#/sw/settings/...`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` is declared for a second, independent reason, and two separate obstacles justify it."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` je deklariran iz drugega, neodvisnega razloga in dve ločeni oviri to upravičujeta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` : The app authenticates against its own `platform_users` table. There is no OIDC client and no   auto-provisioning, so the biber account never exists inside Social Home. Path back: upstream   grows an OIDC/trusted-header auth path."
msgstr "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` Aplikacija overi proti lastni `platform_users` miza. Ni odjemalca OIDC in ni samodejnega zagotavljanja, tako da biber račun nikoli ne obstaja znotraj Social Home. Pot nazaj: navzgor raste OIDC / zaupa-glava-uth pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` accepts a caller-supplied `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), and `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` accepts a caller-supplied `secret_id`. Both verified in [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (lines 889 and 1243)."
msgstr "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` sprejme pozivnika `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), in `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` sprejme pozivnika `secret_id`. Oba preverjena v [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (črte 889 ter 1243)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PROJECT_ROOT` is the repo root derived from this file's location."
msgstr "`PROJECT_ROOT` je koren repo, ki izhaja iz lokacije te datoteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Pi <https://github.com/earendil-works/pi>`__ is a minimal terminal coding agent with a lazy-loading skill system. This role installs it on a workstation and registers the platform’s model gateway as its provider."
msgstr "`Pi <https://github.com/earendil-works/pi>`__ je minimalni terminalni kodni agent z lenim sistemom spretnosti. Ta vloga ga namesti na delovno postajo in registrira model platforme kot svojega ponudnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`__ is an open-source systems monitoring and alerting toolkit that collects and stores time-series metrics and provides a powerful query language (PromQL)."
msgstr "`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`__ je odprtokodni sistem za spremljanje in opozarjanje orodja, ki zbira in shranjuje časovno-serije metrike in zagotavlja močan jezik poizvedbe (PromQL)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Pull requests`: **Read and write** (`gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`)."
msgstr "`Pull requests`: **Beri in piši** (`gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`README.md` files MAY exist under `scripts/` as documentation-only exceptions."
msgstr "`README.md` datoteke LAHKO obstajajo `scripts/` kot izjeme, ki se nanašajo samo na dokumentacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`README.md` files MAY exist under `utils/` as documentation-only exceptions."
msgstr "`README.md` datoteke LAHKO obstajajo `utils/` kot izjeme, ki se nanašajo samo na dokumentacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apk add` (Alpine ≥3.18 HTTPS)"
msgstr "`RUN apk add` (Alpsko ≥3.18 HTTPS)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apk add` (inner Dockerfile build, Alpine ≤3.17 HTTP)"
msgstr "`RUN apk add` (notranja dockerfile grail, alpska ≤3.17 HTTP)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apt-get install` (inner Dockerfile build, Debian/Ubuntu)"
msgstr "`RUN apt-get install` (notranja gradnja Dockerfile, Debian/Ubuntu)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN pip/npm/gem/composer/go install` (inner Dockerfile build)"
msgstr "`RUN pip/npm/gem/composer/go install` (notranji dockerfile build)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_COUNT` defaults to `RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS // RUNNER_CPUS` (auto-scaled to hardware). Override explicitly when debugging a specific count."
msgstr "`RUNNER_COUNT` privzeto za `RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS // RUNNER_CPUS` (Samodejno nastavljeno na strojno opremo). Preglasiti izrecno, ko razhroščevanje določeno število."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` is **required** and has no default; it is passed automatically by the CLI."
msgstr "`RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` m **zahtevano** in nima privzete vrednosti; CLI jo samodejno prenese."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_GITHUB_OWNER` and `RUNNER_GITHUB_REPO` resolve from `GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER` / `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` env vars when set (CI context), falling back to `meta/services.yml` for production deploys."
msgstr "`RUNNER_GITHUB_OWNER` ter `RUNNER_GITHUB_REPO` zdravljenje z `GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER` / `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` env vars ko je nastavljen (Okvir CI), se vračam na `meta/services.yml` za uporabo v proizvodnji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNTIME` (`dev`/`act`/`github`) selects which test stages run."
msgstr "`RUNTIME` (`dev`/`act`/`github`) izbere, katere preskusne faze potekajo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ is a frontend for emulators, game engines, and media players powered by the `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ framework. It supports multiple UI styles including `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ and `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, and provides a unified interface for retro gaming across platforms."
msgstr "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ je začel za emulatorje, igralne motorje in medijske igralce, ki jih poganja `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ okvir. Podpira več uporabniških stilov, vključno z `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ ter `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, in zagotavlja enoten vmesnik za retro igre na srečo po vseh platformah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ is a Node.js-based front-end application that simulates a roulette wheel in the browser."
msgstr "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ a Node.js-based front-end aplikacija, ki simulira ruleta kolo v brskalniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (base64 32 bytes, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) encrypts stored access keys; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` secure sessions."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (osnova64 32 bajtov, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) šifriranje shranjenih dostopovnih ključev; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` Varne seje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed the first admin (no setup wizard)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seme prvi admin (ni čarovnika nastavitev)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` ∈ `bolt` (file at `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres uses `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` `bolt` (datoteko v `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres uporablja `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus attribute mappings (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus kartiranje atributov (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON map. Per-provider: `display_name`, `provider_url` (issuer), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Redirect path is `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore has native OIDC — no `oauth2-proxy` sidecar needed.**"
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = zemljevid JSON. Na dobavitelja: `display_name`, `provider_url` (izdajatelj), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Preusmeri pot je `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semafor ima domorodni OIDC – do `oauth2-proxy` Potrebna je prikolica.**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` sets the externally-reachable base URL; required for correct OIDC redirects behind `sys-svc-proxy`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` nastavi zunanje dosegljivi osnovni URL; potreben za pravilne preusmeritve OIDC zadaj `sys-svc-proxy`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` is emptied so the container never fetches the app catalog from github.com. Set it to a self-hosted catalog when one exists."
msgstr "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` se izprazni tako, da posoda nikoli ne prinese kataloga aplikacij iz github.com. Nastavite jo na katalog, ko obstaja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` is unset — the SPA is same-origin. Needed only if a third-party client should talk to the API."
msgstr "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` je izključena – SPA ima enak izvor. Potrebno le, če stranka tretje osebe naj govori z API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` is pinned to 4 GiB in `vars/main.yml` so the app's media cap stays inside `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Raising one without the other lets the volume outgrow its declared budget."
msgstr "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` je pritrjena na 4 GiB v `vars/main.yml` tako, da bo večpredstavnostna kapa aplikacije ostala znotraj `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Vzgajanje eno brez drugega omogoča obseg preraste svoj prijavljeni proračun."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ is a cryptographic network protocol for operating network services securely over an unsecured network. The `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ project provides the reference implementation, including ``ssh-agent`` for managing authentication keys."
msgstr "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ je kriptografski omrežni protokol za upravljanje omrežnih storitev varno preko nezavarovanega omrežja. – `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ projekt zagotavlja referenčno izvajanje, vključno ``ssh-agent`` za upravljanje ključev za avtentikacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (string): desired state (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"
msgstr "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (niz): želeno stanje (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ is a metasearch engine. It forwards a query to other search engines and returns the merged result without an account and without a tracking profile."
msgstr "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ je metaloški motor. Posreduje poizvedbo drugim iskalnikom in vrne združeni rezultat brez računa in brez sledilnega profila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ is a fast distributed storage system for blobs, objects, and files. It exposes an S3-compatible API, so applications store and retrieve objects with standard S3 SDKs and CLIs."
msgstr "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ je hitro porazdeljen sistem za shranjevanje mehurčkov, predmetov in datotek. Razkrinka S.3-združljivo API, tako aplikacije shranjevanje in pridobivanje predmetov s standardom S3 SDK in CLIS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ is a modern web UI and API for running Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plans, and shell scripts on a schedule or on demand. This role deploys the official ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`__ container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy with central PostgreSQL, native Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, and optional LDAP login."
msgstr "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ je sodoben spletni uporabniški vmesnik in API za zagon Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu načrte, in lupin skripte na urnik ali na zahtevo. Ta vloga napoti uradnika ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>` posoda za Infinito.Nexus obratni posrednik s centralnim PostgreSQL, domorodna Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On in neobvezna prijava LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Svc Engine <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Svc Engine <https://example.com/>`__ je vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Svc Objstore <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Svc Objstore <https://example.com/>`__ je vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_COMMAND` (default: `npm install --no-fund --no-audit && npx playwright test`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_COMMAND` (privzeto: `npm install --no-fund --no-audit && npx playwright test`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (default: `noble`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (privzeto: `noble`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE` (resolved in `vars/main.yml` from `meta/services.yml.playwright.image` + `.version` via `lookup('config', 'test-e2e-playwright', 'services.playwright.image|version')`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE` (ve `vars/main.yml` od `meta/services.yml.playwright.image` + `.version` preko `lookup('config', 'test-e2e-playwright', 'services.playwright.image|version')`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_REPORTS_BASE_DIR` (default: `/var/lib/infinito/logs/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_REPORTS_BASE_DIR` (privzeto: `/var/lib/infinito/logs/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (default: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (privzeto: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ is a powerful and intuitive open-source project management platform tailored for agile teams. Whether you’re practicing Scrum, Kanban, or a custom hybrid workflow, Taiga offers a rich, customizable environment to plan, track, and collaborate on your projects, without the complexity of enterprise tools or the vendor lock-in of SaaS platforms."
msgstr "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ je močna in intuitivna platforma za odprtokodno upravljanje projektov, prilagojena agilnim ekipam. Ne glede na to, ali vadite Scrum, Kanban ali hibridni delovni tok po meri, Taiga ponuja bogato, prilagodljivo okolje za načrtovanje, sledenje in sodelovanje na vaših projektih, brez kompleksnosti poslovnih orodij ali prodajalec zaklepanje SaaS platform."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ je vloga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` resolves the caller's token through `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` and presents it as the Bearer"
msgstr "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` reši klicni znak skozi `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` in ga predstavlja kot Nosilca"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Unit tests` verify isolated logic."
msgstr "`Unit tests` preveri izolirano logiko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`UsersLookup` yields the `no-reply` user dict used to derive `from` and `password`. Missing entries MUST yield an empty dict. The fallback for `from` is then `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."
msgstr "`UsersLookup` da `no-reply` uporabniški ukaz za izpeljavo `from` ter `password`. Manjkajoči vnosi MORAjo dati prazen odlok. Rezerva za `from` je `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ is a powerful source code editor with a wide plugin ecosystem, supporting development workflows across many languages and platforms. See also the `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ and general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ on Wikipedia."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ je močan urejevalnik izvorne kode s širokim ekosistemom plugin, ki podpira razvoj delovnih tokov v številnih jezikih in platformah. Glejte tudi `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ in splošno `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ na Wikipediji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ in a selectable flavor: the distribution’s Code - OSS build, VSCodium, or Microsoft’s own binary."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ v izbirnem okusu: distribucija Code - OSS graditi, VSCodium, ali Microsoft lastno binarno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ is a versatile and widely used `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ that powers millions of websites, from blogs and portfolios to e-commerce and corporate sites. This deployment provides a containerized WordPress instance optimized for multisite operation, advanced media management, and extensive plugin support, allowing you to fully leverage the rich features of the WordPress software."
msgstr "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ je vsestranski in široko uporablja `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ ki pooblašča milijone spletnih strani, od blogov in portfeljev do e-trgovine in spletnih strani podjetij. Ta razporeditev zagotavlja zabojnike WordPress primer optimizirano za večstrankarsko delovanje, napredno upravljanje medijev in obsežno podporo plugin, ki vam omogoča, da v celoti izkoristijo bogate značilnosti WordPress programska oprema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ is an open-source helpdesk and ticketing system. Agents handle customer requests across email, chat, phone and web; customers can open tickets from a self-service portal."
msgstr "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ je odprtokodna služba za pomoč uporabnikom in sistem izdajanja vozovnic. Agenti obravnavajo zahteve strank preko e-pošte, klepeta, telefona in spleta; stranke lahko odprejo vstopnice iz samopostrežnega portala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ is a popular video conferencing application for online meetings, webinars, and collaboration."
msgstr "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ je priljubljena aplikacija za videokonference za spletne sestanke, spletne strani in sodelovanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → a device on the host, recovered over ssh then pulled; `[user@]host:/image` → the image is pulled and recovered locally (`device` / `full`)"
msgstr "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → naprava na gostitelju, ki je bila obnovljena nad ssh in nato povlečena; `[user@]host:/image` → slika se potegne in izterja lokalno (`device` / `full`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_as_bool` MUST accept the usual string forms (`true|false|yes|no|1|0|on|off`), booleans, and numbers. Every boolean decision in the fallbacks MUST use it so that `SYSTEM_EMAIL_*` values coming from YAML, environment variables, or already-coerced facts all behave the same."
msgstr "`_as_bool` MORATE sprejeti običajne obrazce nizov (`true|false|yes|no|1|0|on|off`), Booleans in številke. Vsaka boolska odločitev v rezervnih igrah jo mora uporabiti tako, da `SYSTEM_EMAIL_*` vrednosti, ki izhajajo iz YAML, okoljskih spremenljivk ali že prisilnih dejstev, se vse obnašajo enako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_compute` MUST delegate to three other lookup plugins rather than re-reading project state directly:"
msgstr "`_compute` MORAJO prenesti na tri druge vstavke za iskanje namesto ponovnega branja stanja projekta neposredno:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_shared.js` — env + login helpers (`penpotOidcLogin`, `penpotLdapLogin`, `penpotNativeLogin`, `penpotRegister`)."
msgstr "`_shared.js` — env + pomoč pri prijavi (`penpotOidcLogin`, `penpotLdapLogin`, `penpotNativeLogin`, `penpotRegister`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"block-above\"``: the construct's own line, or any comment line above it within the same blank-line-delimited block. A gettext entry stacks several comments and repeats a URL in both ``msgid`` and ``msgstr``, so a marker has to cover the whole entry and survive whichever writer appends its comment last."
msgstr "``\"block-above\"``: lastna vrstica konstrukta ali katera koli vrstica komentarja nad njim v istem praznem bloku, ki je omejen. Getext vnos sklada več komentarjev in ponavlja URL v obeh ``msgid`` ter ``msgstr``, tako da marker mora pokriti celoten vnos in preživeti karkoli pisatelj doda svoj komentar zadnji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"line-above\"``: marker must be on the immediately preceding non-empty line. Blank lines between marker and construct break the association."
msgstr "``\"line-above\"``: marker mora biti na neposredno pred neprazno črto. Prazne črte med označevalcem in konstruktom pretrgajo asociacijo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"same-line\"``: marker must be on the construct's line."
msgstr "``\"same-line\"``: marker mora biti na liniji konstrukta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"same-or-above\"`` (default): either of the above."
msgstr "``\"same-or-above\"`` (privzeto): kar koli od naštetega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``#`` (Python, YAML, shell, conf, INI, …)"
msgstr "``#`` (Python, YAML, školjka, konf, INI, ...)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``#``, ``@``, ``+``, ``%`` and ``/`` introduce an axis and appear in neither a role id nor a display name, so the first of them is the seam."
msgstr "``#``, ``@``, ``+``, ``%`` ter ``/`` uvesti os in se ne pojavi niti v vlogi ID niti v prikazovalnem imenu, tako da je prvi od njih šiv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProviderConnection`` is the JSON object ``{url, endpoint, model, secret}`` built from ``MEDIAWIKI_LITELLM_CONNECTION``; ``url`` is ``LITELLM_OPENAI_BASE_LOCAL_URL`` and ``secret`` is this role’s own ``credentials.litellm_api_key``. The braces are mandatory: a brace-free value is re-wrapped as ``{\"legacy\": ...}`` upstream and the provider falls back to the vendor endpoint at ``api.openai.com``."
msgstr "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProviderConnection`` je predmet JSON ``{url, endpoint, model, secret}`` izdelani iz ``MEDIAWIKI_LITELLM_CONNECTION``; ``url`` m ``LITELLM_OPENAI_BASE_LOCAL_URL`` ter ``secret`` je ta vloga lastna ``credentials.litellm_api_key``. Oporniki so obvezni: vrednost brez opornice je ponovno zaviti kot ``{\"legacy\": ...}`` na začetku dobavne verige in ponudnik se vrne na končno točko prodajalca ob ``api.openai.com``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProvider`` is ``open-ai``."
msgstr "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProvider`` m ``open-ai``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgHTTPTimeout`` is raised inside the same block because core’s 25s is below a cold local model’s first token."
msgstr "``$wgHTTPTimeout`` se dvigne v istem bloku, ker je jedro 25je pod prvim žetonom hladnega lokalnega modela."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "``%%`` is \"contains\" for a scalar string value and \"is a member of\" for a set value; ``==`` / ``!=`` against a set mean membership / non-membership. String comparisons (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) are case-insensitive; ``< > <= >=`` are numeric. A bare expression with no operator (e.g. ``nextcloud``) is shorthand for ``name %% nextcloud``."
msgstr "``%%`` m \"contains\" za skalarno vrednost niza in \"je član\" za določeno vrednost; ``==`` / ``!=`` proti določeni povprečni članstvo / nečlanstvo. Primerjava nizov (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) so neobčutljivi na primere; ``< > <= >=`` so številčni. Gol izraz brez operaterja (Npr. ``nextcloud``) je okrajšava za ``name %% nextcloud``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``'on-failure'`` or ``'on-failure:N'`` -> ``'on-failure'``"
msgstr "``'on-failure'`` ali ``'on-failure:N'`` - > ``'on-failure'``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(\"SKIPPED\", reason)`` when ping is unavailable or lacks CAP_NET_RAW"
msgstr "``(\"SKIPPED\", reason)`` kadar ping ni na voljo ali manjka CAP_NET_RAW"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``('', '')`` when the role has no instructions to replay or this sweep deploys no variant that could carry them."
msgstr "``('', '')`` če vloga nima navodil za ponovno predvajanje ali če ta pregled ne uporablja nobene variante, ki bi jih lahko nosila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(1-based line number, text)`` for every line inside a ``## Credits`` section, ending at the next heading of any level."
msgstr "``(1-based line number, text)`` za vsako vrstico znotraj ``## Credits`` odsek, ki se konča na naslednji stopnji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(None, None)`` when every probe size is dropped"
msgstr "``(None, None)`` ko pade vsaka velikost sonde"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(files_glob, dump_glob)`` for the layout *names* describe."
msgstr "``(files_glob, dump_glob)`` za postavitev *imena* opis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(healthcheck, source)`` where source is ``cache``, ``mirror``, ``upstream`` or ``none``. Reading upstream is the documented fallback for images the mirror does not carry; a caller that sweeps many images can use the counts to tell a fallback from a mirror that stopped working."
msgstr "``(healthcheck, source)`` kjer je vir ``cache``, ``mirror``, ``upstream`` ali ``none``. Branje v smeri proti toku je dokumentirana rezerva za slike, ki jih ogledalo ne nosi; klicatelj, ki pomete veliko slik, lahko uporabi številke, da pove nazaj iz ogledala, ki je prenehalo delovati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(input name, opening literal, is_marker)`` per rendered segment, in template order."
msgstr "``(input name, opening literal, is_marker)`` Na preračunani segment po vrstnem redu predloge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` mapped to ``msgstr``; empty and fuzzy entries are left out, so their source text stands in."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` začrtano na ``msgstr``; prazni in megleni vnosi so izpuščeni, tako da njihovo izvorno besedilo stoji v."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pairs in source order."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` par v vrstnem redu virov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pairs; ``msgctxt`` may be ``None``."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pare; ``msgctxt`` lahko ``None``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(name, email)``, unchanged when the mailmap knows the address not."
msgstr "``(name, email)``, nespremenjeno, ko pošta ne pozna naslova."

