msgstr "``/mcp`` o ``mattermostmcp`` stranska prikolica; adapter doseže ``/plugins/mattermost-ai/mcp-server/mcp`` o ``mattermost`` storitev na toku"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/opt/data/config.yaml``, owned by uid 10000"
msgstr "``/opt/data/config.yaml``, v lasti Uid 10000"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/usr/local/bin`` is NOT bind-mounted, even though MDAD writes a few helper scripts there. The runner’s ``ansible-core`` lives at ``/opt/ansible/bin/`` (out of the way) to keep the option open, but mounting the deploy container’s ``/usr/local/bin`` over the runner causes a Python ABI mismatch segfault (host Python is built differently from ``python:3.13-slim``). MDAD’s host-side helper scripts are not invoked by the deploy flow."
msgstr "``/usr/local/bin`` se ne veže, čeprav MDAD napiše nekaj skripte pomočnika tam. Tekač ``ansible-core`` živi v ``/opt/ansible/bin/`` (Umaknite se.) da ostane možnost odprta, vendar namestitev posode za uporabo ``/usr/local/bin`` nad tekačem povzroči Python ABI neskladje segfault (gostitelj Python je zgrajen drugače kot ``python:3.13-slim``). MDAD-jeve skripte za pomoč na gostiteljski strani se ne sklicujejo z uporabo pretoka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/var/run/docker.sock``, so MDAD-launched containers land in the same Docker daemon as the rest of the stack"
msgstr "``/var/run/docker.sock``, tako da MDAD spuščeni kontejnerji pristane v istem demonu Docker kot preostali kup"

