msgstr "``Authorization`` glava na strežnik iz podatkov o odkritju"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``BARE_BOLD_RE``  ``**Name**`` that is not itself a link's text."
msgstr "``BARE_BOLD_RE`` ``**Name**`` To ni besedilo povezave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``BYPASS_ADMIN_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`` keeps the grant meaningful for administrators too; upstream defaults it to true, which would let every administrator past any grant. ``ENABLE_OAUTH_GROUP_MANAGEMENT`` syncs the platform’s groups on login, so membership follows Keycloak."
msgstr "``BYPASS_ADMIN_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`` ohranja pomen subvencije tudi za administratorje; privzeto neplačilo je resnično, kar bi vsakemu administratorju omogočilo, da opusti kakršno koli donacijo. ``ENABLE_OAUTH_GROUP_MANAGEMENT`` uskladi skupine platforme ob prijavi, tako da članstvo sledi Keycloak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``CA_ROOT.cert_host`` (default: ``/etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.crt``)"
msgstr "``CA_ROOT.cert_host`` (privzeto: ``/etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.crt``)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``CA_ROOT.key_host`` (default: ``/etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.key``)"
msgstr "``CA_ROOT.key_host`` (privzeto: ``/etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.key``)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``CA_ROOT`` (mapping)"
msgstr "``CA_ROOT`` (kartiranje)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``DEV_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`` mirrors ``INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`` from ``default.env``; the pairing is drift-guarded."
msgstr "``DEV_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`` ogledala ``INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`` od ``default.env``; Par je zavarovan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``DevInventorySpec`` is imported but deliberately absent from ``__all__``: listing a re-exported class makes autodoc document it here as well as in :mod:`.spec`, and sphinx then finds two targets for every annotation. Importing it from this package keeps working either way."
msgstr "``DevInventorySpec`` uvožen, vendar namerno odsoten iz ``__all__``: Navajanje ponovno izvoženega razreda naredi avtodoc dokument tukaj, kot tudi v :mod:`.spec`, Sfinga najde dve tarči za vsako oznako. Uvažanje iz tega paketa deluje v vsakem primeru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``EDGES``: the curated, web-verified upstream app↔app plugin/integration pages, each ``(source, target, url, kind)`` with ``kind`` in ``{\"check\", \"coin\"}``."
msgstr "``EDGES``: kurirana, web-preverjena gornji aplikacija app plugin / integracija strani, vsak ``(source, target, url, kind)`` z ``kind`` v ``{\"check\", \"coin\"}``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``ENABLE_OAUTH_ROLE_MANAGEMENT`` maps the application’s administrator group onto the Open WebUI admin role, and it also makes ``OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES`` a sign-in gate. The env sets ``OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES=*`` so every platform role passes that gate; narrow it only to a list that matches the ``/roles/<app>/<role>`` paths Keycloak emits."
msgstr "``ENABLE_OAUTH_ROLE_MANAGEMENT`` načrtuje administratorsko skupino aplikacije na Open WebUI admin vlogo, in tudi naredi ``OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES`` Vpisna vrata. Env set ``OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES=*`` Tako da vsaka vloga platforme preide ta vrata; zožite jo le na seznam, ki se ujema z ``/roles/<app>/<role>`` poti Keycloak oddaja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``FILE_ENVIRONMENT`` (default: ``/etc/environment``)"
msgstr "``FILE_ENVIRONMENT`` (privzeto: ``/etc/environment``)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``FRAMEWORK``: top-level ``meta/services.yml`` integration keys mapped to the in-axis target entity they wire the role into (the infinito-native, group-gated service flags), distinct from the curated upstream edges;"
msgstr "``FRAMEWORK``: najvišja raven ``meta/services.yml`` integracijski ključi, ki so narisani na osni ciljni entiteti, v katero nalagajo vlogo (neskončne oznake storitev, ki temeljijo na skupinah), ki se razlikujejo od kuriranih zgornjih robov;"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``False`` when the covered variant pins ``services.tor.enabled`` to a literal false, ``True`` otherwise. A reactive Jinja flag counts as capable: it is the role saying \"onion when the node is dark\". Consulting the variant matters -- roles pin the gate ``true`` in variant 0 and ``false`` in the rest, so reading only the base config claims an onion for rounds that deliberately run without one."
msgstr "``False`` pri pokritih variantnih zatičih ``services.tor.enabled`` dobesedno laž, ``True`` sicer. Reaktiven Jinja zastava šteje kot sposoben: je vloga, ki pravi \"čebula, ko je vozlišče temno\". Posvetovanje v zvezi z variantami -- vloge pripnejo vrata ``true`` v različici 0 ter ``false`` V ostalem, tako branje samo osnovni konfig zahteva čebulo za kroge, ki namerno teče brez enega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``GH_TOKEN`` env var"
msgstr "``GH_TOKEN`` env var"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD`` (```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__, from ``GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD`` in ```vars/main.yml`` <./vars/main.yml>`__) belongs to GitLab’s built-in ``root`` account, not to the Keycloak ``administrator`` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for ``biber`` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the ``services.sso.enabled: false`` matrix variants that path is removed, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "``GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD`` (```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__, from ``GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD`` in ```vars/main.yml`` <./vars/main.yml>`__) belongs to GitLab’s built-in ``root`` account, not to the Keycloak ``administrator`` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for ``biber`` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the ``services.sso.enabled: false`` matrix variants that path is removed, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona in osnovne trditve potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``HOST``, ``DISTRO``, ``COUNT`` (optional), ``PORT``, ``OWNER``, ``REPO``"
msgstr "``HOST``, ``DISTRO``, ``COUNT`` (neobvezno), ``PORT``, ``OWNER``, ``REPO``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``INFINITO_CI_CHUNK_SIZE`` takes precedence when set; 0 derives the value from the runner slots a chunk may assume and the waves the queue window affords."
msgstr "``INFINITO_CI_CHUNK_SIZE`` ima prednost pri določanju; 0 Izvede vrednost iz tekaških reže lahko del prevzame in valove okno čakalne vrste omogoča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``INFINITO_VERSION_ENV_NAME`` (default: ``INFINITO_VERSION``)"
msgstr "``INFINITO_VERSION_ENV_NAME`` (privzeto: ``INFINITO_VERSION``)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``LINKED_RE``     ``[Name](https://url)`` plus the bold markers a Credits"
msgstr "``LINKED_RE`` ``[Name](https://url)`` plus drzni označevalci a Credits"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``MODE_CLEANUP``: Removes unused Docker containers, networks, images, and volumes."
msgstr "``MODE_CLEANUP``: Odstrani neuporabljene posode Docker, omrežja, slike, in zvezki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``MODE_RESET`` additionally restarts the Docker service after cleanup."
msgstr "``MODE_RESET`` dodatno ponovno zažene servis Docker po čiščenju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``MODE_RESET``: Performs cleanup and restarts the Docker service."
msgstr "``MODE_RESET``: Opravlja čiščenje in ponovno zažene servis Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``Mastodon`` must survive translation, ``Cleanup Disc Space`` must not. Neither the capital nor a dictionary separates them: a brand is deliberately built from an ordinary word, so ``Mastodon``, ``Matrix``, ``Cursor`` and ``Shell`` all sit in an English dictionary, while a descriptive title regularly carries a term no dictionary holds. Measured against en_US-large, that rule would have released Mastodon, PostgreSQL and WordPress for translation and protected ``Automated Email Alerts for Service Failures``."
msgstr "``Mastodon`` mora preživeti prevod, ``Cleanup Disc Space`` ne smem. Niti glavno mesto niti slovar ju ne loči: znamka je namerno zgrajena iz navadne besede, tako ``Mastodon``, ``Matrix``, ``Cursor`` ter ``Shell`` vsi sedijo v angleškem slovarju, medtem ko opisni naslov redno nosi izraz brez slovarja. Izmerjeno proti en_US-Veliko, to pravilo bi se sprostilo. Mastodon, PostgreSQL ter WordPress za prevajanje in zaščito ``Automated Email Alerts for Service Failures``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``None`` empties the topic and is normalised to ``{}``: the closure resolver skips a non-mapping payload, so leaving the bare ``None`` would silently keep the services it was meant to drop."
msgstr "``None`` izprazni temo in se normalizira na ``{}``: zapiranje razreševalec preskoči non-mapping korist tovora, tako da pusti gola ``None`` da bi tiho obdržal usluge, ki naj bi jih opustil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``None`` means the caller has to address the upstream registry: the image name is malformed, the mirror prefix is not configured, or neither the GitHub environment nor the git remote names the GHCR namespace."
msgstr "``None`` pomeni, da mora klicatelj nasloviti gornji register: ime slike je napačno oblikovano, predpona zrcala ni nastavljena, niti okolje GitHub niti oddaljeno ime GHCR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``None`` on any indeterminate outcome (see :func:`fetch_manifest`), on an index without a matching platform, and on a manifest that carries no layers."
msgstr "``None`` o vseh nedoločnih izidih (glej :func:`fetch_manifest`), na indeksu brez ustrezne platforme in na manifestu, ki ne nosi plasti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``None`` on any indeterminate outcome: unresolvable name, network error, auth wall, rate limit, non-200 status, or unparsable body."
msgstr "``None`` o katerem koli nedoločenem izidu: nerešljivo ime, napaka v omrežju, Auth stena, omejitev hitrosti, ne-200 status ali nepopravljivo telo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``None`` when the title carries no deploy row. ``name`` is the display name, returned unresolved -- callers decode it through ``utils.roles.display``, which is what knows the role tree. ``tor``, ``distro`` and ``filesystem`` matter because a priority role runs the same mode and variant several times over, and only the glyphs tell those jobs apart -- a retrigger built from the title alone would otherwise replay a different combination than the one that failed."
msgstr "``None`` kadar naslov ne vsebuje vrstice za razporeditev. ``name`` je ime zaslona, vrnjeno nerešeno -- klicarji dešifrirajo ga skozi ``utils.roles.display``, ki je tisto, kar pozna drevo vloge. ``tor``, ``distro`` ter ``filesystem`` stvar, ker prednostna vloga teče isti način in varianto večkrat več, in le glifi te delovna mesta ločijo -- retrigger zgrajen iz naslova sam bi sicer ponovno igral drugačno kombinacijo kot tista, ki ni uspela."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`` is declared because the shared helper cannot reach Shopware’s logout, not because the journey is untestable. The only logout control lives in ``.sw-admin-menu__user-actions``, which the administration stylesheet keeps at ``display: none`` until its toggle is clicked, and that toggle is a bare ``div`` carrying no role, no ``aria-haspopup`` and no dropdown class — nothing in the helper’s trigger set matches it. Its second fallback, following a same-origin settings link, misses as well because the administration is hash-routed and every settings target is ``#/sw/settings/...``."
msgstr "``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`` je deklariran, ker skupni pomočnik ne more doseči ShopwareOdjavi se, ne zato, ker bi bilo potovanje neokusno. Edini nadzor odjavi živi v ``.sw-admin-menu__user-actions``, ki jih administracijska slogovna predloga hrani na ``display: none`` dokler se ne klikne njen toggle, in da je toggle gola ``div`` brez vloge, ne ``aria-haspopup`` in noben razred spusta – nič na sprožilcu pomočnika se ne ujema z njim. Njegova druga rezerva, po nastavitveni povezavi istega porekla, zgreši tudi zato, ker je administracija hašiša in vsaka nastavitev cilj je ``#/sw/settings/...``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`` is declared for a second, independent reason, and two separate obstacles justify it."
msgstr "``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`` je deklariran iz drugega, neodvisnega razloga in dve ločeni oviri to upravičujeta."

