msgstr "``make install`` na krmilni napravi (namesti Ansible in Python odvisnosti)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``mandatory`` (default ``False``): the file (or dotted-path entry) MUST be present and non-empty for a role of this type. Implies ``allowed: True``; setting ``mandatory: True`` together with ``allowed: False`` is a schema error."
msgstr "``mandatory`` (privzeto ``False``): datoteka (ali vnos pikčaste poti) MORA biti prisotna in neprazna za takšno vlogo. Nečistoče ``allowed: True``; nastavitev ``mandatory: True`` skupaj z ``allowed: False`` je napaka sheme."

