msgstr "``mcp.enabled`` odloči, da ``true`` samo kadar ``web-app-hermes``, ``web-app-openclaw`` ali ``web-app-openwebui`` je del iste razporeditve in je ``false`` sicer. Medtem ko je ``true`` razporeditev:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``mcp`` declares the Model Context Protocol surface GitLab serves natively from its Rails API."
msgstr "``mcp`` razglasi površino vzorčnega protokola GitLab služi iz svoje železnice API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/addons/`` is also the download list: ``MEDIAWIKI_EXT_NAMES`` keeps only the addons whose ``enabled`` resolves true, so a deployment without the matching service never pulls that tarball or runs composer for it."
msgstr "``meta/addons/`` je tudi seznam prenosov: ``MEDIAWIKI_EXT_NAMES`` ima samo dodatke, katerih ``enabled`` je res, tako da razporeditev brez ustreznega servisa nikoli ne potegne, da tarball ali vodi skladatelja za to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/categories.yml`` at the repository root declares the nested category tree every role name is derived from: the dash-joined path of a node is the role's category prefix (``web`` -> ``app`` yields ``web-app-*``), and nodes carry the ``invokable``, ``stage``, ``modes`` and ``run_after`` policy the dispatcher, the stage lookup and the inventory generator read."
msgstr "``meta/categories.yml`` na korenu skladišča izjavlja, da je vgnezdeno drevo kategorije vsako ime vloge izpeljano iz: poševno povezana pot vozlišča je predpona kategorije vloge (``web`` - > ``app`` donosi ``web-app-*``), in vozlišča nosijo ``invokable``, ``stage``, ``modes`` ter ``run_after`` politika dispečer, fazi iskanje in inventar generator brati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/categories.yml`` declares the ordered ``stages`` (constructor -> workstation -> server -> destructor, matching ``tasks/stages/0*.yml``) and a ``stage`` per top-level category. This module resolves a role to its stage and exposes the canonical stage order, so both the CLI (``cli.meta.roles.order``) and the ``stage_order`` / ``role_stage`` lookups read one source of truth."
msgstr "``meta/categories.yml`` razglasi naročeno ``stages`` (konstruktor -> delovna postaja -> strežnik -> destruktor, ujemanje ``tasks/stages/0*.yml``) in a ``stage`` po zgornji kategoriji. Ta modul razreši vlogo na svoji stopnji in izpostavi kanonični odrski red, tako da oba CLI (``cli.meta.roles.order``) in ``stage_order`` / ``role_stage`` Iskalci so prebrali en vir resnice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/distros.yml`` declares every distribution the project builds, tests and deploys on: the id used as ``INFINITO_DISTRO``, the ``os_family`` ansible reports for it, the Galaxy platform name, the upstream base image the development-environment matrix boots it from, and the templates the pkgmgr base image and the environment image references are rendered from."
msgstr "``meta/distros.yml`` razglasi vsako distribucijo projekta gradi, testira in uporablja: ID, ki se uporablja kot ``INFINITO_DISTRO``, ``os_family`` anestabilna poročila zanjo, ime Galaxy platforme, gornjo osnovno sliko, iz katere jo okoljsko-razvojno-okoljska matrika obriše, in predloge, iz katerih sta izdelana osnovna slika pkgmgr in referenca okoljske slike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/variants.yml`` defines three variants (mirrors the ``web-app-kix`` / ``web-app-zammad`` pattern):"
msgstr "``meta/variants.yml`` določa tri variante (Zrcali ``web-app-kix`` / ``web-app-zammad`` vzorec):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``mode`` selects placement semantics:"
msgstr "``mode`` izbere semantiko umestitve:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``modes`` in ``meta/services.yml`` states where a role RUNS; ``skip`` in ``meta/tests.yml`` deactivates TESTING a mode without touching that capability."
msgstr "``modes`` v ``meta/services.yml`` navaja vlogo RUNS; ``skip`` v ``meta/tests.yml`` Izklopi testiranje načina brez dotikanja te zmožnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``modes``: list of DEPLOYMENT_MODE values where this overlay applies"
msgstr "``modes``: seznam DEPLOYMENT_MODE vrednosti, pri katerih se uporablja ta prekrivnost"

