msgstr "`cli/meta/env/` določa vstopno točko CLI kot `python -m cli.meta.env`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cluster_addr` MUST NOT be built from the container name. Compose sets `container_name:` explicitly, but swarm names every task `<stack>_<key>.<slot>.<taskid>`, so a container-name-derived address renders differently per mode. With `replicas: 1` the node only ever advertises to itself, so a loopback cluster address is mode-independent; the HA follow-up story revisits it."
msgstr "`cluster_addr` NE SME biti zgrajena iz imena vsebnika. Kompleti `container_name:` Izrecno, vendar roj imenuje vsako nalogo. `<stack>_<key>.<slot>.<taskid>`, tako da naslov iz kontejnerja-ime-izdelava naredi drugače v načinu. Z `replicas: 1` vozlišče se samo oglašuje samo zase, zato je naslov zankaback grozda neodvisen od načina; nadaljevanje HA ga ponovno obravnava."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`compose build` re-bakes the static output whenever the cloned content changes, so deploys are content-driven without any runtime build step."
msgstr "`compose build` ponovno zavre statični izhod vsakič, ko se klonirana vsebina spremeni, zato se razporedi na vsebino, ne da bi prišlo do graditve časa delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`compose.cache-consumer.yml.j2`, `apt.list.j2`, `npmrc.j2` and `pip.conf.j2` under `templates/`, and the shell scripts under `files/`, belong to the development compose stack, which drives them through [render.py](../../utils/cache/render.py) and [compose.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/compose.py). The Ansible deployment reads none of them."
msgstr "`compose.cache-consumer.yml.j2`, `apt.list.j2`, `npmrc.j2` ter `pip.conf.j2` pod `templates/`, in lupinske skripte pod `files/`, pripadajo razvoj sklada, ki jih poganja skozi [render.py](../../utils/cache/render.py) ter [compose.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/compose.py). Nevidna razporeditev ne bere nobene od njih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
