# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`config.access_grants: []`, administrator-only rather than public"
msgstr "`config.access_grants: []`, samo administrator in ne javni"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`config` (optional) is an opaque, role-interpreted mapping holding the addon's full runtime configuration payload (e.g. Nextcloud `occ config:app` key/value sets, OIDC provider blocks). Lint MUST NOT constrain its inner shape beyond requiring a mapping; only the owning role's tasks read it. Secrets inside `config` MUST resolve through `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` and MUST NOT be inlined literally. Lint enforces this with a bounded heuristic: any `config` value whose key matches a secret-name pattern (`*secret*`, `*password*`, `*token*`, `*client_secret*`, `*api_key*`, case-insensitive) MUST be a `lookup(..., 'credentials.<name>')` expression; a bare literal under such a key fails lint."
msgstr "`config` (neobvezno) je neprozorno, interpretirano kartiranje, ki ima koristni tovor addona za celoten delovni čas (npr. naslednji oblak `occ config:app` nabori ključev/vrednosti, bloki izvajalca OIDC). Lint ne sme ovirati svoje notranje oblike, razen da zahteva kartiranje; samo naloge lastne vloge ga preberite. Skrivnosti znotraj `config` ZAGOTAVLJANJE `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` in NE SME biti dobesedno povezan. Lint uveljavlja to z omejeno hevristično: vsak `config` vrednost, katere ključ se ujema z vzorcem skrivnega imena (`*secret*`, `*password*`, `*token*`, `*client_secret*`, `*api_key*`, neobčutljivi za primere) Mora biti `lookup(..., 'credentials.<name>')` izraz; golo dobesedno pod takim ključem spodleti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`container system prune -a -f` to remove unused Docker resources."
msgstr "`container system prune -a -f` odstraniti neporabljene vire zdravila Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`container.py` is a **general-purpose Docker wrapper CLI** installed as:"
msgstr "`container.py` a **za splošno uporabo Docker ovitek CLI** nameščen kot:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`container.py` is the single failure-diagnostics entry point. The CI workflows (compose + swarm) call it once on the runner when a job fails; it captures the current level and then recurses itself through every Docker-in-Docker boundary, so one call collects evidence from the outermost runner down to the innermost application container. It always exits 1."
msgstr "`container.py` je vstopna točka za napako. Delovni tokovi CI (compose + roj) Poklici jo enkrat na tekača, ko delo ne uspe; zajame trenutno raven in se nato ponovi skozi vsako mejo Docker-in-Docker, tako da en klic zbira dokaze od najbolj oddaljenega tekača navzdol do najbolj notranjega vsebnika za uporabo. Vedno odide. 1."

