msgstr "`n8n <https://n8n.io/>`__ je platforma za avtomatizacijo odprtokodnega delovnega toka. Povežite storitve, preoblikujte podatke in gradite integracije z uporabo vizualnega urejevalnika nizke kode ali uporabniških vozlišč JavaScript/Python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`n8n_workflow`: a checked-in workflow with a stable ownership marker, explicit input schema, explicit connected tools, and a bearer-protected trigger;"
msgstr "`n8n_workflow`: preverjen delovni tok s stabilnim označevalcem lastništva, eksplicitno vhodno shemo, eksplicitno povezanimi orodji in prinosno zaščitenim sprožilcem;"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`name.sh` resolves the concrete repository name once for callers It prefers explicit env overrides (`INFINITO_IMAGE_REPOSITORY`, `REPO_PREFIX`) before GitHub or git metadata."
msgstr "`name.sh` reši ime skladišča za klicatelje Raje ima eksplicitne prednosti. (`INFINITO_IMAGE_REPOSITORY`, `REPO_PREFIX`) pred GitHubom ali metapodatki git."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`name`: unique mapping id"
msgstr "`name`: edinstven identifikator kartiranja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`named_query`: checked-in parameterized read queries or views through an application-specific read-only database principal, never arbitrary SQL;"
msgstr "`named_query`: preverjeno-v parameteriziranih poizvedbe ali pogledi skozi aplikacijsko-specifično zbirko podatkov, ki se uporablja samo za branje, nikoli poljubno SQL;"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`network_role_id`: the role whose network to create. Name and subnet are derived from it."
msgstr "`network_role_id`: vloga, katere omrežje ustvariti. Ime in podmreža izvirata iz nje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`networks:` is a top-level section of each role's `meta/server.yml`. The file-root convention applies: there is no wrapping `server:` key, and the file content IS `applications.<app>.server`."
msgstr "`networks:` je najvišji del vsake vloge `meta/server.yml`. Velja konvencija o korenu datoteke: ni ovoja `server:` ključ in vsebina datoteke IS `applications.<app>.server`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`nftables <https://www.netfilter.org/projects/nftables/>`__ is the packet filtering framework of the Linux kernel and the successor to ``iptables``. Its rules live in memory: a reboot drops them unless something loads them again."
msgstr "`nftables <https://www.netfilter.org/projects/nftables/>`__ je okvir za filtriranje paketov jedra Linux in naslednika ``iptables``. Njena pravila živijo v spominu: ponovni zagon jih spusti, razen če jih nekaj naloži znova."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`no-reply` user's `web-app-mailu` token, else empty string"
msgstr "`no-reply` uporabnik `web-app-mailu` žeton, sicer prazen niz"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`noqa` and `nocheck` are case-insensitive synonyms in the parser. Every project rule MUST use `nocheck:` because `# noqa: <code>` is also parsed by ruff as a flake8 directive and warns on non-flake8 keys. Reserve `noqa:` for real flake8 / ruff codes (`E402`, `F401`, …). [test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py](../../../../tests/lint/filesystem/python/test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py) hard-rejects `# noqa: <code>` whose codes do not match `[A-Z]+\\d+`."
msgstr "`noqa` ter `nocheck` so sinonimi v razčlenjevalniku brez primere. Vsako pravilo projekta MORA uporabljati `nocheck:` ker `# noqa: <code>` je tudi razčlenjen z ruff kot kosmiči8 direktiva in opozarja na neblago8 Ključi. Rezerva `noqa:` za prave kosmiče8 / ruff kode (`E402`, `F401`, ...). [test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py](../../../../tests/lint/filesystem/python/test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py) trdovratni odpadki `# noqa: <code>` katerih kode se ne ujemajo `[A-Z]+\\d+`."

