# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`oidc-authenticator` and `ldap-authenticator` are mutually exclusive auth backends (only one may be enabled; see [`tasks/01_validation.yml`](./tasks/01_validation.yml)), each deriving its enablement from its bridged service flag. The OIDC/LDAP runtime configuration (provider URLs, bind DN, secrets) lives in the XWiki property templates and is read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`; the addon `config:` carries only the installer coordinate."
msgstr "`oidc-authenticator` ter `ldap-authenticator` so medsebojno izključujoče varnostne hrbtenice (omogočen je lahko samo eden; glej [`tasks/01_validation.yml`](./tasks/01_validation.yml)), vsak izhaja iz svoje premostitvene storitvene zastave. Nastavitve časa delovanja OIDC/LDAP (URL-ji ponudnika, vezaj DN, skrivnosti) živi v XWiki predloge nepremičnin in se bere preko `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`; addon; `config:` nosi samo koordinate monterja."

