# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`openai_conversation/config_flow.py` contains no `base_url` (0 matches), so the OpenAI agent cannot be pointed anywhere but the vendor. The only configurable local path is the separate `ollama` integration, whose `config_flow.py` carries `CONF_URL` (7 matches) but speaks Ollama's native API rather than the gateway's OpenAI-compatible surface"
msgstr "`openai_conversation/config_flow.py` vsebuje do `base_url` (0 Ujemanje), Tako da OpenAI agent ne more biti postavljen nikjer drugje kot prodajalec. Edina možna lokalna pot je ločena `ollama` integracija, katerih `config_flow.py` Nosi `CONF_URL` (7 Ujemanje) ampak govori. Ollamaje domorodna API Namesto površine, ki je združljiva s prehodom OpenAI"

