# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`playwright.config.js` MUST remain centralized in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/` and `package.json` in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/templates/package.json.j2` (rendered per-deploy into the staging dir). You MUST NOT duplicate or override either per role."
msgstr "`playwright.config.js` MORAJO ostati centralizirani v `roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/` ter `package.json` v `roles/test-e2e-playwright/templates/package.json.j2` (vstavljen per-deploy v poševni dir). Ne smete podvajati ali prevladati niti na vlogo."

