msgstr "`proxy.conf`: sistemski spust za `docker.service`. Sets `HTTP_PROXY`/`HTTPS_PROXY` pooblaščencu in registrih [registry-ca.sh](../../scripts/docker/cache/registry-ca.sh) kot `ExecStartPre`."

