msgstr "`pull_policy` – roj ga zavrne kot \"Dodatna lastnost pull_policy ni dovoljeno\" (Podaljšek, ki se uporablja samo za komponiranje)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`pull_request` / `pull_request_target`: fires on PR lifecycle events (`opened`, `synchronize`, `reopened`, `ready_for_review`, `closed`, `converted_to_draft`). The `_target` variant runs with the base-branch secrets and is used to grant fork PRs controlled access to privileged steps."
msgstr "`pull_request` / `pull_request_target`: požari na dogodkih v življenjskem ciklu PR (`opened`, `synchronize`, `reopened`, `ready_for_review`, `closed`, `converted_to_draft`). O `_target` varianta deluje z osnovnimi skrivnostmi in se uporablja za zagotavljanje dostopa do privilegiranih korakov, ki so nadzorovani z vilicami."

