msgstr "`sandbox.network`: odhodni klici MORAJO iti do gostiteljev, ki se ujemajo `allowedDomains`. Priključki Unix-socket so dovoljeni samo, če `allowAllUnixSockets: true`; poslušanje v lokalnih pristaniščih je dovoljeno le, če `allowLocalBinding: true`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`schedule`: cron-based periodic runs (UTC)."
msgstr "`schedule`: periodični poteki na podlagi cron (UTC)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`scope.sh` resolves whether a Pull Request is agents-only, documentation-only, or full scope"
msgstr "`scope.sh` odloči, ali je zahteva za vlečenje samo agenti, dokumentacija, ali celoten obseg"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`scripts/install/package.sh` builds and installs the local package for the current distro (Arch, Debian/Ubuntu, Fedora), so dependency resolution is performed by the distro package manager from package metadata."
msgstr "`scripts/install/package.sh` gradi in namesti lokalni paket za trenutno distro (Arch, Debian/Ubuntu, Fedora), tako rešitev odvisnosti izvaja distro paket upravitelj iz metapodatkov paketa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` waits for fork PRs until all required mirror images are available in GHCR before letting the deploy tests proceed. This is necessary because fork PRs cannot push images themselves; the `pull_request_target` event handles that."
msgstr "`scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` čaka na vilice PR, dokler vse zahtevane zrcalne slike so na voljo v GHCR, preden pustite, da izvajajo teste. To je potrebno, ker vilice PR ne morejo potiskati slike same; `pull_request_target` dogodek to ureja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/container.sh` is a direct-entry shell script example."
msgstr "`scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/container.sh` je neposredno vstop lupinski scenarij primer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh` serves a kind only when the **host kernel** carries it: `zfs` needs `/dev/zfs` or a `modinfo zfs` hit, the others need an entry in `/proc/filesystems` or a module. The distro images carry only the userland (`scripts/install/filesystem.sh`)."
msgstr "`scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh` služi samo, če **jedro gostitelja** nosi: `zfs` potrebe `/dev/zfs` ali a `modinfo zfs` hit, drugi potrebujejo vstop v `/proc/filesystems` ali modul. Distro slike nosijo samo uporabniško deželo (`scripts/install/filesystem.sh`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`secrets.credentials.*` paths are populated by `apply_schema()` at `applications.<app>.secrets.credentials.<…>`, so the credential file obeys the same file-root rule as every other `meta/<topic>.yml`."
msgstr "`secrets.credentials.*` poti so naseljene z `apply_schema()` na dan `applications.<app>.secrets.credentials.<…>`, tako da zapisna datoteka upošteva isto pravilo datotečne korenine kot vse druge `meta/<topic>.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`selection.sh` requires the caller to supply the application set explicitly."
msgstr "`selection.sh` zahteva od klicatelja, da izrecno predloži nastavljeno aplikacijo."

