# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`start_interval` is the cadence while `start_period` is still running. Without it a probe only fires every `interval`, so a service ready after three seconds is reported healthy at the next tick -- 30s, or a minute for the curl flavors -- and a stack converges no faster than its slowest quantisation. It changes when the same probe runs, never what it tests."
msgstr "`start_interval` je kadenca, medtem ko `start_period` še vedno teče. Brez nje sonda strelja le na vse. `interval`, tako da je storitev pripravljena po treh sekundah se poroča zdravo ob naslednjem tik -- 30s, ali minuto za okuse kodre -- in sklad se približuje nič hitreje od svoje najpočasnejše kvantizacije. Ko teče ista sonda, se spremeni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`start_period` therefore bounds it: once the window closes the cadence falls back to `interval`, so a service that becomes ready just after the window pays a full tick anyway. The window has to outlast a realistic boot, not merely a fast one, which is why it is measured in minutes rather than sized to `interval`. It costs nothing while the container works, only the time until a broken one is called unhealthy."
msgstr "`start_period` Zato ga veže: ko okno zapre kadenco pade nazaj `interval`, torej storitev, ki postane pripravljena takoj po oknu plača polno klop. Okno mora prestati realistični škorenj, ne samo hiter, zato se meri v minutah, ne pa velikosti, da `interval`Nič ne stane, dokler posoda ne dela."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`stdio_only`, not `hosted_only`. The audit of `discourse/discourse-mcp` at `v0.3.1` closed the sidecar path: ownership, licence, pinning and read-only default pass, but the HTTP transport serves one session per process. Nothing is enabled until upstream supports concurrent sessions."
msgstr "`stdio_only`, ne `hosted_only`. Revizija `discourse/discourse-mcp` na dan `v0.3.1` zaprl bočno pot: lastništvo, licenca, pinning in samo branje privzeto prepustnico, vendar HTTP transport služi eno sejo na proces. Nič ni omogočeno, dokler ne podpre sočasne seje."

