msgid "`svc-ai-agent-broker/meta/services.yml` carries under `agent-broker.agents`:"
msgstr "`svc-ai-agent-broker/meta/services.yml` prenosi pod `agent-broker.agents`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-ai-litellm` already serves an OpenAI-compatible gateway, and `web-app-nextcloud` already binds its `integration_openai` app to that gateway through `tasks/addons/integration_openai.yml`, a `credentials.litellm_api_key` entry and a dedicated Playwright spec. That pattern is implemented once and is not required, described or verified for any other role."
msgstr "`svc-ai-litellm` že služi OpenAI-združljiv prehod, in `web-app-nextcloud` že veže svoje `integration_openai` aplikacija na ta prehod skozi `tasks/addons/integration_openai.yml`, a `credentials.litellm_api_key` Vnos in namenski Playwright spec. Ta vzorec se izvaja enkrat in ni potreben, opisan ali preverjen za nobeno drugo vlogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-ai-litellm` pulls `svc-ai-ollama` and `svc-ai-lmstudio` with it, so a consumer that enables the gateway adds roughly 6 GB to its round. Variant 0 is the fallback every higher round lands on, so a heavy shared dependency pinned there appears in every round: with the gateway on variant 0 of `web-app-matrix`, `web-app-mattermost` and `web-app-zammad`, the `web-app-nextcloud` rounds that pin those partners exceed the 64 GB budget guarded by `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_resource_budget.py`."
msgstr "`svc-ai-litellm` vleče `svc-ai-ollama` ter `svc-ai-lmstudio` z njim, tako potrošnik, ki omogoča prehod doda približno 6 GB na krog. Varianta 0 je zaledje vseh višjih zemljišč na, tako da se v vsakem krogu pojavi težka skupna odvisnost: s prehodom na varianto 0 o `web-app-matrix`, `web-app-mattermost` ter `web-app-zammad`, `web-app-nextcloud` krogi, ki pin ti partnerji presegajo 64 Proračun GB, ki ga varuje `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_resource_budget.py`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-ai-mcp-adapter` carries no MCP surface of its own. It is the adapter runtime a provider role instantiates, so its disposition is `enabler` and it never appears in discovery as a provider or a consumer."
msgstr "`svc-ai-mcp-adapter` ne nosi lastne površine MCP. To je adapter čas delovanja ponudnik vlogo takoj, zato je njegova razporeditev `enabler` in nikoli se ne pojavi kot ponudnik ali potrošnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-ai-mcp-adapter` validates the platform's OIDC access token, so an adapter-backed provider is the one surface that can declare `auth: oidc` with `auth_subject: user`. Only Open WebUI can consume it:"
msgstr "`svc-ai-mcp-adapter` potrdi dostop platforme OIDC žeton, tako da je adapter-backed ponudnik edina površina, ki lahko razglasi `auth: oidc` z `auth_subject: user`. Samo . Open WebUI ga lahko porabite:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-ai-robot` stays out of the platform list. It runs the same agent in embodied mode, which means it drops the isolating runtime on purpose and hands the container the host devices it is meant to drive. A broker platform is defined by the opposite: `runsc`, no host device, no host mount. Serving an embodied agent per user would either break that invariant or ship a robot that cannot reach its hardware."
msgstr "`svc-ai-robot` ne sme biti na seznamu platform. Poganja isto sredstvo v utelešenem načinu, kar pomeni, da namenoma spusti izolacijski čas delovanja in izroči posodo gostiteljskim napravam, ki naj bi jih vozil. Platforma posrednika je opredeljena z nasprotno: `runsc`, Ni gostitelja, ni gostitelja. Služiti utelešenemu agentu na uporabnika bi ali zlomilo to spremenljivko ali pa odneslo robota, ki ne more doseči svoje strojne opreme."

