# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-dns-unbound` is a single-service, single-network, static-IP, pinned role. mailu's services drop their own unbound + static IP, attach to the `svc-dns-unbound` network, and point `dns:` at its static IP. The static-IP allocation therefore lives in a trivial 1-service stack (no deadlock) instead of mailu's 13-service / 4-network stack. mailu also stops embedding redis (uses central) -> fewer services -> less VIP pressure."
msgstr "`svc-dns-unbound` je enostoritvena, enomrežna, statična-IP, podprta vloga. mailu storitve spusti svojo lastno nevezano + statično IP, priključen na `svc-dns-unbound` omrežje in točka `dns:` na svojem statičnem IP. Dodelitev statičnih IP torej živi v nepomembnem položaju 1- kup storitev (Brez zastoja.) namesto mailujeve 13-storitev / 4- Omrežje. mailu tudi preneha vgrajevati redis (uporablja centralno) -> manj storitev -> manj VIP pritiska."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-runner` provisions one or more GitHub Actions self-hosted runner instances on a dedicated machine. Each instance is an isolated unit with its own Docker volume, network subnet, and systemd service. The role interacts with the GitHub API (`gh api`) at deploy time to fetch registration tokens — it does **not** store long-lived credentials."
msgstr "`svc-runner` določbe eden ali več GitHub Dejanja samogostiteljskih primerov na namenskem stroju. Vsak primerek je izolirana enota z lastno Docker prostornino, omrežjem in sistemsko storitvijo. Vloga sodeluje z GitHubom API (`gh api`) ob času uporabe za pridobitev registracijskih žetonov – to počne **ni** shranjevanje dolgoživih poverilnic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/00_core.yml` reads `container info --format DefaultRuntime` and refuses `runc` **before** labelling the node, so the label never promises what the node cannot deliver"
msgstr "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/00_core.yml` bere `container info --format DefaultRuntime` in zavrne `runc` **Pred uporabo** označevanje vozlišča, zato nalepka nikoli ne obljublja tistega, česar vozlišče ne more zagotoviti."

