# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_inline_multiline_sql.py` caps inline multi-line SQL in Ansible tasks at three lines. Larger statements MUST live in a dedicated `.sql` file under the role's `files/` directory and be loaded explicitly so linters, formatters, and database tooling can operate on them."
msgstr "`test_no_inline_multiline_sql.py` večvrstični SQL na treh linijah. Večje izjave MORAJO živeti v posvečenem `.sql` datoteka pod vlogo `files/` imenik in se naložijo izrecno tako, da lahko na njih delujejo linters, formateries, in podatkovna zbirka orodja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_jinja_default_on_spot_path.py` forbids `| default(...)` on Jinja expressions whose path resolves via `group_vars/all/*.yml`. Those keys are loaded unconditionally, so the default is dead code at best and silent SPOT decoupling at worst. Per-line suppression: `# nocheck: spot-default`."
msgstr "`test_no_jinja_default_on_spot_path.py` prepoveduje `| default(...)` o izrazih Jinja, katerih pot se rešuje preko `group_vars/all/*.yml`. Ti ključi so naloženi brezpogojno, tako da je privzeta mrtva koda v najboljšem primeru in tiho SPOT nevezanost v najslabšem primeru. Zatiranje na linijo: `# nocheck: spot-default`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_legacy_get_url_module_usage.py` forbids the unqualified `get_url:` module name; tasks MUST use `ansible.builtin.get_url`."
msgstr "`test_no_legacy_get_url_module_usage.py` prepoveduje nekvalificirane `get_url:` ime modula; opravila MORAJO uporabljati `ansible.builtin.get_url`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_legacy_uri_module_usage.py` forbids the unqualified `uri:` module name; tasks MUST use `ansible.builtin.uri`."
msgstr "`test_no_legacy_uri_module_usage.py` prepoveduje nekvalificirane `uri:` ime modula; opravila MORAJO uporabljati `ansible.builtin.uri`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_literal_no_log.py` forbids literal `no_log: true` / `no_log: false`; every gate MUST flow through the `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` variable."
msgstr "`test_no_literal_no_log.py` prepoveduje dobesedno `no_log: true` / `no_log: false`; vsaka vrata MORAjo teči skozi `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` spremenljivka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_lookup_config_jinja_default.py` forbids `lookup('config', application_id, 'path') | default(X)`. The two-term `config` lookup raises on a missing key, so the Jinja `default(...)` filter never fires; the fallback MUST be passed as the lookup's third argument instead."
msgstr "`test_no_lookup_config_jinja_default.py` prepoveduje `lookup('config', application_id, 'path') | default(X)`- Dvojno. `config` išče dvigne na manjkajočem ključu, tako da Jinja `default(...)` filter nikoli ne strelja; rezervni odgovor mora biti sprejet kot tretji argument vpogleda namesto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_redundant_default_on_module_io.py` forbids `| default(...)` on a task's own `register:` output or input arguments inside its own conditionals, where the value is provably set."
msgstr "`test_no_redundant_default_on_module_io.py` prepoveduje `| default(...)` sama naloga. `register:` izhodne ali vhodne argumente znotraj lastnih pogojev, kjer je vrednost pravilno nastavljena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_sh_lc_pipefail.py` requires that every `sh -lc '...'` invocation containing a `|` pipeline starts with `set -o pipefail`, so failures mid-pipeline propagate."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_lc_pipefail.py` zahteva, da vsak `sh -lc '...'` sprožitev, ki vsebuje `|` cevovod se začne z `set -o pipefail`, tako da napake srednji dupline razmnoževanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` requires that Ansible `shell:` tasks stay on Bash and use Bash's `set -o pipefail` form, not the POSIX-`sh` workaround."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` zahteva, da Ansible `shell:` naloge ostanejo na Bash in uporabite Bash's `set -o pipefail` oblika, ne POSIX-`sh` Raziskujem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`test_role_and_group_vars_used.py` scans top-level keys of `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` and `group_vars/**/*.yml` against every project `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` file. The suppression rule key is `unused-var` (see [suppression.md](../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."
msgstr "`test_role_and_group_vars_used.py` skenira zgornje tipke `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` ter `group_vars/**/*.yml` proti vsakemu projektu `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` Datoteka. Ključ pravila za zatiranje je `unused-var` (glej [suppression.md](../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_run_once_tags.py` requires that every `set_fact` marked `run_once: true` carries the canonical run-once tags so re-runs and `--tags` filters keep the fact populated."
msgstr "`test_run_once_tags.py` zahteva, da vsak `set_fact` označeno `run_once: true` nosi kanonične oznake za enkratni zagon, tako da ponovi in `--tags` Filtri ohranjajo dejstvo poseljeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_sed_escape.py` requires that any Jinja-templated replacement passed to `sed` flows through the `sed_escape` filter so substitutions with regex metacharacters land literally."
msgstr "`test_sed_escape.py` zahteva, da vsaka Jinja-templirana zamenjava preide na `sed` teče skozi `sed_escape` Filtrirajte tako, da zamenjave z regeks metaznakterji dobesedno pristanejo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_service_shared_consistency.py` enforces that every service whose `meta/services.yml` entry marks it `shared: true` exposes the required role-side bindings, and the inverse: a role consuming the shared form MUST declare the corresponding flag in its `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "`test_service_shared_consistency.py` uveljavlja, da vsaka služba, katere `meta/services.yml` Vstopne oznake. `shared: true` izpostavlja zahtevane obveznosti na strani vlog in obratno: vloga, ki uporablja skupno obliko, MORA razglasiti ustrezno zastavo v svoji `meta/services.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_vars_usage_in_yaml.py` scans task-level `vars:` blocks against the same consumer set. The two scanners never overlap because their declaration shapes differ."
msgstr "`test_vars_usage_in_yaml.py` pregleda stopnjo opravila `vars:` blokira isti nabor potrošnikov. Skenerja se nikoli ne prekrivata, ker se njuni obliki deklaracije razlikujeta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tests/lint/...`                           collision/band checks"
msgstr "`tests/lint/...` trk/preverjanje pasu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_unpinned_no_engine_volume.py` stays as the guard: an unpinned role must not declare an engine on-disk data volume."
msgstr "`tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_unpinned_no_engine_volume.py` ostane kot varovalo: nevezana vloga ne sme razglasiti količine podatkov o motorju na disku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tls.py`/`tls_common`: onion branch + app-level flavor override + unit tests."
msgstr "`tls.py`/`tls_common`: čebulna veja + app-nivo arome prevlada + preskusi enote."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tls` reads `external` and `TLS_ENABLED`."
msgstr "`tls` bere `external` ter `TLS_ENABLED`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tool_objectfs` object-file-storage plugin"
msgstr "`tool_objectfs` vstavek za shranjevanje datotek predmeta"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tools/list` returns 10 tools: entity control (`HassTurnOn`, `HassTurnOff`), timers, broadcast, to-do list read and write, date and time, and `GetLiveContext` for the current state."
msgstr "`tools/list` vrne 10 orodja: nadzor subjekta (`HassTurnOn`, `HassTurnOff`), čas, oddajanje, seznam opravil branje in pisanje, datum in čas, in `GetLiveContext` za trenutno stanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` MUST default to `streamable_http` for server deployments. Stdio MAY exist only for local development and MUST NOT be enabled in a deployed web role by default."
msgstr "`transport` MORAJO privzeto `streamable_http` za uporabo strežnikov. Stidio MAY obstaja samo za lokalni razvoj in NE sme biti omogočen v privzeti spletni vlogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` accepts `streamable_http` and `sse` only. A stdio MCP server is a local process the client spawns, so it inherits the client container's filesystem and network with no endpoint to authenticate, no proxy to route through, and nothing for a probe to reach. Every property the other rules rely on (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) is undefined for it. Clients that support stdio are pinned away from it in their own role: Flowise sets `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` so no flow can spawn a command."
msgstr "`transport` sprejme `streamable_http` ter `sse` Samo. Strežnik stdio MCP je lokalni proces, ki ga odjemalec drsti, tako da podeduje datotečni sistem in omrežje odjemalca brez končne točke za avtentikacijo, brez posrednika za prehod skozi, in ničesar, kar bi sonda dosegla. Vsaka nepremičnina, na katero se zanesejo druga pravila. (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) je neopredeljeno za to. Stranke, ki podpirajo stdio, so v svoji vlogi: Flowise sets `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` Tako da noben tok ne more povzročiti ukaza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` (case-insensitive)"
msgstr "`true` (neobčutljiva na velikost črk)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` = baseline install contract: always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. Also gates install-failure: a failed `required: true` addon hard-fails the play; a failed `required: false` addon warns, is skipped, and the play continues."
msgstr "`true` = osnovna pogodba o namestitvi: vedno nameščena, LAHKO izpusti `enabled`, NE SME nastaviti `enabled: false`. Tudi vrata namestitev-neuspeh: a ni uspelo `required: true` addon težko odpove igro; a neuspešen `required: false` Addon opozarja, je preskočil, in igra se nadaljuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` if the host is in the `web-app-mailu` group, else `false`"
msgstr "`true` če je gostitelj v `web-app-mailu` skupina, drugo `false`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` or `false`; appends `--debug` when true"
msgstr "`true` ali `false`; priloge `--debug` kadar je res"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` stops an agent after `idle_minutes` without a request; `false` keeps it running"
msgstr "`true` prekine zdravljenje z zdravilom po `idle_minutes` brez zahteve; `false` Naj teče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` to allow update PRs (workflow-driven and Dependabot)"
msgstr "`true` omogočiti posodobitev PR (delovni tok in odvisnik)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` to keep them for every test (passing runs included); the workflow forwards it as `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP`"
msgstr "`true` da jih obdrži za vsak test. (vključeni preleti); potek dela naprej kot `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` to machine-translate the entries a PR leaves empty or fuzzy, one PR per language"
msgstr "`true` za strojno prevajanje vnosov PR pusti prazno ali puhasto, en PR na jezik"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` to run CI on `main` pushes too"
msgstr "`true` za zagon KI `main` Potisni preveč"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`type:` and `regex:` are enforced by `validate_supplied_value()` in [inventory.py](../../../../../utils/manager/inventory.py) at inventory-creation time, on every path where a value arrives from outside:"
msgstr "`type:` ter `regex:` se izvajajo z `validate_supplied_value()` v [inventory.py](../../../../../utils/manager/inventory.py) v času inventarja-ustvarjanja na vsaki poti, kjer vrednost prispe od zunaj:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`type:` and `regex:` hold an operator-supplied value to the shape the schema declares; a generated one is exempt because the algorithm that produced it is named by the same schema."
msgstr "`type:` ter `regex:` imajo vrednost, ki jo zagotovi operator, za obliko, ki jo shema izjavlja; ustvarjena vrednost je izvzeta, ker je algoritem, ki jo je izdelal, poimenovan po isti shemi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`type` is one of `openapi_allowlist`, `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix`, `prometheus_readonly`, `n8n_workflow`, `resource_readonly`. `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix` and `resource_readonly` additionally require a non-empty `adapter.scope` naming the exact buckets, prefixes, collections or queries reachable. `openapi_allowlist` and `graphql_allowlist` require a checked-in `specification_path` under the role's own `files/`."
msgstr "`type` je eden od `openapi_allowlist`, `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix`, `prometheus_readonly`, `n8n_workflow`, `resource_readonly`. `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix` ter `resource_readonly` dodatno zahtevajo neprazno `adapter.scope` poimenovanje natančnih veder, predpon, zbirk ali poizvedb dosegljivih. `openapi_allowlist` ter `graphql_allowlist` zahteva prijavo `specification_path` pod lastno vlogo `files/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`unreviewed_third_party`, not `hosted_only`. The review ran and selected no module; re-review if Odoo SA or the OCA publishes a server."
msgstr "`unreviewed_third_party`, ne `hosted_only`. Pregled tekel in izbran ni modul; ponovni pregled, če Odoo SA ali OCA objavi strežnik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`update/` reuses the already-initialized inventory."
msgstr "`update/` ponovno uporabi že začet inventar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`update` (optional) controls live upstream monitoring. `update.monitored` defaults to `false`; `update.catalog` MUST name a supported external-test catalog adapter; `update.upstream_id` defaults to `<addon_id>`."
msgstr "`update` (neobvezno) nadzor na začetku dobavne verige. `update.monitored` privzeto za `false`; `update.catalog` MORATE poimenovati podprt zunanji testni katalog adapter; `update.upstream_id` privzeto za `<addon_id>`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`update` reuses the existing inventory; `disable` reaches ansible as an extra-var that renders services disabled, but does not touch the include."
msgstr "`update` ponovno uporabi obstoječi popis; `disable` doseže lahko kot dodatno vrednost, zaradi katere so storitve onemogočene, vendar se ne dotika med drugim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`upstreams.conf.j2 <./templates/upstreams.conf.j2>`__ is rendered to the host and mounted into the frontend as ``conf.d/upstreams.conf``. Its content comes from the ``cache:`` sections of the roles’ ``meta/networks.yml``, so no hostname, repository or upstream URL is written in this role."
msgstr "`upstreams.conf.j2 <./templates/upstreams.conf.j2>`__ je narejena gostitelju in nameščena v ospredje kot ``conf.d/upstreams.conf``. Njegova vsebina prihaja iz ``cache:`` oddelki vlog“ ``meta/networks.yml``, tako da v tej vlogi ni napisano ime gostitelja, odložišče ali URL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`upstreams.conf`: nginx server-blocks, generated from the `cache:` declarations by [render.py](../../utils/cache/render.py) and therefore untracked. HTTPS (port 443) per hostname for runner-side traffic, HTTP (port 80) for inner-`dockerd` Dockerfile builds. Bind-mounted at `/etc/nginx/conf.d/upstreams.conf`."
msgstr "`upstreams.conf`: ginx strežnik-bloki, ustvarjen iz `cache:` izjave [render.py](../../utils/cache/render.py) in zato neopazno. HTTPS (pristanišče 443) na ime gostitelja za promet ob progi, HTTP (pristanišče 80) za notranje`dockerd` Dockerfile gradi. Zvezano na `/etc/nginx/conf.d/upstreams.conf`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`user_username` is resolved from `lookup('users', user_key).username` (fallback: `user_key`)"
msgstr "`user_username` je odpravljen `lookup('users', user_key).username` (rezervno: `user_key`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`username` reads `from`."
msgstr "`username` bere `from`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.authorized_keys` (list; may be empty)"
msgstr "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.authorized_keys` (seznam; lahko je prazen)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.groups` (list)"
msgstr "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.groups` (seznam)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.username` (defaults to WORKSTATION_USER if missing)"
msgstr "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.username` (privzeto za WORKSTATION_USER če manjka)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`users` lookup 👥"
msgstr "`users` iskanje 👥"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils.cache.base._render_with_templar` and the two templar helpers behind it swallow every exception on purpose: a meta payload renders in rounds, and an expression that cannot resolve yet has to come back unchanged rather than abort the round."
msgstr "`utils.cache.base._render_with_templar` in dva templarjeva pomočnika, ki stojita za njim, namenoma pogoltneta vsako izjemo: meta tovor služi v krogih, in izraz, ki se še ne more rešiti, se mora vrniti nespremenjen, namesto da bi prekinil krog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils.cache.records` owns the format and the mirror resolution, so the role's bootstrap task and this key cannot drift apart."
msgstr "`utils.cache.records` Je lastnik formata in zrcalne ločljivosti, tako da naloga vloge boottrap in ta ključ ne more odtavati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils.inventory.bundle_apps` reads each named bundle, walks `all.children`, deduplicates the role groups across all bundles, and prints the resulting application list as CSV. The CSV is exported as `apps` before the delegated script runs."
msgstr "`utils.inventory.bundle_apps` bere vsak po imenu snop, hodi `all.children`, deduplira skupine vlog po vseh svežnjih in natisne nastali seznam programov kot CSV. CSV se izvaža kot `apps` pred prenesenim scenarijem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name` maps a role / application_id to its compose entity name (the longest matching category prefix stripped). The purge orchestrators need the inverse: given an entity name, which application_ids belong to it? This helper walks the roles directory and returns that mapping."
msgstr "`utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name` zemljevidov vloge / application_id ime komponiranega subjekta (Najdaljša ujemajoča se predpona kategorije je odstranjena). Orkesterji čistilcev potrebujejo obratno: glede na ime subjekta, ki application_ids Pripadaš temu? Ta pomočnik hodi imenik vlog in vrne, da kartiranje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils/docker/image/discovery.py` discovers all role images via `iter_role_images()`. See [origin.md](origin.md) for the declaration format and supported registries."
msgstr "`utils/docker/image/discovery.py` odkrije vse slike vlog preko `iter_role_images()`. Glej [origin.md](origin.md) za obliko deklaracije in podprte registre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils/docker/image/discovery.py` scans every `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` and yields `ImageRef` objects for each top-level service entry that carries both `image` and `version`."
msgstr "`utils/docker/image/discovery.py` pregleda vsako `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` in donosi `ImageRef` predmeti za vsak najvišji vnos storitev, ki ima oboje `image` ter `version`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`validation.min_length` is declared in many role schemas but enforced nowhere. Do not read it as a guarantee."
msgstr "`validation.min_length` je deklariran v mnogih shemah vlog, vendar se izvaja nikjer. Ne berite ga kot zagotovilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`variants=None` returns the plan unchanged (full-matrix mode). This is the runner-split entry point: a role with more variants than one runner should iterate is sliced into bundles (e.g. ``0,1,2`` on one runner and ``3,4`` on the next), each bundle passed as `variants`. Out-of-range indices raise `ValueError` so the caller surfaces a clean operator error."
msgstr "`variants=None` vrne nespremenjen načrt (Način polne matrike). To je tekaško razdeljena vstopna točka: vloga z več variantami kot en tekač, če je iterat narezan na svežnje (Npr. ``0,1,2`` na enega tekača in ``3,4`` na naslednjem), vsak paket prenese kot `variants`. Izven dosega indeksov povečanje `ValueError` tako da klicatelj nakaže čisto napako upravljavca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`version` (optional) MUST be a string. `\"\"` means \"track the app's default\". A concrete pin MUST be a string, never an unquoted number."
msgstr "`version` (neobvezno) Mora biti struna. `\"\"` sredstva \"spremlja privzeto aplikacijo\". Betonski pin mora biti struna, nikoli necitirano število."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`version` MUST be the tag."
msgstr "`version` Mora biti oznaka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`vlc` (media player with Blu-ray support)"
msgstr "`vlc` (medijski predvajalnik s podporo Blu-ray)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-*` for end-user applications"
msgstr "`web-app-*` za aplikacije končnega uporabnika"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-akaunting` — Laravel controller shim (stage shim into the named volume on every deploy)"
msgstr "`web-app-akaunting` – Laravel krmilnik šim (oder šim v imenovano glasnost na vsaki uporabi)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-atmo` role layout"
msgstr "`web-app-atmo` razporeditev vlog"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-baserow` is the one row measured against the pinned source rather than a running instance. Confirm it on the deployed stack with `POST /api/database/fields/<field_id>/generate-ai-field-values/` as the seeded superuser: an unlicensed instance answers HTTP 402."
msgstr "`web-app-baserow` je ena vrstica, ki se meri glede na pripet vir, ne pa na tekoči primerek. Potrdite na razporejenem kupu z `POST /api/database/fields/<field_id>/generate-ai-field-values/` kot semenski superuporabnik: nelicenciran primerek odgovori HTTP 402."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-friendica` — addon/hook: header → session"
msgstr "`web-app-friendica` — addon/hook: glava → seja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-funkwhale` — django header / remote-user auth backend"
msgstr "`web-app-funkwhale` — glava django / hrbtenica oddaljenega uporabnika"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-hermes/meta/mcp.yml` `direction: client`, held to the 025 schema by the MCP lint suite"
msgstr "`web-app-hermes/meta/mcp.yml` `direction: client`, ki se jih drži 025 shema z MCP lint apartma"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` each gain the RBAC role `agent-user` and keep their existing shared instance unchanged."
msgstr "`web-app-hermes` ter `web-app-openclaw` vsaka pridobi vlogo RBAC `agent-user` in ohraniti njihov obstoječi skupni primer nespremenjen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-hermes` is deployed there with privileged host access (`/dev`, GPIO, sensors, cameras, host network). The trust boundary is the whole device (Decision #12), so there is no microVM around the agent here."
msgstr "`web-app-hermes` je tam razporejen s privilegiranim dostopom do gostitelja (`/dev`, GPIO, senzorji, kamere, gostiteljsko omrežje). Meja zaupanja je celotna naprava (Odločitev #12)Ni mikroVM v bližini agenta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-keycloak` does not expose its administration API as a tool server. It provides OAuth infrastructure for MCP servers by provisioning an explicit resource, client policy, scope and redirect contract per provider, with experimental token exchange disabled until the exact versions pass user-delegation and revocation tests."
msgstr "`web-app-keycloak` ne izpostavlja uporabe zdravila API kot strežnik orodja. Zagotavlja OAuth infrastrukturo za strežnike MCP z zagotavljanjem izrecnega vira, politike strank, obsega in preusmerite pogodbo na ponudnika, z eksperimentalno izmenjavo žetonov onemogočeno, dokler točne različice ne opravijo uporabniško-delegacijskih in preklicnih testov."

