msgstr "`web-app-openwebui` pridobi drugo povezavo OpenAI, ki kaže na posrednika, posreduje identiteto klicatelja in omeji vsak model agenta na njegovo skupino."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-wordpress` has no AI surface in core; the requirement applies to whichever connector plugin the role installs, and the role MUST pin one rather than leaving the choice to a site administrator. The pinned connector is `ai-engine`, whose `custom` engine type takes an OpenAI-compatible base URL and an API key per environment."
msgstr "`web-app-wordpress` nima površine AI v jedru; zahteva velja za tistega, ki konektor plugin vlogo namesti, in vloga MORAjo pin eno namesto prepustitev izbiro skrbniku mesta. Priključek je `ai-engine`, katerih `custom` tip motorja potrebuje osnovni URL, združljiv z OpenAI, in API ključ na okolje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-zammad` was pinned at 6.5.0, which ships no AI surface at all. The role is bumped to 7.1.2, the newest line whose contract is still the `ai_provider` / `ai_provider_config` setting pair; past 7.1.x the provider moves into an `AI::ProviderConnection` record and the contract changes. 7.1.2 accepts Elasticsearch `>= 7.8, < 10`, so the role's existing 8.13.4 pin stands."
msgstr "`web-app-zammad` je bila pripeta na 6.5.0, katere ladje sploh ne pristajajo. Vloga je preobremenjena 7.1.2, najnovejša linija, katere pogodba je še vedno `ai_provider` / `ai_provider_config` nastavitev para; preteklost 7.1.x ponudnik se preseli v `AI::ProviderConnection` evidentira in spremeni pogodbo. 7.1.2 sprejme Elasticsearch `>= 7.8, < 10`, Torej je vloga obstoječa. 8.13.4 pin stojala."

