# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Ejabberdov `mod_admin` HTTP UI je edina površina, ki jo je mogoče testirati za Playwright; XMPP prijava sama teče čez 5222/5269 in mora izvajati XMPP-Zavedni odjemalec pred Playwright testno zanko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Ejabberdova edina HTTP površina je `ejabberd_web_admin` o `/admin` (glej [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Overi golo JID proti LDAP nad HTTP Basic, tako da ni Keycloak preusmeri za sledenje in brez nadzora odjave v aplikaciji za klik; avtentikacija odjemalca sama teče po vratih 5222/5269 in ostane izven zanke Playwright, kot je navedeno pod Watch Točke. `acl.admin` poleg tega navaja samo administrator JID, tako da spletni admin zavrne vse druge račune dokončno. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) zato izjavljam `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona in osnovne izjave o dosegljivosti potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI je edina površina, ki jo je mogoče testirati za Playwright; XMPP prijava sama teče čez 5222/5269 in mora izvajati XMPP-Zavedni odjemalec pred Playwright testno zanko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberdova edina površina HTTP je ``ejabberd_web_admin`` o ``/admin`` (glej ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona in osnovne izjave o dosegljivosti potekajo brezpogojno."

