# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "phpLDAPadmin authenticates with an LDAP bind DN and the OpenLDAP `administrator_database_password`, not with the Keycloak `administrator` username/password pair, so the `administrator` persona has no in-app credential once it is through the oauth2-proxy. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) additionally admits only the `web-app-phpldapadmin` administrator RBAC group to that proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), and `biber` carries an empty role list, so it is denied before phpLDAPadmin is reached. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "phPLDAPadmin overi z LDAP veže DN in OpenLDAP `administrator_database_password`, ne z Keycloak `administrator` uporabniško ime / geslo par, tako da `administrator` persona nima v app poverilnice, ko je skozi oauth2- Proxy. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) dodatno priznava samo `web-app-phpldapadmin` Skupina upraviteljev RBAC temu posredniku (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`)in `biber` nosi prazen seznam vlog, tako da je zavrnjen, preden se doseže phPLDAPadmin. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) zato izjavljam `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ter `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona in osnovne trditve potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "phpLDAPadmin is a web‑based LDAP client that provides an intuitive interface for managing LDAP directories. This containerized deployment leverages Docker Compose and Ansible automation to offer a secure, configurable environment for administering and exploring your LDAP configurations."
msgstr "phPLDAPadmin je spletni odjemalec LDAP, ki zagotavlja intuitivni vmesnik za upravljanje imenikov LDAP. Ta povezani vzvodi uporabe Docker Compose in Anljiva avtomatizacija ponuditi varno, nastavljivo okolje za upravljanje in raziskovanje vaših konfiguracij LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "phpMyAdmin signs in as the MariaDB ``root`` account wired through ``PMA_USER`` / ``PMA_PASSWORD`` (```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__, ```vars/main.yml`` <./vars/main.yml>`__); the Keycloak ``administrator`` username is not a MariaDB user, so in the ``services.sso.enabled: false`` matrix variants the ``administrator`` persona has no native login to drive and ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ admits only the ``web-app-phpmyadmin`` administrator RBAC group to the oauth2-proxy (``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups``) and ``biber`` carries an empty role list, so ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` holds in every variant. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "phpMyAdmin znaki v kot MariaDB ``root`` račun, povezan prek ``PMA_USER`` / ``PMA_PASSWORD`` (```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__, ```vars/main.yml`` <./vars/main.yml>`__); the Keycloak ``administrator`` username is not a MariaDB user, so in the ``services.sso.enabled: false`` matrix variants the ``administrator`` persona has no native login to drive and ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ admits only the ``web-app-phpmyadmin`` administrator RBAC group to the oauth2-proxy (``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups``) and ``biber`` carries an empty role list, so ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` holds in every variant. The ``guest`` persona in osnovne trditve potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "phpMyAdmin signs in as the MariaDB `root` account wired through `PMA_USER` / `PMA_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)); the Keycloak `administrator` username is not a MariaDB user, so in the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants the `administrator` persona has no native login to drive and [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the `web-app-phpmyadmin` administrator RBAC group to the oauth2-proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`) and `biber` carries an empty role list, so `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` holds in every variant. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "phpMyAdmin znaki v kot MariaDB `root` račun, povezan prek `PMA_USER` / `PMA_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)); Keycloak `administrator` Uporabniško ime ni a MariaDB uporabnik, tako v `services.sso.enabled: false` matrične variante `administrator` persona nima domače prijave za vožnjo in [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Izrisi `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) prizna samo `web-app-phpmyadmin` skupina upraviteljev RBAC za oauth2-proksi (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`) ter `biber` nosi prazen seznam vlog, tako da `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ima v vsaki varianti. – `guest` persona in osnovne trditve potekajo brezpogojno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "pip's package cache. Granted because the project's `make install-python` step (transitively invoked by `make test`, which runs as a pre-commit hook) populates this cache; denying it would force every install to redownload from PyPI even when the requirements have not changed."
msgstr "Pipov predpomnilnik. Seveda, ker je projekt `make install-python` korak (prehodno sklicevanje `make test`, ki deluje kot predobvezni kavelj) zapolni ta predpomnilnik; zanikanje bi prisililo vsako namestitev, da ponovno naloži iz PyPI tudi, ko se zahteve niso spremenile."

