# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "⚠️ **Do not paste that expression into a workflow that listens on `pull_request_target`.** There `github.ref` is the *base* branch, so `github.ref_name` is literally `main` and the rule collapses to a constant `false` — every pull request would stop cancelling its predecessor. `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` therefore declares `cancel-in-progress: true` outright."
msgstr "⚠️ **Ne prilepi tega izraza v delovni tok, ki posluša `pull_request_target`.** Tam. `github.ref` je *osnova* veja, torej `github.ref_name` dobesedno `main` in pravilo se sesuje v konstanto `false` – bi vsaka zahteva po vleki prenehala odpovedovati svojemu predhodniku. `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` zato izjavljam `cancel-in-progress: true` Popolnoma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "⚠️ **Forced overwrite — do not work in `main`.** When the sync runs, the current repository's `main` is **force-pushed** from the source repository's `main`. Any commit that exists only on the fork's `main` is **discarded without warning** on the next push to any covered branch. Never commit or merge work directly into `main` on a synced repository. Always work on a `feature/**`, `fix/**`, or `hotfix/**` branch; treat `main` as a read-only mirror of the source. If you must use `main` as a working branch, disable the sync first (see **To disable the sync** below)."
msgstr "⚠️ **Prisiljena nadomestitev – ne deluje v `main`.** Ko teče sinhronizacija, je trenutno skladišče `main` m **sila stisnjena** iz izvornega skladišča `main`Vsaka zaveza, ki obstaja samo na vilicah. `main` m **Zavržena brez opozorila** na naslednji potisni na katero koli pokrito vejo. Nikoli ne zagreši ali združi dela neposredno v `main` na sinhroniziranem skladišču. Vedno dela na `feature/**`, `fix/**`, ali `hotfix/**` podružnica; obravnava `main` kot bralno ogledalo vira. Če morate uporabiti `main` kot delovna veja najprej onemogoči sinhronizacijo (glej**Onemogoči sinhronizacijo** spodaj)."

